            text = "The easiest way to complete this quest, if you're Horde, is to take Snowfall Graveyard. Your team will hate you and hurl every possible insult they can fathom, but it's the only GY that remains practically unguarded for the entirety of the game.\n\nIf you can handle 39 internet tough guys making fun of you, go for it. If not, do it the hard way.",
