            author = "196807",
            text = "If you still have this quest and never abandoned it from your quest log, you may now complete it by killing Korrak the Bloodrager  (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=30023) at Zul'Drak in Northrend.\n\nThis quest still remains unavailable and cannot be shared by people with it (Share Quest button disabled).",
