        },
        {
            id = 1577379,
            score = 14,
            author = "Chrii",
            text = "After talking to a Game Master regarding the chest not spawning at given hours, he confirmed for me that it still do spawn. But if you for instance is phased out in some other quests in the zone you wont be able to see the chest or /yell from npc.\n\nFor me i was on the two quest Bwemba's Spirit (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29219) and To Bambala (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29220) in the zone. Game Master said, either disband those two or complete the chain in order to be phased to the right zone would solve my issue.\n\nThought id share this with the community that is currently confused on \"why cant i see the chest\" :)",
            date = "2011-11-21T03:14:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=7810#comments:id=1577379",
        },
        {
            id = 1711385,
