            author = "QuickBASIC",
            text = "For those of you that are wondering. The \"Requires Level 35\" refers to equipping this as a trinket. A level 1 can still right click and accept the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=7810 to unlock https://www.wowhead.com/quest=7838 to get https://www.wowhead.com/item=19024 and https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=396.",
