            text = "When you become Friendly reputation with either the Defilers or League of Arathor, the Supply Officer for each faction will give you a quest to complete right in front of them. At level 39, finishing this quest gives you 525 Experience. I was reluctant to finish this quest at first since I was only 1000xp away from leveling. I crossed my fingers and found out it gave me only 525xp, so no level yet =).\n\nThe package they give you includes:\nArathi Basin Mageweave Bandage (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=20065) x20\nArathi Basin Iron Ration (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=20064) x20",
            date = "2008-08-07T15:32:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8261#comments:id=347030",
        },
