            text = "Stonelash flayer stingers drop from blue scorpions.\nStonelash princer stingers drop from yellow scropions.\nRock Stalker fangs drop from brown spiders.\ni found a good group around the horde encampment 48,68 and south. Also by 62,66 to 65,77",
