            author = "Karaken",
            text = "All of these can be easily found around the horde encampment at 51.1, 68.2. (Note to alliance: Around that area. Those coordinates are inside the encampment!) where you turn in the silithyst powder (If you're horde). Do this with the second part of \"Securing The Lines\" to save time.\n\nYou don't have to go near the horde encampment. They should be easy to locate in the southern half of the zone.",
            date = "2006-12-14T21:27:05-06:00",
