            text = "This Twilight Lexicon is part of the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8279 in Silithus.\nTo complete this, you will have to kill and loot 3 NPC's.\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=15200 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=20394\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11803 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=20395\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11804 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=20396\n\nThe NPC's are located here:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=1377:444388452394326333332328250770256768",
