        {
            id = 489262,
            score = 6,
            author = "264223",
            text = "The best place is the general area around 31,43. There are at least a dozen of them packed together and you can run from one to another without having to aggro any scorpions. if those aren't enough to reach 20, go a little south and there are a few more, but in a sea of scorpions. Then you can go across the road east to the regal hive area like everyone has said.",
            date = "2008-12-04T09:52:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8281#comments:id=489262",
        },
        {
