    [8306] = {
        {
            id = 1309770,
            score = 119,
            author = "735166",
            text = "Dammnnn this, in my opinion, is the single most annoying q i ever did during 2 yrs of WOW. I almost gave up on it. But in the end i found it.\n\nSince Cata expansion the entrance of the cave is located in the southwest corner of the Hive Regal (58,78!). Just follow the way south and on the way u will encounter a Cenarion Scout. Then u know that ur close to Natalia.  When u reach the room, just clear all the other mobs and then take out Natalia. She stands at 55,90 inside the cave.\nGL!",
            date = "2011-01-25T18:42:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8306#comments:id=1309770",
        },
        {
            id = 1676744,
            score = 53,
            author = "Kilalah",
            text = "After around an hour of searching I finally found her. So I'll attempt to simplify this quest. It is easiest to start this quest along with  Breaking The Code  and  Glyph Chasing.\n\nFrom the start of the cave (Co-ords - 58.0, 78.8) Head straight and take the first tunnel on your left.\nFollow this tunnel along, ignore the small side tunnel to your right with the Hive'Regal Burrower, and keep going.\nYou'll arrive at a crossroads, you want to take the left tunnel which will lead to a room\n(Again, ignoring the little side room with the Hive'Regal Burrower).\nWhen you reach the room, continue towards the tunnel directly across the room in front of you, dispatching any of the mobs you need to on the way.\n(Note: If you see Cenarion Scout Landion, you are on the right track. He may be stealthed).\nOnce you reach the end of this tunnel, there is a short tunnel to your right that gets cut off, and a large room to your left.\nMistress Natalia Mar'alith is in the room to your left, kneeling before the quest item for 'Glyph Chasing'.\nPlease note you do not need to kill all the inhabitants of this room, however if you wish to it may assist with the fight.\n\nMistress Natalia Mar'alith (Co-ords - 55.6, 90.6) has several spells she casts, none of which are extremely horrible. She can heal herself so whenever you can interrupt her casting that will help. She can cast a fear ability similar to a Priest' Psychic Scream and she has a stun called Blackout, which incapacitates you momentarily.\n\nBest of luck to everyone attempting this quest. It was much easier when I found the right tunnel.\n\n=)\nHappy Questing!",
            date = "2012-06-14T20:54:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8306#comments:id=1676744",
        },
        {
            id = 1182685,
            score = 32,
            author = "708320",
            text = "As of Patch 4.0.3a the location is now 58.3, 78.5",
            date = "2010-11-24T19:02:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8306#comments:id=1182685",
        },
        {
            id = 1714271,
            score = 25,
            author = "MikadoGG",
            text = "Natalia has a pretty long respawn timer (10 minutes or so), so if you get to her spawn room with the glyph in the middle and she's not there, you might have to wait. You need to tag and kill her to complete the quest. I do not recommend standing in the middle of the room where the glyph is, especially if there is competition to tag her. She spawns and immediately fears you for several seconds giving competition time to tag her and kill her.",
            date = "2012-09-15T21:18:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8306#comments:id=1714271",
        },
        {
            id = 1512527,
            score = 23,
            author = "827398",
            text = "For people who don't use add-ons with coords, there's at least two cave entrances in the southwestern corner of the hive. If the one you enter has brownish-red walls, you're in the wrong one. Go back out and go further west. It should have greenish-purple walls.",
            date = "2011-09-08T01:12:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8306#comments:id=1512527",
        },
    },
