            text = "This quest is easily soloable at 60. The mobs in the cave are single pulls, with the exception of Vyral himself (inevitable double pull). When entering the cave, you can jump off the ledge to your right if you're feeling adventurous (mobs below) or clear your way forward and take the right fork. The mobs are casters, one type with frostbolt/frost nova/chain lightning spells and one type that is melee with an instant cast immolate and a fire damage aura/shield.",
