        },
        {
            id = 2547369,
            score = 9,
            author = "290913",
            text = "The Cave Entrance is at 69.94, 16.35. Vyral is located at 58.88, 80.54 inside the cave. Note Bene: this is in OLD SILITHUS, had to speak with Nozdormi in NE Silithus to bring the zone back to level 60 state.",
            date = "2018-01-20T17:08:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8321#comments:id=2547369",
        },
        {
            id = 2310747,
            score = 5,
            author = "allyneia",
            text = "Seriously the worst respawn timer, worse than the Jintha'Alor female troll boss in Hinterlands.\n\nAs a level 60 human warrior, I stood there for at least 6 minutes, maybe more.  There was a level 100 blood elf hunter that had been standing there (he/she got there before I did).\n\nAt first, I had decided I would be polite and let the blood elf go before I did.  After standing there for a few minutes, and having trash respawn, and having the blood elf hunter camouflage so that I took all the damage and had to kill all the trash, I decided.....forget that s**t.\n\nAs soon as Vyral spawned, I CHARGED, one shot that slow MF and got the heck outta there.",
            date = "2016-02-27T18:16:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8321#comments:id=2310747",
        },
    },
    [8323] = {
        {
            id = 988,
            score = 101,
            author = "364",
            text = "You do get more of a reward from this than what is listed above.\n\nWithin 24 hours of turning in the texts, you'll get a letter from Ortell in the mail.  Along with a letter, you'll get a package of documents that were supposedly translated from those texts.\n\nThose will vary from decrypted texts that contain news about the Twilight Cultists, buff scrolls, and certain rare plans.\n\nIn fact, this is the only way to acquire \"Darkrune\" armor plans for blacksmiths, \"Runed Stygian\" armor patterns for tailors, and scrolls to create the \"Crest of Beckonings\" aside from camping out the AH for them.\n\nThis is also a repeatable quest, meaning you can keep turning in stacks of 10 encrypted twilight texts to Ortell instead of to the NPC in Cenarion Hold.  However, while you will get items for the turn ins, you will not get any rep.",
            date = "2006-09-25T01:23:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8323#comments:id=988",
        },
