            id = 103448,
            score = 9,
            author = "Aurora",
            text = "The Springpaw Lynxes and Springpaw Cubs which wander almost everywhere across Sunstrider Isle often drop the Lynx Collar quest items. I advise you to pick up this quest and kill the Lynxes on the way to and from other Sunstrider Isle quests, as doing so will likely make the search for Lynxes a bit less strenuous.",
            date = "2007-06-13T03:36:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8326#comments:id=103448",
        },
        {
            id = 6926,
            score = 8,
            author = "6934",
            text = "Lynx are located to the East/southeast - just follow the road and you're sure to find them. The turn-in buff(5 sta, 5 spir, 30min) is a good sight to see in the lower level areas :D.",
            date = "2006-12-06T02:41:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8326#comments:id=6926",
        },
        {
            id = 1551557,
            score = 6,
            author = "892984",
            text = "So, now we know why blood elves are so bitter: they are forced to kill kittens at level 2. And their mothers then.\n\nMind this when you encounter that jerk-ass pally or ganking hunter again.",
            date = "2011-10-23T07:23:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8326#comments:id=1551557",
        },
    },
    [8327] = {
        {
            id = 911933,
            score = 14,
            author = "161879",
            text = "Can only be accepted by blood elfs.",
            date = "2009-12-10T05:17:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8327#comments:id=911933",
        },
        {
            id = 99817,
            score = 10,
            author = "Endeva",
            text = "He is at 35.4, 22.5  http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=15281",
            date = "2007-06-06T22:53:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8327#comments:id=99817",
        },
        {
            id = 103450,
            score = 10,
            author = "Aurora",
            text = "For players without coordinates:\n\nLanthan Perilon is found west and just slightly south of the Sunstrider Isle starting tower. He stands right out in the open near some lovely benches, so he should not be difficult to find at all. Keep an eye on your mini-map as well; he appears on there as a yellow dot.",
            date = "2007-06-13T03:46:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8327#comments:id=103450",
        },
        {
            id = 714273,
            score = 8,
            author = "Fearghail",
            text = "It isn't Magistrix Erona or Lanthan Perilon that Orcs, Trolls, Tauren and The Forsaken need to speak to upon arriving here. It is Outrunner Alarion (40,32) who sets you on the road to SMC with the quest Slain by the Wretched. You will need to reach level four in your original start zone before speaking to her. You will only have missed out on six uber-noob quests, or seven if you include the level one Report to (Class Trainer). Thereafter, you will be able to tackle level-appropriate content.",
            date = "2009-05-12T18:43:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8327#comments:id=714273",
        },
        {
            id = 38916,
            score = 6,
            author = "25489",
            text = "His right at 35,22",
            date = "2007-02-19T21:09:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8327#comments:id=38916",
        },
    },
    [8334] = {
        {
            id = 926085,
            score = 12,
            author = "359489",
            text = "As of patch 3.3, the tenders and feral tenders are no longer aggressive.  They will not attack you unless you attack them first.",
            date = "2009-12-22T18:05:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8334#comments:id=926085",
        },
        {
            id = 103454,
            score = 11,
            author = "Aurora",
            text = "Tenders and Feral Tenders are likely the first hostile creatures a blood elf character will come across. They are located to the west and south of Lanthan Perilon, the quest giver. Note that Feral Tenders have mana, unlike the regular Tenders, and can cast a weak Renew spell upon themselves, restoring a bit of their health over time. Although both varieties have a bit more health than some of the other creatures on Sunstrider Isle, they are not difficult for an appropriate-level character.\n\nThis quest is excellent to work on whilst heading to the various spots to collect the quest items for the 'Solanian's Belongings' quest.",
            date = "2007-06-13T03:55:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8334#comments:id=103454",
        },
        {
            id = 911937,
            score = 11,
            author = "161879",
            text = "This quest can only be completed by blood elves",
            date = "2009-12-10T05:22:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8334#comments:id=911937",
        },
        {
            id = 21259,
            score = 4,
            author = "hurgh",
            text = "I found the best place to kill both types of creeps for this quest was about TLOC: 34, 26, which is a bit south from the quest giver.",
            date = "2007-01-18T06:30:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8334#comments:id=21259",
        },
        {
            id = 47816,
            score = 2,
            author = "10936",
            text = "Continue Quest Text (from Lanthan Perilon):\n\n\"It is better you learn about survival - and the costs of survival - now rather than later. Making hard choices is something you're going to have to get used to as a .\n\n\"No one was there for us when the Scourge ripped our home in two. It was us and us alone who pulled ourselves up by the bootstraps.\"\n\nComplete Quest Text (from Lanthan Perilon):\n\n\"While the deaths of the tenders give me no joy whatsoever, it does show me that you're ready for the most important task you'll do here on Sunstrider Isle. Take this and put it to good use; you'll need good items and sharp wits for the task ahead. Our reassertion of control over the island depends on it.\"",
            date = "2007-03-07T17:15:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8334#comments:id=47816",
        },
    },
    [8335] = {
        {
            id = 911953,
            score = 17,
            author = "161879",
            text = "This quest can only be completed by blood elves.",
            date = "2009-12-10T05:43:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8335#comments:id=911953",
        },
        {
            id = 276965,
            score = 13,
            author = "OhTeeSee",
            text = "Just something interesting, it was mentioned that a pupil at Magister Duskwither's academy Felendren \"succumbed to the affliction\" after a failing experiment, this is noted in http://wowhead.com/?item=21783 from the quest http://wowhead.com/?quest=8891.",
            date = "2008-04-24T18:10:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8335#comments:id=276965",
        },
        {
            id = 6941,
            score = 12,
            author = "6934",
            text = "All mobs are located on the academy.  Felendren is at the very top of it.\n\nIf you don't see him there, just wait a little - his respawn time is very short!",
            date = "2006-12-06T03:18:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8335#comments:id=6941",
        },
        {
            id = 374784,
            score = 11,
            author = "207916",
            text = "he's at the very top...\nand if your really lazy and dont want to walk all the way down be careful when u jump off the water is shallow at some parts and u can die.....",
            date = "2008-09-12T16:46:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8335#comments:id=374784",
        },
        {
            id = 103466,
            score = 7,
            author = "Aurora",
            text = "Travel to Falthrien Academy, which is located on the southwest edge of Sunstrider Isle.\n\nThe Arcane Wraiths are found all over the tower; work your way upwards, killing the Arcane Wraiths as you go. The Tainted Arcane Wraiths wander around the higher levels of the tower. Continue travelling upwards; you will reach a large, circular platform. Felendren is often found kneeling right in the centre of the circle. Be careful when you engage him in combat; sometimes the surrounding Arcane Wraiths and Tainted Arcane Wraiths join in the fight! The best way to prevent a messy situation is to pull and kill the nearby Wraiths before attacking Felendren himself.\n\nOnce you have fulfilled the quest objectives, you can either leap off of the tower and (hopefully) land in deep enough water to survive the fall, or you can travel back down killing more Wraiths and collecting more items.",
            date = "2007-06-13T04:30:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8335#comments:id=103466",
        },
    },
    [8338] = {
