            text = "Both (69,72) and (62,80) have the Amani Berserkers and Amani Axe Throwers.  Although you should probably go to (69,72) because you can also do \"The Spearcrafter's Hammer\" here.",
            date = "2007-10-08T16:45:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8476#comments:id=164825",
        },
        {
            id = 273579,
            score = 4,
            author = "TheMaelstorm",
            text = "As mentioned around 69,72 is best way to go.\nNot only you do this quest and The Spearcrafter's Hammer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=8477) at the same time, but also Zul'Marosh (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=8479) starts here (which also leads to Amani Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9360)).\nWhat I did was go to 69,72, kill spearcrafter (and some axe-thrower/berserker for quest), talk to zul'marosh npc, then go for zeb'watha (where zul'marosh is, just across the lake), kill the rest of my axe-thrower and berserkers and get the item for Amani Invasion. You just have to do turn ins afterwards, quite fast and rewarding.\n(edited to add amani invasion and second paragraph)",
            date = "2008-04-18T06:36:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8476#comments:id=273579",
        },
        {
            id = 141759,
