            text = "I found 3 at 34,68... one was in one of the small boats off of the docks, one on the docks and one near the broken ship. They seem to have a slow respawn but they're there.\n\nEDIT: Found another at 30,68 right under the big red ship.\n\nEDIT: Another in the wreckage next to the red ship noted above.",
