            author = "13042",
            text = "The stone is 55, 84.",
            date = "2007-01-18T23:04:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8490#comments:id=21516",
        },
        {
            id = 40518,
            score = 14,
            author = "24542",
            text = "This is actually a bit of a tough quest for a starting character. After placing the crystal, quite a few shades appear and attack the crystal. With a young priest character I have not been able to kill all shades, but it's not actually needed to slay them. You can kite them until a minute is up and you get the \"completed\" message. Then just run away and turn in the quest.",
            date = "2007-02-22T11:25:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8490#comments:id=40518",
        },
        {
            id = 198231,
            score = 4,
            author = "70039",
            text = "Don't forget the chest at 56,83 :) Otherwise quite easy as 10 warlock",
            date = "2007-12-08T21:29:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8490#comments:id=198231",
        },
        {
            id = 263041,
            score = 4,
            author = "112754",
            text = "Quests is easy soloable as lvl12 affliction warlock.\nJust sent pet on one, done debuffs on other and we killed them, and together on 3d.\n\nStone is at 55,48.\nWhen you summon stone 3x lvl9 will summon, you need to kill them 2 or 3 times.\n\nTip for warlock : they aren't fearable",
            date = "2008-03-30T04:21:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8490#comments:id=263041",
        },
        {
            id = 273602,
            score = 4,
            author = "TheMaelstorm",
            text = "A few things.\nThey are level 9-10 and  have 50ish healths and one shadowbolt was enough for me to take them down (one of them didnt die but my imp killed it with firebolt)\nThe first wave attacks the crystal and seemingly won't aggro you unless you damage them individually. Second wave however, directly come attack you. (I've done this quest 4 times or so, same story everytime) So be careful if you are trying this at low levels.",
            date = "2008-04-18T07:41:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8490#comments:id=273602",
        },
    },
