            author = "Miyari",
            text = "This quest is available to hunters only and awards the weapon piece of the Trappings of the Unseen Path (?itemset=510).\n\nTrappings of the Unseen Path\n\nHonored: Ring - Signet of the Unseen Path (?item=21402) (quest (?quest=8704))\nRevered:  Cloak - Cloak of the Unseen Path (?item=21403) (quest (?quest=8696))\nExalted: Weapon - Scythe of the Unseen Path (?item=21401) (quest (?quest=8712))\n\nThis quest requires the Qiraji Spiked Hilt (?item=20886), which can drop from any of the later boss in the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj (?zone=3429), as well as idols and scarabs which can either drop off trash or can be found inside Scarab Coffers (?object=180691).\n\nEven though it is obtainable at any reputation level, players must reach Exalted with the Cenarion Circle (?faction=609) before being able to complete this quest.",
