        {
            id = 15591,
            score = 4,
            author = "IW00Bruiser",
            text = "I started at about 5k revered reputation with Cenarion Circle when I decided to get this.  The hardest part was finishing the move to exalted rep, and spent about 1 week or so doing the badge quests overall, though I alrdy had 7 tactical badges, but those are easiest of the 3 to complete personally.  Spent about 200g to gather supplies to complete the logistics badges.\n\nThe hilt needed for this is a chance drop off a couple of the bosses in AQ20, the Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj, namely Moam, Ossirian, Ayamiss, and according to WoWhead, Buru as well.\n\nThe idols and scarabs are just the random chance drops off mobs in AQ20 and AQ40.  For a raiding guild, obtaining these is not difficult at all, but can be quite expensive on the AH.\n\nIt was worth it to get this, my original intention for exalted CC rep was for:\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=21180\n\nbut this was a nice addition as well to dual wield with Doom's Edge should I be forced into melee combat for a short duration of time.",
            date = "2006-12-14T16:55:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8712#comments:id=15591",
