            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8885#comments:id=150340",
        },
        {
            id = 310634,
            score = 9,
            author = "Sunlar",
            text = "Never healed against me, only used chain lightning. It is not difficult to solo him between levels 7-9, merely remember to clear the area where you intend to wreak havoc in (although then you'll miss the fun of seeing the other murlocs feared xD)",
            date = "2008-06-22T16:06:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8885#comments:id=310634",
        },
        {
            id = 722292,
            score = 7,
            author = "367211",
            text = "I find that staking him at around (26.54, 67.34) near the tree stump (by the Golden Strand; cross the river from where you get the quest) works well. When he rounds the bend, there's a short period of time before the surorunding murloc adds intersect w/ his path, so you can use this to pull him on to you.\n\nThis guy ambushes often when you do other quests (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=8886) , so this was my way of getting back at that bastard.\n\nDid this with Lvl8-turning 9 lock and it wasn't too difficult. (have the Imp attack first, Immolate, Corrupt, CoW and follow it up with Shadow Bolt or stab him if you're low on mana)",
            date = "2009-05-20T13:35:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8885#comments:id=722292",
        },
    },
