        {
            id = 1312427,
            score = 3,
            author = "736595",
            text = "For new people this quest can be a pain because there are a lot of them there, just kill everything around you in a wide circle, it may take a while to kill all those things but it's better then dying.  (New people wouldn't know how to use or where to get wands.)\n\nAnd go out to the beach right there - It's Azurebreeze coast, it counts towards the \"Explore Eversong woods\" achievement.  :D",
            date = "2011-01-27T19:41:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8894#comments:id=1312427",
        },
        {
            id = 1893960,
            score = 2,
            author = "Gadoink4",
            text = "This quest is just bad. The mobs for it are everywhere in the area, and while you may think that's a good thing, think again. The questgiver is about as far into the area as possible, meaning you'll have to fight your way through scores of mobs just to get to him. Plus, if you've done the other quest in the area already (which is likely, since it's closer to the questgiver than this guy is), you've probably already killed the required mobs for this quest before getting it... and now you have to do it again. Really inexcusably bad quest design here, there's no reason why this quest shouldn't be at the entrance to Duskwither Grounds.",
            date = "2013-09-08T18:04:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8894#comments:id=1893960",
        },
        {
            id = 960651,
            score = 1,
            author = "203746",
            text = "All I can imagine when I accept this quest is a blood elf screaming at me in an angry scottish accent...",
            date = "2010-01-30T13:27:45-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=8894#comments:id=960651",
        },
    },
