            text = "I looked around but the only thing I saw is that the Mana Stalkers and the Manawraiths can get up there by walking into the green crystal at the top on the inside. It teleports them up and across the room, then they can walk out and around to the balcony. I'm not sure if certain classes can get up there of if there's just a special trick for it. I'm a BE Paladin btw.\n\nAnd there was a battered chest up there for me too.",
