            author = "Hybrid",
            text = "For those of you without coordinates, It's the very top north west of Ghostlands, on the island, Goldenmist Village, and then the murlocs are along the entire western coast of the island.\n\nMap Here: http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3433",
            date = "2007-01-18T18:59:44-06:00",
