            author = "140690",
            text = "This quest, as well as a few others, open up only after you attain a friendly reputation with Tranquillien.\n\nOther quests requiring Friendly rep with Tranquillien:\nHelp Ranger Valanna! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9145) - Ranger Lethvalin (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16213)\nInvestigate An'daroth (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9160) - Dame Auriferous (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16231)\nTrouble at the Underlight Mines (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9192) - Deathstalker Maltendis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16251)",
