        },
        {
            id = 316945,
            score = 15,
            author = "140690",
            text = "This quest, as well as a few others, open up only after you attain a friendly reputation with Tranquillien.\n\nOther quests requiring Friendly rep with Tranquillien:\nHelp Ranger Valanna! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9145) - Ranger Lethvalin (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16213)\nSalvaging the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9150) - Magister Darenis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16199)\nTrouble at the Underlight Mines (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9192) - Deathstalker Maltendis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16251)",
            date = "2008-06-30T18:10:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9160#comments:id=316945",
        },
        {
            id = 163703,
            score = 7,
            author = "84244",
            text = "The first Coord's are correct. It is the area on the map that is between the Scar and Goldenmist Village. You do not need to be near the orb for the kills to count. However, you do need to be near the orb for the \"investigation\" part of the quest to complete.",
