        {
            id = 65948,
            score = 2,
            author = "Vollana",
            text = "According to the previous posts, the location is not on an island, even though the quest log says \"group of night elves that have recently taken over a nearby island\".  I went to the only island shown on my map and it is not the correct place to be.  The coordinates given in the previous post are correct.  The path starts at 37,27.",
            date = "2007-04-12T08:44:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9160#comments:id=65948",
        },
    },
    [9161] = {
        {
            id = 23016,
            score = 37,
            author = "3467",
            text = "Dusty Journal is located on a balcony (80,18) out of the spire.",
            date = "2007-01-22T23:18:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9161#comments:id=23016",
        },
        {
            id = 40296,
            score = 32,
            author = "5828",
            text = "I've had difficulty on several characters I've leveled in this area due to the power, number, and fast respawn times of the Arcane Reavers.\n\nHere's the best way I've found to do this quest.\n1] Run into the building.\n2] Position yourself against the north wall, underneath the second story platform -inside- the building.\n3] Let the Arcane Reavers kill you.\n4] Release, and run back to the building.\n5] As a ghost, run inside, upstairs, and rez on the second story platform -outside.-\n6] You will see a jounal.  Read it to complete the quest and get the next step.\n7] Jump off the platform, go around the back of the building, and run back to Farstrider Enclave.\n\nWARNING: There may be one Arcane Reaver that patrols the ramp between the first and second stories.  Time your rez so that he is not near.",
            date = "2007-02-22T03:09:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9161#comments:id=40296",
        },
        {
            id = 294953,
            score = 9,
            author = "155416",
            text = "Don't confuse Dawstar Spire with Windrunner Spire. Really long walk back :(",
            date = "2008-05-26T12:05:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9161#comments:id=294953",
        },
        {
            id = 35684,
            score = 8,
            author = "23550",
            text = "A very hard quest for a warlock because the robots are immune to fear and your Void's taunt",
            date = "2007-02-14T04:24:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9161#comments:id=35684",
        },
        {
            id = 192872,
            score = 8,
            author = "zane411",
            text = "Actually if your a mage the easiest thing to do is take out the two gaurds at the front of the building one at a time, basically frostbolt, pew pew pew and its dead. then run inside, ignore the Arcane Reavers all together, once they gang up on you up the stairs just frost nova, run, grab the book, hit accept, jump off the balcony and run away.",
            date = "2007-11-28T16:19:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9161#comments:id=192872",
        },
    },
    [9162] = {
        {
            id = 140607,
            score = 7,
            author = "79815",
            text = "when you take the  Dar'Khan's journal you must go back Ranger Vynna at the Farstrider Enclave",
            date = "2007-08-19T13:23:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9162#comments:id=140607",
        },
        {
            id = 1661982,
            score = 5,
            author = "821910",
            text = "Why in bob's name would he write all that crap down? Surely he should've realized it MIGHT GET FOUND? Dar'Khan, you may have once had a stylin' hat, but you are just stupid as hell. (And you ain't got chicken neither.)",
            date = "2012-05-03T01:26:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9162#comments:id=1661982",
        },
        {
            id = 3225273,
            score = 1,
            author = "delney",
            text = "For anyone who can't pick this up, The Traitor's Shadow is required, although it's not marked as part of the storyline here.  Once you do The Traitor's Shadow, the journal will have this quest for you",
            date = "2020-08-24T17:44:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9162#comments:id=3225273",
        },
        {
            id = 212999,
            score = -1,
            author = "10371",
            text = "Did it as a level 20 warlock, despite being a higher level than the quest suggests I still had some trouble.  My voidwalker was unable to hold threat against the Arcane Reavers, as they are immune to tormet.",
            date = "2008-01-04T21:44:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9162#comments:id=212999",
        },
    },
    [9163] = {
        {
            id = 22372,
            score = 40,
            author = "Sauron",
            text = "Night Elf Plans: An'daroth 13:26 In one of those tents.\n\nNight Elf Plans: Scrying on the Sin'dorei 10:22 On the boat\n\nNight Elf Plans: An'owyn 12:23 In one of those tents.",
            date = "2007-01-21T01:54:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9163#comments:id=22372",
        },
        {
            id = 3843,
            score = 27,
            author = "JackOnTheMap",
            text = "The plans can be fond on the island at 12, 26. Plans have different spawn points. Look at tables as well as on the ground. One will be on the boat also.\n\nQuest was bugged as I did it. Hopefully fixed.",
            date = "2006-11-18T13:07:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9163#comments:id=3843",
        },
        {
            id = 27549,
            score = 24,
            author = "Nathrax",
            text = "They can also spawn in the doorways of the trees..  An'darorth was in a doorway when I did it",
            date = "2007-01-30T03:07:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9163#comments:id=27549",
        },
        {
            id = 29605,
            score = 18,
            author = "15585",
            text = "An'daroth was at 14, 26 in front of one of the trees in the doorway\n\nAn'owyn was at 12, 25 in one of the tents\n\nSin'dorei was at 10, 22 on the boat\n\n...that's where I found everything...good hunting...",
            date = "2007-02-02T18:14:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9163#comments:id=29605",
        },
        {
            id = 136490,
            score = 17,
            author = "TheOnyx",
            text = "More specific coordinates:\nNight Elf Plans: An'daroth - 13.70, 26.82 (in a tent by a moonwell).\nNight Elf Plans: An'owyn - 12.78, 25.17 (in a tent beside another tent).\nNight Elf Plans: Scrying on the Sin'dorei - 10.50, 22.52 (on the boat).\n\nKeep in mind that these are not static locations. The items appear to spawn in random areas around the camp, although the most common locations appear to be on the ground inside one of the tents and on the boat in the location listed above. Other people have reported seeing them sitting on a table beside a tent.\n\nKnown locations (supplied by other posters):\nAn'daroth - (12, 26) (13, 26) (14, 26)\nAn'owyn - (12, 23) (12, 25) (12, 26)\nScrying on the Sin'dorei - These always seem to be on the boat (coordinates above).",
            date = "2007-08-12T13:58:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9163#comments:id=136490",
        },
    },
    [9164] = {
        {
            id = 22850,
            score = 50,
