        {
            id = 22087,
            score = 33,
            author = "6448",
            text = "Apothecary Enith (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16208) is in a crypt on the northern side of Deatholme, at approximately the 11 o'clock position (Jurion the Deceiver (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16248) for the quest Dar'Khan's Lieutenants (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9170) is also in there).\n\nRanger Vedoran (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16209) is in a tower on the southern side,  at the 6 o'clock position.\n\nApprentice Varnis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16206) is in a tower on the eastern side, at the 3 o'clock position (Borgoth the Bloodletter (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16247) is for Dar'Khan's Lieutentants is also in there).",
            date = "2007-01-20T13:33:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9164#comments:id=22087",
        },
        {
            id = 22138,
