            text = "This was a good quest.  I soloed it at lvl 17 on my bloodelf mage.  The drop rate was typical for me.  The Spinal Dust dropped every 2-4 kills off of Dreadbone Sentinels and it dropped off a few Deathcage Sorcerers too.  I found these mobs in the Dead Scar west of the Andilien Estate.  And yes, do watch out for Luzran, he's quite a pain and although he is fat and moves slow he'll sneak up on ya and whack u down in no time.  GL and have fun!\n\n~Kristalhart, Dragonblight server",
