        {
            id = 61891,
            score = 20,
            author = "39998",
            text = "To Reach Nestlewood Hills (the best place to get the emitters)\n-Go south of the crash site towards the icon of a cave on your map\n-Go up the mountain, following the path.\n-Go through the cave/mountain path\n\nTips:\n-I found it quite easy to get all of the spare parts without engaging in any combat, making this quest very fast.\n-The Nestlewood Owlkin for the Inoculation quest (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9303) can be found here and it's easy to do both of these quests at the same time.",
            date = "2007-04-04T07:14:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9305#comments:id=61891",
        },
        {
            id = 21558,
