        {
            id = 61896,
            score = 22,
            author = "39998",
            text = "Surveyor Candress is very easy to kill/solo and is found at the top of the blood elf encampment at Shadow Ridge. When you engage with her, one other Blood Elf Scout (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16521) will attack you as well. I suggest putting Gift of the Naaru on you just to negate the slight chance that you would die.",
