            text = "I never noticed the plans remaining in my inventory after doing this quest, but on my shaman, I still have them at level 22.  I click on the plans to accept the quest & am told I've already completed it.  /shrug",
            date = "2008-10-12T12:55:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9360#comments:id=403843",
        },
        {
            id = 6334064,
