            author = "Jakobud",
            text = "On this quest you kill any of the Hellboards.  These items will drop:\n\nTainted Hellboar Meat\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=23270\n\nThen you use the Purification Mixture (given to you) on the meat\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=23268\n\nThe meat will either become:\n\n1. Purified Helboar Meat\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=23248\n\nor\n\n2. Toxic Helboar Meat\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=23355",
            date = "2007-01-18T18:32:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9361#comments:id=21454",
        },
        {
