            text = "It was pretty weird. I was killing em, and after each kill another Vulture would fly right to me, as if the vulture did what those other mobs did, where they call for help. Fought 10 in a row.\n\nMight want to pull far from big packs if you find it hard to solo.",
            date = "2007-11-26T16:10:27-06:00",
