            author = "13231",
            text = "While doing this quest if you head up the right side of the ruins next to the mountain you find a Quest npc, named Morod at tloc 13,61. He gives you a quest to find another npc in that same camp named Naladu who gives a series of quests.",
            date = "2007-01-20T04:02:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9387#comments:id=21909",
        },
        {
            id = 193941,
