            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RJPAbqR37u8\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9390\n•\009Accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9390 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16834 at coords 23.0, 40.4 (Temple of Telhamat).\n•\009Travel east to coords 26.8, 37.4 and turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16852 (laying on the ground).",
