            text = "The windwalkers drop them most of the time but not always...... and the Talonguards drop them some times",
            date = "2007-07-16T09:21:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9396#comments:id=121515",
        },
        {
            id = 823136,
