            text = "This is a Draenei only quest. However you can skip this quest and go right to Admiral Odesyus (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17240) and pick up the quest chain at \009A Small Start (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9506) if you're non Draenei. Not sure it works that way if you're Draenei.",
