            author = "86678",
            text = "There's a really easy way to get this quest done.\n\nWhen you enter the cave, go straight (obviously), and when you see the hole, jump down. You won't lose any health, it's a short drop.\n\nOnce you've landed (You should be surrounded by candles), there will be one mob in front of you. Not within your distance, but you'll need to kill it to get to Sriss'tiz.\n\nYou'll be able to see him from where you land, because it's really close to him.",
