            text = "18,84\n\nLocated on the SW island",
            date = "2007-01-16T23:38:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9531#comments:id=20914",
        },
        {
            id = 617775,
            score = 33,
            author = "128600",
            text = "ok, nothing happens when i'm a tree\nwhat i need to do?\nwhat i'm doing wrong?\nBE MOAR TREE LEIK",
            date = "2009-02-21T07:19:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9531#comments:id=617775",
        },
        {
            id = 796302,
            score = 31,
            author = "25030",
            text = "Engineer \"Spark\" Overgrind picks up the naga flag.\nGeezle: What's the big idea, Spark? Why'd you call for this meeting?\nEngineer \"Spark\" Overgrind: What's the big idea? You nearly blew my cover, idiot! I told you to put the compass and navigation maps somewhere safe - not out in the open for any fool to discover.\nEngineer \"Spark\" Overgrind: The Master has gone to great lengths to secure information about the whereabouts of the Exodar. You could have blown the entire operation, including the cover of our spy on the inside.\nGeezle: Relax, Spark! I have it all under control. We'll strip mine the Exodar right out from under 'em - making both you and I very, very rich in the process.\nEngineer \"Spark\" Overgrind: Relax? Do you know what Kael'thas does to those that fail him, Geezle? Eternal suffering and pain... Do NOT screw this up, fool.\nEngineer \"Spark\" Overgrind: Our Bloodmyst scouts have located our contact. The fool, Velen, will soon leave himself open and defenseless -- long enough for us to strike! Now get out of my sight before I vaporize you...\nGeezle: Yes, sir. It won't happen again...",
            date = "2009-08-02T21:26:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9531#comments:id=796302",
        },
    },
