            author = "remy",
            text = "should you abandon the quest for any reason, you do not need the forms to complete it (the wings, the swim speed, the panther form).\n\nJust go to the end point, the totem [click on the End: Totem of Vark link]. The forms and extra additions are just for fun and to speed things up, but there are no timers. Same goes if you lose the buffs.",
