            author = "peeweesweden",
            text = "As I poked up from the water, I was engaged in combat by one of the goblins. Much to my aggrivation, since I was in combat (I guess) I did not recieve the cat buff. The furball went *poff* and disappeared into the woods.\n\nI abandoned the quest and re-accepted it from the totem. No furball. And there is no way I'm running all the way back and do this again.\n\n*permanent abandon*",
