            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xjyExKxlyD8\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9542\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9542, from the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17363 at coords 63, 67.8 (located underwater).\n•\009Follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17393 to the coast of the river, above water.\n•\009When you receive the buff, https://www.wowhead.com/spell=30448, follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17393 west to coords 28.2, 62.4.\n•\009Turn in the quest to the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17364.",
            date = "2015-11-25T23:37:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9542#comments:id=2280511",
        },
    },
    [9543] = {
        {
            id = 2184049,
            score = 18,
            author = "parkerj316",
            text = "To get this quest you will need to do the following quests first.\n\nIn Search of Sedai (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9390)\nReturn to Obadei (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9423)\nMakuru's Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9424)\n\nAfter you turn in the 3rd quest give it a little bit because Anchorite Obadei will run over to Makuru and scold him for sending us on that quest.  They will go back and forth a few times then Obadei will walk back to where he was and then the Atonement quest will pop up.",
            date = "2015-05-17T11:33:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9543#comments:id=2184049",
        },
