        {
            id = 852815,
            score = 6,
            author = "Aros",
            text = "After handing in the book Anchorite Paetheus said this:\n\nAnchorite Paetheus says: Now , let's see...\nAnchorite Paetheus says: In the process of translating this, I believe I've learned more about the drunken exploits of a certain 'Andrew Clementine' than about the journal's author.\nAnchorite Paetheus says: But, no matter. Mister Clementine's... err, 'contribution' notwithstanding, this seems to be the journal of a man named Nolkai. The entries toward the end describe a brutal battle.\nAnchorite Paetheus says: Take a look at this passage...\n\nand then we get to the follow up quest.",
            date = "2009-09-26T20:53:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9557#comments:id=852815",
        },
        {
            id = 694386,
