            id = 2330910,
            score = 4,
            author = "Faendnor",
            text = "As I Night Elf, I don't get this quest. Instead I pick the quest from the totem of Akida to head to Stillpine Hold, to speak with High Chief Stillpine. I have done this with 3 different alliance races and they all turn the same. Don't know about space-goats tho. Using the Wowhead quest tracker is still points it as incomplete : /\n\nAlso, the mini-quest chain of the Kurken shows as complete yet the quest Stillpine Hold and Search Stillpine Hold shows as incomplete. Makes no sense since you need them both in order to do the Kurken, so Wowhead Dev need to check what's going on there part.",
            date = "2016-05-14T14:52:33-05:00",
