        {
            id = 1353549,
            score = 10,
            author = "794594",
            text = "Alright, maybe this is just me but Nolkia is an anagram of Nikola, like Nikola Telsa (if you don't know him, well, you have him to thank for AC electricity, neon lights, modern electric motors, radio/modern wireless telecommunications, power plant electrical generators (and most of the power in the NY area from his original Niagara Falls power plant) and many other brilliant things) and his very good friend was Samuel Clemens whose writers name was Mark Twain, so... Noklia? Clementine? I think thats the allusions in this quest if I'm right.",
            date = "2011-02-28T20:31:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9561#comments:id=1353549",
        },
    },
    [9562] = {
        {
            id = 49467,
            score = 18,
            author = "table",
            text = "The \"dark-skinned murloc\" mentioned, by the way, is\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17475\n\nwho drops an item that starts,\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9564",
            date = "2007-03-11T07:08:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562#comments:id=49467",
        },
        {
            id = 28491,
            score = 5,
            author = "15932",
            text = "Murlocs are at 34, 11",
            date = "2007-01-31T18:33:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562#comments:id=28491",
        },
        {
            id = 281774,
            score = 4,
            author = "122492",
            text = "As a Mage on the quest Control (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9595), I found this quest difficult. Whenever I killed a murloc, using Magic, the Wraith showed up, and killed me. My recommendation is to either hope and pray the wraith doesn't show up, or Polymorph one of the murlocs and then take the grain.",
            date = "2008-05-03T16:48:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562#comments:id=281774",
        },
        {
            id = 2869761,
            score = 4,
            author = "moneybiz",
            text = "The only way I could get this quest to show up having never done the area was to get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9538 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17232. then going through the quests to get the totems.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9539\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9540\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9541\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9542\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9544\n\nOnce I handed in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9544 then https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562 became available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17441 at stillpine hold but not until then.\n\nOnce you have https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562 from you can head over to the beach around 35.4 11.8 and find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17475. Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17475 and it will drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=23850 Once you have https://www.wowhead.com/item=23850 it will start a quest. Head back over to Stillpine hold and turn it in.",
            date = "2019-02-04T15:02:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562#comments:id=2869761",
        },
        {
            id = 304743,
            score = 3,
            author = "Novawolf",
            text = "My comment on Eshido's post, don't even bother doing this quest while on \"Control\". It's freakin' annoying as all hell; you're better off going back and turning in the mage quest before continuing with this. Doing both at once isn't worth dealing with those OP Magewraiths and them counterspelling your Gift of the Naaru and slaughtering you with Arcane Bolt, Fireball, and Frostbolt.",
            date = "2008-06-14T06:46:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9562#comments:id=304743",
        },
    },
