            author = "motafina",
            text = "To open up this quest at Stillpine Hold, you need to start with Learning the Language (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9538).\n\nThe other quests are as follows:\n\nTotem of Coo (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9539)\nTotem of Tikti (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9540)\nTotem of Yoy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9541)\nTotem of Vark (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9542)\nThe Prophecy of Akida (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9544)\n\nStillpine Hold (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9559)\nBeasts of the Apocalypse (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9560)\nCheiftain Oomooroo (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9573)\n\nThe Kurken is Lurkin' (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9570)\nThe Kurken's Hide (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9571)",
