            author = "Amberley",
            text = "Cruelfin (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17496) can be found on blacksilt shore amongst the other blacksilt murlocs.\n\nThe quest Catch and Release (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9629), given by Morea (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17434) in Blood Watch, requires you to \"tag\" the Blacksilt Scouts. Good chance you will stumble upon Cruelfin while completing this quest",
