            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9579#comments:id=106683",
        },
        {
            id = 1048865,
            score = 9,
            author = "508463",
            text = "Of course it wasn't enough to give one of the worst droprates in WoW to this quest, they had to make all the enemies casters. And no, they didn't stop there but had to make these casters run halfway across the area to pick up a little box that spawned every four seconds, so just as you sit down to eat/drink another one of those buggers comes over and kills you with his fireball!\n\n... I'm Done",
            date = "2010-05-30T12:49:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9579#comments:id=1048865",
        },
        {
            id = 46578,
