            score = 12,
            author = "159774",
            text = "Remember the Blood Elf Bandit Mask (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=23909)? They have a chance to drop off of Blood Elf Bandits (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17591). However your first time killing a Blood Elf Bandits (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17591) will result in the Blood Elf Communication (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=23910) item to drop which opens up this quest.\n\nThe Blood Elf Bandits (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17591) are usually stealthed in various places around Azuremyst Isle (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3524).",
