        {
            id = 110059,
            score = 8,
            author = "37423",
            text = "This is basically the transition quest from the BE area to the rest of the world.  Blizzard seems to pull these kinds of things off nicely.",
            date = "2007-06-23T21:49:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9621#comments:id=110059",
        },
        {
            id = 796814,
            score = 8,
            author = "pennywise33",
            text = "would have been nice if the quest description mentions the magical orb which takes you directly to UC",
            date = "2009-08-03T09:37:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9621#comments:id=796814",
        },
        {
            id = 5770577,
            score = 8,
            author = "RicochetUK",
            text = "It's possible to get this quest and be stuck in the wrong phase in Tirisfal Glades, with no access to Zidormi to switch you back. If this happens, do the following.\n\n1) Travel to Orgrimmar and accept Battle For Azeroth: Mission Statement (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51443/battle-for-azeroth-mission-statement)\n2) Skip the cinematic and head to the inn to meet your NPC group.\n3) Accept the next quest, The Stormwind Extraction. (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=50769/the-stormwind-extraction)\n4) Once this quest has started, abandon it through the map screen. This will drop you back into the Inn in Orgrimmar.\n5) Travel back to Tirisfal Glades, where Zidormi will give you the option of phasing to the correct version of Undercity.\n\nI discovered this method thanks to YouTuber DaggersWow, from here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ZR76nymLEw. Cheers mate!",
            date = "2024-01-23T07:59:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9621#comments:id=5770577",
        },
        {
            id = 210903,
            score = 6,
            author = "pabasa",
            text = "Interestingly, Sylvannas adds another line to the 'progress' speech if you're not a blood elf:\n\n\"I was expecting a Blood Elf, to tell you the truth\".\n\nBlizz covered the bases on that one :)",
            date = "2008-01-01T09:11:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9621#comments:id=210903",
        },
    },
