            author = "Anok8",
            text = "Freeing her starts with a chain of quests in [zone=3524], starting from https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9538 after you finish the quests, ending with  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9544. You will be able to get the quest from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17682. After you get the quest, you will have to kill some Bristlelimb villagers so that you \"summon\" https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17702. After you kill him, he will drop the key which you will use to free the princess.\n\nGood Luck!",
            date = "2014-01-01T16:03:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9667#comments:id=1930833",
        },
        {
            id = 1787680,
            score = 24,
            author = "1057173",
            text = "SAVING PRINCESS STILLSPINE\nThis Quest requires several primers before she talks to you.\nIn the middle of AZURE WATCH is Cryptographer Aurren. Accept his Quest;\nLEARNING THE LANGUAGE.\nTHhis will set you on a multiple quest all over the Island talking to totems (5 of them). The last totem will have you free up 8 Stillpine Captives.\nThen head north to recieve the Quest STILLPINE HOLD.\nTHEN you can proceed with the quest by talking to the Princess and \"save\" her.",
            date = "2012-12-26T12:21:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9667#comments:id=1787680",
        },
