            author = "LumiyaSpellsong",
            text = "You'll find these guys out in the water past the naga.  It may seem as though you're about to go too far or that you'll get the fatigue warning when you're swimming, but just look down and you'll find the bloodcursed voyagers.  They're transparent like ghosts, so very hard to see on the bottom.  Some coords for finding them are 87,17.  They are not aggressive, however, which is nice :)",
            date = "2007-01-20T23:27:58-06:00",
