            text = "Don't forget to ask for a new rebuff (The Captain's Kiss) when you go for next part (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9683) - there you won't get it !\nIt really helps you to get forth and back to the island !\nRemember it need to be done BEFORE completing this part !\n\nI've seen the post above, this is just so importen !\n\nThis 3 part Q took me only 20 min to complete and was really easy - might be a bit lucky on the drops .\n\nHave fun .\nThe reward aint the best: http://www.wowhead.com/?item=24334",
