            text = "A group of about five Level 16 Hand of Argus swordsmen walks through the Bladewood camp every so often.  Hanging out with them makes this quest a breeze - it's easy to do enough damage to get credit for their kills, and you'll never be in any danger of dying.  Just keep pace with 'em until you've got all you need, then peel off.",
