        },
        {
            id = 33295,
            score = 39,
            author = "16637",
            text = "Vindicator Kuros will not offer you this quest unless you first pick up Gaelan's Journal:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?object=182032\n\nThe journal spawns the \"Galaen's Journal - The Fate of Vindicator Saruan\" quest:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9706\n\nOnce you pick up the journal and turn in the quest to Vindicator Kuros, he will offer you the Matis quest.",
