            text = "If you accidentally kill Matis just abandon the quest and try again.  I used the flare and the Tracker spawned and aggro'ed Matis, but I accidentally killed him.  The Tracker was still there though, so I decided to wait for Matis to spawn and see if the Tracker would still capture him.  After Matis spawned, I trained him to the Tracker, who aggro'ed and attacked Matis until he died.",
