            text = "Dammit I am a fool, for those of you who are usually in a hurry to get things done like I am.......\n\nShe is in 15.52 HELLFIRE PENINSULA not zangarmarsh, I went all the way to zangarmarsh 15.52, and ended up at sporeggar",
            date = "2007-11-09T00:35:46-06:00",
