        {
            id = 593280,
            score = 2,
            author = "316293",
            text = "You can do this one along with The Tangled Webs They Weave (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10066) and Cutting a Path (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10065) as they all gather in the same area to the west of Vindicators Rest. It's also a short trip north to the river to kill the targets of Fouled Water Spirits (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10067). If you're so inclined you can also go the Amberweb Pass quests as it's just across the river.",
            date = "2009-02-03T02:20:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9746#comments:id=593280",
