            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9753#comments:id=105761",
        },
        {
            id = 1591341,
            score = 31,
            author = "Schprotznog",
            text = "Looks like they lifted some race restrictions. I was able to complete these quests today with my level 85 Night Elf Druid: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9753, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9756, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9760, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9761, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9759\n\nNo https://www.wowhead.com/item=24344 though.",
            date = "2011-12-06T12:33:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9753#comments:id=1591341",
        },
        {
            id = 51822,
            score = 7,
            author = "chadandjody",
            text = "This quest was not showing up for my level 18 draenei shaman.  I logged out and logged back in.  The quest was available after that.  Not saying it's not a dranei only quest, but it also appears to be a bit buggy.",
            date = "2007-03-15T20:59:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9753#comments:id=51822",
        },
        {
            id = 343880,
            score = 7,
            author = "Radruler",
            text = "The most likely reason this is a draenei only quest is because it is a preq for Ending Their World (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9759), which subsequently leads to recieving Tabard of the Hand (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=24344), which was intended to be a draenei-only tabard.",
            date = "2008-08-03T22:32:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9753#comments:id=343880",
