            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=16197 awaits you at the main road through Tranquillien, at 46.6 28.4 (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=16197#map) spot.\nHe's one of the main quest giver in the city Tranquillien, so visit him often.\nTomTom:\n/way Ghostlands 46.6 28.4 Vandril\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=9758 - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HgpkQjjKXgw",
