            author = "25863",
            text = "Vector Coil is at 23,54\nAnd reason why this quest is elite and lv20 is because the Blood Elf mobs that you have to kill are elites and at lv19 they are not easy to solo with a shaman.  Two at a time is what you will be usually having to try and kill.",
