            score = 10,
            author = "29534",
            text = "If you want a never-ending source of free water breathing potions, just accept this quest to get the potion, then abandon the quest.  You'll keep the potion and can accept the quest again once the charges run out for another free 3 hours of potion. ~_O\n\nOnce completed, you can't get the potion anymore.",
