            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocvDgHyFJys\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9782\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9782, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18004 at coords 68.2, 50.0 (Telredor).\n•\009Travel northeast, to the Dead Mire, to coords 80.1, 41.9.\n•\009Loot the https://www.wowhead.com/item=24400 from the https://www.wowhead.com/object=182119 (appears as a small dirt mound).\n•\009Travel southwest, back to Telredor, to coords 68.2, 50.0.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18004.",
