            author = "DeadlyNinja",
            text = "Best drop rate and number of Spore Bats which drop this are from 19.19 to 23.19, just above Ango'rosh grounds. All from 62-63 lvl",
            date = "2007-02-02T02:52:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9806#comments:id=29274",
        },
        {
            id = 167099,
            score = 12,
            author = "58067",
            text = "Since there is no daily limit on Sporregar quests, i think this rep quest makes more sense: http://wowhead.com/?quest=9727 (Now That We're Still Friends...)\n\nCan I kill 24 nagas faster than I can collect 10 fertile spores...yeah, I think I can..it's certainly more fun to lay waste to a whole island and not have to run around worrying about finding the right mob.",
            date = "2007-10-13T02:10:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9806#comments:id=167099",
        },
        {
            id = 1169947,
            score = 6,
            author = "Erised",
            text = "I just started farming these for Sporeggar rep today, and to my great joy I discovered that this quest (and the Sanguine hibiscus one also) no longer award 250 reputation per turn in but a whopping 750! Certainly makes the thought of grinding these slightly less daunting :p",
            date = "2010-11-13T12:01:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9806#comments:id=1169947",
        },
    },
    [9807] = {
        {
            id = 418159,
            score = 14,
            author = "234577",
            text = "As the new achivement system has been implemented it may be a good idea to complete this quest several times if you're an achivement hunter since the reward, besides reputation, is a Glowcap (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=24245). The glowcaps can be used to buy the Tiny Sporebat (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=34478#comments) and the Sporeggar Tabard (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31775#comments) which both are parts of different achivements. This will save you some time as you won't have to go mushroom hunting when you hit exalted.\n\nTiny Sporebat (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=34478#comments): 30 glowcaps\nSporeggar Tabard (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31775#comments): 10 glowcaps\nThe total of 40 glowcaps = 40 turn ins = 240 Fertile Spores (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=24449#dropped-by).",
            date = "2008-10-24T03:46:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9807#comments:id=418159",
        },
        {
            id = 336118,
            score = 9,
            author = "stakk",
            text = "As for choosing either or between this quest and \"Now that we're still...\". Do both. Take a trip around marshlight lake, killing bats and stalkers as you go, and kill nagas when you encounter them. If you follow the shore underwater, you won't have to deal with the wrekt slaves.",
            date = "2008-07-25T15:23:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9807#comments:id=336118",
        },
        {
            id = 1349141,
            score = 8,
            author = "531440",
            text = "Note that it currently gives 750 rep per turn in.  That is, of course, before perks",
            date = "2011-02-24T23:53:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9807#comments:id=1349141",
        },
        {
            id = 773146,
            score = 5,
            author = "160546",
            text = "To everyone wishing to do this quest to get Sporeggar rep, I  found a very good spot to farm them.\n\nYou know that northwest part on zangarmarsh with the island near it? Don't go over the bridge, stay on the main land. If you look slightly south and slightly east of the bridge you will see A LOT of greater sporebats, which drop the fertile spores.",
            date = "2009-07-09T19:48:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9807#comments:id=773146",
        },
        {
            id = 1053414,
            score = 5,
            author = "Henderman",
            text = "This macro worked well for me:\n\n/cleartarget\n/tar Greater Sporebat\n/tar Fen Strider\n/tar Marsh Walker\n/tar Sporewing\n/tar Boglash\n/tar Sporebat\n/script SetRaidTarget(\"target\", 02)",
            date = "2010-06-06T14:13:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9807#comments:id=1053414",
        },
    },
