            date = "2007-03-22T03:21:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9872#comments:id=55175",
        },
        {
            id = 5317582,
            score = 8,
            author = "EggzBenedict",
            text = "Killed the pack that gives this quest a dozen times this morning. I feel like quest item is a myth. Revered with  The Mag'har. Going to be submitting a ticket about it to see if someone at Blizz if this is still available. Will edit with results.\n\nEdit - Got a response back from Blizz. Basically telling me to look here on wowhead for a solution. Reported the quest bugged, so maybe.... hopefully.... it will be fixed soon.\n\nBy the way, this is trying to get the quest as a max lvl character. Tried both with and without party sync. Neither are currently working at the moment.",
            date = "2022-01-30T09:49:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9872#comments:id=5317582",
        },
    },
