            author = "1650967",
            text = "go scour the roads of Nagrand until you find three Murkbloods riding around on elekks. Kill them and get the Murkblood Invasion Plans. That will start the quest Murkblood Invaders and lead you to its followup, Ortor My Old Friend",
            date = "2016-05-31T10:27:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9873#comments:id=2335933",
        },
        {
            id = 23124,
            score = 30,
            author = "7344",
            text = "Located 31, 42. He is inside the main hut of the village with 2 guards beside him and a bunch of shaman surrounding the outside walls\n\nHe has quite a long spawn time, at least 10 min.",
            date = "2007-01-23T07:08:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9873#comments:id=23124",
        },
        {
            id = 2585400,
            score = 23,
            author = "Bergelmir",
            text = "If you're looking to complete the zone achievement, know that you also need 'The Totem of Kar'dash' (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=9879/the-totem-of-kardash) for 'The Murkblood' part of it. It's easy to overlook. In a hut in the village (found mine at 33,42) there is a kurenai captive with two brutes. Kill the brutes, and he'll offer you an escort quest. If this is the last one you need, you'll get the achievement as soon as he's safe. You don't even need to turn in the quest.",
            date = "2018-07-28T04:48:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9873#comments:id=2585400",
        },
        {
            id = 1728601,
            score = 8,
            author = "Grim32",
            text = "He is no longer elite. However his respawn timer is still quite lengthy.",
            date = "2012-10-02T10:20:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9873#comments:id=1728601",
        },
        {
            id = 39299,
            score = 6,
            author = "23619",
            text = "Good to pair this up with Murkblood Corrupters, http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9862 and Stopping the Spread http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9874 in case the boss needs to respawn.  You can torch the corpses and kill the putrifiers.",
            date = "2007-02-20T11:48:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9873#comments:id=39299",
        },
    },
