            text = "Note, there are four different \"Membership Benefits\" quest entries on Wowhead. These are all the same quest, the only difference is the rewards given. These are related to your reputation level with the consortium. You receive a sack of gems that increases in value and number with each higher rep level.\n\nGem Stuffed Envelope appears to be for Friendly\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25424#00zc\n\nUnmarked Sack of Gems appears to be for Honored\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25419\n\nBulging Sack of Gems appears to be for Revered\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25422\n\nBag of Premium Gems appears to be for Exalted\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=25423",
