            score = 22,
            author = "Painreaver",
            text = "Note that, if for example you are revered with The Contortium when the bags reset (1st of every month), and then hit exalted during the month, you will get an exalted bag for that month if you have not yet picked it up.",
            date = "2008-02-02T05:39:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9887#comments:id=228158",
        },
        {
            id = 1668421,
            score = 5,
            author = "574361",
            text = "I came to this post with 74/75 Nagrand Slam. It was my first time to complete it. There was a yellow ! over his head. As soon as I clicked to accept it completed it as well with no turn in. I received https://www.wowhead.com/item=25419 , and my Consortium rep was at Honored.",
            date = "2012-05-18T20:37:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9887#comments:id=1668421",
        },
        {
            id = 1611914,
            score = 1,
            author = "916405",
            text = "This quest does not show up on your mini-map because of the fact that the repeatable quest over-rides the non-repeatable one (repeatable as in you can continually hand it in, not just one a month). The quest is obtained from Gezhe in Aeris Landing. I hope this helps! (I was stuck at 74/75 quests for Nagrand Slam and this quest did put me over and I got the achievement) Happy Hunting!",
            date = "2012-01-15T23:20:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9887#comments:id=1611914",
        },
        {
            id = 2096905,
