            date = "2007-04-19T09:30:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9916#comments:id=69553",
        },
        {
            id = 32032,
            score = 3,
            author = "19061",
            text = "These are very abundant in the caves at the north/southwind clefts.\n\nIf you're shy of the caves, they can also occasionally drop from the ogres nearby. Also, I'd recommend that you get your crates, and then make your way outside to continue the \"An Audacious Advance\" quest, as the ogres aren't nearly as easy to deal with as the ones outside.",
            date = "2007-02-07T03:58:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9916#comments:id=32032",
        },
        {
            id = 188009,
            score = 3,
            author = "88582",
            text = "I was doing this quest in northwind cleft, entrance about 40,31, and I noticed that when you go into the cave, just loot the first boxes and kill the mobs, kill couple more, and the boxes spawn back. Their spawnrate seems to be really fast so I just stayed in the first corridor of the cave, killed every ogre in sight and looted the boxes. easy.\n\nOh and if you're not afraid of repair costs.... don't be afraid of dying. As a horde at least, the gy is right on top of northwinds cave entrance. :)",
            date = "2007-11-19T23:59:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9916#comments:id=188009",
        },
        {
