            text = "I wonder if this...\n\nFrom what I can gather, they're either planning to \"eat the blue skins and take their village\" or bake a blueberry pie. It really could go either way.\n\n...is Blizzard purposely poking fun at the fact that \"blueberry\" is a common slang term for draenei?",
            date = "2008-04-06T09:10:17-05:00",
