            text = "You need to go to Telaar and speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18353  and pick up the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9917  and turn it in.  Corki is in fact hostile to start, so will NEVER give you the quest until you reach a better standing with the Kurenai in Telaar.  Next you will get the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9918 . \"Persuade\" Lump to talk..(Lump is at 62.7 / 71.5) and return to hand in quest. (You are now neutral with Kurnai.)  Corki will now give you the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9923",
            date = "2013-03-30T19:53:57-05:00",
