            text = "Coordinates: 70, 80\n\nVery easy quest, just kill mob and place banner. Why the quest here says \" Shadow Council Credit Marker slain (20)\" I don't know cuz it's not a part of the quest in game. Just ignore it.",
            date = "2007-01-27T18:43:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9927#comments:id=25932",
        },
        {
