        {
            id = 609883,
            score = 9,
            author = "323344",
            text = "From a lore point of view, its quite interesting to see the end result of the efforts (same quest line) between the Horde here and the Alliance version, it is good storytelling of the more optimistic and initiative of the Alliance leadership in Nagrand.  Note the difference in the Completion text.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9933",
