            score = 36,
            author = "Omnigamer",
            text = "Pair this quest up with Armaments for Deception (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9928) and Ruthless Cunning (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9927) from Lantresor the Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18261). You need to complete the quest chain starting with The Impotent Leader (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9888), which begins in Garadar.",
