        {
            id = 23315,
            score = 24,
            author = "14102",
            text = "Giselda the Crone is in the Largest building in Kil'sorrow fortress (entrance Giselda's building is at 70.81)\n\n1 entrance to Kil'sorrow Fortress is at 69.76",
            date = "2007-01-23T14:25:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9935#comments:id=23315",
        },
        {
            id = 188802,
            score = 6,
            author = "88582",
            text = "Giselda is inside the biggest house in Kil'Sorrow camp in southeastern Nagrand. You have to fight your way to her trough a corridor to the door which leads to a round chamber. In the chamber, Giselda is standing in the middle and there are 2 guards at the walls, left and right.\n\nAs a 66 warrior, I was able to pull her with ranged alone, the guards stood still. She is like the other castermobs in there, priests or so, and very easy to kill by herself.\n\nPair this quest up with the planting of warmaul banners and the quest for the armaments, both obtained from the lantresor of the blade.",
            date = "2007-11-21T09:50:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9935#comments:id=188802",
        },
        {
            id = 266861,
            score = 5,
            author = "NoMetal",
            text = "Giselda transforms itself at 70% health and the transformation hits harder, however she will not transform herself if when she reaches that health she is stunned, so stun her before reaching 70% for an even easier kill! ;-)",
            date = "2008-04-05T14:22:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=9935#comments:id=266861",
        },
    },
