            text = "There are two level 66 Elites that roam around the entrance to the hill. If you wait for them to path, they will engage the Warmaul Ogres. You can then pass them by or get the crates on the path.\n\nOnce you pass the two elites the create are all around the camp at the top and you won't be bothered by the elites.",
