        {
            id = 11223,
            score = 141,
            author = "6934",
            text = "The box is on the Northeast island of Tuurem, in a hut.  There will be a blood elf, firewing courrier, sitting next to it that you must kill before looting the box.  tloc was 53, 29\n\nFirewing Courrier respawns very fast, beware.",
