            text = "Loc confirmed 53,30.Light humanoid slaying required to get into the town and to the box. levels 63-64 mobs. easily solo'd. Hunters use humanoid tracking to find the Firewing Courier if you're having trouble finding it.\n\nDoes lead to:  What Are These Things? (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9995)",
