            author = "13065",
            text = "The prereq. for this quest is Investigate Tuurem (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9990).\nWhich is the final link to a chain that starts with the quest What's Wrong at Cenarion Thicket (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9957).\n\nA good reason for going through all these chains, are these nifty socketed greens rewarded from the quest Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10005).",
