            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10003#comments:id=26617",
        },
        {
            id = 74263,
            score = 8,
            author = "16310",
            text = "If you are a paladin, DO NOT pull the mobs in that room with avengers shield... It seems like much more than 5 yards between them, but the shield will jump and pull the full room.",
            date = "2007-04-28T06:03:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10003#comments:id=74263",
        },
        {
            id = 85216,
            score = 8,
            author = "nordee",
            text = "Short respawn time, perhaps 2 or 3 minutes.\n\nIf someone else clears the room, she will respawn before any of her bodyguards, resulting in an easy kill.",
            date = "2007-05-18T14:31:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10003#comments:id=85216",
        },
    },
    [10004] = {
        {
            id = 28570,
            score = 88,
            author = "10501",
            text = "77, 35 - You have to talk to him to fight. When you walk up to him, he has a gray '?'",
            date = "2007-01-31T20:37:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=28570",
        },
        {
            id = 12838,
            score = 42,
            author = "1633",
            text = "This is not as easy as it seems.\n\nWhen you speak to Sal'salabim, he turns hostile and attempts to own your face.  He is a 68 elite, so you may very well need friends.  Hits for 1k on cloth.  Ow.",
            date = "2006-12-10T15:50:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=12838",
        },
        {
            id = 23155,
            score = 27,
            author = "12816",
            text = "Pre-req for this quest http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10001\n\nI actually completed this quest without attacking him at all. When I arrived at Sal'salabim, 2 alliance were already killing him. When they got him down to low health, he went back to his spot with a quest complete message over his head. I guess you just have to be in the area when he gets 'subdued'",
            date = "2007-01-23T08:33:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=23155",
        },
        {
            id = 670307,
            score = 25,
            author = "124064",
            text = "He is located at 77,35 (http://www.wowhead.com/?maps=3703:770353) in Shattrath at the World's End Tavern in the Lower City. Soloed this quest as a 68 Elemental Shaman. First laid down a Stoneclaw Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=25525) to avoid grabbing aggro. Not necessary as you won't die from one hit, but might as well. Then drop a Fire Elemental Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=2894), talk to him to get it started, toss a few Lightning Bolt (http://www.wowhead.com/?spell=25449)'s when you get a chance and heal. Easy.",
            date = "2009-04-08T21:27:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=670307",
        },
        {
            id = 54046,
            score = 17,
            author = "26387",
            text = "Mob location: http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18584\n\nAnd be careful -- I fear'ed him around as I DOT'ed him and he reset twice as he ran too far away. :(",
            date = "2007-03-20T03:56:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10004#comments:id=54046",
        },
    },
