            date = "2010-07-02T05:56:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10012#comments:id=1071047",
        },
        {
            id = 264885,
            score = 3,
            author = "cromer",
            text = "If you can fly you only have to fight one, maybe two guys.  Just drop down through the hole in the roof and land where the plans are.  If you are a high enough lvl, it's an easy 8G 26S.",
            date = "2008-04-02T01:18:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10012#comments:id=264885",
        },
        {
            id = 2298906,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8KAO0WKRio4\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10012\n•\009Locate the https://www.wowhead.com/object=182549, on the ground, inside a building at the Bonechewer Ruins at coords 67.9, 53.5\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10012, by clicking on it, in your inventory.\n•\009Travel west, to Allerian Stronghold, to coords 58.2, 54.8.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18387.",
            date = "2016-01-16T10:33:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10012#comments:id=2298906",
        },
    },
