            text = "Soloed this as a Rogue. Any class can solo it however -\n\nThe boss guy does NOT link with the four casters surrounding him. Ranged pull him (throw, shoot, fireball whatever) and kill him in the hallway, then run in, talk to the spirit, complete & accept quests, and run. Rogues can Vanish, Hunters can run and FD, anyone else could make it out alive - they are casters and easily LOSed in the topsy turvy hobjob of a diamond Oshu'gun is.",
            date = "2007-01-28T00:16:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10101#comments:id=26071",
        },
