            author = "545567",
            text = "Also want to note if no one else mentioned, that you must be flagged for PVP in order to start the meter for the bar. I was having some trouble just waiting around and running back and forth between flags when a friendly reminder popped up stating I had to be flagged. So, might wanna keep that in mind before going all the way out there.",
            date = "2011-10-18T09:02:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10106#comments:id=1546816",
        },
        {
            id = 905960,
