            author = "19683",
            text = "Do this the same time as \"The Outcast's Plight\" from Vekax up in the tree at 52,16 in the lower city. 30 drops off the same mobs.\nRepeatable, increases rep with Lower City by 250.",
            date = "2007-03-02T01:47:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10112#comments:id=44875",
        },
        {
            id = 11180,
            score = 33,
            author = "6934",
            text = "These mobs are located in the village south of Shattrath.  They have relatively low health, so they're easy kills.  I picked up all 5 items in under 10 kills.",
            date = "2006-12-08T13:53:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10112#comments:id=11180",
        },
        {
            id = 143638,
            score = 19,
            author = "79255",
            text = "Veil Skith is located at 30,41\n\nThese quests are also done in the same area:\n\nMissing Friends:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10852\n\nVeil Skith :  Darkstone Terrok\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10839\n\nStymying The Arakkoa (Urdak only)\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=9987",
