            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10123#comments:id=1920666",
        },
        {
            id = 277043,
            score = 3,
            author = "Toryn",
            text = "The quest may be orange when u first pick it up and the recommended lvl may be 61, but I found this to be a very easy quest as a 58 ret paladin.\n\nAll the mobs are lvl 58-59.  The Flamewalker Imps have very little health and go down very easily (even with the little buddies each one has).  Warbringers are big, but don't have truly dangerous skills.  The Dreadcallers aren't much tougher to kill than the Warbringers but they do have a spell that can hit for a lot of dmg (it was only used once in my fight though).\n\nRegardless of your class this quest shouldn't give you much trouble and it has good rewards.",
            date = "2008-04-24T22:13:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10123#comments:id=277043",
        },
    },
    [10124] = {
        {
            id = 20777,
            score = 15,
            author = "11574",
            text = "65, 43 is where To'arch is.",
