            text = "This is a part of a 12 quest chain which you can start by talking to Force Commander Danath Trollbane (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16819) in Honor Hold. Here is the whole chain.\n\n» The Legion Reborn (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10141)\n¤ The Path of Anguish (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10142)\n¤ Expedition Point (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10143)\n¤ Disrupt Their Reinforcements (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10144)\n¤ Mission: The Murketh and Shaadraz Gateways (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10146)\n¤ Shatter Point (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10340)\n¤ Wing Commander Gryphongar (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10344)\n¤ Mission: The Abyssal Shelf (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10163)\n¤ Go to the Front (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10382)\n¤ Disruption - Forge Camp: Mageddon (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10394)\n¤ Enemy of my Enemy... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10396)\n¤ Invasion Point: Annihilator (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10397)\n\nIf you are unable to talk to Force Commander Danath then you need to do the quest chain below as well. The below quest chain will allow you to accept quests from Danath.\n\n¤ Through the Dark Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10119)\n¤ Arrival in Outland (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10288)\n¤ Journey to Honor Hold (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10140)\n¤ Force Commander Danath (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10254)",
