        },
        {
            id = 1588148,
            score = 15,
            author = "Clousy",
            text = "(reposting this here, in case people don't think to go directly to the NPC's page ('http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18933/isfar'))\n\nIt seems that with 4.3, they moved this NPC to inside the actual Sethekk Halls instance. The question mark will still show where he used to be (the room with the fire - outside the instance portal) but he won't be there. Confused me for a little, until I tried zoning in on a whim. Watch out for the 67 elites that patrol pretty close to the NPC, if you're doing this at-level.\n\nAt 67, I was able to get to him without aggroing them. He gives the same quests as usual.",
            date = "2011-12-03T13:35:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10180#comments:id=1588148",
        },
        {
            id = 211569,
            score = 9,
            author = "31800",
            text = "OK ... if you've never been to Auchindoun ... you can land at 44,64 on top of the steps near a couple of Bonethrashers. No NPC here. He is down below in the ruins, directly beneath the steps, at the same coords. There is a central entrance, as well as one off to each side. Enter the central entrance to find Isfar. Hope this saves some time!",
            date = "2008-01-02T12:04:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10180#comments:id=211569",
        },
    },
    [10182] = {
        {
            id = 4354,
            score = 71,
            author = "4441",
            text = "There are 4 quests which start from a item dropped by their owners. You only need to hand on those items to their homes.\n\nTo complete Abjurist Belmara go to 55.5,86.5\nTo complete Conjurer Luminrath go to 56.4, 87.8\nTo complete Cohlien Frostweaver go to 55,87\nTo complete Battle-Mage Dathric go to 56.9,86.8 (he is located in 60.88/townhall and drops too the \"Annals of Kirin'Var\", item necessary to finish \"The Annals of Kirin'Var\" quest).",
            date = "2006-11-25T10:44:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10182#comments:id=4354",
        },
        {
            id = 254874,
            score = 12,
            author = "69947",
            text = "Went to 56,86 and found a house that is inacessible due to logs blocking it's entrance.\n\nIt is indeed the 1st non-destroyed house when heading into Wizard Row from Tower, but the exact coords are 57,87.",
            date = "2008-03-17T15:26:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10182#comments:id=254874",
        },
        {
            id = 57164,
            score = 9,
            author = "29237",
            text = "The exact location for the weapone rack is 56.9,86.8. Inside a small cabin.",
            date = "2007-03-25T20:46:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10182#comments:id=57164",
        },
        {
            id = 772557,
            score = 7,
            author = "311893",
            text = "For the weapon rack: when facing Custodian Dieworth at the mage tower, simply look to the west and the rack is in the house you see right in front of you.",
            date = "2009-07-09T06:58:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10182#comments:id=772557",
        },
        {
            id = 1042001,
            score = 5,
            author = "363365",
            text = "The weapon rack is sparkling like a normal quest object, but I can't click it, there's no gear. I'm new to this quest - am I supposed to obtain the sword from the mage and turn it in at the rack? I just killed him, but he didn't drop anything else than Netherweave Cloth and some silver.",
            date = "2010-05-19T12:42:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10182#comments:id=1042001",
        },
    },
    [10183] = {
        {
            id = 190829,
            score = 40,
            author = "94271",
            text = "Important to note: You may only accept one of the five quests to initially seek out the rocket chief, and this quest is by far the best. The others offer no gold reward and less experience than this one, which weighs in at 3050 instead of 1150.\n\nMake sure to grab this particular quest if you're looking to get the most out of the opportunity.",
            date = "2007-11-25T05:33:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10183#comments:id=190829",
        },
        {
            id = 63157,
            score = 17,
            author = "ixnorp",
            text = "If you go to Area 52 and accept the quest \"You're Hired!\" before completing this one, this quest will be unavailable.  Just drop \"You're Hired!\" and you can get this one.  Only really worth noting if you want every last bit of quest XP or Gold you can get.",
            date = "2007-04-07T01:39:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10183#comments:id=63157",
        },
        {
            id = 257819,
            score = 9,
            author = "clavicle",
            text = "You will have to drop Report to Spymaster Thalodien (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11039) to get this one too.",
            date = "2008-03-23T02:43:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10183#comments:id=257819",
        },
        {
            id = 217044,
            score = 7,
            author = "40287",
            text = "The quest 'Assist Exarch Orelis' should be added to that list. I had that one in my quest log and was unable to pick up any of the quests listed. When I abandoned it, the others immediately became available.",
            date = "2008-01-12T01:32:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10183#comments:id=217044",
        },
        {
            id = 208395,
            score = 4,
            author = "104009",
            text = "Im not sure of his but as you see on the right how theres\nOff To Area 52\nOut of This World Produce!\nA Strange Vision\nParts for the Rocket-Chief\nA Mystifying Vision\n under number 1, i think you can only choose one of them.",
            date = "2007-12-27T19:47:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10183#comments:id=208395",
        },
    },
    [10184] = {
        {
            id = 26219,
            score = 68,
            author = "Gokou",
            text = "Misleading. You can't start the chain until you at least \"start,\" another chain first.\n\nDo the quest \"The Archmage's Staff.\" http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10173 - Complete that chain up until the 3rd part: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10174, then after that you should be able to get the quest. =]",
            date = "2007-01-28T06:48:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10184#comments:id=26219",
        },
        {
            id = 39071,
            score = 14,
            author = "10676",
            text = "I'd like to add that this quest is significantly easier if you realize that the spirits reside IN the houses and buildings. They sit in all but one of the one-room houses (even the 2 with no roof), there are 2 or 3 inside the town hall and I could only find 2 outside. Try looking indoors you'll have more luck; also, when you're in there fighting try and stay to the back of the building because the defenders pat close and might see you.",
            date = "2007-02-20T04:06:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10184#comments:id=39071",
        },
        {
            id = 60274,
            score = 11,
            author = "7599",
            text = "Kill Severed Spirits in the buildings at 57,90 Netherstorm.\n\n\"A Fate worse than Death\": is the buildings just north of here, so I did them together:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10185",
            date = "2007-03-31T19:55:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10184#comments:id=60274",
        },
        {
            id = 176820,
            score = 6,
            author = "Liandra",
            text = "The Severed Defenders also count as Severed Spirits for this quest. Kill them too.",
            date = "2007-10-30T12:08:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10184#comments:id=176820",
        },
        {
            id = 64606,
            score = 4,
            author = "jamina1",
            text = "Make note, also, that the patrolling mobs aggro from a long ways off. Try to stick clear of them.",
            date = "2007-04-09T19:45:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10184#comments:id=64606",
        },
    },
    [10185] = {
        {
            id = 41510,
            score = 23,
            author = "27069",
            text = "in order to get this quest you need to work your way up through the quest chane http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10173 (The Archmage's Staff) and once you get to \"The Sigil of Krasus\", \"A Fate Worse Than Death\" will unlock also http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10184 \"Malevolent Remnants\" unlocks",
            date = "2007-02-24T10:15:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10185#comments:id=41510",
        },
        {
            id = 306763,
            score = 6,
            author = "158180",
            text = "If you are a magic user, these bastards live up to their name.  Watch out for when they reflect.  Can wind up killing yourself if your not careful.  My suggestion is find a melee friend to help you out.",
            date = "2008-06-18T01:57:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10185#comments:id=306763",
        },
        {
            id = 91269,
            score = 5,
            author = "51076",
            text = "Both these mob types are immune to Arcane Shot and for all you hunters out there Viper sting doesn't work either. All of those who use mana best stock up on fluids these mobs do suck ya dry of mana.",
            date = "2007-05-26T19:28:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10185#comments:id=91269",
        },
        {
            id = 254751,
            score = 5,
