            author = "4205",
            text = "You need to do 2 quests for Nether-Stalker Khay'ji http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19880 before Papa Wheeler gives you this quest.\n\nKhay'ji also gives you a quest to kill those Zaxxis mobs, so take both quests at the same time.",
