            author = "18555",
            text = "Pair this quest up with:\nA Heap of Ethereals\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262",
            date = "2007-03-05T10:13:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10206#comments:id=46474",
        },
        {
            id = 867547,
            score = 10,
            author = "469686",
            text = "Possible fun fact - after turning in, Chubis walks away and says \"This thing kind of reminds me of a Zed Power Nodule...\"\n\nIn the Stargate TV franchise, there's a power source called a ZPM (http://www.stargate-sg1-solutions.com/wiki/Zero_Point_Module_%28ZPM%29), which one character refers to as a Zed PM.",
            date = "2009-10-15T20:37:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10206#comments:id=867547",
        },
        {
            id = 213996,
            score = 9,
            author = "43546",
            text = "Hillarius!\n\n\"Hmm, let me see if I can dig up some pocket change to throw your way.\"'\n\nand he gives you a family heirloom or his fathers bracers",
            date = "2008-01-06T20:26:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10206#comments:id=213996",
        },
    },
    [10208] = {
        {
            id = 115649,
            score = 88,
            author = "33042",
            text = "It takes four stones per portal to destroy them.  You'll need to stand in the very middle of the portal (on the blue area) and right-click it.",
            date = "2007-07-04T18:36:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10208#comments:id=115649",
        },
        {
            id = 21165,
            score = 68,
            author = "10501",
            text = "Xilus is at 70,45 which is #2 in the ss\nKruul is at 74,38 which is #1 in the ss",
            date = "2007-01-17T21:26:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10208#comments:id=21165",
        },
        {
            id = 164350,
            score = 19,
            author = "61412",
            text = "Demonic Rune Stones http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28513 are what you need to collect to use the quest item",
            date = "2007-10-07T15:49:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10208#comments:id=164350",
        },
        {
            id = 228763,
            score = 19,
            author = "100246",
            text = "Make sure you are in the right portal.  There are a lot of portals and not all of them are interactable.  When you are in an appropriate portal you will get a gear icon, not a hand.",
            date = "2008-02-03T09:29:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10208#comments:id=228763",
        },
        {
            id = 20739,
            score = 16,
            author = "Hack",
            text = "If you are in a party you can all collect the 4 runes required to destroy the portal, however, if someone disables the portal it counts toward your quest too which obviously makes it much faster :D\n\nThanks to 'Dwutlenek' for that image he uploaded too, made it much easier :D",
            date = "2007-01-15T19:36:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10208#comments:id=20739",
        },
    },
    [10209] = {
        {
            id = 2284078,
            score = 116,
            author = "Demiona",
            text = "The quest marker on the ingame map is misleading. Summoner Kanthin is not inside the building, nor does he spawn on the spot he's marked at. He patrols on the road in front of Manaforge Duro, loosely in the area shown on the map above.",
            date = "2015-12-05T12:31:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10209#comments:id=2284078",
        },
        {
            id = 246435,
            score = 30,
            author = "Miyari",
            text = "There seems to be some confusion regarding Summoner Kanthin and his elemental so hopefully this will clear everything up.\n\nIt does not matter whether you kill the Summoner or Glacius first, as long as you are on the quest he will always drop the Stone of Glacius (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28479). If you do kill the Summoner first, the elemental will not despawn, so you'll either have to kill it or run away and leash it.\n\nThey're both rather easy mobs and it is possible to ranged pull the Summoner and his pet at a few locations throughout his patrol; I did so from [58,62] near one of the Manaforge's entrances. Summoner Kanthin casts fire-based spells (such as Fireball and Pyroblast) and the water elemental will just beat on you in melee range for about 250 physical damage (on cloth).",
            date = "2008-03-01T21:57:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10209#comments:id=246435",
        },
        {
            id = 156008,
            score = 16,
            author = "47860",
            text = "Glacius = Frost dude from Killer Instinct.  =)",
            date = "2007-09-21T05:01:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10209#comments:id=156008",
        },
        {
            id = 42397,
            score = 8,
            author = "14690",
            text = "Spawns about every 5 minutes and makes a bee line right down the hill when he spawns. So if you see his corpse and there's several people about, make sure you clear all the conjurers, or they'll frostbolt you and make it hard to catch and tag him.",
            date = "2007-02-25T22:51:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10209#comments:id=42397",
        },
        {
            id = 2571773,
            score = 3,
            author = "519566",
            text = "Found him just north of the quest marker.",
            date = "2018-06-02T09:32:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10209#comments:id=2571773",
        },
    },
    [10210] = {
        {
            id = 1094867,
            score = 56,
            author = "Harmony323",
            text = "For all of you who are having a problem with this, Haggard War Veteran is just OUTSIDE the area with A'dal. For those with coords, he's at 59.63, 41.42.",
            date = "2010-08-03T12:56:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210#comments:id=1094867",
        },
        {
            id = 1505353,
            score = 7,
            author = "703881",
            text = "Counts towards Terror of terokkar!",
            date = "2011-08-28T12:47:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210#comments:id=1505353",
        },
        {
            id = 1897058,
            score = 5,
            author = "1144833",
            text = "The Haggard War Veteran is the human patrolling the NE bridge leading out of the city, above the lower city and directly across from the Scryer's Tier. It is a (low-level quest) so the quest icon may not appear for you on the radar. Talk to him then simply talk to A'dal in the Terrace of Light to complete the quest.",
            date = "2013-09-13T08:46:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210#comments:id=1897058",
        },
        {
            id = 2250102,
            score = 5,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hcid_DKguyU\n\nBefore starting the chain quest to receive your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757, it is helpful to set your https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948 to the [zone=6141] (Horde) or [zone=6142] (Alliance).\n•\009https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62996, located in the [zone=6141] (Horde), in the [zone=5840] at coords 69, 49.\n•\009https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64149, located in the [zone=6142] (Alliance), in the [zone=5840] at coords 35, 76.\n\nAfter binding your https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948, to the appropriate Innkeeper travel to the sanctuary's portal room and click the portal to Shattrath.\n•\009Alliance players: go to the room above the opposite of the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 69, 52.\n•\009Horde players: go to the room above the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 64, 58.\n\nAfter reaching the other side, in [zone=3703], you will appear in the Terrace of Light.\n•\009Go outside and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19684 at coords 59.8, 41.0.\n-\009-\009You can also find him wandering the bridges that leave [zone=3703] heading toward [zone=3519].\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210.\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210\n•\009Go back inside the Terrace of Light, and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18481 at 54, 44.\n•\009Turn in this quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18481.\n\nFull Guide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=32757/blessed-medallion-of-karabor#comments:id=2249836) to obtain https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757.\n\nIf you're unsure about which stage of the quest line you are in to obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757, enter the following script into the chat box (special thanks to Vlad for the script):\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q) and 'YES' or 'NO')end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q) and YES or NO)end",
            date = "2015-09-11T00:43:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210#comments:id=2250102",
        },
        {
            id = 839347,
            score = 3,
            author = "386520",
            text = "I have also tried on my 77 tauren hunter....and all he gives me is a simple dialogue that basically says you are welcome in Shattrath. Seems to be bugged.",
            date = "2009-09-13T12:24:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210#comments:id=839347",
        },
    },
    [10211] = {
        {
            id = 1369788,
            score = 860,
            author = "BIackDahlia",
            text = "\"Follow me, stranger.  This shouldn't take long.\"\n\nMy ass.",
            date = "2011-03-18T04:58:47-05:00",
