            text = "If \"A Mysterious Tome\" (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28552#dropped-by) happens to drop within your first few kills, take that back to Spinebreaker Post first so you can aquire- http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10229 and do it at the same time. Easy quest, easy xp!",
            date = "2007-08-13T17:50:56-05:00",
