            text = "The Duro Overseer, as with all Manaforge Overseers, is in the Manaforge itself.  He is in the South East wing.  He's very easy, but you'll need a group for the next part.",
            date = "2007-03-23T09:17:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10338#comments:id=55798",
        },
        {
            id = 115598,
            score = 9,
            author = "56155",
            text = "do this quest along with-\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10223    http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10267 http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10209 http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10341 i think there's another one",
            date = "2007-07-04T16:16:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10338#comments:id=115598",
        },
        {
            id = 126880,
            score = 6,
            author = "73549",
            text = "There's a glitch that rogue's can exploit, you can just sap the technicians when they try and shut it down, even after sap wears off or you sap something else they won't try shutting it down again.",
            date = "2007-07-25T23:34:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10338#comments:id=126880",
        },
        {
            id = 205917,
            score = 6,
            author = "captirrelevant",
            text = "(In regards to getting around inside the building in general)\n\nUnless you want the extra quick and easy kill (and providing there's some more sunfury elves around) you \"could\" consider the principle of \"the enemy of my enemy is my friend\" for this quest. When in the tower itself (not outside or in the corridors (unless maybe more sunfury elves are close by)), kill the elves with non-AOE attacks, and the arcane anomolies will leave you alone and attack a close-by elf.\n\nBut nonetheless the anomolies are a 5 second kill anyway, so do whatever.",
            date = "2007-12-23T07:03:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10338#comments:id=205917",
        },
    },
