            author = "79376",
            text = "[70] A Dark Pact takes place at and around Manaforge Ara.\n\n\009Gan'arg Warp-Tinker slain (6): I could only find 3 of these guys so I recomend killing 3 of them first then do the other 2 mobs you need to kill and come back and kill these guys once you finish since they will have respawned.  (29.44 at the base of the tube)\n\n\009Daughter of Destiny slain (3):  This mob is a bit harder than the other 2 seeing as you are almost guarenteed to always have a Sunfury Nethermancer add.  There is almost always 1 Daughter of Destiny at each of the camps outside of Manaforge Ara.\n\n\009Mo'arg Warp-Master slain (3):  Inside Manaforge Ara you will see about 4 of these guys.  They almost always come alone unless you agro some mobs inside Ara.\n\nHope this helps.",
