            text = "As of patch 4.3 this is no longer a group quest.\n\nHis health has been reduced to only 8.8k or so, in addition the infernos he spawns only have 1.7k each. Finally, the two mistress of pain type mods that patrol on his platform are no longer present.",
            date = "2011-12-11T00:56:40-06:00",
