            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ukXvQtG0IsY\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10410\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10410, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19467 at coords 32.0, 64.2 (Area 52).\n•\009Travel southwest, to [zone=3703].\n•\009Head to the Aldor's Rise, to coords 24.2, 29.8.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18538.",
