    [10451] = {
        {
            id = 86213,
            score = 79,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "Patch: 2.0.12\nQuest completed without problems: 20 May 2007\n\n1) Enter \"Coilskar Cistern\" at 52.8,25.8\n2) Get to the bottom of the cave and to 51.9,18.4\n3) Kill \"Keeper of the Cistern\"\n4) Wait for \"Earthmender Wilda \" to get interactive, and accept the quest.\n\nIf your friends fails to accept simply wait, after a while you will free some small elementals and then make sure your friends are ready to accept the quest, she will then bug and go back to the start, and start walking to free the elementals... again. But the important thing is that everyone will then have the quest.\n\n5) Kill mobs in her path, skin if possible for high selling Cobra Scales (",
            date = "2007-05-20T10:46:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10451#comments:id=86213",
        },
        {
            id = 70500,
            score = 52,
            author = "Blinkie",
            text = "i put up a good earthshield on that lady, and i browsed the internet, catching up occasionally to reapply earthshield. shes pretty serious about escaping.",
            date = "2007-04-21T13:04:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10451#comments:id=70500",
        },
        {
            id = 1832411,
            score = 23,
            author = "610726",
            text = "I think I've only quested through Shadowmoon once, and even then it wasn't for very long, so I wasn't sure how to get this quest (wanted a reward for transmog). However, this cave looked familiar, and I believe coming here is part of the lengthy https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680 chain; this quest appears to only be an extra \"hey while you're here\" escort quest, and has no effect on that quest chain, but I'm not positive.\n\nThe quest may not appear with addon markers, and definitely not just with low level tracking, because the quest giver is restrained. Killing https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20795 at the back of the cave will release her, then she'll offer this quest.",
            date = "2013-03-21T14:57:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10451#comments:id=1832411",
        },
        {
            id = 1968618,
            score = 19,
            author = "356874",
            text = "\"I sense the tortured spirits, [name].  They are this way. Come quickly!\"\n\n...and she walks.",
            date = "2014-05-30T02:52:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10451#comments:id=1968618",
        },
        {
            id = 1029489,
            score = 12,
            author = "574670",
            text = "Quest appears to have been cleaned up since previous posts.\n\nI found after you release her she helps 1 set of 5 water elementals and on the way out gets ambushed by a single Colisker Assassin's on 4 different occasions, she does manage to walk past a fair few mobs but towards the end of the tunnel I did run into respawns so maybe save those long cooldown abilities incase you get stuck with the assassin and the respawns.\n\nWorth mentioning that the Earthmother and her 5 Water Elementals can take down the Assassin.",
            date = "2010-04-30T09:32:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10451#comments:id=1029489",
        },
    },
