        {
            id = 91674,
            score = 5,
            author = "55813",
            text = "I'd like to add that these are great for grinding, they dont have much health and they drop nice AH stuff and a good load of money, they also give you Kurenai reputation + quest items, including the Oshu'Gun Crystal Powder Sample that can be turned in at Halaa. ^-o",
            date = "2007-05-27T11:20:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10476#comments:id=91674",
        },
    },
    [10477] = {
        {
            id = 33301,
            score = 40,
            author = "21585",
            text = "Assuming you start at 0/12000 honored, to grind ogres to exalted would take roughly 1238 kills.\n\nMATH:\nHonored rep (12k) + Revered rep (21k) = 33k Rep Points\nDrop Rate on Ogres (33%), 10 rep per ogre, 500 rep per Turn-in.\nSo, about 30 kills per turn-in, that's 300 rep (kills) + 500 rep (turn-in) = 800 rep for 30 kills, so...\n\n33,000 divided by 800 rep = 41.25\n41.25 x 30 kills = 1237.5 or 1238 Ogre Kills.\n\n:)",
            date = "2007-02-09T19:28:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10477#comments:id=33301",
        },
        {
            id = 15104,
            score = 10,
            author = "Hazelluna",
            text = "Warbead are more easily farmed in the two caves on either side of the Halanni Basin in Nagrand.  If you have a flying mount there are additional higher level mobs in the hills in middle western Nagrand.",
            date = "2006-12-13T17:56:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10477#comments:id=15104",
        },
        {
            id = 634050,
            score = 10,
            author = "116239",
            text = "As of the most recent patch, each turn in nets you 500 rep, even at 80. Made this a breeze. :)",
            date = "2009-03-07T06:08:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10477#comments:id=634050",
        },
        {
            id = 855317,
            score = 6,
            author = "jerodast",
            text = "Does not count toward Nagrand Slam (http://www.wowhead.com/?achievement=1192).",
            date = "2009-09-29T15:25:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10477#comments:id=855317",
        },
        {
            id = 265504,
            score = 4,
            author = "Sient",
            text = "550 rep if you're human.",
            date = "2008-04-03T02:19:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10477#comments:id=265504",
        },
    },
    [10478] = {
        {
            id = 24777,
            score = 39,
            author = "12916",
            text = "The ogre's around Nagrand give ten reputation per kill. They also have a high chance to drop Obsidian Warbeads which give 500 rep per ten at turn in.\n\nThe ogre's can be found at The Burning Blade Ruin's, Laughing Skull Ruin's and Warmaul Hill.\n\nYou need:\nRevered(21000): 21000 / 500 = 42 * 10 = 420 Warbeads\nHonored(12000): 12000 / 500 = 24 * 10 = 240 Warbeads\nFriendly(6000): 6000 / 500 = 12 * 10 = 120 Warbeads\n\nSee also(Nagrand Map): http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3518\nSee also(Rep Rewards): http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20241",
            date = "2007-01-26T01:06:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10478#comments:id=24777",
        },
        {
            id = 1021596,
            score = 9,
            author = "110087",
            text = "This quest gives 500 rep each time you turn it in, not 250.",
            date = "2010-04-18T03:12:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10478#comments:id=1021596",
        },
        {
            id = 1051560,
            score = 8,
            author = "131595",
            text = "To make this quest or any other similar to this (like the turn in for Hodir rep) make a macro that says:\n\n/script SelectGossipAvailableQuest(1)\n/script CompleteQuest()\n/script GetQuestReward()\n\nTo make the macro work add it to your action bar on an easily spammed button like 1 or 2, whichever is easiest for you.\n\nThen simply right click the guy for the quest turn in and spam the button you have the macro on.\n\nRepeat as needed! Should turn 5 min of work down to about 30 seconds. On a side note, the warbeads have a MUCH higher drop rate from the mobs at Laughing Skull Ruins and you can aoe farm them easily as well, I have averaged about 40% from these and only around 20% from the other mobs that drop warbeads. About every 15-20 min you should expect to pick up about 40-50 beads depending on level and class, good luck farming!",
            date = "2010-06-03T16:28:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10478#comments:id=1051560",
        },
        {
            id = 6326571,
            score = 8,
            author = "Boubamoo",
            text = "A head's up that this quest is available for Alliance doing the Arcantina quest \"Hellscream's Heritage\" but while you CAN go get the Warbeads and turn them in, they only give some silver and copper, no Mag'har rep as expected.\n\nI had to test it though!",
            date = "2026-04-07T19:20:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10478#comments:id=6326571",
        },
        {
            id = 281013,
            score = 5,
            author = "Delaxart",
            text = "With my frostmage, i was able to get like 20(It may have been 30, but i forgot if i had had 9 of them beforehand or not)Warbeads within 30-35mins, meaning around 40 warbeads per hour.\n\nIf above calculations are correct (And if i know how to count) it should take like ~7 hours to get from Revered --> Exalted. Granted you keep your CDs rollin` and are able to keep up the pace with little to no manabreaks ect.",
            date = "2008-05-02T09:28:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10478#comments:id=281013",
        },
    },
