        {
            id = 92215,
            score = 7,
            author = "46878",
            text = "Just to help out those of you who do NOT have coords (as I did this quest just after patch hit):\n\nArrow: Follow the wonderful instructions given above.  Doesn't get much clearer than that.\n\nTablet: There's a path that starts at about the center for the area that leads roughly NW, follow that.  Small hut on the left (near a guard tower) which has the tablet.\n\nDrum: Southern end, there's a bit of an up slope with three huts on it.  The left most hut has the drum.\n\nHope that helps. :)",
            date = "2007-05-28T05:09:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10524#comments:id=92215",
        },
        {
            id = 1673661,
