    [10540] = {
        {
            id = 26820,
            score = 151,
            author = "17514",
            text = "For anyone who like me, mounted up without thinking and flew away losing their spirit and having no idea what to do.\n\nYou are meant to walk with your spirit up to about 30,57 as mentioned above.",
            date = "2007-01-29T01:43:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10540#comments:id=26820",
        },
        {
            id = 30580,
            score = 66,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Cipher of Damnation is an extremely long quest line in Shadowmoon Valley.  It is a prerequisite for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.\n\"*\" Indicates quests with rewards.\n\nQuest Line\n1[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n1[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458 - \"Enraged Spirits of Fire and Earth\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Water\"\n4* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Air\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513 - \"Oronok Torn-Heart\"\n6* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514 - \"I Was A Lot Of Things...\" - Most annoying quest ever implemented in World of Warcraft.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515 - \"A Lesson Learned\"\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History\"\n\nAt this point, the quests diverge into three separate lines (which can be done in any order) for each of Oronok's three sons who will in turn help you obtain the three Fragments of Damnation.\n\nQuest Line I - First Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521 - \"Grom'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge\"\n3* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line II - Second Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527 \"Ar'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528 - \"Demonic Crystal Prisons\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537 - \"Lohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge\"\n5* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line III - Third Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546 \"Borak, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547 - \"Of Thistleheads and Eggs...\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550 - \"The Bundle of Bloodthistle\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570 - \"To Catch A Thistlehead\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576 - \"The Shadowmoon Shuffle\"\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577 - \"What Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets...\"\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge\"\n8* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579 \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered\"\n\nAfter completing the quests for the three Fragments of Damnation, the lines converge and you need to kill one last boss.\nFinal* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588 - \"The Cipher of Damnation\"\n\nRewards:\n\nEveryone gets http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31074 - Fire Resist Neck\n\nChoose one of the following:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036 - Caster Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31038 - Healer Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31062 - Paladin/Shaman 2H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31071 - Tanking 1H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31072 - Bow\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31073 - Melee Dagger\n\nAfter completing the quest, you will get a message in the mail from Khadgar.  If you go to Shattrath, he will tell you to talk to A'Dal, who unlocks the the three Trials.  These are prerequisites for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.",
            date = "2007-02-04T12:12:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10540#comments:id=30580",
        },
        {
            id = 26350,
            score = 45,
            author = "16933",
            text = "Venaratus spawns around 30,57. To make the spirit attack, you got to move right on the mobs, or he will just stand beside you. Be careful for paths, there's a lot of them",
            date = "2007-01-28T11:53:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10540#comments:id=26350",
        },
        {
            id = 53409,
            score = 11,
            author = "Atraira",
            text = "Very easily soloed it as a 68 Pally - ONCE I KNEW WHAT I WAS DOING.\n\n1) Clear the area of EVERYTHING before you talk to him and get your spirit.  Watch for pats.\n2) Once you get the spirit, do not just ride off.  Make your way south, he will follow you.  Avoid engagements if you can, his health does NOT regen (but he can be healed/buffed).\n3) The boss mob will spawn without warning near the top of a hill.  Try to pull it up the hill if you can, I did the whole fight without getting any ads.",
            date = "2007-03-18T22:00:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10540#comments:id=53409",
        },
        {
            id = 65767,
            score = 11,
            author = "35923",
            text = "Blizzard have done a very accurate job of capturing the essence of \"retarded hunter party member\" with this pet. He will aggro things from a long way off, will pull adds in during a fight, and may spawn the boss at any moment once you're in teh general area for the quest.\n\nI ended up doing it by spawning the boss, having the hunter aggro three more mobs by backing up into them for range and wipe us.  Then I ran back, rezzed, and solo'd the quest mob.",
            date = "2007-04-11T21:47:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10540#comments:id=65767",
        },
    },
    [10541] = {
        {
            id = 30579,
            score = 80,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Cipher of Damnation is an extremely long quest line in Shadowmoon Valley.  It is a prerequisite for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.\n\"*\" Indicates quests with rewards.\n\nQuest Line\n1(A) - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n1(H) - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458 - \"Enraged Spirits of Fire and Earth\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Water\"\n4* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10481 - \"Enraged Spirits of Air\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513 - \"Oronok Torn-Heart\"\n6* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514 - \"I Was A Lot Of Things...\" - Most annoying quest ever implemented in World of Warcraft.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515 - \"A Lesson Learned\"\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History\"\n\nAt this point, the quests diverge into three separate lines (which can be done in any order) for each of Oronok's three sons who will in turn help you obtain the three Fragments of Damnation.\n\nQuest Line I - First Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521 - \"Grom'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge\"\n3* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line II - Second Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527 \"Ar'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528 - \"Demonic Crystal Prisons\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537 - \"Lohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge\"\n5* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line III - Third Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546 \"Borak, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547 - \"Of Thistleheads and Eggs...\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550 - \"The Bundle of Bloodthistle\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570 - \"To Catch A Thistlehead\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576 - \"The Shadowmoon Shuffle\"\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577 - \"What Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets...\"\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge\"\n8* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered\"\n\nAfter completing the quests for the three Fragments of Damnation, the lines converge and you need to kill one last boss.\nFinal* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588 - \"The Cipher of Damnation\"\n\nRewards:\n\nEveryone gets http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31074 - Fire Resist Neck\n\nChoose one of the following:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036 - Caster Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31038 - Healer Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31062 - Paladin/Shaman 2H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31071 - Tanking 1H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31072 - Bow\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31073 - Melee Dagger\n\nAfter completing the quest, you will get a message in the mail from Khadgar.  If you go to Shattrath, he will tell you to talk to A'Dal, who unlocks the the three Trials.  These are prerequisites for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time.",
            date = "2007-02-04T12:12:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541#comments:id=30579",
        },
        {
            id = 51211,
            score = 17,
            author = "28508",
            text = "Father found at 54.23.",
            date = "2007-03-14T17:30:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541#comments:id=51211",
        },
        {
            id = 590344,
            score = 7,
            author = "Valdan",
            text = "Ok folks.. Let me bring some reality checks for everyone who takes this quest truly understands the lore/insight on how truly long it is and how the \"Entire\" chain begins and ends.  I noticed the link and some though GREAT input on the chains but there not the entire chains accordingly.  They leave out where its supposed to be picked up, and in truth most of the time you \"cannot\" pick up the quest due to not doing the prior quest chains so if your on this quest below is what you may want to do or of course quit at any moment.  But the story doesn't end here clearly.\n\nQuest chain 1 (8 Parts) : (this one of course)\nHorde: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681)\nAlliance: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680)\nEnraged Spirits of Fire and Earth (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458)\nEnraged Spirits of Water (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480)\nEnraged Spirits of Air (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10481)\nOronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513)\nI Was A Lot Of Things... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514)\nA Lesson Learned (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519)\n\nThen as mentioned before there are the 3 quest in any order but MUST be completed in order to proceed to the next chain\n\n- These are the Fragment of Damnation Quest Series (3 Parts Totalling 16 Quest + 1 Final but not end of Chain = 17 Quest in all):\n(Part 1)\nGrom'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523)\n(Part 2)\nAr'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527)\nDemonic Crystal Prisons (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528)\n- The NPC ghost will appear - The chain continues:\nLohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541)\n(Part 3)\nBorak, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546)\nOf Thistleheads and Eggs... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547)\nThe Bundle of Bloodthistle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550)\nTo Catch A Thistlehead (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570)\nThe Shadowmoon Shuffle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576)\nWhat Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579)\n\nNow mind you \"MUST\" complete the above 3 Parts & also turn them into Oronok before carrying forward.\n\n1 Quest\nThe Cipher of Damnation (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588)\n\nNow also as mentioned before you will get a letter in the mail from\nKhadgar to go to Shattrath and speak with A'Dal.\n\nThis has unlocked your future chains not mentioned linking them together is what I think people should understand the can of worms your about to open:\n\n(4 Part Chain)\n4 Trials total however only 3 can be accepted at first.  They are 3 seperate quest given all at once so you can carry all 3 and complete and run back to turn in all together.  The 4th is after the original 3 are completed.\nThe first 3 are:\nTrial of the Naaru: Tenacity (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10886#comments) (HEROIC MODE) - Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) of Tempest Keep. - Note: Here your saving the mage who will be friendly but you kill this boss: Harbinger Skyriss (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20912)\nTrial of the Naaru: Strength (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10885) (HEROIC MODE) - Warlord Kalithresh (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17798) (Steamvault (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3715)) & Murmur (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18708) (Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789)) in any order but both in Heroic Modes.\nTrial of the Naaru: Mercy (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10884) (HEROIC MODE) - Shattered Hand Executioner (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17301) (Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3714))\n\nNow before we get to the fourth part do note after completing the initial 3 there is a mini chain the unlocks and continues on.  You can have both the 4th trial and this chain at the same time:\n\nTrial of the Naaru: Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13430) (Raid) - Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17257)\n\n(2 Part Chain)\nThe Mark of Vashj (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10900) - You talk to: Skar'this the Heretic (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22421#comments) (He is only found in Heroic Mode and is after the first boss)  in The Slave Pens (http://www.wowhead.com/?quests=2.3717) (Heroic Mode)\nThe Cudgel of Kar'desh (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10901)\n- Gruul the Dragonkiller (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19044) (Gruul's Lair (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3618)) & Nightbane (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17225) (Karazhan (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=2562))\nDo note they can be completed in any order for the 2 dungeons on the last part of this quest chain.\n\nThat is all folks.\n\nQuest Grand Total: 31\nHeroic Dungeons: 5 (Slave Pens twice so technically 6)\nGold rewards/Items/Reputation and Experience gained I didn't do the math on sorry.\nNormal Difficulty Dungeons: 0\n\nNow there is a much longer chain in Ironforge but we wont go there.\n\nEdited for spelling issues",
            date = "2009-02-01T02:48:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541#comments:id=590344",
        },
        {
            id = 2300227,
            score = 3,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0PFcZprFhg\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21318 at coords 29.6, 50.4 (Illidari Point).\n•\009Travel northeast, to Oronok's Farm, located at coords 53.8, 23.4.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183.",
            date = "2016-01-20T13:54:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541#comments:id=2300227",
        },
        {
            id = 5789026,
            score = 2,
            author = "Persephonae",
            text = "word of advice for players attempting this in the age of overpowered killing and dragonriding etc, do not accept this quest while mounted and do not mount while doing this quest. if you mess up and lose your ghost buddy you have to wait for the entire 10min debuff to fall off to try again.",
            date = "2024-02-19T17:18:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10541#comments:id=5789026",
