        {
            id = 590342,
            score = 9,
            author = "Valdan",
            text = "Ok folks.. Let me bring some reality checks for everyone who takes this quest truly understands the lore/insight on how truly long it is and how the \"Entire\" chain begins and ends.  I noticed the link and some though GREAT input on the chains but there not the entire chains accordingly.  They leave out where its supposed to be picked up, and in truth most of the time you \"cannot\" pick up the quest due to not doing the prior quest chains so if your on this quest below is what you may want to do or of course quit at any moment.  But the story doesn't end here clearly.\n\nQuest chain 1 (8 Parts) : (this one of course)\nHorde: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681)\nAlliance: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680)\nEnraged Spirits of Fire and Earth (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458)\nEnraged Spirits of Water (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480)\nEnraged Spirits of Air (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10481)\nOronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513)\nI Was A Lot Of Things... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514)\nA Lesson Learned (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519)\n\nThen as mentioned before there are the 3 quest in any order but MUST be completed in order to proceed to the next chain\n\n- These are the Fragment of Damnation Quest Series (3 Parts Totalling 16 Quest + 1 Final but not end of Chain = 17 Quest in all):\n(Part 1)\nGrom'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523)\n(Part 2)\nAr'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527)\nDemonic Crystal Prisons (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528)\n- The NPC ghost will appear - The chain continues:\nLohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541)\n(Part 3)\nBorak, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546)\nOf Thistleheads and Eggs... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547)\nThe Bundle of Bloodthistle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550)\nTo Catch A Thistlehead (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570)\nThe Shadowmoon Shuffle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576)\nWhat Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579)\n\nNow mind you \"MUST\" complete the above 3 Parts & also turn them into Oronok before carrying forward.\n\n1 Quest\nThe Cipher of Damnation (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588)\n\nNow also as mentioned before you will get a letter in the mail from\nKhadgar to go to Shattrath and speak with A'Dal.\n\nThis has unlocked your future chains not mentioned linking them together is what I think people should understand the can of worms your about to open:\n\n(4 Part Chain)\n4 Trials total however only 3 can be accepted at first.  They are 3 seperate quest given all at once so you can carry all 3 and complete and run back to turn in all together.  The 4th is after the original 3 are completed.\nThe first 3 are:\nTrial of the Naaru: Tenacity (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10886#comments) (HEROIC MODE) - Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) of Tempest Keep. - Note: Here your saving the mage who will be friendly but you kill this boss: Harbinger Skyriss (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20912)\nTrial of the Naaru: Strength (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10885) (HEROIC MODE) - Warlord Kalithresh (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17798) (Steamvault (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3715)) & Murmur (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18708) (Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789)) in any order but both in Heroic Modes.\nTrial of the Naaru: Mercy (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10884) (HEROIC MODE) - Shattered Hand Executioner (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17301) (Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3714))\n\nNow before we get to the fourth part do note after completing the initial 3 there is a mini chain the unlocks and continues on.  You can have both the 4th trial and this chain at the same time:\n\nTrial of the Naaru: Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13430) (Raid) - Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17257)\n\n(2 Part Chain)\nThe Mark of Vashj (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10900) - You talk to: Skar'this the Heretic (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22421#comments) (He is only found in Heroic Mode and is after the first boss)  in The Slave Pens (http://www.wowhead.com/?quests=2.3717) (Heroic Mode)\nThe Cudgel of Kar'desh (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10901)\n- Gruul the Dragonkiller (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19044) (Gruul's Lair (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3618)) & Nightbane (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17225) (Karazhan (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=2562))\nDo note they can be completed in any order for the 2 dungeons on the last part of this quest chain.\n\nThat is all folks.\n\nQuest Grand Total: 31\nHeroic Dungeons: 5 (Slave Pens twice so technically 6)\nGold rewards/Items/Reputation and Experience gained I didn't do the math on sorry.\nNormal Difficulty Dungeons: 0\n\nNow there is a much longer chain in Ironforge but we wont go there.\n\nEdited for spelling issues",
            date = "2009-02-01T02:47:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10546#comments:id=590342",
        },
        {
            id = 1638377,
            score = 7,
            author = "Restorawr",
            text = "Basic chain's quest guide beginning from this quest:\nQuest1) Find and talk to this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21293).\nQuest2) Have fun trying to get the right egg (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30500) for this quest. Go to Shattrath and deliver your egg to this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21411).\nQuest3) Take your bait (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30501) back to this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21293).\nQuest4) Place your bait (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30616) to the other side of the bridge that Borak is standing by and wait for this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21409) to dismiss his guard. Kill him and loot your missive (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30617).\nQuest5) Kill these (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30640#dropped-by:0-9-8+1) and collect their armour (www.wowhead.com/item=30640).\nQuest6) Use this (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30639) to go talk to this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=20563). Borak will give you another disguise if you lose it. Also don't try to mount/attack while wearing it. It will be removed.\nQuest7) Kill this guy (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21315). He is elite, but should be soloable at cap. Don't forget to loot the fragment (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30645).\nQuest8) Return to Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183), not Borak. Receive your lewts.\n\nThis does not require entry into any raid or dungeon instances.",
            date = "2012-03-11T20:33:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10546#comments:id=1638377",
        },
        {
            id = 190751,
            score = 5,
