            text = "To do this quest you first need to do A'dal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10210) and then City of Light (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10211).",
            date = "2007-01-17T18:58:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551#comments:id=21126",
        },
        {
            id = 23376,
            score = 51,
            author = "10784",
            text = "For more information on which faction is right for your class, reference:\n\nhttp://www.wowwiki.com/Comparison_of_Aldor_and_Scryer_rewards",
            date = "2007-01-23T16:19:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551#comments:id=23376",
        },
        {
            id = 3193905,
            score = 36,
            author = "Berbe",
            text = "OK... So searched ways to start this quest and finally finish Socrethar in Netherstorm like crazy... All coments led to Allegiance to the Aldor and to the script to see where you're at in the quest line....\n\nBut NO ONE said that you actually have to do Haggard War Veteran's quest first that leads you to A'dal which further leads you to Archmage Khadgar's questline.\n\nTherefor, here you go -> [quest=10210 domain=www] This is the actual quest that you need in order to get to the Allegiance to the Aldor/Scryers quest and further up.",
            date = "2020-03-09T07:41:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551#comments:id=3193905",
        },
        {
            id = 78845,
            score = 9,
            author = "12457",
            text = "For draenei, you are already friendly with the Aldor. It is worth noting that this quest is still available, and does give the same amount of reputation as a reward, giving draenei a large advantage for Aldor reputation and a large disadvantage for Scryers, and vice versa for blood elves. It is reccomended that for each of these races you become nuetral off of the simple lower city quests, as this still works after that point whereas you can only do those easy repeatables before nuetral.",
            date = "2007-05-06T20:21:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551#comments:id=78845",
        },
        {
            id = 55842,
            score = 3,
            author = "36385",
            text = "Can you save this quest and build up faction with the aldor first, or do you have to do this quest to unlock all the other quests to build faction?",
            date = "2007-03-23T11:03:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551#comments:id=55842",
        },
    },
