            score = 6,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=in6jeBqAcpc\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10564\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10564, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21357 at coords 39.4, 53.6 (Wildhammer Stronghold).\n•\009Travel northwest, to Legion Hold, to coords 22.7, 39.9.\n•\009Stand in a green rune, on the ground, and use the https://www.wowhead.com/item=30614, you were provided.\n•\009Travel southeast, to Wildhammer Stronghold, at coords 39.4, 53.6.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21357.",
            date = "2016-01-20T14:48:38-06:00",
