        },
    },
    [10570] = {
        {
            id = 30589,
            score = 61,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Cipher of Damnation is an extremely long quest line in Shadowmoon Valley.  It is a prerequisite for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.\n\"*\" Indicates quests with rewards.\n\nQuest Line\n1[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n1[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458 - \"Enraged Spirits of Fire and Earth\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Water\"\n4* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Air\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513 - \"Oronok Torn-Heart\"\n6* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514 - \"I Was A Lot Of Things...\" - Most annoying quest ever implemented in World of Warcraft.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515 - \"A Lesson Learned\"\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History\"\n\nAt this point, the quests diverge into three separate lines (which can be done in any order) for each of Oronok's three sons who will in turn help you obtain the three Fragments of Damnation.\n\nQuest Line I - First Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521 - \"Grom'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge\"\n3* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line II - Second Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527 \"Ar'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528 - \"Demonic Crystal Prisons\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537 - \"Lohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge\"\n5* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line III - Third Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546 \"Borak, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547 - \"Of Thistleheads and Eggs...\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550 - \"The Bundle of Bloodthistle\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570 - \"To Catch A Thistlehead\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576 - \"The Shadowmoon Shuffle\"\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577 - \"What Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets...\"\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge\"\n8* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579 \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered\"\n\nAfter completing the quests for the three Fragments of Damnation, the lines converge and you need to kill one last boss.\nFinal* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588 - \"The Cipher of Damnation\"\n\nRewards:\n\nEveryone gets http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31074 - Fire Resist Neck\n\nChoose one of the following:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036 - Caster Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31038 - Healer Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31062 - Paladin/Shaman 2H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31071 - Tanking 1H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31072 - Bow\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31073 - Melee Dagger\n\nAfter completing the quest, you will get a message in the mail from Khadgar.  If you go to Shattrath, he will tell you to talk to A'Dal, who unlocks the the three Trials.  These are prerequisites for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.",
            date = "2007-02-04T12:19:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10570#comments:id=30589",
        },
        {
            id = 266966,
            score = 61,
            author = "Nujabes",
            text = "Little conversation that transpires between Zarath and Icarius for those who were curious but did not get close enough.\n\n*Upon spotting the carelessly 'discarded' Bloodthistle*\n\nBlood Lord Zarath says: What is it, my lord?\nEnvoy Icarius says: Zarath you must return to the Black Temple at once! I... I seem to have misplaced Lord Illidan's orders. Quickly!\nBlood Lord Zarath says: My lord, surely you do not expect me to leave you unattended. Lord Illidan would have my head if anything were to happen to you.\nEnvoy Icarius says: Zarath, I am perfectly capable of making it up this road to Eclipse Point. If we do not deliver the missive, Lord Illidan will have both of our heads! You are dismissed!\nBlood Lord Zarath says: As you wish, my lord.\nEnvoy Icarius says: Ah, sweet, sweet bloodthistle... Probably left behind by one of those filthy addicts at Eclipse Point.\nEnvoy Icarius says: Their loss is most definitely my gain...",
            date = "2008-04-05T17:34:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10570#comments:id=266966",
        },
        {
            id = 26537,
            score = 36,
            author = "11966",
            text = "Just do as requested.  Lay it at the other end of the bridge, get some distance and wait for the elf and his mounted bodyguard to appear.  After an exchange the bodyguard will vanish and when the elf goes for the bloodthistle, get him!",
            date = "2007-01-28T17:16:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10570#comments:id=26537",
        },
        {
            id = 54784,
            score = 34,
            author = "21092",
            text = "Just in case anyone is confused, you lay the Bloodthistle at coordinates 48,57",
            date = "2007-03-21T11:22:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10570#comments:id=54784",
        },
        {
            id = 28445,
            score = 19,
            author = "15654",
            text = "Worth noting that the body guard won't go if your stood to close so make sure your stood about half way on the bridge other then that the guy dies easy.",
            date = "2007-01-31T17:32:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10570#comments:id=28445",
        },
    },
    [10571] = {
        {
            id = 28456,
            score = 38,
            author = "Grans",
            text = "Oronu the Elder can be found on the balcony, about 57,32. Very fast to do with flying mount.",
            date = "2007-01-31T17:46:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10571#comments:id=28456",
        },
        {
            id = 99013,
            score = 18,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T22:26:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10571#comments:id=99013",
        },
        {
            id = 32565,
            score = 7,
            author = "17625",
            text = "Oronu the Elder - can heal so be aware of that",
            date = "2007-02-08T05:44:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10571#comments:id=32565",
        },
        {
            id = 370465,
            score = 3,
            author = "EightBitBus",
            text = "Hunters and warlocks, you can stand at 57,33 (right below his balcony on a small hill) and /target Oronu. Once you have him targeted have your pet attack, it will scale the side of the mountain. As soon as it engages Oronu pull your pet back and there you go. No need to clear the whole camp or even have a flying mount.",
            date = "2008-09-06T21:33:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10571#comments:id=370465",
        },
        {
            id = 290181,
            score = 1,
            author = "BlueShoals",
            text = "This dropped in one shot for me... Interrupted his healing with a vengeance, just dropped right on on him without aggro from the warriors around him.",
            date = "2008-05-18T02:43:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10571#comments:id=290181",
        },
    },
