            author = "4484",
            text = "The quest will not show up if you have any of the Toshley Station quests in your quest log.\n\nIt doesn't matter if you never picked them up, if you picked them up and then abandoned them, or if you completed them, the only thing that matters is that they're not in your quest log in that moment.\n\nSo all above posts are correct.",
