        {
            id = 146041,
            score = 7,
            author = "Vollana",
            text = "I did all of the Sylvanaar quests (or thought I had) at 68 and realized i hadn't done the group quest you get from the vindicator \"Plant the Banner\".  Once I finished that and turned it into Commander Skyshadow, the quest for the gnomes came up.  What I believe happens is you have to do all the quests that are turned into him to get that quest, not necessarily all quests from Sylvanaar.\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10927\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10504\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10502\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10512\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10511\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10556\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10510\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10555\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10506\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10456\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10457\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10455\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10516\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10517\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10518\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10690 (wanted poster)",
            date = "2007-08-29T13:15:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10580#comments:id=146041",
        },
        {
            id = 390735,
            score = 7,
            author = "Elinye",
            text = "You have to turn it in to this little guy: http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21690\n\nAnd I'm pretty sure you only have to complete the quests that end with Commander Skyshadow:\nKilling the Crawlers: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10927\nThe Den Mother: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10690\nThe Bloodmaul Ogres: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10502\nThe Bladespire Ogres: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10504\nPlanting the Banner: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10518\n\nOf course, you don't get Planting the Banner until you've completed these quests from Vindicator Vuuleen:\nThe Trappings of a Vindicator: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10516\nGorr'Dim, Your Time Has Come: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10517\n\nSo you really only have to do about half of the quests in Sylvanaar before they send you off to Toshley's, but you might as well do them all. They go really fast, and it's a decent amount of exp.",
            date = "2008-09-28T11:51:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10580#comments:id=390735",
        },
    },
