            text = "them Crystal Flayers are found in the Singing Ridge wandering around Crystals just south of Toshley's Station, and be carful there are Lesser netherdrakes in the erea.\n\nif only you can take one of them drakes and feed him well and grow it up to become and Eternal Netherdrake to ride it xD",
