        {
            id = 1860677,
            score = 1,
            author = "zoomgofstr",
            text = "Getting the Ruuan Weald quest back.  After completing Trial and Error, (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10566)  I received the quest Ruuan Weald (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10615) and flew over to Ruuan Weald.  I was not able to turn in the quest to Timeon (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21782).  I flew back to Mok'Nathal Village to see if I missed anything.  It did not appear that I had missed anything.  I dropped the quest.  Now Dertrok. (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21496) no longer offers the quest to me.  Any suggestions on getting the quest back?",
            date = "2013-05-31T08:39:57-05:00",
