            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10623#comments:id=36229",
        },
        {
            id = 236516,
            score = 5,
            author = "Dzinn",
            text = "ok, so I was grinding Aldor rep, a good while ago, and the Illidari Bane Shard dropped from Overseer Ripmaw, I picked it up and didn't think much of it, now back in those days, this item must have not been a unique item. Since a few days later another one dropped for me.\n\nThis is when I got clever... I rushed to the questgiver in Shadowmoon Village handed that first IB-Shard in and rushed back to loot overseer Ripmaw again.\n\nLo and Behold, I have now both the Bane Shard AND the Demonslaying sword. My question is now, does the Bane Shard actually add attack power / spell damage from just being carried around in a bag?\nIf so, Hooray! :)",
            date = "2008-02-15T07:00:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10623#comments:id=236516",
        },
        {
            id = 5834204,
            score = 3,
            author = "mooonero",
            text = "I tried to kill Overseer Ripsaw a few times now but never got the quest item.\nThe problem was that i already finished the quest and had to go further.\nYou can check the completion here: https://questchecker.com/\n\nAfter i noticed it i went to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21465 in Terrokar Forest that started the next quest for the completion of  https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1195\n\nHope this helps!",
            date = "2024-04-19T06:19:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10623#comments:id=5834204",
        },
        {
            id = 5173166,
            score = 2,
            author = "Berbe",
            text = "If you are searching for Overseer Ripsaw as an Orc like in the screenshot posted here, he is not. He is a Demon with a saw on one of it's hands and a claw on the other, simillar with the others with a drill on their hand, walking around there. There is a video as well on this thread with him. I was searching for one looking like an Orc and didn't knew what i was doing wrong. That screenshot is kinda misleading here, tbf.... Hope this helps.",
            date = "2021-05-10T04:54:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10623#comments:id=5173166",
        },
        {
            id = 3180529,
