            author = "MissKatt",
            text = "If you want the transmog and have done this quest in the past, you can just go to the NPC and ask for replacement spectracles.  I ran the script /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(10633)) to find one of my alts did it eons ago, and scooped them today.",
