        {
            id = 293164,
            score = 3,
            author = "Gunmetal",
            text = "I'm Demonology spec Warlock, I just kept spamming the attack button like rnoahp mentioned he did with his hunter pet.  Seems like you wouldn't be able to use pets at all, as they're not wearing the spectrecles, how do they know anything is there?  It's funny because my Felguard seems so confused.",
