        {
            id = 1367251,
            score = 4,
            author = "kerrymayall",
            text = "As a diehard Warcraft 3 fan into all the lore, it was so cool to finally see Maiev Shadowsong.\n\nGiven her years of solitude and thinking her recently found brother, Jarod Shadowsong (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=49448) is dead, I wonder if they'll ever do some sort of reunion sequence between the two - thats assuming she can pry Shandris Feathermoon (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3936) away from him.",
            date = "2011-03-15T01:21:19-05:00",
