            score = 43,
            author = "36223",
            text = "kill them near 63,33 and if you wanna do a \"suicide\" kill (just kill one, die, rez, loot) you'll spawn at the graveyard nearby!\n\nDPS warr - charged in, recklessness, burned down 2, died, rezzed at the nearby graveyard and looted the truncheon",
            date = "2007-03-22T21:04:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10636#comments:id=55607",
        },
        {
