            date = "2007-02-28T08:22:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10636#comments:id=43851",
        },
        {
            id = 32522,
            score = 36,
            author = "5519",
            text = "They are pretty fast so run the road clockwise to find them quicker.\n\nEasily soloed with lvl 70 warlock though there were only 3 of them. Sent my voidwalker to tank and he was still alive when they were all dead. They are also undead so no sheep / fear.",
            date = "2007-02-08T02:19:03-06:00",
