            author = "innoby",
            text = "You do not have to be alive to complete this quest, I died and then ran to figure out how to get there while still dead, and lo and behold I could complete the quest while dead.",
            date = "2009-07-05T15:42:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10644#comments:id=768696",
        },
        {
            id = 37633,
            score = 8,
            author = "672",
            text = "If you don't have a flying mount and you are aligned with the scryer's, simply fly to the scryer's area and then go around the mountain.  If you aren't aligned with the scryer's, just ride to their small camp \"sanctum of the stars\" and then go around to the east then south.\n\nThis is the same alter used in making shadowcloth.",
            date = "2007-02-17T16:37:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10644#comments:id=37633",
