        {
            id = 1272657,
            score = 4,
            author = "752569",
            text = "Just solo'd as a 69 BM Hunter.  3rd times a charm!  Tried first with spawn of Uvuros even with Ancient Hysteria.  Second time with a devilsaur....didn't work.  Then use a boar to tank.  Just kept Mend Pet up and shot a couple explosive traps, snake traps(not sure why).  Even when my pet died Uvuros was at 5%, I was at around 40-50% health but he hits hard and he just hit me with fear.  Turned around and spammed Arcane Shot.  Very close but glad to see him down.",
            date = "2011-01-02T05:18:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10648#comments:id=1272657",
        },
        {
            id = 667073,
            score = 3,
            author = "88677",
            text = "This guy still hits hard at 80, especially when you don't have very good gear.\n\nSolo'ed as lvl 80 feral druid. In Cat form this quest is still suicide, the flame breath will take you out too fast.\nIn bear form, I got him down fairly easy though.\n\n17.6K health, 22K armor, 20% dodge, 3000 ap, 410 defense, in bear form. And no, for a lvl 80 bear that's not very good. When he got me down to about 50% health I jumped out and casted renew and rejuvenate on myself, then back in bear and finished him off. Gear's a mix of WotLK quest and rep rewards, mostly greens, a couple of 187 blues, most gear lower level than that.",
            date = "2009-04-05T21:45:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10648#comments:id=667073",
        },
    },
