            date = "2007-02-22T08:09:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10666#comments:id=40402",
        },
        {
            id = 1086864,
            score = 16,
            author = "632565",
            text = "This quest counts for the Shadow of the Betrayer Achievement if you are going for your Loremaster.",
            date = "2010-07-22T22:12:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10666#comments:id=1086864",
        },
        {
            id = 1565798,
            score = 14,
            author = "246354",
            text = "The quets item drops in Heroic mode now. (have no idea how ago it was fixed). Dropped for me today.",
            date = "2011-11-07T16:14:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10666#comments:id=1565798",
        },
        {
            id = 32113,
            score = 8,
            author = "5018",
            text = "After doing this quest & this: http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10665\n\nYou get two new dungeon related quests\nNamely these:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10670\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10667\n\nHope that helps out a bit in figuring out this rather complicated questline :)",
            date = "2007-02-07T07:51:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10666#comments:id=32113",
        },
        {
            id = 2545392,
            score = 1,
            author = "mm0p",
            text = "I was doing this quest today at level 110. I first did it on heroic not realizing it didn't drop on heroic. Then i did it on normal but the item did not drop. Then i created a private group in the premade group finder to simulate a normal dungeon run and it dropped. I am not sure if the last part is why it dropped or if it is just  not 100% droprate. It seems odd though not to have a dungeon quest item 100% drop rate.",
            date = "2018-01-13T13:55:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10666#comments:id=2545392",
        },
    },
    [10667] = {
        {
            id = 40410,
            score = 73,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Illidari-Bane questline is a series of quests that leads to some cool anti-demon weapons.  It involves entering many level-70 instances, so you probably want to do the prerequisites before then.  David Wayne is also rumored to be Mograine of the Ashbringer.\n\nQuest Line\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10621 - Illidari-Bane Shard - Drops from Overseer Ripsaw.\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10626 - Capture the Weapons - Soloable as a warlock with banish.\n3[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10662 - The Hermit Smith\n3[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10663 - The Hermit Smith\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10664 - Additional Materials\n\nAfter returning Additional Materials, he offers you two quests which can be completed in any order.\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10665 - Fresh From the Mechanar - The Mechanar in Tempest Keep\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10666 - The Lexicon Demonica - Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun\n\nAfter returning both of these quests, he offers you the second pair which can be completed in any order.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10670 - Tear of the Earthmother - Shattered Halls in Hellfire Citadel\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10667 - Underworld Loam - The Steamvault in Coilfang Reservoir\n\nAfter finishing all these, you can get your new weapon!\n9 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10676 - Bane of the Illidari\n10 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10679 - Quenching the Blade\n\nThe rewards are:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30788 - Melee 1H Sword\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30789 - Melee 2H Sword\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30787 - Caster Dagger\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31745 - Melee Dagger\n\nCombined with the http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30756 that started the quest chain, you will have a lot of extra attack power or spell damage versus demons.",
            date = "2007-02-22T08:20:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10667#comments:id=40410",
        },
        {
            id = 408682,
            score = 25,
            author = "185173",
            text = "just recieved in heroic steamvaults",
            date = "2008-10-16T20:30:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10667#comments:id=408682",
        },
        {
            id = 1676969,
            score = 12,
            author = "941372",
            text = "Counts towards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1195.",
            date = "2012-06-15T12:48:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10667#comments:id=1676969",
        },
        {
            id = 2624044,
            score = -12,
            author = "234707",
            text = "This is what is missing from the past expansions quest lines like this, you aren't getting a legendary you are investing time in the game for a weapon.  I am currently 6/8 H Uldir and I am doing this quest because there is nothing engaging in the game currently.",
            date = "2018-10-16T18:56:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10667#comments:id=2624044",
        },
    },
