    [10679] = {
        {
            id = 40344,
            score = 112,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Illidari-Bane questline is a series of quests that leads to some cool anti-demon weapons.  It involves entering many level-70 instances, so you probably want to do the prerequisites before then.  David Wayne is also rumored to be Mograine of the Ashbringer.\n\nQuest Line\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10621 - Illidari-Bane Shard - Drops from Overseer Ripsaw.\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10626 - Capture the Weapons - Soloable as a warlock with banish.\n3[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10662 - The Hermit Smith\n3[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10663 - The Hermit Smith\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10664 - Additional Materials\n\nAfter returning Additional Materials, he offers you two quests which can be completed in any order.\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10665 - Fresh From the Mechanar - The Mechanar in Tempest Keep\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10666 - The Lexicon Demonica - Shadow Labyrinth in Auchindoun\n\nAfter returning both of these quests, he offers you the second pair which can be completed in any order.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10670 - Tear of the Earthmother - Shattered Halls in Hellfire Citadel\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10667 - Underworld Loam - The Steamvault in Coilfang Reservoir\n\nAfter finishing all these, you can get your new weapon!\n9 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10676 - Bane of the Illidari\n10 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10679 - Quenching the Blade\n\nThe rewards are:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30788 - Melee 1H Sword\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30789 - Melee 2H Sword\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=30787 - Caster Dagger\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31745 - Melee Dagger\n\nCombined with the http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30756 that started the quest chain, you will have a lot of extra attack power or spell damage versus demons.",
            date = "2007-02-22T06:25:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10679#comments:id=40344",
        },
        {
            id = 36926,
            score = 36,
            author = "24382",
            text = "51,40 is the location of the scalding pools.  You have to fly up here. Once there use the item provided and make sure you loot the blade once its quenched.",
            date = "2007-02-16T10:48:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10679#comments:id=36926",
        },
        {
            id = 174924,
            score = 17,
            author = "68244",
            text = "Yikes! It seems no one has mentioned WHERE to quench the blade! Try 51,40 in SMV.",
            date = "2007-10-25T22:46:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10679#comments:id=174924",
        },
        {
            id = 22917,
            score = 16,
            author = "10798",
            text = "That 1hand sword is PERFECT for rogues wanting to grind Aldor rep. Killing demons all day for Marks of Sargeras and Fel Armaments. NEED. I'm on the quest too atm. It starts from a drop in Shadowmoon Valley, at the first demon camp.",
            date = "2007-01-22T18:46:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10679#comments:id=22917",
        },
        {
            id = 60737,
            score = 5,
            author = "25970",
            text = "The amount of AP added on these weapons makes them about equivalent to a level 70 epic (against Demons only) assuming it has NO STATS. Any low end 70 epic (which typically have 78-80 DPS) will beat these weapons when accounting for the stats on the item since most have AP, Str, Crit, Agi, Stam, etc.\n\nAll of these weapons are easily replaced before any serious Demon  encounters (though the caster dagger is somewhat useful).\n\nAdditionally, it costs ~50g to gather the mats and you get only half of this back from completing the rest of the quest line.",
            date = "2007-04-01T20:37:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10679#comments:id=60737",
        },
    },
    [10680] = {
        {
            id = 30562,
            score = 159,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Cipher of Damnation is an extremely long quest line in Shadowmoon Valley.  It is a prerequisite for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.\n\"*\" Indicates quests with rewards.\n\nQuest Line\n1[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n1[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458 - \"Enraged Spirits of Fire and Earth\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Water\"\n4* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Air\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513 - \"Oronok Torn-Heart\"\n6* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514 - \"I Was A Lot Of Things...\" - Most annoying quest ever implemented in World of Warcraft.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515 - \"A Lesson Learned\"\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History\"\n\nAt this point, the quests diverge into three separate lines (which can be done in any order) for each of Oronok's three sons who will in turn help you obtain the three Fragments of Damnation.\n\nQuest Line I - First Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521 - \"Grom'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge\"\n3* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line II - Second Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527 \"Ar'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528 - \"Demonic Crystal Prisons\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537 - \"Lohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge\"\n5* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line III - Third Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546 \"Borak, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547 - \"Of Thistleheads and Eggs...\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550 - \"The Bundle of Bloodthistle\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570 - \"To Catch A Thistlehead\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576 - \"The Shadowmoon Shuffle\"\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577 - \"What Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets...\"\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge\"\n8* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579 \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered\"\n\nAfter completing the quests for the three Fragments of Damnation, the lines converge and you need to kill one last boss.\nFinal* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588 - \"The Cipher of Damnation\"\n\nRewards:\n\nEveryone gets http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31074 - Fire Resist Neck\n\nChoose one of the following:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036 - Caster Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31038 - Healer Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31062 - Paladin/Shaman 2H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31071 - Tanking 1H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31072 - Bow\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31073 - Melee Dagger\n\nAfter completing the quest, you will get a message in the mail from Khadgar.  If you go to Shattrath, he will tell you to talk to A'Dal, who unlocks the the three Trials.  These are prerequisites for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.",
            date = "2007-02-04T12:00:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680#comments:id=30562",
        },
        {
            id = 28356,
            score = 47,
            author = "Atala",
            text = "This begins the quest line for the Tempest Keep key.",
            date = "2007-01-31T15:12:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680#comments:id=28356",
        },
        {
            id = 590325,
            score = 26,
            author = "Valdan",
            text = "Ok folks.. Let me bring some reality checks for everyone who takes this quest truly understands the lore/insight on how truly long it is and how the \"Entire\" chain begins and ends.  I noticed the link and some though GREAT input on the chains but there not the entire chains from beginning to end (primarily the ending).  They leave out where its supposed to be picked up, and in truth most of the time you \"cannot\" pick up the quest due to not doing the prior quest chains so if your on this quest below is what you may want to do or of course quit at any moment.  But the story doesn't end here clearly.\n\nQuest chain 1 (8 Parts) : (this one of course)\nHorde: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681)\nAlliance: The Hand of Gul'dan (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680)\nEnraged Spirits of Fire and Earth (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458)\nEnraged Spirits of Water (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480)\nEnraged Spirits of Air (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10481)\nOronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513)\nI Was A Lot Of Things... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514)\nA Lesson Learned (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519)\n\nThen as mentioned before there are the 3 quest in any order but MUST be completed in order to proceed to the next chain\n\n- These are the Fragment of Damnation Quest Series (3 Parts Totalling 16 Quest + 1 Final but not end of Chain = 17 Quest in all):\n(Part 1)\nGrom'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523)\n(Part 2)\nAr'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527)\nDemonic Crystal Prisons (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528)\n- The NPC ghost will appear - The chain continues:\nLohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541)\n(Part 3)\nBorak, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546)\nOf Thistleheads and Eggs... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547)\nThe Bundle of Bloodthistle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550)\nTo Catch A Thistlehead (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570)\nThe Shadowmoon Shuffle (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576)\nWhat Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets... (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578)\nThe Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579)\n\nNow mind you \"MUST\" complete the above 3 Parts & also turn them into Oronok before carrying forward.\n\n1 Quest\nThe Cipher of Damnation (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588)\n\nNow also as mentioned before you will get a letter in the mail from\nKhadgar to go to Shattrath and speak with A'Dal.\n\nThis has unlocked your future chains not mentioned linking them together is what I think people should understand the can of worms your about to open:\n\n(4 Part Chain)\n4 Trials total however only 3 can be accepted at first.  They are 3 seperate quest given all at once so you can carry all 3 and complete and run back to turn in all together.  The 4th is after the original 3 are completed.\nThe first 3 are:\nTrial of the Naaru: Tenacity (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10886#comments) (HEROIC MODE) - Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) of Tempest Keep. - Note: Here your saving the mage who will be friendly but you kill this boss: Harbinger Skyriss (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20912)\nTrial of the Naaru: Strength (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10885) (HEROIC MODE) - Warlord Kalithresh (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17798) (Steamvault (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3715)) & Murmur (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18708) (Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789)) in any order but both in Heroic Modes.\nTrial of the Naaru: Mercy (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10884) (HEROIC MODE) - Shattered Hand Executioner (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17301) (Shattered Halls of Hellfire Citadel (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3714))\n\nNow before we get to the fourth part do note after completing the initial 3 there is a mini chain the unlocks and continues on.  You can have both the 4th trial and this chain at the same time:\n\nTrial of the Naaru: Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13430) (Raid) - Magtheridon (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17257)\n\n(2 Part Chain)\nThe Mark of Vashj (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10900) - You talk to: Skar'this the Heretic (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22421#comments) (He is only found in Heroic Mode and is after the first boss)  in The Slave Pens (http://www.wowhead.com/?quests=2.3717) (Heroic Mode)\nThe Cudgel of Kar'desh (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10901)\n- Gruul the Dragonkiller (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19044) (Gruul's Lair (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3618)) & Nightbane (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17225) (Karazhan (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=2562))\nDo note they can be completed in any order for the 2 dungeons on the last part of this quest chain.\n\nThat is all folks.\n\nQuest Grand Total: 31\nHeroic Dungeons: 5 (Slave Pens twice so technically 6)\nGold rewards/Items/Reputation and Experience gained I didn't do the math on sorry.\nNormal Difficulty Dungeons: 0\n\nNow there is a much longer chain in Ironforge but we wont go there.\n\nEdited for spelling issues",
            date = "2009-02-01T02:40:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680#comments:id=590325",
        },
        {
            id = 33546,
            score = 19,
            author = "6989",
            text = "Horde quest giver is at 28,26.\nAlliance quest giver is at 36,56.",
            date = "2007-02-10T10:28:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680#comments:id=33546",
        },
        {
            id = 2132245,
            score = 16,
            author = "802086",
            text = "For those of you who may be at max level and cannot find the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680 above the head of either Earthmender Splinthoof (Horde) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21938/earthmender-splinthoof) or Earthmender Sophurus (Alliance) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21937/earthmender-sophurus) you have either already completed the quest or...you may be like me.\n\nAfter much frustration and over an hour of looking on the internet and flying around Shadowmoon Valley doing random quests it finally occured to me that as I was leveling up I may have started the quest and decided for one reason or another to stop the chain.\nSure enough as I tracked down the quest line NPC's I found Oronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183/oronok-torn-heart) sitting there with a big fat ! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10514/i-was-a-lot-of-things) sitting above his head. This is what I get for not eating my vegetables (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30356/shadowmoon-tuber).\n\nHere is a list of all the NPC's along the way so you can save some time tracking down your place in the quest chain:\nEarthmender Splinthoof (Horde) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21938/earthmender-splinthoof) or Earthmender Sophurus (Alliance) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21937/earthmender-sophurus)\nEarthmender Torlok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21024/earthmender-torlok)\nOronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183/oronok-torn-heart)\nFrom here the chain diverts off into 3 paths involving 5 NPC's:\n1. Artor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21292/artor-son-of-oronok)\n1. Spirit of Artor (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21318/spirit-of-artor)\n2. Borak, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21293/borak-son-of-oronok)\n2. Tobias the Filth Gorger (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21411/tobias-the-filth-gorger)\n3. Grom'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21291/gromtor-son-of-oronok)\n\nI know there are others who had the same problem as me so I hope helps them.",
            date = "2015-03-06T17:27:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680#comments:id=2132245",
        },
    },
    [10681] = {
        {
            id = 30555,
            score = 134,
            author = "marskid2",
            text = "The Cipher of Damnation is an extremely long quest line in Shadowmoon Valley.  It is a prerequisite for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.\n\"*\" Indicates quests with rewards.\n\nQuest Line\n1[A] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10680 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n1[H] - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10681 - \"The Hand of Gul'Dan\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10458 - \"Enraged Spirits of Fire and Earth\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Water\"\n4* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10480 - \"Enraged Spirits of Air\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10513 - \"Oronok Torn-Heart\"\n6* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10514 - \"I Was A Lot Of Things...\" - Most annoying quest ever implemented in World of Warcraft.\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10515 - \"A Lesson Learned\"\n8 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10519 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Truth and History\"\n\nAt this point, the quests diverge into three separate lines (which can be done in any order) for each of Oronok's three sons who will in turn help you obtain the three Fragments of Damnation.\n\nQuest Line I - First Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10521 - \"Grom'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10522 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Grom'tor's Charge\"\n3* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10523 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The First Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line II - Second Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10527 \"Ar'tor, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10528 - \"Demonic Crystal Prisons\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10537 - \"Lohn'goron, Bow of the Torn-heart\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10540 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Ar'tor's Charge\"\n5* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10541 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Second Fragment Recovered\"\n\nQuest Line III - Third Fragment of Damnation\n1 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10546 \"Borak, Son of Oronok\"\n2 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10547 - \"Of Thistleheads and Eggs...\"\n3 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10550 - \"The Bundle of Bloodthistle\"\n4 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10570 - \"To Catch A Thistlehead\"\n5 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10576 - \"The Shadowmoon Shuffle\"\n6 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10577 - \"What Illidan Wants, Illidan Gets...\"\n7 - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10578 - \"The Cipher of Damnation - Borak's Charge\"\n8* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10579 \"The Cipher of Damnation - The Third Fragment Recovered\"\n\nAfter completing the quests for the three Fragments of Damnation, the lines converge and you need to kill one last boss.\nFinal* - http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10588 - \"The Cipher of Damnation\"\n\nRewards:\n\nEveryone gets http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31074 - Fire Resist Neck\n\nChoose one of the following:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036 - Caster Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31038 - Healer Staff\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31062 - Paladin/Shaman 2H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31071 - Tanking 1H Axe\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31072 - Bow\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?item=31073 - Melee Dagger\n\nAfter completing the quest, you will get a message in the mail from Khadgar.  If you go to Shattrath, he will tell you to talk to A'Dal, who unlocks the the three Trials.  These are prerequisites for attunement to The Eye in Tempest Keep and Mount Hyjal in Caverns of time.",
            date = "2007-02-04T11:56:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10681#comments:id=30555",
        },
        {
            id = 25760,
            score = 23,
            author = "13893",
            text = "Coords: 42, 45",
            date = "2007-01-27T13:50:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10681#comments:id=25760",
        },
        {
            id = 2132244,
            score = 11,
            author = "802086",
            text = "For those of you who may be at max level and cannot find the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10680 above the head of either Earthmender Splinthoof (Horde) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21938/earthmender-splinthoof) or Earthmender Sophurus (Alliance) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21937/earthmender-sophurus) you have either already completed the quest or...you may be like me.\n\nAfter much frustration and over an hour of looking on the internet and flying around Shadowmoon Valley doing random quests it finally occured to me that as I was leveling up I may have started the quest and decided for one reason or another to stop the chain.\nSure enough as I tracked down the quest line NPC's I found Oronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183/oronok-torn-heart) sitting there with a big fat ! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10514/i-was-a-lot-of-things) sitting above his head. This is what I get for not eating my vegetables (http://www.wowhead.com/item=30356/shadowmoon-tuber).\n\nHere is a list of all the NPC's along the way so you can save some time tracking down your place in the quest chain:\nEarthmender Splinthoof (Horde) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21938/earthmender-splinthoof) or Earthmender Sophurus (Alliance) (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21937/earthmender-sophurus)\nEarthmender Torlok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21024/earthmender-torlok)\nOronok Torn-heart (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21183/oronok-torn-heart)\nFrom here the chain diverts off into 3 paths involving 5 NPC's:\n1. Artor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21292/artor-son-of-oronok)\n1. Spirit of Artor (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21318/spirit-of-artor)\n2. Borak, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21293/borak-son-of-oronok)\n2. Tobias the Filth Gorger (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21411/tobias-the-filth-gorger)\n3. Grom'tor, Son of Oronok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21291/gromtor-son-of-oronok)\n\nI know there are others who had the same problem as me so I hope helps them.",
            date = "2015-03-06T17:27:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10681#comments:id=2132244",
        },
        {
            id = 197246,
            score = 9,
            author = "106002",
            text = "Save this whole (all parts) quest-line for level 70 will grant you:\n\n141 gold 80 silver (and some aditional gold from the very last \"kill-the-big-buy\" instead of experience from the quest, was unable to calculate how much)\n\nAnd if you chose these items when rewarded:\n- Skybreaker's Pauldrons (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30964)\n- Grom'tor's Pendant of Conquest (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30981)\n- Torn-heart Family Tunic (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30959)\n- Felboar Hide Shoes (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30939)\n- Oronok's Ancient Scepter (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31036)\n\nYou will also gain 26 gold 26 silver and 77 copper if you vendor them. You may also sell the fire-resist neck you get from the last part for 4 gold 15 silver and 55 copper wich brings the total, for the whole, hard, long, darn quest-line:\n\n173 gold and 53 silver",
            date = "2007-12-07T02:31:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10681#comments:id=197246",
        },
        {
            id = 157213,
            score = 8,
            author = "702",
            text = "NPC map\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21024",
            date = "2007-09-23T14:33:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10681#comments:id=157213",
        },
    },
