        {
            id = 35935,
            score = 32,
            author = "23727",
            text = "He walks North and South up and down the path to the west of Evergrove. I was lucky enough to catch him while he was walking right infront of the front gate of Evergrove. XD",
            date = "2007-02-14T14:14:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10682#comments:id=35935",
        },
        {
            id = 319103,
            score = 8,
            author = "170093",
            text = "To find him make a macro saying\n/tar overseer nuaar\nthen spam that while you look for him. As you look for him you can also do the other quests in this area involving the wyrmcult. Or, you could just sit infront of the front gate to Evergrove and wait for him, like I did. :p",
            date = "2008-07-03T15:17:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10682#comments:id=319103",
        },
    },
    [10683] = {
        {
            id = 38594,
            score = 59,
            author = "16691",
            text = "The process of attunement to the Black Temple begins in Shadowmoon Valley with a very long quest chain that requires trips to the Arcatraz, Serpentshrine Cavern, Mount Hyjal and finally the doorstep of the Black Temple itself.  Even if you're not planning on raiding just yet, the chain does offer some nice blue rewards half way through.  It starts differently depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S):\n\nAldors pick up the line from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) in the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568)\n2. (A) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571)\n3. (A) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574)\n4. (A) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575)\n\nScyers get it from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. (S) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683)\n2. (S) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684)\n3. (S) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685)\n4. (S) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686)\n\nAt this point the chains converge for both factions:\n5. [70] Proof of Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622)\n6. [70] Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628)\n7. [70] Seer Udalo (Dungeon) (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705)\n\nHere, you have to venture into the Arcatraz (which requires a Rogue with 350 lockpicking or somebody to open the door who's completed the Arcatraz Key chain (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262), which requires trips to the Mechanar and the Botanica respectively) to the room just before the final boss.  Sadly it's impossible to solo-stealth to.  Finding Udalo leads to:\n\nTalk to Akama:\n8. [70] A Mysterious Portent (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706)\nKill waves of nonelites, 3 elites and a boss (5-man) on a terrace outside the Black Temple:\n9. [70] The Ata'mal Terrace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707)\nFinally, deliver the medallion to A'dal in Shattrath City:\n10. [70] Akama's Promise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708)\n\nThe chain ends here, and you're granted a choice of rewards:\nAkama's Sash (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30932) (cloth DPS belt)\nBloodwarder's Rifle (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31000) (gun)\nSpellbreaker's Buckler (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30984) (spelldamage shield)\nAshtongue Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30999) (phsyical DPS dagger)\nVerdant Gloves (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30943) (feral leather gloves)\nStaff of the Ashtongue Deathsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31417) (healing staff)\nHowever, if you now go into Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) and kill Karathress (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21214), you'll be able to talk to Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who'll continue the quest chain for you:\n\n1. [70] The Secret Compromised (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944)\nGo back to Warden's Cage in SMV and talk to Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21700).\n2. [70R] Ruse of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946)\nUsing the Ashtongue Cowl (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31946) provided, kill Al'ar (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19514) in Tempest Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3842) while disguised as a member of the Deathsworn.\n3. [70R] An Artifact From the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947)\nYou need to be attuned to Mount Hyjal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10445) for this.  Simply kill Rage Winterchill (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17767) and loot his phylactery (what is it with liches and their phylacteries?), then deliver it to Akama...\n4. [70R] The Hostage Soul (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948)\n...then return to Ad'al (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18481) in Shattrath City...\n5. [70R] Entry Into the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949)\n...then go back to Shadowmoon and talk to Xi'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18528) on the road leading to the Black Temple.  He'll ask you to help with\n6. [70] A Distraction for Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985)\n...but once you tell Xi'ri you're ready (talk to him after accepting the quest), you can watch a scripted sequence that you do not actually have to help with in any way.  After this is finished, talk to Xi'ri again for your Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)) and the completion of Black Temple attunement.  Congratulations, you can now waltz in to Illidan's latest bachelor pad!\n\nBut before you go, the chain continues from Xi'ri with:\n7. [70R] Seek Out the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958)\nTime to start exploring the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3959)!  When you find the Deathsworn, they'll give you\n2. [70R] Redemption of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957)\n...which requires you to kill the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).  Finally you're given\n3. [70R] The Fall of the Betrayer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959)\nYup, kill Illidan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22917).  No problem.  Then you're done.",
            date = "2007-02-19T08:12:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10683#comments:id=38594",
        },
        {
            id = 25414,
            score = 26,
            author = "13955",
            text = "58, 36 - Items are on the ground. Anoying quest, lots of patroling mobs around.",
            date = "2007-01-26T23:45:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10683#comments:id=25414",
        },
        {
            id = 99012,
            score = 16,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T22:25:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10683#comments:id=99012",
        },
        {
            id = 25460,
            score = 8,
            author = "Phaleux",
            text = "They can also drop off the Ashtongue Workers, but it seems like ~10% drop rate.",
            date = "2007-01-27T02:33:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10683#comments:id=25460",
        },
        {
            id = 58061,
            score = 8,
            author = "Marfu",
            text = "You can complete two quests at once here.\n\nThe Ashtongue Broken\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10807\n\nKill quest where you need to kill the mobs at the same area.\nAlso, Tablet fragmets drop from the Ashtongue Workers.",
            date = "2007-03-27T11:24:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10683#comments:id=58061",
        },
    },
    [10684] = {
        {
            id = 25045,
            score = 31,
            author = "16253",
            text = "57,32, he's on the balcony, pretty easy to get to.",
            date = "2007-01-26T11:41:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10684#comments:id=25045",
        },
        {
            id = 99015,
            score = 16,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T22:27:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10684#comments:id=99015",
        },
        {
            id = 37435,
            score = 4,
            author = "21635",
            text = "fly there , kill it , loot , return",
            date = "2007-02-17T08:49:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10684#comments:id=37435",
        },
        {
            id = 37845,
            score = 4,
            author = "10501",
            text = "Very easy as was mentioned before. It's a single kill. Fly to the back of the building and drop down onto the balcony to fight him. Be wary, he's a healer so if you're a feral, save points up to Maim him and interrupt his heal.",
            date = "2007-02-17T23:46:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10684#comments:id=37845",
        },
        {
            id = 46158,
            score = 2,
            author = "24229",
            text = "Super easy kill if  you have a flying mount.",
            date = "2007-03-04T18:49:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10684#comments:id=46158",
        },
    },
    [10685] = {
        {
            id = 24845,
            score = 89,
            author = "13697",
            text = "Lakann: 49, 23\nUlyaru: 48, 38\nEykenen: 51, 52\nHaalum: 56, 73\n\nKill the totems first as they spawn 3 mini mobs when you kill them and make the guys immune to damage while they are up.",
            date = "2007-01-26T05:06:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10685#comments:id=24845",
        },
        {
            id = 99018,
            score = 21,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T22:30:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10685#comments:id=99018",
        },
        {
            id = 36342,
            score = 6,
            author = "17656",
            text = "The mobs that spawn from the totems, do not aggro if you are far away enough, nor do they aggro the named if you attack them. If you wait about 20-30 seconds they despawn.",
            date = "2007-02-15T08:25:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10685#comments:id=36342",
        },
        {
            id = 41390,
            score = 4,
            author = "16453",
            text = "Very easy. At each one, i stayed at a distance, shot each totum one at a time, let the spawns die off or kill them. When they're gone, kill named. Of course clear surrounding mobs to prevents adds. They go down very quickly. Some will pull shaman moves on ya. The others go down like a wet paper towel. DId this as lvl 70 Survival Hunter w/pet. co'ords are confirmed.",
            date = "2007-02-24T01:13:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10685#comments:id=41390",
        },
        {
            id = 36720,
            score = 3,
            author = "14690",
            text = "For Lakann I didn't even have to kill the totem. He aggroed on me with all 3 totems up and was a quick easy kill, which is good considering the patrolling water elementals.\n\nThe earth guy was particularly hard, I got jumped by him, three fire elementals and one of the walking dogs before it was all over. Had to pull out alot of tricks on that one, and by the time the dust settled he'd already respawned...",
            date = "2007-02-16T01:31:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10685#comments:id=36720",
        },
    },
    [10686] = {
        {
            id = 28754,
            score = 39,
            author = "18921",
            text = "Enter the underground chambers at location 57,49 through the trap door in the ground.  Sanoru is at the bottom of the steps from there.",
            date = "2007-02-01T06:32:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10686#comments:id=28754",
        },
        {
            id = 99020,
            score = 18,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T22:32:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10686#comments:id=99020",
        },
        {
            id = 335630,
            score = 4,
            author = "Farmbuyer",
            text = "As strongly as the Scryer/Aldor questgivers feel about you finding this Akama guy, it's a little weird that that don't seem to care that you never return to them.  :-)",
            date = "2008-07-25T04:20:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10686#comments:id=335630",
        },
        {
            id = 208647,
            score = 2,
            author = "Daywish",
            text = "If you want to land close and don't want to aggro anything, do like I did ... (Flying mount needed )\nPic : http://img165.imageshack.us/img165/7295/wowscrnshot122807162006so2.jpg\nHope it helps ...\n\nBtw dont try attacking him from there, he'll Evade anything you try. Just jump and kill ...",
            date = "2007-12-28T08:25:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10686#comments:id=208647",
        },
        {
            id = 2124900,
            score = 1,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "If you feel lost and unsure where you are in the chain, use the following copy-paste scripts:\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\nSimply copy the script and paste in chat. You'll find a lot of text saying Yes/No for each quest in the chain, chronologically. Find the quest that isn't completed and look that up on Wowhead to proceed.\n\nHave fun obtaining your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757",
            date = "2015-02-27T10:41:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10686#comments:id=2124900",
        },
    },
    [10687] = {
        {
            id = 37252,
            score = 43,
            author = "23774",
            text = "MAJOR TIP: Kill the Initiates....not the supplicants...I have a 0% drop rate off of 20 supplicants, and a damn good 75% drop off of the initiates..Just trying to save everyone some time here. Finished quite quickly after I started killing initiates.\n\n-Avoril\n-Firetree 70 Druid",
            date = "2007-02-16T21:25:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10687#comments:id=37252",
        },
        {
            id = 156126,
            score = 35,
            author = "16691",
            text = "This is the start of the Scryer version of the Book of Fel Names chain.  As well as reputation with your chosen faction, if you complete it you can choose from:\nCeremonial Kris (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31013) (+heal dagger)\nSlayer's Axe (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31010) (2H +str axe)\nSunfury Legguards (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30948) (+AP mail pants)\nHauberk of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30933) (+AP leather chest)\nSummoner's Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31002) (+dmg sword)\nWildcaller (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31009) (feral staff)\n\nAs with the Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707) line, this chain starts different depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S).  All the quests are rated level 70 - though the chain is available at level 68, it sends you to the Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789) to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667), which you might want to hold off on until level 70.\n\nAldors pick it up from Exarch Onaala (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21860) at the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10587)\n2. (A) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10637)\n3. (A) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10640)\n\nScryers need to visit Larissa Sunstrike (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21954) at the Sanctum of the Stars:\n1. (S) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10687)\n2. (S) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10688)\n3. (S) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10689)\n\nHere the chains converge on your old friend Altruis the Sufferer (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18417) in Nagrand.  He gives out three quests that need to be completed (in any order) before you can continue:\n4a. Against the Legion (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10641) - Netherstorm\n4b. Against the Illidari (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10668) - Shadowmoon Valley\n4c. Against All Odds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10669) - Zangarmarsh\nHaving gone around the world killing stuff, you can now return to Altruis and receive:\n5. Illidan's Pupil (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10646)\nwhich leads directly into\n6. The Book of Fel Names (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10649)\n\nNow it's time for a venture into the Shadow Labyrinth to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667)!  Once that's done that and his body has been looted for the book, it's back to Altruis where again the chains diverge depending on your allegiance.\n\nAldor:\n7. (A) Return to the Aldor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10650) - back to Altar of Sha'tar\n8. (A) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10651)\n\nScryer:\n7. (S) Return to the Scryers (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10691) - back to Sanctum of Stars\n8. (S) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10692)\n\nVaredis Must Be Stopped is the final part.  It's a 5-man group quest that sends you to the terrace outside the Black Temple to kill four elites: Varedis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21178), Netharel (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21164), Theras (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21168) and Alandien (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21171).  Look them up  for co-ordinates and tips on killing them - they're pretty straightforward, really.\n\nWhen they're dead it's a simple matter of returning to the questgiver to choose a prize.",
            date = "2007-09-21T09:47:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10687#comments:id=156126",
        },
        {
            id = 25292,
            score = 21,
            author = "11256",
            text = "It's @ 70.50 btw, you been to enter through the main gate and go right.",
            date = "2007-01-26T18:47:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10687#comments:id=25292",
        },
        {
            id = 36205,
            score = 13,
            author = "14690",
            text = "Watch for the 70 elite patrolling mob that doesn't take too kindly on you bashing apart his trainees..",
            date = "2007-02-15T01:52:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10687#comments:id=36205",
        },
        {
            id = 105579,
            score = 13,
            author = "61292",
            text = "This is the Scryer version of the quest.\n\nFor the Aldor version go to:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10587",
            date = "2007-06-16T17:42:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10687#comments:id=105579",
        },
    },
    [10688] = {
        {
            id = 32049,
            score = 89,
            author = "15460",
            text = "If you have a flying mount, just behind him, there is a small ledge, you can land on it, and not agro anything, the scroll has a 30 yard range, use it and mount up quickly, then hover out of range and enjoy the show",
            date = "2007-02-07T04:45:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10688#comments:id=32049",
        },
        {
            id = 22727,
            score = 57,
            author = "14008",
            text = "Slay Sunfury Warlocks(http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21503) and use the quest item on Azaloth to free him.",
            date = "2007-01-22T06:43:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10688#comments:id=22727",
        },
        {
            id = 34140,
            score = 42,
            author = "Flyv",
            text = "The item you need is the Scroll of Demonic Unbanishing (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30811). Looks like the drop rate is better off of warlocks than summoners.",
            date = "2007-02-11T14:58:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10688#comments:id=34140",
        },
        {
            id = 27168,
            score = 35,
            author = "Malhavoc",
            text = "Azaloth is located at 70, 51 near top of Ruins of Karabor.  Normally there's a bunch of Demon Hunter Initiates fighting him in addition to a couple warlocks.",
            date = "2007-01-29T13:23:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10688#comments:id=27168",
        },
        {
            id = 36102,
            score = 32,
            author = "2165",
            text = "Location 70,51 is confirmed.\n\nDon't try to kill the mobs that are fighting him.\n\nFirst kill Sunfury Warlocks until you get this item http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30811\n\nThen just find a spot with a safe distance to him and the guys fighting him - and use the scroll with him targeted. Hopefully you got a flying mount to escape on, I never tried staying for lunch and see how dangerous he really is!",
            date = "2007-02-14T20:59:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10688#comments:id=36102",
        },
    },
    [10689] = {
        {
            id = 156128,
            score = 49,
            author = "16691",
            text = "This is part of the Scryer version of the Book of Fel Names chain.  As well as reputation with your chosen faction, if you complete it you can choose from:\nCeremonial Kris (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31013) (+heal dagger)\nSlayer's Axe (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31010) (2H +str axe)\nSunfury Legguards (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30948) (+AP mail pants)\nHauberk of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30933) (+AP leather chest)\nSummoner's Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31002) (+dmg sword)\nWildcaller (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31009) (feral staff)\n\nAs with the Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707) line, this chain starts different depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S).  All the quests are rated level 70 - though the chain is available at level 68, it sends you to the Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789) to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667), which you might want to hold off on until level 70.\n\nAldors pick it up from Exarch Onaala (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21860) at the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10587)\n2. (A) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10637)\n3. (A) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10640)\n\nScryers need to visit Larissa Sunstrike (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21954) at the Sanctum of the Stars:\n1. (S) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10687)\n2. (S) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10688)\n3. (S) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10689)\n\nHere the chains converge on your old friend Altruis the Sufferer (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18417) in Nagrand.  He gives out three quests that need to be completed (in any order) before you can continue:\n4a. Against the Legion (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10641) - Netherstorm\n4b. Against the Illidari (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10668) - Shadowmoon Valley\n4c. Against All Odds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10669) - Zangarmarsh\nHaving gone around the world killing stuff, you can now return to Altruis and receive:\n5. Illidan's Pupil (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10646)\nwhich leads directly into\n6. The Book of Fel Names (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10649)\n\nNow it's time for a venture into the Shadow Labyrinth to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667)!  Once that's done that and his body has been looted for the book, it's back to Altruis where again the chains diverge depending on your allegiance.\n\nAldor:\n7. (A) Return to the Aldor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10650) - back to Altar of Sha'tar\n8. (A) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10651)\n\nScryer:\n7. (S) Return to the Scryers (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10691) - back to Sanctum of Stars\n8. (S) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10692)\n\nVaredis Must Be Stopped is the final part.  It's a 5-man group quest that sends you to the terrace outside the Black Temple to kill four elites: Varedis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21178), Netharel (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21164), Theras (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21168) and Alandien (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21171).  Look them up  for co-ordinates and tips on killing them - they're pretty straightforward, really.\n\nWhen they're dead it's a simple matter of returning to the questgiver to choose a prize.",
            date = "2007-09-21T09:49:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10689#comments:id=156128",
        },
        {
            id = 29208,
            score = 21,
            author = "14566",
            text = "follow-ups :\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10669\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10668\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10641",
            date = "2007-02-01T23:23:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10689#comments:id=29208",
        },
        {
            id = 25231,
            score = 19,
            author = "16133",
            text = "27,43 nagrand",
            date = "2007-01-26T16:58:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10689#comments:id=25231",
        },
        {
            id = 32741,
            score = 18,
            author = "17104",
            text = "When you complete all 3 above q's this is follow-up\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10646",
            date = "2007-02-08T15:57:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10689#comments:id=32741",
        },
        {
            id = 791768,
            score = 13,
            author = "Mydge",
            text = "Counts towards Nagrand Slam for Loremaster.",
            date = "2009-07-29T03:09:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10689#comments:id=791768",
        },
    },
