    [10692] = {
        {
            id = 156131,
            score = 58,
            author = "16691",
            text = "This is the conclusion to the Scryer version of the Book of Fel Names chain, which gives Aldor/Scryer rep as well as some nice blue rewards.  If you complete it, you can choose from:\nCeremonial Kris (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31013) (+heal dagger)\nSlayer's Axe (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31010) (2H +str axe)\nSunfury Legguards (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30948) (+AP mail pants)\nHauberk of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30933) (+AP leather chest)\nSummoner's Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31002) (+dmg sword)\nWildcaller (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31009) (feral staff)\n\nAs with the Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707) line, this chain starts different depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S).  All the quests are rated level 70 - though the chain is available at level 68, it sends you to the Shadow Labyrinth (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3789) to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667), which you might want to hold off on until level 70.\n\nAldors pick it up from Exarch Onaala (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21860) at the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10587)\n2. (A) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10637)\n3. (A) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10640)\n\nScryers need to visit Larissa Sunstrike (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21954) at the Sanctum of the Stars:\n1. (S) Karabor Training Grounds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10687)\n2. (S) A Necessary Distraction (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10688)\n3. (S) Altruis (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10689)\n\nHere the chains converge on your old friend Altruis the Sufferer (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18417) in Nagrand.  He gives out three quests that need to be completed (in any order) before you can continue:\n4a. Against the Legion (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10641) - Netherstorm\n4b. Against the Illidari (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10668) - Shadowmoon Valley\n4c. Against All Odds (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10669) - Zangarmarsh\nHaving gone around the world killing stuff, you can now return to Altruis and receive:\n5. Illidan's Pupil (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10646)\nwhich leads directly into\n6. The Book of Fel Names (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10649)\n\nNow it's time for a venture into the Shadow Labyrinth to kill Blackheart (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18667)!  Once that's done that and his body has been looted for the book, it's back to Altruis where again the chains diverge depending on your allegiance.\n\nAldor:\n7. (A) Return to the Aldor (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10650) - back to Altar of Sha'tar\n8. (A) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10651)\n\nScryer:\n7. (S) Return to the Scryers (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10691) - back to Sanctum of Stars\n8. (S) Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10692)\n\nVaredis Must Be Stopped is the final part.  It's a 5-man group quest that sends you to the terrace outside the Black Temple to kill four elites: Varedis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21178), Netharel (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21164), Theras (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21168) and Alandien (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21171).  Look them up  for co-ordinates and tips on killing them - they're pretty straightforward, really.\n\nWhen they're dead it's a simple matter of returning to the questgiver to choose a prize.",
            date = "2007-09-21T09:51:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692#comments:id=156131",
        },
        {
            id = 50622,
            score = 21,
            author = "28852",
            text = "As a sidenote, be aware the book has a very very long cast time, like 8 sec or so.",
            date = "2007-03-13T15:54:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692#comments:id=50622",
        },
        {
            id = 3120424,
            score = 15,
            author = "linkshido",
            text = "I did all the previous quests mentioned here, but this one still didn't appeared.\n\nTurns out that besides all that was mentioned in the other comments, you also need to complete ALL the quests from Altruis the Sufferer (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18417/altruis-the-sufferer) found in Nagrand (27.4 43). Then he gives you the quest Return to the Scryers (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10691/return-to-the-scryers) / Return to the Aldor (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10650/return-to-the-aldor) (depending your allegiance at the time).\n\nI am Horde so I cannot confirm that this is the case for the Alliance too, but it may be.",
            date = "2019-04-26T17:27:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692#comments:id=3120424",
        },
        {
            id = 35294,
            score = 14,
            author = "Flyv",
            text = "The Aldor version of this quest has some useful comments. See http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10651",
            date = "2007-02-13T14:24:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692#comments:id=35294",
        },
        {
            id = 1941756,
            score = 12,
            author = "Amager",
            text = "For those of you questing and/or trying to figure out how to:\n\n-unlock Larissa Sunstrike (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=21954)\n-get one of the quest rewards from Varedis Must Be Stopped (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692)\n-or just simply unlock the quests from Sanctum of the Stars in Shadowmoon Valley (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=3520)\n\n...you must first complete the quest City of Light (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10211) from Khadgar (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=18166) in Shattrath City (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=3703)\n*(which is itself a quest given after the quest A'dal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10210) given by Haggard War Veteran (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19684) in Shattrath City)\n\nAND\n\ncomplete the quest Allegiance to the Scryers (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=10552) given by Khadgar in Shattrath City (which is available after you complete City of Light)\n\n...because I can't tell you how long it took me to figure this out >.<",
            date = "2014-02-08T19:24:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10692#comments:id=1941756",
        },
    },
    [10701] = {
        {
            id = 981871,
            score = 111,
            author = "277610",
            text = "I had trouble finding Netherock at first.\nDon't go after the map indication, go to the southern parts and you will soon find Netherock, you don't need to summon him or so, just head south instead of south-west.\nSoloed him as a level 70 Fury Warrior so if you are the same you won't need other people with you.\nGood luck.",
            date = "2010-02-21T06:07:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10701#comments:id=981871",
        },
        {
            id = 19789,
            score = 23,
            author = "Lustral",
            text = "The Netherock Crumblers actually spawn from Netherock's body as you damage him, much like the Raging Colossus's in Hellfire Peninsula, so don't let the crumblers locations on the map confuse you.  He was about the same difficulty level as a Colossus, relative to level while in Hellfire.",
