    [10704] = {
        {
            id = 33887,
            score = 176,
            author = "3316",
            text = "Guide on How To Properly Break Into The Arcatraz*\n(*ARCATRAZ and not Alcatraz)\n\nNotes:\n* I don't know the exact mobs that A/H get the quest from, they're in Area 52 so if you know the quest name it shouldn't be a problem\n* I didn't sum up the gold amount because I'm lazy, the XP gain and reputation are approx. accurate. I hope.\n\nAssisting the Consortium (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10264),  a 'go talk to' quest (1200XP/72s)\nConsortium Crystal Collection ( http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10265), kill a dreadlord called Pentatharon and get a crystal from him\nA Heap of Ethereals  (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262) repeatable quest also for Consortium reputation.\n\n1st chain ends here : 25800XP, 510 Consortium reputation OR around 15g at 70\n\n4. Warp-Raider Nesaad [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10205, a go-kill-him quest.\n5. Request for Assistance [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10266 , find Gahruj at 47,57\n6. Rightful Repossession [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10267 , get 10 boxes from around Mana Forge: Duro\n7. An Audience with the Prince [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10268 , Nexus-Prince Haramad at 44,35 or so in the Stormspire.\n8. Triangulation Point One [Level 69] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10269 , use the Triangulation Device at 66, 33\n9. Triangulation Point Two [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10275 , same thing at 28,41\n10. Full Triangle  [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10276 , Find Culuthas at 53, 21, 70 Elite demon.\n\n2nd chain ends here:  1600 Consortium reputation, 71450 XP or around 60 gold if you're 70.\n\n11. Special Delivery to Shattrath [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10280 , pretty obvious.\n12. How To Break Into the Arcatraz [Level 70] : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10704 , the Bottom Shard of the Arcatraz Key : Pathaleon the Calculator in The Mechanar and the Top Shard of the Arcatraz Key : Warp Splinter in The Botanica. Pretty obvious if you know where they're located, huh.\n\nThe quest chain doesn't stop here, there's also\n13. Harbinger of Doom [Level 70] after : http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10882\n\nAfter this 3rd quest chain, you get around 40g and your Key to the Arcatraz : http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31084",
            date = "2007-02-11T02:52:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10704#comments:id=33887",
        },
        {
            id = 23053,
            score = 68,
            author = "13008",
            text = "Obviously, this is the \"key\" quest to enter Arcatraz, a level 70 instance. Only one person needs the key to enter or have a level 70 rogue with maxed out lockpicking. The Bottom Shard of the Arcatraz Key drops from Pathaleon the Calculator in The Mechanar and the Top Shard of the Arcatraz Key drops from Warp Splinter in The Botanica.",
            date = "2007-01-23T02:16:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10704#comments:id=23053",
        },
        {
            id = 246086,
            score = 47,
            author = "Blued",
            text = "Yes, this quest can be completed on Heroic as well as Normal.",
            date = "2008-03-01T08:51:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10704#comments:id=246086",
        },
        {
            id = 1994350,
            score = 38,
            author = "Hamburgla",
            text = "In case no one saw on the first comment. You need to go to the MECHANAR and BOTANICA for both of these. I just completed Arcatraz and found nothing expecting something.",
            date = "2014-08-20T23:32:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10704#comments:id=1994350",
        },
        {
            id = 25234,
            score = 23,
            author = "252",
            text = "The quest to get this key is a long quest line which starts with the quest 'Warp-Raider Nessad' (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10205)",
            date = "2007-01-26T17:09:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10704#comments:id=25234",
        },
    },
    [10705] = {
        {
            id = 25831,
            score = 198,
            author = "6913",
            text = "He's dead before the last bosses room in Arcatraz.",
            date = "2007-01-27T16:09:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10705#comments:id=25831",
        },
        {
            id = 38598,
            score = 146,
            author = "16691",
            text = "The process of attunement to the Black Temple begins in Shadowmoon Valley with a very long quest chain that requires trips to the Arcatraz, Serpentshrine Cavern, Mount Hyjal and finally the doorstep of the Black Temple itself.  Even if you're not planning on raiding just yet, the chain does offer some nice blue rewards half way through.  It starts differently depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S):\n\nAldors pick up the line from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) in the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568)\n2. (A) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571)\n3. (A) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574)\n4. (A) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575)\n\nScyers get it from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. (S) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683)\n2. (S) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684)\n3. (S) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685)\n4. (S) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686)\n\nAt this point the chains converge for both factions:\n5. [70] Proof of Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622)\n6. [70] Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628)\n7. [70] Seer Udalo (Dungeon) (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705)\n\nHere, you have to venture into the Arcatraz (which requires a Rogue with 350 lockpicking or somebody to open the door who's completed the Arcatraz Key chain (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262), which requires trips to the Mechanar and the Botanica respectively) to the room just before the final boss.  Sadly it's impossible to solo-stealth to.  Finding Udalo leads to:\n\nTalk to Akama:\n8. [70] A Mysterious Portent (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706)\nKill waves of nonelites, 3 elites and a boss (5-man) on a terrace outside the Black Temple:\n9. [70] The Ata'mal Terrace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707)\nFinally, deliver the medallion to A'dal in Shattrath City:\n10. [70] Akama's Promise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708)\n\nThe chain ends here, and you're granted a choice of rewards:\nAkama's Sash (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30932) (cloth DPS belt)\nBloodwarder's Rifle (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31000) (gun)\nSpellbreaker's Buckler (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30984) (spelldamage shield)\nAshtongue Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30999) (phsyical DPS dagger)\nVerdant Gloves (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30943) (feral leather gloves)\nStaff of the Ashtongue Deathsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31417) (healing staff)\nHowever, if you now go into Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) and kill Karathress (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21214), you'll be able to talk to Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who'll continue the quest chain for you:\n\n1. [70] The Secret Compromised (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944)\nGo back to Warden's Cage in SMV and talk to Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21700).\n2. [70R] Ruse of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946)\nUsing the Ashtongue Cowl (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31946) provided, kill Al'ar (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19514) in Tempest Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3842) while disguised as a member of the Deathsworn.\n3. [70R] An Artifact From the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947)\nYou need to be attuned to Mount Hyjal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10445) for this.  Simply kill Rage Winterchill (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17767) and loot his phylactery (what is it with liches and their phylacteries?), then deliver it to Akama...\n4. [70R] The Hostage Soul (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948)\n...then return to Ad'al (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18481) in Shattrath City...\n5. [70R] Entry Into the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949)\n...then go back to Shadowmoon and talk to Xi'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18528) on the road leading to the Black Temple.  He'll ask you to help with\n6. [70] A Distraction for Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985)\n...but once you tell Xi'ri you're ready (talk to him after accepting the quest), you can watch a scripted sequence that you do not actually have to help with in any way.  After this is finished, talk to Xi'ri again for your Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)) and the completion of Black Temple attunement.  Congratulations, you can now waltz in to Illidan's latest bachelor pad!\n\nBut before you go, the chain continues from Xi'ri with:\n7. [70R] Seek Out the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958)\nTime to start exploring the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3959)!  When you find the Deathsworn, they'll give you\n2. [70R] Redemption of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957)\n...which requires you to kill the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).  Finally you're given\n3. [70R] The Fall of the Betrayer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959)\nYup, kill Illidan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22917).  No problem.  Then you're done.",
            date = "2007-02-19T08:15:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10705#comments:id=38598",
        },
        {
            id = 40522,
            score = 61,
            author = "26436",
            text = "Rogues: by starting a Sprint in the antechamber just before the erradar, you be at the speed necessary to break distance. If you're lucky, they'll only hit you once - by then, you'll have popped Cloak of Shadows to avoid the arcane bursts from the golems, and just Vanish to snub the aggro. It's harder in practice than it sounds, but I was able to do it.\n\nUnfortunately, my trek was in vain. The laser-barricaded door beyond that room will not open unless Dalliah the Doomsayer and Wrath-Scyer Soccothrates are killed. A stealth run up to this point is a nice test of your skills, but ultimately futile.",
            date = "2007-02-22T11:44:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10705#comments:id=40522",
        },
        {
            id = 3301607,
            score = 53,
            author = "Gardianangel",
            text = "It took until 2021 to dumb it down for newbies on WoW in under 1 paragraph! Seer Udalo is on the \"Containment Core\" LEVEL of the Dungeon. He is on the final turn going towards Harbinger Skyriss. He is DEAD. But, he will have the Golden \"?\" above him. This is done on Normal or Heroic Mode. Forget the 2007-2009 posts. They are out of date on this thread.",
            date = "2021-02-16T18:41:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10705#comments:id=3301607",
        },
        {
            id = 2326271,
            score = 34,
            author = "ohmisslady",
            text = "For those of you like me, who don't know which Tempest Keep instance is which, the Arcatraz is the highest instance on the left side, with a pinkish bottom.",
            date = "2016-04-26T12:49:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10705#comments:id=2326271",
        },
    },
    [10706] = {
        {
            id = 32008,
            score = 22,
            author = "15757",
            text = "Akama is located in Warden's Cage, in the dungeon located below the demon stationed at approximatelly 58, 48 in Shadowmoon Valley. The follow up quest will require a 5-man team, so if you have time to spare, ask your party members to help.",
            date = "2007-02-07T02:40:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706#comments:id=32008",
        },
        {
            id = 1059126,
            score = 7,
            author = "331426",
            text = "This quest does count toward the Seeker/Loremaster achievements, despite having a dungeon objective.",
            date = "2010-06-16T11:29:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706#comments:id=1059126",
        },
        {
            id = 2250060,
            score = 6,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Aldor Video Guide: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m28FWwhWAdI [sup]1[/sup]\n Scryer Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=73Dsiivs938 [sup]1[/sup]\n\n[sup]1[/sup]The quest IDs are the same for [faction=932] and [faction=934]; however, the separate videos will direct you to the applicable flight locations.\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706\n•\009Interact with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21962 corpse in [zone=3848] ([zone= 3523]) dungeon (located in the Ethereal's room, before the last boss, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=20912), and accept the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706.\n•\009You can run out of the instance and fly back to [zone=3520] (Outlands), or just hearth, if your home port is a city with the Shattrath (Outlands) portal.\n•\009After using your https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948 to reach [zone=6142] / [zone=6141], go to the city's portal room.\n-\009-\009Alliance players: go to the room above the opposite of the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 69, 52.\n-\009-\009Horde players: go to the room above the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 64, 58.\n•\009Once you have arrived on the other side of the portal, fly to and interact with the gryphon flight master, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18940, at coords 63.8, 41.6.\n-\009-\009Aldor players will fly to the Altar of Sha'tar, in [zone=3520].\n-\009-\009Scryer players will fly to the Sanctum of the Stars, in [zone=3520].\n•\009Fly to the Warden's Cage at coordinates 57.2, 49.6.\n•\009Enter the Warden's Cage, and follow the underground passage and swim to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21700 at coords 58.1, 48.2\n\nFull Guide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=32757/blessed-medallion-of-karabor#comments:id=2249836) to obtain https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757.\n\nIf you're unsure about which stage of the quest line you are in to obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757, enter the following script into the chat box (special thanks to Vlad for the script):\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q) and 'YES' or 'NO')end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q) and YES or NO)end",
            date = "2015-09-10T23:50:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706#comments:id=2250060",
        },
        {
            id = 2124905,
            score = 4,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "If you feel lost and unsure where you are in the chain, use the following copy-paste scripts:\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\nSimply copy the script and paste in chat. You'll find a lot of text saying Yes/No for each quest in the chain, chronologically. Find the quest that isn't completed and look that up on Wowhead to proceed.\n\nHave fun obtaining your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757",
            date = "2015-02-27T10:41:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706#comments:id=2124905",
        },
        {
            id = 36198,
            score = 2,
            author = "23852",
            text = "This quest is very buggy. Vagath is just standing there and you won't be able to talk to Akama.",
            date = "2007-02-15T01:27:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10706#comments:id=36198",
        },
    },
    [10707] = {
        {
            id = 38627,
            score = 97,
            author = "16691",
            text = "The process of attunement to the Black Temple begins in Shadowmoon Valley with a very long quest chain that requires trips to the Arcatraz, Serpentshrine Cavern, Mount Hyjal and finally the doorstep of the Black Temple itself.  Even if you're not planning on raiding just yet, the chain does offer some nice blue rewards half way through.  It starts differently depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S):\n\nAldors pick up the line from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) in the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568)\n2. (A) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571)\n3. (A) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574)\n4. (A) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575)\n\nScyers get it from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. (S) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683)\n2. (S) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684)\n3. (S) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685)\n4. (S) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686)\n\nAt this point the chains converge for both factions:\n5. [70] Proof of Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622)\n6. [70] Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628)\n7. [70] Seer Udalo (Dungeon) (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705)\n\nHere, you have to venture into the Arcatraz (which requires a Rogue with 350 lockpicking or somebody to open the door who's completed the Arcatraz Key chain (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262), which requires trips to the Mechanar and the Botanica respectively) to the room just before the final boss.  Sadly it's impossible to solo-stealth to.  Finding Udalo leads to:\n\nTalk to Akama:\n8. [70] A Mysterious Portent (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706)\nKill waves of nonelites, 3 elites and a boss (5-man) on a terrace outside the Black Temple:\n9. [70] The Ata'mal Terrace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707)\nFinally, deliver the medallion to A'dal in Shattrath City:\n10. [70] Akama's Promise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708)\n\nThe chain ends here, and you're granted a choice of rewards:\nAkama's Sash (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30932) (cloth DPS belt)\nBloodwarder's Rifle (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31000) (gun)\nSpellbreaker's Buckler (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30984) (spelldamage shield)\nAshtongue Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30999) (phsyical DPS dagger)\nVerdant Gloves (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30943) (feral leather gloves)\nStaff of the Ashtongue Deathsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31417) (healing staff)\nHowever, if you now go into Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) and kill Karathress (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21214), you'll be able to talk to Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who'll continue the quest chain for you:\n\n1. [70] The Secret Compromised (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944)\nGo back to Warden's Cage in SMV and talk to Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21700).\n2. [70R] Ruse of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946)\nUsing the Ashtongue Cowl (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31946) provided, kill Al'ar (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19514) in Tempest Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3842) while disguised as a member of the Deathsworn.\n3. [70R] An Artifact From the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947)\nYou need to be attuned to Mount Hyjal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10445) for this.  Simply kill Rage Winterchill (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17767) and loot his phylactery (what is it with liches and their phylacteries?), then deliver it to Akama...\n4. [70R] The Hostage Soul (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948)\n...then return to Ad'al (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18481) in Shattrath City...\n5. [70R] Entry Into the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949)\n...then go back to Shadowmoon and talk to Xi'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18528) on the road leading to the Black Temple.  He'll ask you to help with\n6. [70] A Distraction for Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985)\n...but once you tell Xi'ri you're ready (talk to him after accepting the quest), you can watch a scripted sequence that you do not actually have to help with in any way.  After this is finished, talk to Xi'ri again for your Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)) and the completion of Black Temple attunement.  Congratulations, you can now waltz in to Illidan's latest bachelor pad!\n\nBut before you go, the chain continues from Xi'ri with:\n7. [70R] Seek Out the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958)\nTime to start exploring the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3959)!  When you find the Deathsworn, they'll give you\n2. [70R] Redemption of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957)\n...which requires you to kill the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).  Finally you're given\n3. [70R] The Fall of the Betrayer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959)\nYup, kill Illidan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22917).  No problem.  Then you're done.",
            date = "2007-02-19T09:20:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10707#comments:id=38627",
        },
        {
            id = 31509,
            score = 77,
            author = "11279",
            text = "Heres a cheese way to do it:\n\n1) Bring a ranged lvl 70 class that can reach 36-41 yards\n2) Fly on top of the building and start plugging away at the soulstealers. They will not evade.\n3) The spawn waves will come out but won't attack you on top of the building.\n4) Shadowlord Deathwail will now land when the soulstealers are all dead, just wait a few minutes for the spawns to disappear then you can fight him all alone.\n\nNote: I tried this solo but i did not attempt to fully fight him. I attacked him from on top of the building and he did not evade since he does a ranged shadowbolt that only hits for ~1k.\n\nIt may be possible to ranged tank him from the roof while taking no physical damage if your group lacks a warrior/druid/pally tank. Though his melee only hit for 900ish on cloth",
            date = "2007-02-06T01:28:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10707#comments:id=31509",
        },
        {
            id = 25282,
            score = 43,
            author = "16436",
            text = "71,35. Kill the 3 elites channeling the heart. Some none elite adds will spawn when you start attacking each elite. Kill Shadowlord Deathwail for the heart.\nShadowlord Deathwail http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22006\nFollowup http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708",
            date = "2007-01-26T18:31:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10707#comments:id=25282",
        },
        {
            id = 96087,
            score = 15,
            author = "58100",
            text = "Along with the added ranged dps by adds, Deathwail is now immune to fear.\n\nHowever this is still extremely easy  for a warlock to solo.  Kill three channelers and wait for packs despawn.  The two close to the building kill from the ledges and the one you cant reach, stand on an invisible column in the corner of the walls, than once they are done wait for ALL packs to despawn than move to Deathwail.\n\nKeep Shadow ward up, and COT. This is important because obviously you take less damage but also it slows the time it takes for him to run out of mana.  If you don't kill him before he runs out of mana he will either evade (as mentioned above) or melee you, and you would much rather him throwing off extremely slow shadow bolts instead of reseting or meleeing you.\n\nAlso if you use your Felhunter make sure you don't silence him, it will act as the same as him running out of mana.",
            date = "2007-06-02T17:54:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10707#comments:id=96087",
        },
        {
            id = 51178,
            score = 14,
            author = "1966",
            text = "As a hunter:\n\nFrom the roof, kill the three casters around the pole. As stated above, they will not fight back and the melee that spawn will not be able to reach you. When the casters are all dead, wait for Shadowlord Deathwail to land and the rest of the adds to despawn.\n\nDeathwail is susceptible to Freezing Trap, Scatter Shot, and Silencing Shot, all of which are handy abilities for this fight. I also recommend wearing at least two Beast Lord armor pieces for the reduced trap cooldown. Talent points in Clever Traps and Trap Mastery are useful but not necessary (I didn't have them). The fight is pretty independent of gear besides the Beast Lord armor, and even so it'll just require you to take an extra shadow bolt every now and then if you don't have it. You may want to stack a little more HP than normal. Time does not seem to be an issue since I spent about twelve minutes doing the quest, starting from when I fired my first arrow to when Deathwail died; staying alive should be prioritized over doing damage (although doing more damage will reduce the length of the encounter, thus reducing the margin of error).\n\nThe general idea is to nuke Deathwail with an Aimed Shot, Multi-Shot, Arcane Shot, and Auto-Shot rotation. When it casts shadowbolt, fire a Silencing Shot to pull it into your Freezing Trap. Run to the other side of the platform and wait for your traps to cooldown. A mod that counts down the duration of your traps is very handy; I recommend Sorren's Timers (found here http://files.wowace.com/). Just as your Freezing Trap is about to expire, charge up another Aimed Shot, etc. combo and pull it into your trap with Silencing Shot. From here, it's repetition.\n\nSome things can and will go wrong. If your trap is resisted, make use of your Scatter Shot to stun him and line of sight (LOS) to avoid his shadow bolts. A good place to exploit LOS is the nook to the right of the building's entrance, as well as the very left corner of the building. This is where the reduced trap cooldown especially comes in handy.\n\nIf you trap ends prematurely, do the same thing as if it was resisted.\n\nBecause Deathwail will only cast shadow bolts when not silenced, if you fail to pull him far enough to run into your trap with Silencing Shot, use your Scatter Shot and hope that it'll cause him to walk dazedly into your trap. Otherwise, use LOS again.\n\nBe careful when trapping him in melee range. He might land a hit on you before he is affected by the trap, and your character might automatically attack back and break the trap. Make sure you turn your back to him if you plan to trap him within melee range of you. You'll see me do this often.\n\nWhen he's trapped, that's the perfect time to use bandages.\n\nHere's a video of me doing the fight. I made a lot of mistakes but still managed to complete it easily.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HoeSAheA36M\n\nGood luck!",
            date = "2007-03-14T16:29:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10707#comments:id=51178",
        },
    },
    [10708] = {
        {
            id = 38592,
            score = 258,
            author = "16691",
            text = "The process of attunement to the Black Temple begins in Shadowmoon Valley with a very long quest chain that requires trips to the Arcatraz, Serpentshrine Cavern, Mount Hyjal and finally the doorstep of the Black Temple itself.  Even if you're not planning on raiding just yet, the chain does offer some nice blue rewards half way through.  It starts differently depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S):\n\nAldors pick up the line from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) in the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568)\n2. (A) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571)\n3. (A) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574)\n4. (A) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575)\n\nScyers get it from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. (S) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683)\n2. (S) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684)\n3. (S) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685)\n4. (S) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686)\n\nAt this point the chains converge for both factions:\n5. [70] Proof of Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622)\n6. [70] Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628)\n7. [70] Seer Udalo (Dungeon) (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705)\n\nHere, you have to venture into the Arcatraz (which requires a Rogue with 350 lockpicking or somebody to open the door who's completed the Arcatraz Key chain (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262), which requires trips to the Mechanar and the Botanica respectively) to the room just before the final boss.  Sadly it's impossible to solo-stealth to.  Finding Udalo leads to:\n\nTalk to Akama:\n8. [70] A Mysterious Portent (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706)\nKill waves of nonelites, 3 elites and a boss (5-man) on a terrace outside the Black Temple:\n9. [70] The Ata'mal Terrace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707)\nFinally, deliver the medallion to A'dal in Shattrath City:\n10. [70] Akama's Promise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708)\n\nThe chain ends here, and you're granted a choice of rewards:\nAkama's Sash (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30932) (cloth DPS belt)\nBloodwarder's Rifle (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31000) (gun)\nSpellbreaker's Buckler (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30984) (spelldamage shield)\nAshtongue Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30999) (phsyical DPS dagger)\nVerdant Gloves (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30943) (feral leather gloves)\nStaff of the Ashtongue Deathsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31417) (healing staff)\nHowever, if you now go into Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) and kill Karathress (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21214), you'll be able to talk to Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who'll continue the quest chain for you:\n\n1. [70] The Secret Compromised (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944)\nGo back to Warden's Cage in SMV and talk to Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21700).\n2. [70R] Ruse of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946)\nUsing the Ashtongue Cowl (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31946) provided, kill Al'ar (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19514) in Tempest Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3842) while disguised as a member of the Deathsworn.\n3. [70R] An Artifact From the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947)\nYou need to be attuned to Mount Hyjal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10445) for this.  Simply kill Rage Winterchill (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17767) and loot his phylactery (what is it with liches and their phylacteries?), then deliver it to Akama...\n4. [70R] The Hostage Soul (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948)\n...then return to Ad'al (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18481) in Shattrath City...\n5. [70R] Entry Into the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949)\n...then go back to Shadowmoon and talk to Xi'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18528) on the road leading to the Black Temple.  He'll ask you to help with\n6. [70] A Distraction for Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985)\n...but once you tell Xi'ri you're ready (talk to him after accepting the quest), you can watch a scripted sequence that you do not actually have to help with in any way.  After this is finished, talk to Xi'ri again for your Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)) and the completion of Black Temple attunement.  Congratulations, you can now waltz in to Illidan's latest bachelor pad!\n\nBut before you go, the chain continues from Xi'ri with:\n7. [70R] Seek Out the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958)\nTime to start exploring the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3959)!  When you find the Deathsworn, they'll give you\n2. [70R] Redemption of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957)\n...which requires you to kill the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).  Finally you're given\n3. [70R] The Fall of the Betrayer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959)\nYup, kill Illidan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22917).  No problem.  Then you're done.",
            date = "2007-02-19T08:11:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10708#comments:id=38592",
        },
        {
            id = 93307,
            score = 60,
            author = "21551",
            text = "Once you complete this questline/quest you will be able to talk to an NPC who resides in a cage behind Fathom-Lord Karathress in SSC. After killing Fathom-Lord the NPC will be freed and you will be able to pickup a Quest which will be to return to Akama and report some findings.\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944\n\nWhen you get to Akama you will notice he is having a conversation with \"Illidan's Presence\". Illidan orders Akama to have one of his Ashtongue venture into TK to kill A'Lar. Akama passes this duty on to you in the following quest(line):\n\n1. Ruse of the Ashtongue:\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946\n2. An Artifact From the Past\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947\n3. The Hostage Soul\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948\n4. Entry Into the Black Temple\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949\n5. A Distraction for Akama\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985\n\nIt is at this point where you recieve the actual Medallion of Karabor which grants you access to the Black Temple, but the questline is not yet complete. The final quest awards The blessed Medallion of the Karabor which upon \"use:\"transports you to the entrance of the Black Temple but you need to kill Illidan to get it =)\n\n6. Seek Out the Ashtongue\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958\n7. Redemption of the Ashtongue\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957\n8. The Fall of the Betrayer\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959",
            date = "2007-05-29T23:32:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10708#comments:id=93307",
        },
        {
            id = 46946,
            score = 29,
            author = "25633",
            text = "By looking over all the quest's in this chain, to see if it is a good \"gold chain\", i got the total gold and rep you earn are:\n\nYou'll get 1925 rep with Ashtongue Deathsworn, a faction with no reputaition rewards so far.\nIf you're Aldor you'll recive 1825 rep and lose 907 rep Scryers.\nIf you're Scryer you'll recive 1825 rep and lose 907 rep Aldor.\nYou will also get 12 rep with Sha'tar.\n\nIf you need any of the rewards from the last quest you will still earn 28.41 gold. If not you should take the staff and sell it, which will give you a total amount of 38.63 gold.\n\nI havn't done this questchain yet, just looked it over to see how much gold and rep I could get from it. Will try to confirm it in the oncoming days.",
            date = "2007-03-06T05:45:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10708#comments:id=46946",
        },
        {
            id = 51301,
            score = 19,
            author = "23388",
            text = "The completion of the final chain of the quest has neat ending :D. \"You see a glimpse of the future. You see Akama and Maiev fighting their way through to Black Temple. But you see a third shrouded figure, and that figure is you.\"",
            date = "2007-03-14T21:09:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10708#comments:id=51301",
        },
        {
            id = 2124908,
            score = 12,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "If you feel lost and unsure where you are in the chain, use the following copy-paste scripts:\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\nSimply copy the script and paste in chat. You'll find a lot of text saying Yes/No for each quest in the chain, chronologically. Find the quest that isn't completed and look that up on Wowhead to proceed.\n\nHave fun obtaining your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757",
            date = "2015-02-27T10:42:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10708#comments:id=2124908",
        },
    },
