        {
            id = 22584,
            score = 85,
            author = "12339",
            text = "The whelps are found in the cave at 31,32. If you run out of whelps, are its being over-farmed, you can tread on the eggs to spawn some more.",
            date = "2007-01-21T22:19:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10747#comments:id=22584",
        },
        {
            id = 2611834,
            score = 46,
            author = "MidnightDemon",
            text = "To get the Inkling's Leggings (https://www.wowhead.com/item=31519/inklings-leggings) You need to do the following!\n\nGo to Evergrove in the Blade's Edge Mountains (Outland)\nSpeak to Tree Warden Chawn (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=22007/tree-warden-chawn) for the quest A Time For Negotiation... (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10682/a-time-for-negotiation)\nYou'll need to find Overseer Nuaar (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21981/overseer-nuaar#comments), a neutral NPC who patrols the paths around/outside Evergrove (ignore the area noted for the quest on the map)\nSpeak to him to complete the quest.\n\nTurn in to Tree Warden Chawn and pickup the next quest ...And A Time For Action (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10713/and-a-time-for-action), complete it\nTurn in to Tree Warden Chawn again, now you'll need to speak to his buddy Samia Inkling (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21983/samia-inkling) for Poaching from Poachers (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10717/poaching-from-poachers)\nThe nets are dropped from Wyrmcult Poachers (enemies with the Wyrncult Broodlings) at about 60%\nTurn in to Samia Inkling and pickup the next quest Whelps of the Wyrmcult (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10747/whelps-of-the-wyrmcult)\nYou'll need to go north of the area noted on the map, down the side of the cliff to find the cave that has the whelps\nBreaking the eggs will spawn more whelps :) net them and return to Evergrove and turn in\n\nAnd, you'll have the pants!",
            date = "2018-09-07T12:27:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10747#comments:id=2611834",
        },
        {
            id = 24407,
            score = 35,
            author = "Gurg",
            text = "Fastest and easiest way is treading on the eggs, which are found outlining the inside of the cave.\n\nCave Entrance: 32,33.\n\nDieng is not a good idea here, seeing as you will spawn back at Ruuan Weald.",
            date = "2007-01-25T12:55:38-06:00",
