    [10751] = {
        {
            id = 69522,
            score = 9,
            author = "44525",
            text = "Soloed this q dying just once on a sort of dry run.\n\nthe requierd mobs are in the area  that stretches from 51,63 to Crimson Watch at 51,72 (go check this place out if you have flying mount, really scary)\n\nThe mobs stand in groups of 3 with 1 spellbinder and 2 soldiers, the soldiers have about 5k hp and are just grass to kill, the spellbinder do hurs somewath, but just out dps it, around 5k hp there also.\n\nThe only thing to keep in mind is the Crimson Sigil pack that strokes around in the area, 5 blood elfs on mounts, one on the bird and 4 on horses, the one on bird is a huntertype with arrows hitting for ~1k dmg on clothies\n\nthe Giant elites are kite able (atleast for a frost mage) and really easy to kill if you put some effort in it. ~22k hp.\n\n(I'm a frost mage)",
            date = "2007-04-19T08:09:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10751#comments:id=69522",
        },
        {
            id = 53807,
            score = 8,
            author = "34852",
            text = "It's actually solo-able, although you would probably want to at least have a flying mount (and stealth doesn't hurt either).\n\nJust choose a quiet spot along a ledge (I'm at 52, 65), watch your CC and pick them off. I died once on a stupid pull when vanish was up. Also, getting spellbinders is kind of a pain because they usually spawn with two soldiers. The soldiers heal, so make sure to intterupt if you can.",
            date = "2007-03-19T15:35:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10751#comments:id=53807",
        },
        {
            id = 3175971,
