            author = "Zorens",
            text = "No suee, you need to kill the Smith Gorlunk (Level 69) (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22037) in Shadowmoon first. He drops the Primed Key Mould (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31241), which starts this quest. He can be found at  67,36 in Shadowmoon Valley, in a small hut.",
