            author = "LorienGL",
            text = "The complete quest chain:\n\nThunderlord Clan Artifacts (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10524) <- The item that starts it drops from Bladespire Ogres in BEM\nVision Guide (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10525)\nThe Thunderspike (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10526)\n\nThe Spirits Have Voices (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10718)\nWhispers on the Wind (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10614)\nReunion (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10709)\nOn Spirit's Wings (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10714)\nBaron Sablemane (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10783)\nInto the Churning Gulch (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10715)\n\nBaron Sablemane's Poison (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10749) - The chain goes on, you only need to complete this one\n\nCrush the Bloodmaul Camp (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10784) - This quest ;)\n\nAll quests can be soloed easily (Pally lvl 65).\n\nHope this helps :)",
