        {
            id = 1872475,
            score = 1,
            author = "Belthazare",
            text = "(1) If you haven’t received the item and killed him more then once, you have probably already done it.\n(2) Its been reported by a GM that no quest any longer will tie on to being able to do that quest when it drops of Dorgok. (TRUE)\n(3) There is nothing a GM can do about the item to reset the quest or something of the likes, don’t waste your time, you will just be told to submit a suggestion to have the eye patch put in game elsewhere.\n(4) don’t waste your time killing him over and over, if it hasn’t dropped the first kill, its not going to. (68+) for me.\n(5) I started to try and do this quest line for the eye patch, so if your reading this you are probably having the same problem. Submit a suggestion and if enough get to Blizz about this we might be able to see the eye patch elsewhere.",
            date = "2013-07-01T01:06:24-05:00",
