            text = "Just kill all mobs then use it around summoning place.",
            date = "2007-03-21T19:38:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10808#comments:id=55025",
        },
        {
            id = 414487,
            score = 21,
            author = "Zazzy",
            text = "This is going to sound very stupid and it is. I have done this quest many times with other alts and I still make the same error.\n\nSpent an hour today doing the same old thing using the wrong summoning item. Its very easy to look in your bags and spot the first thing that looks like the right item, eg. The Unfinised Headpiece. Wrong.... You need to use the \"Staff of Parshah\". It will then work without killing the summoners or not. This is one mistake I will not be making again.",
            date = "2008-10-21T07:26:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10808#comments:id=414487",
        },
        {
            id = 102133,
            score = 10,
            author = "46661",
            text = "All you need to do is go to the summoning point (41.60) which is between Wildhammer Stronghold and Eclipse Point. Kill that summoners (they will be channeling a purple beam to the C'thun like thing) and use the rod at the edge of the lava.",
            date = "2007-06-10T23:19:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10808#comments:id=102133",
        },
    },
