            text = "Starts a really fun questline that nets you a decent blue neck reward for many classes, found here:\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10912\n\nHunter's should be able to solo most of it, but other classes will probably need at least a healer to deal with the exploding imps and 68 elite. The final guy himself is simplified by the provided treant summon.",
            date = "2007-01-24T05:25:13-06:00",
