    [10813] = {
        {
            id = 21931,
            score = 155,
            author = "12815",
            text = "There is an 'Eye of Grillok' wandering the Zethgor area. Coords: 67.74.\n\nHow to do it? Once you have located the Eye, target it, and use the quest device to capture it. Several people are complaining about an Eye in the barracks that can not be absorbeb. So, I would suggest to use it only on the wandering Eye.\n\nNow, go to Spinebreaker Post (Horde) (you can use your mount if you want) and stand beside the NPC and his cauldron (Zezzak). You have 5 minutes. Once you are at the cauldron, target yourself and use the device (Zezzak's Shard) again.\n\nQuest finished ^^\n\nNOTE: This quest is a pain if you are in a crowded server. I would suggest to do it when there are few people around (I did at 4 am)",
            date = "2007-01-20T05:21:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10813#comments:id=21931",
        },
        {
            id = 1777414,
            score = 110,
            author = "1035481",
            text = "Note, there seems to be a bug with this quest and the default WoW quest tracker.  The location of the quest appears just east of Grillok's cave.  I noticed some people seeming to believe that the cauldron involved was the one at this location.  After pointing out the quest mentions returning to Zellak, it seems to need to be mentioned that once you absorb the eye, you need to go directly back to your quest giver, and not the cauldron near the village.",
            date = "2012-12-07T22:01:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10813#comments:id=1777414",
        },
        {
            id = 2328193,
            score = 53,
            author = "Gronzillo",
            text = "Ignore the blue objective circle on the minimap, there's a cauldron nearby there, but it has nothing to do with this quest. To return the eye, you need to travel back to where you got the quest, a good ways southwest of the blue objective circle.",
            date = "2016-05-04T19:43:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10813#comments:id=2328193",
        },
        {
            id = 181312,
            score = 46,
            author = "Kizrak",
            text = "After completing 'Wanted: Worg Master Kruush' this quest became available (as of 11/9/07)\nPrior to completing this quest, Zezzak had no quests for me\n\nor something,\n-kizrak",
            date = "2007-11-09T04:18:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10813#comments:id=181312",
        },
        {
            id = 130592,
            score = 42,
            author = "Payson",
            text = "This quest can be a bit of a challenge if you don't time it just right.  When you see a patrolling Eye of Grillok in Zeth'Gor, you must use the provided Zezzak Shard on it.  This will channel the Eye into you and you'll get a buff saying it is in you, and the Grillok sees what you see.   The Eye itself will not attack you, but this is where it gets tricky.  When the Eye sees you, it will aggro all mobs within an (estimated) 30 yard radius.  On top of the fact that you might get up to at least 5 mobs on you, if you get hit, the channel of the Eye into you is interrupted and the Eye then disappears.\n\nOnce you successfully get the Eye channeled into you, you have 5 minutes to run back to Spinebreaker Post.  Walk right up to the cauldron that Zezzak is sitting next to.  The Eye will leave you and float into the cauldron.  This completes the quest, and you just talk to Zezzak.",
            date = "2007-08-01T16:49:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10813#comments:id=130592",
        },
    },
    [10814] = {
        {
            id = 32679,
            score = 20,
            author = "greengoo",
            text = "How to get Neutral with Netherdrake (Netherdrake Epic Mount Quest Starter)\nA list by Greengoo\n\n1. Kindness\n- Kill 8 Rocknail Flayers, Use Carcasses to Feed 8 Dragons (don't move!). Also make sure to travel a bit when laying the meat, as the same drakes won't eat twice in a row.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10804\n\n2. Seek Out Neltharaku\n- Fly on your mount and find Neltharaku, he patrols slowly around Dragonmaw about a few hundred feet up. You'll have to be about 5 yards UNDER him to talk to him.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10811\n\n3. Neltharaku's Tale\n- Listen to story.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10814\n\n4. Infiltrating Dragonmaw Fortress\n- Kill 15 of any type of orcs in the fortress.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10836\n\n5.To Netherwing Ledge!\n- Find 12 Crystals from the floating island SE of the mainland.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10837\n\n6. The Force of Neltharaku\n- Free 5 Dragons by using the item on them, then killing the orcs they agro.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10854\n\n7. Karynaku\n- Find Karynaku, she's the second story of the fortress.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10858\n\n8. Zuluhed the Whacked\n- Kill Zuluhed and recover the key. I recommend pulling him inside so as to avoid the archers, and kill him BEFORE he summons his add. Use the key he drops to free Karynaku.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10872\n\n9. Ally of the Netherwing\n- Return to Mordenai, you will immediately gain 42,000 rep and become neutral.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10870\n\n10. ????\n- Blizzard has announced that next patch they will be introducing a continuence of this quest line, including the ability to get exalted and purchase or receive through extensive questing an EPIC netherdrake mount. You will need epic training to use it however, so save your gold!",
            date = "2007-02-08T13:56:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10814#comments:id=32679",
        },
        {
            id = 41872,
            score = 18,
            author = "bprater",
            text = "If you can't talk to the dragon (the talk area is actually under his feet), go to Interface Options > Click-to-move. And click on him and it will take you to the point where you can speak to him.",
            date = "2007-02-25T01:49:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10814#comments:id=41872",
        },
        {
            id = 5911107,
            score = 3,
            author = "weswallace164",
            text = "How do you now hover to listen to Neltharaku's tale with the new dragonriding?\nI cant hover long enough to hear the tale therefore not being able to complete the quest.",
            date = "2024-08-01T23:47:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10814#comments:id=5911107",
        },
        {
            id = 3305182,
            score = 2,
            author = "AySz88",
            text = "(As of Shadowlands) If it's busy, like during timewalking for the rep buff - go through the quest quickly! As part of the quest at the end of the chain (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10870), https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21657 will sometimes leave and fly down near https://www.wowhead.com/npc=22113 for some RP. As soon as he starts moving, you can't interact or get quests from him anymore - you have to wait for him to respawn.\n\nIf you want to read the text, here it is:\n\nI am listening, dragon.\n\nIn the eastern reaches of the Netherwing Fields lies Dragonmaw Fortress. It is there that the cruel Dragonmaw orc clan tortures the drakes that they capture in an attempt to bend them to their will. Many have given up hope, choosing instead to do the bidding of Dragonmaw. The others... They refuse to land for fear of Dragonmaw war parties capturing them and taking them back to the fortress.\n\nBut you are dragons! How could orcs do this to you?\n\nNeltharaku: I... We are powerless. Illidan found and delivered unto the Dragonmaw their leader - Zuluhed. This orc was the one responsible for the capture and incarceration of Alexstrasza. How could we fight against such power? He captured an Aspect!\n\nAnd just as easily, he took my mate.\n\nYour mate?\n\nKarynaku... She is held prisoner atop Dragonmaw fortress. I have made many attempts to free her. All have failed... You have battled these beasts before, have you not?\n\nI have battled many beasts, dragon. I will help you.\n\nIt takes a couple of minutes for the player doing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10870 to arrive with another NPC and witness the conversation, and then for https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21657 to fly away and disappear. Then he respawns.\n\n(Judging by the comments, there might be a separate glitch where he doesn't respawn for a long while, but I haven't seen that yet. There are times when he gets pulled away almost instantly, though.)",
            date = "2021-03-01T14:28:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10814#comments:id=3305182",
        },
        {
            id = 3304368,
            score = 1,
            author = "xLunacyx",
            text = "I cannot seem to turn in this quest after completing it. :T",
            date = "2021-02-26T18:10:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10814#comments:id=3304368",
        },
    },
