        {
            id = 64126,
            score = 26,
            author = "797",
            text = "Mobs that path?\nCheck\n\nMobs that randomly evade at the drop of a hat?\nCheck\n\nPathing mobs that summon help?\nCheck\n\nPathing level 70 elites?\nDouble Check\n\nOne of the hardest non elite quests I've done yet.",
