        {
            id = 1981979,
            score = 1,
            author = "Nopeace",
            text = "Macros\n10x https://www.wowhead.com/item=30810\n\n#showtooltip Sunfury Signet\n/script SelectGossipAvailableQuest(1)\n/script CompleteQuest()\n/script GetQuestReward()\n\nSingle https://www.wowhead.com/item=30810\n\n#showtooltip Sunfury Signet\n/script SelectGossipAvailableQuest(2)\n/script CompleteQuest()\n/script GetQuestReward()\n\nRight click on the NPC who you turn the https://www.wowhead.com/item=30810 into and press whatever button you have this bound to. This makes turning in any rep item a breeze. I suggest binding it to the mouse wheel for nearly instant turn ins.",
            date = "2014-07-18T21:28:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10822#comments:id=1981979",
        },
    },
