            text = "http://www.wowhead.com/?maps=3519:304423\n\nThere are 3 mobs surrounding the stone, but 2 of them walk away after a bit, so you can kill them 1 at a time, if you want to.",
            date = "2007-09-02T03:06:11-05:00",
