            author = "9877",
            text = "There are \"Cursed Egg\"s found around the camp (23, 74), they are in bird nest looking things outside of the huts.\n\nThey have a chance (seems to be a pretty small chance) to let out a Malevolent Hatchling that you can kill.",
            date = "2006-12-21T03:16:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10861#comments:id=17682",
        },
        {
            id = 22202,
