            author = "MrGorun",
            text = "Confirmed 23, 74. Use the cursed egg then kill Malevolent Hatchling.",
            date = "2007-01-20T17:55:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10861#comments:id=22202",
        },
        {
            id = 1731303,
            score = 26,
            author = "945326",
            text = "Here's the problem:\n\nThe eggs spawn as either redeemed or malevolent.  Once spawned, they do not change.\n\nSo if you come into the area and all the currently spawned eggs are redeemed, once you open three of them, you will no longer be able to interact with any more eggs.  You will have to wait until those three eggs re-spawn.  And the re-spawn timer is excruciatingly slow.\n\nOnce they do re-spawn, they have a 50/50 chance of re-spawning as either  redeemed or malevolent.  So if you've got your 3 redeemed hatchlings, and the three eggs you've already opened re-spawn as redeemed, you still can't interact with any of the eggs.\n\nThere is no advantage to dropping the quest and re-starting it, as that won't change any of the redeemed eggs into malevolent eggs or malevolent eggs into redeemed eggs.  It's just a random chance as to which way they will re-spawn.\n\nSo unless you're supremely lucky and manage to get there when there are three of each kind of eggs, you'll end up spending a lot of time waiting for eggs to re-spawn.  And if they all re-spawn the kind you already have, then you basically end up sitting there waiting for somebody else to come start the quest and open more eggs.  Which you will then have to hope re-spawn the way you need them to.\n\nSo, essentially, you have two options:\n\n1)   Keep going off and doing other things and then come back to the area once in a while to see if any of the eggs sparkle for you again (which could literally take hours), or\n\n2)  Skip this quest.",
            date = "2012-10-04T14:43:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10861#comments:id=1731303",
        },
        {
            id = 89098,
            score = 18,
            author = "2259",
            text = "Yeah I had 5 redeemed and 3 malevolent. Not bad!\n\nOh another thing, be careful when fighting in the middle of their camp, a large Ogre, Mug'gok, comes into the camp and wanders through. He's only lvl 64, but it can catch you off-guard.\n\nHe will yell something about wanting to play with the birdies when he enters. But if you are locked in mortal combat with one of these ugly SOB's then you might miss it! :D",
            date = "2007-05-24T03:15:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10861#comments:id=89098",
        },
        {
            id = 240458,
            score = 11,
            author = "127410",
            text = "Mages can blink away to aviod aggro from malevolent",
            date = "2008-02-20T21:44:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10861#comments:id=240458",
        },
    },
    [10862] = {
