        {
            id = 23235,
            score = 13,
            author = "12690",
            text = "There are indeed a few at Gor'gaz, but I found it to be easier to simply pick them off where they stood around the wall. The entire wall, if you follow it from where the above poster suggests you start, has orcs lining it, nicely spaced apart for easy pulls. There were a ton of alliance at Gor'gaz, so that made it a less appealing choice for me.",
            date = "2007-01-23T12:17:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10864#comments:id=23235",
        },
        {
            id = 311574,
            score = 9,
            author = "Kozz",
            text = "If you don't have a coords mod, Shattered Hand Berserker (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=16878) and Shattered Hand Guard (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19414) are the mobs you need to kill, Wowhead lists their locations.",
