            author = "733706",
            text = "I received this quest as a lvl 60 Warrior, the quest mobs can be as high as lvl 63. This was generally no problem though some of the fights were drawn out.\n\nExcept for the spiders.  They patrol much of the area and will agro while you are fighting one of the quest mobs. You have to look around for them during fights. At my level, trying to fight two or three lvl 62-63 mobs at once was often fatal.",
