            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10877#comments:id=147316",
        },
        {
            id = 25969,
            score = 9,
            author = "Warlucky",
            text = "Tip:Get on top of the chest then take the relic.Mount up and run through them.\n\nI did this twice another good idea is have thorns(druids) or fire shield(warlock's imp)",
            date = "2007-01-27T20:17:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10877#comments:id=25969",
        },
        {
            id = 207290,
            score = 9,
            author = "70445",
            text = "Rogues:\nThere are apparitions with stealth detection in the area.  You cannot see them until they attack you.  You will be stealthing through the skellies and suddenly see \"Entering Combat\".  The will break your stealth and can potentially aggro too many adds to handle.\n\nSave yourself the run and pick a good path between the skellies, so that if you do aggro an invisible spirit you will only aggro one add.  I just popped blind on the add and easily finished off the spirit and then the skeleton.\n\nOpened the chest, mounted, and booked it.  Very easy!",
            date = "2007-12-25T22:42:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10877#comments:id=207290",
        },
