            text = "The skeletons that spawned only hit me for about 7 and I am a Druid,also they only have (judging from how much my thorns did to them) maybe 500 health.",
            date = "2007-01-20T12:02:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10877#comments:id=22042",
