        {
            id = 36974,
            score = 9,
            author = "19655",
            text = "Simple fight, easily soloable. The mob has no special abilities, but is surrounded by level 66-67 non-elite's. She slightly patrols down the pathway, so it is possible to pull without having to fully clear the area. 46, 32.",
            date = "2007-02-16T11:58:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10893#comments:id=36974",
        },
        {
            id = 177424,
            score = 6,
            author = "58847",
            text = "You can use your flying mount in the tunnel, and find her fairly quickly using /target Draaca.  Just wait until there's no one around her, fly down, slay her, then fly back to the questgiver.",
            date = "2007-10-31T18:42:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10893#comments:id=177424",
        },
        {
            id = 90635,
