        {
            id = 87968,
            score = 37,
            author = "52418",
            text = "Recorded a 13 min re spawn time on this bird when someone have started the quest.",
            date = "2007-05-23T02:54:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10898#comments:id=87968",
        },
        {
            id = 45189,
            score = 26,
            author = "14590",
            text = "This quest took me two tries to solo as a 64 rogue, and I learned some valuable information:\n\n-Skywing has 5,600 hit points and can defeat any of the regular enemies ON HIS OWN and be left at low HP.\n-Skywing regens all his lost hit points in a matter of seconds.\n-He also generates moderate threat and can serve as a tank if you are trying to conserve hit points or mana.\n-He can last for a short while against the boss.\n\nAs a rogue fighting the boss, I blew all of my cooldowns. I had forgotten to bring healing pots so when I reached about 500 HP when the elite was almost dead I vanished and Skywing (who was at about 30% HP) took over the aggro. I stayed stealthed for a second or two and then cheap shotted the boss and finished him off while he was stunned.\n\nIt was very risky but I realized that Skywing could be used to save your life on the final boss and to buy you time before him on easier enemies so that you can eat or mana regen.",
            date = "2007-03-02T14:23:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10898#comments:id=45189",
        },
        {
            id = 183765,
