            text = "He bugs completely out on one of the towers right after we jumped down, dropped quest and repeated only to have him freeze up at the same place again... forget about this quest!",
            date = "2007-11-13T22:04:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10898#comments:id=183765",
        },
        {
            id = 25945,
            score = 24,
