    [10921] = {
        {
            id = 23782,
            score = 46,
            author = "11660",
            text = "Can be soloed as a rogue.  I had double Deadly Poison on, opened with a Premed Cheap Shot, hit Bladefist's Breadth and Ruptured.  Popped evasion and Ghostly Strike, built up a few combo points then SnD.  Prepped Evasion when it ran out and did it again.  She cannot be Blinded or Gouged, but you can 5 pt Kidney Shot and bandage, just make sure you don't have the dot poison on you.  Pop a health pot if needed.\n\nA Combat Rogue may be able to burn her down with SnD - Blade Flurry - Adrenaline Rush, but I dunno.\n\nAlso, make sure you don't stand on the spawn point typing on Wowhead after you kill her.",
