    [10944] = {
        {
            id = 98884,
            score = 325,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T18:15:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10944#comments:id=98884",
        },
        {
            id = 251378,
            score = 58,
            author = "16691",
            text = "The process of attunement to the Black Temple begins in Shadowmoon Valley with a very long quest chain that requires trips to the Arcatraz, Serpentshrine Cavern, Mount Hyjal and finally the doorstep of the Black Temple itself.  Even if you're not planning on raiding just yet, the chain does offer some nice blue rewards half way through.  It starts differently depending on whether you're Aldor (A) or Scryer (S):\n\nAldors pick up the line from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) in the Altar of Sha'tar:\n1. (A) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568)\n2. (A) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571)\n3. (A) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574)\n4. (A) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575)\n\nScyers get it from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. (S) [70] Tablets of Baa'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683)\n2. (S) [70] Oronu the Elder (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684)\n3. (S) [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685)\n4. (S) [70] The Warden's Cage (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686)\n\nAt this point the chains converge for both factions:\n5. [70] Proof of Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622)\n6. [70] Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628)\n7. [70] Seer Udalo (Dungeon) (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705)\n\nHere, you have to venture into the Arcatraz (which requires a Rogue with 350 lockpicking or somebody to open the door who's completed the Arcatraz Key chain (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10262), which requires trips to the Mechanar and the Botanica respectively) to the room just before the final boss.  Sadly it's impossible to solo-stealth to.  Finding Udalo leads to:\n\nTalk to Akama:\n8. [70] A Mysterious Portent (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706)\nKill waves of nonelites, 3 elites and a boss (5-man) on a terrace outside the Black Temple:\n9. [70] The Ata'mal Terrace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707)\nFinally, deliver the medallion to A'dal in Shattrath City:\n10. [70] Akama's Promise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708)\n\nThe chain ends here, and you're granted a choice of rewards:\nAkama's Sash (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30932) (cloth DPS belt)\nBloodwarder's Rifle (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31000) (gun)\nSpellbreaker's Buckler (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30984) (spelldamage shield)\nAshtongue Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30999) (phsyical DPS dagger)\nVerdant Gloves (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30943) (feral leather gloves)\nStaff of the Ashtongue Deathsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31417) (healing staff)\nHowever, if you now go into Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) and kill Karathress (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21214), you'll be able to talk to Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who'll continue the quest chain for you:\n\n1. [70] The Secret Compromised (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944)\nGo back to Warden's Cage in SMV and talk to Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21700).\n2. [70R] Ruse of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946)\nUsing the Ashtongue Cowl (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=31946) provided, kill Al'ar (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=19514) in Tempest Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3842) while disguised as a member of the Deathsworn.\n3. [70R] An Artifact From the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947)\nYou need to be attuned to Mount Hyjal (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10445) for this.  Simply kill Rage Winterchill (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=17767) and loot his phylactery (what is it with liches and their phylacteries?), then deliver it to Akama...\n4. [70R] The Hostage Soul (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948)\n...then return to Ad'al (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18481) in Shattrath City...\n5. [70R] Entry Into the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949)\n...then go back to Shadowmoon and talk to Xi'ri (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=18528) on the road leading to the Black Temple.  He'll ask you to help with\n6. [70] A Distraction for Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985)\n...but once you tell Xi'ri you're ready (talk to him after accepting the quest), you can watch a scripted sequence that you do not actually have to help with in any way.  After this is finished, talk to Xi'ri again for your Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)) and the completion of Black Temple attunement.  Congratulations, you can now waltz in to Illidan's latest bachelor pad!\n\nBut before you go, the chain continues from Xi'ri with:\n7. [70R] Seek Out the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958)\nTime to start exploring the Black Temple (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3959)!  When you find the Deathsworn, they'll give you\n2. [70R] Redemption of the Ashtongue (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957)\n...which requires you to kill the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).  Finally you're given\n3. [70R] The Fall of the Betrayer (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959)\nYup, kill Illidan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22917).  No problem.  Then you're done.",
            date = "2008-03-10T19:12:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10944#comments:id=251378",
        },
        {
            id = 2124909,
            score = 44,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "If you feel lost and unsure where you are in the chain, use the following copy-paste scripts:\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\nSimply copy the script and paste in chat. You'll find a lot of text saying Yes/No for each quest in the chain, chronologically. Find the quest that isn't completed and look that up on Wowhead to proceed.\n\nHave fun obtaining your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757",
            date = "2015-02-27T10:42:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10944#comments:id=2124909",
        },
        {
            id = 105684,
            score = 32,
            author = "Astralen",
            text = "Observe! If you go inside SSC a day later after killing Karathress (within the reset) and attempt to fetch the quest...he wont be there =) Apparently he despawns.",
            date = "2007-06-16T21:59:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10944#comments:id=105684",
        },
        {
            id = 108484,
            score = 27,
            author = "24449",
            text = "Confirmed, despawns after a soft reset, which is basicly everyone leaving the instance and reforming a raid.",
            date = "2007-06-21T07:55:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10944#comments:id=108484",
        },
    },
    [10946] = {
        {
            id = 98885,
            score = 78,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T18:17:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10946#comments:id=98885",
        },
        {
            id = 333742,
            score = 52,
            author = "Lukian",
            text = "Seer Olum says: Akama, my friend!  Have you been informed?  I was found out by Vashj's followers.  Our secret is in peril!\nAkama says: Olum... old friend.  It is good to see that you are safe.\nSeer Olum says: Illidan will find me and when he does... he will pry the Ashtongue secret from me - such is the power of the Betrayer!  No... there is only one way.  My usefulness to the cause has come to an end. I must venture into the spirit world!\nAkama says: You cannot... be serious, Olum.  Your sacrifice has already been too great.\nSeer Olum says: My decision is final.  I will not be dissuaded.  I have devoted my life to our plan.  To jeopardize it now would betray all who have died for the cause long before me.\nAkama says: It appears your mind is set then.  We will guide you to the spirit world with as much kindness as we can.\nSeer Olum says: I thank you, Akama.  You honor me by allowing me this moment, surrounded by my brothers.  Farewell, friend.  Guide our people well.\nAkama says: Farewell, dear friend. We shall meet you in the next world when our duties in this one are fulfilled.\nAkama says: Master!  We've found the traitor who escaped Vashj!  His body lies in front of me... lifeless!\nIllidan's Presence says: You disappoint me, Akama.  I wanted to question the treacherous worm myself!  I'm beginning to question your allegiance, Broken.\nAkama says: But, sire!  You have misjudged my actions... I do have knowledge of someone close to you who plans to betray you.  It is that dog, Kael'thas!  He has allied with Kil'jaeden and intends to replace you as Lord of Outland!\nIllidan's Presence says: I do not sense lies in your voice, Akama.  That Kael'thas would betray me does not come as a big surprise - I'm not as oblivious as some would think. That one of your own was involved with him puts your loyalties into question.\nIllidan's Presence says: Send your Ashtongue into Tempest Keep and slay his most prized possession, the phoenix known as Al'ar.  I must know that you're not on his side.  Do not think of betraying me, Broken.  We both know who owns your soul!",
            date = "2008-07-23T07:52:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10946#comments:id=333742",
        },
        {
            id = 218144,
            score = 36,
            author = "117989",
            text = "Also-\nIf you are battle-rezzed you must re-equip the disguise or you will not get credit.",
            date = "2008-01-14T10:41:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10946#comments:id=218144",
        },
        {
            id = 164760,
            score = 27,
            author = "50773",
            text = "Do I still complete the quest if he dies when I'm dead?",
            date = "2007-10-08T13:44:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10946#comments:id=164760",
        },
        {
            id = 315212,
            score = 21,
            author = "smcn",
            text = "If you're the forgetful type, put /use ashtongue cowl in your most-used macro (or even all of your macros). Using the cowl does not initiate a global cooldown.\n\nUnfortunately for feral druids, the act of using the item WILL remove you from cat and bear form, although you are able to switch into bear and cat after you use the cowl.",
            date = "2008-06-27T21:02:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10946#comments:id=315212",
        },
    },
