        {
            id = 2250087,
            score = 6,
            author = "Aurleis1",
            text = "Aldor Video Guide: http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bQy6VAyViEU [sup]1[/sup]\n Scryer Video Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axqaQWiLnAI [sup]1[/sup]\n\n[sup]1[/sup]The quest IDs are the same for [faction=932] and [faction=934]; however, the separate videos will direct you to the applicable flight locations.\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10947\n•\009Accept the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10947 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21700, at coords 58.1, 48.2, in Warden's Cage, [zone=3520] (Outland).\n•\009Travel to [zone=4395], either via one of the Dalaran teleport rings, or by using your https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948, and clicking the Dalaran (Northrend) portal.\n•\009Travel to a building, in [zone=4395], whose entrance is located at 32.0, 48.6.  Go up the stairs and to your left there is a portal labeled: 'Dalaran Portal to Caverns of Time.'  Click this Portal to be transported.\n•\009At the [zone=2300], head into the tunnel in front of you, underground to coords 48.3, 24.5 and enter the raid instance: [zone=3606].\n•\009Enter the instance portal located to your left, which is not gated (see video).\n•\009Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17772 and select, \"My companions and I are with you, Lady Proudmore.\"  Starting this will activate the first waves of mobs to spew forth.\n•\009Head southwest and wait for the mobs to reach you.  Don't allow any of the 10 waves of mobs to pass you and enter the Alliance Base.\n•\009After defeating the 10 waves of trash, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17767 will approach.  Defeat https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17767 and loot the https://www.wowhead.com/item=32459, from the corpse.\n•\009Unfortunately, you can't run out of the instance.  You will need to use one of your pieces of teleport gear or a https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948 to reach the [zone=6142] / [zone=6141].\n•\009Go to the city's portal room.\n-\009-\009Alliance players: go to the room above the opposite of the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 69, 52.\n-\009-\009Horde players: go to the room above the Innkeeper and click the Shattrath portal at coords 64, 58.\n•\009Once you have arrived on the other side of the portal, fly to and interact with the gryphon flight master, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18940, at coords 63.8, 41.6.\n-\009-\009Aldor players will fly to the Altar of Sha'tar, in [zone=3520].\n-\009-\009Scryer players will fly to the Sanctum of the Stars, in [zone=3520].\n•\009Fly to the Warden's Cage at coordinates 57.2, 49.6.\n•\009Enter the Warden's Cage, and follow the underground passage and swim to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21700 at coords 58.1, 48.2\n\nFull Guide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=32757/blessed-medallion-of-karabor#comments:id=2249836) to obtain https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757.\n\nIf you're unsure about which stage of the quest line you are in to obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757, enter the following script into the chat box (special thanks to Vlad for the script):\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end",
            date = "2015-09-11T00:08:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10947#comments:id=2250087",
        },
        {
            id = 1639297,
            score = 5,
            author = "pellmell",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=17767 drops the quest item.  He can be found in [zone=3606].",
            date = "2012-03-14T03:40:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10947#comments:id=1639297",
        },
        {
            id = 1655837,
            score = 5,
            author = "965937",
            text = "Was able to solo this quest with my 85 Priest. Rage Winterchill can be tricky but it all comes down to avoiding death and decay. Bring more ppl if needed !",
            date = "2012-04-18T16:48:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10947#comments:id=1655837",
        },
    },
    [10948] = {
        {
            id = 98891,
            score = 31,
            author = "19650",
            text = "This is a quest involved in the Black Temple Attunement Chain:\n\nThe Black Temple attunement starts at The Altar of the Sha'tar for Aldors, and the Sanctum of the Sun for Scryers. Both are in Shadowmoon Valley.\n\nAldors start attunement from Anchorite Ceyla (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21402) at the Altar of Sha'tar in Shadowmoon Valley:\n1. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10568 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10571 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10574 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [A] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10575 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nScyers start attunement from Arcanist Thelis (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=21955) at the Sanctum of Stars:\n1. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10683 [70] Tablets of Baa'ri\n2. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10684 [70] Oronu the Elder\n3. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10685 [70] The Ashtongue Corruptors\n4. [Sc] http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10686 [70] The Warden's Cage\n\nAfter that, the chain comes together for Aldor and Scryer.\n\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10622 [70] Proof of Allegiance\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10628 [70] Akama\n7. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10705 [70] Seer Udalo\n\nSeer Udalo is found in the Arcatraz (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3846) just before the last boss.\n\n8. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10706 [70] A Mysterious Portent\n9. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10707 [70] The Ata'mal Terrace\n10. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10708 [70] Akama's Promise\n\nAfter you finish this chain, you get to pick from some rewards and the chain seems like it ends. It continues however, inside Serpentshrine Cavern (http://www.wowhead.com/?zone=3607) from an NPC called Seer Olum (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22820) who you can speak with after killing Fathom-Lord Karathress. He starts the next part of the Black Temple Chain by offering the quest:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10944 [70] The Secret Compromised\nFor this quest you just return to Akama.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10946 [70] Ruse of the Ashtongue\nIn this quest, you must use the costume Akama provides, and kill A'lar in Tempest Keep: The Eye while wearing the Ashtongue Cowl. Attunement for The Eye is a whole different chain.\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10947 [70] An Artifact From the Past\nIn this, you need to gain access to The Battle of Mount Hyjal in Caverns of Time, and slay the first boss, Rage Winterchill. Attunement for this involves killing Lady Vashj and Kael'Thas Sunstrider.\n4. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10948 [70] The Hostage Soul\nFor this you must speak with A'dal in Shattrath city.\n5. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10949 [70] Entry into the Black Temple\nFor this, just speak with the naaru Xi'ri in front of Black Temple.\n6. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10985 [70] A Distraction for Akama\nUnknown what this quest asks of you, most likely you need to defend Xi'ri and make your way into Black Temple. At the end, you become attuned to enter and are granted The Medallion of Karabor (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=32649)\n\nAt this point, you are attuned and can enter Black Temple, although the chain continues and you can soon upgrade your medallion. It continues with:\n\n1. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10958 [70] Seek Out the Ashtongue\nYou just need to find Seer Kanai (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23158) inside Black Temple.\n2. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10957 [70] Redemption of the Ashtongue\nThis involves entering Black Temple, and killing the boss the Shade of Akama (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22841).\n3. http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10959 [70] The Fall of the Betrayer\nAfter killing the Shade of Akama and returning to Seer Kanai, he asks one last thing of you. Kill Illidan The Betrayer. After doing so, you are granted the Blessed Medallion of Karabor, an upgraded version of your original medallion, and allows teleportation to the Black Temple.",
            date = "2007-06-05T18:23:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10948#comments:id=98891",
        },
        {
            id = 1530122,
            score = 8,
            author = "448060",
            text = "This particular quest in the line is a waste of time. You have to travel to Shat'rath for A'dal to do his mind trick \"I'm not the naaru you are looking for, go back to where you just were.\"\nMandatory but pointless and lame.",
            date = "2011-09-28T15:16:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10948#comments:id=1530122",
        },
        {
            id = 1074667,
            score = 6,
            author = "294849",
            text = "Even though i have completed the questline Wowhead shows this as not completed. Anyone know why (I'm Scryer)\nDlavroth",
            date = "2010-07-06T16:24:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10948#comments:id=1074667",
        },
        {
            id = 1924308,
            score = 3,
            author = "warslayerxxx",
            text = "the rewards from becoming exalted with Ashtongue Deathsworn faction is awesome. they are trinkets which are quiet good.",
            date = "2013-12-07T22:06:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10948#comments:id=1924308",
        },
        {
            id = 2124912,
            score = 1,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "If you feel lost and unsure where you are in the chain, use the following copy-paste scripts:\n\n[faction=932]\n/run local y={568,571,574,575,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Aldor:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\n[faction=934]\n/run local y={683,684,685,686,622,628,705,706,707,708,944,946,947,948,949,985,958,957,959}print\"The Scryers:\"for i,q in ipairs(y)do q=\"10\"..q print(i,\"\\124cffffff00\\124Hquest:\"..q..\"\\124h[\"..q..\"]\\124h\\124r\",IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(q)and YES or NO)end\n\nSimply copy the script and paste in chat. You'll find a lot of text saying Yes/No for each quest in the chain, chronologically. Find the quest that isn't completed and look that up on Wowhead to proceed.\n\nHave fun obtaining your https://www.wowhead.com/item=32757",
            date = "2015-02-27T10:42:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10948#comments:id=2124912",
        },
    },
    [10949] = {
