        {
            id = 995050,
            score = 17,
            author = "504286",
            text = "I also noticed the great rep for this...\n\n[Player]:\"Yeah Danath, I just killed the bane of all of hellfire, had to survive the horrors of all before him and then had to roll on this with 24 other hero's, but I finally got his head! The bane of hellfire and creator of all fel-orcs is no more thanks to me!\"\n[Danath Trollbane]: \"Yeah thanks for that, here take a weird (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28793) silly (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28791) ring (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28790)-thingy (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=28792) from this box and some rep...\"\n[Player]: But I killed Magtheridon, reagent for all fel-orcs! I faced the horrors before him and his befouled lair, had to survive the befouled instance cooldowns and now I finally have Magtheridons head and I only get a @#$%ty 1000 rep!\nWhat's up with that?\"\n[Dargath Trollbane]: Hey, do you see that hobo over there? He just keeps on killing that same fel orc at the side of the instance door, but we love him because of that.\n[Dargath Trollbane]: Hey Hobo! Come over here and buy this big halberd-thingy (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=29166) so you can kill that fel orc faster! We love you!\"\n\nriiiiiiiight >.> well it's just grinding for me then...",
            date = "2010-03-10T14:59:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11002#comments:id=995050",
        },
        {
            id = 470992,
            score = 4,
            author = "Crimsonlord",
            text = "When you hand in this quest he yells:\n\n\"The fest of corruption is no more! Magtheridon has fallen to the prowess of  and his allies! Witness the might of the Alliance! A pit lord commander is destroyed!\"\n\n\"Hear me brothers and sisters-in-arms! The time of our enemies is at an end! We must strike at the fel orcs remain! Exterminate them like the vermin that they are! Carry with you the favor of the Sons of Lothar!\"",
            date = "2008-11-26T03:41:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11002#comments:id=470992",
        },
