            author = "4797",
            text = "29,57 to turn in the quest",
            date = "2007-05-22T22:17:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11009#comments:id=87748",
        },
        {
            id = 697371,
            score = 8,
            author = "293216",
            text = "Don't forget to pick up \"Speak with Mog`dorg\" from one of the supplicants before getting this quest.  I had my low level quest tracker turned off since I went linkdead during the last fight and before I could get to him they all disappeared, including the quest giver.  The supplicants will appear on the ground after turning in \"Into the Soul Grinder\" but you would not know this if you just accept \"Ogre Heaven\" since I think this made them vanish.  I hope to get this again when another player completes his quest line.",
            date = "2009-04-28T09:30:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11009#comments:id=697371",
        },
        {
            id = 6283507,
