            date = "2026-02-15T08:49:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11009#comments:id=6283507",
        },
    },
    [11010] = {
        {
            id = 512624,
            score = 173,
            author = "263298",
            text = "Ok, i haven't seen a single comment on here telling you how exactly to get this particular quest so I am going to tell you.\n\nStart with :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10984  (Found at 65,68 in Shattrath Lower City)\n\nOnce you speak with that Ogre you will go do this quest :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10983 (Found at 55,44 in Blades Edge Mountains)\n\nThis ogre will give you 3 quests at first.  Do all of these quests :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10995 (Found at 61, 47 in Blades Edge Mountains)\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10996 (Found Patrolling around http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=20600)\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10997 (From the Terrokar Map Coords are 12, 18, just north west above Shattrath (Flying mount NEEDED to get here)\n\nThese 3 quests you do NOT have to be IN the group that killed the elites to loot the skulls or other items they drop.\n\nAfter you finish those three quests you will go back to Mog'dorg the Wizened and turn them in.\n\nHe will then give you another quest :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=10998 (Map location of the casting circle http://www.wowhead.com/?maps=3522:779310)\n\nGo back to Mog'dorg and turn in that quest and he will give you another quest :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11000 (Map location - http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=22910)\n\nDo that quest, turn it in, and then he will tell you to go to Ogri'la with this quest :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11009\n\nOnce you get to Ogri'la do these quests (found at the NPC you turn in the previous quest to)\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11025 \\\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11058  -  See each quest for more info on how to do them.\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11080 /\n\nOnce you finish those 3 quests you have to do a quest from an NPC in that circle called \"Torkus\" (can be found at http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23316)\n\nDo his quest called \"Our Boy Wants To Be A Skyguard Ranger\" :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11030\n\nOnce you finish that quest you can go back to Chu'a'lor (the first NPC you got quests from in Ogri'la) and he will ask you to a quest called \"The Skyguard Outpost\"\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11062\n\nUpon completion of that quest you can finally get \"Bombing Run\" :\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11010\n\nHope this helps you guys, because I spent forever trying to do this stupid quest and people had me goin all over the place!  Good luck!",
            date = "2008-12-15T20:28:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11010#comments:id=512624",
        },
        {
            id = 131825,
            score = 30,
            author = "31053",
            text = "In order to unlock this quest, you must complete ALL the Ogri'la quests up until Relic's Emanation. You also must complete the quests, 'Our Boy Wants to be a Skyguard Ranger' and 'A Father's Duty'. When you finish that quest line, the Bombing Run quest will open up.",
            date = "2007-08-03T17:15:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11010#comments:id=131825",
        },
        {
            id = 89105,
            score = 22,
            author = "42324",
            text = "Doable in Flight Form as well, so don't despair you druids without a wyvern/gryphon.",
            date = "2007-05-24T03:32:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11010#comments:id=89105",
        },
        {
            id = 88554,
            score = 21,
            author = "54666",
            text = "A tip for completing this quest easily:\n\nKEEP MOVING! Only stop when your bomb is off cooldown, and stop for as little time as possible to drop the bomb, then keep flying. I did this and the follow up with a 60% speed flying mount, and didnt get hit by the flak once.",
            date = "2007-05-23T14:38:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11010#comments:id=88554",
        },
        {
            id = 5893659,
            score = 17,
            author = "mateymcmatey",
            text = "For anyone dumb like me, the cannons aren't the actual target, it is the round circle thing next to the cannons that make them explode.  I kept flying in, dropping bombs, no kill... target the circle things next to the cannons.   Fly down - target and drop - fly up ...15 times...  done.",
            date = "2024-07-08T08:17:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11010#comments:id=5893659",
        },
    },
    [11012] = {
        {
