            text = "After the change of riding (flying) skills available.\n\nDid https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10870 on my Expert skill (slow flying) but the quest line stopped here, and could not pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11012 until I spent the 4000g (exalted discount) on the next rank, Master Riding.",
