        {
            id = 92554,
            score = 50,
            author = "40383",
            text = "Basically you open the portal with the gem (which requires an Apexis Shard) near the demons. Then you have to kill the demons near the portal.",
            date = "2007-05-28T15:05:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11026#comments:id=92554",
        },
        {
            id = 99379,
            score = 20,
            author = "Woetoo",
            text = "The portals last 3 minutes.\n\nYou don't have to open one per mob, just open one and keep pulling mobs back to it.",
            date = "2007-06-06T10:18:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11026#comments:id=99379",
        },
        {
            id = 385161,
            score = 13,
            author = "stoppableforce",
            text = "Check out the Ogri'la faction page (http://www.wowhead.com/?faction=1038), which has links to their quests and daily quests. Ogri'la and the Sha'tari Skyguard share dailies in that area; right now I've gotten to honored by doing a combination of dailies:\n\nThe Relic's Emanation (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11080) and its one-time intro quest, An Apexis Relic (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11058)\nWrangle More Aether Rays! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11066) and its one-time intro quest, Wrangle Some Aether Rays! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11065)\nBomb Them Again! (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11023) and its one-time intro quest, Bombing Run (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11010)\n\nAnd some of the non-repeatable quests:\n\nOgre Heaven (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11009)\nThe Crystals (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11025)\nOur Boy Wants To Be a Skyguard Ranger (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11030)\nA Father's Duty (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11061)\nA Special Thank You (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11091)\n\nIt only takes a few days to get to honored with Ogri'la this way (and you'll be grinding a decent amount of rep with the Skyguard as well), at which point this quest (and its daily followup (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11051)) become available. You can speed this process up with some of the 5-person group quests for the area, such as Guardian of the Monument (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11059), To Rule the Skies (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11078),  and A Fel Whip for Gahk (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11079), but I haven't found it really necessary.",
            date = "2008-09-23T08:49:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11026#comments:id=385161",
        },
        {
            id = 105349,
            score = 11,
            author = "alexiel",
            text = "Leads to http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11051",
            date = "2007-06-16T08:47:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11026#comments:id=105349",
        },
    },
