            text = "This quest, like the other breadcrumb quest offered by Seer Jovar (Visions of Destruction (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=11044)), appears to count towards the Nagrand Slam achievement, but is bugged to lose credit upon logout!\nI managed to reach 72/75 easy enough.  Completing this advanced the counter to 73, but upon logging out and logging in the next day, it was back to 72.  Visions of Destruction did the same thing.  Be careful!",
