            text = "This NPC is located at co-ordinates 39.5, 53.7\n\nFor those without co ordinates, from Allerian Stronghold (57.8,54.5) head north-east past Bonechewer Ruins, until you get to the path that leads to Shadowmoon Valley. From there, follow the path south-east until you reach Wildhammer Stronghold. You will see him just outside the main gate, off to the left side.",
