    [11049] = {
        {
            id = 353983,
            score = 72,
            author = "31843",
            text = "Here's a link to a video I've found pretty useful. It shows the most common spawn points for the eggs.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2rumkxSmhrQ (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2rumkxSmhrQ)",
            date = "2008-08-15T19:17:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11049#comments:id=353983",
        },
        {
            id = 1067856,
            score = 56,
            author = "277424",
            text = "The easyest way to spot it is because theres a column of gray smoke coming out of it!",
            date = "2010-06-28T10:20:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11049#comments:id=1067856",
        },
        {
            id = 97691,
            score = 50,
            author = "58191",
            text = "These seem to spawn at certain locations, though I am not sure how long the respawn time is. I've seen one respawn behind the two elite drakes near the 'dock' where Netherwing Transporters land and fly off from, and it respawned in the same exact place. However, getting it required one person distracting the drakes because it was too close to them to open up without aggroing.\n\nI've also seen them drop off the Nethermine Flayers more than once, though it's rather rare most of the time. I have also seen some spawn at different places in the cave, but finding them is tough since the mines are so camped most of the time.\n\nSome other things to note:\n\n1. Like Sasquatchiii said, if you're grouped you roll need/greed on the eggs if you come across one on a mob or 'open' a spawned egg up.\n\n2. They DO stack, I think either to 10 or 20 per stack, but not sure because I only have 5 at the moment.\n\n3. You only get the gold reward once on the FIRST turn in, and any eggs turned in after that just net you 250 rep.\n\n4. You can turn in as many as you like in one day as the quest to turn them in IS NOT considered a daily quest.\n\n5. A spawned egg is considered to be like a treasure chest in that you CANNOT open it up if you're in combat. You have to be OUT of combat to open it up and get the egg.",
            date = "2007-06-03T23:56:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11049#comments:id=97691",
        },
        {
            id = 3217808,
            score = 25,
            author = "bdun4",
            text = "This quest is NOT part of the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1195. As I saw it on the Shadowmoon Valley story (https://www.wowhead.com/storyline/shadowmoon-valley-493#quest) page and was able to get the achievement without needing it done.",
            date = "2020-07-16T22:16:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11049#comments:id=3217808",
        },
        {
            id = 98856,
            score = 22,
            author = "Gargon",
            text = "They can drop off any mob on the Netherwing Ledge.\n\nThe best place for finding eggs on the ground is deep in the mines, and check the slime/worm area every so often theres a good chance of spotting them, always keep an eye out for eggs, if you are in an area with other players that if you arent looking for the eggs they will get it before you",
            date = "2007-06-05T17:29:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11049#comments:id=98856",
        },
    },
    [11050] = {
        {
            id = 255586,
            score = 62,
            author = "108727",
            text = "These eggs are hard enough to find already. If Blizzard added a gold reward to those who are already exalted, the countless amount of people with netherdrakes farming for eggs would make it downright impossible for those who are still grinding netherwing rep.\n\nThis is why, at exalted, you shouldn't be able to loot them anymore. You already have your ultimate reward. You're exalted, and you have other dailies you can do if you really need the money. Nobody farms the eggs for money, they're doing it for rep.\n\nBlizzard needs to change this so that it's no longer lootable at exalted. The respawn timer as it is now is ridiculous when exalted people farm eggs for no other reason than hoping for gold or just to spite lower levels.",
            date = "2008-03-19T00:03:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11050#comments:id=255586",
        },
        {
            id = 227839,
            score = 48,
            author = "31971",
            text = "Once you hit exalted you will still be able to loot eggs and deliver them to Yarzill, you will however not get any kind of reward for it, no money, no rep, no nothing.\n\nYou'd best just post in general that you've found an egg and you don't need it. Let someone who's still doing the rep grind loot it, it's only fair.\n\nIf you ask me, blizzard should make it so exalted people cannot get this quest anymore and cannot loot any more eggs either.",
            date = "2008-02-01T12:50:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11050#comments:id=227839",
        },
        {
            id = 790488,
            score = 29,
            author = "432728",
            text = "A very helpful website I found gave the coordinates for every nether egg spawn point. Here are the coords, and the website is at the bottom:\n\nInside Mine\n68, 85 (in mine)\n74, 87 (in mine)\n72, 88 (in mine)\n64, 86 (Entrance of mine)\n74, 88 (Near crazed guys)\n69, 88 (bottom of ramps in big room)\n64, 87 (mine entrance, right by a box)\n75, 86 (in mine, flayer area, back in cove)\n71, 80 (in mine, by flayers)\n66, 82 (in mine, by waterwheel)\n\nNetherwing Ledge\n66, 91 (edge of shelf, behind crystals)\n68, 94 (on island on south of shelf)\n65, 84 (right in camp, by racers)\n68, 81 (on top of hill)\n78, 83 (side of cliff, down in a little crevace)\n66, 91 (don't remember, first egg I found)\n65, 84 (on top of crystal)\n71, 86 (on top of mountain, by den mother)\n77, 85 (on top of mountain)\n63, 82 (on ground, beneath crystal)\n\nDragonmaw Camp on Mainland:\n69, 63 (top of building)\n70, 62 (upper level of zuluhed's building)\n68, 59 (up in tower by dragon rider)\n67, 61 (wagon in mainland camp)\n\nI did not come up with these, Wowtips (http://wow-tips.blogspot.com/2007/08/netherwing-egg-hunting-for-quick-rep.html) did.",
            date = "2009-07-27T18:03:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11050#comments:id=790488",
        },
        {
            id = 1429068,
            score = 22,
            author = "717646",
            text = "Hello.. my name is Beefhunter. I'm a Level 85 Tauren Hunter... and I'm a Netherwing Eggaholic.\nI have dreams.. of seeing Netherwing Eggs everywhere I look, yet they aren't there.",
            date = "2011-05-28T02:10:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11050#comments:id=1429068",
        },
        {
            id = 89855,
