            text = "Once you finish \"The Great Netherwing Egg Hunt\" quest (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11049) turning in one Netherwing Egg, you can get this quest, which allows you to turn in more eggs for increesing reputation with Netherwing faction.\n\nThe quest giver can be found at loc 66,86 Shadowmoon Valley, Dragonmaw Base Camp.",
            date = "2007-05-24T20:39:32-05:00",
