            text = "There can be a lot of kill-stealing and general aggressiveness when it comes to bagging a Ravager for the quest. I'd be all for them upping the respawn timer on the ravagers, or just having more pats overall. This quest would be pretty simple, and fast, if those changes were made...and you wouldn't see /rudes being thrown around so much, either.",
