        {
            id = 129048,
            score = 57,
            author = "Vlad",
            text = "He casts this spell when he is \"giving\" the hand :P\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/?spell=41121",
            date = "2007-07-30T06:09:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11082#comments:id=129048",
        },
        {
            id = 531941,
            score = 19,
            author = "greenskye",
            text = "Since this was not immediately apparent to me, thought I'd share.\n\nYou need to talk to the Murkblood Foreman that's near the Flayers (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23169). This is not the same as the Crazed Murkblood Foreman (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=23305) that is farther down in the mine with the other Murkbloods. As other's have said the one you want to talk to can be found in the offshoots off the main path. They aren't really that visible so you may have to get a bit further in to see him.",
            date = "2008-12-26T22:19:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11082#comments:id=531941",
        },
        {
            id = 2164287,
            score = 10,
            author = "1429829",
            text = "Just a tip - In the mines, you don't have to do all the backtracking necessary to get up to the area on the left with all the baddies. On the left after you enter the mines, you'll noticed a fenced area atop a rise. You can jump up the right side of the support there. It might take a few tries, but will save you a ton of time.",
