            text = "Think you need to be friendly with netherwing to get this quest.\nYou get it deep down in the netherwing ledge cave close to a flying dragon Toranku, from the orc Ronag the Slave Driver.\n\nTo get to the quest npc's you'll have to backtrack and get up on the first small bridge there is. Then just head on while  taking every right turn you can that isnt a dead end. ( if you pass through flayer's you're in the right direction).",
