        },
        {
            id = 82208,
            score = 30,
            author = "43225",
            text = "The ogres are north of the Aldor rise in Shattrah City where all the mana thistle and other herbs are. Primarily only available to someone with a flying mount, unless you can get a summon.\nWatch out for the elite summoner who paths there.",
