        },
        {
            id = 95909,
            score = 1,
            author = "Vindicator",
            text = "Arcus is inside the aldor base by the mail box. Speak to him and give him the flare, once you do he will start the quest.\n\nBasically you just have to make sure he lives through the waves of dragonmaw skybreaker's (you get help from 8 other non-elite npc's and himself) and after a while he will say that the aldor are victorious. (Quest completed)\n\nIf you die in the middle of the event, the graveyard is about 4 steps away from the event, just protected Arcus.",
            date = "2007-06-02T10:31:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11100#comments:id=95909",
        },
        {
            id = 251561,
