            author = "136008",
            text = "Solo it with pvp gear on my enhancement shaman, could even bandage when I was oom.\n\nAnd the graveyard is only a step away if one would die",
            date = "2008-03-11T05:35:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11100#comments:id=251561",
        },
        {
            id = 373761,
