        {
            id = 1163423,
            score = 16,
            author = "182693",
            text = "Be warned that the trip back to Shatt at the end of this chain was excruciatingly slow (15 minutes!+).  That may be a bug working off the back of the OTHER bug (where you auto-insta-mount while on the ledge), but it felt like I was on the back of a walking goblin instead of a drake/dragon.",
