        {
            id = 1525760,
            score = 2,
            author = "StansDad",
            text = "\"This quest is no longer available within the game\"\n\nNot true.\nI got this quest just today, so it is clearly still \"available\".\nWhether it is completable however, is another question. Having got as far as taking out the first boss I had not encountered any of the Tempest-Forge Destroyers required before I had to log out.\n\n*update* Completed, very easy at level 85 (look out for mobs that spawn directly in front of you on the path to the final boss on the upper level). The lack of Destroyers in my first run was, it transpires, because I had failed to change the instance setting to Heroic mode.\nBear in mind that it is necessary to kill the first boss before you can gain access to the upper level.\n\nThe map given by the quest is confusing though, as has been mentioned, as it is not in fact a map of The Mechanar.",
