            author = "19211",
            text = "The scryer version is \"Duty Calls\".\n\n (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=11482)",
            date = "2008-03-27T13:50:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11481#comments:id=261182",
        },
        {
            id = 1538843,
            score = 7,
            author = "893158",
            text = "How do you get to the quest as I cannot fly/swim to the island?",
            date = "2011-10-09T10:25:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11481#comments:id=1538843",
        },
        {
            id = 2331311,
            score = 5,
            author = "pellmell",
            text = "You can actually complete both this quest and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11482 if you want to.\n\nHere's what you need:\n1) You must not already be committed to either [faction=932] or [faction=934].\n2) Avoid completing or picking up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29682.\n3) Talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18166 and click to accept each quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10551 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10552, as if you are going to complete them, but back out before doing so. Something about doing this seems to activate your eligibility for the quest from each faction.\n4) Accept one of the quests from either https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18537 or https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18594 and complete it by talking to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=24813 on [zone=4080]. (Do not pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29682!)\n5) Return to the other questgiver and accept and complete the second quest.\n\nI'm not sure what you gain additionally other than a small amount of experience and an extra bit of rep with [faction=1077], but there you go.",
            date = "2016-05-16T00:07:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11481#comments:id=2331311",
        },
        {
            id = 303156,
