            text = "As the quest text states, you will need a Bash'ir Phasing Device (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=34248) in order to see the hidden mana cells. Just start killing the ethereal in the area until one drops.\n\nOnce you are phased, there doesn't seem to be a time limit. You'll be able to see the mana cells but you will also be vulnerable to Phase Wyrms (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=24917).",
            date = "2008-03-03T18:10:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11514#comments:id=247508",
