            author = "jzkalika",
            text = "Before you can \"energize\" a crystal ward, you have to kill the \"Wretched\" to get their mana remnants. They Wretched are not within the quest highlighted area on the map, they're around the area of the map that says \"Dawnstar Village\". They look kind of like undeads.\n\nAfter you get 4 mana remnants in your inventory, go back to the quest highlighted area on the map and find a large red crystal. Stand near one, right click the mana remnants and you're done!",
