            author = "55557",
            text = "On PTR this quest is obtained from: General Tiras'alan (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=25167) (located beside Adal)\n\nwiki: This is the introduction quest to the Shattered Sun Offensive and the Isle of Quel'Danas. If you accept this quest you will automatically learn the Sun's Reach Harbor flight path from Hatchet Hills (FP outside the entrance to ZA -- Ghostlands) and Silvermoon City.\n\nGold gains: 1g 89s @ lvl 70.",
