    [11556] = {
        {
            id = 298585,
            score = 8,
            author = "Slash",
            text = "It is best to pick the Aldor Supplies package (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=34592) regardless of faction. Due to the massive amounts of players actively farming mobs in the Isle of Quel'Danas, the price of Scryer turn-ins (Arcane Tomes (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=29739) and Sunfury Signets (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30810)) has dropped sharply on nearly every server.The Fel Armaments (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=29740) and Marks of Sargeras (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=30809) can be sold in the Auction House for almost double what their Scryer counterparts sell for, and the money can be spent to buy more Scryer items than you would've gotten in the Scryer Supplies Package (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=34593).\n\nEither way, you still get several potions, scrolls, and foodstuffs.",
