        {
            id = 596258,
            score = 3,
            author = "244023",
            text = "All a player has to do to capture a point regardless of status\nis turn PVP on and sit there whlie the status bar glacially moves from blue to grey to red\nthis also works on the towers in the Plagelangs when getting the quest from the argent dawn\n\nThe downside is the risk that someone will jump you while you wait.\n\nI have rarely gotten attacked I believe Blizzard expected a war over these they should make the rewards bigger if they expect big battles at these sites",
            date = "2009-02-05T06:31:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13411#comments:id=596258",
