    [13429] = {
        {
            id = 1903101,
            score = 41,
            author = "Urbanspacesquid",
            text = "The quest is working now but I was sure it was broken because of the way it's scripted. The event's a really cool one but overdoes it a bit on dramatic pauses. If you're doing it and nothing much seems to happen, just wait some more.\n\nAfter you talk to X'iri nothing happens for a bit, then after a while he gives you the buff thing. X'iri's forces run in and fight, and this goes on for quite some time (you'll see reinforcements running up the road from the Aldor and Scryer FPs). Most of the fighting is done by these guys. Vargath and his mates will spawn and stand around being ugly.\n\nSometime after that - they really do take AGES - Akama and Maiev will show up. I suspect they've /walked all the way from the warden's cage.\n\nIt's easiest just to hang with X'iri and wait, then when you see Akama and co. wandering up from the main road, stick with them. Akama engages in some fighting but not a lot. Just watch the dialogue and emotes and follow him to the crack in the wall. The quest completes as he goes inside. You don't need to go with him, just go back to X'iri to hand in and get your Medallion of Karabor.",
            date = "2013-09-26T19:35:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13429#comments:id=1903101",
        },
        {
            id = 2867514,
            score = 10,
            author = "Aethasis",
            text = "It seemed like Maiev and Akama weren't showing up, but after the initial battle, I ran back to Xiri and eventually the Deathsworn showed up. I followed them and saw Akama enter the temple.",
            date = "2019-01-22T14:17:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13429#comments:id=2867514",
        },
        {
            id = 1983389,
            score = 6,
            author = "Neutralagent",
            text = "If you are on the green fire questline [quest=32325 domain=www] the area will be phased, however if you stand by the quest giver for about 10 minutes the NPCs should eventually make it to where they need to and give you credit.",
            date = "2014-07-22T22:13:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13429#comments:id=1983389",
        },
        {
            id = 864222,
            score = 5,
            author = "138194",
            text = "I've had the quest for Hyjal attunement (the vials) in my log since TBC, but only recently picked up the continuation quest for the BT attunement in SSC. Even so, I still obtained the Hand of A'dal title after completing these quests just now.\n\nSo if you, like me, never did SSC and didn't get to pick up the BT questline, but still have the vials quest in your log, you might be able to pick up your title after all :)",
            date = "2009-10-11T08:24:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13429#comments:id=864222",
        },
        {
            id = 1639314,
