        {
            id = 1875325,
            score = 5,
            author = "1020729",
            text = "I felt awful..I killed a Corrupted bear who was wandering with a cub....As i attacked, the cub ran away and as the mother died the cub just turned around to face me and sat down. I waited for it to cry or something. >.<\nAnd I've gone and killed 8 so far, and all I'm getting is pelts :S",
