            text = "Just for anyone looking to do this quest in recent times. I just did it at level 48 and had no prerequisite. Rode straight down to Brolg and did his 3 VERY simple and fast quests and the 4th one \"The Defiler\" rewards the bow etc.",
            date = "2014-05-11T19:30:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13546#comments:id=1964712",
        },
