            text = "One is lying on the floor at the entrance of the Inn (the building right in front of Yalda).\nAnother is lying on the broken wooden dock to Yalda's left.\nSentinal Elissa is lying on the floor of the building down the hill northeast of Yalda (you'll see Cloudtamer Wildmane on the second floor of the building).\nThundris Windweaver is lying on the floor of the building north of Yalda, across the river (Thundris is lying in front of Skylord Braax).",
