    [13558] = {
        {
            id = 1204704,
            score = 26,
            author = "jerodast",
            text = "Just wanted to note, after I clicked the orb and watched the dialogue, Aetherion despawned and I had to try again. I had backed away from the orb so maybe it glitched the encounter. When I did it again I stayed next to the orb and it was fine.",
            date = "2010-12-03T17:33:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13558#comments:id=1204704",
        },
        {
            id = 1203536,
            score = 11,
            author = "196807",
            text = "When you click on the orb, if Aetherion isn't already floating above the orb, he is summoned into the world above the orb. The spirits (wisps) of the 4 night elves that you have rescued in the quest before this along with Yalda's spirit appears around him.\n\nAetherion yells: YOU DARE? TODAY WILL SEE THE END OF LOR'DANEL, MALFURION, AND YOU!\nYalda's Spirit yells: No, Aetherion, we will not allow that to happen!\nAetherion yells: WHAT IS THIS? YALDA? AHAHAHAHAHA, THERE IS NOTHING THAT YOU OR THESE OTHER SPIRITS CAN DO TO STOP ME!\nYalda's Spirit yells: We shall see. Let us weaken him, my friends!\nAetherion yells: EVEN IN THIS WEAKENED FORM, I WILL DESTROY YOU!\n\nThe 5 wisps detonate on Aetherion (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=33041) (325 hp) and transforms him into Weakened Aetherion (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=33042) (650 hp, yes don't ask me why that is more hp than his unweakened form) and he lands on the docks. He doesn't yell anymore after that as you kill him.\n\n------------\nWhen the quests's event script isn't active, Aetherion sometimes yells random stuff:\n\nAetherion yells: YOU MORTALS ARE MADE OF THE STUFF OF THE ELEMENTS. HOW CAN YOU POSSIBLY HOPE TO PREVAIL? PREPARE TO RETURN TO YOUR TRUER, MORE BASIC NATURES!\nAetherion yells: THERE IS BUT ONE OUTCOME POSSIBLE. THE CATACLYSM WAS ONLY THE BEGINNING. THE WORLD AS YOU KNOW IT IS AT AN END\nAetherion yells: I HAVE ALMOST ARRIVED. TWILIGHT'S HAMMER, DO NOT RUSH THE SUMMONING OR I WILL DESTROY YOU AS WELL!\nAetherion yells: MALFURION, CAN YOU HEAR ME? WHEN I HAVE DESTROYED THE CHILDREN OF ELUNE, I WILL COME AND PUT AN END TO YOU!\nAetherion yells: PATIENCE! THE RITUAL TO BRING ME INTO THIS WORLD IS COMPLEX AND MUST NOT BE RUSHED!\n\nThere's probably more lines.",
            date = "2010-12-03T05:53:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13558#comments:id=1203536",
        },
        {
            id = 1220411,
            score = 7,
            author = "brynne660",
            text = "FaaR is right.  Stay in the rune circle after activating the orb & and you will have no problems.",
            date = "2010-12-10T00:50:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13558#comments:id=1220411",
        },
        {
            id = 1766136,
            score = 4,
            author = "178821",
            text = "Wasn't bugged for me, it is just has a real fussy sequence.  The first time, I blew it, by stepping out of the purple ring.  So here is what I did -\n\n1. Dropped the quest, and reacquired.\n2. Set my pet to passive (I am a hunter).\n3. Went back to the purple ring, and clicked on the floating orb.\n4. Chilled for a bit, while the whole sequence played out.  The 4 spirits have to interact with Aetherion, and since they're dead they're a bit slow.  So be patient.  Eventually, they will suck the go-juice out of Aetherion, and he will drop from elite to normal.\n5. Don't attack him yet!  Especially if you are RDPS, the temptation is to start wailing on him.  But don't. Wait until he floats down to you, and gets on the dock, in melee range.  Again, be patient.  Expect to take a little bit of damage.  Why?  Because if you kill him while he is still in the air, you will not be able to loot him.\n6.  He's on the dock pummeling you?  Okay, now it's time to do what you do best.  Kill!  Kill!  Kill!\n7.  Loot.  Done.  Epic win.",
            date = "2012-11-22T06:01:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13558#comments:id=1766136",
        },
        {
            id = 1906132,
            score = 4,
            author = "CallMeNoa",
            text = "In Warcraft 3, Wisps had a spell called Detonate that harmed summoned units. That's why they're able to hurt Aetherion, because he was summoned.",
            date = "2013-10-06T13:35:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13558#comments:id=1906132",
        },
    },
