            text = "Don't be surprised if the \"complete quest\" screen gets stuck and the next quest does not come up.  not sure if its because I am trying to complete it as a higher level character.",
            date = "2010-11-27T21:19:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13639#comments:id=1191634",
        },
        {
            id = 1209107,
            score = 3,
