            text = "Something that confused me a bit doing this quest...\n\nIf you go into the excavation, find the Upturned Giant, the Overdressed Woman, and the Broken Tablet, and make sure they're still intact.\n\nRather odd, wouldn't you say?",
            date = "2011-08-03T14:18:56-05:00",
