            score = 38,
            author = "463230",
            text = "Just to make things easier, I gathered up all of the coordinates in one place.\n\nExplorers' League Document (1 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13656) - 37.0, 61.3\nExplorers' League Document (2 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13655) - 41.4, 39.0\nExplorers' League Document (3 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657) - 61.7, 73.2\nExplorers' League Document (4 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13658) - 68.1, 66.1\nExplorers' League Document (5 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13660) - 53.7, 38.1\nExplorers' League Document (6 of 6) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13659) - 73.2, 35.9\n\nAfter finding all 6 and turning in the quests, your reward is: Heartfelt Appreciation (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13661).",
            date = "2010-11-27T04:16:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13656#comments:id=1189552",
        },
    },
    [13657] = {
        {
            id = 1442972,
            score = 30,
            author = "CleonanTehGnome",
            text = "Parts 1 through 6 guide (I'll post it on all quests)\nThe objective of each quest is to speak with a NPC in Thelsamar, Loch Modan.\nEach quest is acquired from a scroll object laying on the ground.\n\nPart l:\nLocation: (36.8, 61.2)\nDescription: Inside a cave, up the mountain south of Thelsamar, next to both a campfire https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33456 (Objective of https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13648)\n\nPart ll:\nLocation: (41.3, 39.1)\nDescription: Inside the Central-East area of the crater where \"The Loch\" used to be. You will see a dwarven in-ground house entrance with a fishing trainer and a half-buried dock in the sand. The scroll will be slightly under the right side of the dock (Looking away from the house), next to one of its small support pillars.\n\nPart lll:\nLocation: (61.6, 73.1)\nDescription: At the bottom of a crate, to the left of a cave entrance which occasionally houses a rare spider: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14266.\n\nPart lV:\nLocation: (68.1, 66.0)\nDescription: This scroll is towards the center of Ironband's Excavation Site. To know if you're on the right track if you stumble upon a wooden plank path. At the end of that path, to the left, will be the quest.\nNOTE: This is not near the quest givers, it is behind the huge green wall.\n\nPart V:\nLocation: (53.7, 38.2)\nDescription: If you look at your Loch Modan map, towards the center of the dried up lake, there is a somewhat large patch of water. In the upper right area of that general region, near most likely to be the largest tree, will be the scroll.\n\nPart Vl:\nLocation: (73.1, 35.9)\nDescription: Directly south of Mo'Grosh Stronghold, there is a troll statue near the first line of trees, will be part 6 of the quest.\n\nThe Final Part:\nAfter completing ALL SIX of the scroll quests, you will be offered one final quest entitled \"Heartfelt Appreciation\" which still entails you talking to the same NPC as always, but gives a bit more EXP than the other six.\n\nGood luck!\n(Rate up!)",
            date = "2011-06-16T21:41:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657#comments:id=1442972",
        },
        {
            id = 1191748,
            score = 29,
            author = "Malgayne",
            text = "Here's a link to a map, showing all the locations of the different scrolls.\n\nhttp://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=38:370613414390617732681661537381732359",
            date = "2010-11-27T22:18:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657#comments:id=1191748",
        },
        {
            id = 1195426,
            score = 18,
            author = "Illinger",
            text = "Also, a couple good things to point out...\nAll the others are in the general area of other quests, but nothing that I've seen out there leading to this one.\nAnd, the crate that this is next to is out front of a cave, wherein resides a 18 epic (rare) spider.\nAgain, no quest related to it, just there to jump you if you're low enough level and not looking.\n\nCheers",
            date = "2010-11-29T10:29:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657#comments:id=1195426",
        },
        {
            id = 1190581,
            score = 15,
            author = "286335",
            text = "To help you out a bit more, if you have Tom Tom addon, make a macro and copy/paste this into it\n\n/way Loch Modan 36.8 61.2\n/way Loch Modan 41 38\n/way Loch Modan 61.6 73.1\n/way Loch Modan 68.1 66\n/way Loch Modan 53.6 38.1\n/way Loch Modan 73.2 36\n\nThat will mark up your map and get you there pretty quickly.\n\nAnd if you don't have Tom Tom, here's a map (http://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=38:369613410382615730689660536382733361)",
            date = "2010-11-27T13:42:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657#comments:id=1190581",
        },
        {
            id = 1185059,
            score = 12,
            author = "DeadMAX",
            text = "If you find all 6 documents you will receive this quest http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13661.",
            date = "2010-11-25T14:14:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13657#comments:id=1185059",
        },
    },
