            author = "756183",
            text = "She is hidden in a small house that has metal fences for walls.  Once you leave the place you get the quest.  Leave through the wooden gate and turn right.  Go forward  for a few seconds and on your right you will see the house.\n\nShe ended up leaping to attack me.  You don't have to kill night elves to get to her.",
            date = "2011-01-05T10:38:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13871#comments:id=1278620",
        },
        {
            id = 3169924,
