            text = "I ran multiple laps through the building laying traps and flares with no luck. Finally found her outside to the left as you exit the main building by the Warsong Shredder NPC.",
            date = "2019-11-07T00:54:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13871#comments:id=3169924",
        },
        {
