            text = "I think this quest might be bugged;\n\nMy friend (level 70 worgen mage), thought we did it at the same time. We did. She was getting credit while we were doing it, but it said she didn't do it. She abandoned it, took it again, and the names above the bears were yellow.\n\nShe did it TWICE and it didn't let her turn it in because the first time it said she didn't do. She abandoned it AGAIN (for a third time), and this time the bears' names were red. It told her that she got the credit in the middle of he screen, but not on the quest tracker. She logged out and in, but it still didn't work.\n\nBugged or not?",
