            author = "zacke10",
            text = "If you, like me, had a hard time finding Orseus he is standing next to the flight master at Grove of the Ancients. If you check the map it is near the \"G\" in Grove of the Ancients.\n\nStill cant find him? Check here (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=34392)",
