            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13896#comments:id=1678518",
        },
    },
    [13897] = {
        {
            id = 1183206,
            score = 210,
            author = "153135",
            text = "This quest is given by Malfurion on top of Nazj'vel. Malfurion appears there when you complete the objective of \"The offering to Azshara\". However he only stays there for about 1 min after the mini event ends. He actually despawned before I took this quest and the only place I could find him was at eye of the vortex.... however he wont give this quest from that location.\n\nI found that if you repeat the event for \"the offering to Azshara\" by killing the 4 darkscale priestess on top of Nazj'vel at the green portal, then the mini event between Queen Azshara and Malfurion repeats itself and you can still get the quest from Malfurion here.\n\nHope this is of help to anyone else who finds Malfurion despawning before they take the quest.",
            date = "2010-11-24T22:55:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897#comments:id=1183206",
        },
        {
            id = 1539518,
            score = 35,
            author = "Maliander",
            text = "Entire quest chain:\n \n[table cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0]\n[tr][td=header width=35%]Quest[/td][td=header]Description[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13892[/td]\n[td]Discover the identity of Soggoth.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13948[/td]\n[td]Discover the Twilights' Hammer plan.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13896[/td]\n[td]Seek more information.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13893[/td]\n[td]Learn of a historic battle.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13895[/td]\n[td]Seek help from Ancients.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13953[/td]\n[td]Learn that Naga stole an essential horn.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899[/td]\n[td]Kill the Naga responsible.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900[/td]\n[td]Retrieve the horn.[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897  [/td]\n[td]Fight Soggoth with help.[/td][/tr]\n[/table]\n \nNote: These are only the quests directly relevant to this quest chain. Due to cataclysm's linear questing style, other quests you encounter while doing the quests above may be required to unlock the next step in the chain.",
            date = "2011-10-10T07:27:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897#comments:id=1539518",
        },
        {
            id = 2865798,
            score = 13,
            author = "dasbaum",
            text = "This quest is started by a \"spawned\" NPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=34422 during an event from the previous quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900.\n\nIf you didn't pick up the quest in time. Malfurion will despawn after about 30 sec. Simply redo the event with the horn, by killing the NPCs and the event will repeat, you can then pick the quest again.",
            date = "2019-01-13T09:27:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897#comments:id=2865798",
        },
        {
            id = 1189819,
            score = 8,
            author = "Sianl",
            text = "As a horde you can kill the 4 naga summoning Azshara and see the RP. However you wont get much else from the situation.",
            date = "2010-11-27T07:19:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897#comments:id=1189819",
        },
        {
            id = 1835405,
            score = 8,
            author = "crookedthumb",
            text = "If you are a rogue and have glyph of disguise you can pickpocket the Avatar of Soggoth and take his appearance.",
            date = "2013-03-27T16:43:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897#comments:id=1835405",
        },
    },
    [13898] = {
        {
            id = 1228101,
            score = 7,
            author = "sixhigh1",
            text = "If you are in Ashenvale and still have this quest, Bliz quest helper shows the mobs as being south of BFD. There are no Darkscale Myrmidons in that area.",
            date = "2010-12-12T16:00:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13898#comments:id=1228101",
        },
        {
            id = 2272399,
            score = 5,
            author = "stinkyfinger",
            text = "You must complete the Naga In Our Midst (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13953/naga-in-our-midst) quest before this will become available.",
            date = "2015-11-06T14:28:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13898#comments:id=2272399",
        },
    },
    [13899] = {
        {
            id = 1224856,
            score = 21,
            author = "723243",
            text = "Warlord Wrathspine is located in the cave on the island.  He's at the bottom of the cave. Once you kill him, another quest is given which is The Offering to Azshara (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900).\n\nTo complete this quest, go out of the cave, to the top of the island and slay the four priestesses there.\n\nAfter, Queen Azshara will appear along with Malfurion Stormrage.  You turn in the quest to Malfurion and he subsequently gives you another quest entitled The Battle for Darkshore (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897/the-battle-for-darkshore).  To accept the quest, you must have room in your inventory.  If you don't, like I did the first time, clear out a spot and wait until the priestesses re-spawn and kill them.  You'll have to listen to Azshara and Stormrage again, but you'll be able to pick up the quest.",
            date = "2010-12-11T13:53:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899#comments:id=1224856",
        },
        {
            id = 1206908,
            score = 18,
            author = "237274",
            text = "The ramp up to the cave is at [34.4, 83.9].",
            date = "2010-12-04T21:07:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899#comments:id=1206908",
        },
        {
            id = 1196301,
            score = 6,
            author = "Solarax",
            text = "This is an Alliance Only quest.",
            date = "2010-11-29T18:30:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899#comments:id=1196301",
        },
        {
            id = 1209088,
            score = 6,
            author = "Parc",
            text = "From the corpse, \"quickly\" accept the follow up The Offering to Azshara (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900), otherwise you will need to kill Wrathspine again to pick it up.",
            date = "2010-12-05T20:32:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899#comments:id=1209088",
        },
        {
            id = 2003410,
            score = 2,
            author = "861121",
            text = "Coordinates 38,85 at bottom of cave. He is brown coloured and looks similar to the others so easy to miss.\n\nThis quest is available to Horde since I have just done it.\n\nWhen you go up to the top to kill Azsara, make sure you have 2 bag slots free and don't loot  'til after since the guy who gives you the reward disappears very quickly and you have to rekill the four priestesses to get him to come back. Same goes for the follow up quest he gives you, you need space in bags to receive it. I had to kill the preistesses 3 times :(",
            date = "2014-09-17T03:31:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13899#comments:id=2003410",
        },
    },
    [13900] = {
        {
            id = 1185850,
            score = 77,
            author = "65482",
            text = "If, like me, you unfortunately get disconnected after killing the priestesses but before you can turn in the quest, just wait for the priestesses to respawn and kill them to trigger the event again.",
            date = "2010-11-25T20:04:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900#comments:id=1185850",
        },
        {
            id = 1181221,
            score = 68,
            author = "Killmore",
            text = "left of the entry of the cave, there's a ramp who head to the 4 priestesses that you need to kill.\n\nJust wait there after you kill the priestesses :)",
            date = "2010-11-24T11:07:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900#comments:id=1181221",
        },
        {
            id = 1203757,
            score = 42,
            author = "196807",
            text = "When you kill the 4 priestesses, Queen Azshara will spawn, followed by Malfurion Stormrage.\n\nQueen Azshara yells: Who dares oppose Queen Azshara?  You will soon beg for a swift death!\nMalfurion Stormrage yells: It's over Azshara!  You and your naga will return to the bottom of the seas where you belong!\nQueen Azshara says: Ah... Malfurion Stormrage.  I'd hoped to keep you occupied for a little longer.  It was my goal to keep you away from Hyjal while my allies attacked.  It would seem I have succeeded.\nQueen Azshara says: I've no need to fight you, for it appears I've already won.  You cannot stop our attack on Darkshore and save Hyjal at the same time!\n\nQueen Azshara leaves and despawns.\n\nMalfurion Stormrage says: She's not lying.  Nordrassil is in danger.  I must make haste and prepare for Hyjal's defense.\nMalfurion Stormrage says: It will be up to you to use the Horn of the Ancients and stop Soggoth's return.\n\nMalfurion then offers a followup quest The Battle for Darkshore (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13897) (pick it up quickly before he despawns after a minute or you have to repeat the scripted event).",
            date = "2010-12-03T08:33:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900#comments:id=1203757",
        },
        {
            id = 5460255,
            score = 40,
            author = "Telroshan",
            text = "Malfurion wouldn't let me talk to him to turn in the quest, no question mark would even appear.\nWaiting for the nagas to respawn and redo the event didn't help, leaving the game and disconnecting didn't help either.\nIn the end, I had to do a /reload after Malfurion was done talking, only then did the question mark appear and I could turn in the quest & take the next one.",
            date = "2022-10-29T06:25:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900#comments:id=5460255",
        },
        {
            id = 1180627,
            score = 23,
            author = "707679",
            text = "The horn is at 32:84 on the very southern island with Nagas.\n\nYou need to kill the four priestesses who are offering the horn.",
            date = "2010-11-24T07:56:45-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13900#comments:id=1180627",
        },
    },
