        },
        {
            id = 1080667,
            score = 2,
            author = "524046",
            text = "the WH quick fact list this quest as race specific. (Blood Elf and Orc) I however have completed this on my mage and the final quest of They Grow Up So Fast does count as a Loremaster of Kali tick.",
            date = "2010-07-14T21:41:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13905#comments:id=1080667",
        },
        {
            id = 828896,
            score = 0,
            author = "357826",
            text = "It says on the quest text that the mobs are \"northeast of Thistleshrub Valley\". There seem to be different mobs in the south to those in the north of Tanaris. After killing mobs unsuccessfully for a good 15 minutes around all the dead animals near to Gadgetzan, I read the quest log, went down to the area just above Uldum, and got drops off every other bird.\n\nEDIT: The mobs that you're after for the feathers are Searing Rocs, the birds in the north are just Rocs.",
            date = "2009-09-01T07:42:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13905#comments:id=828896",
        },
    },
    [13906] = {
        {
            id = 812373,
            score = 228,
            author = "Veph",
            text = "Aww, I love how it grows with you. ^^ Makes you feel like you're really raising this. It's going to be a special mount because you'll remember taking care of it and helping it grow up. It's not like you're just given a mount.\n\nI wish more mounts were like this. :) It creates a bond.",
            date = "2009-08-15T10:46:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13906#comments:id=812373",
        },
        {
            id = 881296,
            score = 149,
            author = "Fizzles",
            text = "Disclaimer Warning: Giving a real baby feathers, eggs and raw meat will not speed up the teething process.",
            date = "2009-11-02T13:25:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13906#comments:id=881296",
        },
        {
            id = 797208,
            score = 79,
            author = "246906",
            text = "Reminder:  There is a shortcut from the Violet Citadel to Caverns of Time.  Use this for easy access to the dailies.",
            date = "2009-08-03T17:29:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13906#comments:id=797208",
        },
        {
            id = 813950,
            score = 59,
            author = "46481",
            text = "Toxic Tolerance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13850) leads to the quest Venomhide Eggs (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13887)\n\nToxic Tolerance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13850) is a very annoying quest because you have to be doing damage to the Venomhide Ravasuare for it to be able to bleed on you. The higher level you are the harder of a time you will have with this quest.\n\nOnce you do compelte the Toxic Tolerance (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13850) quest you will then continue o to Venomhide Eggs (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13887)\n\nVenomhide Eggs (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13887) is a very easy quest. Just got to the egg piles that you went to for the Lar'korwi (http://www.wowhead.com/?npc=9684) quest The Scent of Lar'korwi (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=4291)\n\nOnce you are done that you will receive the quest They Grow Up So Fast (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13906). This quest gives you a non combot pet that takes up bag space that you summon that will give you a daily quest. Completeing the daily quest will give you a venomhide baby tooth (http://www.wowhead.com/?item=47196).\n\nTo complete They Grow Up So Fast (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=13906) you will need the following\n\nVenomhide Baby Tooth x20\nRunecloth x20\nRugged Leather x20\nGold x80\n\nand then presto you have yourself a Venomhide Ravasaur Mount",
            date = "2009-08-16T21:05:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13906#comments:id=813950",
        },
        {
            id = 841220,
            score = 49,
            author = "KerynTB",
            text = "If you accidentally delete this quest, the baby teeth do not disappear from your inventory.\n\nYou can simply go back to Mor'vek and pick the quest up again, which puts you right back where you were when you deleted it.",
            date = "2009-09-15T20:31:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13906#comments:id=841220",
        },
    },
