        {
            id = 1359303,
            score = 5,
            author = "798115",
            text = "Please tell me I'm not crazy...I did this quest weeks ago, and had the baby murlocs do the dance.\nThen yesteray, while I was doing quests in Daggerfen Village in Zangarmarsh, all of a sudden a group of baby murlocs ran into the village and started dancing, including the little guy with the tophat.\n\nI swear I didn't dream this...the only connection I can make is with this quest - does it somehow make the murlocs spawn for you at random places later? Has anyone else seen them after doing quest in Darkshore?",
