            text = "If you ever did Ogrila rep, or its dailies at some point, you may remember the sound the detector makes when it finds mounds . Specifically the daily, The Relic's Emanation (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=11080). If your like me who did Ogrila dailies for a long time or went for their rep, you'll most likely remember the sounds of those crystals (Which one of the four is used for this quest).",
