            text = "Ramp up starts at 41.85 also even 1 point of damage breaks your stealth.",
            date = "2010-11-24T16:18:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13948#comments:id=1182226",
        },
        {
            id = 1203676,
            score = 7,
            author = "196807",
            text = "The dialog you are spying on is simple but further confirms that Soggoth is the old god the twilight cultists are trying to summon or revive.\n\nDoomspeaker Trevellion says: Our men are almost finished unearthing great Soggoth.  Is the ritual ready?\nThalya the Voidcaller says: Not quite.  We shall need a great many offerings of sacrifice before the Herald of the Old Gods roams the land again.\nDoomspeaker Trevellion says: Do not worry.  Like I said, our men are almost done unearthing the Slithering One.  They will make for a suitable -- and even voluntary -- sacrifice.  Soggoth will rise!",
            date = "2010-12-03T07:41:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13948#comments:id=1203676",
        },
    },
