            author = "elkagorasa",
            text = "easy to spot, he's the quilboar riding a raptor mount.",
            date = "2010-08-18T22:56:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13968#comments:id=1103307",
        },
        {
            id = 1605740,
            score = 1,
            author = "875810",
            text = "I killed his raptor and then died cuz i didnt clear out the area. When i got back the one that i was attacking was still there and there was another one of him that was on his mount ( the respawn one). After letting the one on the mount pass i moved my original to the space between the thorn and that little half wall thing. I didnt get any other guys on me either. I also got the credit too. At the end i just ran out, and straight back to the quest giver. I got about 5 guys on me but they weren't able to kill me.",
            date = "2012-01-02T09:16:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13968#comments:id=1605740",
        },
        {
            id = 1938205,
            score = 1,
            author = "698374",
            text = "Do NOT spam your attack macros when trying to tag this mob, unless it's set to specifically target Tortusk.  Fez needs half a second to spawn Tortusk on top of him.  If Fez is attacked immediately, Tortusk will never spawn.  A cross-realm crowd camped the spawn location for about 30 minutes without a single Tortusk spawn.  As soon as I convinced them not to spam their macros and let Fez live, Tortusk spawned right on top of him.",
            date = "2014-01-26T18:59:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13968#comments:id=1938205",
        },
        {
