            date = "2011-02-20T08:57:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13980#comments:id=1343236",
        },
        {
            id = 1264319,
            score = 3,
            author = "490440",
            text = "This quest rewards one of the few tanking rings at this level.\n\nThe quest chain starts with Tweedle's Dumb (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13936) from Captain Goggath (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=34359) in Hellscream's Watch, and contains three major quests, including this one.\n\nIf you're coming in from the east (maybe you flew in to Splintertree Post or are coming from The Barrens), it's probably worthwhile to pick up the flight path at Silverwind Refuge on your way by.",
            date = "2010-12-28T15:21:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13980#comments:id=1264319",
        },
    },
