            text = "When I first went up to the totem, the eagle disappeared, but nothing happened.\n\nI went half way down the hill, summoned the eagle and went up the hill again.  This time the eagle did not disappear, but took off, flew a circle around the totem and the quest completed.",
            date = "2012-02-19T08:33:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13988#comments:id=1628858",
