            id = 1179846,
            score = 30,
            author = "Liri",
            text = "The end fo this quest chain has been nicely reworked;\n\nHargash says: Hold it!\nHargash says: What are you two conspiring? Hand me that package.\nSashya says: What, this? This is nothing. Just some ... wildlife research.\nHargash says: We've seen the results of your 'research' before. I'll deliver this package to Orgrimmar for study.\nSashya says: Nonsense! You're overreacting. Have you been watching me this whole time?\nHargash says: , you should know the Warchief doesn't trust the undead. Have you heard what happened at the Wrathgate?\nHargash says: You should do well to consider where your loyalties lie, .",
