        {
            id = 1075364,
            score = 9,
            author = "447186",
            text = "As of Cataclysm Baron Longshore has been captured by the Alliance and held in the stockade at 69,85. Likely to be executed he will bargain for your assistance. Free him from his shackles and he will reveal the whereabouts of his treasure map. And doesn't every pirate captain have a treasure map?\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
