            score = 19,
            author = "447186",
            text = "The quest giver is Kala'ma (loc 62,63) (http://cata.wowhead.com/npc=34828). On accepting this quest you will receive a Waptor Twap in your inventory. Place it on the ground near any raptor in the area and it will run to the trap and be trapped. Click on the trap to receive a Wittle Waptor in your inventory. You will need to collect 5 Wittle Waptors to complete the quest.\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
            date = "2010-07-08T20:20:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14068#comments:id=1076324",
        },
        {
            id = 1194552,
            score = 13,
            author = "172500",
            text = "In case it isnt clear, this quest giver has trouble saying his r's and l's because he has a swollen lip. Blizzard just kind of ran with it from there",
            date = "2010-11-28T22:30:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14068#comments:id=1194552",
        },
        {
            id = 1187892,
            score = 7,
            author = "194661",
            text = "Those Wascawwy Waptors (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yxiv3CBMS4M)!",
            date = "2010-11-26T14:21:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14068#comments:id=1187892",
        },
    },
    [14072] = {
        {
            id = 1075299,
            score = 29,
            author = "447186",
            text = "These items can be found both inside and outside of the tents in each of the centaur camps.\n\nVerified spawn points;\n52,80\n51,83\n54,87\n56,85\n58,82\n\nThis quest sequence is a significant improvement on the old one of killing centaur until Verog spawns.\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
            date = "2010-07-07T12:25:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14072#comments:id=1075299",
        },
        {
            id = 2192076,
            score = 15,
            author = "elhabanero",
            text = "Another quest that is miserable to do if in a group, or more than a couple other players around.",
            date = "2015-06-10T13:28:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14072#comments:id=2192076",
        },
        {
            id = 3186636,
            score = 11,
            author = "Shardsy",
            text = "Spawn points\n\n/way 52 80\n/way 51 83\n/way 54 87\n/way 56 85\n/way 58 82\n\nData from lgthomas\n\n(or look for them in any hut)",
            date = "2020-01-27T12:03:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14072#comments:id=3186636",
        },
        {
            id = 1699106,
            score = 10,
            author = "546553",
            text = "Waiting for them to respawn isn't really recommended, from what I've found, it takes longer than 3 mins for them to respawn, and you'd get it done alot quicker just going to the next hut.\n\nAlso, the Kolkar Pack Runners can totally ruin your day when going from tent to tent, right as you're fighting one, BAM! Another one appeared. So make sure you are only fighting one pack at a time, otherwise they'll absolutely slaughter you without heirlooms.\n\nOh, and If you are gonna wait for a respawn, at least do it right, and go to 52.2, 76.8 where there are two pieces of intel instead of one. :3",
            date = "2012-08-12T15:14:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14072#comments:id=1699106",
        },
        {
            id = 1179651,
            score = 7,
            author = "Zuruk",
            text = "I found these inside the tents around The Stagnant Oasis.  I didn't see any outside of the tents.  They where kind of hard to come by, and I could see this being a very annoying quest to complete if the area has a lot of people, or your questing with a group of friends.",
            date = "2010-11-23T23:58:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14072#comments:id=1179651",
        },
    },
    [14073] = {
        {
            id = 1205147,
            score = 10,
            author = "IgnusRavnos",
            text = "Probably only available after you've completed A Little Diversion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13992) and Kolkar Leaders (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=850). I'm not sure which one is needed or if the two are needed because I've completed them together, so needs confirmation.",
            date = "2010-12-03T23:29:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14073#comments:id=1205147",
        },
        {
            id = 1076343,
            score = 4,
            author = "447186",
            text = "Report to Regthar Deathgate at the bunker (loc 37,55) to the west of \"The Crossroads\". This is the same guy that gave the old \"Kolkar Leaders\" and \"Centaur Bracers\" quests. In fact he gives the new Cataclysm version of \"Centaur Bracers (http://cata.wowhead.com/quest=855)\" now.\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
            date = "2010-07-08T21:19:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14073#comments:id=1076343",
        },
        {
            id = 1264560,
            score = 1,
            author = "Voij",
            text = "Just wanted to add that I think it's highly interesting that this quest is said to require level 16, the follow-up requires level 15 and \"Counterattack!\", which is unlocked after completing the followup, requires level 11.",
            date = "2010-12-28T17:53:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14073#comments:id=1264560",
        },
        {
            id = 2496445,
            score = 1,
            author = "Sastep3",
            text = "This quest is unavailable to me. I assume that once you complete the followup quest Hezrul Bloodmark (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=852/hezrul-bloodmark) this one becomes unobtainable.",
            date = "2017-05-25T13:35:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14073#comments:id=2496445",
        },
        {
            id = 1187379,
