            score = 4,
            author = "883656",
            text = "This quest opens up at 8. If you're any class with a heal, it's just a regular kill quest with a stealth mob.\n\nIf you're not however, this quest can be EXTREMELY annoying. Classes like a warrior, rogue, things like that, will find this quest a pain at 8. Reason being, like all rogues, these ones like sneaking up on you to get the first shot.\nAlso like most rogues, the second you move away from one, another comes out from the bushes to imbalance the odds. So if you don't have a self heal, you might just wanna wait a level or two, or be prepared to die a few times, only to rez and be killed again by the mobs that camp the graveyard.",
            date = "2011-09-24T14:44:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14117#comments:id=1526559",
        },
        {
            id = 1697064,
            score = 2,
            author = "1020178",
            text = "its not that hard if you pick the quest with the runaway shredder\nthen just pick the robot and use it to kill the scouts way easyer then just grinding them",
            date = "2012-08-07T06:55:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14117#comments:id=1697064",
        },
        {
            id = 1697067,
            score = 1,
            author = "1020178",
            text = "and watch your back because those guys can ninja log and teleport behind you",
            date = "2012-08-07T06:58:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14117#comments:id=1697067",
        },
    },
    [14118] = {
        {
            id = 2020024,
            score = 31,
            author = "1011992",
            text = "The drop rate for these is really bad, i killed 20 of these, for 3 venison. And watch out for the phasing becuase when you venture too far from the rear gate they dissapear",
            date = "2014-10-27T19:10:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14118#comments:id=2020024",
        },
        {
            id = 1852573,
            score = 25,
            author = "Marumain",
            text = "If you're role-playing as a Tauren while doing this quest, you would probably being feeling disgusted with yourself. After all, these people whom you're helping are deforesting the whole region and stripping it of its natural resources, which alone should disgust your Tauren character. But then they have you hunt and kill the animals who are now left homeless from the desecration of the natural environment, all to feed the very ones who caused this. This is NOT the balance with nature that all Tauren strive for.",
            date = "2013-05-12T19:41:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14118#comments:id=1852573",
        },
        {
            id = 1700666,
            score = 23,
            author = "1017142",
            text = "Make sure there are no kids around when you're playing this quest because there will be swearing. You'll curse under your breath (and over it) as you're distracted from your stags by elvin scouts as they sneak up on you, and then as you chase after your stag it suddenly vanishes! For these are not normal stags, my friend.\n\nJust imagine the looks on their faces! Proud orc warriors, tired after a long day of fending off Night Elf raiders, when they open their mouths before their juicy stag meat and it suddenly vanishes off the plate!",
            date = "2012-08-16T18:37:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14118#comments:id=1700666",
        },
        {
            id = 1834424,
            score = 22,
            author = "shoxi",
            text = "I could not turn this quest in until I completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14155.",
            date = "2013-03-25T21:07:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14118#comments:id=1834424",
        },
        {
            id = 2417948,
            score = 3,
            author = "7rinity",
            text = "Just skip the quest.\n\nNot 100% drop rate.\nStags not aggressive. (slightly harder to mass murder)\nSpaced really far from each other.\nPhasing issues\nGetting kills while in the shredder not providing loot.\nNot a prerequisite for a single quest.\n\nAvoid at all costs.\n\nFun fact: It probably would have taken my longer to do the quest than it took to look up this quest and make this comment.",
            date = "2016-09-30T00:28:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14118#comments:id=2417948",
        },
    },
    [14127] = {
