            author = "883656",
            text = "Simple quest. I found that the fastest way to complete it is not to move at all. Go to the rear gate and sit between the two barriers (I was at 27.1, 76.7), and spam tab plus your 3 abilities. I was done the quest in about 30 seconds since they continually spawn maybe 30 yards ahead.",
