            text = "[quote In the Quest 'A Thousand Stories in the Sand', Malynea Skyreaver]The ruins around Lake Mennar, to our east, have a tale to tell. The lesser races - like those clumsy dwarves - would go after the truth with picks and shovels.  We'll be using more elegant methods.\n[quote In the Quest 'Survey the Lakeshore', Custer Clubnick]All these cruddy ancient ruins have to be bulldozed if we're ever to see Azshara's full potential.\nConclusion:\n---------Superior -------- Lesser ----------------------------------------------------------\n.........Blood Elves..........Dwarf..........Goblin..........................................Gnomes\n\nicwatblizzdidthar.",
            date = "2011-08-13T01:24:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14201#comments:id=1493741",
