            text = "Amusing how the brazier \"indiscriminately\" grants a boon to Horde players, while \"graciously\" granting it to Alliance players. One would think Elune would know who she was giving a boon to.\n\nPersonally I feel she is showing gratitude to *anyone* who takes care of the Satyrs defiling her temple.",
