            text = "She's also not directly on the shoreline as the quest implies.  On the north side of the lake is a sort of stone pavilion on the top of a small hill.  She pats in a very small area on the top/far side of the hill.",
            date = "2011-10-02T23:20:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14215#comments:id=1533560",
        },
    },
