            text = "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livermorium\n\nThat stuff should be exploding into Protons and such within 60ms of creation.\n\nInb4 downrate.",
            date = "2012-06-14T17:10:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14254#comments:id=1676681",
