        {
            id = 1310089,
            score = 5,
            author = "406368",
            text = "Valishj is only available ON THIS ISLAND if you start the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14260.  If you are doing the \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14284\" later quest, she is only available on the island N-NW called Ranazjar Isle.  See this other version of her here for \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14284\" (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=35898).\n\nNOTE: The quest \"Mystery Solved\" later on this quest-chain destroys this https://www.wowhead.com/item=49064 (text for the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14260 does not tell you this). Also the https://www.wowhead.com/item=49064 is only able to be activated while you are in the area that says 'Slitherblade Shores', but while the 150% swim speed and water breathing buff lasts, you can swim/run anywhere in Desolace, including making it into Stonetalon Mountains by swimming. Great for all levels! Sneak up on those pesky level 80+s and wipe them as they scan the skies!\n\n*edit:  Now with nifty links!  =^D     (confirming Horde can still pick up this ENTIRE quest chain as of 4.2.2.)",
            date = "2011-01-26T01:08:38-06:00",
