            author = "Pypode",
            text = "Pick up Bone Collector quest from Bibbly F'utzbuckle which sends you to the Kodo graveyard for bones.  He is located a bit NE of the Cenarion Wildlands, on the western shore of the lake (see your map). Catch some fish there, too. The graveyard is SW of Bibbly.\n\nYou will find lashers on your way, for the Pulling Weeds quest. Also, plenty of Aloe Thistle grow in the graveyard for A Time to Reap quest. Both quests from Botanist Ferrah in the \"town\" in center of the Cenarion Wildlands.",
            date = "2011-05-15T21:50:02-05:00",
