            text = "okay, wow, I did the first quest, getting food, and then, I go get some food irl before taking this quest, nd I come back, and the quest giver de-spawned or something.. he isn't there anymore! how the hell can I continue desolace's questing now? D8<\n\nGG blizz\n\n*edit* well, guess blizz did something right for once, he can be found in his tent, north of where you first meet him",
            date = "2011-11-27T01:24:14-06:00",
