            text = "The goblin mentioned is at [48,62]. As of 4.2, Dying Kodos population total is ~10. Several are located around the goblin and then there are the two @ [48,60] and [52,55]. The drop rate is approximately 40% from my experiences in this area.\n\nGood luck!",
            date = "2011-05-06T20:04:18-05:00",
