        {
            id = 3310303,
            score = 7,
            author = "Tteer",
            text = "Leveling an alt in SL expac, Chromy time: Cataclysm, level 35, WA.\nAfter doing Ergll's other 3 quests, he just unexpectedly threw me onto the turtle the moment I accepted this quest.\nSo I took the long ride on the turtle to the Northern tower. Upon arrival, Sorata was nowhere to be found.\nAfter relogging, which didn't make him appear, I tried abandoning the quest, no Sorata. Went back to Ergll to reacquire the quest only to find that he was gone too.\nSo I went back to Bilgewater Harbor to find Kalec... you guessed it... gone.\nI have no idea what to do to finish this questline, It LOOKS like it could be phasing interference again, but gives NO clue what it wants.\nWhatever the case, players, I would suggest you DON'T abandon this \"Wash Out\" quest!\n\nAssuming that phasing interference is once again the problem, how many YEARS has Blizz had to fix this? Tired of it.\nReported to Blizz.",
            date = "2021-03-21T17:23:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14345#comments:id=3310303",
        },
