            score = 14,
            author = "703351",
            text = "76.70  18.60 is the cup of elune\n78.45 22.60 is the brazier\n76.34 26.08 is the handmaiden\n\nthere are 3 quest you can get from each one of these if you want to take them.\n\nLots of 30-31 saytr's around, and some of them are rogue's they do disappear on you so watch out. Otherwise pretty simple.",
