            author = "brynne660",
            text = "It took me maybe 10-15 minutes max (killing everything in sight) to do all three of the altar quests then hearth back to turn in the original quest.  Of course, if it moves I'll prolly kill it, so that may not be helpful.\n\nI found the sword drop rates sucked on the mobs, but the racks respawned fairly quickly.  The satyr meat had a good drop rate, though.",
