            date = "2018-05-29T17:24:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14378#comments:id=2570777",
        },
        {
            id = 1204997,
            score = 28,
            author = "61984",
            text = "Note that you can do this very short and easy quest chain without having done any other quests in the zone before getting here. The only prereqs are the two quests that Thargad offers when you first meet him, Infernal Encroachment (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14373) and Portals of the Legion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14374).\n\nThat's 15 minutes work for some very nice blue rewards.",
            date = "2010-12-03T21:16:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14378#comments:id=1204997",
        },
        {
            id = 1662618,
            score = 28,
            author = "Takata",
