        },
        {
            id = 1541611,
            score = 17,
            author = "DrAwkward",
            text = "While the level requirement for this quest is only 30 you must be 31 to do the first quest in the chain\nHunting Brendol (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14378)",
            date = "2011-10-13T03:43:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14381#comments:id=1541611",
        },
        {
            id = 1205926,
            score = 7,
            author = "435028",
            text = "This is really a fun quest! =D\n\nBetter than the bombing quest in Outland. Here you will continue to fly the Crevasse until you have downed all the needed targets. However, you may want to keep your (L)og set to this quest so you can quickly check how many you have left. (Hint: when you bomb one, and you don't get the yellow text giving you credit, you have all of them.)\n\nThere are at least three Giants atop the island, so getting at least two in one pass is quite easy--once you know what you're looking for.\n\nAlso, in the beginning of the crevasse you will find them close enough together that you can get two with one bomb :-)\n\nHappy Hunting!",
            date = "2010-12-04T11:23:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14381#comments:id=1205926",
        },
        {
            id = 1664065,
            score = 6,
            author = "827926",
            text = "Try to prioritize the Giants so you don't have to make another loop.",
            date = "2012-05-07T23:24:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14381#comments:id=1664065",
        },
    },
