        {
            id = 1383215,
            score = 38,
            author = "RaQin",
            text = "Here's a MUST DO for anyone doing these quests at a higher level just for fun:\n\n1) Talk to Greely and ask her to shrink you\n\n2) Mount up your Traveler's Tundra Mammoth\n\n3) ...\n\n4) Profit\n\nAlthough you and your Traveler's Tundra Mammoth will be shrunken super-small, the vendors who ride on the back of the mammoth with you are apparently unaffected and remain normal size.\n\nIt's absolutely hilarious to see these two full-sized 'toons riding around on the back of your super-shrunken mammoth.",
            date = "2011-04-03T15:21:55-05:00",
