            text = "Step 1: Talk to Greely (the goblin that gives you the quest) to get shrinked\n\nStep 2: Mount a nearby rat\n\nStep 3: Ride to Gormungan (the cliff giant you already talked to) and talk to him in order to scare him\n\nStep 4: Profit!",
