            text = "When you talk to the Arcane Construct (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=36599) nearby as a step on this quest, you see the following textbox:\n\n(Player) Um... Al'teth ... la c'tolgar? Or something.\n\nIn the chatbox, you then see: The arcane Construct surges with uncontrolled arcane energies.\n\nThe Arcane Construct wanders forward and attacks all of the nearby Apprentice Illuminators (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=36593) and Apprentice Investigators (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=36592).  It kills them by charring them to the bone with an arcane aoe blast before it itself dies away.",
            date = "2010-12-21T02:14:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14430#comments:id=1249427",
        },
