        {
            id = 1633128,
            score = 5,
            author = "Zanthraxis",
            text = "Probably a reference to Army of Darkness where Ash has to repeat the words \"Klaatu Barada Nikto\" to get the Neconomicon, and screws it up in the end:\n\nAsh: Klaatu Barada Nikto.\nWiseman: Well, repeat them.\nAsh: Klaatu Barada Nikto.\nWiseman: Again.\nAsh: I got it, I got it! I know your damn words, alright?\n\nAsh: Klaatu Barada N... Necktie... Neckturn... Nickel... It's an \"N\" word, it's definitely an \"N\" word! Klaatu... Barada... N...\n[coughs]\nAsh: [pause] Okay... that's it!",
