        {
            id = 1183241,
            score = 8,
            author = "684218",
            text = "Toss the torch from Feed of Evil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14461) at the troughs while there are boars nearby to get one-hit KOs.\n\nThey count toward the kill count of this quest, so you can kill the boars a bit easier if you're too lazy to go get your level 3 skills from the trainer and walk back.",
