            text = "Slinky Sharpshiv says: Okay, this place is set to blow. Let's get out of here!\n\n\"Okay!\" *Jumps off the tower in pure badassery*\n\nSlinky Sharpshiv says: Hop on!\n\n\"Wait wha–\"\n\nEDIT: I redid the quest. Absolutely worth it.",
