            text = "Enjoyed hugely using my voidwalker as a minesweeper for this quest",
            date = "2010-11-25T11:29:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14469#comments:id=1184704",
        },
        {
            id = 2529296,
            score = 14,
            author = "1718507",
            text = "If anyone is having trouble on this I personally had got launched all of the place while running.  I turned my character to walk instead of run (the / above your 10-key on keyboard) and simply walked down and didn't set off any mines.  I was able to walk what seemed like closer to the mines without them detonating.  Give this a try if having difficulty.",
            date = "2017-10-12T13:21:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14469#comments:id=2529296",
