            text = "This quest is not bugged as many suggest. There is however an issue with mounts, if you are flying towards the end it will not trigger the event to happen.",
            date = "2016-05-10T00:59:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14482#comments:id=2329415",
