        {
            id = 3216684,
            score = 6,
            author = "Hasizae",
            text = "This quest is kind of annoying but once you get the trick it works:\n\nThe obelisks are not clearly pointed in the area on the map, but they have a purple-ish halo around them that makes them quite easy to spot.\nYou can blast the same obelisk almost right after it exploded, but for me a fresh squad was needed each time to not bug.\nFirst get the area around the obelisks clear to not pull additional trash.\nUse the quest item to get a fresh squad. Next thing you need to do is wait for the dialog:\n\nPatch: Ticker, Blow this thing\nTicker: On it.\nTicker: Almost done\nTicker: It's set. Get clear!\n\nOnce the last line is told by Ticker, the explosion is almost immediate so get indeed clear.\n\nIt takes a bit of time for Ticker to be done, so no worries if it lasts a tad.",
            date = "2020-07-09T23:16:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14485#comments:id=3216684",
        },
        {
            id = 3224937,
            score = 5,
            author = "Stoepsel3000",
            text = "Still kinda bugged since it's hard to trigger the goblins to destroy the obelisks even if you stand right next to them. Sometimes it helps to run around them especially the one which is standing on this round stone thing.",
            date = "2020-08-23T07:43:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14485#comments:id=3224937",
        },
    },
    [14486] = {
        {
            id = 1640757,
            score = 27,
            author = "sephyre",
            text = "Here is a list of the quests you need to do to unlock this quest assuming you haven't done any in Azshara:\n\nYou need to do all the quests at Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=35085 (29.2, 66.6) gives you:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14197\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=35091 (29.0, 66.2) gives you 2 quests\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14165 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14161\nThe first starts a chain which leads to:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14190\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14192\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14194\n\nThese will unlock https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36752's quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14468 which will send you to the next chain.\n\nYou need to do the quests for everyone at this new outpost on Forlorn Ridge (north of the rocketway exchange)\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36749 (29.4, 57.6)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14469\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36746\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14471\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36744\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14470\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14472\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36749\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24452\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24453\n\nNow you can pick up the quest chain from https://www.wowhead.com/object=201578 at Bilgewater Harbor\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14478\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24455\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14479\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24435 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36920 (41.4, 53.6)\n\nYou will also need to pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24436 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36921 (41.4, 53.8)\n\nNow you can get https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36920's follow up quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24448.\n\nOnce you turn this quest in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36745 (34.4, 44.8) this quest will be unlocked.",
            date = "2012-03-17T17:27:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14486#comments:id=1640757",
        },
