        {
            id = 1196733,
            score = 8,
            author = "Ethanol",
            text = "Was not able to pick this quest up as a non tauren, despite being able to do all the previous steps.\n\nHowever the next quest in the line was available ([quest=24215 domain=www]), and I knew where the npc was for that with a quick wowhead search to this page!",
