            author = "151989",
            text = "Like me, you may end up slightly confused as to how to get up to this NPC. What you need to do is travel towards the thorny area where you killed the named NPC in one of the previous quests. Along the way if you look to your right you'll see a hill with 3 trees standing in a row at the top. Right next to these trees is the start of the path leading upwards towards the NPC you turn this into.",
            date = "2010-12-01T22:27:54-06:00",
