        {
            id = 2573049,
            score = 3,
            author = "Gymlea",
            text = "1) At the bottom of the screen are a series of Icons, or spaces for Icons. Left-mouse-click on the right-most icon, labeled \"Backpack\". This is what Wowhead users mean when they say \"Open your backpack.\"\n2) A window opens up showing all of the spaces in the Backback for items. One of the spaces is occupied by \"Sten's First Aid Kit\".\n3) Move \"Sten's First Aid Kit\" to your Action Bar, which means left-click it, hold the mouse button down, move the mouse to drag the icon across the screen, and release the button when the icon is over one of the left-side gray boxes in the Action Bar at the bottom of the screen.\n4) Now left-click a Wounded Mountaineer, and then left-click \"Sven's First Aid Kit\" in the action bar.\n5) The Mountaineer will be healed.",
            date = "2018-06-09T19:57:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24471#comments:id=2573049",
        },
    },
