        {
            id = 1696641,
            score = 6,
            author = "DesertFly3",
            text = "Funnily enough, upon aggroing a Rockjaw Scavenger (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37105), they have a chance to just chuck (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=69897) one of the things at you. In my testing, I received credit for an artifact for getting hit with that attack.",
