            score = 1,
            author = "Gurk",
            text = "I was unable to receive this quest to complete the Loremaster achievement. A GM was able to resolve this with an explanation of why it happened. My character's name is \"Ku\".\n\nTo help, I first took a look Ku’s quests in that zone. This helped me prove that the criteria for it were met. To resolve your ticket I looked into Ku and also was able to verify all quests were done except A Family Divided (which cannot be done as Ku did the followup quest A Line in the Dirt (and all that followed that, which makes A Family Divided not possible to do)).!\n\nWith those 2 powers combined, I was able to grant Ku - Southern Barrens Achievement! Congrats on all your hard work ^_^\n\nOur Quality Assurance team, those that resolve in-game bugs that are caused by the back end, are currently working to resolve this issue. However if you know anyone else who experienced this issue, please do not hesitate to ask them to open a ticket. We need their approval to alter their account, however we also want to ensure everyone is helped until this problem is resolved once and for all. ^^",
            date = "2020-10-30T14:19:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24543#comments:id=3243805",
        },
        {
            id = 1672545,
