    [24553] = {
        {
            id = 891799,
            score = 73,
            author = "474751",
            text = "Talk to the Ranger next to the quest giver. Then you will get teleported to Kil'Jaeden's lair aka. The Sunwell.",
            date = "2009-11-15T14:09:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24553#comments:id=891799",
        },
        {
            id = 910859,
            score = 35,
            author = "lovelywaz",
            text = "When you throw the Tainted Quel'Delar in the Sunwell, following scripted event happens...\n\nChamberlain Galiros yells: My lords and ladies, I present , bearer of Quel'Delar.\n\nLor'themar Theron says: We shall see.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: Look at it, Lor'themar. It certainly is Quel'Delar.\n\nLor'themar Theron says: So it is. You have may thanks, , for restoring Quel'Delar to its rightful owners.\n\n====\nAt this point, Quel'Delar knocks back Lor'themar Theron and you (player) gets a ice chain CC buff. Guards yell at Captain Auric Sunchaser and move towards him.\n====\n\nSunwell Honor Guard yells: My Lord Regent! What have they done to you?\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: What is the meaning of this treachery?\n\nSunwell Honor Guard says: Drop your weapon and surrender, traitor.\n\nCaptain Auric Sunchaser says: This is not my doing, Rommath. There is no treachery here.\n\nCaptain Auric Sunchaser says: Call off your men. Lor'themar's own foolishness caused his injuries. Quel'Delar is not chosen, it chooses its master.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: It seems the captain is correct. Quel'Delar is not to be ours after all.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: Guards, return to your posts.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: You will have what you have come for, . Take the sword and begone. And you, Auric, have a care what you say in this sacred place.\n\nCaptain Auric Sunchaser says: Carry the sword back to Dalaran through that portal,  . You have done what many quel'dorei have dreamt of for years.Quel'Delar has been restored at last.\n\nYou can then Pick the sword from Sunwell and take the portal to Dalaran in the North-Esat corner of the room.",
            date = "2009-12-09T12:46:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24553#comments:id=910859",
        },
        {
            id = 2152910,
            score = 24,
            author = "Lostelf",
            text = "As of WoD Lor'themar is killed when he tries to take Quel'delar instead of knocked back, this is likely because they forgot the nerf the damage along with the stat squish to Lor'themar's health.",
            date = "2015-04-03T20:56:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24553#comments:id=2152910",
        },
        {
            id = 920661,
            score = 21,
            author = "41127",
            text = "Just a little info I dug up since the quest bugged for me (couldn't loot the restored blade). Just zone out, abandon quest and retake it from the npc. You get given the item from him and everything is well :)",
            date = "2009-12-17T04:43:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24553#comments:id=920661",
        },
        {
            id = 2439041,
            score = 21,
            author = "Hiljentaja",
            text = "This quest is at the moment bugged, or atleast for me and many others it is/was. I just found a way around the bug.\n\nWhen you speak to the Rangers to be teleported to the Sunwell and they teleport you to the entrance of the raid instead, don't try to run to the Sunwell yourself (you will be teleported out of the raid when you reach it), but wait at the entrance for a while (I waited about 15 to 20 minutes), and then slowly start walking towards the first boss and you will be teleported to the quest area.\n\nI was stuck on this quest for approximately 5 to 6 months until today. I just completed the quest chain.",
            date = "2016-11-02T08:58:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24553#comments:id=2439041",
        },
    },
    [24562] = {
        {
            id = 911082,
            score = 28,
            author = "45234",
            text = "Here's the entire quest chain, with simple descriptions and quest links for the Horde versions.\n\nThe Battered Hilt (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24554)\nBring the Battered Hilt to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\n2. What The Dragons Know (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24555)\nSpeak to Krasus at the top of Wyrmrest Temple.\n\n3. The Silver Covenant Scheme (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24557) (Alliance version is called \"The Sunreavers' Plan)\nObtain the Orders by killing an NPC in the Dalaran Sewers.  Make sure you kill the right one.\n\n4. A Suitable Disguise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24556)\nObtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam; He is upstairs in the Threads of Fate: if you are standing in front of the stairs with the Violet Citadel to your back, it is to the right (to the left is the toy store).\n\n5. An Audience With The Arcanist (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24451)\nRetrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Arcanist Tybalin. Use the disguise and go in the Alliance section of Dalaran.\n\n6. Return To Myralion Sunblaze (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24558)\nBring the Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.\n\n7. Reforging The Sword (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24559)\nObtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer and use them to make the Reforged Quel'Delar. (AKA: Run the Pit of Saron.  The infused bars are near the entrance; don't forget you have to kill the boss, too.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n8. Tempering The Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24560)\nTemper the Reforged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls. (AKA: kill the final boss of Forge of Souls; use the quest item nearby.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n9. The Halls Of Reflection (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24561)\nBring your Tempered Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.  (AKA, obviously, run Halls of Reflection.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n10. Journey To The Sunwell (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24562)\nSpeak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.\n\n11. Thalorien Dawnseeker (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24563)\nVisit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.  (Go around behind SWP to the Dead Scar (southern end of Isle of QD zone, not in the SWP raid instance) and kill a bunch of mobs.)\n\n12. The Purification of Quel'Delar  (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24564)\nImmerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau. (Possibly different versions of this for sword/mace?)\n\n13. A Victory For The [Sunreavers/Silver Covenant] - (sword (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24801) or  mace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24798))\nBring the Restored Quel'Delar to the NPC at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.\n\nA lot of this info came from comments people left on the various quest pages. Thanks to all those who posted useful tips!",
            date = "2009-12-09T15:42:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24562#comments:id=911082",
        },
        {
            id = 1138542,
            score = 12,
            author = "426462",
            text = "Script as seen by a Blood Elf:\n\nSunwell Honor Guard says: Can that really be Quel'Delar?\n\nLor'themar Theron says: We shall see.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: Look at it, Lor'themar. It certainly is Quel'Delar.\n\nLor'themar Theron  says: It is indeed Quel'Delar. I had not thought I'd live to see the day when Thalorien Dawnseeker's legendary sword would be restored to us.\n\nLor'themar Theron says: You are a hero and an inspiration to the sin'dorei, , a symbol of our endurance in the face of tragedy and treachery.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: The regent speaks truly, . Thalorien's sacrifice could not prevent the fall of this very Sunwell.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: When you found the sword, it was broken and abandoned, much like Silvermoon after Kael'thas's betrayal.\n\nGrand Magister Rommath says: Let Quel'Delar be a sign that we will never give up, that we will face any enemy without fear.\n\nCaptain Auric Sunchaser says: Quel'Delar is not held in high esteem by the sin'dorei alone. It holds a place in the heart of all children of Silvermoon.\n\nCaptain Auric Sunchaser says: This blade has been returned to us for a reason, my lords. Now is the time to rally behind the bearer of Quel'Delar and avenge the destruction of Silvermoon and the Sunwell.\n\nMagister Rommath says: Reclaim the sword, , and bear it through that portal to Dalaran. Archmage Aethas Sunreaver will be waiting to congratulate you.",
            date = "2010-10-09T15:54:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24562#comments:id=1138542",
        },
        {
            id = 873282,
            score = 10,
            author = "466130",
            text = "wow, go to the sunwell that was activated.... epic, instead of kiljaeden sitting there ==",
            date = "2009-10-22T22:55:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24562#comments:id=873282",
        },
        {
            id = 2354567,
            score = 5,
            author = "1032127",
            text = "Quest is bugged as of 7.0 for the Horde side.\nHalduron is stuck out of phase so you can't talk to him.",
            date = "2016-07-21T15:51:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24562#comments:id=2354567",
        },
        {
            id = 933863,
            score = 3,
            author = "29475",
            text = "For Horde: You can get their from the FP in Silvermoon. If you're 80 (which you'll be), the FP is automatically added. It's north of the Eastern Kingdoms.",
            date = "2009-12-31T19:59:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24562#comments:id=933863",
        },
    },
    [24563] = {
        {
            id = 911077,
            score = 33,
            author = "45234",
            text = "Here's the entire quest chain, with simple descriptions and quest links for the Horde versions.\n\nThe Battered Hilt (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24554)\nBring the Battered Hilt to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's rest, south of the Argent Tournament Grounds.\n\n2. What The Dragons Know (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24555)\nSpeak to Krasus at the top of Wyrmrest Temple.\n\n3. The Silver Covenant Scheme (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24557) (Alliance version is called \"The Sunreavers' Plan)\nObtain the Orders by killing an NPC in the Dalaran Sewers.  Make sure you kill the right one.\n\n4. A Suitable Disguise (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24556)\nObtain a Borrowed Tabard from Shandy Glossgleam; He is upstairs in the Threads of Fate: if you are standing in front of the stairs with the Violet Citadel to your back, it is to the right (to the left is the toy store).\n\n5. An Audience With The Arcanist (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24451)\nRetrieve the Ancient Dragonforged Blades tome from Arcanist Tybalin. Use the disguise and go in the Alliance section of Dalaran.\n\n6. Return To Myralion Sunblaze (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24558)\nBring the Ancient Dragonforged Blades to Myralion Sunblaze at Quel'Delar's Rest.\n\n7. Reforging The Sword (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24559)\nObtain 5 Infused Saronite Bars and the Forgemaster's Hammer and use them to make the Reforged Quel'Delar. (AKA: Run the Pit of Saron.  The infused bars are near the entrance; don't forget you have to kill the boss, too.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n8. Tempering The Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24560)\nTemper the Reforged Quel'Delar in the Crucible of Souls. (AKA: kill the final boss of Forge of Souls; use the quest item nearby.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n9. The Halls Of Reflection (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24561)\nBring your Tempered Quel'Delar to Sword's Rest inside the Halls of Reflection.  (AKA, obviously, run Halls of Reflection.)(It appears this can be done on Normal Difficulty.)\n\n10. Journey To The Sunwell (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24562)\nSpeak with Halduron Brightwing at the entrance to the Sunwell Plateau on the Isle of Quel'Danas.\n\n11. Thalorien Dawnseeker (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24563)\nVisit Thalorien Dawnseeker's Remains and obtain his blessing to wield Quel'Delar.  (Go around behind SWP to the Dead Scar (southern end of Isle of QD zone, not in the SWP raid instance) and kill a bunch of mobs.)\n\n12. The Purification of Quel'Delar  (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24564)\nImmerse your Tempered Quel'Delar in the Sunwell. Speak to a Warden of the Sunwell when you are ready to enter the Sunwell Plateau. (Possibly different versions of this for sword/mace?)\n\n13. A Victory For The [Sunreavers/Silver Covenant] - (sword (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24801) or  mace (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=24798))\nBring the Restored Quel'Delar to the NPC at the Violet Citadel in Dalaran.\n\nA lot of this info came from comments people left on the various quest pages. Thanks to all those who posted useful tips!",
            date = "2009-12-09T15:40:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24563#comments:id=911077",
        },
        {
            id = 910360,
            score = 29,
            author = "417150",
            text = "The remains of Thalorien Dawnseeker are at the southern end of the Dead Scar on the Isle of Quel'Danas (52,80), where the bombing run daily used to fly over (phased out during this quest though).  Do NOT do what I did and assume the \"Dead Scar\" meant on the main land in front of Silvermoon City (with the southern end therefore being in Ghostlands).",
            date = "2009-12-09T04:59:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24563#comments:id=910360",
        },
        {
            id = 944232,
            score = 26,
            author = "469444",
            text = "...I wonder why the Blood Elves just left this guy's corpse sitting out there for so long.  \"He fell in what is now the Dead Scar, buying time for his men to make their own preparations.  So anyway, we just left him there to rot... his body's probably still there, and his ghost is undoubtedly still haunting the place begging for a proper funeral;  go see if you can get his blessing.\"",
            date = "2010-01-10T22:34:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24563#comments:id=944232",
        },
        {
            id = 913379,
