            text = "k just go too the part that got already said 10 times above.\n\n3 waves of mobs will spawn:\n\n1x 5x 10-13k hp mobs normal\n1x 4x 13k hp mobs\n1x 3x ranged 20k hp mobs\n1x elite 40k hp horse rider\n\nall mobs hit for crap and are easy killable.",
            date = "2010-01-25T04:48:47-06:00",
