        {
            id = 1668625,
            score = 2,
            author = "dayoodin",
            text = "Annoyingly low drop rate with mobs spread out all over the place. They must be tweaking it, as I had no 100% drop rate from either brown or blue, and instead got three from blue, one from brown, though there were vastly more blue ones around than brown, so that's probably why (usually, they are paired one blue with one brown but that wasn't the case this time for me).\n\nIncidentally, it helps to get the Forward Command quests (for Alliance) at the same time, as it has two advantages:\n\nGetting spread out all over for those quests gets you all over the place for more lashvines\nIt gives you stuff to do while you wait for more lashvines to spawn if you killed them all",
