            text = "Kill Outgrowths (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37092) in the rivers of the same area where the quest giver is (The Overgrowth in Southern Barrens). Once you've killed the Outgrowth, tentacles will come out of the ground, they are yellow and will not attack you. You don't HAVE to kill them, they don't drop the Squirming Heart (http://www.wowhead.com/item=49883) that you need for the quest, but you can if you want to.The Outgrowths will drop the heart, just keep killing them. I got mine on the 3rd kill.",
            date = "2011-08-09T16:39:03-05:00",
