        {
            id = 1216258,
            score = 4,
            author = "718423",
            text = "Although I've completed the quest, Mahka isn't able to be interacted with -- the map shows a ? over her, but one the actual screen there isn't one. Has anyone else had this problem, and how did you solve it?",
            date = "2010-12-08T20:44:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24606#comments:id=1216258",
        },
        {
            id = 1846174,
            score = 3,
            author = "tsukasadt",
            text = "Here is the official response I got from Blizzard when I made a support ticket about the issue.\nI am Game Master Endaraal. I hope you're doing well. :)\n\nThanks for contacting me about this quest bug that you ran into. Your ticket tells me that you can't seem to turn in the quest 'Blood of the Barrens' as the quest NPC doesn't give you the option to complete it. Sorry to hear that - I'm not totally sure what causes this problem, since players don't seem to report it to us very often. :-\\\n\nAfter some investigation, it appears that resetting that quest turn-in NPC can fix the problem, so I've gone ahead and done that. I recommen checking back next time you're online to see if you're able to successfully turn that quest in. Thank you for your patience as I looked into your case!\n\nPlease don't hesitate to let us know if you have any further questions or concerns. Take care!\n\nRegards,\n\nGame Master Endaraal\nCustomer Services\nBlizzard Entertainment\nhttp://us.battle.net/support\nThis worked for me when clearing my cache and WTF folders, disabling all add-ons, and loading the game in safe mode did not.\n\nBasically, if you are having this issue, open a support ticket, you can even reference mine (US37294578), and let the GMs know that the bug has reoccurred and that you need the NPC reset.  It took them about 5 hours to respond to my request on Ysondre-US.\n\nAlso, the more reports they get, the quicker they will actually try to fix it.  According to Endaraal, they don't get very many reports on this bug, so ticket them as much as you can when you find bugs. ;)\n\nI hope this helps everyone that's stuck here.",
            date = "2013-04-23T09:17:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24606#comments:id=1846174",
        },
        {
            id = 1931983,
            score = 2,
            author = "Shashos",
            text = "Yep, quest still broken. I didn't put in a ticket to have the quest reset for me, but I did submit another bug report, pointing these comments out to emphasize that this quest has been broken since 2010.\n\nDropped the quest since by the time a GM would get around to resetting it via ticket, I'll have long since outleveled the quest and be in a different zone.\n\nGood luck to all others. Here's hoping it works for ya. :)",
            date = "2014-01-05T17:08:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24606#comments:id=1931983",
        },
        {
            id = 1960874,
            score = 2,
            author = "corry2",
            text = "I was able to do this quest today without any problems",
            date = "2014-04-24T12:29:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24606#comments:id=1960874",
        },
    },
