        {
            id = 1200670,
            score = 83,
            author = "Zuljid",
            text = "After a tough and bloody battle against three Triumph Vanguards (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37923), I drew my mighty bonesaw (http://www.wowhead.com/item=49948) and started butchering the corpses of my enemies, cackling maniacly while gallons of blood splattered all over my face. When I finished this insane and evil deed, I noticed an Alliance player watching the scene open-mouthed with eyes like saucers.\n\nThe only thing I could to do to justify my acts was to type /hungry.\n\nI dont think that helped at all :/",
