        {
            id = 1180999,
            score = 14,
            author = "707790",
            text = "Given by Calder Gray (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37908) in Desolation Hold in the South Barrens.  After killing a Triumph Vanguard (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37923#drops) or Wildhammer Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=37977#drops) (both in the Battle Scar), use Calder's Bonesaw (http://www.wowhead.com/item=49948).  Chopping these corpses up yields anywhere from 1-3 Severed Extremities (http://www.wowhead.com/item=49945).\n\nI recommend doing this quest in conjunction with Flightmare (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24631).",
