        },
        {
            id = 3292049,
            score = 1,
            author = "2201631",
            text = "Here is the full storyline quest and broadcast text, played as a Nightborne Mage.\n\nStoryline Overview:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25064\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24622\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24623\n>https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24624\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24625\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24626\n\nLocation: Darkspear Hold in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Moraya has been lookin' for some help with tha raptors. Ya should talk to her on the other side of Darkspear Hold when ya get a chance.\n\n[Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38005.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38005:Hey there, hon. Vol'jin sent you? So sweet of him to be thinkin' of me.\n\nI surely could use da help, but ya have a bit more walkin' ahead of ya.\n\nIf ya lookin' for something ta do, we need some more raptors moved over to da pens. If ya head over to da island south of here, you can be meetin' with our caretakers and dey can set ya up.\n\nDey might appreciate a hand too. Got ta be spreadin' da love, ya know?\n\nLocation: Bloodtalon Shore in [zone=6453]\n\n[Speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=37969 on Bloodtalon Shore.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37969:Nice ta see new faces 'round here, mon. It's easy ta get ta feelin' isolated since we left Orgrimmar.\n\nI actually have somethin' really important dat I could use help with, if ya be willin', mon.\n\nOur hatchlins' are bein' stolen by someone on da next island. At first I thought dey were just runnin' away or that nature be claimin' dem, but we are missin' more than a dozen of da little guys now.\n\nPlease head to Zalazane's Fall to da northwest and point da little hatchlins back dis way. Poor tings.\n\nLocation: Zalazane's Fall in [zone=6453]\n\n[Use the https://www.wowhead.com/item=52283 to rescue 12 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=39157s.]\n\nLocation: Bloodtalon Shore in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37969:Thank ya so much! They can be vicious when provoked, but most of da time dey don't know betta.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37987:The fiend who stole our raptors has been corruptin' dem with some kind of magic. Now dat dey've grown with dis corruption inside of them, I fear dere's little we can be doin' to save dem outside grantin' them da peace of death. Go ta Zalazane's Fall, northwest of here, an' see da task done.\n\nI hope ya can stomach dae work. I don't tink I could bring myself ta do da deed, even knowin' that it be needed.\n\nLocation: Zalazane's Fall in [zone=6453]\n\n[Kill 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=37961s.]\n\nLocation: Bloodtalon Shore in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37987:Thank you, .\n\nIt will be takin' brave and determined people like you ta drive da Darkspear up again. I hope dere are more people even half as dedicated to come.\n\nI been investigatin' our corrupted Bloodtalons troubles and I think I've found da source. A lone naga. He was holdin' a red orb aloft over our hatchlings and I could see dem... changin'.\n\nI'm certain he tinks his thievery and spellcastin' have gone unnoticed, so ya should be able ta catch him unawares. Kill dis naga and bring me back dat vile orb - you'll be findin' him to da northwest, at Zalazane's Fall.\n\nLocation: Zalazane's Fall in [zone=6453]\n\n[Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=39072 and retrieve his orb (https://www.wowhead.com/item=50018).]\n\nLocation: Bloodtalon Shore in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37987:Da naga have been our enemies for a long, long time, and our previous encounters with dem have not gone well. It be clear dat dis time will be different. Tings have changed, and you be part of dat change.\n\nWell done, ! Dis naga has set us back quite some time, but nothin' will be holdin' us down foreva.\n\nIt's good ta be havin' ya wit us, . Ya have a fierce heart within ya.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37969:Ya be a good one, .\n\nMoraya was askin' for new raptors ta train. We shouldn't keep her waitin' any longa! I have a few other recruits bringin' some over as well, but I have a special one dat I've been promisin' Moraya for a while.\n\nSwiftclaw be one of our fastest and bravest young raptors yet, but he can be a bit unruly. I'll lend ya da lasso, I just need ya to catch him somewhere on da island here and steer him over to da pens on da main isle. I doubt he'll be makin' it easy on ya though.\n\n[Capture https://www.wowhead.com/npc=37989 and bring him back to the pens near Darkspear Hold.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38005:Swiftclaw! Kijara was tellin' me about him and he sounded like he'd be a handful. I don't mind da challenge - it's da spirited ones like dat that be makin' da bravest and truest companions when real times of need be comin'.\n\nTank ya, hon. Ya've been very helpful.",
            date = "2021-01-18T01:14:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24624#comments:id=3292049",
        },
    },
    [24625] = {
        {
