        {
            id = 1180981,
            score = 6,
            author = "707790",
            text = "Given in Desolation Hold in the South Barrens.  There are Wildhammer mercenaries flying around on white hippogryphs.  Target one of the hippogryphs and use the hook (http://www.wowhead.com/item=50031).  From what I can tell, the hook has a pretty decent range.\n\nOnce you hook the mercenary, he comes to you and you just melee him down.\n\nI also recommend doing this in conjunction with Parts-is-Parts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24619) (also given in Desolation Hold) because you can chop the mercenaries up.",
            date = "2010-11-24T09:57:27-06:00",
