            text = "Run West of the camp and you will see a small pit full of spikes.\n\nRun a bit further west and you will find young diemetradons, use the meat on one and lure it into the pit of spikes.",
            date = "2012-04-22T03:03:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24697#comments:id=1657124",
