            text = "Finally, I humbly request that you cease venting your hostility 'pon my good squire.\n\nI laughed heartily at this last part of the blessing request.\n\nAnyway, to add in some useful information: sometimes you approach a Steaming Fury and instead of asking for a blessing, Max will start attacking it. And then tell me off reproachfully for killing them. I'm not sure if this is a bug, but you should just keep trying and carefully approach the Steaming Fury until he yields his blade and drops on one knee.",
