        {
            id = 1203093,
            score = 11,
            author = "Xaerjin",
            text = "The colored crystals that once were placed randomly all over the map have now been split into quadrants of the map. As I was picking them up today I noticed that I've been finding them in different areas from where they are shown on the map above. Here's what I found:\n\nBlue: Southeast\nGreen: Northeast\nRed: Southwest\nYellow: Northwest.",
