            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24720#comments:id=1210600",
        },
        {
            id = 1266298,
            score = 5,
            author = "487694",
            text = "The proportions you need to get the final power crystals has also changed. Whereas you needed ten of two different crystal colours you now need eight of the primary colour for that area and six of one of the other colours:\n\nCrystal Charge: 6 Red + 8 Yellow\nCrystal Restore: 8 Yellow + 6 Green\n\nWestern Crystal Pylon:\n\nCrystal Ward: 8 Red + 6 Green:\nCrystal Yield: 6 Blue + 8 Red\n\nEastern Crystal Pylon:\n\nCrystal Force: 8 Blue + 6 Green\nCrystal Spire: 8 Blue + 6 Yellow\n\nSo with just 18 greens but 22 each of the other colours you can get a batch of each kind.",
            date = "2010-12-29T16:03:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24720#comments:id=1266298",
        },
    },
