        },
        {
            id = 1511720,
            score = 15,
            author = "725312",
            text = "\"Excellent, these should do the trick.  And now, if you'll permit me, in case anyone's listening...\n\nTHANKS FOR DIGGING ALL OF THESE BONES OUT OF THE GROUND FOR AND NOT HURTING THE NATIVE BEASTS IN ANY WAY.\n\nWhether you really did or didn't, I don't want to know.  Let's keep it that way, shall we?  Here - maybe this will keep your lips shut on the whole thing.  Anything to get out of here alive, I say!\"\n\nHis caps, not mine.",
            date = "2011-09-06T22:45:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24730#comments:id=1511720",
        },
        {
