    [24733] = {
        {
            id = 1184185,
            score = 61,
            author = "tarax",
            text = "Make sure you add the bait, and then use the pheromone mixture. I had no problem with this quest. I found the rock at 70,40 right in the middle of a bunch of juvenile bloodpetals",
            date = "2010-11-25T08:15:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24733#comments:id=1184185",
        },
        {
            id = 2003246,
            score = 13,
            author = "Sinnoh1996",
            text = "You can find the https://www.wowhead.com/item=11569 and the https://www.wowhead.com/item=11570 in the bag(https://www.wowhead.com/item=11568) provided to you from the npc for the quest.",
            date = "2014-09-16T11:04:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24733#comments:id=2003246",
        },
        {
            id = 2315116,
            score = 13,
            author = "Wowzir",
            text = "As of this date, I found the rock (definitely not black at this point, shades of green) at [70.1, 40.9].  This is the approximate center of the rock.\n\n/way Un'Goro Crater 70.1, 40.9 Un'Goro Flat Rock\n\nIt is about 1/2 a Gnome higher than the surrounding flat area and about 2 1/2 Gnomes long on the longest measurement in the horizontal plane.\n\nNo problems on obtaining or completing the quest other than poor precision on the stated coords and uncertainty as to which point in time rock location and/or description changed.\n\nMy suspicion is that many people were at the right spot as most of the coordinates given since Patch 4.0.3 are adequate to get one reasonably close.  Perhaps many were (like I) looking for a black rock initially.\n\nThanks and congratulations to Pynda for getting the coords exactly right!  In light of THAT, I choose to believe the rock was black at the time of Pynda's comment.\n\nIn the full disclosure department, I must admit that I had not specifically checked Pynda's coordinates before finding the rock from alternate comments.\n\nError on other coordiates given:\n\"70.1 - 41.0\"    2 yards\n\"70,41\"            3 yards\n\"70,40\" and \"70, 40\"     22 yards\n\nInterestingly, the \"70, 40\" is the only characterization which can be successfully copied and pasted into the text entry box for use with Tomtom (which IMO is the \"gold standard\" of coordinate addons) following an entry of \"/way \".  Each of the others will require \"massaging\" to get a valid waypoint.\n\nFYI, in Tomtom coordinates, the comma between the two coordinate entries is strictly optional, HOWEVER, the space is not.  If you omit the space, the presence or absence of the comma can do nothing to allow a successful result.\n\nThe Un'Goro Crater Zone is quite unique in it's nearly perfect circular shape.  This results in a minimum of waste for either coordinate and accordingly, the error for incorrect coordinates (whether due to lack of precision, round-off (correctly rounded or not), or typographical error) is much smaller for Un'Goro than a zone which covers much more real estate in one coordinate than the other.\n\nIn many zones, the 22 yards above (presumably an incorrect round off, unadvisable truncation, or perhaps the user was not displaying to the first decimal point in the coordinate display) would become an error well in excess of a hundred yards.\n\nAs a matter of personal preference, I try to provide a fully functional Tomtom coordinate entry including the proper zone identification.",
            date = "2016-03-18T11:48:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24733#comments:id=2315116",
        },
        {
            id = 1626569,
            score = 11,
            author = "948993",
            text = "This quest has changed. New location of the rock is 70/41. At the bend in the river described in the quest details.",
            date = "2012-02-14T19:44:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24733#comments:id=1626569",
        },
        {
            id = 3212261,
            score = 8,
            author = "WokkaD",
            text = "The rock is at 70 41\nYou open the supplied https://www.wowhead.com/item=11568 to obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=11569 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=11570\nYou place https://www.wowhead.com/item=11569 on the rock first.\nYou then add https://www.wowhead.com/item=11570\nMove back or you will be attacked straight away.\nKill and loot https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9684\n\nYou can summon https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9684 multiple times, but you only get https://www.wowhead.com/item=11510 once.\nIf the https://www.wowhead.com/item=11569 is still there, you only need to add https://www.wowhead.com/item=11570\nFor hunters : he is tameable. He's a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=6506",
            date = "2020-06-13T23:10:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24733#comments:id=3212261",
        },
    },
