        {
            id = 3127126,
            score = 7,
            author = "Slavrix",
            text = "For anyone who cannot hand this in at a higher level.\nThis was the official response from a GM\n\nIssue ID: #67654139\n\nYour ticket has received the following response:\n\nHeya! How is it going?\nGame Master Eciaya here. Thank you so much for your patience today, mate! I hope this message finds you well. :)\n\nIf you cannot see Vol'jin on the Echo Isles (Troll starting area) - this is because your character has progressed too far in the game's story, to the point where Vol'jin is killed. You will not be able to hand the quest in due to that.\nAs the Echo Isles quests are not necessary for Loremaster, so you may abandon the quest to continue your adventure. :)\n\nIf you have no other questions, please help us to mark this case as resolved on this page: https://us.battle.net/support/en/case/ and fill up the following survey! We are really appreciated hearing any feedback or suggestions from you.^^\n\nMay life bestow you with epic loots and legendary journeys!\nGame Master Eciaya\nBlizzard Entertainment",
            date = "2019-06-16T20:22:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24755#comments:id=3127126",
        },
        {
            id = 3304985,
            score = 4,
            author = "Cadiencie",
            text = "You can turn this quest in, even if you have progressed to the point that Vol'jin has died, by quest synching with a fresh character (preferably a troll) who is working through the Echo Isles quests.\n\nThis is from the response to my ticket:\n\nI am Gromnaskod, High Warlord of the Horde, and Game Master of these lands. We have been busy, fighting off the Black Dragonflight of Blackwing lair, so I appreciate your patience during the wait.\n\nI understand that you're having trouble with the quest More Than Expected and not being able to turn it in.\n\nThis is due to the progress you have already made in the story and as a result Vol'jin is no longer there.\n\nWhile it is true that the quest is not needed and can be safely abandoned if you truly must have it complete you can use the party sync feature with a low lvl troll and that way you will be in their phasing and you should be able to turn it in then.\n\nI hope this helps you out.\n\nWishing you luck and hoping you have a good day.\nGromnaskod.",
            date = "2021-02-28T18:45:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24755#comments:id=3304985",
        },
        {
            id = 3292036,
            score = 1,
            author = "2201631",
            text = "Here is the full storyline quest and broadcast text, played as a Nightborne Mage.\n\nStoryline Overview:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24750\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24751\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24753\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24754\n>https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24755\n\nLocation: Darkspear Shore in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=37951:Tha Darkspear tribe have long been victims. Outcasts. We found ourselves fleein' our homes time 'n time again... but dis time, it's not fleein' dat drives us here.\n\nVol'jin has offered us leadership through wisdom, and it has kept us alive dis long. Now dat same wisdom offers portents of a chaotic future for tha Horde unda Garrosh Hellscream.\n\nNo, dis time we not fleein'. Dis time, we are fightin' for a home dat will last.\n\nIt's time to begin ya trainin', . Speak with Soratha to the east.\n\n. Zuni. Ya'll find ya trainer in the trainin' grounds to the east. Bring pride to the Darkspear.\n\nLocation: Darkspear Training Grounds in [zone=6453]\n\n[Meet with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38246 in the Darkspear Training Grounds.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38246:Anotha newblood, eh?\n\nYa actually have an intense look about ya though. Fiery eyes. You might have the makings of a real .\n\nLets not waste anymore time 'den.\n\nAlright, mon. We start simple. I need ta know dat you know the basics of the arcane arts.\n\nGo thrash dose tiki targets. Take it slowly. Natural-like. I'll watch how you form your casts and we'll go from dere.\n\n[Destroy 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38038s.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38246:Not bad, mon. Ya have a natural flow to ya spells - you may have a talent for dis.\n\nSome rough edges ta be sure, but we'll get dose ironed out here and I'll teach ya a few new tings as we go.\n\nLets put dose skills ta use. I'll start ya off easy, mon.\n\nThere be cats killing our boars. Dat food ain't for sharin'. Dose boars are gonna need ta be alive if ya be wanting food tonight.\n\nDey're all over the island. Bring me some cat pelts.\n\n[Retrieve 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=50222s.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38246:I doubt dey too much of a challenge, mon, but they'll still claw up ya ankles if ya don't stay quick footed.\n\nDese are some fine pelts, boy. We could make some hefty cloaks outta dese.\n\nYa done quite well for ya'self, . I'm sure I could teach ya a trick or two here and dere, but I not be wastin' ya time on tiki targets no longer.\n\nl put one last trial before ya den, mon. Head over to da provin' pit in the middle of dis area and fight a real baddy - one dat wants ta kill ya back. Just let the jailor by the pit know when ya ready.\n\n[Speak to a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=39062, then enter the proving pit and kill a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38142.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=39062:Get in the pit and show us your stuff, boy.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38142:They sssend you to your death, youngling.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38246:Well done, !\n\nYa handle yerself quite well. Ya gonna be quite powerful some day.\n\nYa definitely more den expected, mon. I'm sure dere's more important stuff we can be usin' ya talents on now. Ya don't need ta hang out with da newbloods no more.\n\nHead down to da village to da southeast and make yaself known. Lend a hand here and there and I'm sure ya make yer way up to sometin' more prestigious quick enough.\n\nLocation: Darkspear Hold in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Ya tha new recruit everyone's talkin' about, eh? Welcome ta tha Darkspear.\n\nI have sometin' to show ya. It be easier to understand if ya see it yourself.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38938:Don't talk back to me, troll.  You know who was left in charge here.  Haven't you stopped to ask yourself why Thrall chose me instead of you?\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38953:Dere be no question why, Garrosh.  He gave ya tha title because ya be Grom's son and because tha people be wantin' a war hero.\n\nI tink ya be even more like ya father den ya thought, even witout da demon blood.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38938:You are lucky that I don't gut you right here, whelp.  You are foolish to think that you can speak to your Warchief in such ways.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38953:Ya be no Warchief of mine.  Ya not earned my respect and I'll not be seein' tha Horde destroyed by ya foolish thirst for war.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38938:And what exactly do you think that you are going to do about it?  Your threats are hollow.  Go slink away with the rest of your kind to the slums, I will endure your filth in my throne room no longer.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38953:I know exactly what I'll be doin' about it, son of Hellscream.  I'll watch and wait as ya people slowly become aware of ya ineptitude.  I'll laugh as dey grow ta despise ya as I do.\n\nAnd when tha time comes dat ya failure is complete and ya \"power\" is meaningless, I will be dere to end ya rule swiftly and silently.\n\nYa will spend ya reign glancin' over ya shoulda and fearin' tha shadows, for when tha time comes and ya blood be slowly drainin' out, ya will know exactly who fired tha arrow dat pierced ya black heart.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38938:You have sealed your fate, troll.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38953:And you yours, \"Warchief.\"\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Tha Darkspear are 'ere because I led dem here.  Orgrimmar be no home as long as it be under Hellscream's hand.\n\nStill, I fear I was lettin' my temper drive me ta bein' rash. Thrall devoted himself to makin' the Horde what it is, so I've no eagerness to be leavin' it on a whim.  Dis will be needin' much more thought.\n\nBut dese be worries for older minds.  Ya still have much to learn.  Go help tha people of tha Darkspear.  I am sure we'll be speakin' again real soon.",
            date = "2021-01-18T00:44:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24755#comments:id=3292036",
        },
    },
