            text = "I had the same issue today while completing old quests. I submitted a ticket & a GM got back to me & was able to figure out why he wasn't there for me. He said myself & other level 100's have progressed too far, so Vol'jin in already dead in our current world so he can't appear to us there to turn the quest in, therefore there is no way to complete it. He advised me to abandon it as it doesn't have any follow-up quests & won't affect anything.",
