            text = "For anyone who cannot hand this in at a higher level.\nThis was the official response from a GM\n\nIssue ID: #67654139\n\nYour ticket has received the following response:\n\nHeya! How is it going?\nGame Master Eciaya here. Thank you so much for your patience today, mate! I hope this message finds you well. :)\n\nIf you cannot see Vol'jin on the Echo Isles (Troll starting area) - this is because your character has progressed too far in the game's story, to the point where Vol'jin is killed. You will not be able to hand the quest in due to that.\nAs the Echo Isles quests are not necessary for Loremaster, so you may abandon the quest to continue your adventure. :)\n\nIf you have no other questions, please help us to mark this case as resolved on this page: https://us.battle.net/support/en/case/ and fill up the following survey! We are really appreciated hearing any feedback or suggestions from you.^^\n\nMay life bestow you with epic loots and legendary journeys!\nGame Master Eciaya\nBlizzard Entertainment",
            date = "2019-06-16T20:35:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24787#comments:id=3127130",
        },
    },
    [24794] = {
        {
            id = 1808906,
            score = 53,
            author = "BossInvader",
            text = "I have GM conformation as to why myself and others are unable to even acquire this quest.  It seems that others like myself are higher level for this zone and completed another quest in this particular chain that they lead up to called \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24693\".  Once you complete Mossy Pile (which is supposed to be further ahead) you can not go backwards in the quest chain and acquire \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24794\" ever again.  I was told that it is a Bread Crumb quest and will in no way effect my outcome for the zone completion.  To add, I also had my wife fly to Un'Goro on her account and got the quest immediately from Krakle, she was unable to share it with me as well so that is not a bypass for this.\n\nScreen Shot of my informative talk with the GM.  Wasn't sure if we are supposed to have a GM's name out there so I covered it just in case:  http://i.imgur.com/HsiV31a.png\n\nThumb this up so others can see the official reasoning for this \"issue\" and that it is not a bug! (For those wondering, relevant still as of 10.2+)",
            date = "2013-02-04T01:51:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24794#comments:id=1808906",
