        {
            id = 1700256,
            score = 1,
            author = "Ellinna",
            text = "Anything that allows you to walk on water or that makes you big enough to walk through the water is best for this. But make sure you bring more than one of those items if it disappears when you take damage, for sometimes a Southsea Scoundrel will appear when you grab the supplies.\n\nThis quest is best done with Puddle Stomping, which is given by the same quest giver.",
