            text = "whether it is new with 4.1 or simply I don't remember doing the prerequisite quests to open the quests offered by Zeke Bootscuff . The Quest Chain that leads into Zeke Bootscuff quests are as follows:\n1.Dead Man's Chest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24927)\n2. Booty Duty (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24949)\n3. To The Ground (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24928)\n4.Going Off-Task (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25534)\n5. Filling Our Pockets (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25541)\n6. Captain Dreadbeard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24950)",
