        },
        {
            id = 1599136,
            score = 8,
            author = "93453",
            text = "If you're doing this quest and thinking, \"I wonder what those eggs that are all around here are for, am I missing a quest?\" then I have an answer for you.\n\nThe eggs in the noxious lair are for Poached, Scrambled, or Raw? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13916) - part of the Venomhide Ravasaur (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=64659) daily chain that starts in Un'Goro.\n\nIf you are doing this at-level, don't worry, you can't get that quest yet.",
            date = "2011-12-20T00:22:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24957#comments:id=1599136",
