            text = "Recently I made a new undead character and had issues finding Darnell. I had forgotten that this quest sometimes glitches. To make him show up, run ahead a bit, until you reach the Rotbrain Encampment. Then turn around and walk back towards where Darnell was supposed to be. Works for me, he always shows up that way. :3",
