        {
            id = 1185407,
            score = -5,
            author = "30736",
            text = "If you're interested in finding out a pretty vital part of the Lilian Voss story chain (Like I was), make sure you loot them until A Scarlet Letter (http://www.wowhead.com/item=52079) drops. I (like many others) didn't bother looting the mobs and missed out on the story, didn't realise until it was too late.\n\nIt's sloppy of Blizzard in my opinion, to base a big piece of the story from the main zone quest chain on a drop off a mob you only kill for a quest that doesn't require you to loot the mob in question",
            date = "2010-11-25T16:34:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24980#comments:id=1185407",
        },
    },
