            text = "There are a few prereq quests before you can pick this up.  He will first only offer you [quest=25003 domain=www].  Then, after that is completed you have to do [quest=25004 domain=www] and [quest=25029 domain=www] from him before he will offer you this quest chain.\n\nEdit: Links.",
