            text = "If you're here to start the decor chain, here's what you have to do.\nMy hunter had done the dark ranger stuff prior.  When I took the portal from Org to UC-Zidormi was in her spot.  She gave me the option to get old UC back.  The vendor is there but it said I hadn't done the quest. So I flew out and went up to this guy.\n[npc=1500 domain=www]\nGe starts the chain that leads to this quest.  The turn in is upstairs in the tower in Brill.",
