    [25035] = {
        {
            id = 1604844,
            score = 8,
            author = "304770",
            text = "Since there are no [class=2] or [class=6] versions of the quest chain that begins with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=24776, none of the Echo Island quests unlock for these two classes.",
            date = "2011-12-31T19:33:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035#comments:id=1604844",
        },
        {
            id = 1178939,
            score = 6,
            author = "707108",
            text = "He's on the northern most island outside Spitescale Cavern.",
            date = "2010-11-23T19:06:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035#comments:id=1178939",
        },
        {
            id = 3292067,
            score = 1,
            author = "2201631",
            text = "Here is part 1 of 2 (part 2 of 2) (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035/breaking-the-line#comments:id=3292068) of the full storyline quest and broadcast text, played as a [race=27] [class=8].\n\nStoryline Overview:\n>https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24812\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24813\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24814\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25073\n\nLocation: Darkspear Hold in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38440Vol'jin be callin' for an all out attack on da naga that have taken over our northern isle. Many of our men were already engaged with their forces near da bridge, but several of us are breakin' through their lines ta assault their isle itself.\n\nSpeak to Jornun right 'ere to secure a ride to da isle. Once there, seek out Morakki, da Captain of da Watch. He will be tellin' ya how ya can aid in da battle.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38989:Just let me know when ya ready, mon.\n\nYa want to join the attack on the naga?\n\nPlayer Character:Yes. Do you have a raptor that can take me there?\n\n[Speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38989 to secure a ride to Spitescale Cove and then seek out https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38442.]\n\nLocation: Spitescale Cavern in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38442:Good to have ya, brotha.\n\nVol'jin makes us all proud in dese moments. It feels good ta be tacklin' threats head on.\n\nDa naga have committed great atrocities on our people. Da time ta show dem mercy has long passed.\n\nEnter da cave and kill any naga you find dere. Every naga dead dis day is one less naga ta take us unawares later on. I trust ya will be thorough.\n\n[Kill 12 Spitescale Naga.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38442:Well fought, young .\n\nDis is no casual counter-attack. We be fully intendin' ta slaughter every last naga here and do anything we can ta ensure that dey will have no desire ta return.\n\nI want ya ta place dese fetishes on any Spitescale banner ya be findin' inside their cave. It should prove a clear statement of what we think of their presence here. More dan dat, da magic in dese fetishes will be weakenin' any Spitescale dat approach, which should make dem second guess stayin' on our isle.\n\n[Place 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=52065es on Spitescale flags.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38442:Dat should keep dem at bay.\n\nDa Sea Witch is here, on top of dis very isle. We've been waitin' a long time for dis chance at revenge and ya will be havin' da privilege of seein' it through.\n\nMeet with Vol'jin, up da ramp to da northeast. Let him know when you are ready ta join da battle.\n\nLocation: Spitescale Cove in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Share has returned. Tha revenge of the Darkspear finally comes to pass dis day.\n\nLet me know when ya ready, . We'll not let her slip away again.\n\nPlayer Character:I am ready, Vol'jin.\n\n[Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966 in Spitescale Cove and aid him in killing https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38306, the Sea Witch.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38225:Ya were foolish to come 'ere, Sea Witch. Ya escaped our vengeance once, but the Darkspear Tribe will not abide ya trespassin' again.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38306:You are weak Vol'jin, like your father was weak. Today I will finish what I started long ago - the Darkspear shall be wiped from existence!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38437:Take care of her spirits! We be handlin' Zar'jira.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38306:You were a fool to touch my fires! When Vol'jin falls, you know who dies next!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38423:I'll get the fires dis time!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38306:Not so fast, little troll!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38437:ZUNI! NOOOO!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38225:It be done. Our ancient enemy is defeated.\n\nI been waitin' a long time for a chance to avenge my father. A great weight has been lifted from my shoulders.\n\nI must be returnin' ta Darkspear Hold. Please meet me there once Vanira is done with her healin' of the boy.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38437:I'm afraid there's nothin' I can do for our brother... her power tore away at his soul.\n\nI'll send some watchers ta get his body so we can offer a proper farewell... I wish I could do more.\n\nVol'jin rushed off in eagerness, but I can take us back to safety. Just give me the word when ya ready, mon.\n\nAn ancient score is settled today.\n\nPlayer Character:Take me back to Darkspear Hold if you would, Vanira.",
            date = "2021-01-18T02:07:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035#comments:id=3292067",
        },
        {
            id = 3292068,
            score = -1,
            author = "2201631",
            text = "Here is part 2 of 2 (part 1 of 2) (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035/breaking-the-line#comments:id=3292067) of the full storyline quest and broadcast text, played as a [race=27] [class=8].\n\nStoryline Overview:\n>https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24812\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24813\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=24814\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25073\n\nLocation: Darkspear Hold in [zone=6453]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Tha power d'at burst forth when tha Sea Witch died was immense. I can use d'is power ta enact a vision of places far away.\n\nObserve, youngblood. I want ya ta be here when I make contact wit' Thrall, perhaps it will be grantin' ya insight as well.\n\nTha Sea Witch is dead, our home is reclaimed, but our future still be uncertain.\n\nI've no love for Garrosh, dat much is sure, but leavin' tha Horde is not a decision I be takin' lightly.\n\nDere's only one with tha answers I seek. Ya can stay and watch if ya like.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38939:Vol'jin.  It's good to see you, brother.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Thrall!  I am glad ya be well.  Dere were rumors otherwise.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38939:Indeed.  Someone did try to kill me, but that is not my greatest concern at this moment.  The world itself calls for my aid.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:I must beg ya council, my friend.  I can't be standin' by Garrosh while he be turnin' our people against each other for tha sake of war.  My respect for you does not extend to dis new Horde... I am tinkin' of leadin' my people away.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38939:Vol'jin, I chose Garrosh because he has the strength to lead our people in these trying times.\n\nFor all my supposed wisdom, there have been moments that I've barely been able to hold the Horde together. The Wrath Gate and Undercity displayed that clearly enough.\n\nThe Horde cries for a hero of old. An orc of true blood that will bow to no human and bear no betrayal. A warrior that will make our people proud again. Garrosh can be that hero.\n\nI did not make this decision lightly, Vol'jin. I know our alliances will suffer for it. I know the Horde will be irreversibly changed. But I made this choice with confidence that Garrosh is exactly what the Horde needs.\n\nI'm trusting you and the other leaders to not let this divide our people. You are stronger than that.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:I understand, brotha. I will tink on this and be troublin' ya no furtha. You have a world to be savin'.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38939:Throm'ka, old friend.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=38966:Ya be strong and proud, youngblood.  Tha Darkspear will be honored ta have you fight beside d'em.\n\nDese be dark times, but our people will be stayin' with tha Horde for tha good of all.\n\nThrall's words be true. Dey always be. The Horde is much more den a few old, stubborn leaders and a handful of heroes from Northrend. The people be cryin' Garrosh's name... at least for now.\n\nStill, I be hopin' Thrall will return to us one day. Tha future right now be lookin' very grim... and very bloody.\n\nGo now. Make tha Darkspear proud. Dere are many wars ahead of us, an' I'm sure ya be havin' a part to play in all of dem.\n\nYou've be doin' quite well for one so young. I've no doubts you'll be makin' quite da name for yarself.\n\nGo now, northwest, across da shallows ta Sen'jin Village. Dere you'll be meetin' Master Gadrin. He'll likely have a task or two for ya before ya truly make ya way out into the Durotar wilds.\n\nPlease remember, , we may disagree wit' the young Hellscream at times, but his intentions are noble, and it be very important that we remain united as one Horde. Make da Darkspear proud.\n\nLocation: Sen'jin Village in [zone=14]\n\n[Report to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3188 in Sen'jin Village.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=3188:Welcome, young .\n\nYa come highly recommended, mon. It's nice ta finally be meetin' ya in person.",
            date = "2021-01-18T02:10:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25035#comments:id=3292068",
        },
    },
    [25036] = {
