            text = "If you DC or something and lose the Lillian \"pet\" and can't get it back even if you logout, just solo your way to the tower. Once you're at the tower, relog and Lillian will spawn next to you. This only works if you still have the quest.\n\nSource: My experience with my undead mage about 2 minutes ago. i'm only level 11 AND clothie so you should be able to solo your way there with pretty much any class. Priests might be the only ones with problems, but they still have healing spells and mages don't.",
