            author = "martanius",
            text = "If you wish to start doing quests in Echo Isles on other race than Troll, you first must do few pre-quests before the main troll starting zone quest chain begins.\n\nGo to Jin'thala (https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=37951/jinthala#comments) and do his short quest chain leading to Vol'Jin and unlocking this quest and the rest.\nUnfortunately if your class is not available for Troll race you will not get any quest from Jin'thala.",
