            text = "If you're looking for this NPC, you must unlock itd. You have to complete the quest line in Gadgetzan first, starting with this this Kelsey Steelspark (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=38535).\n\nYou then have to finish the quests with the next Kelsey Steelspark (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=38704).",
