            text = "Finished this quest with no problems, but when I tried to pick up the next one, I got the message \"You do not meet the prerequisites for this quest\" and when I relogged to see if that would fix it, the quest giver didn't have a yellow exclamation mark above his head, and had no quest to give. -.-\n\nEDIT: Found out how to fix this. Go far enough away from the quest giver that he disappears, and then come back. He -should- have the quest for you now.",
