        {
            id = 1286481,
            score = 2,
            author = "129203",
            text = "Normally for quests such as these where you need to collect something from a corpse, it has to be your own tagged mob or else it says \"Target is tapped.\" Not so with this quest. I found a bunch of already dead mobs and was able to use the Butcherbot on them :)",
