    [25131] = {
        {
            id = 1687417,
            score = 1,
            author = "Cakins",
            text = "First!\n\nIn all seriousness, a pretty simple and straightforward quest. Just kill 8 Vile Familiars that are found directly north of the quest giver. On a different note, some of the quest text didn't appear for me when I looked at this quest in my log. It seems that I clicked on the quest giver and accepted too fast or something, but either way it went away when I abandoned the quest and got it again.",
            date = "2012-07-12T16:08:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131#comments:id=1687417",
        },
        {
            id = 1796015,
            score = 1,
            author = "MickMaster01",
            text = "Bugged, you start with one familiar already checked as slain.\n\nEDIT: Never mind, I logged in today and it was fine.",
            date = "2013-01-10T14:33:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131#comments:id=1796015",
        },
        {
            id = 2331944,
            score = 1,
            author = "BloodveinHD",
            text = "Here's a video of my completing this quest. Coordinates are on screen to make finding it even easier. Hope it helps! :)\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0d5eW9Rdkk8 (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0d5eW9Rdkk8)",
            date = "2016-05-17T22:31:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131#comments:id=2331944",
        },
        {
            id = 3250215,
            score = 1,
            author = "Danakovskyi",
            text = "You first need to complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25127 so the NPC offers you this one.\nIt starts the departure serie from [zone=6451] to [zone=14].",
            date = "2020-11-17T10:05:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131#comments:id=3250215",
        },
        {
            id = 3292005,
            score = -1,
            author = "2201631",
            text = "Here is the full storyline quest text up to arrival in Sen'jin Village, played as a Nightborne Mage.\n\nStoryline Overview:\n\n>https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25132\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25133\n\nLocation: [zone=6451]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=3145:I trust the Valley of Trials will teach you much, young .\n\nI was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here...\n\nOne of the Burning Blade - a foul, demon-worshipping cult - has made camp here in the Valley of Trials. He skulks in a cave to the north, and his vile familiars have spilled from its mouth to cause havoc.\n\nAs your first task against the Burning Blade, I bid you, defeat these familiars. Slay many and, if you survive, return to me.\n\n[Kill 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3101s.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=3145:You have done well, .\n\nAlthough the Vile Familiars were merely pets of the darker powers within the Burning Blade, your success against them foretells greater deeds ahead.\n\nThrough my divinations, I see that an item of power - a medallion - hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. We must have it.\n\nFor too long these demon-worshippers have defiled our homelands. Cleanse the coven of its demonic taint by slaying the fel beasts and their leader. Return with this medallion as proof of your deed.\n\nGo, . You will find the coven in a cave to the north.\n\n[Slay 5 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3102s and obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=4859.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=3145:Is your task complete, ?\n\nYou retrieved it!  Well done!\n\nYour efforts within the Burning Blade Coven are key in rooting out this cult in the Valley of Trials.  But I fear they have further aims in our land.\n\nWe have not seen the end of them.\n\nYour trials against the Burning Blade are finished... here in the Valley. But I want you to report your findings.\n\nGo to the troll village of Sen'jin and seek out Master Gadrin. Sen'jin Village is east out of the valley, then right at the fork.\n\nTell Gadrin of the Burning Blade, and that they have reached the Valley of Trials. Discover from him if they have yet reached Sen'jin.\nGo, , and be swift. I fear the evil found in the Burning Blade Coven is but the herald of a larger threat...\n\nLocation: Sen'jin Village in [zone=14]\n\n[Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3188 in Sen'jin Village.]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=3188:Hm... your report comes at a bad time.  The Burning Blade is no longer seen here in Sen'jin, but we will be vigilant in our efforts to prevent their return to the area.\n\nThe orcs are friends of the Darkspear Trolls.  Honorable friends.  We want to help the orcs, but... we need help too.",
            date = "2021-01-17T22:05:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25131#comments:id=3292005",
        },
    },
