            text = "Using Emergency Fire Vaules (on wall) and letting them spray you will make you last longer :). Also good to know for  quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25153",
            date = "2014-01-03T15:42:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25151#comments:id=1931418",
