            author = "104955",
            text = "Tiragarde keep is a settlement from citizens of Kul Tiras. Kul Tiras is currently not on the map, but is between Lordaeron and Stormwind, near Tol Barad in the Eastern Kingdoms. This quest requires you to kill Northwatch humans. Before the Cataclysm and the Shattering, this keep was inhabited by Kul Tiras humans.",
