        {
            id = 1425942,
            score = 24,
            author = "Borelia",
            text = "Oh sweet lord, no. No, this is not a \"reference\" to Jersey Shore.\n\nJust...no.\n\nDo you seriously think any quest with the word \"Situation\" has anything to do with that .... thing?\n\nEDIT:  Humanity is safe for now.  The OP deleted his comment.",
