    [25329] = {
        {
            id = 3238696,
            score = 67,
            author = "Autriel",
            text = "Quest is one of many that was made broken during the Shadowlands pre-patch. I've reported it as a bug.\nEdit: After about 30-35 minutes I got him down to 80% with a friend and the quest worked like it should, him running away. Still the scaling is off on this NPC:",
            date = "2020-10-15T14:49:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25329#comments:id=3238696",
        },
        {
            id = 1182220,
            score = 46,
            author = "349565",
            text = "To get to this you need to come straight into Dire Maul, and follow the corridor until you arrive at a \"T\" junction. In front of you there is a big wooden door, which is part of the scenery. The entrances to the arena are immediately to left and the right of this.\n\nThere is a small entrance to the arena at 43.1, 67.9 (looking at the overall map of Kalimdor). This will take you into the arena the proper way. You will see it on your left as you come into the courtyard.\n\nThe alternative is to leap directly into the arena from above. It seems that leaping directly into the arena from above isn't enough to set off the event. Instead you will need to leave the arena and come back in. There is a small exit near the crowd.",
            date = "2010-11-24T16:17:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25329#comments:id=1182220",
        },
        {
            id = 1422918,
            score = 22,
            author = "239242",
            text = "An interesting note, Azeroth is apparently encircled by two moons according to this representation.\n\nThat is because it actually has two moons, but due to technical difficulties, the second moon (The Blue Child (http://www.wowpedia.org/Blue_Child)) was scraped in BC.",
            date = "2011-05-20T01:11:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25329#comments:id=1422918",
        },
        {
            id = 1678766,
            score = 20,
            author = "Fiskero94",
            text = "To begin this quest you must first complete the quests:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25209\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25341\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25342\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25344\n\nHope this helps confused people like me.",
            date = "2012-06-20T16:30:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25329#comments:id=1678766",
        },
        {
            id = 1344049,
            score = 18,
            author = "745268",
            text = "Get in on Arena and wait. He will start to yell, and start the event.",
            date = "2011-02-20T22:04:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25329#comments:id=1344049",
        },
    },
    [25333] = {
        {
            id = 1542399,
            score = 88,
            author = "892445",
            text = "For this quest, when you get to the arena, jump down into it. There will be a bunch of non-combatants. Face Cho' Gall and wait for him to complete his speech. He will then see you in the arena and send one of his lvl 37 henchmen to fight you. After you kill that guy, another lvl 37 drops down to fight you. After you kill the second lvl 37, Cho will jump into the arena with 2 of his guards...but... no worries as the sentinels show up to fight with you at that point. Just stay alive long enough and the quest will complete.\n\nGood luck,\nTrac\nAvatrac on Medivh\n\nps There is a tunnel at 60.7 32.2 (left side of Broken Commons) that you can enter/leave the arena by.... I jumped in but I'm a bit wacky",
            date = "2011-10-14T03:24:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25333#comments:id=1542399",
        },
        {
            id = 1259094,
            score = 48,
            author = "745380",
            text = "As others said before, this is pretty easy.  Just jump into the pit and defeat the first two mobs that are sent against you.  After that just stay put and do NOT attack Cho-gall when he starts his soliloquy.  Just sit there and enjoy the show.\n\nIf you do attack Cho-gall and manage to pull agro you will not complete the quest (ask me how I know).  If this happens to you just run into the catacombs and wait about 60 seconds then run back into the pit, defeat the 2 mobs again as they're sent against you, and wait in your cozy little ice-block (NOT ATTACKING this time) until you get the quest-complete sign.\n\nHave fun.\n\nSkef/Plake/Dribblefang",
            date = "2010-12-26T00:06:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25333#comments:id=1259094",
        },
        {
            id = 1205931,
            score = 30,
            author = "196807",
            text = "This part of the quest is actually voice-overed. As Cho'gall is a two-headed ogre, he actually has 2 distinct voices. The conversation bits in brackets are the bits spoken by the second head.\n\nAbove the arena, you will notice 4 elementals (Glacial Exile, Rumbling Betrayer, Thundering WIndfury, Burning Exile ) besieging a globe of Azeroth floating over the arena. You also notice Cho'gall with 4 bodyguards standing at the edge of the arena. You cannot do anything to them. As you approach the arena, Cho'gall starts to yell.\n\nCho'gall yells: The sun of life will set forever, as light gives way to eternal night! (Oblivion looms! It calls!)\nCho'gall yells: The Twilight's Hammer is the instrument of this grand destruction, the method of glorious annihilation! (Tear aside the veil! Open your mind to emptiness!) Through us will you find true power.\nCho'gall yells: Join us (Join us!) and be granted strength beyond strength! (Strength! His STRENGTH! His MIGHT!)\n\nThe arena is in a different phase while you are on this quest, entering it will not flag you for FFA-PvP. When you jump into the arena:\n\nCho'gall yells: Behold! The world you see before you has been judged. (Fire, water, earth, air!) All shall perish before the elements! (Burn and drown and crush and suffocate!)\nCho'gall yells: Join us, and embrace the inevitable end. (The Master's power calls!) You will be reborn, stronger than flesh! (Strength beyond form! Power in the infinite!)\nCho'gall yells: Swear your allegiance to me (The master wants! He sees and wants and hungers!) and you will be remade in my image. (Wait! INFIDEL! A heathen among us!) An intruder! YOU! Show yourself...\nCho'gall yells: Prove yourselves, my ogres! Slay this insect! (Blood for the master! Blood and suffering!)\n\nOne of the bodyguards jumps down and you have to kill it. Another jumps down and you kill it too. After you defeat the first 2 ogres that jump in:\n\nCho'gall yells: Enough! I'll stain my hands with your blood! (Hyehahahaha! Murder! MURDER!)\n\nCho'gall jumps in with his 2 bodyguards and casts Deep Freeze on everybody in the arena, followed by Flaming Pillar of Doom. Shandris Feathermoon jumps into the arena with a lot of buddies and interrupts the cast.\n\nShandris Feathermoon yells: Cry havoc, brothers and sisters!\n\nYou don't have to do anything for the remainder of the fight. When Shandris brings Cho'gall down to 5.4m health out of his 7 million, he teleports away.\n\nCho'gall yells: Enjoy your hollow victory, insects. (The darkness comes...) May it console you as your world rots.\n\nShandris and all of his buddies starts to walk away. If you don't exit the arena, Cho'gall will respawn and jump in and Deep Freeze/Flaming Pillar of Doom again and waste another minute of your time.",
            date = "2010-12-04T11:25:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25333#comments:id=1205931",
        },
        {
            id = 2293624,
            score = 27,
            author = "1569320",
            text = "Still very buggy!\n\nAttempt 1: Helped in the fight... The NPC's  all disappeared.\nAttempt 2: Didn't help in the fight... The NPC'c all disappeared (backed away from fight to several meters behind main NPC; also there was another non-party player there).\nAttempt 3: Didn't help in the fight and didn't move from spot of initial ice block... Mission complete!\n\nLevel 43 Sub Rogue.",
            date = "2015-12-31T14:03:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25333#comments:id=2293624",
        },
        {
            id = 3238588,
            score = 20,
            author = "Hordraric",
            text = "for shadowlands pre patch if youre doing this on scaled map it takes ages for boss to reach certain HP percentage. i believe some tunning needs to be done here.",
            date = "2020-10-15T08:30:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25333#comments:id=3238588",
        },
    },
