            author = "CoaFeanaro",
            text = "Yup, their location is still off. They're to the north west of where the marker shows.\n\nBest to do this quest in one go while you're doing A New Cloak's Sheen (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25361/a-new-cloaks-sheen)! Which I wish I had known in advance :)",
            date = "2022-09-11T04:27:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25345#comments:id=5432302",
        },
    },
