        {
            id = 1848735,
            score = 3,
            author = "379501",
            text = "This and the Horde quest The Darkmist Ruins (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=2564) are essentially bread-crumb quests to The Darkmist Legacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25422) and Ancient Suffering (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25423) from Sensiria (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40131). Once you've finished her chain, be sure to get the finishing quest from the amulet: Ally's Return to Vestia (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26401) and Horde's Return to Sage Palerunner (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25645).",
            date = "2013-04-30T20:24:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25350#comments:id=1848735",
        },
        {
            id = 1619201,
