        },
        {
            id = 1289474,
            score = 9,
            author = "slowbeans",
            text = "i was unable to pick up this breadcrumb quest as well. i completed loremaster pre-cata and one of the quests i did got converted to having me completed the quest The Gordunni Threat (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25209) in cata. since the quest To Stonemaul Hold (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25386) is a breadcrumb quest that leads me to a new quest hub combined with the fact that i have already quested in the hub the breadcrumb would have sent me to. i was not qualified to pick up this quest :( on a side note from the best i can tell breadcrumb quests DO count toward loremaster. One way to check to see if you had the same problem as me then the quest Rulers of Dire Maul (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25252) will be unlocked when it is actually a 2 quest chain.",
            date = "2011-01-11T17:20:40-06:00",
