        {
            id = 1518842,
            score = 4,
            author = "athenerus",
            text = "Feralas Whisp's (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40079#objective-of)\n48.9 51.5\n49.9 49.6\n50.3 50.1\n\nThat's are some coordinats. They're circle around big tree's.\nChoose one of them and use  Tessina's Wisp Call (http://www.wowhead.com/item=53101).\n\nKoordinatlar. Büyük ağaçların etrafında tur atan minik whisp'ler.\nBirini seçerek Tessina's Wisp Call (http://www.wowhead.com/item=53101)'u kullanın.",
