            text = "For any old players who can't see the NPC, I found a modern work around I used to fix the problem. Simply level sync with someone in the area and rework through the quest chain. I flew my little buddy all around for an hour until we got to the part in the chain, and there she was! Did the quests, and as far as I can tell from my 2 trackers and the giant exclamation no longer on my map, the quest has been finished. Unfortunately Blizzard in 2020 has yet to fix this issue, but the sync looks like a real work around!",
            date = "2020-08-04T01:35:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25423#comments:id=3221060",
        },
        {
            id = 1632725,
            score = 3,
            author = "Theilea",
            text = "You need to pick up The Lost Apprentice (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25350) to start this questline.",
            date = "2012-02-27T23:54:51-06:00",
