            text = "Like the quest before it, skinning seems to give a 100% drop rate for the hides.\nThese Yetis may also drop an OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon (http://www.wowhead.com/item=8705), which starts a quest and leads to an escort quest.",
            date = "2010-12-27T19:38:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25453#comments:id=1262648",
        },
