            text = "This and Forces of Nature: Mountain Giants (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25469) are follow-up quests from a series of \"Forces of Nature\" quests from Handler Tessina (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40078) at Estulan's Tower (the Highborn camp further west, opposite Dire Maul), starting with Forces of Nature: Wisps (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25407).",
