            text = "This is not a two part quest chain.  Forces of Nature: Faerie Dragons can be done simultaneously.\n\nYou do however have to complete the three (3) part quest chain given by Handler Tessina at the Tower of Estulan starting with Forces of Nature: Wisps first.\n\n[quest=25407 domain=www]",
