        {
            id = 2366886,
            score = -1,
            author = "1669612",
            text = "\"On behalf of Lady Feathermoon, I'd like to award you with this weapon, fit for a Sentinel. \"\nWell? Where is it?.. :(\n\nIn fact, it's not the first time I'm offered a smaller reward - often it's 1-2 items instead of 3-5 listed on this site. Either the rewards changed or some automatic filtering occurs (which is bad as I can't choose a more expensive version in cases of unsuitable stats).\n(And speaking of unsuitable stats - for some reason most of the time I get mob-drops with intellect stat - instead of agility for myself or a proper random variety. Baffling and annoying.)",
            date = "2016-08-13T16:08:12-05:00",
