            author = "Hairband",
            text = "I wanted to take this quest if you get a hippograph to ride there (saves travelling time) but, she didn't have a quest symbol over her head.\n\nAfter looking at the quest chain progression and after noticing I had already accepted the Hero's Call! Thousand Needle quest in my log I was convinced if I dropped Hero's Call!  Thousand Needles, I could pick up her quest with the hippograph ride.\n\nI was right.  Drop Hero's Call!  Thousand Needles and take her quest.  Talk to the regular goblin flight master at Mudsprocket for your Hippograph ride.  No running across Azeroth.",
