            author = "4336",
            text = "You need to follow the quest line of Kelsey Steelspark (Alliance) to enable this quest.\n\nEven though you are lvl 47 and have completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25095, you still need to complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25065 in order to unlock this final fight.",
            date = "2011-08-30T19:57:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25513#comments:id=1507032",
        },
        {
            id = 3230437,
            score = 11,
            author = "exucapp",
            text = "I was trying to complete this quest for Loremaster progress and kept running into the issue of \"not meeting the quest requirements\".\n\nA work around I have found for this is taking off most of your gear. For whatever reason, going down to an ilvl of 116 allowed me to accept and subsequently complete the quest with no issues!",
