    [25613] = {
        {
            id = 1116460,
            score = 461,
            author = "124958",
            text = "The quest description is massively vague on where you actually go. There is an unnoticable pathway inside Stardust Spire, just to the right of the exit into Stonetalon Mountains. The archway leads directly up in the mountains.",
            date = "2010-09-08T18:43:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613#comments:id=1116460",
        },
        {
            id = 1875860,
            score = 115,
            author = "Takata",
            text = "As soon as you accept the quest, turn and face south, you'll see two gates, one on the left heading down into Stonetalon Mountains, and one on the right, you take the one on the right.",
            date = "2013-07-11T17:12:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613#comments:id=1875860",
        },
        {
            id = 1220688,
            score = 56,
            author = "43040",
            text = "YouTube Video: Path to Kalen Trueshot (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NiBa1InPXAw).\n\nI went a bit out of the way trying to find this guy, and I don't like trying to explain what I can visually show you. If you like this video guide. Please rate up. It's what keeps me making the searching videos. Thanks.",
            date = "2010-12-10T03:33:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613#comments:id=1220688",
        },
        {
            id = 1183363,
            score = 35,
            author = "239616",
            text = "path to turn in is at 35.33,72.86, make sure your still in Stardust Spire. Also there is an archway over the path you want.",
            date = "2010-11-25T00:24:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613#comments:id=1183363",
        },
        {
            id = 1183368,
            score = 31,
            author = "708409",
            text = "Huntress Jalin's quests appear to be a prerequisite for this one.\n\nThey Took Our Gnomes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13913)\nThe Goblin Braintrust (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13979)\nMaybe Ze Gnomecorder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25607)\nProbably They Set Them Up The Bomb! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13981)\n\nI think what is supposed to happen is that you have already done her quests and then find \"The Bomb\" and when you turn that in it reveals a hot air balloon heading toward Stonetalon with the giant bomb and then Gnombus offers this quest.\n\nWhen I first turned in They Set Them Up The Bomb! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13981) out of order, I thought it was strange that nothing seemed to appear despite the Sentinel asking \"what's that over there\".",
            date = "2010-11-25T00:26:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613#comments:id=1183368",
        },
    },
    [25614] = {
        {
            id = 1423482,
            score = 22,
            author = "Bignbeefy",
            text = "Clearly the Night Elves are not party to the Law of Armed Conflict.",
            date = "2011-05-20T21:25:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614#comments:id=1423482",
        },
        {
            id = 1191929,
            score = 19,
            author = "Arranja",
            text = "dear god! this is a clear violation of the geneva convention!",
            date = "2010-11-28T00:06:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614#comments:id=1191929",
        },
        {
            id = 1202584,
            score = 11,
            author = "568686",
            text = "To get this quest you have to quest at Stardust Spire in Ashenvale until you get [quest=25613 domain=www] . Then pass through the archway going up into the mountains to get to the quest area.\n\nEnter cannon, point and shoot wind rider, shoot slowly falling orc.",
            date = "2010-12-02T16:31:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614#comments:id=1202584",
        },
        {
            id = 1433964,
            score = 10,
            author = "dstorm78",
            text = "At first, I was killing the wind-riders and not getting credit for the kills.  I was quite confused and thought this had to be an bug, obviously.  So I restarted, reloaded, abandoned and reacquired the quest etc.\n\nAnd then, I actually read the quest and found out you actually shoot the wind-riders and then get kill credit when you actually shoot the parachuting orc that drops out of the killed wind-rider.",
            date = "2011-06-04T08:58:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614#comments:id=1433964",
        },
        {
            id = 1189393,
            score = 9,
            author = "365125",
            text = "Just jump in a cannon and pew pew.  Don't make my mistake of running down to the bottom of the canyon.",
            date = "2010-11-27T02:42:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614#comments:id=1189393",
        },
    },
    [25615] = {
        {
            id = 1183494,
            score = 10,
            author = "708409",
            text = "Completing this appears to also unlock Field Test: Gnomecorder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25621).\nOf course, Professor Xakxak says that he has finally had time to construct the Gnomecorder, in reality this is an indirect way of requiring you to complete Huntress Jalin's quests to free Boog the \"Gear Whisperer\" who you will need to talk to later in the quest chain. Not to mention setting up the whole bombing of Stonetalon that seems to be the undercurrent for all of the quests in that zone.",
            date = "2010-11-25T01:33:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25615#comments:id=1183494",
        },
        {
            id = 1208461,
            score = 7,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "CHASING THE BOMB Quest Tree From Whiterock\nGive + to 11/25/2010 Ravenhurst aswell\n[pre]\n1)They Took Our Gnomes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13913)*\n ||\n || 1)Ze Gnomecorder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25607)* 1)The Goblin Braintrust (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13979)*\n ||__||_________________||\n ||\n2)Do Yourself a Favor (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25613)\n2)The Only Way Down is in a Body Bag (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25614)\n1)Return to Stardust (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25615)-->2)Hellscream's Legacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25616)\n ||\n2)Field Test: Gnomecorder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25621)\n2)Burn, Baby, Burn! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25622)\n2)Bombs Away: Windshear Mine! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25640)\n ||                     ||->2)Don't Look Them in the Eyes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25642)\n2)Illegible Orc Letter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25647) ||->2)Windshear Mine Cleanup (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25646)\n2)Minx'll Fix It (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25649)\n2)Orders from High Command (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25650)\n2)Commandeer That Balloon! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25652)-->2)Just Ask Alice (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25673)\n ||->1)Gerenzo the Traitor (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25729)    2)Mr. P's Wild Ride (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25728)\n ||\n2)Free Our Sisters (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25662)              1)BEWARE OF CRAGJAW! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25730)\n2)Rumble in the Lumber... Mill (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25669)\n ||  ||               ||->3)Preparations for the Future (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25741)\n ||  ||               ||\n || 3)Arcane Legacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25766) 3)Capturing Memories (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25767)\n ||  ||              /\n || 2)Fallowmere Beckons (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25769)\n || 4)Bombs Away: Mirkfallon Post! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25768)\n ||  ||                    ||->4)Schemin' That Sabotage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25878)\n || 4)Gnome on the Inside (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25875) ||->4)The Lumbering Oaf Problem (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25879)\n || 4)It's Up There! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25876)\n || 4)No Time for Goodbyes! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25877)\n || 1)Warn Master Thal'darah (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25880)\n || 6)Save the Children! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25889)\n || 6)Last Ditch Effort (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25891)\n ||  ||->5)Back to the Depths! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25914)\n ||  ||->5)Putting Them to Rest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25913)\n ||  ||->5)Seen Better Days (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25912)        Help for Desolace (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25938)*\n ||  ||\n || 1)Thal'darah's Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25925)\n ||  ||                   ||->7)Hungry Pups (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25935)\n || 7)Ascending the Vale (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25930) ||->7)World First: Gnomegen (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25934)\n || 7)Brood of Seldarria (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25931)\n ||\n ||\n3)If the Horde Don't Get You... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25739)\n1)Tell 'Em Koko Sent You (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25765)\n8)The Deep Reaches (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25793)\n ||_________________________________________\n ||                 ||                      ||\n8)Shuttin Her Down (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25811) ||        8)Leave No Man Behind! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25809)\n ||                /                       ||\n || 8)They Put the Assass in... Never Mind (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25806) ||\n || 8)Is This Thing On? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25808)                    ||\n ||___||____________________________________||\n ||\n1)A Special Kind of Job (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25821)\n1)Death by Proxy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25834)\n1)A Proper Peace Offerin' (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25837)\n9)Sating the Savage Beast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25844)\n1)Terms of Service (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25845)-->8)The Unrelenting Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25823)\n ||\n8)Armaments for War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25822)\n9)Grundig Darkcloud, Chieftain of the Grimtotem (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25846)\n9)Grimtotem Supremacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25847)\n9)Downfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25848)\n1)Dances with Grimtotem (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25851)\n1)All's Clear (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25852)\n\nD)Thinning the Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25671)(Not aviable?)\nHero's Call: Stonetalon Mountains! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28539)(WTB info)\nThey Set Them Up The Bomb! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13981)(Ashenvale quest)\nQuest zones:\n1)Unique zones_____2)Windshear Crag+Windshear Mine_____3)Ruins of Eldre'thar+Webwinder Hollow_____4)The Sludgewerks_____5)Stonetalon Peak_____6)Thal'darah Grove_____7)The Charred Vale_____8)The Deep Reaches+Unearthed Grounds_____9)Camp Aparaje+Grimtotem Post\nD)Daily_____G)Gluing Separate Questlines\n*Click to see more info about that quest-line.\nStonetalon Mountains(Alliance) is done! Leave your comments/sugestions at my comment in Stonetalon Mountains zone (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=406). Thanks everyone who helped me to make it via comments on wowhead and in-game pre-quest tracking. Special thanks to Ravenhurst (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Ravenhurst).\n\n[/pre]",
            date = "2010-12-05T15:15:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25615#comments:id=1208461",
        },
        {
            id = 1189224,
            score = 3,
            author = "Ostracized",
            text = "It's quest text like this that makes me glad I actually took the time to read it. Although most of the new quests usually have funny dialogue in them, I think quests like these help you immerse yourself a lot better.\n\nFor the Alliance!",
            date = "2010-11-27T00:41:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25615#comments:id=1189224",
        },
    },
