            text = "... Who the hell in the Horde writes with kodo poop and blood!",
            date = "2011-03-02T08:07:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25649#comments:id=1354990",
        },
        {
            id = 1385769,
            score = 8,
            author = "401337",
            text = "I was stuck on this for a bit, till I searched a bit harder... here's where the bit** us located :L\n\nhttp://avan-tech.co.uk/images/wow/\n\nFollow the numbers\n\nStep 1. http://avan-tech.co.uk/images/wow/mix1.png (Enter the cave at the top entrance!)\nStep 2. http://avan-tech.co.uk/images/wow/mix2.png (Follow the cave dead straight , then ahead no left turn or right turn!)\n\nStep 3. http://avan-tech.co.uk/images/wow/mix3.png (Of what looks like a dead end isnt.. and to the left she is located up the wooden stairs)\n\n:)\n\nRegards,\nScott.",
            date = "2011-04-06T20:05:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25649#comments:id=1385769",
        },
