            author = "Ainasni",
            text = "His bodyparts are in the orge-caves.\nTorso: (Same cave as questgiver) at 39,37\nHead: (Other cave, entrance: 45,30) at 46,26\nLegs: (Other cave, entrance: 45,48) at 46,39",
