        {
            id = 1402421,
            score = 9,
            author = "617575",
            text = "In Dreadmaul Furnace, where the blood elf gives you the quest, jump off of the ledge behind the questgiver and open the box. An ogre was sleeping on mine, partially concealing it, but he didn't wake up when I opened it.\n\nIn Dreadmaul Post, the box is right inside the entrance.\n\nIn the Rise of the Defiler, enter and go left at the fork. The box is on the right after an ogre or two.",
