            text = "Having a little trouble here, hoping somebody comes along and has an answer. I am attempting to complete this quest as it is a prerequisite for a quest chain for a transmog piece. On my level 100 Orc DK, the quest giver is simply not present. I completed all of the area quests as well, hoping this would unlock him, but no good. I used the macro to see if I had completed this quest, and I had not. I then decided to hop on my 90 Belf Pally and give it a try, same thing, he is simply not there. Okay, would sure love some feed back on this. Thank a ton guys! :)",
            date = "2016-08-31T14:48:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25694#comments:id=2378727",
        },
    },
    [25695] = {
        {
            id = 1598516,
            score = 672,
            author = "111039",
            text = "Edit: What finally...FINALLY worked for me was standing between the quartermaster and the cart. That way the guard on the outside of the camp can't see you. As for the guard on the inside (and thus where you are), you have to be very careful to start reading the very microsecond he passes by you going towards the Dark Portal, otherwise he will see you and send you back.",
            date = "2011-12-18T17:47:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25695#comments:id=1598516",
        },
        {
            id = 1184665,
            score = 126,
            author = "trav88",
            text = "Stand on The cart beside the plans, to remain hidden.",
            date = "2010-11-25T11:19:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25695#comments:id=1184665",
        },
        {
            id = 1201579,
            score = 95,
            author = "Ladria",
            text = "I only read the first comment, so I tried that for about 7-8 times. Getting pissed off at the teleport all the time, I found out I should try something new.\n\n So I stood inside the cart next to the papers, and started reading it the second the guard turned to go the opposite direction (towards the portal). Got it first try, without any hassle! :)\n\n Easy XP and a quest reward :)\n\nIt also leads up to https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25696",
            date = "2010-12-02T03:59:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25695#comments:id=1201579",
        },
        {
            id = 3160347,
            score = 61,
            author = "Agamemnicon",
            text = "This is kind of buried in the comments, so I'm copy/pasting it here.  This is the only piece of advice that worked for me:\n\n---\nKalidyyr on 2019/01/21 (Patch 8.1.0)\n\nI stood directly behind quartermaster apone, not in the cart, facing south towards the box. as soon as the guard walked the path from behind me and passed just to my right, i started. it worked fine. from this position. here's a screenshot https://snag.gy/WabsQN.jpg\n\n---",
            date = "2019-09-30T20:04:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25695#comments:id=3160347",
        },
        {
            id = 1913720,
            score = 41,
            author = "jakeisonline",
            text = "Simply stand right here (http://cl.ly/image/36161y172o2H), and neither guard will see you",
            date = "2013-10-31T23:05:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25695#comments:id=1913720",
        },
    },
