        {
            id = 1556583,
            score = 27,
            author = "Niamh",
            text = "An overview of all the quests needed to get to the blue rewards and all other gear you can earn on your way there:\n(This is mostly Horde version of the quests, but Alliance version is pretty similar.)\n\n0. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28504\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25478\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25487\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25489: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63562 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63563 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63564 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63565\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25505\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25516: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63546 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63547 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63548 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63549\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/spell=75627\n6. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25518\n7. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25526\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25533\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25543: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63554 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63555 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63556 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63557\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/item=55121\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25589: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63578 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63579 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63580 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63581)\n\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25596 (pick it up to do together with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586)\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25610\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25628: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63628 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63629 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63630 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63631\n\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25660\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25661: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63617 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63618 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63619 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63620\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25672\n17. https://www.w