        {
            id = 1551719,
            score = 9,
            author = "821910",
            text = "I feel terrible for this poor hairy guy even though he is kind of a naive airhead. Dude you need to WARD HARDCORE against dreadlords, they're insidious @#$%^&s.\n\nDoofus though Marl may be, he didn't deserve Nathrezim in the brains. My belfadin's a Hordie through and through, but he got sadfaced about this quest nonetheless.",
            date = "2011-10-23T11:24:20-05:00",
