            text = "You need to finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25515 +https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25524 > https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25532 +https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25561 in order to open up this quest. Not sure if you need to finish the Thousand Needles zone entry quest, which you can find if you click the link to this https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25515.",
