        {
            id = 1681770,
            score = 15,
            author = "880040",
            text = "This group of quests is really disgusting, and I felt dirty doing them. But you really have no choice if you wish to proceed in the quest chain. WoW should have given us some options (like killing the greedy, oil-grubbing gnome!). After all, this IS a role-playing game.",
