            text = "You cannot get and therefore complete this quest if you have completed the equivalent quest before Cataclysm.\n(I don't know the link to the former quest, sorry)\n\nI just spoke to a GM about the issue. He told me that I had already completed the quest before cataclysm hit. He explaned to me that they took the old quest and made it to the last part of this questline. So theoretically you completed the last part of the quest chain before the other quests. Sounds funny and to me is very odd storywise but technically it makes sense to me.\n\nI hope this information is useful to others.",
