            text = "Pretty simple, but can be a little confusing if you're in a hurry.\n\nHead to (89, 46) which is slightly Northwest of the questgiver.\n\nThere is a large spiral horn at the top of a hill.  You want to click the very end of it, to \"Blow the Horn.\"  Then Whrrrl will spawn and you simply destroy him.",
            date = "2012-08-31T07:55:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25813#comments:id=1706916",
        },
        {
            id = 1635853,
            score = 6,
            author = "francescamarie",
            text = "\"You dare call upon a lord of Skywall? I will destroy you and cast your carcass back down into the pit of slime from whence you crawled!\"",
            date = "2012-03-06T13:37:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25813#comments:id=1635853",
        },
        {
            id = 1387368,
            score = 4,
            author = "802681",
            text = "Go blow your horn,\ndoesn't really tell u what to do..\ngo up to the big hill and click on the big horn and the elem. will come down..\n\ni looked in my bags for the horn. lol\nguess i shouldn't stay up so late..\n\nhappy hunting",
            date = "2011-04-09T03:45:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25813#comments:id=1387368",
        },
