            date = "2013-07-25T15:47:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25814#comments:id=1880682",
        },
        {
            id = 1385131,
            score = 8,
            author = "810976",
            text = "So let me see if I got this straight.  We try to bribe natives with fake gold for their oil and when they see through it, we murder a bunch of them and then kill their god.  Awesome.  Makes me feel great as a player, Blizzard, thanks.",
            date = "2011-04-06T00:21:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25814#comments:id=1385131",
        },
        {
            id = 1189028,
            score = 3,
            author = "365880",
            text = "Careful, this quest is easy to bug out.  When the boss comes down, lay off him for a few seconds until he officially lands.  Otherwise he'll stay just off the ground and you won't be able to hit him.  Easiest way to tell is to use a ranged attack, just keep trying to hit at range until one lands, then go to town on him.",
            date = "2010-11-26T22:52:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25814#comments:id=1189028",
        },
        {
            id = 1191983,
            score = 3,
