            author = "progz",
            text = "The chest is at the bottom of the ship. The last floor, you'll notice one of them big boat guns at the ground, then towards the left is the chest, with a mob near it. I had some issues finding it, so I thought it be helpful to post this on wowhead.",
            date = "2011-08-03T19:49:19-05:00",
