        {
            id = 1754030,
            score = 5,
            author = "Hairband",
            text = "Her son is Gimlok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1447#.).  I was very curious about him as he seemed to be the ONLY dwarven child in the game.\n\nGranted, there may be a shorter adult model passing off as a child in Dun Morogh.  She is the rabbit vendor over by the ranch.  However, smaller she may, be but child model she ain't.  Why is a tiny child endowed like a dwarven adult female?",
            date = "2012-10-30T20:27:20-05:00",
