owhead.com/quest=25844)\n1)Terms of Service (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25845)-->8)The Unrelenting Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25823)\n ||\n8)Armaments for War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25822)\n9)Grundig Darkcloud, Chieftain of the Grimtotem (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25846)\n9)Grimtotem Supremacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25847)\n9)Downfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25848)\n1)Dances with Grimtotem (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25851)\n1)All's Clear (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25852)\n\nD)Thinning the Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25671)(Not aviable?)\nHero's Call: Stonetalon Mountains! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28539)(WTB info)\nThey Set Them Up The Bomb! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13981)(Ashenvale quest)\nQuest zones:\n1)Unique zones_____2)Windshear Crag+Windshear Mine_____3)Ruins of Eldre'thar+Webwinder Hollow_____4)The Sludgewerks_____5)Stonetalon Peak_____6)Thal'darah Grove_____7)The Charred Vale_____8)The Deep Reaches+Unearthed Grounds_____9)Camp Aparaje+Grimtotem Post\nD)Daily_____G)Gluing Separate Questlines\n*Click to see more info about that quest-line.\nStonetalon Mountains(Alliance) is done! Leave your comments/sugestions at my comment in Stonetalon Mountains zone (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=406). Thanks everyone who helped me to make it via comments on wowhead and in-game pre-quest tracking. Special thanks to Ravenhurst (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Ravenhurst).\n\n[/pre]",
