        {
            id = 1543250,
            score = 9,
            author = "Rhynchelma",
            text = "Tested with new character.\n\nYou need to do the chain Where's Wizzle? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25590) though to  The Mad Magus (http://www.wowhead.com/quest= 25704) and the chain  Negotiations (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25744) though to  Back to Crazzle (http://www.wowhead.com/quest= 25790). You do not need to do any side quests.\n\nThese are the alliance versions, the Horde should be similar.\n\nTo open these two chains, you need to do The Grimtotem are Coming (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=[25486) through to  Circle the Wagons... er, Boats (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=[25561) or the Horde equivalent.",
            date = "2011-10-15T03:57:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25835#comments:id=1543250",
        },
        {
            id = 1189009,
