            author = "406368",
            text = "Quest is very obtainable at lvl 76, and attained achievement after speaking to her SE of the actual Freewind Post.  Follow the SE bridge until it takes a path towards the water, she will be there with the old Salt Flats dark elf, Quentin, as well as a blacksmith that you can repair/sell to.\n\n*Edited to note that at the top of the path there is a 2nd quest giver who gives you https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25872.",
            date = "2011-02-03T09:13:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25836#comments:id=1320271",
        },
        {
