            text = "In the end, you don't end up really freeing Freewind. I believe I've completed all quests in this zone (got the achievement), but Freewind Post is still occupied, and I have not regained it as a flight point for this zone. Sad -- Freewind really has been lost.",
            date = "2010-12-13T14:09:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25836#comments:id=1230585",
        },
