            text = "Quest talk:\n\nGrimtotem Brute (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11912){Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11911);Ruffian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11910);Sorcerer} (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11913) says: Such a powerful weapon!\nGrimtotem Brute (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11912){Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11911);Ruffian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11910);Sorcerer} (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11913) says: The Horde cannot win!\nGrimtotem Brute (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11912){Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11911);Ruffian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11910);Sorcerer} (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11913) says: The Horde shall tremble before me!\nGrimtotem Brute (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11912){Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11911);Ruffian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11910);Sorcerer} (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11913) says: The Horde will taste Alliance steel!\nGrimtotem Brute (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11912){Mercenary (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11911);Ruffian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11910);Sorcerer} (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11913) says: What's this?",
