            author = "EmJii",
            text = "As of patch 7.3.5, this quest is no longer obtainable. Only one Hero's Call leads you now to Southern Barrens.\n\nI have to stay corrected.\n\ntoday i found out that you have 3 breadcrumb quests, including 2 Hero's Calls, that lead you to Soutern Barrens.\n\nYou have to keep the order to be able to do all 3:\n\n1.https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28551 (this one only appears in the adventurers guide, once you hit lvl 25)\n\n2.https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28550 (this one can be found on every Hero's Call Board, as long as you are lvl 25-60)\n\n3.https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25852 (this quest only appears once you quested through stonetalon mountains and completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25851)\n\nDon't accept any further quest in Southern Barrens, to be able to do all breadcrumbs.",
            date = "2018-07-07T09:46:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25852#comments:id=2579175",
