            id = 1813336,
            score = 21,
            author = "sitecow09",
            text = "Cliffwatcher Longhorn used to be the lead Brave (guard) of Freewind Post. Turned out all those times he sent you against the Grimtotem were just to throw off suspicion. It appears that when the Cataclysm happend, he gave the order for the Grimtotem to strike at Freewind, when their defenses were at their weakest. The plan worked, the horde was forced to abandon Freewind and ask the Feralas Sentinels for help to retake it.\nWhile I will admit that it was a really cool twist, im sad to see such a cool looking character turn out to be a villan :(",
            date = "2013-02-13T21:16:41-06:00",
