            text = "I'm wondering if this is a bread crumb quest.  I completed the prerequisite quest \"Strike from Above\" but was not offered this quest.  I checked and found that I have already completed the Amberstill Ranch quest \"It's Raid Night Every Night.\"  Hope someone has the answer.",
