            author = "Niamh",
            text = "How to get there:\n\n1) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28532\n2) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25945 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=77851\n3) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25999 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57471 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57470 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57469\n4) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26001\n5) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26002\n6) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26004 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78054\n\n7) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26010 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57479 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57478 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57477\n8) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26020\n9) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26044\n10) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26045\n\n11) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26046\n12) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26047\n\n13) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26048 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57491 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57490 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57489\n14) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26058 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78306\n\n15) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26059\n16) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26060\n17) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26061\n18) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26062\n19) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26067\n\n20) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26066\n21) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26068 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57507 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57506 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57508\n\n22) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26073 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78346\n23) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26074\n24) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26075\n25) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26076 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57500 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57499 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57498\n26) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26077\n27) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26082 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57497 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57496 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57495 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57494\n\n28) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26097\n29) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26098\n\n30) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26099\n31) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26100\n32) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26101 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78529\n33) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26115 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57512 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57511 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57510 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57509\n\nUpdate: added quests 11/12, tnx trombi (http://www.wowhead.com/user=trombi) and blupache (http://www.wowhead.com/user=blupache)\n\nUpdate 2: moved from reply to normal post, as new system displays larger replies rather weird",
            date = "2012-01-10T02:09:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26010#comments:id=1609495",
        },
        {
            id = 1701531,
            score = 9,
            author = "Salvogpwns24",
            text = "Neat fact: The way the flamethrower works is not a hitbox you need to hit with the flames, it works that you have to be standing beside a tent (within a certain range) and have the full duration go off. Which means you do not need to aim at the tent at all, don't worry about that, just be nearby.",
            date = "2012-08-18T22:59:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26010#comments:id=1701531",
        },
