            score = 12,
            author = "932160",
            text = "Upon handing in the quest, Spy-Mistress Anara will ask you if you did not find any plans on Marshal Paltrow, or inside his tent. Do not be fooled by that: the follow-up quest has been removed and the plans no longer fall from Marshal Paltrow.",
