\n28) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26097\n29) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26098\n\n30) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26099\n31) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26100\n32) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26101 ... https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78529\n33) https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26115 ... https://www.wowhead.com/item=57512 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57511 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57510 https://www.wowhead.com/item=57509\n\nUpdate: added quests 11/12, tnx trombi (http://www.wowhead.com/user=trombi) and blupache (http://www.wowhead.com/user=blupache)\n\nUpdate 2: moved from reply to normal post, as new system displays larger replies rather weird",
