            text = "To get to the cave entrance (which the first comment has shown is at 62, 89), run around the path until ~(68, 84), then turn and go towards the the cave entrance that's to the right of the cave entrance icon you're trying to get to (65, 90).\n\nYou should see a path there that will first take you to the first cave entrance, then follow from there follow the path to the actual cave entrance you're trying to get to (62, 89).\n\nIf you try to go along the path until the 62, 89 cave entrance then turn you'll be blocked by the mountains.",
