            text = "Cave entrance is 62.43 89.76. Up the path into the mountains. The path starts from the main road at 67.19 84.22, by a road sign. The map makes it look like the cave entrance is in the Ravine. It is not. The Kobolds will tank for you but they die quick. It does not affect the quest. Fast re-spawn of the mobs. Do with \"Da Voodoo: Resonite Crystal\", also in the cave.",
