            text = "Her weapon is similar to https://www.wowhead.com/item=10570 a random world drop from Razorfen Downs.  It's kind of rare to see now.",
            date = "2012-03-26T22:54:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26069#comments:id=1645113",
        },
        {
            id = 6141132,
