        {
            id = 1530939,
            score = 28,
            author = "InnaSkadi",
            text = "The little conversation:\n\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says: Oh Masha...\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker yells: GENERAL! Come out from your tent and face me!\nGeneral Grebo says: Foolish old tauren, you dare display such disrespect?\nGeneral Grebo says: What is the meaning of this interruption?\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says: Did you lose this, General?\nGeneral Grebo says: My insignia! Yes. I did lose it. Where did you find it, tauren?\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says:  found it.\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says: On the corpse of my only child, you miserable son of a pig.\nGeneral Grebo laughs.\nGeneral Grebo says: Your boy was weak. Spineless. Just like his father.\nGeneral Grebo says: And as for you,, disappointing. You are a disgrace to the Horde!\nGeneral Grebo says: The punishment for you all is DEATH!\n\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says: That was for my son!\nHigh Chieftain Cliffwalker says: Masha, we have to run. We must get far away from here. They will come for us.",
