        },
        {
            id = 1183789,
            score = 17,
            author = "196807",
            text = "The following conversation starts when you complete the quest.\n\nMoira Thaurissan says: How dare you storm into my throne room and attempt to spread this conspiratorial nonsense!\nMoira Thaurissan says: I will not let you and this treasonous Commander Stonebreaker steal my son's birthright!\nMuradin Bronzebeard says: That is quite an accusation, Moira. It's hardly your throne room in the first place.\nMuradin Bronzebeard says: I know Commander Stonebreaker and I will vouch for his loyalty and his honesty. We must take his word.\nMuradin Bronzebeard says: What cause do the Dark Irons have for taking up arms against Ironforge? Are you unable to control your own people, Moira?\nFalstad Wildhammer says: Muradin has a point. If you cannot govern your own people, you have no place at this table.\nMoira Thaurissan says: Both of you know I would never order such a thing! Why would I set one half my son's inheritance against the other?\nMoira Thaurissan says: No, this is the work of a traitor to both our peoples. Despite my best efforts, some Dark Irons remain in the grip of Twilight's Hammer.\nMoira Thaurissan says: The cult must have someone in the city to coordinate this kind of attack. That only leaves one suspect, Ambassador Slaghammer!\n\nWhich leads to the next quest: Seize the Ambassador (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26118), to arrest Ambassador Slaghammer and bring him to the High Seat",
            date = "2010-11-25T03:44:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26112#comments:id=1183789",
        },
        {
            id = 2271015,
            score = 17,
            author = "Dinoraurus",
            text = "Never leveled around this area before so I had some trouble with the quest, at first.\nAs stated in the comments before, you get back by taking https://www.wowhead.com/npc=42175, which is North West of Commander Stonebreaker.\nThe exact location of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=42175 is at (76, 17).",
            date = "2015-11-02T10:52:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26112#comments:id=2271015",
