            id = 1430151,
            score = 10,
            author = "836382",
            text = "To get the fight started correctly you need to ride all the way out on the bridge, until you pass the overhead section. Then  turn around and go back, Calamoth Ashbeard should be going through his speech and you should be able to target him. Hope this helps.",
