            author = "Nogrid",
            text = "This quest appears to be bugged. There are a few friendly and unfriendly dwarves fighting on the bridge but I can't interact with them. Also, there is no Calamoth in sight, though he will probably show up after the skirmish is over.\n\nI have tried going inside the bridge as well and that doesn't change anything. Occasionally some normal enemies will spawn but nothing comes after.\n\nEdit: I tried this quest again today and it appeared to work correctly. Calamoth gave his speech and became targetable and I swiftly killed him and was on my way.",
