            author = "183073",
            text = "If u pick up or complete Hero's Call: Loch Modan! then you can not pick up this quest so its your choice",
            date = "2011-01-11T19:22:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26131#comments:id=1289629",
        },
        {
            id = 2455579,
            score = 7,
            author = "TheFharaoh",
            text = "For some Hero's Call quests you can complete the Hero's Call quests and the other breadcrumb quest if you pick the Hero's Call quest FIRST and turn it in, but don't accept any other quests in the new zone. You can then go back and pick the other breadcrumb quest. That way you can complete both breadcrumb quests.\n\nThat does not work with this breadcrumb quest though. I tested it with two characters. You can only complete one of the breadcrumbs so I suggest you take this quest and ignore Hero's Call: Loch Modan! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28567/heros-call-loch-modan#comments:id=2455578) as this one gives +10 more reputation to Gnomeregan and a free flight to Pilot Hammerfoot.",
            date = "2016-12-21T16:47:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26131#comments:id=2455579",
        },
        {
