            text = "Decided to fly into Desolace rather than ride.  Picked up the follow on quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14188 before riding out to finish this one.  Didn't get the option for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=14184.  If you looking to complete as many quest as possible you might want to watch for that.\n\nThen again if your reading this it's probably too late...",
