            text = "I've just completed this. When you arrive at Furien he appears to be dead and his mount is hovering over him but there is a \"?\" there.\n\nIt takes a LOT of manoeuvring to get the \"?\" to open but it will eventually and he isn't dead but 'dying'  and then gives you quest, 'My time has passed'",
