        {
            id = 1961661,
            score = 2,
            author = "HotRats",
            text = "Contrary to what Garrosh said, the rank of General _does_ have meaning _if_ you can use one of the items that is rewarded by the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=42028, back at Krom'gar Fortress.  If you find his items useful (click that link), you should fly back there, before heading to Desolace (if Desolace is where you will be going).\n\nOne way to get to Desolace from Krom'gar Fortress is to hoof it via Sun Rock Retreat (due west of the fortress, at 48, 61).  You might as well pick up its flight path. Then take the foot path over the mountains towards Desolace (the path is within sight of the Sun Rock Retreat flight master).",
            date = "2014-04-27T23:49:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26134#comments:id=1961661",
        },
        {
