            score = 34,
            author = "329137",
            text = "I'm guessing that if you already have \"Hero's Call: Wetlands!\" Hero's Call: Wetlands! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28565) you won't be able to pick up \"Checking on the Boys\". Both are \"breadcrumb\" quests leading you to Mountaineer Rharen.\n\nThis quest gives much more experience and rep with Ironforge, and some coin to boot, so you probably want to take it instead of the Hero's Call quest.\n\nEdit: Confirmed. I had \"Hero's Call: Wetlands!\" in my log while I was standing in front of Mountaineer Stormpike; \"Checking up on the Boys\" wasn't offered to me. As soon as I abandoned \"Hero's Call\", Stormpike offered me this quest.",
