        },
        {
            id = 3200027,
            score = 15,
            author = "KnoHype",
            text = "I believe some things have been altered as none of these posts helped me much. I tried flying, stealthing, standing on the barrels, getting on the top of the tent ... nothing seemed to work - except timing.\n\nStep One: Get in position.\nI flew next to the plans and positioned my back to the tent/Dark Portal. (I'm sure standing would have been fine, but I'm a Druid and my flying is life.)\n\nStep Two: Watch and wait.\nI waited to click the plans until the sentry on the right walked passed the stack of boxes, heading TOWARD the portal; that gave me enough time to read them before he made his way back to me - and it didn't allow time for issues with the left sentry.",
