    [26185] = {
        {
            id = 1393007,
            score = 6,
            author = "166187",
            text = "Shayana patrols all around Surwich.  Check the chicken coop, docks, or the inn.",
            date = "2011-04-16T22:37:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26185#comments:id=1393007",
        },
        {
            id = 2058203,
            score = 1,
            author = "1398001",
            text = "How does she knows that the druid is corrupted? He grew a damn forest in blasted lands and he failed. Having not enough power is a reason to be corrupted?\n\nPlease, a bit of sense. Maybe an interquest between this and the last were you talk to the druid and see that he is crazy.",
            date = "2014-12-03T18:42:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26185#comments:id=2058203",
        },
    },
    [26186] = {
        {
            id = 1179515,
            score = 125,
            author = "McKizz",
            text = "This quest reminds me of Russian nesting dolls (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matryoshka_doll).\n\nYou will need five (5) open bag slots before you begin this quest. You will also need to kill three (3) different types of mobs in order to complete this quest:\n\nTainted Screecher (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42338)\nTainted Black Bear (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42336)\nTainted Nightstalker (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42337)\n\nThe Tainted Screecher (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42338) has the chance to drop Screecher Brain (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57179). You need two (2) Screecher Brains for the quest, which you will make (right-click) into Screecher Brain Paste (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=78980). This was the lowest drop rate for me. Go after these first. I killed about 10-15 of them before I got my two brains.\n\nThe Tainted Black Bear (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42336) has the chance to drop Tainted Hide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57177). You need four (4) of these for the quest, which you will make into a Tainted Hide Pouch (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=78978).\n\nThe Tainted Nightstalker (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42337) has the chance to drop Nightstalker Legs (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57178). You will need twenty (20) of these, which you convert (right-click) into Crushed Nightstalker Leg (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=78979).\n\nYou will combine (right-click) the two Screecher Brain Pastes and the 20 Crushed Nightstalker Legs into a Demoniac Commixture (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57183). (Make sure you have the correct number of each item or else you will not be able to make the Commixture.) Once you have the Commixture, you will place (right-click) it into your Tainted Hide Pouch, creating you your Demoniac Vessel (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57184).\n\nReturn to Mayor Charlton Connisport (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42349) in Surwich to complete the quest for 250 reputation with Gilneas and Cenarion Expedition. The follow-up quest is The Downfall of Marl Wormthorn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26187).\n\nRegards,\nTheHavel of Stormrage\nHuman Warlock\n\nEdit: Added information provided by grammarya (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1299085).",
            date = "2010-11-23T22:54:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1179515",
        },
        {
            id = 1784859,
            score = 23,
            author = "MarsJenkar",
            text = "Whose idiot idea was it to force you to abandon the quest the moment you discard any of the quest items, no matter how little you needed them?",
            date = "2012-12-20T21:54:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1784859",
        },
        {
            id = 1299085,
            score = 15,
            author = "669065",
            text = "I suggest going after the screecher brains first.  As you go after these, the spiders and bears will also attack you and you'll get some of the other items.\nI can confirm the low drop rate.  11 bats = 2 brains.  That says something for their intelligence.\nI also suggest not starting to put things together until you have enough.  It eats up bag space.The least number of slots you will need is 5.",
            date = "2011-01-18T11:29:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1299085",
        },
        {
            id = 1249111,
            score = 13,
            author = "736961",
            text = "I actually hated this quest.  Unlike most kill x of thing a, y of thing b, and z of thing c, this one didn't show the status in the quest tracker so I never knew how many more I needed to kill.  I think when you get the quest, the quest giver tells you how many of each thing to find, but the actual quest description you can view later doesn't say how many of each thing you need.\n\nWhat makes it worse is that even after you have enough bat brains, bear hides, and spider legs, the creatures all still show up as red which normally means you still need to kill more of them.\n\nIf it hadn't been for the write-up above this comment, I would never have figured out what to do next and would have abandoned this.",
            date = "2010-12-20T23:20:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1249111",
        },
        {
            id = 1347353,
            score = 10,
            author = "settlestone",
            text = "I'm in accordance with what one of the other people said.  This quest sucks.. but I guess that's the point, because the followup nets a blue (albeit it's not that great of a blue..) and finishes the short chain.  Really though, the quest is really confusing for one, and the drop rates are stupid :P.  This one had me cursing..",
            date = "2011-02-23T15:11:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26186#comments:id=1347353",
        },
    },
    [26187] = {
        {
            id = 6241876,
            score = 70,
            author = "Catnipp",
            text = "If you are here to get the decor piece from Maurice Essman. You need to accept the quest Wormthorn's Dream from Mayor Charlton Connisport who is standing not far from Maurice Essman. This will start a short series of quests that lead up to The Downfall of Marl Wormthorn. The whole chain of quests are:\n\n1. Wormthorn's Dream\n2. Advice from the Cenarion Circle\n3. Demoniac Vessel\n4. The Downfall of Marl Wormthorn",
            date = "2025-12-08T07:11:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26187#comments:id=6241876",
        },
        {
            id = 1179536,
            score = 17,
            author = "McKizz",
            text = "Marl Wormthorn can be found inside the hollow tree in the Tainted Forest (it's a cave-like entrance). \"Throw\" your Demoniac Vessel (http://www.wowhead.com/item=57184) at the quest mob, releasing him from his shadowmourne-like prison (aka: Marl's Shield (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=78986)). Defeat him and return to Mayor Charlton Connisport (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42349) in Surwich.",
            date = "2010-11-23T23:03:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26187#comments:id=1179536",
        },
        {
            id = 1926949,
            score = 14,
            author = "IMissThottbot",
            text = "Incredibly sad quest.  With all the \"cleansing\" and druids about I've no idea why they don't try to \"fix\" him instead.  He seems aware of what's going on, his abilities are all still standard druidic rather than demonic, etc :(",
            date = "2013-12-17T23:34:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26187#comments:id=1926949",
        },
        {
            id = 1985040,
            score = 12,
            author = "nahkhaz",
            text = "In the quest text, the Mayor indicates that the townspeople of Surwich might get upset as they live for Marl. But, seeing as there are only 5 of them...In fact, why do they even need a Mayor at all?",
            date = "2014-07-26T22:28:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26187#comments:id=1985040",
        },
        {
