        {
            id = 1486060,
            score = 22,
            author = "Eladria",
            text = "So going to get downrated for this, but...\n\n... Keeping with Blizzard's \"insanity is the norm\" sense of humor, back during the beta I actually suggested they consider renaming this quest \"Hungry Hungry Hobos\". :P  Don't get me wrong, I'm glad they kept the name though as it just adds to the atmosphere nicely.\n\nThis whole quest chain just really hits home how messed up things are post-Cataclysm, even moreso if you get to see the little mini-event that sometimes happens with the guards and the two transients trying to get in :)",
            date = "2011-08-03T01:58:36-05:00",
