        {
            id = 1200062,
            score = 17,
            author = "690489",
            text = "The mob you're looking for is called Direlob, level 32 with about 3171 hp.\nHe can be found inside the \"Skulk Rock\" cave.\n\nHe has the ability consume which traps you inside him and deals 5% of maximum hp every 1 or 2 seconds (until you're dead).\nAlso, he does seem to have about 4 minutes respawn timer.\n\nEDIT: Killed him now, and but seems that I had to \"bug\" him in order to do so. It is not considered a stun, even though you can't move or use any skills, so you can't blink out of it as mage. However, Iceblock does work. You're 100% stuck inside him, but you can kill him from the inside and he won't attack you.\n\nSo there you go, Paladins and Mages.\n\nScreenshot added",
            date = "2010-12-01T11:33:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26283#comments:id=1200062",
        },
        {
            id = 1182092,
