            text = "Respawn rate on the Direglob is atrocious. Five or more minutes at the very least. Best to group up if you can so more can get quest credit, if not, tag him quickly!\n\nAlso, it seems that some high levels enjoy standing there one shotting him so others can't complete the quest. Gotta love people in this game sometimes.",
