        {
            id = 1179025,
            score = 3,
            author = "286335",
            text = "A good place to get this done is at (54.9, 43.8; map (http://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=40:549438)) Lots of gnolls with a quick respawn rate.\n\n You may consider doing this quest along with In Defense of Westfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26286).",
