        {
            id = 1196267,
            score = 3,
            author = "62855",
            text = "Is there a prerequisite for these quests? I can't seem to get them in Sentinel Hill.",
            date = "2010-11-29T18:14:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26287#comments:id=1196267",
        },
        {
            id = 1302156,
            score = 2,
            author = "Naenthos",
            text = "Take care not to move too far out. The defenders tend to gang up on one gnoll, even if there are three or more nearby. So although there are many defenders, you can still end up with a couple of gnolls after your blood. It's best to pick off those gnolls who aren't attacking yet in such situations.",
