    [26293] = {
        {
            id = 3281501,
            score = 96,
            author = "DreadWolf",
            text = "As of the Shadowlands launch (9.0.2), I've had some problems with getting this quest to show up on some of my characters.  Eitrigg would not have the quest.  I had put in a ticket to Blizzard for help and was met with an automated response that wasn't helpful.  After spending several days trying to find out how to overcome this problem, I managed to come up with a solution that worked for me.  I'm sharing it here in hopes that it might help someone else.\n\nFor whatever reason, it turns out my Grommash Hold was phased because the game had me \"in progress\" for the BFA intro quest but never put it in my quest log.  This was not indicated to me in game and I just sort of stumbled on this being the problem.  This is how I resolved it.\n\nGo to Silithus and talk to Magni. He won’t look like he has a quest to offer, for me he looked like he had a quest for me to turn in but no corresponding quest in my log. When I clicked on him, he did have the quest “The Heart of Azeroth”. He had me go in the heart chamber.\nComplete the following quests. “The Heart of Azeroth” and “Infusing the Heart”. Basically watch the two cinematics, stabilize the heart chamber.\nI accepted but did not actually complete “A Brother’s Help” and “The Warchief’s Order”. (I don’t know if this is required but I waited to abandon these until after I had accepted Machines of War.)\nGo back to Orgrimmar, look in Grommash Hold and Eitrigg had the “Machines of War” quest available to me.\nFrom there, the rest of the quest chain functioned flawlessly.\n\nI do not believe you can actually attempt this “fix” until your character is level 50.  Additionally, if you leveled through Chrome time, there is an additional step as you may not get the phantom “in progress” issue. If that’s the case, you should be able to start the BFA intro quest chain with the “Earthen Guardian” that is standing outside the Great Seal in Dazar’alor. From there, refer back to step 1 listed above.\n\nHope this helps anyone else who is coming across this issue.\n\nEdit:12/27/2023 - just used the list function in markup to make it easier to read. This method still proves to work.",
            date = "2020-12-27T21:55:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26293#comments:id=3281501",
        },
        {
            id = 2583523,
            score = 46,
            author = "JoobJoob",
            text = "As of BfA's pre-patch, 8.0.1, this quest has yet again moved to be given by Eitrigg in Grommash Hold.  This also applies to the followup quests.  I spent quite a while and an unhelpful ticket looking in frustration before giving up and clicking random quest-givers.",
            date = "2018-07-22T12:29:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26293#comments:id=2583523",
        },
        {
            id = 5324397,
            score = 44,
            author = "Phenzer",
            text = "Wasn't able to start this quest line at level 60.\nHad to start BFA to get it.\n\nComplete Zandalar introduction quests up until you get the achievement \"Welcome to Zandalar\" (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12555/welcome-to-zandalar).\nAt The Great Seal in Zuldazar pick up the quest \"The Heart of Azeroth\" (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51211/the-heart-of-azeroth).\nTake the portal to Silithus in The Great Seal, you may need to speak to Zidormi (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=128607/zidormi) once you go through the portal to make sure you are in the correct time line.\nComplete the quests “The Heart of Azeroth” (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51211/the-heart-of-azeroth) and “Infusing the Heart” (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52428/infusing-the-heart).\nYou should now be able to return to Grommash Hold and pick up \"Machines of War\".",
            date = "2022-02-12T11:23:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26293#comments:id=5324397",
        },
        {
            id = 2014689,
            score = 30,
            author = "a1chera",
            text = "The quest chain required  (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28717 )  to bump your neutral reputation with the Dragonmaw Clan to friendly is broken as of patch 6.0.2.\n\nPlease report this bug to Blizzard, it needs to be fixed, because it's impossible for new characters to quest and gain reputation with this faction.",
            date = "2014-10-17T13:57:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26293#comments:id=2014689",
        },
        {
            id = 1216716,
            score = 19,
            author = "Malsherz",
            text = "I found a phasing issue caused by the Arborcide (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14155) chain. I'm not sure at which point in the questline the issue surfaces but having started the chain and not finishing it before the 7th I was unable to see Foreman Glibbs when I approached him, I was able to see him before I got to him(thus the phasing issue).\n\nSimply finishing the Arborcide chain SHOULD make him visible and eligible for turning in the quest.",
            date = "2010-12-08T23:55:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26293#comments:id=1216716",
        },
    },
