            text = "While doing this quest it doesn't specify that Yenniku is actually \"imprisoned\" like it states in the quest info. So to use the gem on him you have to kill Ana'thek the Cruel first and then let Yenniku attack you. You don't have to kill him, just use the soul gem on him and boom. Finished.",
            date = "2014-04-06T16:05:59-05:00",
