            author = "Zarpy",
            text = "These are tiny little spiders that you loot by right clicking on them.\nAs a Tip: Turn on Health Bars, by pressing the V key by default keybindings, this makes it very easy to see where they are. All the Yellow bars are spiders, all the red are the trolls. You can also loot them by right clicking their health bar, which makes it much easier then trying to click those tiny things. Hope this helps!",
