            author = "bladden",
            text = "Am I the only one reacting to the fact that this was for only 5 years ago, and Vanessa can't have been more than about 7 or 8 years old at the time, which means that she's now, 5 years later, 12-13 years old... And I'm supposed to kill her knowing that?  O_O\nI think Blizzard might have failed on that part...",
