        {
            id = 1984276,
            score = 45,
            author = "1091478",
            text = "Once you get down to the basement, use \"M\" key to open a map. You will need to walk all the way to the left on the map to where you see a double circle mark which is the REAL ENTRANCE to The Deadmines (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1581) instance. Once you walk through the entrance of The Deadmines (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1581) instance, use the item: Incense Burner (http://www.wowhead.com/item=58147) to look into its past. After finishing watch the event, get out from the instance and walk all the way back to the outside of the basement.\n\nNote: I found this incredible youtube music video worth viewing about The Deadmines (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1581) (found in this thread):  - Welcome to the Deadmines (Rise to Power 2010 Winner) -  (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qX7ehxyYRQc). This was created by wow players for the WOW Rise To Power Movie Contest 2010 (which is already finished) (http://us.blizzard.com/en-us/community/contests/machinimacontest/rules.html). Check it out!",
            date = "2014-07-25T03:06:10-05:00",
