            text = "I had trouble finding where my little raptor would dig in the dirt.  The beach to the west of the Ruins of Zul'Kunda is where my lashtail hatchling dug up the fetishes.  I just walked around while occasionally killing trolls outside the ruins and there and had all 8 of them in 5 minutes or so.",
