            author = "Drunkenvalley",
            text = "This quest is NOT exclusive to rogue or shaman. I just finished it as paladin!\n\nOh, and WoWhead's coordinates are way off. I think they're still combining Stranglethorn into one zone, but it's been split into two! Just go to Venture Co.'s base camp at the lake and follow the river south from there! You'll find at least one Elder Snapjaw Crocolisk as you go, I would hope.",
            date = "2010-12-01T14:52:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26345#comments:id=1200434",
        },
        {
