        {
            id = 1766353,
            score = 22,
            author = "168405",
            text = "For those who are fond of accurate coordinates :)\n\nDo it in this order:\n\n1. Foreman Cozzle (Cozzle's Key): 54.74 34.12\n2. Cozzle's Footlocker (Cozzle's Plan): 55.81 37.20",
