            text = "Just ran my new Troll toon all of the way up from Booty Bay to complete this quest.  Huge waste of time/effort for Horde IMHO.  My only reward was:\n\n* https://www.wowhead.com/item=3342\n* decomposed boot\n* soft patch of fur\n* ruined pelt\n* https://www.wowhead.com/item=2842 (crafting)\n* and https://www.wowhead.com/item=3343 (8 slot soulbound)\n\nNo pirate anything as the original quest used to give.\n\nNOTE:  Captain Sander's Shirt has an almost nude appearance (tan-like) and might be interesting for humanoids with tan skin.\n\nIf this quest is repeatable, can someone (probably Alliance for ease of access) confirm this?",
            date = "2022-01-22T23:08:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26353#comments:id=5313646",
