        {
            id = 1661182,
            score = 7,
            author = "Glace90",
            text = "Waist is perfect look for alternative for Buccaneer's set for Transmogrifying.\nThis is the final part of the quest however.\nTo get this quest started, you need to loot the trasure map of the Murlocs running around closeby where the Old Jug quest starts, just on the beach. Then follow it quick till the end.\nFast with flying ;)",
            date = "2012-05-01T06:01:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26356#comments:id=1661182",
        },
        {
            id = 2260613,
            score = 7,
            author = "Eido",
            text = "Just to note: you will receive all 4 of the quest rewards upon quest completion.\n[hr]\n\nMore information about the rewards\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=3344 - for Alliance  this sash is the only red version of this cloth model.\nHorde can just purchase https://www.wowhead.com/item=28155.\n[br]\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=2842 - this item is smelted via [skill=186][del](65)[/del] from the https://www.wowhead.com/item=2775 of a https://www.wowhead.com/object=1733, a rare spawn of https://www.wowhead.com/object=1732.\nThe https://www.wowhead.com/item=2842 is also a reagent for a few recipes and still worth a bit on the Auction House (about 8g at the time of posting).\n[br]\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=3342 - since this quest used to be a rare drop, this shirt was once sought after.\nNowadays, many players like to use it due to its sleeveless model, for their fishing attire (http://www.wowhead.com/compare?items=3342:6263:19972:19969:6256#modelviewer:4:4;3552;20;11182;1;15908;8;25459;17;20730:4+1:0), or just for nostalgia. View shirt in 3D (http://www.wowhead.com/item=3342/captain-sanders-shirt#modelviewer:4+1).\nIdentical in model and color to https://www.wowhead.com/item=5107.\n[br]\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=3343 - a standard 8 slot bag. Note that this one is BoP!\nThe biggest variety of 8-slot bags are either drops/fished up or obtained from quests for both factions.\nOne 8-slot bag (https://www.wowhead.com/item=4498) can be purchased by both factions for 25s from multiple  vendors.\nThere are also three 8-slot bags that are crafted via [skill=197]: https://www.wowhead.com/item=4240[del](80)[/del], https://www.wowhead.com/item=4241[del](95)[/del], and https://www.wowhead.com/item=5763[del](115)[/del].",
            date = "2015-10-05T16:04:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26356#comments:id=2260613",
        },
        {
            id = 1248989,
            score = 6,
            author = "694653",
            text = "Captain Sanders can be found in Old Hillsbrad\n[npc=20351 domain=www]",
            date = "2010-12-20T22:05:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26356#comments:id=1248989",
        },
        {
            id = 2142221,
            score = 6,
            author = "ayeee",
            text = "If you did this quest ages ago and deleted the shirt by now, dont panic.\nYou still have chance to have it.\n\nOpen restoration ticket and ask game master to restore it.\nAs this quest have no \"choose one\" option for rewards, they will restore it.\nBut be sure to mention that in your ticket.\n\nIf you want to know if you done the quest or not, use this :\n\nhttp://ZZ.battle.net/api/wow/character/XXX/YYY?fields=quests\n\nExchange\n\nXXX with Your characters realm name\nYYY with Your characters name\nZZ with Eu or Us region you play on, or else.\n\nOR ELSE WHAT? EXACTLY... (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GL1XlVpn8gc)\n\nones you got it, search for this quest id number \" 26356 \" by using ctrl + f or whatever your key are.\n\nIf you can find it, then you did quest before and need ask game master for help to restore it\nIf you cant fint it, then go and do the quests.\n\nHope this helps.",
            date = "2015-03-23T19:11:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26356#comments:id=2142221",
        },
    },
