            text = "It just took me three tries as a level five warlock. First time, I was ambushed by four Crushcog Technicians and didn't live very long. Second time, I had three of the Technicians killed before the fourth managed a critical hit on me and killed me. Third time, I ran to the far right side of the battle and the Technicians only came one at a time which allowed me to live and complete this quest. Hopefully this will help others!",
