        {
            id = 1665142,
            score = 19,
            author = "Andraylia",
            text = "After getting your Quest, turn to the left and click on Kotonga, he will port you to Akil'darah at the middle terrace, which is at the top of the summit where you will then go to the cave with spiders. Once you get to the top and head to your quest keep going south, to the right as you head out there will be what looks like a cave but it is a tunnel and on the other side are level 40's this is NOT the way to go, just keep watch of your arrow to guide you.",
