            score = 39,
            author = "22271",
            text = "Cromula (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=43063), the questgiver, is a play on cromulent (http://www.snpp.com/episodes/3F13.html).\nBort (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=43062) is from the Simpsons episode Itchy and Scratchy Land (we need more Bort license plates in the gift shop!)\n\"Woozle wozzle\" is Bart's failed catchphrase after he loses popularity in Bart Gets Famous (http://www.snpp.com/episodes/1F11.html)",
