            text = "How can someone get this quest?",
            date = "2010-11-26T14:20:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26434#comments:id=1187890",
        },
        {
            id = 1194471,
            score = 2,
            author = "652883",
            text = "It seems the Flem quests are not attainable for people who start questing in 'The Cape of Stranglethorn' prior to questing in 'Northern Stranglethorn'\n\nI'm stuck at 57/60 like several other people.\n\nHere is a link to the battle.net forums on the topic.\n\nhttp://us.battle.net/wow/en/forum/topic/1127156641",
            date = "2010-11-28T21:41:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26434#comments:id=1194471",
        },
        {
            id = 1374648,
            score = 2,
