            text = "You need to do The Holy Water of Clarity (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26433) to unlock Primal Reagents of Power (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26434) and Diffractory Chromascope (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26592).",
            date = "2011-03-24T01:31:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26434#comments:id=1374648",
