        {
            id = 1174216,
            score = 15,
            author = "434395",
            text = "In the PTR(4.0.3a) so far all Garley does when you go to complete the quest is tell you to take some time and check out Booty Bay while she looks it over.  I completed every quest including the 'finale' yet she still will not offer any more quests.\nSeeing as this chain starts from a mob drop (http://cata.wowhead.com/item=58491), I don't know how important it's meant to be... but I was hoping for something... perhaps leading back to ZG?",
            date = "2010-11-18T09:45:52-06:00",
