        {
            id = 1250743,
            score = 7,
            author = "anhsieh",
            text = "Yep, I'll go ahead and confirm Rainemard's comment is still in effect. Stood there right-clicking for a couple of seconds and ... nothing. This is grimly similar to another unfinished questline introduced in Cataclysm, A Hello to Arms (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24458); or, if they're actually finished, they're certainly anticlimactic.",
            date = "2010-12-21T17:48:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26435#comments:id=1250743",
        },
        {
            id = 1434595,
            score = 3,
            author = "838085",
            text = "Maybe That book isn't the ending? The Far Seer in Grom'gol says something about his contacts to the east, but he does not provide a quest to go there. The same thing about the goblin in Bambala, that just talks about Flem to the south. And now, Garley tells you to have a look around in Booty Bay, and if you do have a look around, you might find the book, https://www.wowhead.com/object=207200, Garley's Journal, that Varghedin Mentioned. And in that book, Garley writes that she has \"sent the sample to Silvermoon.\" It really seems like the quest chain could continue, or end, there. But I just haven't been able to find the book, even though I have been looking. In water below Booty bay, and on all the floors of the house that is positioned on the coordinates provided here on Wowhead. If anyone knows where it is, and can describe it, or just make a screenshot, that would be pretty cool.",
            date = "2011-06-05T04:12:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26435#comments:id=1434595",
        },
    },
