            text = "Starting quest for the new pvp daily that scales with level: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26452\nThe daily is the same thing, you will get a summoned NPC of same level to kill. Easy if noone else around.\n\nWhen inside the Arena you will get flagged for combat (different from being PVP flagged) and anyone can attack you, so I advise not to try this during chest times or you in for a big fight.\nJust like the NPC that gives this quest says, anything goes, so be prepared when you enter arena, for what you think that would be a quick quest can end up in getting camped from high levels.\n\nMore info about this Arena: http://www.wowwiki.com/Gurubashi_Arena",
