            author = "336631",
            text = "Anilia had left the camp two days previously, and since she didn't return, Illiyana asked the player to look for her.\n\nNow she claims they were playing together in the woods just the other day. Either Dryads have a very weird view of time, or the person writing this quest is missing something",
