            score = 4,
            author = "Myhv",
            text = "Blizzard should fix the crates, 'cause they are too big atm, since some people can actually see them. It would also be nice if they would make them more of gray-blueish, like the cave around them.",
            date = "2011-03-13T13:33:17-05:00",
