        },
        {
            id = 1606673,
            score = 2,
            author = "452166",
            text = "Yes, folks, the operative word in all of these comments is: CAVE\n\nDon't be a moron like I was.   Don't wander around on top of the rock, killing everything in site for twenty minutes, hoping that a crate would somehow magically drop from a slime or an ooze.\n\nThe crates are IN the CAVE.   The CAVE is around the back of the rock.   And while they are small, they are not that hard to see.  Once in the CAVE you should have no trouble.",
            date = "2012-01-04T21:42:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26492#comments:id=1606673",
