            text = "If you are doing the Trial of Ascension - Bastion Questline - STOP!\n\nDO NOT FOLLOW THE BAILIFF!\n\nGo back to the magistrate and pick up the next quest from him, which is to board up the windows and then follow those steps.\n\nSomehow, the programming from the old and the new got merged. There are no murlocs.  Everything you need to do for the Bastion quest line is WEST of the bridge and in the town area.\n\nGood Luck!",
            date = "2023-01-07T20:52:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26511#comments:id=5522354",
        },
    },
    [26512] = {
        {
            id = 1259790,
            score = 22,
            author = "745748",
            text = "The grave yard you are looking for is at 32.30, 39.47. It is up the road north of town not across the lake. Which I would’ve known if I read the quest.    :-)",
            date = "2010-12-26T10:24:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26512#comments:id=1259790",
        },
        {
            id = 1208962,
            score = 5,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "Guide to Redridge Quests:\n\nDo these at any time:\nNida's Necklace (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26508)\nAn Unwelcome Guest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26509)\nLake Everstill Cleanup (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26511)\nWanted: Redridge Gnolls (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26504)\nFranks and Beans (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26506)\nThreat to the Kingdom (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26761) (from Westfall chain)\n\nOptional prequest: Hero's Call: Redridge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26365) or Hero's Call: Redridge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28563)\nThen a long chain:\nStill Assessing the Threat (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26503)\nParker's Report (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26505)\nWe Must Prepare!  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26510) (available earlier)\n        Completing the above enables: Like a Fart in the Wind (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26513)\nTuning the Gnomecoder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26512)\nCanyon Romp (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26514)\n       A gnoll drops dirt-stained scroll (http://www.wowhead.com/item=58898) which allows for He Who Controls the Ettins (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26519) and Saving Foreman Oslow (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26520)\nThey've Wised Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26544)\nYowler Must Die! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26545)\nJohn J Keeshan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26567)\nThis Ain't My War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26568)\nWeapons of War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26571)\n       Accepting this enables  Render's Army (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26570) and Surveying Equipment (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26569)\nHis Heart Must Be In It (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26573)\nIn Search of Bravo Company (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26586)  (I'm not sure what the exact prerequisties are)\nBreaking out is hard to do (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26587)\nJorgensen (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26560)\nKrakauer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26561)\nAnd Last but not Least...Danforth (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26562)\nReturn of the Bravo Company (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26563)\nThey Drew First Blood (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26607)\nIt's Never over (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26616)\n\nThen do these together:\nBravo Company Field Kit: Camouflage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26636)\nBravo Company Field Kit: Chloroform (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26637)\nHunting the Hinters (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26638)\nPoint of Contact: Brubake (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26639)r and Unspeakable Atrocities (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26640)\n\n(Main chain Continues)\nPrisoners of War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26646)\nTo Win a War, You Gotta Become War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26651)\nDetonation (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26668)\n    (Shadowhide Extinction (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26692) now available)\nThe Dark Tower (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26693)\nThe Grand Magus Doane (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26694)\nAHHHHH! AHHHHHHHHHHHH! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26708)\nShowdown at Stonewatch (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26713)\nDarkblaze, Bood of the Worldbreaker (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26714)\nTriumphant Return (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26726)\n\nA truly epic chain!",
            date = "2010-12-05T19:08:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26512#comments:id=1208962",
        },
        {
