            author = "1023879",
            text = "I've doen this quest several times, with different characters and discovered that the only way to complete it and get Ongo to break out is to wait for one of the trolls to wander past. Then, when he chases you, she sees the other troll and breaks his chains.\n\nHope this helps.",
