            text = "His respawn timer is now 1-2min now as of 4.2...in my experience.\n\nConfirmed just now, just a little change- it's not 1-2min, it's 1-1:30min.\nMany dire trolls died to bring us this information.",
            date = "2011-08-28T18:04:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26515#comments:id=1505546",
        },
