        },
        {
            id = 2271920,
            score = 8,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "I used to really like these quests because you'd receive a whole bunch of quests at once and then can go in jintha'alor and do them all at once, was great for leveling.\n\nBut now after cataclysm for some reason Blizzard think it's better to do a couple quests, then go  clear back to the camp and return them, get a few more quests, then back to jintha'alor, then back to camp, etc.  I think you do it about 4 or 5 times.\n\nReally really annoying now.",
            date = "2015-11-05T02:44:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26526#comments:id=2271920",
        },
        {
            id = 2441812,
