            author = "NoblePickle",
            text = "Quests I did to unlock this quest:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26521\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26523\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26524\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26497\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26518\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26515\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26517\n\nWas after https://www.wowhead.com/item=59258, since it says it's collectible in my transmog collection book.\nAs a rogue, it was not collectible. Damn lying collection book.",
