    [26528] = {
        {
            id = 1179332,
            score = 29,
            author = "648135",
            text = "I posted this as a comment on the end of the quest chain and realize it might be good to put it here too.\n\nI did a lot of running around trying to figure this out. I couldn't find any info on where to get it or anything. You pick the quest up at Quel'Danil Lodge. I did some chains outside of Jintha'Alor. Still couldn't pick up the starter for this. Went back to Aerie Peak and Wind Master something or another inside the building by the flight master there had a quest to go to Quel'Danil lodge. You pick up two quests there, get phased, do those quests, and then you're able to pick the starter to this up.\n\nI'm not sure if the Wind Master dude has this quest at first or whatnot, or if there's a specific chain to unlock it, but once you get the Quel'Danil quest it leads to this. Hopes this somehow helps anyone curious even though it's kind of vague. :3",
            date = "2010-11-23T21:41:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26528#comments:id=1179332",
        },
        {
            id = 1183872,
            score = 9,
            author = "681008",
            text = "Chest was at 45, 38 inside the tent. Takes a bit to respawn if you have multiple people.",
            date = "2010-11-25T04:38:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26528#comments:id=1183872",
        },
        {
            id = 1191729,
            score = 5,
            author = "kumalo",
            text = "At first I thought maybe I had made the same mistake as Robert, but this is just on a really SLOW spawn timer. If you start at Aerie Peaks you should be fine and not have to worry about phasing issues.",
