            text = "I used the idols at the three temples, but when I went to talk to the Wildhammer Lookout, he was engaged in battle with four elite undead which were not attackable by players. None of them are damaging each other, so the fight will go forever. Not long ago, I saw Shadra the giant spider come out of the water, so it was working at that point. Must be bugged at this time.",
