            author = "DTAMoonDawg",
            text = "So, the Alliance and Horde have this same quest. The only difference is that Dwarves help the Alliance and Undead help the Horde.\n\nA random Horde player and I accidentally started the quest at the same time, and... well...\n\nYeah... (http://i.imgur.com/OOIhowP.jpg)\n\nThe Undead and Dwarves have been fighting each other for ~20 minutes now with no end in sight. Neither side is able to be targeted, and they're literally not doing damage to each other.\n\nOops!",
