        {
            id = 1209203,
            score = 22,
            author = "DarkShado",
            text = "If you use Carbonite it is giving you the wrong location for Spy on Zanzil\nas of Dec 5 2010. it tells you to go to Ruins of Aboraz which is INCORRECT\nthat is where  it takes you once you click on the Totem of Hir'eek.\n\nThe correct location where you want to go is to the Totem\nof Hir'eek at 54,31 it is at the Ruins of Jubuwal which is\nright across from the Grurubashi Arena.",
