            score = 14,
            author = "Apolocyntosis",
            text = "You gotta pay the troll toll to get into this troll's hole, you gotta pay the troll toll to get in.",
            date = "2011-07-26T21:51:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26552#comments:id=1480428",
        },
        {
            id = 5759134,
            score = 2,
            author = "Mepoc",
            text = "I abandoned this quest and couldn't get it to trigger again.\nThe solution was to head back to Hardwrench Hideaway and ask Chabal (34.6 . 27.9) to remind me where I was supposed to be\nThis teleported me to the portal and upon entering it the quest chain continued and worked",
            date = "2024-01-02T19:06:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26552#comments:id=5759134",
        },
        {
            id = 1354985,
            score = 0,
            author = "406368",
            text = "Portal still works to send you to -a- Zul'Gurub instance-type place, and asks you to auto-accept the next quest in the chain, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553...\n\nNOTE:  After patch 4.1 hits, Zul'Gurub will be a level 85+ heroic dungeon.",
            date = "2011-03-02T07:58:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26552#comments:id=1354985",
        },
    },
    [26553] = {
        {
            id = 1594474,
            score = 10,
            author = "Djsedj",
            text = "You will have to walk by land to the place specified. Don't try to just fly to the spot, it will not work.\nAt least, that's what happened to me.",
            date = "2011-12-11T13:32:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553#comments:id=1594474",
        },
        {
            id = 2368821,
            score = 10,
            author = "1511200",
            text = "To everyone who can't do it:\n\nHi Cindy,\n\nGamemaster Kilkrozen here, great to hear from you today! I understand that you are unable to complete the quest \"High Priestess Jeklik\" at the moment. I had look into it and unfortunately there is a known issue with this quest that our devs are working to resolve as soon as possible however as of now we do not have ETA for its resolution.\n\nI know this wasn't the answer you were looking for and I can understand any frustration you may feel, especially when its holding you back from and achievement like loremaster. I would like to genuinely apologise for any inconvenience cause and assure that we will resolve this issue as soon as we can :)\n\nIf there is anything else that we can assist you with please do not hesitate ask and we will be happy to help.\n\nBest of luck on your adventures!\n\nKind Regards,\nGame Master Kilkrozen\n\nRIP Loremaster",
            date = "2016-08-16T10:32:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553#comments:id=2368821",
        },
        {
            id = 2368031,
            score = 9,
            author = "BloodiestCODY",
            text = "The Quest \"High Priestess Jeklik\" is bugged and cannot be completed for me as when I transport to Zul'Gurub neither Zanzil or The Priestess is there.  They are completely gone  I have tried removing all Addons and Repairing my game.  I even went as far as full re-installation. None of these fixed the issue.\n\nI sent a support ticket also but can anyone here help?",
            date = "2016-08-15T05:15:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553#comments:id=2368031",
        },
        {
            id = 1263858,
            score = 8,
            author = "400785",
            text = "Alright, this is a frustrating quest and i have experienced all the problems that have been complained, but I found the correct way to finish the quest, you will get credit. First, you need to attack Zanzil, once he is at 600 health or so he will say \"I can't take this no more, mon\" and will disappear, he will also drop \"Zanzil's Elixir\" You can click the elixir and it will heal you for about 300 health. This happens every time he disappears. Then, go attack High Priestess Jeklik, you will have about 10 seconds to attack Jeklik before Zanzil appears again, you need to go and start attacking Zanzil again until he is at 600 health, click the elixir again and starting attacking Jeklik again, you need to repeat this cycle until you have defeated Jeklik. Once this has been done, a portal will appear at the area where you began attacking Zanzil and you will receive credit. Turn in the quest and continue on. I really hope this helps everyone, this is a very difficult quest.",
            date = "2010-12-28T10:46:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553#comments:id=1263858",
        },
        {
            id = 1200089,
            score = 7,
            author = "Raiking",
            text = "I did this quest but I didn't get any credits for destroying the body, so I decided to abandon the quest and re-accept it so I could do the event over again.\nAfter porting out using the provided item for it, I abandoned the quest only to find out I can't re-accept it anywhere.\n\nAnybody else having this issue?\n\nEdit: I made a GM ticket and after going through some of the usual solutions, the GM logged onto my character and enabled the quest manually it seemed. I asked him if this was the only way to re-accept a quest which is obtained through the new system (I'll call it on-distance questgiving for now), but he said that if such issues would occur more often they would look for a solution.",
            date = "2010-12-01T11:50:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26553#comments:id=1200089",
        },
    },
