            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26589#comments:id=1381696",
        },
        {
            id = 5789010,
            score = 3,
            author = "Apathy",
            text = "There are a few quest lines which need to be completed for the quest giver to show up and for the quest to appear:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36060 in Karnum's Glade, [zone=405] (58.2, 50.0)\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14305\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14306\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14311\n\nOnce that chain is finished you will begin the longest quest line:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36052, also in Karnum's Glade, [zone=405] (58.4 49.8)\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14312\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14314\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14316\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14318\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14325\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14327\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14328\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14330 - Quest is started by the https://www.wowhead.com/item=38567 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4656\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14332\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14393\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14394\n\nAfter completing these you will be able to see https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36487 but with no quests, as Horde you must do these quests:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=36034, in Karnum's Glade, [zone=405] (57.4 47.6)\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14338 - Optional (Breadcrumb)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14339\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14343\n\nOnce you are finished, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26589 will be available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=36487 in Shok'Thokar, [zone=405] (73.2 73.0)",
            date = "2024-02-19T16:54:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26589#comments:id=5789010",
        },
        {
            id = 1852550,
            score = 1,
            author = "10171",
            text = "If the NPC does not offer this quest to you, try to complete more of the other quests in the zone first. I did both Ghostwalker Post and Shadowprey Village before being able to get this.",
            date = "2013-05-12T17:53:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26589#comments:id=1852550",
        },
    },
