            author = "986715",
            text = "I too couldn't see the gorillas as an 85 priest. I tried the log trick...it worked for only a couple of seconds. I tried the changing continents trick (learned this on another quest I was having trouble with). I didn't work either. I discovered that it was Bwemba's Spirit that was with me was preventing them from showing. When I abandoned that quest, the gorillas appeared again (after logging).",
            date = "2012-04-28T21:15:55-05:00",
