            text = "The two items you need are purchased from people within Booty Bay.\n\n- Crate of Grade-E Meat: Kelsey Yance (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=2664) (located in the Old Port Authority ... enter the central door, go to the left)\n- Crate of Pupellyverbos Port: Whiskey Slim (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=2491) (located in the Inn ... gnome by the door on the bottom floor)",
