            author = "asdsa020",
            text = "Kelsey Yance (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2664/kelsey-yance) seems bugged as of now. Players cannot interact with him and a couple of the Booty Bay Bruiser NPCs.\n\nEdit: Fixed! You can go get your crates of meat now.",
