            text = "Kelsey Yance = Enter the \"Old Port Authority\" (bottom level) at 42,70 and NPC is at 42,68.\nWhiskey Slim = Enter the \"Salty Sailor Tavern\" (top level) at 40,74 and NPC is at 41,74 on the right.",
            date = "2011-05-06T17:45:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26600#comments:id=1411579",
        },
        {
            id = 1852214,
            score = 12,
            author = "1119686",
            text = "Okay.\n\nFirstly I found this quest difficult as I am bad at finding my way around and I was completely hopeless at finding the NPC's. And I do not use coordinates.\n\nHere's my tips on finding them!\n\nKelsey Yance - - NOT ON THE LOWEST LEVEL. Simplest way to find him: go through the entrance to Booty Bay, down the ramps. Carry on straight and it's the first building entrance you will come to (will a red drape above it). He is on the left at the back!\n\nWhiskey Slim - -  Again THIS IS NOT THE HIGHEST LEVEL. Best way. Go up one level from the deck that you walked in to Booty Bay on. He's on the building at the end before you go down a ramp to the Bank.!",
            date = "2013-05-11T16:53:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26600#comments:id=1852214",
        },
        {
