            text = "When i go and kill the dire wolves, my count for dire wolves killed remains at 0/12.\nI've tried abandoning the quest and restarting it multiple times with no luck.\nAt first it worked, i went to a bg, came back to kill more and it stopped counting the dire wolves killed.\nAny ideas? ever experienced this with other kill count quests?\n\nThanks in advance for any advice",
            date = "2015-07-26T09:58:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26618#comments:id=2220487",
        },
