        {
            id = 2554832,
            score = 8,
            author = "Ramdomize",
            text = "As of Patch 7.3.5, it seems the drop rate has been improved slightly. I was getting it for every other spider I killed. Unfortunately, the spawn rate on spiders is excruciatingly slow, and at busy hours, Duskwood is most popular leveling zone for new level 20 alts. Spiders do spawn further west than the quest indicates, so you can go almost as far as Raven Hill and find spiders to kill.\n\nAlso now a part of the Duskwood Quests meta achievement, which requires you to complete this quest as part of \"Citizens of Darkshire\". It is the only quest in that storyline, if you can even call it a storyline.",
