        {
            id = 1637671,
            score = 2,
            author = "Devor",
            text = "How are you supposed to dive down to the level of the Muckdwellers in order to kill them? I've swum the length & breadth of the lake, jumped like a dolphin, leapt off the cliffs, the dock, the bridge, but I cannot work out how to get deep enough. Help!",
