        {
            id = 3211227,
            score = 2,
            author = "Runemauler",
            text = "If, like me, you're after the https://www.wowhead.com/item=60715 to add to your transmog collection, this is the most expedient route. Also, this likely goes without saying but, make sure you're working your way through these quests on a character who can both equip and transmogrify \"Held In Off-hand\" items, otherwise it might not be added to your collection.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26567\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26568\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26586\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26571\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26587\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26560\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26561\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26573\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26562\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26563\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26607\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26616\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26637\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=60715",
