        {
            id = 1591852,
            score = 83,
            author = "Snooty",
            text = "If the bomb item doesn't show on your action bar, just press '4'. It will then plant the bomb anyway.",
            date = "2011-12-07T07:53:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26651#comments:id=1591852",
        },
        {
            id = 2547586,
            score = 71,
            author = "deathxelf",
            text = "Currently with the scaling close to unpossible...camouflage doesnt work and can't chloroform due to that. i'd advice bringing a high level friend to help you, or you will have to go through alot of corpse running",
            date = "2018-01-21T08:06:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26651#comments:id=2547586",
        },
        {
            id = 2550924,
            score = 53,
            author = "rtoppe",
            text = "As of time of posting this, this quest has become ridiculously broken. The mobs can now see through camouflage, and as a result, all of your abilities except distraction are useless.\nI think I found a decent way of planting the seaforium at the tower if you can't kill the mobs.\n\n1. Distract the orcs guarding the entrance to a location as far away as possible.\n2. Walk in - then die - or don't if you can, but you're almost definitely going to die.\n3. Release and walk to the tower. As a ghost, get as far up as you can, and resurrect.\n4. Walk to the highest level, and just try your best to get into the room - then you're probably going to die.\n5. Release, walk back to the tower, and place your ghost inside the room as far back in the room as possible.\n6. While still dead - activate your Bravo Company Field Kit. (I agree, it's strange you can use it while dead, but you can.)\n7. Be careful with this step - resurrect and immediately spam 4, or whichever key is bound to planting the Seaforium.",
            date = "2018-02-05T22:38:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26651#comments:id=2550924",
        },
        {
            id = 2548536,
            score = 33,
            author = "Hedonis",
            text = "After the level scaling changes I can say that this is by far and away my least favorite quest in all of WoW.  Never, ever doing the Redridge quest line again.\n\nJohn J. Keeshan can do his own damn dirty work next time.",
            date = "2018-01-26T13:34:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26651#comments:id=2548536",
        },
    },
