            text = "Long John Copper Is below  main deck, on The Damsel's Luck, not in bottom of ship. Didn't have a name over his head, like the other NPCs. Standing against the wall facing the entrance to bottom of ship.\nEnormous Shawn Stooker is in bottom of his ship, The Crimson Veil, with the Corsairs. No name over his head.\nMary is on The RipTide below deck, in second cannon room. No name over her head.\nNow you'll report back to Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay.",
