    [26674] = {
        {
            id = 1184904,
            score = 26,
            author = "89505",
            text = "After you use the ring, the Mistmantle brothers Stalvan (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=315) and Tobias (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=43453) would face off with each other...\n\nStalvan Mistmantle says: My ring... Who holds my family ring... Tilloa, is that you?\nTobias Mistmantle says: Brother!\nTobais Mistmantle says: Tell me it's not true, brother. Tell me you didn't die a murderer!\nStalvan Mistmantle says: Tobias...\nStalvan Mistmantle says: It's all true, brother. Every word. You doubted it?\nTobias Mistmantle says: But why? How could you?\nStalvan Mistmantle says: You know why!\nStalvan Mistmantle says: Surely you've felt anger. Anger so foul and vicious that it makes you want to tear someone to shreds...\nTobias Mistmantle yells: No... NO! STOP IT!\n\nStalvan Mistmantle says: Aren't you feeling it right now?\nStalvan Mistmantle says: You see, brother... we're not so different...\nTobias Mistmantle says: No...\n\nCompared to the old quest chain (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=98), this revised one gives more of the backstory of the legend of Stalvan. But a new question is brought up... Was Stalvan already infected with the worgen plague when he committed the murders? Or was he simply a man driven mad by his perceived betrayal by his \"love\"?",
            date = "2010-11-25T13:11:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26674#comments:id=1184904",
        },
        {
