            author = "averagehero",
            text = "This is a bit of a lengthy \"breadcrumb\" quest into the Dustwallow Marsh questline. Just follow the main road east into Dustwallow from Southern Barrens, and you'll quickly come across the highway that the Alliance has set up. It will take you safely all the way to Theramore.",
