        {
            id = 1715515,
            score = 3,
            author = "1033970",
            text = "This quest counts towards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4929\n\nYou must also complete all of the following quests\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25104\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=29155\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25108 (do these together)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25106\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25120\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25163 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=39220\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25174\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25182 (do these two together)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25183\n\nFor the Alliance there are exactly 59 quests that will not involve goblins.  There is one quest that you will end up picking up from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23600 that will ask you go talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23797 which does NOT hurt bloodsail rep.",
