            author = "Raknagog",
            text = "This quest does seem to be bugged at the moment, but I somehow managed to get it to work. I tried reloading and relogging like others. Eventually I gave up and decided to do the other two quests offered at the same time, then flew around a little bit.\nIt's possible that flying far enough away for it to phase out, then coming back again might give it a chance to work, or perhaps completing the other two quests has something to do with it.\n\nI'm afraid all I can offer is speculation, but try flying away and coming back a few times.\n\nWhether it works or not, submit a bug report so this can get fixed.",
