            text = "Gazlowe does not offer this quest if https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27210 has been completed.",
            date = "2016-05-11T05:25:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26702#comments:id=2329932",
        },
        {
            id = 1531482,
            score = 6,
            author = "Bengarion",
            text = "Apparently the Hero's Call quests parallel usually more profitable breadcrumb quests. If you accept/complete one you can't accept the other.\n\nHero's Call: Dustwallow Marsh! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28552) - 330 exp, 10 rep Stormwind, 0 silver\n\nFlight to Theramore - 330 exp, 10 rep Alliance, 3.5 silver",
            date = "2011-09-30T08:54:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26702#comments:id=1531482",
        },
        {
            id = 1893685,
            score = 5,
            author = "stickshift",
            text = "Wow, talk about having it handed to you on a silver platter!  I spent one night back in 05 or 06 just swimming and fighting my way from Ratchet to Theramore along the Dustwallow coastline.\n\nIt was a blast; put some music on, drank some beers and slowly filled my measly 12-slot bags with skins and vendor loot.  Fished junk out of the occasional pool, plotting how I was going to get past the Mirefins, pirates and sharks that aggo'd before you could even get a good look at them.\n\nSure, I died a few times.  Back then, if you didn't die once a day it was because you were too busy watching night elf bank-dancers in ironforge.\n\nBlizz should do away with the evil \"talk to so-and-so for a ride\" quests so new players would actually have some fond leveling memories to look back on!",
            date = "2013-09-07T23:05:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26702#comments:id=1893685",
        },
    },
    [26703] = {
        {
            id = 2259004,
            score = 79,
            author = "Reindoggo",
            text = "To get this quest you must do a rather lengthy set of various chain quests.\nI wasted a monumental amount of time having to figure out which quests were needed, as a lot of the chains are 'unrelated' and did not give you a connective quest, So I went through all the quests from start to finish to make it easier for people.\n\nSTART\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2501\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26593\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26594\n3: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26595\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC =  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2490\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26609\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26610\n3: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26611\n4: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26612\n5: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26624\n6: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26629\n7: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26631\n8: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26633\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2545\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26635\n\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2549\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26634\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC =  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2490\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26644\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2547\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26647\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26649\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2546\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26650\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest Object = https://www.wowhead.com/object=204450\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26662\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26663\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26664\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26665\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2496\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26678\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26698\n3: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26695\n\nUnlocks:\nQuest NPC = https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2487\n1: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26697\n2: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26699\n3: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=2670