        {
            id = 1194967,
            score = 24,
            author = "693971",
            text = "Easily finished out Cape of Stranglethorn achievement on this, with about two quests to spare.\n\nThis series was pretty cool, showing phasing in the old world. I really liked the feel that I was defending booty bay, swinging on a rope to a pirate ship and such.",
            date = "2010-11-29T04:22:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26703#comments:id=1194967",
        },
        {
            id = 1617122,
            score = 18,
            author = "Qoko",
            text = "Important for those that want to be Exalted with both the Buccaneers and the Cartel: during (!) this quest the phasing started after accepting https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26679 ends. This happens the moment Firallion is killed and you are teleported back. You can however restore it by abandoning the quest as mentioned.\n\nTherefore you should accept this quest, then grind to max Honored Bloodsail during THIS quest before killing Firallion. I made an overview on the [faction=87] page.",
            date = "2012-01-26T11:08:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26703#comments:id=1617122",
        },
        {
            id = 1969222,
            score = 13,
            author = "Trollee",
            text = "To get to this quest, you start with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26609, but to unlock that chain, you have to complete one of several possible mini-chains in Stranglethorn Vale (to prove your general seadog worthiness!).\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26593, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26603, or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26599 will all work to unlock it.  If you've already done any of them, then First Mate Crazz (lowest dock, in the middle of town) should talk to you.\n\nOne note: a quest further down in the Bloodsail Buccaneers chain, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26679, puts you in a phased, instanced version of Booty Bay where all the bruisers are level 35 non-elites—this is highly desirable for players  going for the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=871 and/or https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=2336 achievements, and cannot be returned to after you turn-in the quest, so plan wisely. :)",
            date = "2014-06-01T19:00:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26703#comments:id=1969222",
        },
    },
