            text = "Since I have not seen this commented, I wanted to mention:\n\nMy quest ended at Keeshan's Post, and the \"?\" for Troteman was misleading.  Standing directly on the \"?\" showed nobody nearby, just a bunch of dead orcs on pikes.  Eventually, I wanderded into the area with the orcs and discovered that I had not actually been \"in\" Keeshan's Post -- walked up the hill and found Troteman and the gang to complete the quest and get the next one.\n\nL23 Human Hunter, not very adept at seeing things on the screen, so maybe this is just me ... but I am guessing that Troteman moves around somewhat randomly during quests.  Commandos gotta keep mobile, y' know?",
