            author = "26532",
            text = "Don't look for them in their old locations.   Tharil'zun and Gath'Ilzogg are both guarding the path that runs by the keep itself.  Tharil'zun is just at the top of the hill (60.3 47.3 (/maps?data=44:603473))  on the north side and has a couple guards.  Gath'Ilzogg stands alone  (57.8 56.3 (/maps?data=44:578563)) on the remains of the bridge in the south.  If you don't see them, their respawn is fairly short, so you shouldn't have to wait for long.",
