            text = "Just Pick up the hat in the house.",
            date = "2011-06-27T14:02:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26723#comments:id=1452011",
        },
        {
            id = 2557276,
            score = 4,
            author = "dsiacono",
            text = "Now I get it! Once you kill Morbent Fel (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=43761/morbent-fel) down in the mausoleum, next you have to go outside, up the path to the nearby house, go upstairs to (17.0 - 33.4) & click on the Bloodsoaked Hat (http://www.wowhead.com/object=204816). THEN the quest will be complete.\n\n Rewards: You will receive: 90 silver.\nGains:  Upon completion of this quest you will gain: 3,960 experience and 250 reputation with Gilneas.",
            date = "2018-03-11T09:05:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26723#comments:id=2557276",
        },
    },
