            author = "qtqtc",
            text = "If you're doing this with a high level character, you can use Soft Foam Sword (https://www.wowhead.com/item=137663/soft-foam-sword) for the lurking Worgen. This drops him to near zero HP, but does not kill him",
            date = "2025-12-08T00:36:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26760#comments:id=6241760",
        },
        {
            id = 1859115,
            score = 15,
            author = "MidnaLink",
            text = "this should help anyone trying to complete it - just go back to the Worden, abandon, and the quest will come back up (click accept-wait around) simples :)\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rr7psKIfmtE",
            date = "2013-05-28T06:40:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26760#comments:id=1859115",
        },
        {
            id = 1181791,
            score = 12,
