            text = "Fun little bit of lore here. It turns out that the Lurking Worgen is actually Sven Yorgen. Yeah, the one from the old Duskwood. He gets a bit... mad. With Jitters.",
            date = "2010-11-24T14:04:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26760#comments:id=1181791",
