        {
            id = 1197895,
            score = 3,
            author = "196807",
            text = "While you are staring through the eyes of Ohgan'aka, Bloodlord Mandokir tells you the following:\n\nBloodlord Mandokir says: Welcome to Zul'Gurub, little one.  It might not look like much now, but give it time...\nBloodlord Mandokir says: Ahh... it's good to be home.\nBloodlord Mandokir says: There's plenty others of your kind here, but I wouldn't worry about competition.  You're from the bloodline of Ohgan, my oldest friend.  You see... our souls are intertwined, yours and mine.\nBloodlord Mandokir says: Here we are.  Get ready for your training, little one.  I recommend you forget about that worthless   and start thinking about your duties here in Zul'Gurub.",
            date = "2010-11-30T13:16:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26772#comments:id=1197895",
