            text = "Tip for higher level player who want to complete this quest:\n\n1. slay Morbidius https://www.wowhead.com/npc=45619. He is in front of the entrance of the tombs, at 16.4 38.9. He is elite but as a higher level player you should have him down easily, ofcourse.\n2. enter the tombs and spam some AoE spells until you have killed 20 ghouls.\n\nThere are many ghouls close to each other down there. You won't need to fly all around the place and keep mounting, dismounting, running from mob to mob. As a level 85 priest using holy nova, I had the quest completed in 15 seconds :)",
