            text = "Just a word of warning, in case you are doing multiple quests like I was at the time:\n\nIf you get this box, and then fight the venture company shredders near the Ogre Camp, you may see a message about how the Shredder makes a noise, at which point your Mosh'Ogg Bounty (http://www.wowhead.com/item=58205) will become Opened Mosh'Ogg Bounty (http://www.wowhead.com/item=58490).  Despite that sounding helpful, the second is turned in for a quest later, and doesn't count for this quest any longer.  You will have to go get another one from the Ogre Camp if this happens.",
