        },
        {
            id = 3153359,
            score = 1,
            author = "dirch",
            text = "Spoiler\n\nThis input with a daughter suddenly alive and well and being a watcher ... after some thinking this makes the whole quest-line fall flat. If daddy Ladimore had looked high and low for his family he would surely had found her - but no. Is it me, or is this sloppy scriptwriting here? Imho they should have written a more convincing end.\nPff ... I think I have too much time to worry wbout game-scriptwriting; gotta go back to watching the paint dry instead.",
            date = "2019-09-08T14:06:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26796#comments:id=3153359",
        },
        {
            id = 3159081,
            score = 1,
            author = "Subjecttochange",
            text = "You can find her easily by doing /target Watcher Ladimore instead of Sarah Ladimore",
