            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26796#comments:id=3159081",
        },
        {
            id = 6153130,
            score = 1,
            author = "Raixe",
            text = "I had some issues finding her so hopefully this helps someone.\n\nSeems like she’s not in every shard as I sat around waiting for her to show up in town for over 5 minutes. Tried relogging. Nothing.\n\nI did have war mode on so I went back to Stormwind, turned it off, then returned to Darkshire and there she was!",
            date = "2025-08-02T12:15:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26796#comments:id=6153130",
        },
    },
    [26797] = {
        {
            id = 1365769,
            score = 44,
            author = "112652",
            text = "Morgan Ladimore says: My sword Archeus served me well in life, but as at last my spirit may pass from the unhappy existence, I need it no longer.\nMorgan Ladimore says: I shall cling to the love of my daughter and hope that I will find forgiveness under the Light for my sins.\n\nMor'ladim's melee swing hits you for 59.\n\nDammit stop breaking my immersion!",
            date = "2011-03-13T11:16:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26797#comments:id=1365769",
        },
        {
            id = 1199886,
            score = 26,
            author = "Drunkenvalley",
            text = "A small, but nice story.\n\nI was on my way to Northern Stranglethorn after having done quests in Ashenvale. On my way through Duskwood I thought to do the Yorgen Worgen questline. After that, I thought I'd do Sven's quests involving Morbent Fel, and saw the \"questgiver\" from where I finished first part of the quest I was on.\n\nAnd this little detour was clearly worth the time I took to do this.",
            date = "2010-12-01T09:46:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26797#comments:id=1199886",
        },
        {
            id = 1488757,
            score = 19,
            author = "McLockhart",
            text = "Prior to the Shattering the very same questline would reward the player with https://www.wowhead.com/item=2000. I personally find it quite odd that the sword goes from being a two-hander to a one-handed sword.\n\nAlthough this could be an entirely different sword, given the \"Restored\" part",
            date = "2011-08-06T16:21:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26797#comments:id=1488757",
        },
        {
            id = 2555752,
