            text = "Although the In-Game Quest Tracker tells you to go to the Ruins of Aboraz, you must actually go to the back of the Ruins of Jubuwal.\n\nThere you will find the Totem which you should interact with to fly you over to the Ruins of Aboraz where the conversation between https://www.wowhead.com/npc=43245 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=43246 will take place (this being the reason why the game points you to the Ruins of Aboraz in the first place!)",
