            text = "By Adorendo (7) on 11/27/2010 (Patch 4.0.3)\nFor this chain you may need to disable your mods in order to complete\n\nYou do not need to disable mods to complete this quest. I have carbonite addon and it worked fine with this. All you have to do is use Maywiki's Fetish, which should be in your bag. This teleports you to Maywiki, then all you have to do is speak to him then he teleports you to the portal and you can continue your quest chain.\n\nBoneraker (Eonar)",
