        {
            id = 1712524,
            score = 7,
            author = "mcdisney2001",
            text = "I don't know if you'd call it a bug, or just a poor quest description, but here's the deal:\n\n1: When you get there, she's already at half health.\n\n2: Use a ranged attack to ALMOST kill her. The priest won't even notice you're there, and you won't be bothered.\n\n3: Go in and kill her the rest of the way at close range. You must be within melee range of her, and have the priest aggroed on you (which he will be the moment you run in).\n\nI took little or no damage from him in the few shots it took me to finish her off.",
            date = "2012-09-12T01:30:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26812#comments:id=1712524",
