            text = "I have found the solution to this problem.\nfirst of all dont kill her in mid air\nif you should happen to do (dots n so on)\nthen you can go back to get quest giver and talk to the guy say you lost your way and that (remember to abandon the quest first.. then he will teleport you inside where you then auto will have to accept the quest again and there you go a new try just remember dont kill them mid air..)",
            date = "2010-12-04T18:46:20-06:00",
