        {
            id = 1860305,
            score = 10,
            author = "Araxom",
            text = "Hi all, just dropping in to let you know we're aware of the reports regarding some players not being able to loot the Pure Water.\n\nUpdate (6/18): The issue has been resolved. Thanks to everyone for your patience while we worked this out! -Blizz.",
