        {
            id = 1780502,
            score = 8,
            author = "ZerotZallander",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=44112's diary reads:\npage 1:\nFascinating!  It's some sort of piece of an old god!  This is exactly why I was sent here!  Our assumptions were right!\n\nCelebratory beers are called for.\n\npage 2:\nStarting to feel woozy.  Something is not right.  Perhaps it's the beer?  Investigating.\n\npage 3:\nIt wasn't the beer, it was the artifact.  I should have known it.  I'm sending the artifact up to Ironforge for further analysis.\n\nThat Garley Lightrider from the Reliquary has been eying me lately... I think she suspects something.  I am hiding this journal where she has no chance of finding it.\n\nNow, back to the beer.",
            date = "2012-12-13T03:43:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26821#comments:id=1780502",
        },
        {
            id = 1692415,
