        {
            id = 1814424,
            score = 14,
            author = "asktgm",
            text = "For anyone curious, here is what Sauranok the Mystic (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44120) says while fighting him, translated from demonic (starting from when you trick the peon):\n[ins]\nSuspicious Peon says: Wait, uh - you put words in my mouth! Not fair!\nSauranok the Mystic says: Silence, idiot.\nSauranok the Mystic says: Hear anything interesting [name]? Your little revelation about me is about to cost you your life.\nSauranok the Mystic says: The Twilight's Hammer has agents everywhere! Kill me and a dozen take my place!\nSauranok the Mystic says: My powers of sight... I beheld the future... I have seen what is to come...\nSauranok the Mystic says: This world unravels. If you could see the horrors I have seen...\nSauranok the Mystic says: To serve is madness, but defiance ... impossible!\n[/ins]\n\nUsed Dark Apotheosis (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=114168) on my warlock while fighting him to translate.\n\nEDIT: Seems he no longer speaks in demonic during this quest, so this comment is outdated.",
            date = "2013-02-16T15:28:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26830#comments:id=1814424",
        },
