            text = "This quest is obtainable from Mountaineer Stormpike (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1343) at Algaz station (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=925), Loch Modan. Coordinates 25 17 following completion of A tiny clever commander (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26843).\n\nThe objective is to kill 5 Tunnel Rat Surveyors (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1177) and 5 Tunnel Rat Foragers (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1176).\n\nReturn to mountaineer stormpike to hand in the quest once complete.\n\nMountaineer stormpike will then allow you to progress on to who's in charge here (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26845) and filthy paws (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26863).",
