    [26845] = {
        {
            id = 1181146,
            score = 10,
            author = "skevans",
            text = "This quest is obtainable from Mountaineer Stormpike (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1343) at Algaz station (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=925), Loch Modan (Coordinates 25 17), upon completion of Kobold and Kobolder (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26844).\n\nIt is advisable to complete Filthy paws (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26863) at the same time.\n\nThe objective is to remove Foreman Sharpsneers (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44198) head from his shoulders. The Foreman can be found in the Silver Stream Mine. The entrance to which is East of the questgiver at co-ords 35 18.\n\nInside you will find Tunnel rat geomancers (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1174) and stonesplinter workers (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44163/stonesplinter-worker). Go straight ahead at the first junction and then continue to follow the broken rail tracks to the foreman at co-ords 34 26.\n\nHe has a respawn timer of approximately 2 minutes and 546 health.\n\nReturn to mountaineer stormpike to hand in the quest once complete.\n\nOn completion I also gained 69 rep with Alliance and 69 with Gilneas.",
