            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26866#comments:id=1334316",
        },
        {
            id = 1715582,
            score = 1,
            author = "604409",
            text = "Apparently the last patch changed Ragefire Chasm.  I got the quest in TB, went to Ragefire chasm and there are orcs fighting Firedogs, but no Kurjack.  You need to update your quest info, and Bliz may need to update their breadcrumb quest.  Without Kurjack, you can't get the quest to kill the dungeon boss.",
            date = "2012-09-18T14:35:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26866#comments:id=1715582",
        },
        {
            id = 1881633,
            score = 1,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "Please note, this quest DOES exist in the game. It's just that the requirements have been changed, and the quest itself overhauled. The quest entitled \"Enemies Below\" now exists at the following links:\n\nFor Orgrimmar quest: : Garrosh,  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31034)\nFor Thunderbluff quest:  Baine, (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31036)\nFor Undercity quest: Sylvanas (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31037)\n\nSome quest mods may have issues with this quest because of this.",
            date = "2013-07-28T10:19:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26866#comments:id=1881633",
        },
        {
            id = 6282881,
            score = 1,
            author = "pietersen9",
            text = "This quest is still in the game",
            date = "2026-02-14T05:52:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26866#comments:id=6282881",
        },
    },
