        {
            id = 1423895,
            score = 5,
            author = "Hendo72",
            text = "I just did the quest with my lv 47 Frost Mage.\n\nMy water elemental refused to climb the plank and I died twice trying to climb the plank. I used fatherix's advice and respawned on the ship.\n\nIt was a cake walk after this. I even went out of my way to clear the ship.\n\nThey must have fixed Southsea Taskmaster's (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40593) respawn rate, because he repopped while I was still standing there. Couldn't have been more than a minute, if even that.\n\nBy Expetra (6) on 03/30/2011 (Patch 4.0.6)\nI received no reputation gain from this.\nEarned 275 rep with Gnomeregan",
            date = "2011-05-21T12:04:18-05:00",
