            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26886#comments:id=1892568",
        },
    },
    [26887] = {
        {
            id = 1183940,
            score = 4,
            author = "malavae",
            text = "These guys are outside through on the south side of the main compound.\n\nSo run through the general melee in the compound (easy run), then you'll see them.\n\nTheir camp runs around the bend as well, so there are plenty of them.\n\nMost drop 3 teeth at a time, some 2 and some 1, so quick to collect.",
            date = "2010-11-25T05:26:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26887#comments:id=1183940",
        },
        {
            id = 1346044,
            score = 1,
            author = "ziggy29",
            text = "This was a pretty challenging quest for me -- not so much because any individual mob was particularly difficult (using level 47 shadow priest) but because of a combination of factors:  (a) the fact that the strongarms pull you in close to them, and (b) if there are several mobs close to the strongarm, they will likely aggro you as well AND (c) the musketeers will shoot from a distance.  Also, these mobs have a bad habit of running away when almost dead -- and the strongarms will then pull you in again, and if they are near more mobs... it doesn't end quickly or easily.\n\nThe bottom line is that it's not easy to get these mobs on you one at a time.  And with the running away, I found myself using Shadow Word:Death very frequently before they could run.  It was a real mana suck because of that and because it was hard to \"take a breather\" quickly and often meant killing 3-4 mobs in quick succession without a chance for mana regen.  I would guess that this is much easier for, say, a tank warrior.\n\nAs for the comment above, most of the mobs I found had only one gold tooth and none had three, making the need for 20 of them annoyingly high.  (Your mileage may vary, but that was mine.)",
            date = "2011-02-22T12:17:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26887#comments:id=1346044",
        },
        {
            id = 1801551,
            score = 1,
            author = "GregorWowhead",
            text = "Look out, respawn rate is quite fast, You can easily do this quest camping single, northmost tent with one mob. Otherwise... they have bad habit respawning behind Your back in the middle of the fight...",
            date = "2013-01-20T13:35:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26887#comments:id=1801551",
        },
    },
