            text = "This quest is nearly impossible to do on your own for some classes. I've been through here several times on different characters, and some were able to do it easily and others I had to get help.\nIt isn't killing Araj that is difficult... it's looting before he respawns, with all those skeletons beating on you...\nClasses with an AOE should be fine, though.\n\n*Edit* If you still have the grenades from the previous quest, they work wonders on the skeletons!",
