            text = "Locations is 40,52 just east of Felstone Field.\n\nScouting out the camp, you'll only find burning corpses and Lindsay Ravensun standing in the middle looking like the cat that swallowed the goldfish.\n\nYou won't get a direct follow-up to this quest. Just follow the rest of the quest available at Bulwark from other NPC's.",
