        {
            id = 1878772,
            score = 4,
            author = "Bethgael",
            text = "This quest currently has a tracking issue that causes all of your kills to apparently be added to the \"Fox Hunter\" numbers.\n\nWhat will happen is this: when you kill any of the kills, the quest will show 1,2,3,4/4 kills as you go (up on your screen) BUT when you look at your quest in the tracker, what you will see is foxes: 0/4, hounds 0/4 fox hunters x/4 (when I was done with the quest, my number was fox hunters: 18/4 (complete), heh).\n\nSo long as you kill 4 foxes, 4 hounds and 4 fox hunters, the quest WILL be able to be handed in at the Bulwark, even though the quest tracker looks like it's not completing.",
            date = "2013-07-20T00:00:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26931#comments:id=1878772",
        },
