            author = "Takata",
            text = "The only thing I hate about this quest is that you don't have enough time to loot the corpse before the Val'kyr changes the dead Alliance Laborer's corpse into an undead. I even had auto loot on and still couldn't target a corpse and my character got stuck in an awkward position after trying to loot a corpse.",
