        {
            id = 1814930,
            score = 15,
            author = "769220",
            text = "If you are using Dugi Guides on a hard quest setting, do not use the suggested route of going to Flight Master Marge Heffman and fly to the Eastern Plaguelands.  If you fly, you'll lose Zen'Kiki.  Also, do not log out before you complete this quest or when you log back in, Zen will be gone also.\n\nWhat you have to do is, as previously stated by klyxmaster, go back to Adrine Towhead (48.91, 54.76 a /o 17 Feb 2013) in The Menders' Stead and ask for Zen'Kiki's availability for additional training.  Then open up your world map and follow the defined trail/path, due East to prox 65.31, 51.47 then cut off to the left, going NNE and you will see the captive holding crates.  It is prox 105 yards from the path at the above location points.",
            date = "2013-02-17T20:17:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26955#comments:id=1814930",
        },
        {
            id = 1433713,
            score = 10,
            author = "33678",
            text = "You click on a cage to free a Captive Plaguebear (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44902) which Zen'Kiki then heals.  The bear transforms into a Shaggy Brown Bear (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44903) and you witness the bear's coat turn from a scarred, diseased, grayish hide into a nice unblemished, beautiful light brown coat...which then proceeds to revert back to the nasty-looking hide when the bear despawns. =)\n\nGuess Zen'kiki needs to work on his healing some more!",
            date = "2011-06-03T22:50:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26955#comments:id=1433713",
        },
    },
