    [26965] = {
        {
            id = 1194156,
            score = 128,
            author = "139511",
            text = "First of all, I'm getting downrated for expressing an opinion relevant to the quest and topic in a perfectly neutral manner? What is this, YouTube?\n\nSecond of all, what he does with Vol'jin isn't at all relevant to what I said, nor did I mention him.\n\nMy point is, while Garrosh is certainly crude and does things he shouldn't do, it's easy to have this whole \"They're valuable allies and should be respected\" and all that from a player point of view, but that's not the same thing.\n\nA minority can very easily give the majority a bad name, justified or no, real life examples are absolutely everywhere, and perfectly good and normal people fall for them. And we're talking \"backstabbing killers who toy with deadly plagues\" -level here.\n\nAnd if you've done SFK (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=209) for example, you'll know that the Forsaken are completely ready to just plain disregard the warnings (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27996), calling the orcish High Warlord Cromush (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=47294) basically a \"thick-skulled brute with a fool's brain\", and play with the plague anyway. There are many similar quests as well, such as gathering those \"supplies\" (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28144) in Hillsbrad.\n\nAnd none of this, mass-raising the dead Lich King (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=36597) -style, allying themselves with (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44608) the (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44610) goons (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=45626) of the aforementioned Lich King or developing deadly plagues (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27988) can possibly look like anything but trouble for any non-Forsaken or has any positive effect on you if you're alive (like Garrosh (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=39605) and the REST OF THE WORLD (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=34246)), but there's a whole lot of potential for disaster (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13267). It's all entirely and completely for the Forsaken (http://www.wowhead.com/item=60862) and the Forsaken (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=85524) alone, there is zero \"respect\" for any other race in all of Azeroth, and you're complaining that THEY aren't shown enough respect?\n\nI would dare to say that you didn't look at it from all perspectives (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=21546). Just because Sylvanas is liked (http://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1291) and Garrosh hated (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=58500) doesn't mean everything is black (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=46230) and white (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=10687). Also, I'm seeing way too much trouble making an argument (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=23416) about fictional characters and using way too many silly links (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=8737), especially considering I'll probably get downrated again and this'll all go to oblivion (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=40718), but hey. If you read all the way here, have a cookie (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=645).",
            date = "2010-11-28T18:22:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26965#comments:id=1194156",
        },
        {
            id = 1201596,
            score = 48,
            author = "139511",
            text = "the alliance between the horse and the forsaken\n\nSo THAT's how they created Dreadsteeds.\n\nI stand by my point, if your neighbour was a zombie whose cousin happened to kill half the neighborhood with blueberry pie, you probably wouldn't support his plans of building a pie factory even if it is to support his family no matter how well it's advertised for the dough to be \"to die for\" (Recipe of the Month in the Cooking Mama And Her Pets -magazine!), especially if you get to see the blueberries being grown with \"100% safe mystery fertilizer\" provided by Ol' Elkay's \"Kill 'Em Good\" Nuclear Rat Poison Company.",
            date = "2010-12-02T04:20:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26965#comments:id=1201596",
        },
        {
            id = 1081590,
            score = 43,
            author = "Contay",
            text = "As seen/reported to be in the Beta as of 6/22/2010\n\nSource: http://forums.worldofwarcraft.com/thread.html?topicId=25482320560&sid=2000&pageNo=2#27\n\nI won't be surprised if this gets 'toned down' a bit in later Beta builds or when Cataclysm goes live, as you will see...\n\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Where is that Orge headed buffoon?\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner Ah, speak of the devil...\n*Portals from Ogrimmar arrive with Hellscream, Hellscream's elite, and High Warlord Cromush*\n*Hellscream jumps from the portal down to Sylvanas*\nGarrosh Hellscream: This better be important, Sylvanas. You know how I detest this place and its foul stench. Why have you called for me?\nGarrosh Hellscream: And more importantly, what are those Scourge fiends doing here? *Garrosh makes a gesture @ the Val'kyr*\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Warchief, so glad you could make it.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: With the death of the Lich King, many of the more intelligent Scourge became...unemployed. Those 'fiends,' as you so delicately put it, are called val'kyr. They are under my command now...\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: ...and they are part of the reason that I asked to see you.\nGarrosh Hellscream: Get on with it Sylvanas.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Very well, Warchief. I have solved the plight of the Forsaken!\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: As a race, we Forsaken are unable to procreate.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: With the aid of the val'kyr, we are now able to take the corpses of the fallen and create new Forsaken.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Agatha, show the Warchief!\n*The Val'kyr Agatha proceeds to resurrect fallen corpses as Undead*\nHigh Warlord Cromush: ABBERATION!\nGarrosh Hellscream: What you have done here, Sylvanas....it goes against the laws of nature. Disgusting is the only word I have to describe it.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Warchief, without these new Forsaken my people would die out...Out hold upon Gilneas and northern Lordaeron would crumble.\nGarrosh Hellscream: Have you given any thought to what this means, Sylvanas.\nGarrosh Hellscream: What difference is there between you and the Lich King now?\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner: Isn't it obvious, Warchief? I serve the Horde. (She does the Female Blood Elf salute, which is downright hysterical because it's such a condescending salute to begin with ;p)\nGarrosh Hellscream: Watch your clever mouth, $%^&*.(Yes he really called her a @#$%^)\nGarrosh Hellscream: Cromush, you stay behind and make sure the Banshee Queen is well \"guarded.\" I will be expecting a full report when next we meet.\nHigh Warlord Cromush: As you command, Warchief!\nGarrosh Hellscream: Remember, Sylvanas, eventually we all have to stand before our maker and face judgment. Your day may come sooner than others...",
            date = "2010-07-16T01:28:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26965#comments:id=1081590",
        },
        {
            id = 1109773,
            score = 42,
            author = "97036",
            text = "The Val'kyr, Agatha, that Lady Sylvanas speaks to in this quest is accompanied by two other Val'kyrs named Dashura and Arthura.\n\nAll three Val'kyrs are references to the \"precogs\" from the movie Minority Report: Agatha, Dashiell and Arthur.",
            date = "2010-08-28T16:17:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26965#comments:id=1109773",
        },
        {
            id = 1313092,
            score = 36,
            author = "Avish",
            text = "I am proud to count myself in the not-so-silent minority that detests Sylvanas. In fact, Garrosh calling her, you know, that thing he called her, seriously raised my opinion of him, quite a bit. The Forsaken deserve no respect from anyone because they give no respect to anyone. God, but I would like to see her overthrown and her wretched lot straightened out. They've gone from  vaguely evil to distinctly evil.\n\nSylvanas fanboys may now feel free to downrate the bajeezus out of me.",
            date = "2011-01-28T10:13:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26965#comments:id=1313092",
        },
    },
    [26978] = {
        {
            id = 1181587,
            score = 17,
            author = "304661",
            text = "Pretty simple quest. Use your Drums on the locations.\nMill is in the middle of the farm, Barn is the building to the right, ranch house is to the left, and the grain silos to the north of the farm.\nOnly difficulty is placing the drum on the grain silo, took me a few try, it has to be in the middle of the two silos.",
            date = "2010-11-24T13:06:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26978#comments:id=1181587",
        },
        {
            id = 1696162,
            score = 15,
            author = "sitecow09",
            text = "Replauge the plaguelands just as theyv been un-plagued! God, I can see the recruitment posters now: The Forsaken, we do exactly the same crap the Scourge pulled, but YOUR a playable character, so you wont have to face the prospect of becoming a threat to Azeroth and consequently becoming a raid boss. Join today! :D",
