            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26978#comments:id=1696162",
        },
        {
            id = 1182429,
            score = 7,
            author = "whuzzupj",
            text = "Interesting little tidbit, after you place the original barrel you can continue to place more at that site, you can use this to get ontop of things like the loft on the inside of the barn, I will add a screenshot.\n\nAlso you can get 4 barrels placed, as it is coming off cooldown for the fifth one the first one will dissapear, however any that were on top of it will stay there.",
            date = "2010-11-24T17:23:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26978#comments:id=1182429",
        },
        {
            id = 1195820,
            score = 7,
            author = "338236",
            text = "You must be physically inside the place where you are trying to place the barrel in order to get credit. If you try to stand outside of the barn or house and drop it at range, it won't work.\n\nAlso, as a full sized Tauren, I was able to get inside both the barn and farmhouse as of the date of this post.",
            date = "2010-11-29T13:46:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26978#comments:id=1195820",
        },
        {
            id = 1296120,
            score = 6,
            author = "Ramenka",
            text = "Well i dont know if it is glitched or whatever but i dropped this quest,placed the barrel at the silos and the cottage without problem but once i left the cottage the respawn rate became downright idiotic, in the course of about 5 minutes i had to kill over 20 npcs, and more were still spawning making it impossible to solo with that type of rate,Now i applaud Blizzards attempt to make the game a bit harder as in the pre bc days but on some quests they have become just plain stupid,as is the case for this 1,my advice dont even bother and move on to andorhal. case in point i went from just under lvl 37 1/2 to 38 just from killing the respawns b efore i gave up,didnt even have time to loot half the corpses.",
            date = "2011-01-16T09:23:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26978#comments:id=1296120",
        },
    },
