        },
        {
            id = 6239668,
            score = 5,
            author = "Paperclips",
            text = "Took bat to bomb the murlocs.\nLook inside murloc area.\nNo murlocs.\n\nEntire area is phased and there are only Scarlets on the islands. Nothing I did would place me in the right phase. You see the correct phase when you're on a neighbouring map, so I had to circle the islands to find murlocs close enough to reach with my spells to get the 50 kill count from a distance. Thankfully you can just kill them yourself.  I was able to reach a bunch from Hillsbrad Foothills 37,18, just waited a bit for respawns.\n\nEdit: I had no phasing issues with a level 12 character. So the solution, it seems, is to not go in with max level.",
            date = "2025-12-05T16:12:05-06:00",
