            id = 1188681,
            score = 11,
            author = "470888",
            text = "Just an fyi, this quest is ridiculously easy. Like this should be the first quest done in all starting zones, it's that easy.  This being said... do it. Almost 5k xp, for maybe 1 minute of your time.\n\nLeave mill, go to horse (which you passed on the way in) mount up, go past the mill, find groups of spiders, press 1, find spiders, press 1. I think I was getting 3 or 4 each time.\n\nLots of spiders in groups around 46,36",
            date = "2010-11-26T19:45:06-06:00",
