            text = "My Sea Pup de-spawned when I decided halfway through the quest to send my poisonous chicken at the Forest Ettin who was walking past.  Had to go back to Admiral Hatchet to request a new one.  As I had credit for the 2 my first Pup carried, my new Pup got off easy!",
