            text = "Weegil Blastfuse is an essential part of Wrath of the Sandfury and Chief Ukorz Sandscalp. You need him to open a locked gate after the fight (the \"If you free him, he'll help you blast your way to Ukorz's private chamber\" bit). He doesn't do it on his own, you have to keep him alive and ask him. Oh--and there's a giant mob scene coming up the stairs after you free him and his companions. It's confusing, and I completed this quest without getting him to open the gate. :-( Learn from my experience!",
