            text = "This quest is part of the second time you'll be operating out of Andorhal while questing in this zone. After completing the first series of quests to defeat the Scourge forces in the town and a temporary ceasefire with the Alliance is declared, you will need to travel to the Bulwark and complete quests at Felstone Field before you are sent back to Andorhal and this quest becomes available.",
            date = "2012-07-27T01:54:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27085#comments:id=1692535",
        },
