            text = "I tired over and over again to kill the npc's to complete the quest, but I kept dying.\nI found it easiest to kill off a few npc's to make my way around the rest of them. It's a lot easier. (I went to the left side killed off a few of the front men/women and went through some broken down buildings, and made my way around the rest of the npc's to the other side to complete the quest. Never died doing it that way.)\nHappy Questing!",
