            author = "Trinket90",
            text = "As a lvl 80 doing Loremaster, I had the same problem--the Val'kyr and the Forsaken troopers would NOT go away! Finally the troopers disappeared while I was doing other quests, but the Val'kyr stuck around, getting in the way of targeting and opening quest items. I finally took a flight path, even though my flying mount was SO much faster, and she disappeared. Thank the good Lord. She's obnoxious.",
            date = "2010-12-15T11:53:17-06:00",
