    },
    [27124] = {
        {
            id = 1281531,
            score = 92,
            author = "360166",
            text = "1. Enter instance - Do Not Kill Guard Mol'dar (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14326) (69.63, 75.05) (Important - If you kill him, you can't complete the quest and will need to exit & reset the instance, then he will attack you until you kill the King again - avoid him by killing the dogs to his right, carefully so as to not aggro him)\n2. Click on the chest at 49.35, 78.41 to get the Gordok Courtyard Key (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18266)\n3. Speak to Knot Thimblejack (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14338) (28.58, 55.22), take the quest The Gordok Ogre Suit (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27119)\n(optional, no reward or rep) 'fix' the broken trap, trapping Guard Slip'kik - one less to kill\n4. Go up the first ramp, collect the Ogre Tannin (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18240)  (basket 23.65, 55.32) - Bring it back to Knot, get the Gordok Ogre Suit (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18258/gordok-ogre-suit), put it on (lasts 10 minutes)\n5. Go up both ramps, through door, speak to Captain Kromcrush (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14325) (31.74, 48.77) - he's now standing where you got the\n6. Go forward, kill King Gordok (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11501) (31.70, 26.02) - speak with Mizzle the Crafty (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14353) (31.76, 27.48) - collect loot.\n7. Head back towards the entrance\n8. Speak to Captain Kromcrush (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14325) (he's now standing where you got the Gordok Courtyard Key (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18266)) - Get quest Unfinished Gordok Business (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124)\n9. Speak with Stomper Kreeg  (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14322) (67.87, 66.01) - Get quest The Gordok Taste Test (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27114) - (optional, no rep but get 5 Gordok Green Grog (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18269) and 5 Kreeg's Stout Beatdown (http://www.wowhead.com/item=18284))\n10. Speak with Guard Mol'dar (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=14326) - complete Unfinished Gordok Business (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124)\n\nEDIT: As I was compiling this, I was hoping to get some rep for Steamwheedle Cartel -  unfortunately, this was NOT the case.",
            date = "2011-01-07T00:21:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124#comments:id=1281531",
        },
        {
            id = 1800021,
            score = 41,
            author = "445261",
            text = "Notes on Thora's instructions, after Cata and Mists have dropped:\n\n1) Enter Dire Maul north - that's the one this quest takes place in.\n2) No longer necessary since the removal of keys.  https://www.wowhead.com/object=179516 is now empty and the door is already unlocked; just go straight through.\n3) No change.\n4) Thora's instruction and wowhead's map (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27119) for this quest are correct, but Blizzard's in-game quest marker is incorrect.  It puts the location much farther along in the instance than it actually is.  Follow the instructions here, not your in-game map.\n5) https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14325 wasn't standing where I got the... tannin, I'm guessing?  Anyway, he's all the ramps and down the hall, just before you enter Gordok's Seat (the circular room with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11501).\n6) Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11501 but make sure to leave https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14324 alive.\n7) No change.\n8) Well, where you would have gotten the key in step (2) if it was still in game.  You can't really miss him, though, as you're running back towards the start.\n9) No change.\n10) No change.\n\nHope this helps some folks.  Thora (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Thora3967)'s original comment quoted below:\n\n1. Enter instance - Do Not Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14326 (69.63, 75.05) (Important - If you kill him, you can't complete the quest and will need to exit & reset the instance, then he will attack you until you kill the King again - avoid him by killing the dogs to his right, carefully so as to not aggro him)\n2. Click on the chest at 49.35, 78.41 to get the https://www.wowhead.com/item=18266\n3. Speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14338 (28.58, 55.22), take the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27119\n(optional, no reward or rep) 'fix' the broken trap, trapping Guard Slip'kik - one less to kill\n4. Go up the first ramp, collect the Ogre Tannin (basket 23.65, 55.32) - Bring it back to Knot, get the Gordok Ogre Suit, put it on (lasts 10 minutes)\n5. Go up both ramps, through door, speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14325 (31.74, 48.77) - he's now standing where you got the\n6. Go forward, kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11501 (31.70, 26.02) - speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14353 (31.76, 27.48) - collect loot.\n7. Head back towards the entrance\n8. Speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14325 (he's now standing where you got the https://www.wowhead.com/item=18266) - Get quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124\n9. Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14322  (67.87, 66.01) - Get quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27114 - (optional, no rep but get 5 Gordok Green Grog and 5 Kreeg's Stout Beatdown)\n10. Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14326 - complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124",
            date = "2013-01-17T10:15:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124#comments:id=1800021",
        },
        {
            id = 3139295,
            score = 17,
            author = "delilama",
            text = "Done in BFA 8.2. This for how to solo this after the removal of the keys and to maximize your chances to get loot from the https://www.wowhead.com/object=179564 chest. If you don't care for getting maximum chest loot, then make sure you don't kill Guard Mol'dar and that you get the ogre suit and talk to Captain Kromcrush.\n\nFull Tribute Run (skip this if you already know how to do one):\n\nSkip all bosses (including extra bosses) except for King Gordok\nAfter entering the hallway after Guard Fengus area, go until you see a hunter looking trap (Broken Trap) on the ground. Complete its quest (but avoid aggroing Guard Slip'kik)\nWait for Slip'kik to get caught in the trap and then work your way up the ramp\nWhen you see the brown basket in the middle, click on it to get the https://www.wowhead.com/item=18240\nGo back down the ramp to the goblin next to the fire (Knot Thimblejack) and turn in the tannin to get the https://www.wowhead.com/item=18258\nUse the suit and go up the ramp until you see Captain Kromcrush. Talk to him to trigger him to leave.\nGo to the King Gordok and only kill him; don't kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14324\nWait for Mizzle the Crafty to come and keep talking to him until he spawns the chest and loot it.\n\nQuest Steps:\n\nDo a \"Full Tribute Run\" (or do the minimal parts to get Kromcrush back to the courtyard)\nHead back to where Guard Fengus would be fought at and talk to Captain Kromcrush\nAccept the quest and turn it into Guard Mol'dar\ngg",
            date = "2019-07-13T19:21:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124#comments:id=3139295",
        },
        {
            id = 1195358,
            score = 13,
            author = "712900",
            text = "you'll get the quest from Captain Kromcrush, after you're defeated King Gordok. So you have to ignore him, and directly go kill the king (:",
            date = "2010-11-29T09:47:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124#comments:id=1195358",
        },
        {
            id = 1666937,
            score = 5,
            author = "Mirrodin",
            text = "Well, i am horde and the npc was giving me this quest, so i guess the alliance tag on this quest is wrong and should be replaced with a tag for both factions.",
            date = "2012-05-14T15:29:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124#comments:id=1666937",
        },
    },
    [27125] = {
        {
            id = 2028457,
            score = 4,
            author = "Dalylah",
            text = "You can turn this in at Dire Maul North (Gordok Commons). The physical entrance to this instance is at 64.49, 24.90 in Feralas. For those of you without coordinates it is at the back of the Broken Commons, past the Maul.",
            date = "2014-11-12T12:34:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27125#comments:id=2028457",
        },
        {
            id = 1195170,
            score = 3,
            author = "Sulis",
            text = "When u get the quest to get the suit, u got to go upstairs and kill till u can reach the basket. One of the group members receive the blood from this basket. He/she's to return to the questgiver and receives a suit. Then return up with the whole group, put on the suit and talk to the captain, he will wander off and u can pass.\nKill Cho'Rush the Observer first and then King Gordok. After both are killed an ogre called Mizzle the Crafty comes running to u. Talk to him and he'll give u a chest with rewards.\n\n...it's good to be the king...",
            date = "2010-11-29T07:10:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27125#comments:id=1195170",
        },
        {
            id = 1493752,
            score = 3,
            author = "708567",
            text = "Also don't kill Guard Mol'dar or Stomper Kreeg as these 2 are quest related after you become the king. Guard Mol'dar is where you hand in Unfinished Gordok Business (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27124). Stomper Kreeg offers The Gordok Taste Test (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27114), which gives you some free alcohol. He also becomes a vendor, conveniently enough.",
            date = "2011-08-13T01:45:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27125#comments:id=1493752",
        },
        {
            id = 1624111,
            score = 2,
            author = "27993",
            text = "In case anyone gets the quest but doesn't complete it and forgets which part of Dire Maul to queue for, queue for \"Dire Maul - Gordok Commons\"",
            date = "2012-02-09T13:51:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27125#comments:id=1624111",
        },
        {
            id = 1687493,
            score = 1,
            author = "425699",
            text = "\"Find and kill King Gordok while killing as few of their other leaders as possible, and not only will your reward be great, you will be able to use your power as king to halt the Gordok invasion without conflict!\"\n\nInvading their stronghold, slaughtering the way to the King, and killing the King, is not conflict, it seems.",
            date = "2012-07-12T23:41:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27125#comments:id=1687493",
        },
    },
