            author = "Krastopic",
            text = "Ok - to be clear.  You are inside the courtyard area.  You see the round hole where the arena is in front of you as you enter the area.  Go all the way across the courtyard to the north wall of the courtyard on the far side of the arena area.  You will see what looks like a big wooden door with two fires, one on each side burning at the top of the stairs.  Go up to this, look right and you will see the dungeon entrance.  Your quest giver is just inside - you do not have to organize a party to go in and complete this quest.  Bop in and then turn around and bop out.",
