        {
            id = 1236763,
            score = 68,
            author = "stoner1991",
            text = "Poor Koltira. This makes me hate Sylvanas even more.",
            date = "2010-12-15T20:58:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27144#comments:id=1236763",
        },
        {
            id = 1590903,
            score = 55,
            author = "stormeagle6",
            text = "I had Zen'kiki accompanying me on this entire quest chain since I still had the quest in my log to kill the diseased birds... and while it's fun to watch him miss Alliance soldiers with his wild wrath spells, he managed to park himself in front of the camera during the first part of this cutscene, blocking out both Sylvanas and Koltira.\n\n... Zen'kiki really can't do anything right.",
            date = "2011-12-05T21:47:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27144#comments:id=1590903",
        },
        {
            id = 1104097,
            score = 43,
            author = "302379",
            text = "Here's the complete dialog from the scene that plays before you can complete the quest:\n\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner yells: Koltira! Your queen summons you!\nKoltira Deathweaver says: Your highness, I deliver to you... Andorhal.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: Enough of this insolence. Do you think that I'm blind to everything that goes on outside of the Undercity?\nKoltira Deathweaver says: I... your majesty, we were victorious!\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: No thanks to you. Andorhal should have been ours days ago, when we defeated the Scourge.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: I know your secret, Koltira. I'm aware of your friendship with the Alliance death knight, Thassarian.\nKoltira Deathweaver says: Y... your majesty...\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: Arthas clearly failed when he created his death knights. You are still weak.\n((At this point, Sylvanas opens a portal to the Undercity.))\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: Fortunately, I have agents that can help you... erase this weakness. Beneath the Undercity you go.\nKoltira Deathweaver yells: NO!\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: Shh... quiet, death knight. When I'm finished with you, your fear will be gone.\nLady Sylvanas Windrunner says: You can thank me later.",
            date = "2010-08-20T01:52:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27144#comments:id=1104097",
        },
        {
            id = 1322811,
            score = 37,
            author = "splunge",
            text = "I pondered for a while how hard and yet awesome it would be to find a way to keep leveling and keep this hot sexy undead winged banshee momma of my dreams with me all the way to 85.... but one thing kept going through my head:\n\nFLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP FLAP\n\n...so i sent her packing.",
            date = "2011-02-05T15:19:45-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27144#comments:id=1322811",
        },
    },
