            text = "For the location impaired:\n\nHigh Cleric: He's in the east-most building, south of the Keep.  It has a clock-tower.\nIronstock:     She's in the center, in the barn-like stable\nMorris Vant:  He's in the north-most building between the Keep and the mine\nOutfitter:        He's in a tent between Vant and the mine",
            date = "2010-11-25T21:44:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27153#comments:id=1186031",
