            text = "Wow! For awhile I thought I was going blind! They are tough to find!\nAt least I found out that they're actually there, haha.. They're very small!\nI only found one because I was mousing over the ground and I had a loot symbol on my cursor.. Whew..\nFor me, it was easier to find them in the grass along the road, I even found a feather on the path. It seemed like on the hills close to the mountain range was less likely for them.. Could of just been for me, though!",
