            text = "Lore-wise, this is a good quest, good idea.  If you ran this in Wrath or previous, you remember the undead around the area. This follows up the 'cleansing' of the area and how the battlefront has moved elsewhere, but even though it's cleansed, it's far from a completely restored scene. Good 'spirit' comments at times when they release. They did this one right.",
