            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27171#comments:id=1339546",
        },
        {
            id = 1784654,
            score = 4,
            author = "Beagall",
            text = "Looks like phasing is being used during this quest since at once point when I was fighting these guys outside the crypt they disappeared (due to me running outside of the phased area) and I had to use https://www.wowhead.com/spell=115546 (since I was on my Monk) to get them within the phased area. If you can't get everything inside the crypt and have to go outside, watch out for this.",
            date = "2012-12-20T13:18:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27171#comments:id=1784654",
        },
        {
            id = 2272569,
