        {
            id = 1206819,
            score = 23,
            author = "Sukie",
            text = "Go to Interface > Names, and check \"Critters and Companions\". It makes the frogs much easier to see :)",
            date = "2010-12-04T19:56:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27183#comments:id=1206819",
        },
        {
            id = 1231417,
            score = 9,
            author = "40089",
            text = "If you're a hunter, be sure to attack the frogs from range or put your pet on passive stance.  I walked up to these critters, right clicked to attack, and my pet killed them milliseconds before my melee hit, making them unlootable.\n\nYeah okay I sound like an idiot for not figuring out the problem sooner, but there it is.",
            date = "2010-12-13T20:41:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27183#comments:id=1231417",
        },
        {
            id = 1207882,
            score = 6,
            author = "698260",
            text = "They only drop one leg per frog. You'd think that frogs have two legs, eh?",
            date = "2010-12-05T09:43:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27183#comments:id=1207882",
        },
        {
            id = 5366365,
            score = 5,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "BE WARNED: They really like to Evade! They will Evade from you --without fail-- if you don't kill them fast enough.\nThe time limit is roughly 6 seconds. This is plenty of time if you're fighting them one at a time, but pulling a few as a group is inadvisable due to this hidden timer.\nAlso, if you find yourself in combat with a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23555 or a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23554 in addition to a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23979, I'd recommend killing the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23979 first. ;)",
            date = "2022-04-29T23:36:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27183#comments:id=5366365",
        },
        {
            id = 1708979,
            score = 3,
            author = "artsylaurie",
            text = "If you have the Creepy Crate mini-pet, DO NOT have it out while doing this quest. The frogs you are after are critters, and it WILL eat them.\n\nWell, I suppose you could have it out if you really wanted to... it will make the quest take much longer though!",
            date = "2012-09-03T21:50:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27183#comments:id=1708979",
        },
    },
    [27184] = {
        {
            id = 1703653,
            score = 3,
            author = "276651",
            text = "Completing this quest opens up two new quests from Jarl:\n\nHungry as an Ogre (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27191)\nJarl Needs a Blade (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27186).",
            date = "2012-08-24T01:02:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27184#comments:id=1703653",
        },
        {
            id = 1712400,
            score = 3,
            author = "923647",
            text = "I already did the quests from Brackenwall Village and killed 9000 of these spiders before I got this quest... *bashes head on keyboard*  Make sure you go to the village and get Darkmist Extermination (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25051) and SMASH BROODQUEEN (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27229) first.",
            date = "2012-09-11T19:37:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27184#comments:id=1712400",
        },
        {
            id = 3230870,
            score = 3,
            author = "Slothcat",
            text = "The process of the quest undermines the idea.  Jarl has you go find spider eyes because spiders have more than two eyes, so in theory your quantity should be larger per kill, but every spider I killed dropped no more than two.  I guess the rest of them all popped...",
            date = "2020-09-17T16:03:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27184#comments:id=3230870",
        },
        {
            id = 5366371,
            score = 1,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "Every few minutes, you can catch a short conversation between https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23843 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4792:\nMordant Grimsby says: I brought you a housewarming gift, Jarl.\nMordant Grimsby says: Go on, open it. I think you'll like it.\nMordant Grimsby says: Jarl?\n\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl says: Unless it's something I can eat, I don't want it.\nMordant Grimsby says: Jarl, you haven't been yourself ever since I arrived. What's going on?\n\"Swamp Eye\" Jarl says: Nothing. Wanna help me whip up some frog leg stew?\nMordant Grimsby says: I came out here to visit you, Jarl! And I find you living in an empty cabin in the middle of nowhere, babbling about frogs? You're hopeless!\nI find it amusing that https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23843 specifically calls attention to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4792's cabin being completely empty, and the weirdness of that fact -- it's the first thing I noticed when I walked in there!",
            date = "2022-04-29T23:51:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27184#comments:id=5366371",
        },
    },
