            author = "Rumahn",
            text = "To those attempting this in 8.0.1, be aware that opening the box pulls every mob in the area. If you don't clear all the trash, you will wipe. Unfortunately, this quest is still bugged, and if you wipe before the boss is dead, the box despawns and you aren't able to summon him again.",
