            text = "Ok here we go\n\n1. You must wait till the animation of the current battle is done.\n2. After Tethyr is dead the sky will clear and the the quest will be available for turn in.\n\nIf the Major is not visible. Run off for a few minutes and come back.",
            date = "2017-11-05T19:39:31-06:00",
