            text = "Open up your character window while you're hosing one of them Orcs down and you'll get something kind of sort of hilarious. At least, if you're an easily amused jerk like me.\n\nhttp://i56.tinypic.com/w85j7c.jpg\n\nI laughed. You may not.",
