            text = "In Shadowlands, if you're on https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58983 the throne room is totally empty.  You can abandon Tides of War and the room will repopulate... but of course Varian, nor Anduin is there... so talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=1750 instead.  I thought Chromie Time was supposed to fix this stuff ;-)",
