            author = "415869",
            text = "Use the https://www.wowhead.com/item=137663 for an easy way to complete this quest if you do too much damage.",
            date = "2017-06-03T11:05:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27242#comments:id=2498055",
        },
        {
            id = 2509761,
            score = 21,
            author = "rcuosukgi42",
            text = "Anyone doing this or any other low level \"wound the mob\" quest in patch 7 or later use the https://www.wowhead.com/item=137663 which is purchasable in Stormwind, it works perfectly and doesn't require any rez-sickness or other trouble.",
            date = "2017-07-23T14:16:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27242#comments:id=2509761",
        },
        {
            id = 1238301,
            score = 19,
            author = "Bezo",
            text = "use the quest item when the mob have less then 20% hp.",
            date = "2010-12-16T12:47:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27242#comments:id=1238301",
        },
        {
            id = 1666775,
            score = 13,
            author = "953950",
            text = "It was a bit tricky doing this quest as a lvl 85. With the Raptors having 1200-1300 hp and my lowest hitting attack causing 2500dmg I first tried removing gear etc, but it obviously would've taken ages since I was hitting them for next to nothing.\nAs a mage I put on https://www.wowhead.com/Spell=30482, which does about 196dmg when attacked, and I just stood there and took the hits from the Raptor a few times, until the raptor was at 20% and I used the rope.\n\nThe first one I captured I took help from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4880, after picking up the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1222. It took some time just standing there watching him hit the raptor, but if you have no other options you might want to try it :)",
            date = "2012-05-14T07:31:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27242#comments:id=1666775",
        },
        {
            id = 1550549,
            score = 10,
            author = "Kurasu",
            text = "If you are having problems with autoattack, the rope can be used when your back is turned. Whack on the mob until they're low, then quickly turn around and use the rope. Taking a hit or two is vastly preferable to accidentally whacking them to death when you're trying to capture them!",
            date = "2011-10-21T16:55:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27242#comments:id=1550549",
        },
    },
