            author = "Zuljid",
            text = "Alas, I was expecting Horatio Lane  (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=42744/lieutenant-horatio-laine#comments)to be the one inspecting the ruins.\nIt seems he wasn't...\n*sunglasses*\nInn for it.\n\nYEEEEAAAAAAAAHH! (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6YMPAH67f4o&feature=related)",
