            id = 6263274,
            score = 1,
            author = "ragedaug",
            text = "In TBC Anniversary, this quest was tough to figure as the quests changed from Classic Vanilla.\n\nTo get this quest, I needed to complete: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27253\n\nAfter turning those in, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23567 tell me to check out the ruins, however, the quest items were already gone, as I picked those up and turned them in during Vanilla.\n\nTo get the next quest from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4926, I had to complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27261 first, then once I returned to Krog, he gave me https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27258, which sent me to Thunder Bluff, where I picked up this Quest (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27292), and then I was able to turn that in with Krog and pick up the follow up quests.",
            date = "2026-01-16T02:49:24-06:00",
