            author = "Apolocyntosis",
            text = "You will find a LOT of weapon racks on the main mesa of Darkcloud Pinnacle, so don't worry about there not being many on the first few mesas.",
            date = "2011-08-20T11:52:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27311#comments:id=1499354",
        },
        {
            id = 1797830,
            score = 3,
            author = "1078869",
            text = "This is the most frustrating quest I have hit yet. I have been screwing around for almost an hour trying to find a weapons rack. There are three other players hanging around up there doing the same thing. The creatures respawn every two seconds it seems, and the weapons rack don't ever sem to respawn. As far as I can tell, this quest cannot be completed unless you are the ONLY player doing it. On the plus side, I got a few good drops from the 1-200 fights it hit while trying futiley to find one more weapons racks.",
            date = "2013-01-13T11:09:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27311#comments:id=1797830",
