            text = "Freewind Brave seems to despawn after you complete the Arikara quest chain, so if you have not completed this quest by then, there appears to be no way to turn it in (or the other \"along the way to Arikara\" quests).\n\nI've got a support ticket in to a GM on it, but I think I'll probably have to wind up abandoning the quest although it's marked \"Complete\".",
