            id = 1435281,
            score = 10,
            author = "tpie89",
            text = "for all of the above quests you have to have completed all the quests up to free freewind post, then you have to complete the brave and the bold, then together again, to do this one kill all three enemies at the north facing bridge, he will appear to hand in quest and will stay until you have done the quest chains above.\n\nin the brave and the bold quest you will find him located at 45.25, 50.21 chained up. will only see him once you have accepted the quest. together again i handed in at 42.22, 48.61.\n\nHope this helps.",
            date = "2011-06-06T01:54:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27315#comments:id=1435281",
        },
        {
