        },
        {
            id = 2451048,
            score = 17,
            author = "silveress",
            text = "If you're wondering where to turn them in, return to the bridge where Eastern Plaguelands meets Western Plaguelands. Questgiver is there. For some reason, the question mark didn't show up the map for this and The Gift for Fiona quest. But the questgiver is still there.",
