        {
            id = 1245858,
            score = 4,
            author = "717526",
            text = "You need to update the map, as I've just done this quest on my Level 41, and the start and finish points are different.",
            date = "2010-12-19T15:00:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27372#comments:id=1245858",
        },
        {
            id = 2371963,
            score = 4,
            author = "bonechene",
            text = "If you're here for the belt, like me, you'll want to know this. You must do this on a druid or monk. You don't get to pick your quest reward otherwise, it's given based on your class & spec. I did this on my rogue and only got the option for the bracers.\n\nTo get to this quest, go to the caravan on your map (8.92, 66.28). Talk to the worgen Fiona (www.wowhead.com/npc=45417/fiona) and get the quest \"Tarenar Sunstrike (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27370/tarenar-sunstrike)\". Complete it by talking to the blood elf Tarenar (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=45429/tarenar-sunstrike), then do his quest, \"What I do best (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27371/what-i-do-best)\". After that you'll get \"A Gift for Fiona (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27372/a-gift-for-fiona)\". Whole process takes less than 5 minutes.\n\nHappy transmog hunting!",
            date = "2016-08-22T04:03:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27372#comments:id=2371963",
        },
    },
    [27373] = {
        {
