            author = "804418",
            text = "Could this be a Lord of the Rings reference? An elf and a dwarf fighting about how many they've killed?",
            date = "2011-04-17T18:20:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27373#comments:id=1393740",
        },
        {
            id = 1191065,
            score = 39,
            author = "196807",
            text = "The following conversation occurs between the 3 NPCs while you are on the ride to Crown Guard Tower from Thondroril River.\n\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Shotgun!\nGidwin Goldbraids says: Hey now!  Why do you get to sit in front?\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Because I won our bet.  And because I called shotgun.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: Who says you won the bet?  We haven't compared tallies yet.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Fine.  I killed five zombies.  And they were huge.  How many undead did you kill?\nGidwin Goldbraids says: I'm pretty sure I killed six.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: I'm going to bet that you only killed four.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: H... how did you know that?\nTarenar Sunstrike says: I didn't.  You just told me!\nTarenar Sunstrike says: So seriously, how did your undead hunting go?  I want to hear stories.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Gidwin?  Are you ignoring me?\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Giddy... you're mad at me, aren't you?\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Remember when we were kids, Gidwin?  We would spend all day pretending to fight the trolls, or the murlocs, or the girls.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: Don't do this, Tarenar.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: We had a name we called ourselves... what was it?\nGidwin Goldbraids says: You remember damn well enough what it was.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: I'm dead serious.  I've completely forgotten.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: ... \"The Paladin Pals\".\nFiona says: Gidwin, you can sit in front with me next time.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: Maybe now I don't want to.  Maybe I like it better sitting back here with my new friend.  It smells like horses up there.\nFiona says: There's a tower coming up on our left.  What do you say we stop and rest a bit?\nGidwin Goldbraids says: We just rested a few minutes ago!  Let's just go to Light's Hope Chapel!\nFiona says: The roads here are rough, Gidwin.  I don't want to risk losing a horse.\nGidwin Goldbraids says: We won't lose a horse.  Look at them!  They look exactly like they did when we started.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: Actually, I agree with Fiona.\nTarenar Sunstrike says: The Argent Crusade can wait for us a little while longer.  Besides... our guest may want to get off the caravan soon.\nFiona says: Here we are!",
            date = "2010-11-27T17:19:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27373#comments:id=1191065",
        },
        {
            id = 1298881,
            score = 30,
            author = "DocLithius",
            text = "Edit: I know, I know.  Eagletamer said it first.  Sorry.  XD\n\n\"We have two paladins and a shopkeeper, but you know what we really need? A paladin!\"\n\nFiona, Fiona, Fiona...  You poor, easily-confused dear.  The line makes sense with just about any other class in the game, but I'd think the last thing you'd need would be another paladin!  (I think \"you know what we really need? A death knight!\" is about as questionable, all things considered...  Heh)",
            date = "2011-01-18T07:49:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27373#comments:id=1298881",
        },
        {
            id = 1193699,
            score = 29,
            author = "366821",
            text = "They pretended to fight the girls and they're The Paladin Pals.  I seriously love these guys.",
            date = "2010-11-28T15:20:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27373#comments:id=1193699",
        },
    },
    [27381] = {
        {
            id = 1179712,
            score = 34,
            author = "Tardis1488",
            text = "To complete the quest run inside the tower to the top and talk with Argus Highbeacon who is also another quest giver.",
            date = "2010-11-24T00:17:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381#comments:id=1179712",
        },
        {
            id = 1180940,
            score = 18,
            author = "common5",
            text = "You'll need to complete Argus Highbeacon's guest \"Rough Roads\" to be able to continue on with Fiona's Caravan. She will give the quest \"The Trek Continues\" once you do.\n\nEdit: Since Argus joins the caravan you will have the new option of a caravan buff. \"Argus' Journal\" Grants 2%xp Bonus while in the Eastern Plaugelands.",
            date = "2010-11-24T09:45:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381#comments:id=1180940",
        },
        {
            id = 1323025,
            score = 10,
            author = "txngurl25",
            text = "I'd suggest doing Onward to Light's Hope Chapel - Once you get to Crown Guard Tower, the caravan stops.\nTalk to Tarenar Sunstrike to get the quest to find a traveling companion.\nThe npc you can add to the caravan is up top of the tower - Argus Highbeacon. In order to continue, you must complete his quest to kill 13 Plaguebats.\nIf you are farming for Mr.Grubbs, I managed to finally get mine after the 9th Plaguebat kill.\nBtw, the more people added to the caravan - the better your chance of it dropping from the hidden stash (with Fiona's Lucky Charm buff active), so if you're farming for Mr.Grubbs, I'd say just wait til you get this 3rd guy added - w/ just the 2 pallies I got maybe 20 stash in 2 hours (Farming the Trolls up north) and no drop.",
            date = "2011-02-05T18:31:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381#comments:id=1323025",
        },
        {
            id = 1983906,
            score = 3,
            author = "ayukas",
            text = "For a quick way down, click on the box of Argent Parachutes besides Argus for a slowfall buff and you can jump off the tower safely.",
            date = "2014-07-24T08:05:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381#comments:id=1983906",
        },
        {
            id = 1186475,
            score = 2,
            author = "294564",
            text = "You have to do the quest \"Rough Roads\" that Argus gives you BEFORE he will agree to join the caravan.",
            date = "2010-11-26T01:48:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381#comments:id=1186475",
        },
    },
