        {
            id = 1584595,
            score = 7,
            author = "857663",
            text = "The Shattered Sword of Marduk is at 39.8 , 72.4",
            date = "2011-11-30T12:01:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27387#comments:id=1584595",
        },
        {
            id = 2543731,
            score = 6,
            author = "SVAFnemesis",
            text = "For those who come back later for the Chromie's Mirror, The questline to trigger this quest is called \"Rewriting The Battle of Darrowshire\". It is located in Crow Guard Tower and it will take you to southwest corner and find little girl Pamela. And then the questline goes as such:\n     1. [41]Pamela's Doll;\n     2. [41]I'm Not Supposed To Tell You This;\n     3. [41]Uncle Carlin;\n     4. [41]A Strange Historian;\n     5. [41]Villains of Darrowshire;",
            date = "2018-01-03T00:51:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27387#comments:id=2543731",
        },
    },
    [27388] = {
        {
            id = 1208980,
            score = 109,
            author = "334124",
            text = "Talk to Carlin Redpath inside Crown Guard Tower for the Annals.",
            date = "2010-12-05T19:12:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27388#comments:id=1208980",
        },
        {
            id = 1331857,
            score = 73,
            author = "763262",
            text = "Talk to redpath in Crown Guard tower he'll give you the annals\nGo to the Marris Stead then directly in from the doorway you'll see the sheild\nGo up the stairs inside the Marris Stead and look left, inside the fireplace you'll find the book\non your way out two brighthound dogs will come at you, they're pretty damn easy to take down but I crapped myself when they randomly attacked me out of nowhere.\nJust a little heads up for you there :')",
            date = "2011-02-11T12:44:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27388#comments:id=1331857",
        },
        {
            id = 1204260,
            score = 17,
            author = "151462",
            text = "The shield is on the first floor of the building in The Maris Stead, and the libram is upstairs in the fireplace.\n\n(Until I moved to the right spot, it looked like the wall was sparkling!)\n\nWhen you pick up the book, 2 hounds will appear attack you.",
            date = "2010-12-03T13:41:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27388#comments:id=1204260",
        },
        {
            id = 1750904,
            score = 14,
            author = "795658",
            text = "When I did this quest today, I did not run into any bugs.  Pretty straightforward.\n\nFor the Extended Anals, just go in the Crown Guard Tower by Chromie (questgiver) and speak with Carlin Redpath - has has this item.\n\nFor Redpath's Shield, go into the house at Marris Stead - the shield is on the floor directly in front of you.\n\nFor Davil's Libram, in the same house at Marris Stead, go upstairs.  The Libram is in the fireplace in the room to your left.  And yes, two dogs jump out when you pick up Davil's Libram.  I did not find them hard to kill, but they do appear quickly, so be prepared.",
            date = "2012-10-26T12:29:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27388#comments:id=1750904",
        },
        {
            id = 1269133,
            score = 11,
            author = "Dirkster",
            text = "The information in Extended Annals of Darrowshire (http://www.wowhead.com/item=13202) is incorrect (outdated) at this moment. The information herein tells of old locations, for example Redpath's Shield (http://www.wowhead.com/item=12955) would be in Gahrron's Withering in the Western Plaguelands; well, it isn't anymore (it's at 22,68 in EPL). It's a nice read though, but for quest pointers, just use your map.\n\nI even thought: \"Hey Blizz still kept a quest which would let you cross zone lines for a change!\". Well, I was wrong and it feels a bit sad, it was nice to travel and see the world searching for items. Ah well... nostalgia.",
            date = "2010-12-31T04:28:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27388#comments:id=1269133",
        },
    },
    [27389] = {
        {
            id = 1894305,
            score = 33,
            author = "Spdhntrs",
            text = "If the pink area is not coming up on your map like it happened to mine, the coordinates of the NPCs that you need to kill are at:\n\n34,49",
            date = "2013-09-10T00:15:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27389#comments:id=1894305",
        },
        {
            id = 1198810,
            score = 29,
            author = "181815",
            text = "Excellent work, .  Are you certain you haven't done this before?\n\nWhich was especially funny, because I HAD!",
            date = "2010-11-30T21:10:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27389#comments:id=1198810",
        },
        {
            id = 1360617,
            score = 22,
            author = "716234",
            text = "In order for you to do this quest, you must have a fetid skull in your inventory in order to use the crystal to obtain the resonating skull.  After you kill a scourge champion, a fetid skull usually drops but not 100%.",
            date = "2011-03-07T20:13:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27389#comments:id=1360617",
        },
        {
            id = 1520480,
            score = 18,
            author = "Shigy",
            text = "One important thing to note with this is if you have enough space in your inventory to pick up the fetid skull but then don't have a spare slot after that then when you click the crystal it will destroy the fetid skull but you won't get a resonating skull.",
            date = "2011-09-18T00:58:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27389#comments:id=1520480",
        },
        {
            id = 1973075,
            score = 6,
            author = "Lazare69",
            text = "The path to the vale is at 30.2 56.9, where Rayne is sitting there waiting to finish a quest for you.",
            date = "2014-06-17T08:41:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27389#comments:id=1973075",
        },
    },
    [27390] = {
        {
            id = 1180642,
            score = 70,
            author = "Skurken",
            text = "Go to the town square at Darrowshire (34.9, 83.9) and place your Relic Bundle (http://www.wowhead.com/item=15209).\nNPC's will appear just around the outskirts of Darrowshire - help them fight the hostile mobs.\nMake sure Davil Lightfire (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=10944) does not die (if you help him kill the mobs this shouldn't be a problem at all).\nAfter some time Horgus (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=10946) will appear - kill him with the help from the NPC's.\nNow protect Captain Redpath (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=10937). Again, this should not be a problem with the help from the NPC's.\nRedpath will eventually turn evil. Time to DESTROY him.. or just kill him even.\nHurray - you are victorious. Go to the town square and talk to Redpath. It may take some time before you can actually talk to him - be patient.\nTurn the quest in at Pamela Redpath (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=10926) - she is in the western part of Darrowshire.",
            date = "2010-11-24T08:03:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27390#comments:id=1180642",
        },
        {
            id = 1193485,
            score = 37,
            author = "287446",
            text = "One note: Do NOT kill Horgus until Davil interacts with him.\n\nI tried this again after a server restart, but because I killed Horgus when he showed up (being 80), he and Davil did not interact as intended. Eventually Davil just despawned, bugging the event.",
            date = "2010-11-28T13:37:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27390#comments:id=1193485",
        },
        {
            id = 1603483,
            score = 33,
            author = "santoxthanksyou",
            text = "I tried sveral times to do this quest and every time I was with Redpath until:\n\nMarduk the Black says: Redpath! Your life ends, here and now!\n\n...then Redpath despawns and I'm left standing there with a dead Redpath and seemingly no corrupt Redpath to kill. In disgust and out of tiredness from trying so many times I made the decision to head back to Crown Guard Tower, abandon \"The Battle for Darrowshire\" and continue questing. However on my way heading north along the path back to  Crown Guard Tower, there was the corrupt Redpath half way up the hill standing all alone waiting to be slain! So I began to attack him without any retaliation, fulfilling that part of the quest and able to go back to Town Square to be forgiven.\n\nI don't know if this will help anyone or even if this is the way the quest is meant to be and that I'm just a total noob but if this scenario happens to you, walk North up the path and you may find your corrupt Redpath too!\n\n***Edit - Ok I see now the last few posters have confirmed my experience with this quest as of this time. These posts need to be moved up the list I think (which I have voted to do with Rizzatto's post)",
            date = "2011-12-29T05:26:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27390#comments:id=1603483",
        },
        {
            id = 1508504,
            score = 29,
            author = "raistlyn",
            text = "After Joseph walks to his house to talk to his little girl, Pamela, this is what transpires:\n\nJoseph: Pamela? Are you there, honey?\n\nPamela: Daddy!\n\nPamela: Daddy! You're back!\n\nPamela: Let's go play! No, tell me a story, Daddy! No... let's go pick flowers! And play tea time! I found my dollie, did I tell you?\n\nJoseph: Hahah!\n\nPamela: I missed you so much, Daddy!\n\nJoseph: I missed you too, honey. And I'm finally home...\n\nThis is a great ending to a very sad story.",
            date = "2011-09-02T00:54:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27390#comments:id=1508504",
        },
        {
            id = 1198584,
            score = 25,
            author = "690507",
            text = "Don't 1 shot Horgus until after you see the interaction emotes \"Horgus, your nightmare ends,\" or it will bug.",
            date = "2010-11-30T18:45:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27390#comments:id=1198584",
        },
    },
