            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=5835 & https://www.wowhead.com/item=5836 are both in the Den of Flame.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=5834 is in Stonemaul Ruins.\n\nThe TomTom coords you need are below, this can be copied and pasted as one block using the addon Paste:\n\n/way Dustwallow Marsh 39.7 66.84 Den of Flame Entrance\n/way Dustwallow Marsh 38.64 65.54 Grog just inside entrance to the Den of Flame\n/way Dustwallow Marsh 36.63 69.57 Strongbox inside the cave located in the Den of Flame\n/way Dustwallow Marsh 45.13 67.18 Stonemaul Ruins entrance\n/way Dustwallow Marsh 44.52 66.04 Snuff on stone in Stonemaul Ruins",
