        {
            id = 1310022,
            score = 7,
            author = "264227",
            text = "Note that you won't get this quest available until you've followed up the leads from the Shady Rest Inn. I assumed that it would be a followup to the raptor-wrangling quest that you get from the same tower and ended up destroying my battle plans before I actually had \"Confirming the Suspicion\" as a quest.",
