            score = 7,
            author = "Nover05",
            text = "So, I lost track of this half way through and had to track this place down again. The Grimtotem Tribe is located in the very northern part of Dustwallow Marsh. If you go to the North Tower, there is a path leading you to the Grimtotem's camp, located just north. When I got there, I killed about nine of the breakers and one shifter before killing two elders. Both elders dropped the battle plans. Then while reading the quest objective, I see where it tells me to kill the elders... smh, if only I would read the objective first.\nAnyway, hope the location helps you!",
            date = "2018-05-19T16:46:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27426#comments:id=2568684",
        },
        {
            id = 1246969,
            score = 3,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "You can't do this quest again if you did it pre-catacylsm. I wish I knew their logic since most of the other quests you can do again even though they are the same.\n\nOh, and just to be even more strange, the elders drop the quest items even though you aren't on and can't get this quest!",
            date = "2010-12-20T01:49:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27426#comments:id=1246969",
        },
        {
            id = 1262131,
            score = 3,
            author = "hollywould",
            text = "you CAN do this quest post-cata... just follow the quest chain which will eventually lead you to Theramore and you will follow more quests to North Point Tower where you complete this quest.  so yes, hold on the battle plan!",
            date = "2010-12-27T14:43:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27426#comments:id=1262131",
        },
    },
    [27427] = {
        {
            id = 2530463,
            score = 8,
            author = "Ralkuth",
            text = "Looking for some transmogs?\n\nAs Albtraum here has mentioned in a reply, you need to do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27249, then in the ruins you will find 3 quests.\n\nHand them in, and you will get a chain of others that are fairly straightforward and all of them from Vimes only. You might talk to some NPCs of Theramore Isle, but it's mostly just running across the map. Finish up, and you will get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27287 which will finally send you over to Darill for this quest.",
            date = "2017-10-19T04:31:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27427#comments:id=2530463",
        },
        {
            id = 2170379,
            score = 1,
            author = "Gammosh",
            text = "How do you do this quest?  The NPC that leads to Darill is no where to be found?  Plz Help!",
            date = "2015-04-22T12:07:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27427#comments:id=2170379",
        },
        {
            id = 3173072,
            score = 1,
            author = "Doloria",
            text = "Approach from the North side of the village (above the word Blackhoof).  There are sparkling armaments just inside the village that have one or no defenders. Grab one, stun, go back into the brush and repeat.",
            date = "2019-11-22T22:26:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27427#comments:id=3173072",
        },
    },
    [27428] = {
        {
            id = 1612918,
            score = 10,
            author = "484366",
            text = "Note that this is not the beginning of this quest-chain. It, in fact, begins with  Inspecting the Ruins (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27249), from Captain Garran Vimes (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=4944), at 68.2, 48.4, in Theramore.",
            date = "2012-01-18T02:19:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27428#comments:id=1612918",
        },
    },
    [27429] = {
        {
            id = 3193083,
            score = 1,
            author = "davemanvell",
            text = "When i did this quest one of the tents had a large metal chest in it with a blue item inside. look for it in case it is spawned there. Also you must be in the tent to set off the torch.",
            date = "2020-03-02T19:23:08-06:00",
