    [27430] = {
        {
            id = 3159332,
            score = 1,
            author = "Ellemere",
            text = "Okay so...I've completed all of the Dustwallow quests; except for this one. I've been searching all over the place for quite a while now, talking to characters, but I just can't get started on the Hyal one. Did I miss anything? (Draenei hunter..level 51 at the moment)",
            date = "2019-09-27T17:34:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27430#comments:id=3159332",
        },
        {
            id = 5675675,
            score = 1,
            author = "NiccoloM",
            text = "Ok, I'm also done with all other quests except this series.\n\nThe quest text mentions Shady Rest Inn.  That means you need to travel to that place, which is at the border between Dustwallow Marsh and Barrens.  You pick up three items and three quests there, and return back to Theramore to turn them in.\n\nAt this point, I still have some quests about a deserter named Reethe that Captain Vimes kept on sending me to find, including the quest The Deserter.  After flying out again and back, I get sent to deal with the Grimtotem Clan once again, after having already finished the quests related to the achievement.\n\nVimes send me back to North Point, and I got the quests Confirming the Suspicion and Arms of the Grimtotems, which are actually prequels to the raptor-wrangling quest.\n\nAfter finishing them, I get sent to Tabetha's farm, which, after Razing Direhorn Post, brings me to this quest.\n\nIn retrospect, you should begin Dustwallow Marsh questing with picking up the three items at the Shady Rest Inn.  This storyline directly ties in with the Grimtotem one and the Black Dragon one.  Doing them in conjunction would save you the most time.",
            date = "2023-09-03T01:02:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27430#comments:id=5675675",
        },
        {
            id = 1213513,
            score = -7,
            author = "nota",
            text = "You should be on the beginning of the stone (not the teeth or raid entrance) to plant the flag. A lvl 40 dragon comes down. Dialog, fight, finished.",
            date = "2010-12-08T00:47:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27430#comments:id=1213513",
        },
    },
