        {
            id = 1477096,
            score = 2,
            author = "701981",
            text = "Note:  according to a Blizzard GM (chat on 2011-07-20), the quest from Toshe Chaosrender cannot be obtained unless your character is at least Level 81 because \"characters lower than Level 81 cannot enter Deepholm\".\n\nThe GM declined to reveal which Cataclysm zones can be entered by characters lower than Level 81.  Regardless, since the level cap for Wrath of the Lich King was 80, characters should be able to enter at least one Cataclysm zone, else no one would be able to continue playing the game.",
            date = "2011-07-22T19:49:15-05:00",
