        {
            id = 1358230,
            score = 4,
            author = "136727",
            text = "To help avoid confusion for some. I didn't need to:\n\nHave any Earthen Ring Faction. (I was neutral)\nMove Fiona's Caravan to Light's Hope Chapel.\n\nIn short, when I received the \"Boys will be Boys\" quest, I just rocked up at Light's Hope Chapel, picked up and completed every quest in sight (not the two repeatable dungeon quests) and as I handed in my last quest this one showed up. You might not have to do them all I'm not sure but imo, it's all Xp and Loremaster. :D",
            date = "2011-03-05T11:08:29-06:00",
