            score = 4,
            author = "725088",
            text = "Leads to:\n\nScarlet Salvage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27614)\nThe Wrathcaster (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27615)\nThe Huntsman (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27616)\nThe Commander (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27619)",
            date = "2010-12-17T10:31:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27462#comments:id=1240565",
        },
        {
            id = 1435049,
            score = 3,
            author = "733706",
            text = "Clearing the barracks is a tough one if you are doing these quests solo and at level. The mobs fight in groups and adjacent ones agro real quick, not to mention the fast respawn rate. The mobs you will be questing after aren't that tough, its just when a group of mobs gets after you, as is often the case. I'm a hunter and trying to do ranged, traps  and kiting in such a confined space is a nightmare. Got killed four times in the process.",
            date = "2011-06-05T17:30:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27462#comments:id=1435049",
        },
        {
            id = 2551743,
            score = 2,
            author = "Metrallero",
            text = "Fine, I can give you a mission or two. (Proceeds to give you four missions)",
            date = "2018-02-09T14:54:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27462#comments:id=2551743",
        },
    },
