            score = 4,
            author = "Alanoor",
            text = "Alanoor\nSkywall\n\nIf you are doing this quest, also pick up the quests:\nFriends On The Other Side from Ragged John at Flame Crest in The Burning Steppes,\nand A Potential Ally from Overseer Oilfist at Thorium Point in  The Searing Gorge.\n\nAll these three (3) quests are going to the same NPC, and you might as well do them at the same time.\nAcride is located inside the instance for UBRS.  In the first room when you come inside, he is immediately on your right hand side in the corner.\n\nGood luck.",
