            score = 7,
            author = "Eziair",
            text = "25th Oct 2017.\n\nWell, this quest is still bugged to hell.....\n\nI sat there listening to Sylvanas twitter on and when she finished and Godfrey and his mates wondered off nothing happened. Sylvanas just sat on her horse and Godfrey and his mates just stood in front of the general goods tent.\n\nI waited five mins before I took a flight to The Sepulcher and back but that was a bad thing to do because they're all missing now! Nipped back to the Sepulcher again but Sylvanas is no longer there. So I ran back into Gilneas (it's now phazed, look out for the elite lvl 14/15s) to look at my Quest Completist addon... and yep done all the quests.\n\nI headed back to the beach and dropped the quest to pick up the 'The Great Escape' quest again but when I got to the beach weres nothing here! Went back to Emberstone Village, still nothing. Rutsak's Guard... nothing. Forsaken Forward Command... Nothing.\n\nOh hell, lol. I come back to the Forsaken Front and Sylvanas is sitting there with a ! over her head. Yep, it's the quest 'Rise, Godfrey'. Took the quest and sat right next to her. This time after her twitter she turned and is now standing on the gazebo thing with a ?\n\nSo if this quest messed up on you\nDrop quest to see if she respawns, if not leave the zone (head in to Gilneas or Hillsbrad) and come back.",
            date = "2017-10-25T16:17:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27472#comments:id=2531582",
        },
        {
            id = 2855804,
