        {
            id = 5650076,
            score = 6,
            author = "Lilyoptra",
            text = "As a followup to Bluyan's comment on 1/21/23 and my response, here is what worked for me to get this quest (not on original toon so a workaround and not a real solution sadly) :\n\nI found one of my toons that had the caravan at Light's Shield Tower.  I grabbed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27432 back at Crown Guard Tower, which is a precursor to getting Vex'tul to appear at Light's Shield. Vex'tul was now here and offered https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27449 which I did.  He still did not offer this quest, though, so my next thought was to get the caravan to Eastwall Tower.  From reading, doing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27465 moves the caravan and after completing that quest, the caravan was indeed at Eastwall Tower.  Vex'tul is now here (Eastwall) and offering this quest.  It seems Blizz has borked up this chain and at some point later Vex'tul disappears. So do this and the followup when you see them!\n\nAs a nice aside, this quest allows you to complete it at the quest site and then automatically gives the followup, which also complete right there. Very convenient (Once you can get it!)\n\nI will go ahead and put in a bug report, but not holding my breath.",
