        {
            id = 2548588,
            score = 18,
            author = "AlakeiThancan",
            text = "If, like me, you came here wondering where the hell you were supposed to click to get the next quest in the chain ... There isn't one. At the end of this quest, the line \"Wait, what's this? He must have dropped this on his way to the pyre\" (or something along those lines) actually refers to the reward for this quest, a plate torso. Might sound obvious to some. However, I did this quest as a hunter, and thus was presented only with gold at the end of the quest, so I thought this line meant there should be an item on the ground to pick up to start the rest of the quest chain....",
            date = "2018-01-26T18:11:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27482#comments:id=2548588",
