            text = "I found him at 27, 21. at a fork in the road.",
            date = "2010-11-27T01:40:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27524#comments:id=1189316",
        },
        {
            id = 1198559,
            score = 4,
            author = "573744",
            text = "You can find Tarenar at 27.7, 21.1, just in the road that leads to Stratholme.",
            date = "2010-11-30T18:27:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27524#comments:id=1198559",
        },
        {
            id = 2063934,
            score = 2,
            author = "1020729",
            text = "On my way into Plaguewood for this quest, all I could think was that this place was a trypophobe's nightmare... *shivers*",
            date = "2014-12-08T18:21:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27524#comments:id=2063934",
        },
    },
    [27525] = {
        {
            id = 1394989,
            score = 22,
            author = "817879",
            text = "Ok here is the latest, if he is not at the crossroads and you did the quest off the boss he should be back at lights hope chapel. Be sure to talk to Beezil Linkspanner to join the caravan or you will run into another bug on this quest.\n\nHope this helps\nSaslen",
            date = "2011-04-19T12:47:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27525#comments:id=1394989",
        },
        {
            id = 1204176,
            score = 15,
            author = "80976",
            text = "Immediately to our east and our west are a pair of necropoli...\n\nTarenar clearly doesn't know Scourge architecture:\n\nNecropolis (http://images2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20080811105748/wowwiki/images/thumb/0/05/Naxxramas_Wotlk.jpg/830px-Naxxramas_Wotlk.jpg)\n\nZiggurat (http://images2.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20070121192628/wowwiki/images/d/d3/Howling_Ziggurat.jpg)\n\nTip: one is floating!",
            date = "2010-12-03T13:04:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27525#comments:id=1204176",
        },
        {
            id = 1387267,
            score = 8,
            author = "813796",
            text = "The building that Tarenar Sunstrike ends up in is south, southeast of that fork in the road where the quest was given. The building entrance is at 29.5, 26.3 (if you look on the map it's about where the \"e\" is in Plagueland).\n\nHappy Questing!",
            date = "2011-04-09T00:03:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27525#comments:id=1387267",
        },
        {
            id = 1399484,
            score = 8,
            author = "IDrownFish",
            text = "The followup is \"The Baroness' Missive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27551)\"",
            date = "2011-04-25T18:16:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27525#comments:id=1399484",
        },
        {
            id = 1185357,
            score = 5,
            author = "709220",
            text = "To progress further, don't forget to loot the corpses of the two quest mobs for a \"Letter from the Baroness\".\n\nIt's easy to miss if you're powering through the questlines with your lvl80 main.",
            date = "2010-11-25T16:12:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27525#comments:id=1185357",
        },
    },
    [27526] = {
        {
            id = 1196236,
            score = 45,
            author = "141924",
            text = "The cutscene happened, but I couldn't see any of the speech bubbles nor did I see any action. The tauren runs up to her and just stands there in front of her, nothing happens. Then it ended after about 15 seconds of waiting. The problem then is that the quest completes, but Gidwin Goldbraids is still on the table and you can't turn the quest in.\n\nIf you have this same problem, abandon the quest, pick it up again, and enter into the slaughterhouse to replay the cutscene.",
            date = "2010-11-29T17:57:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526#comments:id=1196236",
        },
        {
            id = 1197223,
            score = 31,
            author = "75738",
            text = "So relieved, gotta admit I thought Blizzard was going to pull a Crusader Bridenbrad with this guy.",
            date = "2010-11-30T05:01:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526#comments:id=1197223",
        },
        {
            id = 1644750,
            score = 27,
            author = "Maizou",
            text = "Did anyone else get a classic-style RPG feel from this quest?\n\nIt's a classic story of:\n\n*Party Member is Kidnapped*\n*You set out to find them alone/with 1-2 others*\n*You find them, only to have the boss be all \"Only *** of you?\"*\n*No, there's *** of us!\"\n*Kills boss*\n\nMade me so nostalgic. xD",
            date = "2012-03-25T23:40:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526#comments:id=1644750",
        },
        {
            id = 1388589,
            score = 22,
            author = "226304",
            text = "My hunter self went up and started beating the Baroness up with my staff during the cutscene.\n\nI...I feel ashamed.",
            date = "2011-04-10T18:22:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526#comments:id=1388589",
        },
        {
            id = 1188279,
            score = 21,
            author = "Shogol",
            text = "Yes! Thank you blizz for not killing him, I was really sad when he got lost in the Quest chain :) Really great quest with a nice story.",
            date = "2010-11-26T17:01:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526#comments:id=1188279",
        },
    },
    [27527] = {
        {
            id = 1188776,
            score = 37,
            author = "Solembum",
            text = "I LOVED this quest chain. A great use of phasing technology.\n\nAl tho I feel that some of the characters were a bit random\n*looking at you goblin, while I keep an eye on Pamela*",
            date = "2010-11-26T20:22:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527#comments:id=1188776",
        },
        {
            id = 1330988,
            score = 34,
            author = "371039",
            text = "This quest line was amazing, I actually felt a little dissapointed when we were done traveling together.",
            date = "2011-02-10T20:25:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527#comments:id=1330988",
        },
        {
            id = 1675833,
            score = 31,
            author = "Soeroah",
            text = "\"I won't need it - I'm going to be riding in the caravan.\n\nIn the FRONT SEAT. \"\n\nThat's our Gidwin!\n\n/freeze-frame, roll credits",
            date = "2012-06-12T01:44:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527#comments:id=1675833",
        },
        {
            id = 1350847,
            score = 25,
            author = "662504",
            text = "Awesome story telling in this quest chain, my favourite so far among the revamped old zones quest lines. I love how all the other EPL stories (like Darrowshire and the little Redpath girl, the troll crypt or the high elf lodge) were framed into the big story arc of travelling with those guys.\nAnd you just gotta love the \"Paladin Pals\".\nI was so scared of an unhappy ending for Gidwin, but thank the light he was saved and all are happy now (including myself). :)\nGonna repeat this on my mains for fun/achievement/hearthstone to Light's Hope.",
            date = "2011-02-26T12:44:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527#comments:id=1350847",
        },
        {
            id = 1348770,
            score = 24,
            author = "353104",
            text = "My alltime favorite questline. It's gonna sound a little cheesy, but these guys grew on me. And since I'm an RP-ing dwarf shaman, I felt as though I was helping family. A truly excellent questline.",
            date = "2011-02-24T16:23:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527#comments:id=1348770",
        },
    },
    [27528] = {
        {
            id = 1334126,
            score = 17,
            author = "594786",
            text = "There is a Slaughterhouse at (33.77,15.31) with 4 Overstuffed Golem waiting to be killed and burned.",
            date = "2011-02-13T03:14:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27528#comments:id=1334126",
        },
        {
            id = 1203286,
            score = 4,
            author = "32411",
            text = "When doing this quest, you will very likely have the quest The Plaguewood Tower (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27532) in your quest log. I would highly recommend finishing that and then picking up the follow-up quest Counter-Plague Research (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27531) as both require you to run around the Plaguewoods and it could save you some time to do them together.",
            date = "2010-12-03T01:31:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27528#comments:id=1203286",
        },
        {
            id = 1235110,
            score = 3,
            author = "Ithuraen",
            text = "For those under-80s that might try and get as much Argent Crusade rep as possible (hopefully even exalted) you might have noticed that you stop getting rep at 5999/6000 from killing undead in EPL. Well the abominations you kill for this quest still reward the 6-7 rep per kill, while slow this is the only way I've found for my 60 twink to continue past honoured (so far).",
            date = "2010-12-15T06:34:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27528#comments:id=1235110",
        },
        {
            id = 2355260,
            score = 1,
            author = "Foxies",
            text = "Overstuffed Golem (npc=45851)s like to hide around or inside those Slaughter Houses if I called them right.\nSo, simple macro should help a lot:\n\n/tar Overstuffed Golem\nPut it in your bars, keybind it, spam it as you fly/walk around, profit.",
            date = "2016-07-22T14:06:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27528#comments:id=2355260",
        },
        {
            id = 3196799,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aeryl",
            text = "This is not required for the Journey's End portion of the storyline-based https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4892.  Once you get the quest for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27551, all you should need to complete are https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27526 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27527 for the achievement.",
            date = "2020-03-29T08:40:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27528#comments:id=3196799",
        },
    },
    [27529] = {
        {
            id = 1193914,
            score = 30,
            author = "Marzen",
            text = "As the description says, look for cannibal ghouls. (They don't currently show the quest details in their tooltip.)\n\nAnd it's not enough to kill a cannibal ghoul... you need to talk to the resultant spirit to get credit.",
            date = "2010-11-28T16:30:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27529#comments:id=1193914",
        },
        {
            id = 1442379,
            score = 7,
            author = "694934",
            text = "If you can afford to invest in https://www.wowhead.com/item=9154  unless of course you're a hunter.  The Ghouls do not have their names highlighted so it can be a tad difficult finding them through the vastness of plaguewood.\n\nIt makes life easier.\n\nFYI All alchemists can make this with a skill level of 230 and requires only one https://www.wowhead.com/item=8836.",
            date = "2011-06-15T22:42:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27529#comments:id=1442379",
        },
        {
            id = 1793239,
            score = 7,
            author = "1069800",
            text = "I found most of the cannibal ghouls in and around Terrordale, the west most point in the blue area.",
            date = "2013-01-05T18:22:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27529#comments:id=1793239",
        },
        {
            id = 1203284,
