            author = "32411",
            text = "When doing this quest, you will very likely have the quest The Plaguewood Tower (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27532) in your quest log. I would highly recommend finishing that and then picking up the follow-up quest Counter-Plague Research (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27531) as both require you to run around the Plaguewoods and it could save you some time to do them together.",
