        },
        {
            id = 1437630,
            score = 2,
            author = "gajackson",
            text = "lvl 60 checking in -\n\nWhen I talked to Urk, he didn't offer this one, only the troll/Undercroft one. After doing that, flying back, I decided to make a detour up to Rayne (the CC Druidess he's referring to). She was there, and offered me both quests (as well as dialogue tips on where to find savage fronds).\n\nI'll do the Pamela chain first for the breadcrumb, just to see how much CC rep it gives.",
