        },
        {
            id = 1654062,
            score = 19,
            author = "Archaix",
            text = "I've done some pretty dispicable things for money since Level 1, even for a rogue.\n\nBut I don't think I ever picked the last possessions off of cold, waterlogged corpses of shipwreck passengers.",
