            author = "945326",
            text = "If you are not a gnome, the first quest in the gnome quest line you can pick up is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26380\n\nOnce you've finished https://www.wowhead.com/quest=315 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25724, you can easily jump down to Ciara Deepstone to grab it on your way back to Kharanos.\n\nI don't know why the last two links aren't working.  The two quests are \"The Perfect Stout\" and \"Frostmane Aggression.\")",
            date = "2013-07-20T19:17:14-05:00",
