            text = "My group and I ran this quest yesterday and you no longer have to get the two staff items.  The dwarf chest just contained a book that was vendor trash.  When you go into the map room, there is a section of the little map on the floor you click on to open the door.\n\nI'm thinking this is a new change, post the most recent patch.",
