            text = "Depending on who you turn it into, you can get a different quote from the after they finish:\n\nGrunt Grimful says: I know I worked a hundred and sixty eight hours last week... but if the paperwork says I didn't clock in, maybe you're right.\n\nSo, you just took his pitiful pay for working 24/7 last week.",
            date = "2013-08-04T11:22:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27686#comments:id=1883891",
        },
    },
