        {
            id = 1180427,
            score = 8,
            author = "NoSmoking",
            text = "You can pick up this quest from Garyanne Fleezlebop (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46653). Which is also part of the achievement Ready, Set, Goat! (http://www.wowhead.com/achievement=5444).",
            date = "2010-11-24T05:57:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775#comments:id=1180427",
        },
        {
            id = 1204366,
            score = 6,
            author = "zukeithat",
            text = "Two-headed Ogre with the purple sash at 56,25.",
            date = "2010-12-03T14:27:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775#comments:id=1204366",
        },
        {
            id = 2190831,
            score = 5,
            author = "Taraezor",
            text = "The Badlands of Khaz Modan was reworked for Cataclysm and now contains an epic quest chain along with a very humorous side quest chain.\n\nThe Rhea quest chain, if a further incentive is required, contains a cinematic at its conclusion. It is not to be missed.\n\nThe quest chain commences with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27774. Players need only fly directly to the top of Fuselight to pick up the quest. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775 will also be offered but can be ignored.\n\nSeveral quests prior to that are offered, including faction city noticeboards and a fun rocket flight from the Eastern Plaguelands https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27762. They are unnecessary.\n\nWhile flying around the optional https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27823 (A) and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877 (H) are available and can be ignored if you are in a hurry. Anyhow, you will be taken to the locations where these quests are offered if you progress in the Rhea quest chain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=27927 will be offered as you fly around. This is optional and functions merely to get you to the location of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2785 at location 26.2, 62.3, who offers https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27713. This is a very funny quest chain and not to be missed. A great counterpoint to the epic Rhea saga.",
            date = "2015-06-06T16:46:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775#comments:id=2190831",
        },
        {
            id = 1628107,
            score = 1,
            author = "660876",
            text = "Billy Ocean would be proud of this! :D",
            date = "2012-02-17T13:12:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775#comments:id=1628107",
        },
    },
