        },
        {
            id = 1328873,
            score = 11,
            author = "606358",
            text = "this is how i did it (the second time)...\nas others have said...zoom way out\ndo not use the AOE until you absolutely have to, like near the end of the 3rd wave\nthen you won't be able to use it again until the 4th because of the cooldown\njust keep shooting all the close up ones, maybe waiting until there is a group\ni didn't get any damage to my cannon until the end of the 3rd while i was collecting a group to use the AOE on\nduring the 4th i just kept mashing the 1 button until a bunch had collected near me, then AOE, a few seconds later the wave ended and i had finished with over half the cannon's health\ngood luck! hope this helps....",
            date = "2011-02-09T15:07:37-06:00",
