            text = "Automatically when taking the quest, you get a follower - this follower will be the character whose spells/attacks you have to use.. Just like a hunter, their spells will be available for you, in the right corner of your screen. (Depending on where you have your pets actionbars.) I was able to do all the three quests, on two mobs..\nTake in note that with 'Baelog' - who has ranged attacks - you'll have to use his spells in distance of the mob.\nI hope this was helpful!",
