        {
            id = 1859443,
            score = 6,
            author = "Destler",
            text = "Stay away from the sunken guard hut on the eastern side of Stonard near the gate. Although the area is instanced, there is a regular town guard there who is PVP flagged and seems to be trapped under the ground. He will one shot you with his bow.\n\nI was trying to figure out who was shooting me for the longest time until I finally saw an image of a town guard glitching/clipping under the ground beneath the sunken hut. I think he killed me about 5 times. Be wary!",
            date = "2013-05-29T00:31:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27851#comments:id=1859443",
        },
        {
            id = 1967434,
            score = 1,
            author = "Claircy",
            text = "Was going to do this quest, going to loot one of them, boxes glimmering and all, I click one of them and my character bows down to loot but I'm not getting anything. Tried to relog but that didn't help the case. Deleted the quest and picked it up again and that didn't help either. So, what is wrong?\n\nI also tried looting other boxes but it was the same thing on them. Just uncompleteable for me.\n\nAfter I killed all the 6 Stonard Defenders it was possible for me to loot them.",
