        },
        {
            id = 1199032,
            score = 19,
            author = "196807",
            text = "A cutscene follows the acceptance of the quest.\n\nRhea walks into the nearby cave and drops her notes at the side of the cave.\n\nRhea says: I'll just leave this right here.\n\nThen she walks to the back of the cave and carries a dragon egg out of a barrel.\n\nRhea says: How's my little baby doing?\n\nSuddenly she notices a dragon standing outside the cave entrance and cowers in terror.\n\nRhea says: No... it's... it's you!  NO!\nDeathwing says: You impetuous little whelp... I know exactly what you and the mortal are up to.\nDeathwing says: Are you ready to die, dragon?\nRhea says: Yes.  Just... just show mercy to the egg.\nDeathwing yells: Mercy?\nDeathwing yells: THERE IS NO MERCY!  YOU WILL BURN FOR THIS, DRAGON!\n\nDeathwing proceeds to breathe fire into the entire cave and flies off without noticing the player hiding in the bushes outside the cave.",
            date = "2010-11-30T23:43:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27858#comments:id=1199032",
        },
        {
            id = 1460849,
