            text = "I can't begin to comprehend how terrifying it would be to see Deathchin staring at you through a cave entrance.\nBecause the camera is bugged...",
            date = "2011-07-04T23:31:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27858#comments:id=1460849",
