            author = "921728",
            text = "Did the Temple (dungeon) before doing any of the SoS quests. Sure enough Baba did not have this quest available, however, going to the top of the Temple, Lord Itharius had the quest Blessing of the Green Dragonflight (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27914/blessing-of-the-green-dragonflight) which is the last quest in the Marshfin Madness (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27691) quest line. Which then led me to the \"To Marshtide Watch (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46676)\" quest with Joanna Blueheart, and \"Assault on Stonard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27849)\". I suspect I just left the dungeon (random queue) and never went out to talk with Lord Itharius.",
