            score = 2,
            author = "93332",
            text = "Nice easy quest \"chain\", worth doing before moving on to the next zone for the quick xp it gives.\n\nThey all appear to have 100% drop rates.  The only reason this \"chain\" needs to take anyone any time at all really is if you stop to pick all the bloody Golden Sansam (http://www.wowhead.com/object=176583) and Sorrowmoss (http://www.wowhead.com/object=176587).\n\nQuests involved:\nPrayerblossom (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27875) and Secrets of the mire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27876);\nThe Purespring (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27902) and Breath of Mist (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27904);\nRemember the Light (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24913).",
            date = "2011-02-23T21:39:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27876#comments:id=1347662",
        },
    },
    [27877] = {
        {
            id = 1210140,
            score = 5,
            author = "Sanuye",
            text = "The flavor text of the dark iron dwarves is a reference to flintlock vs the horde.\n\nHere is the link to the page in question.\nhttp://pc.gamespy.com/flintlocke-vs-the-horde/episode-2-a-horrific-interruption/909252p1.html",
            date = "2010-12-06T11:55:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877#comments:id=1210140",
        },
        {
            id = 1730189,
            score = 4,
            author = "31866",
            text = "Messing with their heads. Hehehe.",
            date = "2012-10-03T15:40:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877#comments:id=1730189",
        },
        {
            id = 2190835,
            score = 2,
            author = "Taraezor",
            text = "The Badlands of Khaz Modan was reworked for Cataclysm and now contains an epic quest chain along with a very humorous side quest chain.\n\nThe Rhea quest chain, if a further incentive is required, contains a cinematic at its conclusion. It is not to be missed.\n\nThe quest chain commences with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27774. Players need only fly directly to the top of Fuselight to pick up the quest. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775 will also be offered but can be ignored.\n\nSeveral quests prior to that are offered, including faction city noticeboards and a fun rocket flight from the Eastern Plaguelands https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27762. They are unnecessary.\n\nWhile flying around the optional https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27823 (A) and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877 (H) are available and can be ignored if you are in a hurry. Anyhow, you will be taken to the locations where these quests are offered if you progress in the Rhea quest chain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=27927 will be offered as you fly around. This is optional and functions merely to to get you to the location of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2785 at location 26.2, 62.3, who offers https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27713. This is a very funny quest chain and not to be missed. A great counterpoint to the epic Rhea saga.",
            date = "2015-06-06T16:48:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877#comments:id=2190835",
        },
    },
