        },
        {
            id = 1202857,
            score = 15,
            author = "233551",
            text = "And its not the BIG red statute in the other room, its the other little red one located across the same room on the same side as where you started.",
            date = "2010-12-02T19:41:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27886#comments:id=1202857",
        },
        {
            id = 1520707,
            score = 10,
            author = "Zorie",
            text = "This is the horde version. Alliance version is here: [quest=27709 domain=www]",
            date = "2011-09-18T07:40:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27886#comments:id=1520707",
        },
        {
            id = 1189223,
            score = 7,
            author = "wbalmung",
            text = "As of today, this quest worked without mounting up.\n\nAfter you place the red statue, you get this quest, and a purple beam shines out from the statue you placed. It hits one of the small statues on the ground, which you must turn to hit another statue and so on. The goal is to get the beam to hit the statue in the other alcove in the room, and then all the statues will fall down and you can complete the quest.\n\nAll in all, a very fun quest, a show of the interesting, fun quests the Shattering added.",
            date = "2010-11-27T00:39:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27886#comments:id=1189223",
        },
        {
