            text = "Do NOT follow this quest line and steer clear of the 'Bad Dogs'.  These guys act as pets, and they are horrible; they will agro on EVERYTHING around and keep you in combat so you can't eat or mount.  Just do the other quests and leave these guys in the bar. ;-)",
