            text = "Before doing this quest and moving out of zone I strongly recommend doing his other quests.\n\nNice easy and fast quest \"chain\".\n\nThey all appear to have 100% drop rates.  The only reason this \"chain\" needs to take anyone any time at all really is if you stop to pick all the bloody Golden Sansam (http://www.wowhead.com/object=176583) and Sorrowmoss (http://www.wowhead.com/object=176587).\n\nQuests involved:\nPrayerblossom (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27875) and Secrets of the mire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27876);\nThe Purespring (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27902) and Breath of Mist (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27904);\nRemember the Light (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24913).",
