            author = "692994",
            text = "In order to get credit for killing this guy (and the other guys in the quest chain) you want to hit/tag them first OR do a lot of damage during the fight. On my third try going through the dungeon, I finally figured that out. You can still get credit if you didn't tag the guy first, just go all out with damage and you'll get credit for killing him.",
            date = "2011-09-16T16:45:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27920#comments:id=1519514",
        },
    },
