            text = "This quest is somewhat annoying for groups, as the Dark Iron Memo only drops for one in the group, in contrast to all other similar quests I've done so far. Usually these (named) mobs drop the item for all party members. I suspect this quest is bugged in this regard. Being in a 5-man party, we had to kill this mob 5 times.",
