            author = "Liri",
            text = "While doing Finster go past him and towards Thorium point to grab the Prayer to Elune (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27985), it ends in front of the cave.\n\nWhen you enter the cave head left, you will find Kiyuubi in a pool, continue down the corridor beyond and you will find Letherlo on a little rise in a large room.",
            date = "2010-11-26T04:28:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27979#comments:id=1186714",
