            text = "Finnister will be at the top of the hill to the right of the cave. You should literally just walk straight into him as you get to the first level of that area.\n\nThe other two ministers are in the cave, if you head left first, you get to Letherio and just follow the map round. You will then see the other minister on an elevated ridge and voila, you will be done for this quest!",
