    [28008] = {
        {
            id = 1196649,
            score = 4,
            author = "FeyGyrl",
            text = "For anyone doing the druid weapon quest in 4.0.3.....I figured I'd post this here, too, to maximize on my research time for everyone. LOL\nAlso, as you can't, yet, find the Commander directly here in Wowhead, I did find his link through the other quests, and included it in this summary.\n\nCheck the list of quest for SFK (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=209) now - it appears all the classes now have level 20 weapon quests, in SFK.\nQuest List (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=209#quests:0+2+1)\n\nAlso, it seems that you can speak with Deathstalker Commander Belmont (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=47293) outside SFK, to get other SFK quests for the Horde. (Sorry, Alliance guys - you have a similar bloke, too, form what I saw, but I'm a Horde Gyrl. :D You guys need to look for Packleader Ivar Bloodfang (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=47006), according to Wowhead. But I didn't want to leave you high and dry, so the basics you need are here, too - just not the expanded list...just don't tell the other Horde members I helped ya. LOL )\nThis is significant because one of the chains he begins includes one in which you must kill Walden - the guy we druids need for our staff run. So if you've already done some of the preceding quests, you can maximize your run for XP/gold/loot rewards. Even if you haven't, Belmont (And Bloodfang) is giving out a \"carrot quest\" (that's this one, gang - Adventurers Wanted) to get you in the door, so you might as well pick it up, too.\n\nAdventurers Wanted: Shadowfang Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28008) - Horde version\nAdventurers Wanted: SFK (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28009) - Alliance version\n\nAnd to make it easy, fellow Horde, if you DO want to do the other runs -here's the series, in order:\nThis Land is Our Land (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27974) - kill Baron Ashbury (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46962)\nPlague...Plague Everywhere! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27988) - kill Baron Silverlaine (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3887) and Commander Springvale (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=4278)\nOrders are for the Living (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27996) - kill Lord Walden (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46963) - the guy we also need for the druid quest (for the Alliance druids, you want fighting Tooth and Claw (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27921), to kill Walden)\nSweet Merciless Revenge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27998) - kill Lord Godfrey (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46964)\n\nHope this is helpful to a few other folks. :)\n\n***************************************************\nAfter the run update:\nBelmont sort of accompanies you through the keep, and as you kill one, he's there to accept the turn in & give you the next quest in the chain, so if you're persistent, you'll run the whole dungeon, reap a lot of XP, get your SFK achievement & if you're a druid going for her/his staff, you've got that for turning in (in Moonglade), too.\nDon't forget to equip your tabard of choice for rep gains, too. I want my Bilgewater trike, so I'm working their rep, but hey, you do what you want. ;)",
            date = "2010-11-29T22:30:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28008#comments:id=1196649",
        },
        {
            id = 1368965,
            score = 3,
            author = "665279",
            text = "One small question...who gives you this quest?  I can't find any reference to it anyplace else, and I can't find any NPC's anywhere who offer this quest.",
            date = "2011-03-17T05:22:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28008#comments:id=1368965",
        },
    },
