            score = 14,
            author = "Schadow",
            text = "A warning in advance:\n\nBefore, Kaelan of the Black Dragonflight (pre-Cata) gave this quest with the same name. There, the Torch of Retribution did not disappear and might still be in your bank.\n\nEven if you destroyed it, the first time, you might not get the Torch of Retribution. Abandon the quest, destroying the old Torch of Retribution (whether you destroyed it before or you have it in your bank) and picking it up again, will give you correctly the new Torch of Retribution.\n\nUnfortunately, this new Torch of Retribution you will not keep after you completed the quest (sorry roleplayers).\n\nThis new one doesn't require you to be wield though (hurray for the levelers).\n\nEdit: very late edit, but if you still have the old torch, you can use that as well to complete the quest. However, this also will be turned in and loose the torch.",
            date = "2010-11-28T05:07:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28029#comments:id=1192431",
        },
        {
            id = 1381179,
            score = 9,
            author = "796783",
            text = "You're looking for very small objects in the corners closer to the edge. They're not difficult to spot.",
            date = "2011-03-31T19:41:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28029#comments:id=1381179",
        },
        {
            id = 1870222,
            score = 8,
            author = "1126810",
            text = "Not only are the braziers very tiny, but they are each obscured by a wall of flame which makes them even harder to spot.  The good news is that these massives flames do no damage and actually define your search area.\n\nThe weird thing is: how come these massive flames don't ignite the bonfire above, but the tiny brazier does?  Hmmm ...",
            date = "2013-06-24T17:08:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28029#comments:id=1870222",
        },
        {
            id = 1629566,
