            author = "377637",
            text = "Carrying the I-Scream Cryocannon in your bag will give you a graphic of two white-blue columns on your shoulders, even outside of the zone.\nI had been wondering what those were for a while...",
            date = "2011-06-15T13:33:27-05:00",
