            author = "Crystallyne",
            text = "I had the HARDEST time finding this thing.  Following the other comments (specifically the location of 41, 75) helped me.  But I thought I would add, if you look at the built-in quest assist, it currently shows the location as being on top of a ridge that is inaccessible.  The actual location is immediately south of that marker, on the south side of that ridge.  It's fairly close to the hills, a bright green circular design on the ground.  It's hard to miss once you spot it.",
