            author = "Syrieal",
            text = "Overseer Oilfi, in Thorium Point, will disappear, at some point, after accepting this quest. If you happen to abandon the quest, you will simply need to enter the Middle of the 3 North West caves on the map (47.5, 46.5) and speak to Overseer Oilfis and accept the quest again. You will have to run back to Thorium Point, but at least you will be able to get the quest again.",
