            score = 15,
            author = "750237",
            text = "How come no one has mentioned the \"Gang\" of Sleepy Dark Iron Workers who attack in the middle of this quest and never leave?\n\nI got ambushed before completing and now the gang of workers (about 12) all pace back and forth through that hall.  I am not sure how to complete it against that many plus the regular mobs standing around.  There isn't enough time to complete before they return back within attack range.",
