            author = "937338",
            text = "This quest would be unavailable while your character is level 57 or higer, tested by my little mage today.\n\nWhen my character was level 56, this quest was there, right on the board. But after I turned into another quest to a NPC next to the board and reached to level 57, this quest was gone.\n\nI guess maybe this quest is just like other \"Hero's Call\" quests, have a maximum limit level to accept the quest.\n\nHope this would help. :D",
