        {
            id = 1387963,
            score = 3,
            author = "390723",
            text = "This quest requires you to do nothing.   You just accept it, and then you are able to get armor from the quartermaster.  There are some decent gear, most prominent the helms.  Unsure if you can get a helm at this level anywhere else, maybe you can.  There's something for all classes as well.",
