            author = "happaman",
            text = "Actually, each rank of the armor, ie, Sargent, has a quest attached to it I think. You get the bread crumb in ashenvale and go to Krom'gar as a private. Each time you take a quest you go up in rank and can then buy the next rank of armor. Still and all, this is a nice place to get better items while in the mid 20's.",
            date = "2011-12-16T21:25:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28084#comments:id=1597527",
