            text = "The area where the flowers are have changed in the last patch and are now a bit to the northwest along the road to the Jaedenar Cultists.\n\nAnd you have to turn in the quest to Andalar Shadevale at the top of the Jaedenar Cultists at entrance to Shadow Hold (same with Purity From Corruption).",
