            text = "You want to complete this quest and Purity from CorruptionForces of Jaedenaer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28121#comments:id=1241105) and turn them in while \"in the field\" before going into Shadow Hold cave.\n\nThen once you go in Shadow Hold, you can complete the next two quests together.",
            date = "2010-12-17T15:42:01-06:00",
