            score = 26,
            author = "Niamh",
            text = "(On a side note: I got https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4938 while just going for the end quest by doing all it's pre-requisit quests and some side quests that were in the same area. (Also did a chain started with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28042 but afaik this is not needed.))\n\nAn overview of all the quests needed to get to the blue rewards and all other gear you can earn on your way there:\n(This is mostly Horde version of the quests, but Alliance version is pretty similar.)\n\n0. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28504\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25478\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25487\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25489: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63562 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63563 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63564 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63565\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25505\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25516: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63546 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63547 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63548 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63549\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/spell=75627\n6. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25518\n7. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25526\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25533\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25543: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63554 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63555 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63556 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63557\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/item=55121\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25589: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63578 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63579 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63580 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63581)\n\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25596 (pick it up to do together with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586)\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25610\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25628: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63628 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63629 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63630 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63631\n\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25660\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25661: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63617 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63618 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63619 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63620\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25672\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25704: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63587 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63588 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63589 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63590 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63591\n\n18. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25745\n19. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25757\n20. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25775\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25762: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63608 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63609 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63610)\n21. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25779\n22. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25791: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63570 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63571 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63572 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63573\n\n23a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25797\n23b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25799\n24. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25814\n25. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25826: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63614 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63615 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63616\n26. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25836\n27. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25870\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25874: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63633)\n\n28. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25872\n29. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27276\n\n30. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27315\n31. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27319: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63604 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63605 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63606 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63607\n32. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27324\n33a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27321\n33b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27326\n33c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27328: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63637 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63638 https://www.wowhea