        {
            id = 2019775,
            score = 56,
            author = "Nenenene8789",
            text = "This felt impossible to do on my 90 Ret Paladin, as I was 1 shotting them with all of my attacks with all of my gear unequipped.\n\nI found if you go deeper into the mine there is another quest on offer called Deep Mine Rescue where you need to escort Dumass out of the mine. I used Reckoning(Taunt) on each mob while healing Dumass as needed.  He seemed to do enough damage to bring them below 35% HP (the spider pet you get doesn't seem to do any damage anymore).\n\nHope this helps",
            date = "2014-10-27T06:26:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28138#comments:id=2019775",
        },
        {
            id = 1440736,
            score = 36,
            author = "xxRevolver",
            text = "Doing this quest felt like I was in some weird bondage game.\nHad to strip down naked (female blood elf, by the way..) so I wouldn't kill them, then walked around the cave dragging several shirtless men around in chains. Very, very weird.\n\nAs an 85, I took everything off, hit them with my fists once (got them to around 50% health), then stepped back and let the hungry spider from Coastal Delicacies! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28146) attack them until they were down to 35%. Sometimes I accidentally killed them, but it worked out alright.",
            date = "2011-06-13T13:58:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28138#comments:id=1440736",
        },
    },
