        {
            id = 3150530,
            score = 1,
            author = "dirch",
            text = "Magatha cant be found ? Look no further - maybe you did the same as I:\nI entered the codes in the quest before and released Magatha. He said something about meeting to the east, so I hasted away. After coming to The Twillight Withering there was no Magatha at the quest-question on the map... hmm. Ah! A quest had popped in the right side of the screen. (embaressing... thats where the RTFM enters). I accepted the quest and Magatha was nowhere...\nIf this happens, dont dispair - log off and login again and Magatha will magically be present at the questionmark.",
            date = "2019-08-29T15:35:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28142#comments:id=3150530",
        },
        {
            id = 3204638,
