            text = "I'm also having issues getting my spider to eat. I dismissed my own pet and make sure to get the killing blow, but the thing doesn't want to cut me a break.",
            date = "2010-11-30T20:14:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28146#comments:id=1198734",
        },
        {
            id = 1204842,
