            score = 2,
            author = "739946",
            text = "I died in the middle of this quest, suddenly I'm across the water at the spirit healer for the splinterhoof clan.  how do I get back up into Twliight Withering?  the only way I know to get up there is to take Heartrazor, and you can't do that dead.",
            date = "2010-12-20T18:57:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28158#comments:id=1248650",
        },
        {
            id = 1817894,
            score = 1,
            author = "Soeroah",
            text = "Oh yeah? Well this 'simple boy' freed your ass from the Twilight's Hammer!\n\nHahahahaha....wait",
            date = "2013-02-25T00:00:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28158#comments:id=1817894",
        },
    },
    [28159] = {
        {
            id = 1199653,
            score = 55,
            author = "82963",
            text = "Why.  The hell.  Do we give this item to her?  Especially as a Horde player.  She effectively caused the death of one of the most beloved Horde leaders ever.  That's common knowledge at this point.  I understand needing her help to rid the zone of the Animus threat, but there's absolutely no reason to give her the stone at the end of it all.\n\nI hope they explain this plot-hole.  It certainly ended an awesome questing experience on a \"wtf\" note for me.",
            date = "2010-12-01T06:48:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159#comments:id=1199653",
        },
        {
            id = 1202676,
            score = 41,
            author = "567557",
            text = "So apparently we give over 3 powerful tauren artifacts and a dark evil powerful weapon called the \"Doomstone\" to an evil tauren witch that murdered Cairne Bloodhoof and countless tauren in Thunder Bluff, and ya know...probably plans on destroying and reeking havoc on the world...\n\nAs long as I get my 1g 30s...",
            date = "2010-12-02T17:40:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159#comments:id=1202676",
        },
        {
            id = 1187258,
            score = 34,
            author = "435201",
            text = "U recive an item in bag, elemental nullifier, that u have to use on Amimus before u can attack him :P\n\nTook me a while before i understood that :)",
            date = "2010-11-26T09:38:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159#comments:id=1187258",
        },
        {
            id = 3238012,
            score = 24,
            author = "Velhym",
            text = "As of 9.0.1, some part of this appears to be bugged out.\n\nUsing the Elemental Nullifier on Animus has no effect and the barrier never drops off of Animus that allows it to be killed. (Tested on Highmountain Shaman, Level 27)",
            date = "2020-10-14T00:59:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159#comments:id=3238012",
        },
        {
            id = 1185666,
            score = 17,
            author = "132176",
            text = "It may go without saying, but make sure you pull Animus back away from the pit before you kill him, otherwise his body will fall into a spot where you cannot loot him.",
            date = "2010-11-25T18:38:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159#comments:id=1185666",
        },
    },
    [28160] = {
        {
            id = 1195979,
            score = 46,
            author = "Vonara",
            text = "You can begin these quests by going to New Thalanaar (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25481) and completing The Grimtotem Are Coming! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25486), and taking a ride to the Speedbarge. After you finish the Speedbarge chain up to and including Circle the Wagons... er, Boats. (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25542) you may go back to the gnome  Fizzle (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40027) to obtain the quest: Negotiations (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25744). (You may also need to finish the Southsea (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25590) > Holdfast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25660) chain, culminating with The Mad Magus (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25704)) Finish his quests until you are sent back to the Speedbarge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25825). You will now receive the quest Free Freewind Post. (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25835) Take the trip to the quest end location to begin making (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27314) your (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27318) way (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27323) towards (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27320) the (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27325) Chief of Chiefs (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27327). After defeating him, you will discover Lakota Windsong (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27357) and be sent to deal with Trouble at Highperch (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28085). During this quest, you will discover Twilight's Hammer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28088) nearby. Meet up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28124) with Lakota Windsong once more at her new location, and complete the tasks Magatha (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28140) asks of you. When the world is saved, make your way back to the Speedbarge to collect your reward.",
            date = "2010-11-29T15:12:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28160#comments:id=1195979",
        },
        {
            id = 1395769,
            score = 15,
            author = "nykion",
            text = "To be clear we are not talking about just doing a few quests and getting 1 good blue.  This quest requires you complete 57 total quests in 1000 needles.  This is not a quick grab by any means.  Took me the better part of 4 hours, and I was overgeared for the zone.\n\nPerspective Side Note:  [Thousand Needles Quests] (http://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4938) Achievement requires 60 quests.",
            date = "2011-04-20T15:35:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28160#comments:id=1395769",
        },
        {
            id = 1408054,
            score = 7,
            author = "247287",
            text = "Not taking into account the heirloom PvE chest, the low drop leather items from Scholo, or the equally painful Gordok Tribute at Dire Maul... chances are that, if you are a feral druid or rogue, https://www.wowhead.com/item=63669 would be your perfect chest item, until you hit your fifties and go for https://www.wowhead.com/item=12793 at BRD (30% drop if you care at all before BC greens).\n\nIf you like the new Thousand Needles, I would reccomend to stay there, enjoy the new quests and lore, and get your reward eventually.",
            date = "2011-05-03T05:19:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28160#comments:id=1408054",
        },
        {
            id = 1266621,
            score = 3,
            author = "628217",
            text = "To put it simply, Do every quest you run into, starting with those in the Speedbarge (floatilla in the middle of map). When the quests start leading into Grimtotem territory, you know you just started, but you're on the right path.",
            date = "2010-12-29T19:25:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28160#comments:id=1266621",
        },
        {
            id = 1887657,
            score = 1,
            author = "elstohn",
            text = "Not 100k quest xp (as noted above) but nearly 500k. I gained 4.5 levels doing this chain (full boa). I was doing it for a transmog run for my progression twink and burned though an ENTIRE bracket because I didn't lock xp (based off the above stated 100k xp)\n\nIf you do progression twinking, LOCK XP before you do this quest chain (and get some munchies, it WILL take 3hrs or more)",
            date = "2013-08-16T20:12:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28160#comments:id=1887657",
        },
    },
    [28161] = {
        {
            id = 1229101,
            score = 31,
            author = "163843",
            text = "It's rather disappointing that finishing these quests doesn't phase the zone out so the Horde owns Freewind Post again. :(",
            date = "2010-12-12T23:43:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161#comments:id=1229101",
        },
        {
            id = 1556530,
            score = 28,
            author = "Niamh",
            text = "An overview of all the quests needed to get to the blue rewards and all other gear you can earn on your way there:\n(This is mostly Horde version of the quests, but Alliance version is pretty similar.)\n\n0. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28504\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25478\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25487\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25489: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63562 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63563 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63564 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63565\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25505\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25516: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63546 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63547 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63548 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63549\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/spell=75627\n6. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25518\n7. ... https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25526\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25533\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25543: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63554 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63555 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63556 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63557\n... gives https://www.wowhead.com/item=55121\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25589: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63578 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63579 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63580 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63581)\n\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25596 (pick it up to do together with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25586)\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25610\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25628: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63628 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63629 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63630 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63631\n\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25660\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25661: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63617 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63618 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63619 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63620\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25672\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25704: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63587 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63588 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63589 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63590 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63591\n\n18. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25745\n19. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25757\n20. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25775\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25762: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63608 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63609 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63610)\n21. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25779\n22. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25791: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63570 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63571 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63572 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63573\n\n23a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25797\n23b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25799\n24. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25814\n25. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25826: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63614 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63615 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63616\n26. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25836\n27. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25870\n(side quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25874: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63633)\n\n28. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25872\n29. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27276\n\n30. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27315\n31. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27319: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63604 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63605 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63606 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63607\n32. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27324\n33a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27321\n33b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27326\n33c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27328: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63637 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63638 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63639\n34. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27358\n35. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27330: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63644 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63645 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63646 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63647\n36. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28085\n(https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27311, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28284, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27317 & https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27313: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63596 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63597 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63598 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63599 are side quests during this chain)\n\n37a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28086\n37b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28087: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63648 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63649 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63650 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63651\n38. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28088\n39. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28098: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63652 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63653 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63654 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63655\n40. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28124\n\n41a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28125: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63656 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63657 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63658\n41b.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28127\n42a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28136: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63659 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63660 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63661 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63662\n42b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28139\n43. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28140\n44. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28142\n\n45a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28157\n45b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28158\n46. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63663 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63664 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63665 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63666\n\n47. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63673 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63674 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63675 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63676 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63677 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63678\n\n(If I missed something, let me know)\n\nSee also this wowpedia page (http://www.wowpedia.org/Thousand_Needles_storyline) (as pointed out by  Schnoodledorfer (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Schnoodledorfer))\n\nOn a side note: I got https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4938 while just going for the end quest by doing all it's pre-requisit quests and some side quests that were in the same area. (Also did a chain started with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28042 but afaik this is not needed.)\n\nNote: 07/11/2011, changed the 1st sentence, it was originally \"An overview of all the quests needed to get there:\" to avoid some confusion as to what this post is all about.",
            date = "2011-10-29T05:29:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161#comments:id=1556530",
        },
        {
            id = 1197171,
            score = 17,
            author = "259313",
            text = "After finishing this quest chain, I'm really hoping that we'll personally get to play a part in Magatha's presumably inevitable downfall, rather then it simply being an event that takes place in a future novel or something similar.",
            date = "2010-11-30T04:32:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161#comments:id=1197171",
        },
        {
            id = 1195857,
            score = 13,
            author = "Vonara",
            text = "You can begin these quests by going to Westreach Summit and completing The Grimtotem Are Coming! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25487), and taking a ride to the Speedbarge. After you finish the Speedbarge chain up to and including Circle the Wagons... er, Boats. (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25543) you may go back to the goblin  Pozzik (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40028) to obtain the quest: Negotiations (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25745). Finish his quests until you are sent back to the Speedbarge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25826). (You may also need to complete Southsea (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25596) > Holdfast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25660) chain culminating with The Mad Magus (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25704)) You will now receive the quest Free Freewind Post. (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25836) Take the trip to the quest end location to begin making (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27315) your (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27319) way (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27324) towards (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27321) the (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27326) Chief of Chiefs (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27328). After defeating him, you will discover Lakota Windsong (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27358) and be sent to deal with Trouble at Highperch (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28085). During this quest, you will discover Twilight's Hammer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28088) nearby. Meet up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28124) with Lakota Windsong once more at her new location, and complete the tasks Magatha (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28140) asks of you. When the world is saved, make your way back to the Speedbarge to collect your reward.",
            date = "2010-11-29T14:07:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161#comments:id=1195857",
        },
        {
            id = 1207573,
            score = 13,
            author = "whoopiecushion68",
            text = "ALL.\nOF.\nMY.\nHATE.\n\nMUST DESTROY.",
            date = "2010-12-05T05:19:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161#comments:id=1207573",
        },
    },
