            text = "abyssmal drop rate - have killed over  10 so far and not one drop\n\nEDIT - after posting this i carried on killing them and the next three all dropped the thing! - then the next ten didnt - so i have come to post again hoping  this is influencing the drops  :)\n\nEDIT - nope didnt work - had to kill 10 more before last 2 drops - am suspicious of Blizz random number generator - will dedicate the rest of my life to working out how their RND works",
            date = "2025-11-17T11:06:09-06:00",
