            author = "bbthings",
            text = "You have to do the 3 quests (Squirrely Clean (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28361), Running Their Course (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28360), Weeding the Lawn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28374)) from Tender Puregrove (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=48459) before you can get this quest.",
