            score = 12,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "Guide to Burning Steppes quests:\n\nOptional breadcrumbs:\nHero's Call: Burning Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28666) or Mouton Flamestar (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28514)\n\nDo anytime before leaving to Chiselgrip:\nDone Nothing Wrong (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28172)\n\nKeeshan is back with either:\n    Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28416) if you did the Redridge chain or Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28174) if you did not.\n\nThese three at once:\n  Stocking Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28177)\n A Future Project (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28178)\n Mud Hunter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28179)\n\nThen:\nThe Sand, the Cider, and the Orb (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28180)\n\nThese two at once: Warlocks Have the Neatest Stuff (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28181) and Shadow Boxing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28182)\n\nThen:\nReturn to Keeshan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28183)\nChiselgrip, the Heart of the Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28184)\n\nEnables these quests, which must be completed before General Thor'izog in the main chain:\nProve Yer Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28225)\nScrapped Golems (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28226) (leads to Golem Training (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28227))\n\nMain chain continues:\nA Needle in a Hellhole (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28254)\nA Perfect Costume (4 versions) Read the quest carefully. What creature disguise do you need?\n  --->    Orc (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28202) (given to Humans and Dwarves): 2 Hides, 4 muds, 2 thread\n  --->    Goblin (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28204) (given to Gnomes): 1 hide, 3 mud, 4 thread\n  --->    Troll (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28205) (given to Night Elves): 3 Hides, 2 mud, 1 thread\n  --->    Ogre (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28203) (given to Draenei and Worgen): 4 Hide, 1 Mud, 3 thread\n\nThen:\nInto the Black Tooth Hovel (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28239)\nGrunt Work (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28245)\n  Look in your quest log -- Strategic Cuts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28246) has silently appeared\nThe Kodocaller's Horn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28252)\nTaking the Horn for Ourselves (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253)\nUntil Blizzard fixes it, when you turn in this quest, you will get a failed quest sound\n  with \"You don't meet the requirements for that quest\". Don't panic.\n\nYou must by this time have finished Stebben's quests, listed above.\nGeneral Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28265)\nTrial by Magma (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28266)\nI Am the Law and I am the Lash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28278) [I think this completing this one is optional]\n  When you accept the above, look for Abuse of Power (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28279) in your quest log\n\nThen:\nEnough Damage for One Day (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28286)\nMorgan's Vigil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28310)\n\nCompleting that quest allows for these four together:\nSEVEN! YUP! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28415) [rewards Tiny Flamefly (http://www.wowhead.com/item=66080)]\nBlackened Ashes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28311)\nA Heap of Delicious Worg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28313)\nLatent Demons of the Land (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28312)\n\nThen these three together:\nBlood Tour (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28314)\nDraconic Vanguard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28315)\nA Deal with a Dragon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28316)\n\nGiven when third one above is completed: Placing the Pawns (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28326)\n\nThen these three:\nA Delivery for Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317)\nA Delivery for Neeralak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318)\nA Delivery for Zi'lun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28319)\n\nAuto-accepted when above three are done:\n Locked and Loaded (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28327)\n\nAnd the epic conclusion:\nAssault on Dreadmaul Rock (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28320)\nGlory Amidst Chaos (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28321)\nThe Spoils of War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28322)",
            date = "2010-12-27T18:12:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253#comments:id=1262520",
        },
        {
            id = 2371933,
            score = 1,
            author = "Xsef",
            text = "You apparently don't get any item rewards anymore. But instead, you get the items right into your appearences list.",
            date = "2016-08-22T00:18:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253#comments:id=2371933",
        },
        {
            id = 1205722,
            score = 0,
            author = "710737",
            text = "so, thats it?  cant complete the questline for the pet? what a waste of 2 hours.",
            date = "2010-12-04T08:16:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253#comments:id=1205722",
        },
    },
