            text = "This is just a breadcrumb quest to make sure that players get started on https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27317, in case they passed by the questgiver by accident.\n\nIf you've already obtained the above quest from the object of the same name located just outside of Isha Gloomaxe's tent during https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27315, you won't receive this quest because you don't need it.",
