    [28286] = {
        {
            id = 1262496,
            score = 4,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "Guide to Burning Steppes quests:\n\nOptional breadcrumbs:\nHero's Call: Burning Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28666) or Mouton Flamestar (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28514)\n\nDo anytime before leaving to Chiselgrip:\nDone Nothing Wrong (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28172)\n\nKeeshan is back with either:\n    Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28416) if you did the Redridge chain or Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28174) if you did not.\n\nThese three at once:\n  Stocking Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28177)\n A Future Project (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28178)\n Mud Hunter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28179)\n\nThen:\nThe Sand, the Cider, and the Orb (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28180)\n\nThese two at once: Warlocks Have the Neatest Stuff (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28181) and Shadow Boxing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28182)\n\nThen:\nReturn to Keeshan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28183)\nChiselgrip, the Heart of the Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28184)\n\nEnables these quests, which must be completed before General Thor'izog in the main chain:\nProve Yer Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28225)\nScrapped Golems (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28226) (leads to Golem Training (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28227))\n\nMain chain continues:\nA Needle in a Hellhole (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28254)\nA Perfect Costume (4 versions) Read the quest carefully. What creature disguise do you need?\n  --->    Orc (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28202) (given to Humans and Dwarves): 2 Hides, 4 muds, 2 thread\n  --->    Goblin (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28204) (given to Gnomes): 1 hide, 3 mud, 4 thread\n  --->    Troll (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28205) (given to Night Elves): 3 Hides, 2 mud, 1 thread\n  --->    Ogre (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28203) (given to Draenei and Worgen): 4 Hide, 1 Mud, 3 thread\n\nThen:\nInto the Black Tooth Hovel (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28239)\nGrunt Work (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28245)\n  Look in your quest log -- Strategic Cuts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28246) has silently appeared\nThe Kodocaller's Horn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28252)\nTaking the Horn for Ourselves (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253)\nUntil Blizzard fixes it, when you turn in this quest, you will get a failed quest sound\n  with \"You don't meet the requirements for that quest\". Don't panic.\n\nYou must by this time have finished Stebben's quests, listed above.\nGeneral Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28265)\nTrial by Magma (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28266)\nI Am the Law and I am the Lash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28278) [I think this completing this one is optional]\n  When you accept the above, look for Abuse of Power (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28279) in your quest log\n\nThen:\nEnough Damage for One Day (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28286)\nMorgan's Vigil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28310)\n\nCompleting that quest allows for these four together:\nSEVEN! YUP! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28415) [rewards Tiny Flamefly (http://www.wowhead.com/item=66080)]\nBlackened Ashes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28311)\nA Heap of Delicious Worg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28313)\nLatent Demons of the Land (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28312)\n\nThen these three together:\nBlood Tour (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28314)\nDraconic Vanguard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28315)\nA Deal with a Dragon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28316)\n\nGiven when third one above is completed: Placing the Pawns (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28326)\n\nThen these three:\nA Delivery for Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317)\nA Delivery for Neeralak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318)\nA Delivery for Zi'lun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28319)\n\nAuto-accepted when above three are done:\n Locked and Loaded (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28327)\n\nAnd the epic conclusion:\nAssault on Dreadmaul Rock (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28320)\nGlory Amidst Chaos (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28321)\nThe Spoils of War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28322)",
            date = "2010-12-27T18:07:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28286#comments:id=1262496",
        },
    },
    [28287] = {
    },
    [28288] = {
        {
            id = 1197610,
            score = 187,
            author = "Borelia",
            text = "For those who have played Robot Unicorn Attack, this quest will make you smile.  Again. And again.  For those that haven't, picture a unicorn chasing through rainbows to collect stars, all while Erasure - Always is playing in the background.  Notice the quest text.\n\nQuest: Open Their Eyes.\nQuest Completion: \"I see.... their eyes are open.\"\nErasure - Always lyrics:\n\"Open your eyes, I see\nYour eyes are open.\"\n\nBy far the best quest in the expansion so far, and that includes the Horde grand finale in Stonetalon Peaks.\n\nEDIT: A lot of haters in here purging the slightest mention of Robot Unicorn Attack.  Oh well.",
            date = "2010-11-30T10:45:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288#comments:id=1197610",
        },
        {
            id = 1205803,
            score = 171,
            author = "341933",
            text = "This quest does come at the end of a quest chain, but it's all very straightforward. You get the starting quest from Arcanist Delaris, the same person who gives the \"Open Their Eyes\" quest.\n\n1. Do the Imp-Possible (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28000)\n2. See the Invisible (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28049)\n3. Touch the Untouchable (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28044)\n4. Break the Unbreakable (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28113)\n5. Open Their Eyes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288)\n\nYou can pick up more quests from a nearby NPC, Eridan Bluewind, but those 5 quests are all you need to complete for a Rainbow Generator. Takes less than 10 minutes for most!",
            date = "2010-12-04T09:37:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288#comments:id=1205803",
        },
        {
            id = 1194205,
            score = 97,
            author = "55557",
            text = "After each use, the Jadefire Imp (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=47369) will run around screaming various things:\n\nMake it stop! MAKE IT STOP!\nGet it away!\nIt's so intense!\nAAAAAAAAAAAAHHH!\nIt burns! IT BURNS!\nIt's too much!\nWhat does it mean?\nThe colors! Nooooooooooooooo!\n Jadefire Imp starts sobbing uncontrollably!\n Jadefire Imp screams at the top of its lungs!\n Jadefire Imp flees in terror!",
            date = "2010-11-28T18:48:45-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288#comments:id=1194205",
        },
        {
            id = 1187223,
            score = 96,
            author = "Norrec",
            text = "And live in harmony, harmony oh love",
            date = "2010-11-26T09:18:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288#comments:id=1187223",
        },
        {
            id = 1433144,
            score = 81,
            author = "504286",
            text = "Felwoodian Impody:\n\nIs this a rainbow?\nOr maybe a dubble one.\nToo bright for their eyes,\nNo escape for their sanity\nOpen their eyes,\nLook in the rainbow and seeeeeeeeeeee,\nThey're just some poor imps, they need no sympathy.\nBecause it's easy run,\nFrom big rainbow.\nRun away,\nBut you're too slow.\nAny way the imp runs,\nDoesn't really matter to meeee,\nTo meeeeee....\n\nMamaaaa,\nJust feared an imp.\nPut a rainbow on the ground,\nWhen they saw it, they were scared.\nMamaaaa,\nI had just begun,\nAnd now they've gone and despawned all away!\n\nMamaaaa,\nOoooOOooOOOooOOOOOOOO!\nDidn't mean to make them die,\nIf they're not spawned today, maybe tomorrow!\nRainbow on, Rainbow on,\nLike nothing really happened...\n\nToo late!\nTuesday has come.\nSends shivers down their spine,\n'cause now it's respawn time,\nTuesday maintenance\nIt's going oooon!\nGotta get those imps with me\nAnd fear them alll...\n\nMamaaaa\nOoooOOooOOOooOOOOOOOO!\nAnyway the rainbow glows\nI just wanna grind,\nI sometimes wish I've never been a 'lock at all!\n\nI see a little silhouetto of an imp!\nSuccubus, Succubus, can you see the shiny rainbow?\nGo and fetch your whip and get the imps to there!\nShiny rainbow!\nShiny rainbow!\nShiny rainbow!\nShiny rainbow!\nShiny rainbow it's so bright\nMANY COLOOOOORRRSS!\nHe's just a poor imp, nobody loves him\nHe's just a poor imp, from a poor demonic plane,\nSpare him his life, from this rainbowity!\n\nEasy run,\nfrom big rainbow\nWill you just let me go?\nOH RAINBOW NOOO! Will not let you go!\n[Demonic]: Let him gooo!\nOh rainbow will not let you go!\n[Demonic]: Let him gooo!\nOh rainbow will not let you go!\n[Demonic]: Let him go!\nOh rainbow will not let you go!\nLet him go!\nWill not let him go!\nLet him gooo!\nWill not let him go!\nLet him ruuuuunnnnn!\n[Demonic]: Oh succubus\n[Demonic]: Oh succubus\n[Demonic]: Oh succubus please let me go!\n[Demonic]: Lord Sargeeras, has a demon put aside for meee,\n[Demonic]: For meee,\n[Demonic]: For meeeeeeeeeeeee!\n\n[GM]: So you think you can bug out and not run for mee?\n[GM]: So you think you can stand there and bee?\n[GM]: Ooh, impy,\n[GM]: You don't do this for mee,\n[GM]: You're doing it for yourself,\n[GM]: Or else I will go /delete!\n\nAny way the rainbow glows,\nAnyone can fear mee.\nAnyway it gloows...\nDoesn't really matter....\nTo meeeeee......\n\nAny way the rainbow glows...",
            date = "2011-06-03T02:38:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28288#comments:id=1433144",
        },
    },
