            text = "This is a Warrior Only breadcrumb quest to visit Grezz Ragefist (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3353), an Orgrimmar Warrior Trainer.\n\nThe follow-up to this quest is A Dangerous Alliance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28457), a Blackrock Depths quest for Faceguard Of The Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/item=65625) or Headguard Of The Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/item=65642).\n\nIt appears that this quest is not given retroactively to players who had already progressed beyond level 50 when the Shattering occured.",
            date = "2010-11-25T06:21:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28290#comments:id=1184012",
