            score = 3,
            author = "KorbinArmand",
            text = "Today, while doing Heritage Armor quest on my BE Pally (that Ive had since first months of TBC) had this quest show up at end of Heritage questline. Last part before turning the lantern in.\nChampion Bachi was at the steps leading up into Sunfury Spire, offering me both Meet with Master Pyraenor and Seek Out Master Pyaenor. This pally was not in past eligable for these questlines, but for w/e reason I could get them at this point.\n\nNOTE: I did not notice nor check to see if I could get these quest prior to doing Heritage Armor set, I was wearing my Blood Knight Tabard which was earned via Steed mount back in TBC.",
            date = "2020-06-19T03:09:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28303#comments:id=3213190",
        },
    },
