        {
            id = 3276769,
            score = 2,
            author = "Dolphers1",
            text = "Had issues with this quest as well because Keeshan disappeared.  The way I resolved it was to fly to a flight points outside of the zone, logout, log back in, and fly back to the Burning Steppes.  Once I landed in one of the Burning Steppes flight points, he appeared back next to me, and I was able to turn it in.",
