            score = 4,
            author = "909946",
            text = "By far one of the best quests to come out of Cataclysm, theres no ogre body surfing a crystal spider but meh its up their.. Its kind of sad that a Expansion ment to bring players into brand new zones and up to level cap 85 will be remembered for the stuff they added to the original content, where as if i wasnt currently running Loremaster id have never seen these quests and forever callled this expansion Crapaclysm!",
            date = "2011-11-08T18:22:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28316#comments:id=1566842",
        },
        {
            id = 2006662,
            score = 1,
            author = "tyharris01",
            text = "Do not turn in [A Deal With a Dragon] ([A Deal With a Dragon) without John J. Keeshan present. If you do that you will not be able to turn in the other two quests until someone else comes along and has Keeshan following them around. I made the mistake of leaving the Burning Steppes, logging off for a while and then came back and completed this quest without help from the NPC. If you leave the zone abandon this quest and pick this up again before proceeding. This triggers Keeshan to follow you around, without him you are stuck.",
            date = "2014-09-28T18:02:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28316#comments:id=2006662",
        },
    },
    [28317] = {
        {
            id = 1194114,
            score = 63,
            author = "712614",
            text = "Entrance for the cave that he is located in. 65.26, 46.55",
            date = "2010-11-28T17:55:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317#comments:id=1194114",
        },
        {
            id = 1189149,
            score = 15,
            author = "SubjectV",
            text = "General Thorg'izog is easy to find. He's located in the cave on the bottom level of the mountain (level with the rest of the zone). Enter the cave and keep to the left -- you'll end up at the General.",
            date = "2010-11-26T23:55:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317#comments:id=1189149",
        },
        {
            id = 2342526,
            score = 10,
            author = "Desertcobra",
            text = "Cave entrance is at 64.78, 46.71",
            date = "2016-06-20T06:39:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317#comments:id=2342526",
        },
        {
            id = 1262460,
            score = 7,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "Guide to Burning Steppes quests:\n\nOptional breadcrumbs:\nHero's Call: Burning Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28666) or Mouton Flamestar (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28514)\n\nDo anytime before leaving to Chiselgrip:\nDone Nothing Wrong (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28172)\n\nKeeshan is back with either:\n    Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28416) if you did the Redridge chain or Burning Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28174) if you did not.\n\nThese three at once:\n  Stocking Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28177)\n A Future Project (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28178)\n Mud Hunter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28179)\n\nThen:\nThe Sand, the Cider, and the Orb (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28180)\n\nThese two at once: Warlocks Have the Neatest Stuff (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28181) and Shadow Boxing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28182)\n\nThen:\nReturn to Keeshan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28183)\nChiselgrip, the Heart of the Steppes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28184)\n\nEnables these quests, which must be completed before General Thor'izog in the main chain:\nProve Yer Allegiance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28225)\nScrapped Golems (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28226) (leads to Golem Training (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28227))\n\nMain chain continues:\nA Needle in a Hellhole (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28254)\nA Perfect Costume (4 versions) Read the quest carefully. What creature disguise do you need?\n  --->    Orc (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28202) (given to Humans and Dwarves): 2 Hides, 4 muds, 2 thread\n  --->    Goblin (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28204) (given to Gnomes): 1 hide, 3 mud, 4 thread\n  --->    Troll (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28205) (given to Night Elves): 3 Hides, 2 mud, 1 thread\n  --->    Ogre (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28203) (given to Draenei and Worgen): 4 Hide, 1 Mud, 3 thread\n\nThen:\nInto the Black Tooth Hovel (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28239)\nGrunt Work (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28245)\n  Look in your quest log -- Strategic Cuts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28246) has silently appeared\nThe Kodocaller's Horn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28252)\nTaking the Horn for Ourselves (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28253)\nUntil Blizzard fixes it, when you turn in this quest, you will get a failed quest sound\n  with \"You don't meet the requirements for that quest\". Don't panic.\n\nYou must by this time have finished Stebben's quests, listed above.\nGeneral Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28265)\nTrial by Magma (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28266)\nI Am the Law and I am the Lash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28278) [I think this completing this one is optional]\n  When you accept the above, look for Abuse of Power (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28279) in your quest log\n\nThen:\nEnough Damage for One Day (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28286)\nMorgan's Vigil (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28310)\n\nCompleting that quest allows for these four together:\nSEVEN! YUP! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28415) [rewards Tiny Flamefly (http://www.wowhead.com/item=66080)]\nBlackened Ashes (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28311)\nA Heap of Delicious Worg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28313)\nLatent Demons of the Land (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28312)\n\nThen these three together:\nBlood Tour (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28314)\nDraconic Vanguard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28315)\nA Deal with a Dragon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28316)\n\nGiven when third one above is completed: Placing the Pawns (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28326)\n\nThen these three:\nA Delivery for Thorg'izog (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317)\nA Delivery for Neeralak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318)\nA Delivery for Zi'lun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28319)\n\nAuto-accepted when above three are done:\n Locked and Loaded (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28327)\n\nAnd the epic conclusion:\nAssault on Dreadmaul Rock (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28320)\nGlory Amidst Chaos (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28321)\nThe Spoils of War (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28322)",
            date = "2010-12-27T17:59:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317#comments:id=1262460",
        },
        {
            id = 1633567,
            score = 6,
            author = "958779",
            text = "I found entrance finally. Coordinates are 64,46. Look at screenshots.\nGreetings",
            date = "2012-03-01T01:33:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28317#comments:id=1633567",
        },
    },
    [28318] = {
        {
            id = 1197034,
            score = 126,
            author = "Sympathy",
            text = "Skull Warren is located at 71, 38.",
            date = "2010-11-30T02:56:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318#comments:id=1197034",
        },
        {
            id = 1187522,
            score = 73,
            author = "496594",
            text = "The quest NPC can be found at the back of the cave (The Skull Warren entrance).\n\nKeep left when entering and, of course, you need the disguise on. ;)",
            date = "2010-11-26T11:45:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318#comments:id=1187522",
        },
        {
            id = 1946211,
            score = 22,
            author = "wrocamb",
            text = "Ok, the tricky part to this quest is finding the cave, when looking on the map it does not show the entrance. On the northwest of the hill(Dreadmaul Rock) you will see a Rope and Wood Bridge, just the left of that bridge is trail that goes up and you will cross over a dirt like bridge with horns sticking out on both sides, which will lead you to the cave. Once your in the cave stay to the left the whole way down the bottom of the cave and you will find your guy.",
            date = "2014-02-24T00:06:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318#comments:id=1946211",
        },
        {
            id = 2583961,
            score = 21,
            author = "Oceandust",
            text = "Confirmed that the question mark was directing me to the wrong spot. The entrance to the cave (for those that do not have coordinates) is on the side of Dreadmaul Rock. When looking at the map it is slightly north of the L in the word Dreadmaul exactly in the red fire line.",
            date = "2018-07-23T20:26:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318#comments:id=2583961",
        },
        {
            id = 2305258,
            score = 13,
            author = "1456400",
            text = "The question mark on my map was at the wrong place.\nThe cave entrance is at 71.4,37,9.\nThe guy is on the bottom of the cave.",
            date = "2016-02-08T12:28:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28318#comments:id=2305258",
        },
    },
    [28319] = {
        {
            id = 1189147,
            score = 36,
            author = "SubjectV",
            text = "High Warlock Xi'lun is in a small cave at the very top of the mountain. Take the \"ogre path\" (it's the one with the rope/wood bridges and patrolling ogres) directly to the top (entrance to the path is near the north part of the mountain).",
            date = "2010-11-26T23:54:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28319#comments:id=1189147",
        },
        {
            id = 1388522,
            score = 20,
            author = "813796",
            text = "The foot of the wood/rope bridge is on the western side of the mountain at 64.4, 37.5. From that point just cross the bridge and continue on up to where the guy is in the opening of the shallow cave.",
            date = "2011-04-10T16:09:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28319#comments:id=1388522",
        },
        {
