            author = "RimmaJenkins",
            text = "Why did the quest only give me the ring option? I've run around for this transmog and I only got the ring option as reward. I'd thought it would change when I completed it and went to turn it in, but still no other rewards just the ring... Is there any other way to get the shoulders apart winterspring? (i've already completed the quest..)\nupdate: nevermind... lol. they've been put in the transmog tab upon completion... >.> creepy...",
