            author = "mgap",
            text = "To unlock this quest you must complete 6 quests from Darla Drilldozer (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=48127/darla-drilldozer). She is located in the Irontree Clearing, just a bit to the south.\n\nNo other prequests required.\n\nWhen you complete her 6 quest she will send you to Foreman Pikwik and the first quest he will give you will be this",
            date = "2011-11-06T15:39:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28335#comments:id=1564846",
        },
        {
