            text = "These can be looted from the nearby https://www.wowhead.com/npc=7136 (which is done simultaneously with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28358) with a pretty low droprate (Yes, while having the quest), roughly 20-25%. But they can ALSO be looted from the ground. It took me a while to see them though, but once you know what to look for they are not hard at all to find.",
