        {
            id = 1601274,
            score = 9,
            author = "912837",
            text = "This quest is still a known issue, with level 85's not being able to see Npc or complete this quest.\n\nIf you use Carbonite addon with \"Show quest on map\" turned on, you should be able to see all available quest. However, I got stuck at the same spot with no other available quest in the zone and this can make it seem like a dead end.\n\nI found 3 item drops that start quests, that can open up more quest that count toward your Hillsbrad 50/50 loremaster achievement, this ended up to be all I needed and got it today.\n\nThe Battle for Hillsbrad: [item=63250 domain=www]\nMuckgill's Flipper: [item=63090 domain=www]\nDaggerspine Attack Plans:  [item=63686 domain=www]\n\nIf these do not end up completing your achievement after opening up all available quest, then you are definitely missing some out there in this zone, I Hope this helps a bit.",
            date = "2011-12-24T07:15:51-06:00",
