        {
            id = 1673115,
            score = 6,
            author = "997071",
            text = "In case anyone else is looking for this, especially if you are higher level and questing for Gilneas rep — you do have to do the Nature and Nurture and Wanted: The Demon Hunter quest lines as a prerequisite.  But, if you do them and the quest still doesn't appear, check that you haven't already picked up a quest from Denmother Ulrica in Talonbranch Glade.  If you have, abandon it and the denmother quest should appear.",
