        {
            id = 1452047,
            score = 13,
            author = "795337",
            text = "a note about the quest marker for this quest, it's totally in the wrong place. So when you look at your map and see the # marking where the quest should be, don't go there! Also it appears on 2 different maps, Searing Gorge and Burning Steppes.\nThe quest area is in Burning Steppes, lower left area of the map and the cave can be found at the above co-ordinates.\nHope this helps you from flying/riding around in circles",
