            author = "jtbalogh",
            text = "If you lost your disguise, then check your bags to use item [Blackrock Disguise] and see Quartermaster Kaoshin to complete the quest.\n\nIf not in your bags, then abandon quest, remove costume buff, click on table for the ingredients, talk to Thelaron Direneedle to get costume, use the item [Blackrock Disguise], see Quartermaster Kaoshin, and then start the quest over again.",
