            text = "If you turn in Abuse power and lose your Blackrock Orc Disguise don't fret you can still turn in the quest, simply go back to Thelaron Direneedle (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=48001) and Loot the Tailor's Table next to him with the following mats below and turn them into Thelaron who will give you a new disguise.\n\n2 hides\n4 Handfuls of mud\n2 Spools of thread",
