            text = "For this quest you can actually continue to clobber one unsuspecting soldier over and over until they die and you'll continue to get quest credits as if it were a different guy every time. No need to actually hit 20 dudes, and if it discovers you, you'd have to kill him anyway so not much lost. I'm not sure if one mob counting as multiples is a glitch currently, but worked as 11/24/10.",
