quest=28401)/Slaves of the Firelord(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28465) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Earthfury Helmet (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16842).\n\nWarlock: Stones of Binding(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28399)/Stones of Binding(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Felheart Horns (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16808).\n\nWarrior: A Dangerous Alliance(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28393)/A Dangerous Alliance(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28457) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Helm of Might (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16866).\n\nThese rewards are also quite good at their level if you don't have a heirloom helmet for your alt(s). I also have no idea why the horde priests get race specific quests.",
            date = "2012-02-06T02:24:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28458#comments:id=1622349",
        },
        {
            id = 1184737,
            score = 4,
            author = "Solarax",
            text = "This is the Horde version of the Mage Only quest given by Ureda (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=47246), an Orgrimmar Mage Trainer.\n\nThere is an optional breadcrumb quest that preceeds it called Meet With Ureda (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28300) which is received when a player hits level 50.",
