    [28459] = {
        {
            id = 1562410,
            score = 25,
            author = "628452",
            text = "This is soloable by a demo lock, use the mole machine to tele to the domicile, then use your demon as a distraction to run up and grab the stones, one or two at a time. Die, and run back in. Repeat. If you can't get all the stones, reset the dungeon.\n\nEdit: Spelling",
            date = "2011-11-04T01:13:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459#comments:id=1562410",
        },
        {
            id = 1622326,
            score = 22,
            author = "13930",
            text = "Post-Cata class quest that rewards the T1 helm lookalike.\n\nA list of all classes are as follows:\n\nDeathknight : No T1, no dice.\n\nDruid: Breath of Cenarius (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28343) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Cenarion Helm (http://wowhead.com/item=16834). Both the alliance and the horde gets the quest from the same NPC.\n\nHunter: The Golem Lord's Creations(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28394)/The Golem Lord's Creations(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28461) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Giantstalker's Helmet (http://wowhead.com/item=16846).\n\nMage: The Pyromancer's Grimoire(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28398)/The Pyromancer's Grimoire(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28458) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Arcanist's Crown (http://wowhead.com/item=16795).\n\nPaladin: Weapons of Darkness(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28405)/Weapons of Darkness(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466)/Weapons of Darkness(Blood Elf) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28473) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Lawbringer's Helm (http://wowhead.com/item=16854), also rewards Blood Elf paladins with the Blood Knight Tabard (http://www.wowhead.com/item=25549).\n\nPriest: Twilight Scheming(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28328)/Twilight Scheming(Blood Elf) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28475)/Twilight Scheming(Goblin) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28478)/Twilight Scheming(Tauren) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28476)/Twilight Scheming(Troll) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28477)/Twilight Scheming(Undead) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28474) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Circlet of Prophecy (http://wowhead.com/item=16813).\n\nRogue: The Dark Iron Army(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28406)/The Dark Iron Army(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28463) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Nightslayer Cover (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16821).\n\nShaman: Slaves of the Firelord(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28401)/Slaves of the Firelord(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28465) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Earthfury Helmet (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16842).\n\nWarlock: Stones of Binding(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28399)/Stones of Binding(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Felheart Horns (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16808).\n\nWarrior: A Dangerous Alliance(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28393)/A Dangerous Alliance(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28457) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Helm of Might (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16866).\n\nThese rewards are also quite good at their level if you don't have a heirloom helmet for your alt(s). I also have no idea why the horde priests get race specific quests.",
            date = "2012-02-06T01:56:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459#comments:id=1622326",
        },
        {
            id = 3283472,
            score = 13,
            author = "zanesavage",
            text = "Man-o-man took me awhile to find this quest in 2020. Hopefully it helps someone else.\n\n\"Stones of Binding\" quest for this xmog is located in Orgimmar at 74.64, 47.06 NPC Kazak inside building.",
            date = "2020-12-31T19:55:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459#comments:id=3283472",
        },
        {
            id = 1184743,
