            text = "This is the Horde version of the Warlock Only quest given by Zevrost (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3326), an Orgrimmar Warlock Trainer.\n\nThere is an optional breadcrumb quest that preceeds it called Meet With Zevrost (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28299) which is received when a player hits level 50.",
