            author = "menace97",
            text = "This quest is incorrectly showing that https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3326 starts this quest. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=88705 is now the Warlock trainer in Orgrimmar (The Cleft of Shadow) who has replaced https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3326; it is him you speak to about beginning this quest.\n\nHe is located at (55,35) in The Cleft of Shadow, see map: Kranosh's Location (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=88705/kranosh#map:1637.1).",
