            text = "This is the Horde version of the Tauren Paladin Only quest given by Sunwalker Atohmo (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=44725), an Orgrimmar Paladin Trainer.\n\nThere is an optional breadcrumb quest that preceeds it called Meet With Sunwalker Atohmo (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28302) which is received when a player hits level 50.",
            date = "2010-11-25T09:03:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466#comments:id=1184295",
        },
        {
            id = 1426643,
            score = 5,
            author = "569787",
            text = "Only reason I did this quest as a level 85 was for the tabard https://www.wowhead.com/item=25549.\n\nYou can gather x5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=64313 from the dwarves just outside BRD entrance (you can also collect from dwarves inside).\n\nEnter BRD instance and to the right is an abandoned mole machine. Click it and take the option \"Just pass Grim Guzzler\".\n\nJump down and kill Lord Incendius (careful of the knockback). Use the https://www.wowhead.com/item=64313 on the anvil. Return to Org and collect your shiny new tabard https://www.wowhead.com/item=25549 to clutter up more bank space.\n\nOther quest rewards are a choice of:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=65632\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=65645\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=65648",
            date = "2011-05-25T00:49:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466#comments:id=1426643",
        },
        {
            id = 1205945,
            score = 4,
            author = "Agronok",
            text = "Takes a while finding a group willing to run the whole place =/\nThe helm has some sweet stats for it's level but...I mean really?...Tier 1?...last I checked that was the infamous Banana set for paladins...",
            date = "2010-12-04T11:29:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466#comments:id=1205945",
        },
        {
            id = 1310657,
            score = 3,
            author = "11563",
            text = "I just did this on my 85 paladin, so I don't know if anything is different once you are that level (such as doors being unlocked, etc.), but I can say I didn't do any prerequisite BRD quests or have any keys on my keychain.\n\nAll I did was enter the instance (I used the Orgrimmar portal to the Blasted Lands, then flew to the BRD entrance), head left through a closed gate which you can open simply by clicking it, then continue straight ahead and take the second opening on the right, the one which leads straight down a narrow hallway/bridge toward the anvil.\n\nWarning: Lord Incendius patrols around the anvil. At a high level you may be able to break the weapons without aggroing him, but if you do, pull him into the hallway immediately, because the first time I fought him he knocked me off the platform into the lava and I was so lost after that point that I had to hearth back to Org and start over.",
            date = "2011-01-26T12:27:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466#comments:id=1310657",
        },
        {
            id = 1622344,
            score = 3,
            author = "13930",
            text = "Post-Cata class quest that rewards the T1 helm lookalike.\n\nA list of all classes are as follows:\n\nDeathknight : No T1, no dice.\n\nDruid: Breath of Cenarius (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28343) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Cenarion Helm (http://wowhead.com/item=16834). Both the alliance and the horde gets the quest from the same NPC.\n\nHunter: The Golem Lord's Creations(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28394)/The Golem Lord's Creations(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28461) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Giantstalker's Helmet (http://wowhead.com/item=16846).\n\nMage: The Pyromancer's Grimoire(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28398)/The Pyromancer's Grimoire(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28458) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Arcanist's Crown (http://wowhead.com/item=16795).\n\nPaladin: Weapons of Darkness(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28405)/Weapons of Darkness(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466)/Weapons of Darkness(Blood Elf) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28473) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Lawbringer's Helm (http://wowhead.com/item=16854), also rewards Blood Elf paladins with the Blood Knight Tabard (http://www.wowhead.com/item=25549).\n\nPriest: Twilight Scheming(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28328)/Twilight Scheming(Blood Elf) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28475)/Twilight Scheming(Goblin) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28478)/Twilight Scheming(Tauren) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28476)/Twilight Scheming(Troll) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28477)/Twilight Scheming(Undead) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28474) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Circlet of Prophecy (http://wowhead.com/item=16813).\n\nRogue: The Dark Iron Army(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28406)/The Dark Iron Army(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28463) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Nightslayer Cover (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16821).\n\nShaman: Slaves of the Firelord(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28401)/Slaves of the Firelord(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28465) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Earthfury Helmet (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16842).\n\nWarlock: Stones of Binding(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28399)/Stones of Binding(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28459) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Felheart Horns (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16808).\n\nWarrior: A Dangerous Alliance(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28393)/A Dangerous Alliance(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28457) - Rewards with blue quality lookalike of Helm of Might (http://www.wowhead.com/item=16866).\n\nThese rewards are also quite good at their level if you don't have a heirloom helmet for your alt(s). I also have no idea why the horde priests get race specific quests.",
            date = "2012-02-06T02:16:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28466#comments:id=1622344",
        },
    },
