            text = "Maybe if he were the leader of a more intelligent race it would, ComradeAlek.  But the Winterfall Furbolg aren't exactly geniuses.  They are simpleminded and driven only by rage now, so, without a leader to guide them, they'll prettymuch be without direction and dangerous only to anyone that was unlucky nough to run into one in the wilderness!",
