        {
            id = 1204372,
            score = 28,
            author = "102058",
            text = "Possible for a BM Hunter.\nJust tried it and got him down to 1k.\n\nThis guy is way annoying though\nHe knocked me into a tree \009>.<\n\nYou have to make sure your pet doesn't get knocked away from you. Or else it will be dismissed.\n\nTry not to aggro off your pet. He hits like a truck :(\n\nIt is really refreshing knowing Blizz wants us to actually group up and not 1-shot everything :)",
            date = "2010-12-03T14:30:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28485#comments:id=1204372",
        },
        {
            id = 2586111,
            score = 23,
            author = "shotmachine",
            text = "With the new scaling zones introduced in 7.3.5 this boss is significantly harder to solo as a melee class, but it is still possible.\n\nTo solo this boss you have to get the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28604 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28603, which are part of a quest chain started by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=48218. While on this quest you are disguised as a member of the SI:7, which means alliance is now friendly to you.\n\nTo solo the boss stand at 46.7, 49.1 and pull him. while trying to use any movement and survival you might have, move towards the camp north of you, at 44.7, 46.2.\nKeep the distance between you and yetimus low enough or he will go out of combat and run back. When you are at the camp the alliance guard will start to attack, and take aggro after a while, the guard will kill him and you can finally loot that damned horn.\n\nIt took me about 3-4 tries on my monk.\nHope this helps :)",
            date = "2018-07-30T10:26:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28485#comments:id=2586111",
        },
        {
            id = 2570813,
            score = 17,
            author = "GDerkon",
            text = "Should say... Suggested players: 5",
            date = "2018-05-29T23:33:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28485#comments:id=2570813",
        },
    },
    [28487] = {
        {
            id = 1241498,
