://www.wowhead.com/quest=27311, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28284, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27317 & https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27313: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63596 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63597 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63598 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63599 are side quests during this chain)\n\n37a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28086\n37b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28087: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63648 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63649 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63650 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63651\n38. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28088\n39. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28098: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63652 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63653 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63654 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63655\n40. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28124\n\n41a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28125: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63656 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63657 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63658\n41b.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28127\n42a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28136: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63659 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63660 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63661 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63662\n42b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28139\n43. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28140\n44. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28142\n\n45a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28157\n45b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28158\n46. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28159: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63663 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63664 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63665 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63666\n\n47. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28161: https://www.wowhead.com/item=63673 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63674 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63675 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63676 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63677 https://www.wowhead.com/item=63678\n\n(If I missed something, let me know)\n\nSee also this wowpedia page (http://www.wowpedia.org/Thousand_Needles_storyline) (as pointed out by  Schnoodledorfer (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Schnoodledorfer))\n\nOn a side note: I got https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4938 while just going for the end quest by doing all it's pre-requisit quests and some side quests that were in the same area. (Also did a chain started with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28042 but afaik this is not needed.)\n\nNote: 07/11/2011, changed the 1st sentence, it was originally \"An overview of all the quests needed to get there:\" to avoid some confusion as to what this post is all about.",
