        {
            id = 1292257,
            score = 8,
            author = "750237",
            text = "Thinning their ranks is right!\n\nHad to kill 34 in order to get the 10 beads.... with all these exciting new quests since the shattering, it makes these boring, long, drawn-out quests even more long and drawn out!\n\nUGH!\n\nWinterfall Activity completed.\nXP gained: 5100\nRec'd 1G, 45S\nRec'd {Vest of the Den Watcher} -- chosen by Talva\nRep with Timbermaw Hold increased by 1400",
            date = "2011-01-13T15:02:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28522#comments:id=1292257",
        },
        {
            id = 1892377,
            score = 7,
            author = "1142689",
            text = "This is supposed to be an over-time quest. Meaning as you quest in Winterspring you'll be completing this one as well.\n\nObjective:\n\nCollect 10 https://www.wowhead.com/item=21383 from Winterfall Furblog.\nThe Furblog kind is not specified.\n\nDrop Rates:\n\n(Winterfall Shaman)\n - Coordinates: (67.6, 49.6) -- Drop Chance: 54%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=7439\n\n(Winterfall Ursa)\n - Coordinates: (67.6, 49.6) -- Drop Chance: 54%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=7438\n\n(Winterfall Totemic)\n - Coordinates: (26.4, 49.6) & (35.4, 57.0) -- Drop Chance: 53%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=7441\n\n(Winterfall Pathfinder)\n\n- Coordinates: (26,4 49.6) & (35.4, 57.0) -- Drop Chance: 52%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=7442\n\n(Winterfall Den Watcher)\n\n- Coordinates: (26,4 49.6) & (35.4, 57.0) -- Drop Chance: 51%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=7440\n\n(Winterfall Runner)\n\n- Coordinates: (27.0, 55.0) to (33.6, 54.4) -- Drop Chance: 43%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=10916\n\n(High Chief Winterfall)\n\n- Coordinates: (36.8, 55.6) -- Drop Chance: 25%\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=10738",
            date = "2013-09-02T16:02:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28522#comments:id=1892377",
        },
        {
            id = 1286272,
            score = 3,
            author = "557195",
            text = "1,400 rep at level 83, at Revered rep.",
            date = "2011-01-09T17:44:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28522#comments:id=1286272",
        },
        {
            id = 2337373,
            score = 3,
            author = "1064378",
            text = "Don't be like me and think the only area to kill these mobs is right near the questgiver. There are at least two other areas in the zone where you can do this. The one to the southeast where their chief is seems to have much higher respawn times and no one else competing for kills, unlike by the quest-giver.\n\nHope this helps someone.",
            date = "2016-06-05T20:09:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28522#comments:id=2337373",
        },
        {
            id = 1271100,
            score = 2,
            author = "Lupey",
            text = "This quest appears bugged. I was working on this in tandem with Threat of the Winterfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28460), and the mobs stopped dropping the beads after I had gathered 7 (I believe). The tooltip no longer gave the quest progress, and dropping the quest, deleting the beads and getting the quest again gives no results.\n\nI think it happened when I completed Threat of the Winterfall, don't properly recall. Anyone else encounter this?\n\nI haven't tried opening a ticket: queues on my realm seem to be very long :(",
            date = "2011-01-01T10:43:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28522#comments:id=1271100",
        },
    },
    [28523] = {
        {
            id = 1179091,
            score = 24,
            author = "142804",
            text = "Quest awards 2000 reputation with Timbermaw Hold and 30 Silver at lvl 80.\nThis is also still available from the NPC Salfa (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=11556) near the Timbermaw Hold entrance in Northwestern Winterspring. Patch 4.0.3.",
            date = "2010-11-23T20:11:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28523#comments:id=1179091",
        },
        {
            id = 1388359,
            score = 14,
            author = "Rasmaus543",
            text = "Yep. Its true, that they nerfed it here in Cataclysm. First i didnt believe it, and i went to Timbermaw Hold with 5 Beads to turn in. And it worked.\n\nSo with all \"Honor-Bonus\" Guild Perks, you get 2200 Reputation pr 5 pcs of Winterspring Spirit Beads, you hand in.\n\nExalted in no time!\n\nEdit;\nPlus you get 22 Reputation with the Honor-Bonus perk, everytime you nail one of those furry scumbags, that drops the beads. :-D",
            date = "2011-04-10T12:27:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28523#comments:id=1388359",
        },
        {
            id = 1419139,
            score = 8,
            author = "Spyderz",
            text = "Wow, i remember 3 days of straight grinding feathers from timbermaws to get enough rep for the 15 agility enchant. Nice to know the days of endless grinding for something worth while has come to an end. Thanks bliz for the silver platter.\n\nEdit:  About 6 quest and 20 beads. Am now honored. Took all of 15 minutes",
            date = "2011-05-15T02:57:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28523#comments:id=1419139",
        },
        {
            id = 1199532,
            score = 2,
            author = "Mixern",
            text = "This quest has been nerfed a lot. I'm not sure but I think that prior to patch 4.0.3a these quests required 10x [Winterfall Spirit Beads] and gave you 500rep. Before the patch I had farmed some Winterfall Spirit Beads, and was turning them in today, just to find out that each 5 pieces gave me 2000rep, that means that I just got my Diplomat title. Thx Blizzard for the NERF :)",
            date = "2010-12-01T05:32:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28523#comments:id=1199532",
        },
    },
    [28524] = {
        {
            id = 1444729,
            score = 29,
            author = "169653",
            text = "This breadcrumb quest comparably rewards more experience and yields Timbermaw Hold reputation as compared to https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768.\n\nI personally testified that abandoning https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 I am able to get this quest from Salfa where previously I couldn't.\n\nAlso, after abandoning https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545, I went back to the Warchief's Command Board and am not able to get the quest again.\n\nHope this helps!",
            date = "2011-06-19T06:00:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524#comments:id=1444729",
        },
        {
            id = 1426049,
            score = 8,
            author = "np088224",
            text = "This looks like a breadcrumb that cannot be accepted once you have done Threat of the Winterfall.",
            date = "2011-05-24T06:29:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524#comments:id=1426049",
        },
        {
            id = 3208913,
            score = 4,
            author = "Ehall671",
            text = "Breadcrumb Steps:\n\n1) Complete all Felwood Quests.\n2) Turn in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 and don't accept any other quests from Donova Snowden.\n2) Go to Nafien (Brown Furblog right outside Timbermaw tunnel on Felwood side) and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768. Turn this in to Donova and don't accept any other quests.\n3) Go to Salfa (White Furblog right out Timbermaw tunnel on Winterspring side) and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524. Turn this quest in and now you can pick up the rest of her quests.\n\nThere's a little bit of back and forth but it allows you to turn in the available breadcrumb quests.",
            date = "2020-05-26T15:56:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524#comments:id=3208913",
        },
        {
            id = 6438396,
            score = 1,
            author = "Roxtoni",
            text = "For completionists, this is the exact order that worked for me to complete all the Horde breadcrumbs into Winterspring without losing any quests.\n\nFirst, in northern Felwood, complete:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28338\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28366\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28362\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28364\n\nAfter completing these, return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=15395. You should now be able to accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521.\n\n1. Complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521 and turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11556.\n\nDo this BEFORE progressing any of the Winterspring breadcrumbs. This quest can become unavailable if you progress too far.\n\n2. Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT accept any other quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298 after turning it in.\n\n3. Return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=15395 and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nAgain, DO NOT accept any other quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\n4. Go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11556 and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nAfter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524 is completed, you can safely continue with the normal Winterspring questline.\n\nSafe order:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28338 + https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28366 + https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28362 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28364 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 OR https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524\n\nFollowing this exact order allowed me to complete all of them on the same character.",
            date = "2026-09-29T15:40:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524#comments:id=6438396",
        },
        {
            id = 1877828,
            score = -1,
            author = "BReal85",
            text = "In fact it gives 300 reputation to Timbermaw Hold.",
            date = "2013-07-17T10:48:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524#comments:id=1877828",
        },
    },
    [28525] = {
