            score = 10,
            author = "184486",
            text = "Be aware you can also get a breadcrumb quest from Flinn in Tanaris.\n[quest=24911 domain=www] - Tropical Paradise Beckons\nThis quest does provide more xp & money, so might be worth picking up if your looking to maximize your xp/money gain from quests.",
            date = "2011-09-03T07:06:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28525#comments:id=1509319",
        },
        {
