        {
            id = 1591543,
            score = 9,
            author = "Dimikcz",
            text = "Actually, you can complete this quest and the The Sands of Silithus or The Dunes of Silithus. You can not have both quests in your log at the same time, but if you complete the Warchief's Command quest first, you can then go pick up The Sands of Silithus or The Dunes of Silithus.",
