            text = "Not sure if this happened to anyone else, but when i headed out for this quest, according to the map, it looked very much like this quest was located in felwood.  I ran north (into far higher level mobs) and was very confused when my marker appeared to be located inside some mountains. As I turned tail and headed south, something clicked and the quest relocated itself to ashenvale where it was supposed to be. Just thought I'd throw this out there for anyone who runs into the same issue. Very frustrating.",
