        {
            id = 2534291,
            score = 3,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "Only available in The Exodar and Darnassus? Oo\n\nI can confirm that Stormwind doesn't offer this quest, so it seems likely that Ironforge doesn't offer it either. If you plan on doing into Felwood, and Winterspring, you should stop by Darnassus between lvl 44-47 to pick up this breadcrumb. Otherwise the story-line won't have a lead in.\n\nEDIT\n\nSeems like this quest is not available in Darnassus either. I imagine the same applies to The Exodar. Instead, you are directed to the Adventure Guide version when you click on the board. Save yourself the flight, and just do this directly from your hotbar.",
            date = "2017-11-11T18:44:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28543#comments:id=2534291",
        },
    },
    [28544] = {
        {
            id = 2869064,
            score = 9,
            author = "Mortimerty",
            text = "As of Patch 8.1 you can complete two breadcrumb quests which lead you to Winterspring.\n\nYou have to keep the order to be able to do both of them.\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544 (this quest can be found on every Hero's Call Board) OR https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768 (both have same reward, mutually exclusive, but both are marked as completed if one of them is completed)\n\n2.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524 (BEWARE: if you complete it BEFORE https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521 becomes unavailable)",
            date = "2019-01-31T08:56:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544#comments:id=2869064",
        },
        {
            id = 1696213,
            score = 4,
            author = "Adamsm",
            text = "Fastest way to reach this quest giver is to take a flight to Moonglade, then run through the Timbermaw Hold and follow the road to the north to her camp at the Springs.",
            date = "2012-08-05T02:07:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544#comments:id=1696213",
        },
        {
            id = 6438393,
            score = 1,
            author = "Roxtoni",
            text = "For completionists, this is the exact order that worked for me to complete all the Horde breadcrumbs into Winterspring without losing any quests.\n\nFirst, in northern Felwood, complete:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28338\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28366\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28362\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28364\n\nAfter completing these, return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=15395. You should now be able to accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521.\n\n1. Complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521 and turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11556.\n\nDo this BEFORE progressing any of the Winterspring breadcrumbs. This quest can become unavailable if you progress too far.\n\n2. Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT accept any other quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298 after turning it in.\n\n3. Return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=15395 and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nAgain, DO NOT accept any other quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\n4. Go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11556 and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524. Turn it in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=9298.\n\nAfter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524 is completed, you can safely continue with the normal Winterspring questline.\n\nSafe order:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28338 + https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28366 + https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28362 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28364 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28521 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28545 OR https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28768 → https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28524\n\nFollowing this exact order allowed me to complete all of them on the same character.",
            date = "2026-09-29T15:38:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28544#comments:id=6438393",
        },
    },
