        {
            id = 1212065,
            score = 29,
            author = "75955",
            text = "The alternate breadcrumb quest is called \"Reinforcements to Loch Modan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26131)\" which starts from Mountaineer Barleybrew (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=1959) in Ironforge by the King. :)",
