            text = "U can get this quest but you won't be able to get Into the Woods or the quest called Visitors which getting either Into the Woods will cancel out visitors and vis versa",
            date = "2011-01-04T20:13:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28578#comments:id=1277680",
        },
    },
    [28579] = {
        {
            id = 1634417,
            score = 52,
            author = "TreeroyJ",
            text = "Blizzard assigned the quest ender to the Eastern Plaguelands because that is where you may possibly have just been questing.\n\nWhat they forgot, however, is that the Hero's Call boards are in the cities.",
            date = "2012-03-03T04:19:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28579#comments:id=1634417",
        },
        {
            id = 1273107,
            score = 24,
            author = "752869",
            text = "Time to eat a piece of cake this is a long flight. I am not sure why they have you run all the way to EPL to fly all the way back to badlands when it is so close to Ironforge.",
            date = "2011-01-02T11:21:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28579#comments:id=1273107",
        },
        {
            id = 1593362,
            score = 13,
            author = "9mmx19",
            text = "You can jump directly to Easily Swayed without any prereqs.",
            date = "2011-12-09T18:18:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28579#comments:id=1593362",
        },
        {
            id = 1428238,
            score = 9,
            author = "plymoc",
            text = "The reason is that you would normally be questing in EPL before you come to Badlands. It takes you to Badlands when you are done with EPL. Of course, if you hadn't been questing in EPL before Badlands, it makes no sense whatsoever.",
            date = "2011-05-26T17:42:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28579#comments:id=1428238",
        },
        {
            id = 2190830,
            score = 7,
            author = "Taraezor",
            text = "The Badlands of Khaz Modan was reworked for Cataclysm and now contains an epic quest chain along with a very humorous side quest chain.\n\nThe Rhea quest chain, if a further incentive is required, contains a cinematic at its conclusion. It is not to be missed.\n\nThe quest chain commences with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27774. Players need only fly directly to the top of Fuselight to pick up the quest. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27775 will also be offered but can be ignored.\n\nSeveral quests prior to that are offered, including faction city noticeboards and a fun rocket flight from the Eastern Plaguelands https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27762. They are unnecessary.\n\nWhile flying around the optional https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27823 (A) and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27877 (H) are available and can be ignored if you are in a hurry. Anyhow, you will be taken to the locations where these quests are offered if you progress in the Rhea quest chain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=27927 will be offered as you fly around. This is optional and functions merely to to get you to the location of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2785 at location 26.2, 62.3, who offers https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27713. This is a very funny quest chain and not to be missed. A great counterpoint to the epic Rhea saga.",
            date = "2015-06-06T16:45:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28579#comments:id=2190830",
        },
    },
    [28580] = {
