            text = "I just recently had a bug where Drill Sergeant Magnus was evading everything after being mocked into the fight.\n\nThe simple fix is to just stand on the box with him.\n\nTook me way too long to come up with that answer so I figured I'd come on here and I might save someone some pain.",
