            author = "jerodast",
            text = "Watching this video on \"Good\" settings I was unable to see the explosions. Perhaps a fluke, but when I rewatched it (abandon/reaccept) with View Distance set to High I was able to see the results of my work :) I highly recommend you tweak your settings up to appreciate the big finale!\n\nShame Blizz couldn't find a way to make this scale better to video capabilities :/",
