    [28620] = {
        {
            id = 1194726,
            score = 14,
            author = "276651",
            text = "When you turn in the quest, if you wait a moment you can see a cutscene between Nils and the orcs affected with \"Durnholde Syndrome.\"\n\nNils Beerot says: It has now been six weeks since your release. Are you ready to have the shackles removed?\nDrull says: Can't you just see me for me, doc? Why does it always  have to be about Teddy?\nTog'thar says: I'm with Drull, doc. Laverne and I are happy together. Why try and separate us?\nNils Beerot says: My official diagnosis is that you are both idiots! IDIOTS I SAY!\n\nI happened to be standing nearby when another player turned in the quest, and it seems like Drull and Tog'thar's response can change.  Here is the alternate I saw, there may be more:\n\nDrull says: NO, DAMN IT! For the hundredth time, NO!\nTog'thar: And we don't appreciate you referring to our friends as a 'ball and chain,' doc.\n\nEdit:  apparently it's not just when you turn in the quest, it just happens every so often.  Also, the random comments from Drull and Tog'thar aren't linked.\n\nDrull says: What I want to know is this: WHY DO YOU CARE IF I HAVE A BALL AND CHAIN SHACKLED TO MY ANKLE!\nDrull says: You'll be free to take it off when I die.\nTog'thar says: Frankly, I'm getting a little tired of these therapy sessions. We're fine! Just let us go.",
            date = "2010-11-29T00:59:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28620#comments:id=1194726",
        },
        {
            id = 1259130,
            score = 8,
            author = "swedishnoob",
            text = "Now they sit upon my couch with their big, iron balls and cry. \"\"\nSomebody needs to visit a urologist =P",
            date = "2010-12-26T00:43:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28620#comments:id=1259130",
        },
    },
