            author = "dreamgarden",
            text = "This bit... \"The Honor Hold Mage in the Mage District can help you get there.\" Well, the Honor Hold mage can help me get to Blasted Lands, but that's not the same, because (in present time) Khadgar and crew are just standing there in Blasted Lands waiting for the flow of enemies to abate, which I expect would happen ... never. As PrimeFusion pointed out, you can talk to Zidormi (there is a Zidormi at the Northern entrance to Blasted Lands) and go back in time (\"before the invasion\"). Then you can go through the gate (one way!) to the gate in Hellfire Peninsula.",
