            text = "Even after turning in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28714, if you haven't turned in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28715 yet, there is still hope to get the breadcrumb quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28734 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=2079. Simply abandon https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28715, then that breadcrumb quest will be available again.",
            date = "2012-07-07T07:30:20-05:00",
