        {
            id = 2409190,
            score = -1,
            author = "mpwalter",
            text = "Hi -- I'm a complete newbie to WoW, and feeling a bit lost.  I have this quest, and keep seeing Grelkin, but most of the time, my character can't seem interact with them.  I was somehow able to attack and kill 2 of them, but I have no idea why those 2 and not the dozens of others I've encountered.  I've tried everything I can think of, and can't seem to figure out what to do.  It's getting a bit frustrating, as all my character can do is walking around in circles, see a grelkin and click on it, but (except for those 2 times) nothing happens.\nThere doesn't seem to be much information to explain to new players how to play -- the \"new player guide\" has cool graphics explaining how to pick a character race and class, but doesn't really EXPLAIN much about learning how to play.\nCan somebody help?  Or point me to something that is actually helpful?",
            date = "2016-09-20T13:34:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28714#comments:id=2409190",
        },
    },
