            author = "358692",
            text = "Quick note for death knights hoping to do the starting area quests for Teldrassil for Alliance reputation:\n\nAs a death knight you'll only be able to do the first four quests in this small chain. Any other class (at least, any other class that a night elf is able to be) would get another quest afterwards that is class-specific. And you, being the awesome death knight that you are, can't get these class specific quests. Because you're a death knight.\n\nThis may or may not be the case with other starting areas - I'll edit this post after confirming this at Coldridge and Northshire.\n\nEdit: After checking out Gnomeregan and Northshire, I was completely unable to find any questgivers whatsoever. I was, however, able to complete the Ironforge starting quests.",
