 mount to get around):\n\nWhen doing both quests it took me just over 12 minutes to do, starting from standing in front of Lord Raymond George (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=49856) (the quest giver) and ending in front of him. However, if I only did https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28756, it took me around 5 minutes 30 seconds to complete meaning it's actually quicker to spam Rattlegore kills than to try doing both.\n\nThe best way to complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28756 is once you've got to Scholomance, jump down from the 'bridge' and stay as close to the wall as you can (there's a little ledge in the pit below which you'll land on and it will greatly reduce the chance of pulling anything). Then run up the steps and over to the room with whelplings in; once in this room, jump down the hole on your left and then run over and kill Rattlegore. After that there's only really one way back to the entrance. It shaves off about 30 seconds or so taking this route to Rattlegore.",
