n2)Blood and Thunder!(H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25949)\0092)All or Nothing(A) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25558)\n ├──┬────────────────────┘\n │ 3)Better Late Than Dead (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25477)  3)Kliklak's  Craw (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25467)\n │ 3)The Abyssal Ride (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25371)\n │ G)Good Deed Left Undone (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27685)  3)The Horde's Hoard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25377)\n │OR│\n3)Gimme Shelter! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25587)────────>3)A Case of Crabs (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25388)\n3)Ain't Too Proud to Beg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25598)\n ├>3)A Girl's Best Friend (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25390)\n ├>3)A Taste For Tail (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25389)\n ├>3)An Opened Can of Whoop Gnash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27687)\n ||\n3)Can't Start a Fire Without a Spark (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25602)  4)Blackfin's Booty (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25503)\n ├>3)Nerve Tonic (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25358)\009     ||\n ||\009\009\009    4)Oh, the Insanity! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25651)\n3)Ophidophobia (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25459)\009\009    5)Dah, Nunt... Dah, Nunt... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25657)\n ├>4)Lady La-La's Medallion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25419) 5)Shark Weak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27699)\n3)A Desperate Plea (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25638)\009    5)DUN-dun-DUN-dun-DUN-dun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25670)\n3)Undersea Sanctuary (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25794)\009    4)A Bone to Pick (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25732)\n6)Spelunking (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25812){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26000)\009\009    5)Decisions, Decisions (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25743)\n6)Debriefing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25824){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26007)\n6)Wake of Destruction (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25887)─────┬>6)Decompression (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25888){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26008)\n6)Come Hell of High Water (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25884) ├>6)What? What? In My Gut...? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25885){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26040)\n6)The Warden's Time (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27708)\009  └>6)How Disarming (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25883)\n7)Across the Great Divide (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25471)\n7)The Looming Threat (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25334)\n7)Backed Into a Corner (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25164)\n7)Rundown (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25221)\009     ┌>9)Slippery Threat (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25220)\n8)Silver Tide Hollow (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25222)─┼>9)Don't be Shellfish (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25219)\n9)The Great Sambino (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25216)  └>8)A Distracting Scent (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25215)\n9)Undersea Inflation (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25218)\n9)Totem Modification (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25217)  9)Crabby Patrons (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25360)\n8)Back In One Piece (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25456)\nG)Toshe's Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25359)──>Vengeful Heart (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25439)*\nQuest zones:\n1)Orgrimmar+Stormwind_____2)Legion's Fate+Seafarer's Tomb_____3)Shallow's End+Smuggler's Hole_____4)Gurboggle's Ledge_____5)Skeletal Reef_____6)Deepmist Grotto+The Clutch_____7)Damplight Chamber+Shimmering Grotto_____8)Silver Tide Hollow_____9)Silver Tide Trench\nG)Gluing Separate Questlines_____S)Skippable\n*Click to see more info about that quest-line.[/pre]\nIMPORTANT INFO:\nIn order to gethttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=27668 you must completehttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25944 before acceptinghttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25946.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25477 andhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25371 are NOT needed to takehttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25587 and future progress of quests, however that would make you unable to pickuphttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=27685.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=55186 - will never drop for you before you completehttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25459. Afterhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25459 it will drop at 100% rate. However anyone can share you this quest even you havn't completedhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=14482/https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25924.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25439 is a starter of second part of Vashj'ir, as (G) symbol stands athttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25359 means you can go directly tohttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=25439 and do that part first.\n\n> (http://www.wowhead.com/forums&topic=180241&p=2487503)",
