        {
            id = 1416924,
            score = 7,
            author = "wharris",
            text = "Guide to Vash'jir Kelp'thar Forest (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=4815) Alliance Quests:\n\nOptional Pre-quests:\nA Personal Summons (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28825) and Eye of the Storm (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28826)\nEither Into the Abyss (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14481): or Hero's Call: Vashj'ir (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27724)\n\nMain chain:\n  Call of Duty (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=14482)\n  Sea Legs (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=24432) (At any time, kill a Slitherfin eel (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40855) to start   Once More, with Eeling (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27729))\n  Pay it Forward (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25281)\n  Rest for the Weary (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25405)\n  Buy Us Some Time (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25357) & Travelling on Our Stomachs\n (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25546)     (Be sure to kill a Sabreclaw Skitterer (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=40276) to get Crumpled Treasure Map (http://www.wowhead.com/item=54345) which starts Kliklak's Craw (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25467))\n  To Arms! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25545) and Stormwind Elite Aquatic and Land Forces (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25564)\n    On Our Own Terms (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25547)\n  All or Nothing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25558)\n  Better Late than Dead  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25477)\n  The Abyssal Ride (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25371)\n  Good Deed Left Undone (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27685) (optional)\n  Gimme Shelter! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25587)  (also unlocks A Case of Crabs (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25388))\n  Ain't Too Proud to Beg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25598)\n   (which also unlocks A Girl's Best Friend (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25390) and A Taste for Tail (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25389))\n   This is a convenient time to do The Horde's Hoard (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25377), which starts\n         from Tattered Treasure Map (http://www.wowhead.com/item=53053), dropped by Clacksnap Pincer (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=39918)\n\n Next comes Can't Start a Fire Without a Spark (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25602)\n\n This allows for the optional quest Nerve Tonic (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25358), and the optional Bud (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46338) Chain:\n\n    Oh, the Insanity (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25651)\n Dan, Nunt... Dah, Nunt... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25657)\n Shark Weak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27699),\n    Dun-dun-DUN-dun-DUN-dun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25670)\n A Bone to Pick (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25732)\n Decisions, Decisions (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25743)\n\n    Around this time, kill Gilblin Collectors (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=41017) and hope\n       Lady La-La's necklace (http://www.wowhead.com/item=55186) drops for Lady La-La's Medallion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25419). There are conflicting reports of what quests are needed for the item to drop.\n   This is also a good time to kill Gilblingle (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=41183) for waterlogged journal (http://www.wowhead.com/item=54639) which starts Blackfin's Booty (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25503).\n\n  The main chain continues:\n  Ophidophobia (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25459)\n  A Desparate Plea (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25638)\n  Undersea Sanctuary (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25794)\n  Spelunking (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25812)\n  Debriefing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25824)\n  Wake of Destruction (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25887)\n     (also unlocks What? What? In My Gut...? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25885)  and Decompression (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25888))\n  Come Hell or High Water (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25884) (While in naga camp, pick up How Disarming (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25883))\n  The Warden's Time (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27708) is auto-given when Come Hell or High Water (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25884) auto-completes\n  Across the great Divide (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=25471) leads to the Shimmering Expanse (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=5144) chain.\n\nDon't forget to group up or come back at 85 for\n    An Opened Can of Whoop Gnash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=27687)",
            date = "2011-05-12T15:18:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28825#comments:id=1416924",
        },
    },
