            score = 11,
            author = "662504",
            text = "Way more than 5 tesseracts in the cave. Each of those rifts has one or more mobs in front of it that you have to kill before using the dream catcher to close it. So you can chose whether you rather go for aoe-ing groups or for single target fights.\nThe mobs are a weird mixture of things you'd usually find in Outland (various types of demons, ravagers, mana wyrms, ethereals, etc.)",
            date = "2011-02-28T16:17:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28841#comments:id=1353351",
        },
        {
            id = 1716123,
            score = 3,
            author = "1034513",
            text = "One of the mobs drops a ring that teleports you back to Haleh.  The ring is called \"Haleh Back\", which amused me way more than it should have.",
            date = "2012-09-19T22:40:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28841#comments:id=1716123",
        },
        {
            id = 1958213,
            score = 3,
            author = "752236",
            text = "Odd to find so many Outland creatures here; ethereals, eredar, etc.  Of course, this quest was new in the Cataclysm.",
            date = "2014-04-13T05:34:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28841#comments:id=1958213",
        },
        {
            id = 2125990,
            score = 3,
            author = "Gaaralia",
            text = "So if you happen to go into the cave and see tiny greenish orbs that say \"arcane tesseract\" above them and try to use the dream catcher but it won't work (like I did) it's because the tesseracts have already been closed recently. Simply wait a few minutes for the tesseracts to reopen and the enemies to respawn :)",
            date = "2015-02-28T22:24:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28841#comments:id=2125990",
        },
    },
    [28842] = {
        {
            id = 1182470,
            score = 65,
            author = "181947",
            text = "When you use the ring to teleport back to Haleh, the spellcast bar says \"Haleh Back.\"  lmao",
            date = "2010-11-24T17:39:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28842#comments:id=1182470",
        },
        {
            id = 1353833,
            score = 41,
            author = "772029",
            text = "He is in the cave (where you had to do The Arcane Storm Within quest). Enter the cave at 55.34, 63.88",
            date = "2011-03-01T04:58:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28842#comments:id=1353833",
        },
        {
            id = 1265576,
            score = 32,
            author = "rsongy",
            text = "Okay well I figured it out finally. In order to get this quest, you must start by doing Kelek Skykeeper's (at 46, 53 - Lake Kel'Theril, Winterspring) quest line. He then sends you to Nymn (59, 50 - Everlook, Winterspring). I was given no follow up quest from Nymn at level 53, but i decided to run to Haleh (58, 63 - Beryl Egress, Winterspring) and she now offers the quest \"Altered Beasts,\" which was unavailable to me before. After completing that quest, Haleh offered me the quest \"The Owlbeasts' Defense.\" Upon completion, this leads to the quest \"Magic Prehistoric,\" which leads to \"Winterwater,\" which finally leads to \"Umbranse's Deliverance.\"",
            date = "2010-12-29T07:33:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28842#comments:id=1265576",
        },
        {
            id = 1181621,
            score = 20,
            author = "MalygosHelper",
            text = "Lore:\nOnce a friendly member of Everlook, Umbranse has attacked the Blue Dragonflight and lies now inside Mazthoril, defended by crazed magic he accidentally summoned. His madness is the product of a crystal.\n\nHow to start the questline:\nKelek Skykeeper is the starter of the questline. Quite a long one.\n\nPersonal Note:\nI like how the Blue Dragonflight has plays the role of the weakened dragonflight requiring aid. That was their lore role, after all...\n\nDifficulty:\nVery easy. (One-shotted at level 80.)",
            date = "2010-11-24T13:13:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28842#comments:id=1181621",
        },
        {
            id = 1366860,
            score = 17,
            author = "238149",
            text = "Note: The ring is consumed when used, for some reason, so if, for example, you wander in, target the mob, and then use the ring thinking it is some sort of debuff or call for help like most of the new quests are, and arrive back at haleh thinking 'wtf?', you will need to abandon and get the quest again in order to get a new ring.\n\nAlso you will have to walk back in.\n\n*sigh*",
            date = "2011-03-14T14:37:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28842#comments:id=1366860",
        },
    },
    [28847] = {
        {
            id = 1520901,
            score = 27,
            author = "765979",
            text = "you have to do the series of quests at Lake kel'theril which will send you to nymn he'll say thanks we may need you later. so after you do the Hammer, axe and sword chain (in building with banker)  then you can do the yeti quest chain from umi rumpelsnicker and then Nymn  should be ready to offer you The pursuit of umbranes",
            date = "2011-09-18T12:15:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847#comments:id=1520901",
        },
        {
            id = 5342248,
            score = 7,
            author = "Tyrsenus",
            text = "How to get this breadcrumb quest:\n\nCheck that you have not completed or accepted any quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=10929, OR\nParty sync with a character that has not completed or accepted any quests in Winterspring.\n\nThen do the following quests in this order:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28460 - pick up at /way #83 25.0 58.6 Donova Snowden\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28464\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28467\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28469\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28470\n\nHigh Chief Winterfall will drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=12842, which starts https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28471. Winterfall will not drop it unless you're on the quest to kill him. Once you have it, you can ignore all other quests currently in your log and proceed with the next ones in this list.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28471\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28472\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28479\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28513\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28534\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28518\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28535\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28519\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28536\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28537\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28848\n\nNext quest line starts from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11191 in the Everlook building with the telescope.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28609\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28610\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28618\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28624\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28625\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28626\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28627\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28632\n\nBefore you head off the complete Fresh from the Hills, pick up these three quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=10305:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28630\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28629\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28631\n\nDo https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28630 first to be ported to the back of the cave. Complete those quests, then Umi will offer https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28722. Complete it.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=50366 will now offer https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847.",
            date = "2022-03-18T08:05:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847#comments:id=5342248",
        },
        {
            id = 1951276,
            score = 5,
            author = "kileytoo",
            text = "To sum it all up, this quest has two prerequisite quest chains: the long chain beginning with The Final Piece (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28471) and the short one beginning with Are We There, Yeti? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28629).",
            date = "2014-03-15T14:50:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847#comments:id=1951276",
        },
        {
            id = 5976871,
            score = 5,
            author = "TheBaldr",
            text = "If your using BtWQuests and it doesn't tell you the right prereqs You need Winterfall Furbolg, Ruins of Kel Theril, Superior Weapons, and Yeti Surprise.",
            date = "2024-10-06T13:54:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847#comments:id=5976871",
        },
        {
            id = 1267010,
            score = 4,
            author = "Taithrah",
            text = "The pre-requisite seems to be Trailing the Spiritspeaker (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28848)",
            date = "2010-12-30T00:45:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28847#comments:id=1267010",
        },
    },
