            text = "Here is where high levels go :) https://www.wowhead.com/npc=88206 (first)",
            date = "2015-01-01T07:40:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28858#comments:id=2080179",
        },
        {
            id = 1567103,
            score = 3,
            author = "899614",
            text = "\"The best way to Dreadmaul Hold is to cross the Great Sea, then to take the road south from the Swamp of Sorrows.\"\n\nThis is not true. I found the best way to get there is to take the the portal in Org to the Dark Portal then run north. Much faster.",
            date = "2011-11-09T00:24:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28858#comments:id=1567103",
        },
        {
            id = 2157233,
            score = 3,
            author = "LentzRose",
            text = "If you takehttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=28553 or vise versa you will make the other quest not attainable. For example I picked up Okrilla and the Blasted Lands so I can no longer pick up Blasted Lands: The Other Side of the World. Keep in mind you can still do the Warchief's command board as well with one of these two just have to turn in the Command board one before picking up one of the other two",
            date = "2015-04-08T13:02:56-05:00",
