            author = "qalpha94",
            text = "Actually, you can complete this quest and the Warchief's Command/Hero's Call quests. You can not have both quests in your log at the same time, but if you complete the Warchief's Command quest first, you can then go pick this one up (or The Sands of Silithus). Almost all Warchief's Command/Hero's Call quests work this way with the other breadcrub quests.  Try it!",
            date = "2011-05-15T21:49:50-05:00",
