    },
    [28867] = {
        {
            id = 2013450,
            score = 29,
            author = "spacecheeserocks",
            text = "! Re: PATCH 6.0.2 !\nIf you're level 90 and phased to the invaded Blasted Lands, but wish to complete low level quests, speak to Zidormi (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=88206) (48.2, 7.2).\n\nShe will phase you to the old version of Blasted Lands.\n\nThis also shows the green version of the dark portal, which can be entered to access Hellfire Peninsula without the City portals. However, the reverse is not possible.",
            date = "2014-10-15T11:59:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28867#comments:id=2013450",
        },
        {
            id = 1485582,
            score = 24,
            author = "236646",
            text = "I thought the completion text of the quest was amusing, \"Silithus, not such a great place, eh? We get a lot of you from there...\"\n\nKind of a head nod from the designers to the fact that the only 55-60 zones in the game are Silithus and Blasted Lands, and Silithus wasn't redone for the Cataclysm.  As a result, Silithus is one of the last relics of vanilla-style questing in the game- much more grindy and slow going exp wise than Blasted Lands.  I can see a lot of people starting out in Silithus, doing a few quests, getting sick of it, and taking the portal to Blasted Lands.  I know I did.",
            date = "2011-08-02T11:57:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28867#comments:id=1485582",
        },
        {
            id = 1329073,
            score = 6,
            author = "13rock",
            text = "There really needs to be a portal back. I accidentally clicked it, now I have to fly all the way back..",
            date = "2011-02-09T17:02:55-06:00",
