    [29021] = {
        {
            id = 1336736,
            score = 30,
            author = "megablast",
            text = "\"Now what the heck is a samophlange?\" I'm sure that this has been said before, but this is a reference to a famous Thundercats blooper video (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWRvkRj8KQA).",
            date = "2011-02-15T01:54:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29021#comments:id=1336736",
        },
        {
            id = 1393467,
            score = 8,
            author = "160411",
            text = "If you've already completed these quests pre-shattering, you may have trouble getting Sputtervalve to start this quest chain for you. I spoke with a GM who mentioned that it was a known issue, and that I should check back after each patch.",
            date = "2011-04-17T11:36:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29021#comments:id=1393467",
        },
        {
            id = 1567113,
            score = 5,
            author = "jtbalogh",
            text = "This quest to access the control console 4 years ago had the title \"Samophlange\". 2 years ago with another alt the title was still \"Samophlange\". The next 3 quests in the chain have the same name too.\n\nThe quests I see changed are the new Samophlange Repair (http://thottbot.com/quest=14003) QID 14003, and Read the Manual (http://thottbot.com/quest=14006) QID 14006, which used to be called Samophlange Manual (http://thottbot.com/quest=3924) QID 3924.\n\nThe old Samophlange quest description before being changed was,\n\n\"The Venture Company set up a small research facility far to the north of here, southwest of the Sludge Fen. I don't know very much about what they're doing, but did manage to discover that they're experimenting with something called a \"samophlange\".\n\nNow what the heck is a samophlange? Well, whatever it is, I want to examine it, so I need someone to go get it.\n\nI obtained a copy of their control system operating manual, you should be able to figure out how to disengage the samophlange from it.\"",
            date = "2011-11-09T00:47:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29021#comments:id=1567113",
        },
        {
            id = 3202754,
            score = 5,
            author = "RyuzakiPower",
            text = "If you happen to be in my situation, where you had done these quests pre-cata, and now the questline is bugged, and won't allow you to continue, quest sync with someone who has not done Northern Barrens, and you can complete it as normal. Questline has no requirements other than being above a minimum level, so you can just head right there and do it.\n\nIf you're unfamiliar with quest sync, the person doesn't even need to be in your zone, just party up, hit the button on the map, and any quests one of you have not done are available. Note that you will also be synced to their level.\n\nFinally my Northern Barrens section of AllTheThings isn't screaming at me.",
            date = "2020-04-28T02:32:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29021#comments:id=3202754",
        },
        {
            id = 2004081,
            score = 3,
            author = "gbalkam",
            text = "Be sure to get your flight path here and at Mor'shan Ramparts as soon as you get close.  It will save a fair bit of walking / travel time!",
            date = "2014-09-19T05:39:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29021#comments:id=2004081",
        },
    },
