            text = "The grand majority of the locations for the nugget slugs are NOT at the Burning Blade settlement, but at The Sludge Fen. There are no buckets there anymore. Used to be, but not now. Further, if you're using Carbonite, it still takes you back to The Sludge Fen. Previous posts list accurate coords for the Burning Blade Settlement.\n\nI did however get as many as 3 nugget slugs in a bucket (twice actually) and it's not this quest that offers you a teleport, it's the one after, Return to Samophlanger (http://thottbot.com/quest=14004).",
