        {
            id = 1436715,
            score = 4,
            author = "kaiderey4",
            text = "Progression\n\n[50] Get Them While They're Young (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29032)\n[50] They Grow Up So Fast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29034)\n\n[50 Daily] A Cub's Cravings (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29035)\n[50 Daily] 'Borrowing' From the Winterfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29037)\n[50 Daily] Cub's First Toy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29040)\n[50 Daily] Hunting Practice\n\nNotes\n\nSimply bring your cub close to one of the mounds. The cub will pounce on the mound, and the player will see the emote\nWinterspring Cub pounces on the snow-covered hare burrow (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=51711) (View comments on that page for coordinates to some of the burrows I've found) If you don't have coordinates, most of the burrows are in the middle area between: Frostsaber Rock, The Hidden Grove, and Starfall Village.",
