        },
        {
            id = 1450973,
            score = 11,
            author = "Wildcupcake",
            text = "And ofcourse, like for many other quest, you cant get the feathers and hide if you are in a RAID group.\nI should've realised, but I killed ALL possible moonkins in the whole winterspring and finally realised why I didn't got any.. Silly me.",
            date = "2011-06-26T08:40:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29040#comments:id=1450973",
        },
        {
            id = 1436704,
            score = 8,
            author = "kaiderey4",
            text = "Progression\n\n[50] Get Them While They're Young (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29032)\n[50] They Grow Up So Fast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29034)\n\n[50 Daily] A Cub's Cravings (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29035)\n[50 Daily] 'Borrowing' From the Winterfall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29037)\n[50 Daily] Cub's First Toy\n[50 Daily] Hunting Practice (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29038)\n\nNotes\n\nTo make the cat toy, you need these things:\n\nTough Yeti Hide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=68663) (1)\nDropped by the yeti just south of the Winterfall Village in the cave.\n\nWildkin Feather (http://www.wowhead.com/item=68662#dropped-by) (5)\nDropped by the Owlbeasts in The Hidden Grove.\n\nAfter collecting the hide (http://www.wowhead.com/item=68663) and feathers (http://www.wowhead.com/item=68662), right-click to combine them into the cat toy (http://www.wowhead.com/item=68668). Then right-click the toy to Use it.\nUsing the toy produces a ground targeted area of effect targeting circle. Click the circle to have the cub play with the toy.\nThe Hidden Grove can be found at the north end of Winterspring, due north of Everlook, and is labeled on the game map.",
            date = "2011-06-08T02:00:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29040#comments:id=1436704",
        },
    },
    [29071] = {
        {
            id = 1337405,
            score = 9,
            author = "464017",
            text = "Wowhead doesn't have enough info on this yet, but IF:\nthis quest becomes avaiable when a toon hits 80, AND has their Heartstone set to Dal, or is given by the Dal Innkeepers, etc. then this is a really good \"story\" way to get toons back into stormwind.",
            date = "2011-02-15T14:54:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29071#comments:id=1337405",
        },
        {
            id = 1428574,
            score = 9,
            author = "248534",
            text = "Turns grey at Lv94...? o.O",
            date = "2011-05-27T06:30:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29071#comments:id=1428574",
        },
        {
            id = 1477753,
            score = 6,
            author = "473253",
            text = "Even though you get the Hero's Hearthstone in Dalaran upon acepting this quest, it's not restricted to be used only from there. And since there's a portal right next to the board you get this quest from, you might as well use that portal instead of the HHS and keep it in your bag.\n\nSave the HHS for a rainy day, like when your HS is on cd (indeed, they don't share cd!) and you need to get back to a capital city. Or when you've been stupid and hearthed back to the middle of nowhere before having set your HS in SW again.",
            date = "2011-07-23T17:12:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29071#comments:id=1477753",
        },
        {
            id = 2247130,
            score = 4,
            author = "Ikarugamesh",
            text = "As the Adventure Guide, which has replaced the bulletin boards, directly gives https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27724 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27726, apparently this quest (along with https://www.wowhead.com/item=68808) is no longer available.",
            date = "2015-09-06T15:39:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29071#comments:id=2247130",
        },
        {
            id = 1449734,
            score = 3,
            author = "darknesscalls",
            text = "The stormwind portal is back but the quest is still here, since it doesn't given any experience the only thing useful from it is a free teleport to Stormwind. It doesn't share a cooldown with the hearthstone so might as well save it for later use.",
            date = "2011-06-24T17:12:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29071#comments:id=1449734",
        },
    },
    [29073] = {
        {
            id = 1334487,
            score = 7,
            author = "Scruffee",
            text = "I got this from the Warchief's Command Board in Dalaran today, used the item and arrived in Orgrimmar, but there's nowhere to hand any quest in and it's disappeared from my quest log. Unsure what the point of this quest is at the moment other than a free return to Orgrimmar from Dalaran since portals got removed.",
            date = "2011-02-13T09:58:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29073#comments:id=1334487",
        },
        {
            id = 2247131,
            score = 5,
            author = "Ikarugamesh",
            text = "As the Adventure Guide, which has replaced the bulletin boards, directly gives https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27718 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27721, apparently this quest (along with https://www.wowhead.com/item=68809) is no longer available.",
            date = "2015-09-06T15:41:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29073#comments:id=2247131",
        },
        {
            id = 1449733,
            score = 3,
            author = "darknesscalls",
            text = "The portals are back now but the quest remains, so really it doesn't serve a purpose except to give you a free teleport to Orgrimmar. It doesn't share a cooldown with your hearthstone so might as well keep it for later use.",
            date = "2011-06-24T17:11:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29073#comments:id=1449733",
        },
        {
            id = 1892899,
            score = 1,
            author = "HarlWindwolf",
            text = "For a reason that I haven't been able to find out yet, this quest isn't available for everyone (every character).\n\nEarlier today, I accepted (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29609) with my level 82 DK, turned it in and the Warchief's Command Board had this here quest for me waiting right on it. A few hours later, I proceeded the exact same way with my level 82 monk and there was no quest on the board. At first, I thought it was an exclusively monk-related bug (read section below why that is) but my level 81 huntress didn't see the quest either and, like the DK and the monk, she hadn't been to Dalaran before at all. My level 90 druid was able to pick it up, so it's probably not level-related and since she's been questing in cataclysm zones, it's probably not related to completing the initial cataclysm quests either (which would have been the most logical relation to me).\n\nWith the monk, I also wasn't able to do the quests in Utgarde Pinnacle, nor the quest chain in The Culling of Stratholme though I don't remember doing those. Also, I should have been able to cut the RP sequence if I really had completed the quest before but I couldn't, so I proceeded with the dungeon as usual which worked out fine (the way it had to be done before cutting the RP sequence was even possible).\n\nIt seems that it's a character-specific drawback of some kind (not sure if it's a bug or just something on my end that I'm not aware of) - however, I had no issues picking up the initial Northrend quests in Dalaran and then questing in those zones (Sholazar Basin & Storm Peaks) with that same monk, so why I would see certain quests but not others is beyond my current understanding.",
            date = "2013-09-04T19:13:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29073#comments:id=1892899",
        },
        {
            id = 5905980,
            score = 1,
            author = "jewelkingquests",
            text = "as of 11.0 accepting this quest is bugged, we have a bug report going for it and the other broken quests:\nhttps://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/broken-quests-incompletable-list/1903553",
            date = "2024-07-26T22:17:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29073#comments:id=5905980",
        },
    },
