            score = -1,
            author = "TheWoWExp",
            text = "As of 8.3\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=G76hq2WTra4\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nStarts: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197 (33.39,53.32)\nEnds: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197 (33.39,53.32)\n\nTo the left is an area with all kinds of Worgs roaming around. All you have to do is kill six of them and turn in the quest.\n\nThere's not much point in looting them unless you don't mind collecting some grays to sell at a vendor. The respawn of all the mobs in the area doesn't make it a half bad place to spam and kill everything at your leisure.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nRare nearby!\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nThere's a possibility of finding the rare known as https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62 outside the gated entrance to the mine at 31.03,18.56.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nHappy questing,\nTGEXP (https://tgexp.com/beating-them-back/)",
            date = "2020-09-12T16:06:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29078#comments:id=3229569",
        },
    },
    [29079] = {
        {
            id = 1420580,
            score = 8,
            author = "Apolocyntosis",
            text = "This variant of the quest would appear, as far as I can tell, to be the only non-human version. Just did this quest on my gnomish priest, and these pants were the only reward I was offered.",
            date = "2011-05-16T20:16:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29079#comments:id=1420580",
        },
        {
            id = 3229576,
            score = -1,
            author = "TheWoWExp",
            text = "As of 8.3\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nhttps://youtu.be/pe5HU2qGl8Q\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nStarts: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197 (33.39,53.32)\nEnds: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197 (33.39,53.32)\n\nTo the left is the area where you'll find a lot of Worgs and Blackrock Spies. The spies are trying to skulk around without doing a very good job of it. And people who suck at their jobs deserve to be canned.\n\nSo get them off the payroll.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nRare nearby!\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nThere's a possibility of finding the rare known as https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62 outside the gated entrance to the mine at 31.03,18.56.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nHappy questing,\nTGEXP (https://tgexp.com/lions-for-lambs/)",
            date = "2020-09-12T16:28:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29079#comments:id=3229576",
        },
    },
