        {
            id = 3229583,
            score = -1,
            author = "TheWoWExp",
            text = "As of 8.3\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nhttps://youtu.be/7qcppQfC7T4\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nStarts: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197 (33.39,53.32)\nEnds: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=823 (35.73,40.27)\n\nSergeant Willem is to the left side of the building, standing next to a small makeshift camp. Just, you know, watching everything happen. Like he’s shell-shocked. Or not allowed to move from his post and intervene in the battles.\n\nAt least poor Brother Paxton is healing their comrades.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nHappy questing,\nTGEXP (https://tgexp.com/join-the-battle/)",
            date = "2020-09-12T16:55:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29080#comments:id=3229583",
        },
    },
    [29081] = {
        {
            id = 5432957,
            score = 1,
            author = "glassleo",
            text = "This version of the quest is available for Monks and Druids regardless of race, as well as some other non-Human races.\n\nHowever, there is a bug with this quest if you abandon it, then you will not be able to pick it up again. If you are stuck in this situation you'll have to Party Sync with someone below level 50 who have not completed the Northshire quests yet, and then redo the prerequisites. You'll get this quest automatically after turning in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31143.",
            date = "2022-09-12T18:25:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29081#comments:id=5432957",
        },
        {
            id = 3229592,
            score = -1,
            author = "TheWoWExp",
            text = "As of 8.3\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nhttps://youtu.be/4Z75MRQGu4A\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\n\nStarts: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=823 (35.73,40.27)\nEnds: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=823 (35.73,40.27)\n\nThe goblins in question are sneaking around the nearby area, but they aren't stealthed, so...don't worry about not being able to see them. They're your typical black-garbed assassins. Or maybe assassins-in-training, considering how bad they are.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nRare nearby!\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nThere’s a possibility of finding the rare known as https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62 outside the gated entrance to the mine at 31.03,18.56.\n_____________________________________________________________________\n¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯¯\nHappy questing,\nTGEXP (https://tgexp.com/they-sent-assassins/)",
            date = "2020-09-12T17:33:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29081#comments:id=3229592",
        },
    },
