            author = "57893",
            text = "As of this posting, the completion text is listed as:\nThis is terrible news! , at least you arrived safely.\n\nI experienced a different completion text post 4.1, when they replaced They Call Him Swiftdagger. He Kills Harpies. (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=28877) with The Short Way Home (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29094).\n\nPost 4.1, Nagla comments that he heard you screaming from your rocket ride as you flew overhead while doing that quest.",
            date = "2011-06-04T02:15:25-05:00",
