            text = "No need to grab the flame from him, you get it when you accept the quest (see your bags). Just run up the stairs in the building, find the terrace on the top floor and click the banner...\nPosted Feb 20, 2023",
            date = "2023-02-20T12:35:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29408#comments:id=5552787",
        },
        {
            id = 1808018,
            score = 9,
            author = "837727",
            text = "It seems a bit bugged, i had to move the mouse slightly to the left and above his name in order to get the \"grab\" icon and be able to take the flame from him.",
            date = "2013-02-02T05:13:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29408#comments:id=1808018",
        },
    },
    [29409] = {
        {
            id = 1653941,
            score = 0,
            author = "Zillions",
            text = "He's such a good sport!\n\"It was an honor to be defeated by you\"\n\"Amazing! You're much stronger than you look.\"\n\"It seems I have more training to do. Thank you for the lesson.\"\n\nAfter accepting the quest, leave the building by the opposite door, then follow the path across the bridge. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54611 will be there, waiting to be defeated.\n\nNote: More than one player can complete this quest at a time.",
            date = "2012-04-14T16:26:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29409#comments:id=1653941",
        },
    },
    [29410] = {
    },
    [29412] = {
        {
            id = 1453529,
            score = 122,
            author = "Fiyasoldier",
            text = "The Balloons can either keep floating up or pop in midair...\n\nDid i just kill a child?",
            date = "2011-06-29T01:07:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29412#comments:id=1453529",
        },
        {
            id = 1452912,
            score = 74,
            author = "292346",
            text = "This is a level 20 quest, so if you are doing this as an 85, make sure that you have low-level quest tracking turned on. Vin is found behind the orphange on the sidewalk, with a Gilnean-style dog standing next to her.\n\nThe balloons are attached to sidewalks and pavement at ground level and sparkle.",
            date = "2011-06-28T15:28:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29412#comments:id=1452912",
        },
        {
            id = 1454073,
            score = 49,
            author = "rustedangel",
            text = "I found all of mine hiding behind trees at ground level in Old Town.",
            date = "2011-06-29T10:18:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29412#comments:id=1454073",
        },
        {
            id = 1438789,
            score = 46,
            author = "sacreddevil",
            text = "Vin is at lower right of cathedral zone.\nMost of those balloons are around the streets - hope it's useful.",
            date = "2011-06-10T20:14:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29412#comments:id=1438789",
        },
        {
            id = 1484797,
            score = 25,
            author = "104789",
            text = "I haven't played WoW in a few months. Returning to level a worgen alt, I finish up Darkshore and run through Stormwind, heading to check out the new Duskwood quests. I find her along the way.\n\n\"Hey, this is new,\" I think to myself. \"It rewards a pet and everything! I really wanna go to Duskwood, but she's just so cute, and... and a pet!\"\n\nI accept the quest and have a somewhat difficult time finding balloons, until I head into the Dwarven District to see that those dirty dwarves apparently stole most of them. Rounding them up, I return to the little girl, and... oh, lord. No, no, come back down here! Ahhhhhhhh! Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!\n\nI think I'm gonna take another few months off of WoW to deal with my guilt, now :(",
            date = "2011-08-01T11:41:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29412#comments:id=1484797",
        },
    },
    [29414] = {
        {
            id = 1653490,
            score = 7,
            author = "329137",
            text = "You fight off waves of incoming Scamps (Forest Sprites) while Aysa is meditating. As you're fighting, she's conversing with the spirit of a Master Li Fei, and their speech gives you information about what's going on. Be sure and check the chat log when you're done protecting her, if you weren't able to follow along while you fought.\n\nWhen she finishes meditating, you don't follow up with her (at the time I'm writing this, it's Beta, so that could change). Instead you go back to the entrance of the cave and speak with Master Shang Xi. He gives you the next quest.",
            date = "2012-04-13T19:45:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29414#comments:id=1653490",
        },
        {
            id = 1726293,
            score = 7,
            author = "243923",
            text = "While Aysa is meditating, she has a conversation with a spirit named Li Fei.  Here is a transcript, in case you missed the dialogue in-game because you were too busy fighting monsters.  :)\n\nAysa Cloudsinger says:  Keep those creatures at bay while I meditate.  We'll soon have the answers we seek.\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"The way of the Tushui... enlightenment through patience and meditation... the principled life.\"\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"It is good to see you again, Aysa. You've come with respect, and so I shall give you the answers you seek.\"\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Huo, the spirit of fire, is known for his hunger.  He wants for tinder to eat. He needs the caress of the wind to rouse him.\"\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"If you find these things and  bring them to his cave, on the far side of Wu-Song Village, you will face a challenge within.\"\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Overcome that challenge, and you shall be graced by Huo's presence. Rekindle his flame, and if your spirit is pure, he shall follow you.\"\nMaster Li Fei's voice echoes, \"Go, children. We shall meet again very soon.\"\nMaster Li Fei fades away.\nAysa Cloudsinger says: And so our path lays before us. Speak to Master Shang Xi, he will tell you what comes next.",
            date = "2012-09-30T16:10:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29414#comments:id=1726293",
        },
        {
            id = 5342541,
            score = 4,
            author = "im2cuteferu",
            text = "Look at the pavement at the entrance of the building. Stand where the large flat stones meet with the smaller ones. Many of the sprites will run past you and not attack you. This was the only way I could beat it.",
            date = "2022-03-18T18:50:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29414#comments:id=5342541",
        },
        {
            id = 1744101,
            score = 2,
            author = "oozie",
            text = "I found it easier to just run around the room in a circle avoiding stuff till she had finished meditating\n\nThats the way of the Chickenrice (my character)  :)",
            date = "2012-10-17T13:30:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29414#comments:id=1744101",
        },
        {
            id = 1795499,
            score = 1,
            author = "Jayrai",
            text = "I goofed, and would aggro too many each time.\n\nIf you're low on health, take any chance you get and eat some food. The sprites come rushing in quite fast, putting you in combat right away.\n\nStand in front of Aysa and eat, I found it worked once or twice just giving me enough health to get through the next waves.",
            date = "2013-01-09T19:06:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29414#comments:id=1795499",
        },
    },
    [29417] = {
        {
            id = 1653474,
            score = 5,
            author = "329137",
            text = "Be careful where you go to fight them. It's easy to get mobbed by a bunch of them, in which case they will kill you. Most classes simply don't have the tools to deal with 3 or more of them at this level.\n\nUnless you can pull one at a time, it's best to stay in \"town\" and kill the ones that rush in. Otherwise you give them the chance to surround you.\n\nNote that they have an ability where they jump on your head and DPS you from there for a few seconds, and you can't fight back. If you're a Monk, you can use Roll (http://mop.wowhead.com/spell=109132) to dislodge them. Otherwise, you can try jumping up and down-- some say that works.\n\nEdit: this has been iterated on a number of times since I wrote the post during Beta. Currently (Patch 5.1) the Hozen don't jump on your head anymore, and they also seem to be less powerful. Still be careful though, not to pull too many at once.",
            date = "2012-04-13T19:10:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29417#comments:id=1653474",
        },
    },
    [29418] = {
    },
    [29419] = {
