        {
            id = 2253939,
            score = 1,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "Can't seem to find ANY information on this quest (even in the wiki and other outdated sources) so I am assuming this used to be the breadcrumb quest for the Blood Furnace dungeon that has since been removed from the game.\n\nBlizzard went through and removed a number of breadcrumb quests leading to dungeons, and battlegrounds - but they seem to have been very inconsistent when doing so. Of the three Hellfire Citadel Dungeons, two still have their breadcrumb intact",
