            author = "357415",
            text = "Annoyingly, she will not always offer a reward.\n\nWhile spec'd as a Mistweaver monk, she offered me nothing, whereas when I was spec'd as a Brewmaster, I was offered the 1h-agi axe.\n\nI like that she won't offer two handed swords or shields to me, as I can't use those, but I shouldn't have to respec every time just to see the different things I might use.",
            date = "2012-10-11T15:14:38-05:00",
