        {
            id = 2023403,
            score = 4,
            author = "blupache",
            text = "The Critically Wounded Pilot (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66565) and Mortally Wounded Pilot (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66567) NPCs will actually gradually lose health if you sit around watching them, and eventually die if they're not saved. Neat bit of realism.\n\nHey, I was fishing on a horde character, ok? I wasn't just sitting around watching them die.. honestly...",
