        {
            id = 1659718,
            score = 34,
            author = "Peter4730",
            text = "OK, so the map above shows you how to find Earthbinder Rayge.  This dude, upon being found, acts like a scared kitty, and instead of leading you in the search for the next target Windcaller Claw - simply wimps out!  He tells you Claw is the pet of Swamplord Musel'ek.  So, NOW go do a Wowhead search on that guy.  Where he is, Claw will also be.  Kill Swamplord first, and then start whacking Claw, who backs off after a bit of damage, and reverts to tauren form.  Go talk to him and complete the quest.",
