        {
            id = 1610286,
            score = 9,
            author = "Omegabeast",
            text = "This quest just showed up in 4.3.  Starting from the Throne of the Elements in Nagrand, you are sent to the Underbog in Zangarmarsh to talk to Watcher Jhang near the entrance inside of the instance.  Watcher Jhang starts the dungeon quest Rescuing the Expedition (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29570), another new quest in 4.3.",
