            text = "As of patch 5.4, during his ritual, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=56113 now says:\n\n\"What... what is this place?  It is beautiful... But... something is not right.\"\n\nThis is indicative of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms being corrupted by the Sha, as you get to see for yourself in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581.",
            date = "2013-09-26T00:02:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29577#comments:id=1902782",
        },
        {
            id = 1660596,
            score = 4,
            author = "StansDad",
            text = "Clever Ashyo is standing on the bank of one of the Pools of Purity just off from the road. At this time he has nothing over his head (i.e. question or exclamation mark or the new yellow speech bubble) to indicate that it is he a NPC of particular interest, but a regular white speech bubble will appear when you interact, allowing you to select the dialogue which will enable you to complete the task.",
