    [29581] = {
        {
            id = 1900423,
            score = 87,
            author = "Stealthfire13",
            text = "Completing this quest in 5.4 does in fact show the desecrated Vale. Afterwards Yan comments:\n\nYan says: No... That's not right...\nYan says: It should be beautiful. It should be pristine!\nYan says: Perhaps I brewed the tea wrong? Yes, that must be it. I brewed the tea wrong. My apologies.",
            date = "2013-09-20T03:23:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581#comments:id=1900423",
        },
        {
            id = 1866079,
            score = 57,
            author = "940955",
            text = "The vision you see when you consume the drink, \"The Golden Dream\", is actually a vision of the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. It appears to be a vision updated to fit the current state of the vale too, as doing it in 5.3 showed me the Horde digsite and the desecrated area.\n\nCome 5.4, I have a feeling this vision won't be so 'golden' anymore...",
            date = "2013-06-13T06:46:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581#comments:id=1866079",
        },
        {
            id = 1722564,
            score = 45,
            author = "kgurnhill",
            text = "When escorting Li Li (Chen Stormstouts niece) her comment changes depending on wether you're a Herbalist or not.\n\nIf you have Herbalism (Not sure if it requires a certain level to trigger this dialogue though) she says the following\n\nLi Li says: ... you picked that flower like a champion! You're like a... a professional flower-picker! Have you done this before?\n\nIf you dont have Herbalism, she tells you not to Manhandle the plant!\n\nLi Li says: Yikes, , don't manhandle the thing. Have you never picked an herb before?\n\nYep, she says \"An herb\" - Naughty blizzard! lol\n\nEdit: changed what Li Li says when youre not a herbalist, thanks to Ojomann below :)",
            date = "2012-09-28T04:06:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581#comments:id=1722564",
        },
        {
            id = 1936725,
            score = 44,
            author = "38901",
            text = "I think it's kind of sad that they didn't phase the Vale of Eternal Blossoms so that you can still see it as it was before the 5.4 patch. It'd have been nice to use this quest (say) to show it in its pristine state.",
            date = "2014-01-22T10:02:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581#comments:id=1936725",
        },
        {
            id = 1684897,
            score = 31,
            author = "DarkElfIT",
            text = "The dreamleaf looks like a small tree, and it isn't right on top of the shrine.  Check further to the east, near the cliff and you will see it.  It's right next to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=56833.  Who also will drop an item that starts a quest if you are are interested.",
            date = "2012-07-05T17:30:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29581#comments:id=1684897",
        },
    },
    [29582] = {
        {
            id = 1588840,
            score = 7,
            author = "406368",
            text = "New quest added in patch 4.3 to the [zone=3519] area, and can be acquired from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19606 (he is busy trying to get someone to read him the Wanted Poster board near the mailbox) in the Horde's Stonebreaker Hold.  The mission is to speak to the \"shiny mummy\" in [zone=3792], which is the [faction=933] representative named https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692.  He is located in the northern-most instance portal, inside of the [zone=3792] itself.  The Alliance version is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583 and obtained from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21400 talking about \"treasure and ancient knowledge\" in the Alliance's Allerian Stronghold.\n\nPlayers DO NOT need to be in Heroic mode in order to complete this quest.\n\n(At level 85 with both guild perks, I received zero (0) guild rep, which may be a bug in the quest or new NPC coding.  With both guild perks https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78635, players will receive 275 reputation with [faction=933], and 1 guild rep or 2 with https://www.wowhead.com/item=69210) for each of the next two quests.)\n\nWhen https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29582 is turned in players will see:\n\n\"That meathead send you instead?\"\n\n\"I suppose you'll have to do.\"\n\n(NOTE:  Cookie!  Notice the grammatical error and the extra '.' inside of 's above as of this patch?)\n\nNPC chat text between https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54694:\n\nArtificer Morphalius says: \"Look at me!  You said I would be fine!  Do I look fine?\"\n\nMamdy the \"Ologist\" says:  \"I can only show you the door, Morphalius.  You're the one that has to walk through it.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692 starts and ends two 4.3 quests named https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29573 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29575, both also occurring in the [zone=3792].\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=54694 who starts and ends the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29574.\n\n*Special note for patch 4.3 is that most Auchindoun/Ring of Observance quest NPCs have been moved from the four instance lobbies to actually inside of their respective instances.\n\nADDENDUM:  As of this time few of the tooltips, quests, or Quick Facts have been updated linking items/NPCs/quests together.  These are single quests and as yet do not have any associated chains or quests thereafter.  Will continue to scan for changes and update as needed.",
            date = "2011-12-04T04:23:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29582#comments:id=1588840",
        },
        {
            id = 1959818,
            score = 5,
            author = "Wigge",
            text = "Does not count toward Loremaster achieves as it is a dungeon quest, even though you get the quest in Terokkar.",
            date = "2014-04-20T12:05:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29582#comments:id=1959818",
        },
    },
    [29583] = {
        {
            id = 1678138,
            score = 17,
            author = "shipwreck",
            text = "This quest does NOT count towards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=1191.",
            date = "2012-06-18T17:31:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583#comments:id=1678138",
        },
        {
            id = 1586866,
            score = 4,
            author = "gtadem",
            text = "This is just a breadcrumb quest available at Allerian Stronghold to get you to go into Mana Tombs.",
            date = "2011-12-01T21:52:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583#comments:id=1586866",
        },
        {
            id = 1589047,
            score = 3,
            author = "406368",
            text = "There is a pre-quest leading players to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692,  the Alliance version is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583 and obtained from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=21400 talking about \"treasure and ancient knowledge\" in the Alliance's Allerian Stronghold.  The Horde version is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29582 and can be acquired from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19606 (he is busy trying to get someone to read him the Wanted Poster board near the mailbox) in the Horde's Stonebreaker Hold.  The mission is to speak to the \"shiny mummy\" in [zone=3792].\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=29573 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29575 are two new quests added in patch 4.3 to the [zone=3519] area, and can be acquired from and returned to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692 inside of the [zone=3792] dungeon instance, which is a representative for [faction=933].  He is located in the northern-most instance portal, inside of the [zone=3792] itself.  It is highly suggested to pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29574 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54694 right next to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692 before clearing this dungeon.\n\nIn https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29573, players must happily kill 10 Ethereal Crypt Raiders, 5 Ethereal Sorcerers, 5 Nexus Stalkers, and 5 Ethereal Spellbinders (links to each inside of the quest link) in [zone=3792].  All of these are mobs that are usually packed in mixed groups of 2-5 together, so if players are near the level for this zone, they should be careful of mixing pulls from other close groups as they may end up pulling 10-15 mobs in a single room at once.  Some of the mobs are only located in the room just before https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18344.\n\nFor https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29575 players must acquire https://www.wowhead.com/item=28490 by killing anti-Consortium leader https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18344 in [zone=3792].\n\nPlayers DO NOT need to be in Heroic mode in order to complete this quest.\n\n(At level 85 with both guild perks, I received zero (0) guild rep, which may be a bug in the quest or new NPC coding.  With both guild perks https://www.wowhead.com/spell=78635, players will receive 275 reputation with [faction=933], and 1 guild rep or 2 with https://www.wowhead.com/item=69210) for each of the next two quests.)\n\nWhen https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583 is turned in players will see:\n\n\"That meathead send you instead?\"\n\n\"I suppose you'll have to do.\"\n\n(NOTE:  Cookie!  Notice the grammatical error and the extra '.' inside of 's above as of this patch?)\n\nNPC chat text between https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54692 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54694:\n\nArtificer Morphalius says: \"Look at me!  You said I would be fine!  Do I look fine?\"\n\nMamdy the \"Ologist\" says:  \"I can only show you the door, Morphalius.  You're the one that has to walk through it.\n\n*Special note for patch 4.3 is that most Auchindoun/Ring of Observance quest NPCs have been moved from the four instance lobbies to actually inside of their respective instances.\n\nADDENDUM:  As of this time few of the tooltips, quests, or Quick Facts have been updated linking items/NPCs/quests together.  These are single quests and as yet do not have any associated chains or quests thereafter.  Will continue to scan for changes and update as needed.",
            date = "2011-12-04T07:32:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583#comments:id=1589047",
        },
        {
            id = 1893282,
            score = 2,
            author = "944648",
            text = "Quest description reminds me a video of Paul McCartney telling a version of old joke.\n\"Why he’s not called fencemaker\": http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQjM5qsVryw",
            date = "2013-09-06T12:27:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583#comments:id=1893282",
        },
        {
            id = 1934287,
            score = 1,
            author = "1210728",
            text = "Luckily another player close to me was looking for it too, and while we were chatting, some ogre walked by on the road with the question mark over his head. You get some 11,000 xp for it, but all you do is wait on that road until he appears. Then he gives you a quest to continue it elsewhere.",
            date = "2014-01-13T17:07:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29583#comments:id=1934287",
        },
    },
