    [29595] = {
        {
            id = 1589247,
            score = 11,
            author = "406368",
            text = "Patch 4.3 Update:  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595 is obtained from a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19698 outside of the instance after turning in quest chain https://www.wowhead.com/quest=10253.  Another two quests can be obtained in the beginning of this dungeon from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=54725, (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18371 is now the lucky recipient of a quest to slay this boss https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29590 = Pretty much play 'slay the Beholder'.) and (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29596 to slay the 2nd and main boss https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18373).\n\nNOTE:  These quests DO NOT require Heroic difficulty to complete.\n\nThis is a stripped down version of the original quest line, with all item rewards removed, and players no longer are required to defeat https://www.wowhead.com/npc=18373 until the next quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29596.\n\nText emotes/dialogue between the NPCs and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19698 still located around him have some bearing on the original chain storyline.  They still repeat emote in this same order even with 4.3 quest changes:\n\nHa'lei giggles.\nHa'lei says: \"You promise?\"\nHa'lei tugs on Clarissa's robe.\nHa'lei says: \"Mommy, Greatfather says everything will be ok.\"\nClarissa wipes the tears away.\nClarissa says: \"Mommy is going to make sure you're ok, baby.\"\n\nClarissa says: \"Please, father, I do not have your strength. I cannot do this on my own. Please help me...\"\n\nHa'lei giggles.\nHa'lei says: \"I'll tell her, Greatfather.\"\nHa'lei tugs on Clarissa's robe.\nHa'lei says: \"Don't cry, Mommy. Greatfather says not to worry.\"\nClarissa wipes the tears away.\nClarissa says: \"In the end, we will all be together, sweetheart.\"\n\nHa'lei laughs.\nHa'lei says: \"I will, Greatfather.\"\nHa'lei tugs on Clarissa's robe.\nHa'lei says: \"Mommy, Greatfather told me that he will watch over us and make sure we're ok.\"\nClarissa wipes the tears away.\nClarissa says: \"Oh sweetheart, grandpoppy has passed. It will be ok.\"\n\nClarissa says: \"Father, give me strength to go on.\"\n\nThe original dialogue upon quest completion occurred outside of the instance where the many Lost Souls were appearing to pray on the altar to the right half of the instance lobby.\n\n *Special thanks to xXTheBlackHaloXx back in 2010 for grabbing the original completion dialogue*\nClarissa says: Give me a sign... anything...\n\nSpirit of Exarch Maladaar says: The dark ones had taken a hold of me, master. You were merciful in seeking my death. Forgive me...\nGreatfather Aldrimus says: In death, all is forgiven...\nSpirit of Exarch Maladaar nods.\n\nClarissa says: Father? Father is that you?\nGreatfather Aldrimus says: It will be alright, darling. Grieve no more...\n\nNOTE:  As of this time the Quick Facts and quest data tooltips are incorrectly showing this as an Alliance-only quest.  This is INCORRECT, and is in fact both obtainable and completable by Horde as well.",
            date = "2011-12-04T11:19:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595#comments:id=1589247",
        },
        {
            id = 2489468,
            score = 9,
            author = "Expiring",
            text = "You can't take https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595 if you have already completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29596 as https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595 is a bread crumb quest leading to it\nYou can check by running a test with command \"/script print(IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(29596))\"\nIf it shows true, it means, you have completed https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29596 and cannot take the bread crumb quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595",
            date = "2017-04-22T13:11:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29595#comments:id=2489468",
        },
        {
            id = 1938720,
            score = 4,
