            author = "dasbaum",
            text = "Apperently https://www.wowhead.com/item=27633 drops only in normal mode, not on heroic. Even though the other item https://www.wowhead.com/item=27632 does drop on heroic. The quest does not specify that it needs to be normal mode. Seems bugged. I asked a GM for the item, but rerunning in normal is probably faster :P",
            date = "2018-05-06T07:09:52-05:00",
