            text = "A simple route if you've got hopelessly lost:- on the world map find the  road that runs north from Serpent's Heart to Tian Monastery. Take that road to 39.1, 30.1 where you will see a steep, dark path turning up and off to the east. You'll find the monastery at the top of  the track.",
