            text = "Xiao does not offer quests,and can not even be found until you talk to Lin Tenderpaw,complete quest The High Elder(Elder Cloudfall is upstairs)complete quest A Courteous Guest,and finally complete quest The Great Banquet. Then he is sitting at one of the banquet tables with 2 quests.",
