    [29623] = {
        {
            id = 1724728,
            score = 164,
            author = "banshee",
            text = "It's already mentioned, but as a reply to another post.  Do NOT react immediately to the visual cue.  Wait for the pupils to react and then do the move. If you go too quickly, you won't get credit.",
            date = "2012-09-29T15:03:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29623#comments:id=1724728",
        },
        {
            id = 1793725,
            score = 55,
            author = "809438",
            text = "Just completed this quest.  A few hints to help out:\n\nThe punch is easy to see, he is obviously throwing his fist out.\n\nKick got me a bit, because it look like he's butt slamming and jumping back up.  Could have been how I had the camera set up, but it was a bit confusing.\n\nThe Growl button should be used when the head of the instructor is thrown back.\n\nAlso as the others have stated please make sure you wait until the students start their actions before you hit your buttons.  If you try to be the \"Star pupil\" and do it first, you don't get credit.  No body wants to do these movements 12 times, let alone 20 if you don't watch your timing =)\n\nHappy questing",
            date = "2013-01-06T14:15:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29623#comments:id=1793725",
        },
        {
            id = 1653611,
            score = 22,
            author = "262772",
            text = "Once you accept the quest from Instructor Xann, go down the staircase into The Practice Pit. You will notice that your action bars have changed to three main abilities: Punch, Kick, and Growl.\n\nTo complete this quest, you need to follow what the Chun Tian Instructor does. Each ability has a different animation, and you have a fairly generous time frame to follow up with the correct move. Just complete this 12 times (it does not have to be in a row) and you will be done the quest.",
            date = "2012-04-14T01:38:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29623#comments:id=1653611",
        },
        {
            id = 2001416,
            score = 10,
            author = "Takata",
            text = "Yes, I've been wondering why i wasn't getting credit for performing the right move like when it was the punch. Because if you do it too early before the students do, you won't get credit. No special treatment! :) Even if you are a hero from Azeroth!",
            date = "2014-09-10T16:44:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29623#comments:id=2001416",
        },
        {
            id = 1790596,
            score = 8,
            author = "Astralon",
            text = "Is it me or there should be a gap in the formation for you to take place?\nI felt kind of an outsider there.\n\nOf course you could stand next to the instructor, to show the students how it's done...",
            date = "2013-01-01T09:42:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29623#comments:id=1790596",
        },
    },
    [29624] = {
        {
            id = 1653613,
            score = 88,
            author = "262772",
            text = "Once you accept the quest from Instructor Xann, run back into The Practice Pit. There are some neutral mobs called \"Training Bag\". These are the mobs that you need to kill for the quest.\n\nHowever, Instructor Xann will do emotes on screen with either \"LEFT!\" or \"RIGHT!\". When you see this, it is key that you are attacking the correct bag, as the other one will recieve a buff that allows it to absorb 99% of all incoming damage.\n\nEssentially, you just need to switch when Xann calls for it, and the bags will die eventually.\n\nEDIT: When I did this yesterday, the bags did need to be at full health. If you are not getting the quest complete text, start on a set of bags with 100% health.",
            date = "2012-04-14T01:45:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29624#comments:id=1653613",
        },
        {
            id = 1742175,
            score = 58,
            author = "Soliptic",
            text = "I signed up for an account here just to post this, because I think I see what the problem is.\n\nAfter doing this three times and not getting a quest complete indication, I read a post on the WoW forums that explains it.\n\n2/3rds of the punching bag models are placed BACKWARDS in the environment, meaning you'd have to hit those in the opposite order for it to work.  They have a front and a back to the model and it knows which bag you have to hit by the direction it's facing.\n\nMake sure you are using the bags where the yellow circle on the top of the front post is facing  you.  If you don't see the yellow circle, that model is placed backwards and it won't work.\n\nI'm sure this will be fixed at some point, but for now, that's the deal.",
            date = "2012-10-15T07:57:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29624#comments:id=1742175",
        },
        {
            id = 1713173,
            score = 55,
            author = "Zillions",
            text = "This quest is much easier than it looks.  In all likelihood you are here on Wowhead because the quest didn't complete for you.\n\nAs of the latest beta patch before release, there is a small \"bug\" with this quest where you must be extremely close to the bags when you kill them.  Additionally, killing the wrong target by accident (with leftover dots, or poor switching) will not give you credit.",
            date = "2012-09-13T14:21:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29624#comments:id=1713173",
        },
        {
            id = 1741772,
            score = 28,
            author = "Sparat",
            text = "Whichever dev coded this quest should be reassigned. It is a buggy annoying quest.",
            date = "2012-10-14T20:05:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29624#comments:id=1741772",
        },
        {
            id = 1746396,
            score = 16,
            author = "874940",
            text = "This! ...\n\nBy Soliptic (133 – 1) 5 days ago (Patch 5.0.5)\nI signed up for an account here just to post this, because I think I see what the problem is.\n\nAfter doing this three times and not getting a quest complete indication, I read a post on the WoW forums that explains it.\n\n2/3rds of the punching bag models are placed BACKWARDS in the environment, meaning you'd have to hit those in the opposite order for it to work. They have a front and a back to the model and it knows which bag you have to hit by the direction it's facing.\n\nMake sure you are using the bags where the yellow circle on the top of the front post is facing you. If you don't see the yellow circle, that model is placed backwards and it won't work.\n\nI'm sure this will be fixed at some point, but for now, that's the deal.\n\nI was there for ages before I saw your post here Soliptic - Thank You!",
            date = "2012-10-20T10:48:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29624#comments:id=1746396",
        },
    },
