    [29627] = {
        {
            id = 1767407,
            score = 21,
            author = "Sketchie",
            text = "If you attempt to take the Rattan Switch next to Yao the Collector (who is sitting), a brief scene will occur.\n\nYao the Collector yells: Hey... HEY! What are you doing?\nYao the Collector yells: You're stealing my inventory, aren't you?\nYao the Collector yells: Don't make me stand up!\nYao the Collector yells: I'll do it, I swear! I'm about to stand up!\nYao the Collector yells: Here I go!\nYao the Collector says: Oh, who am I kidding? You are a wily one, thief.\n\nYao says the above rather quickly, but he does not even attempt to stand up at all.\n\nIt was pretty amusing. :P",
