            text = "Be careful, mobs in the area will attack your cauldron, even the neutral tricksters.",
            date = "2012-09-25T19:15:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29628#comments:id=1719118",
        },
        {
            id = 1836420,
            score = 10,
            author = "875810",
            text = "First thought: Why is it following me?\n\nSecond thought: Will this become a companion pet?\n\nThird thought: Why do you smell sooo yummy? and why do the Tricksters attack you?\n\n(After running up a ways) Fourth thought: Why are you sooo slow?",
            date = "2013-03-29T19:49:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29628#comments:id=1836420",
        },
        {
            id = 2474311,
            score = 10,
            author = "Boxofbeer",
            text = "Travel to 37.8 17.6 spot and take https://www.wowhead.com/object=209551 near Mother Wu. You have to bring it back to Groundskeeper Wu by pulling behind you.\nYou also have to protect cauldron from mobs as it has health pool and can be killed (you have to start you travel again). You can mount while you pulling the cauldron, just keep distance.\nTomTom:\n/way The Jade Forest 37.8 17.6\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=29628 - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tjhkOcj9viU",
            date = "2017-02-25T11:53:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29628#comments:id=2474311",
        },
    },
