        {
            id = 1718815,
            score = 12,
            author = "Kemaria",
            text = "Once you start gathering the extract, you get a Blushleaf Residue buff that says \"Your hands are dyed red from blushleaf.  Perhaps permanently.\"  This lasted for a while after I turned in the quest.",
