            date = "2013-07-07T15:23:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29633#comments:id=1874564",
        },
        {
            id = 1653616,
            score = 6,
            author = "262772",
            text = "Once you accept the quest from Master Stone Fist, head straight from the quest giver and go through the archway. Zhi-Zhi is at the top of the hill directly past this archway, and is a friendly mob before you challenge him. He has 316K health, and will give up once he reaches zero health.\n\nAfter defeating Zhi-Zhi, return to Master Stone Fist to complete this quest.",
            date = "2012-04-14T01:58:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29633#comments:id=1653616",
        },
        {
            id = 1725160,
            score = 3,
            author = "795658",
            text = "To Master Stone Fist's right, you'll see a round archway opening in the wall.  Go through this round archway and just to your right you see a stone \"hill\" with a grass path that looks too steep to climb - it's not.  A very quick sprint up this grass path on the hill and Zhi-Zhi is there to your right.",
            date = "2012-09-29T20:45:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29633#comments:id=1725160",
        },
        {
