            text = "what wowhead doesn't tell you is that you have to complete all of Groundskeeper Wu's quests.",
            date = "2012-09-27T17:38:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29639#comments:id=1721915",
        },
        {
            id = 1723319,
            score = 18,
            author = "Jollygood",
            text = "Did all the quests and did not get the achievement. Oh well.\n\n--ETA\n\nI am leveling my second 'toon and patiently followed all the questlines (I was not in a hurry and it was rewarding to enjoy all the cinematics and the storyline) in Jade Forest, only missing one (I finished it later while looking for Golden Lotus) involving reducing the Sha NPCs near the Jade Serpent shrine.\n\nI did not get a reward for the quest, because mages don't get a reward. I also did not see the  banner on my screen for the achievement. I logged out and in again and the achievement was noted in my listing.",
            date = "2012-09-28T16:40:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29639#comments:id=1723319",
        },
        {
            id = 1734882,
            score = 14,
            author = "46669",
            text = "Anyone know if they're planning to change this? It's pretty terrible that half the classes get 17-37g, disenchanting mats, or, you know, a great weapon, and the other half get screwed.",
            date = "2012-10-07T19:12:20-05:00",
