        {
            id = 1584040,
            score = 36,
            author = "bookworm13",
            text = "Found just to the left of the elevator that goes up to the second floor after you kill Gatewatcher Gyro-Kill (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19218) and Gatewatcher Iron-Hand (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=19710).  See the screenshot for more detail.",
