            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29659#comments:id=1584040",
        },
        {
            id = 1806638,
            score = 19,
            author = "ariandra",
            text = "The item becomes unlocked after killing https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19218 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=19710. There's no need to do anything more. The elevator won't unlock until you've killed the two Gatewatchers anyway.",
            date = "2013-01-30T07:34:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29659#comments:id=1806638",
        },
        {
            id = 1608017,
            score = 18,
            author = "Dernar",
            text = "This quest used to require players to loot a key fragment from each of the gatekeepers. Because each boss only dropped a single key fragment, and not one for each player, players were usually required to trade the fragments to one another in order to complete the quest (and to advance any farther through the instance).\n\nTrading is impossible in cross-realm groups, which is likely why this quest was changed to require a kill of each Gatekeeper rather than the key itself.",
            date = "2012-01-07T08:13:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29659#comments:id=1608017",
        },
        {
            id = 2530393,
