            text = "This quest is automatic now, and to loot the item from the chest kill the guards on both sides on first floor.  Not just the side you started on.  It's a Big U Turn and then return back to the item and its loot able now. The big robot guys are what needs to be killed.\n\nTLDR kill everything on first floor... literally to unlock quest item loot cache.",
