            text = "Ok, I had this quest in my log and took a long break. I just came back to find I had the question mark, but no way to turn it in. This worked for me.\n\nGo to the bank in Org, Valley of Honor. Fly up over the bank, past the mountains and look for the ship. Get on it. Abandon the quest. General should immediately have the quest for you. The cinematic will begin, quest chain restarts. Boom!",
