    [29723] = {
        {
            id = 1721773,
            score = 7,
            author = "erpbridge",
            text = "The quest NPC can be triggered and moved along before you read her dialog. Talking directly to her is not a pre-requisite, you can complete quest if you just follow her pathing. She has about 60 second respawn time from the time she is killed until respawning in hut.\n\nDialog is as follows.\n---\nWell well, a young visitor.\n\nHave you come to pay your respects at the shrine of my husband? He was a hero you know. A master of Jade crafting and fighting. He was to be remembered forever they said.\n\nDo you like my statues? I craft them with special care saving only the best to provide my husband company and protection.\n---\n(Dialog option: Where is Shin?)\n(triggers spoken speech and pathing)\nI believe I heard some young whipper snapper in my garden out back. Let's go look for him.\n----\n(Widow Greenpaw exits house and walks around the right side of house. She stops at statue Shin, which is near center statue, Master Greenpaw.)\n\nAh, here is the boy. Doesn't he look special? My late husband and I always wanted children.\nYou should join our family, preserved forever in jade.\n(combat starts.)\n(partway through, summons a cat and says \"Here kitty kitty.)\n(Upon defeat, all the jade statues from front of house are turned back to normal, and appear in a circle around fight location.)\n\nAn Windfur:\nYay! Shin! You're alive!\nThank you so much (charactername)! If you find me in Dawn's Blossom later I'll give you one of the things we stashed from our adventures.",
            date = "2012-09-27T14:12:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29723#comments:id=1721773",
        },
        {
            id = 1726544,
            score = 6,
            author = "934716",
            text = "Socks, my boy!\n\nI wish there was a way of returning you to \"the Pickle\" (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=55282)!",
            date = "2012-09-30T20:37:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29723#comments:id=1726544",
        },
        {
            id = 1719674,
            score = 5,
            author = "Tenjen",
            text = "Rewards you with a rather familiar Jade Racoon :D",
            date = "2012-09-26T05:19:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29723#comments:id=1719674",
        },
        {
            id = 1656792,
            score = 4,
            author = "9646",
            text = "According to players who have completed this quest you just need to be around her when she is defeated to get credit.\n\nAs of this writing, in the beta she bugs out.  Works once after a restart/reset and then does nothing.  Sounds like the \"bunny\"* used to control this fight doesn't reset properly.\n\n*WoW links events, triggers, etc. to invisible critters, usually unkillable now*.  Normally called \"bunnies\".\n\n** Horde used to have fun causing chaos in Stormwind in early Vanilla by sneaking under Stormwind and killing all of Stormwind's \"bunnies\".",
            date = "2012-04-21T09:11:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29723#comments:id=1656792",
        },
        {
            id = 1883451,
            score = 3,
            author = "Filipse",
            text = "I actualy feel kinda sorry for her in the end she's only acting out this way due to that her husband died before they could have children.",
            date = "2013-08-03T00:46:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29723#comments:id=1883451",
        },
    },
