            text = "Very unclear quest. You'll have a hill in front of you. Go left around it, and across the water. Follow the path to your right, towards the south. There will be a fork in the road - right leads across a bridge and up over by the statue. That's the wrong direction.\n\nContinue on the left fork a little bit more until you see a couple tents on your left. Bear left across the grass, south (to the right) of a small hill. The Young Alliance Soldier will be there and you'll get a cut scene, indicating you're good.",
