        },
        {
            id = 1664155,
            score = 1,
            author = "873673",
            text = "This is 2 quests  Break the Cycle is too kill 8 Shan'ze Spiritbinders and Simulacrum is picked up from the Shattered Simulacrum which laying on the ground .Quest is too knock over 6 Vacant Simulacrums once both are completed an auto hand in will pop up giving you An Urgent Plea",
            date = "2012-05-08T05:49:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29747#comments:id=1664155",
        },
        {
            id = 1726815,
            score = 1,
            author = "Amria",
            text = "I either was too distracted to too stupid to notice, I got through the rest of the zone and this was the only thing I needed for the lore achv.  This quest is an automatic turn in, so if you open your quest log, there is an option to 'complete quest' on the bottom.   I just thought I'd put it out there incase anyone else got carried away.",
