            score = 22,
            author = "781678",
            text = "Krosh (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56833#comments:id=1720971) and Krosh's back (http://www.wowhead.com/item=83767) are references to the Wailing Caverns boss Kresh (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3653), who drops a shield Kresh's Back (http://www.wowhead.com/item=13245). The quest Guess Whose Back (guess who's back?) points out this connection.",
