            text = "The crate you are looking for is in the easternmost lake SW of Hellscream's Fist. On the map, it is the most NW island dot, and has a tree on it. Don't be fooled by the island with the huge tree in the middle of the lake. The one you want is past that.\n\nThe crate is on the western end of the small island, and is marked by smoking debris.",
