        {
            id = 1866746,
            score = 6,
            author = "1128732",
            text = "\"I think I punched him so hard his ancestors felt it.\"\n-Kang Bramblestaff, just after staring impassively at me during my fight with three Mogu.\n\nAbout 50% of fights, he'll just stand there.",
            date = "2013-06-15T00:30:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29874#comments:id=1866746",
        },
        {
            id = 5890485,
            score = 6,
            author = "tooltip",
            text = "Same problem exists in MoP Remix. I completed all the Krasarang Wilds story-lines on an Alliance alt, and eventually returned later since she still had this quest in her log.\n\nKang Bramblestaff was nowhere to be seen at the Sentinel Basecamp. I even tried The Incursion location which, unsurprisingly, did not have him appearing there either. So following Geordles' old comment, I flew to Stoneplow and talked to the flight master; no dice.\n\nI then abandoned this quest and went back to Pang's Stead in Valley of the Four Winds to pick it back up. However, as I suspected, there was no ! symbol in the area nor could https://www.wowhead.com/npc=56110 be found. For the heck of it, I tried Xiao's location at Paoquan Hollow (where you do the Hidden Master story), but as expected there was no interaction available.\n\nMy thoughts: If you have done the VotFW campaign \"out of order\", as it were, there is no point holding onto this quest. It cannot be completed nor picked back up once abandoned.",
            date = "2024-06-30T20:48:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29874#comments:id=5890485",
        },
        {
            id = 1725333,
            score = 5,
            author = "jasmer",
            text = "Okay I just wanted to clarify Kang Bramblestaff's location.  If you begin the Arcanic Oubliette quest and Kang is nowhere to be found, just turn in Arcanic Oubliette and he will spawn inside the camp right next to you.  You might not have to go all the way to Sentinel Basecamp.",
            date = "2012-09-30T00:26:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29874#comments:id=1725333",
        },
    },
