        {
            id = 1660351,
            score = 10,
            author = "639038",
            text = "This quest requires 2 things to be completed.\n\n1) Must kill 5 Engorged Crocolisks - Which will release the 5 Hozen\n2) Gather 5 Speckled  Trout - Which will be 5 little fish that you can right click to grab.\n\nNOTES:\n *They are both in Lake Kittitata\n*The fish are extremely small and you will not notice them at first, they are bigger than those school of fish but still quite small.\n*The fish will be grabbed not killed or looted, simply through the hand icon that will appear when you use your cursor.",
            date = "2012-04-29T12:01:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29879#comments:id=1660351",
        },
        {
            id = 1747314,
            score = 8,
            author = "1048259",
            text = "Hi while doing this quest (I'm not talking abut how to do this quest.) i recived a total of 305k FREE XP. All you have to do is get on the Island Called 'Circle Of The Scale'. (It's a small island that has rituals around it) Whe  you go up there you'll see something you can loot. Loot it. when you loot it, it will give you 305k XP. Then you can sell the item for 105 Gold. The item you pick up is called 'Pandaren Ritual Stone'.\n\nPlease vote this up if its helpfull and you want free XP.",
