            score = 7,
            author = "885261",
            text = "This quest is really annoying. So there you are, a great hero, but your people won't tell what the next step is if you don't go and get rations. And to add insult to injury your people are picky, too! Not just every bit of tortoise meat will do, oh no!",
            date = "2013-09-18T16:27:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29885#comments:id=1899885",
        },
        {
            id = 1657166,
            score = 6,
            author = "Catixie",
            text = "Pearly Tortoise are located in the water surrounding Pearlfin Village",
            date = "2012-04-22T04:30:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29885#comments:id=1657166",
        },
        {
            id = 1834216,
            score = 5,
            author = "royiouson",
            text = "58, 84 coords. SWish of Pearlfin Village. You're looking for \"pearly tortoise\" - and I suggest hitting \"v\" to show names, it helps.",
            date = "2013-03-25T14:34:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29885#comments:id=1834216",
        },
        {
            id = 3205859,
            score = 5,
            author = "Sparrows413",
            text = "Upon handing in this quest, the following scene takes place:\n\n[ The Skyfire slowly moves into place above Pearlfin Village. Several villagers begin to point up at it. ]\n\nPearlfin Villager says: Wh... what is that?\nPearlfin Villager says: Is... is it some sort of giant flying whale?\nPearlfin Villager says: It is so much larger than any of the Pandaren balloons... Does it belong to the outsiders?\n\n[ A gyrocopter descends from the Skyfire, and Rogers dismounts from it to stand with Admiral Taylor. ]\n\nSky Admiral Rogers says: Admiral! It's good to see that you are okay.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Thank you, Catherine. It's good that you're here: With full carrier support we can push north-\nSky Admiral Rogers says: I'm afraid you'll have to push forward without us.\nAdmiral Taylor says: What?\nSky Admiral Rogers says: I've been ordered back to the main battlegroup to provide carrier escort. The full might of the Alliance navy will arrive in two months' time.\nAdmiral Taylor says: What am I supposed to do until then? I've got no men! We don't know where the Horde are, or how many we're dealing with!\n[ Rogers laughs at Taylor.]\nSky Admiral Rogers says: Put on your big-boy pants, Taylor. I will leave the SI:7 officers with you. I suggest a scouting mission.\nSky Admiral Rogers says: Maybe you can recruit some of the locals. I'll leave the situation here in your capable hands.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Yes, Admiral.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Godspeed.\n\n[ Rogers returns to the Skyfire, which departs. ]\n\nAdmiral Taylor says: \"Improvise.\" Humph.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Nightwind! Take your men and scout the interior. Look for a Horde presence. And find Prince Anduin!\nRell Nightwind says: If there's any sign of Anduin, we'll find it.\nBold Karasshi says: Wait! Even though we are not friends, you should not go into unfamiliar territory alone.\nBold Karasshi says: I will send my brother to go with you.\nLittle Lu says: Hmm, you want... me?\nBold Karasshi says: Please bring him back safely. He is young, but clever. He can help you find your way.\nRell Nightwind says: I swear I will keep him safe. We will return as soon as we can.\n\nRell lowers his voice to a whisper.\nRell Nightwind whispers: Make friends with the jinyu. We may need them before this mission is over, and that's an order.\n\nLittle Lu says: Very well. Let us proceed.\n\n[ Rell, Sully, and Lu run off. ]",
            date = "2020-05-11T11:39:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29885#comments:id=3205859",
        },
    },
