            text = "Dropping it lets you pick it up again, but they still despawn if someone else picks it up before you complete.\n\nSome people have been trying to do it as a group instead, but noone has mentioned whether or not it worked, could be that they never manged to get the 10 seconds needed to complete without someone else picking up the quest though...",
