            author = "onlymeaz",
            text = "I have to comment on this because I found it hysterical.  The \"large virmen\" will attack you as soon as you attack though the way they attack is pretty funny  (SOME of the large virmen).  As soon as you hit them, they jump onto you and do the \"bunny hop\".  It's kind of...dirty in a way but very funny.  As a caster (lock), I can still target and take them out when they are on me so just enjoy the silliness of this quest.  :)",
