        {
            id = 1810774,
            score = 15,
            author = "Stalyn",
            text = "You must complete A Seemingly Endless Nuisance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29908), A Poor Grasp of the Basics (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29877), and Low Turnip Turnout (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29909) for this quest to appear from Ana.",
