        {
            id = 1654865,
            score = 15,
            author = "Cielos",
            text = "This quest is given by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=56205 in Thunderfoot Ranch.  You have to collect his three pigs who have strayed from the ranch, which are:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=56253 : Located down the hill from the ranch towards the path leading to the Kun-Lai Summit.  He is right near the kite master https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62658 , who is also stationed in the area.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=56254 : Located in the pond near the turtles you need to kill for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29913 . If you're having trouble seeing Ling, make sure your map says \"Grassy Cline\" and not \"Valley of the Four Winds\".  I had a phasing problem when trying to retrieve this pig.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=56255 : Located right down the path leading you to the field where you kill the Mushan Beasts for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29913.",
