            text = "Chen: We are the outsiders here, Li Li. We probably look even weirder to him!\nLi Li: Only because we're traveling with this ! (voiceover is \"outsider\")\nLi Li: Sorry , but you do kind of stand out.\n\nInevitably entertaining; A pandaren monk probably stands out the least, but doing this as, say, an undead death knight in giant, spikey plate armor astride a giant raven, is hilarious.",
