            text = "Athelena I don't agree with you.  Even though Setback's comment is very basic and obvious it is still helpful.  Tons of times when I am doing an escort quest I usually let the NPC walk at his own slow pace while I keep busy killing mobs until the NPC catches up to me.  So, because of Setback's comment, I will be sure I don't do that this time and avoid a headache.",
