    [29944] = {
        {
            id = 2856418,
            score = 28,
            author = "MercurioGraven",
            text = "For those who missed out on the punching bag, started playing in Legion and beyond, or who might have misplaced it somewhere, there isn't a lot of clarity on which quests  you must complete in order to reach this reward.\n\nIn order to reach the quest that rewards this, you must finish the Thunderfoot Fields criteria of the Rally the Valley (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6301/rally-the-valley) achievement. This is initiated by your first entrance into Valley of Four Winds, with This quest chain. (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29907/chen-and-li-li) Follow this first chain onwards until you reach the criteria (it's very linear). Once you reach Mudmug's home, the quests for both the punching bag and the turnip gun will become available.\n\nThe reason I'm providing this explanation is that it wasn't made very clear by many other sources. People just say \"do a bunch of quests,\" and that didn't help me very much, because I had certain alts that had parts of this zone completed, and others who didn't, before this item became a toy.",
            date = "2018-12-04T22:00:12-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944#comments:id=2856418",
        },
        {
            id = 2327535,
            score = 24,
            author = "reedwand",
            text = "I threw out the punching bag shortly after I looted it, I figured I needed the space in my bags more than I would ever \"use\" the item to warrant keeping it. Ofc now I am chasing up items such as these as this will be a toy in legion. Anyway! if you are anything like me, I had an alt that quite literally flew past most of the quests in the zone and had not yet completed Leaders Among Breeders (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944/leaders-among-breeders).\nYou can check this by using the following script in game: /script print(IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(29944))\nIf you receive a False reading it means you have not yet completed the quest. (True means you have completed this quest)\n\nWhat is difficult to track down however are the pre-req quests to gain access to this quest, so my best advice is to look for Li-Li in the various quest hubs but start off with Shang's Stead (a bit south west of ThunderFoot Fields)\nIf she is there then you can simply pick up Great Minds Drink Alike (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29919/great-minds-drink-alike) and then your next quest (once escorting Chen and Li-Li) will be exactly what you are after - Leaders Among Breeders (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944/leaders-among-breeders).\n\nSomething else that may be useful is to check for Chen here (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133/chen-stormstout). It is worth noting that should be far south, I would check if you have completed the quest as at this point I would say yes.\n\nI found her at Pang's Stead unfortunately, so I had to quest through the ranch and surrounding areas until she appeared at Shang's. Good luck ! :)",
            date = "2016-05-01T10:50:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944#comments:id=2327535",
        },
        {
            id = 1723485,
            score = 13,
            author = "1037558",
            text = "Confirmed all three of these guys are ABOVE ground.",
            date = "2012-09-28T19:23:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944#comments:id=1723485",
        },
        {
            id = 1852470,
            score = 10,
            author = "dlevine999",
            text = "Aiyu can be found around a big tree at 68.6 37.8\n\nJinany is at about 66.1 36.7\n\nFrenzyhop can be found on top of a big hill at  64.1 40.7",
            date = "2013-05-12T11:21:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944#comments:id=1852470",
        },
        {
            id = 2625436,
            score = 7,
            author = "Mapekz",
            text = "To be able to access this quest, you need to do the entire Pang's Stead + follow up quests (the last of which is https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29918), which then lead you to Shang's Stead for the escort quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29919.\n\nIn other words, you need to achieve Thunderfoot Fields in the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6301 achievement for Li Li and Chen to phase at Shang's Stead as well as offer quests for you to escort them to the next hub.\n\nAfter doing the escort quest, this quest is finally available. However, you can also pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945 at the same time for another easy toy.",
            date = "2018-10-22T20:25:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944#comments:id=2625436",
        },
    },
    [29945] = {
        {
            id = 1722035,
            score = 58,
            author = "Futeko",
            text = "I've just came back from killing bird couples to steal their eggs (quest=29988) so that a recluse monk could have fun throwing them at me \"for my training\", and now I'm tasked to slaughter deer families to harvest their blood so that a little girl can paint some turnips orange to trick and mock rabbity-mousey vermins.\n\nI'm a horrible person.",
            date = "2012-09-27T19:20:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945#comments:id=1722035",
        },
        {
            id = 1731800,
            score = 53,
            author = "591447",
            text = "I killed them. I killed them all. They're dead, every single one of them. And not just the men, but the women and the children, too. They're like animals...oh wait they were animals. I just slaughtered a whole bunch of deer. Not really feeling like the hero of the game right now.",
            date = "2012-10-05T00:54:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945#comments:id=1731800",
        },
        {
            id = 1665447,
            score = 49,
            author = "jojopojo64",
            text = "Marigolds spawn all over the Sunsoaked Meadow.\n\nVials of Animal Blood are easily gotten by killing the local Wolves, Mushan, and the Tawnyhide deer families wandering around (yes, that includes the Stag, Doe, and even their baby fawns).\n\nThe Tawnyhide deer by far spawn the most and are easiest to kill, but only a right, true bastard would slaughter an entire family of innocent deer for--\n\n*Beholds all the dead deer corpses in the meadow*\n\n...Oh.. God.",
            date = "2012-05-11T06:47:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945#comments:id=1665447",
        },
        {
            id = 1731188,
            score = 37,
            author = "1040135",
            text = "Li Li seems to have committed that age old blunder of confusing comedy with genocide.... oppsie-daisy!",
            date = "2012-10-04T12:05:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945#comments:id=1731188",
        },
        {
            id = 1725954,
            score = 14,
            author = "MarsJenkar",
            text = "I love the quest description.  \"This can only end in comedy.\"",
            date = "2012-09-30T10:59:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945#comments:id=1725954",
        },
    },
    [29946] = {
        {
            id = 1733714,
            score = 9,
            author = "Zuljid",
            text = "There's a nice symbiosis between these (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947) three (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948) quests (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946) (which you'll get together).\n\nUse the fake carrots (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76370) on the Twitchheel Hoarders (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56538) to make your way inside their burrow, thus completing Crouching Carrot, Hidden Turnip (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947).\n\nOnce inside, grab all the sacks of stolen hops (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76337) to complete Thieves to the Core (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948). If you're a stealther, avoid the stinky turnips (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66526), as they'll expose you. Twitchheel Sleepyheads (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66655) will not fight you if you avoid them, so watch out you don't step on them. If you aggro Hoarders (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56538), don't despair: throw at them another fake carrot (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76370) and wait for them to despawn (in the meantime they'll keep attacking you).\n\nMake your way into the deepest part of the burrow and fight Chufa (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56537). You'll be alone for a little while, and after she drops to 75% or so, Chen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56611) will appear to aid you. Finish her (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946) and make your way to the surface to complete your quests.",
            date = "2012-10-06T18:49:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946#comments:id=1733714",
        },
        {
            id = 1719705,
            score = 4,
            author = "JackLenY",
            text = "it's under land\nMine entrace 68.92, 40.18\nBoss place   67.96, 37.24",
            date = "2012-09-26T05:49:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946#comments:id=1719705",
        },
        {
            id = 1772996,
            score = 3,
            author = "Darneas",
            text = "There's a couple of entrances outside behind the building the questgivers are at. This will lead  underground where you will find the hops, can throw the fake carrots to not get mobbed, and find the den-mother. She's not that hard of a fight. She will spit fire in front of her but as long as you're behind her she won't shoot it at you. At least, she didn't at me. But, Chen will help you when she's almost defeated. Fairly easy fight.",
            date = "2012-12-01T10:34:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946#comments:id=1772996",
        },
        {
            id = 1823836,
            score = 3,
            author = "QuikandEZ",
            text = "There have been some issues with completing this quest lately (myself included) and I have found a solution. Just follow these simple steps.\n\n1. Find your WoW folder.\n2. Open the folder named \"Cache\"\n3. Open the folder named \"WDB\"\n4. Open the next folder.\n5. DELETE the file named \"creaturecache.wdb\"\n\nNow kill Chufa and the quest should be fixed. Deleting this file will not damage your game because this file remakes itself every time you open up WoW.\nYou also do not need to exit your game in order to delete this file and get the credit for the kill.\n\nFor those of you with issues on this quest, I hope this helped! Good luck and happy WoWing!",
            date = "2013-03-07T14:55:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946#comments:id=1823836",
        },
        {
            id = 1822389,
            score = 2,
            author = "1104342",
            text = "I killed her four times and still no credit.  I think it is bugged.",
            date = "2013-03-06T07:42:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946#comments:id=1822389",
        },
    },
    [29947] = {
        {
            id = 1667974,
            score = 106,
            author = "Latias714",
            text = "Seems legit.",
            date = "2012-05-17T22:43:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947#comments:id=1667974",
        },
        {
            id = 1666581,
            score = 46,
            author = "Jakome",
            text = "The things the virmen say when you toss the fake \"carrot\" in front of them are awesome.  Moreso when you realize how some of them sound EXACTLY like forum trolls.\n\nA few quotes:\n\n\"Seems legit.\"\n\n\"I love it.  I love this carrot.\"  (Incoming guild name: )\n\n\"Look, look!  Weird, bumpy carrot!\"\n\n\"Ahh, turnip!  Get out of here!\"\n\n\"No, we been tricked!\"\n\n\"I think we should eat it.\"\n\n\"Good things happen to us today.\"\n\n\"You no take carrot!  You take turnip instead!\"",
            date = "2012-05-13T18:30:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947#comments:id=1666581",
        },
        {
            id = 1736160,
            score = 29,
            author = "852822",
            text = "\"False carrot alert! False carrot alert!\" and \"I love it. I love this carrot.\" are the best quotes in the game. I stood around and threw carrots at these guys for at least an hour just for the lulz. These guys are definitely a mockery of stupid forum trolls. \"Seems legit\" is the best example.\n\nI love this particular virmen conversation too:\n\nVirmen 1: I just notice funny-looking carrot!\nVirmen 2: Let's eat it!\nVirmen 3: Seems legit!\n*carrot becomes turnip*\nVirmen 1: Who would do this!\nVirmen 2: Stay away! We know what it can do!\nVirmen 3: Ahhh, turnip! Get out of here!\n\nThey are literally terrified of turnips for some reason.",
            date = "2012-10-08T23:33:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947#comments:id=1736160",
        },
        {
            id = 1719097,
            score = 23,
            author = "ollebull",
            text = "\"Turnip was carrot! Run!\"\n\nI laughed out loud",
            date = "2012-09-25T18:51:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947#comments:id=1719097",
        },
        {
            id = 1720510,
            score = 22,
            author = "Itsversayce",
            text = "False carrot alert! False carrot alert!",
            date = "2012-09-26T16:38:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947#comments:id=1720510",
        },
    },
    [29948] = {
        {
            id = 1733710,
            score = 5,
            author = "Zuljid",
            text = "There's a nice symbiosis between these (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947) three (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948) quests (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946) (which you'll get together).\n\nUse the fake carrots (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76370) on the Twitchheel Hoarders (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56538) to make your way inside their burrow, thus completing Crouching Carrot, Hidden Turnip (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947).\n\nOnce inside, grab all the sacks of stolen hops (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76337) to complete Thieves to the Core (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948). If you're a stealther, avoid the stinky turnips (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66526), as they'll expose you. Twitchheel Sleepyheads (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=66655) will not fight you if you avoid them, so watch out you don't step on them. If you aggro Hoarders (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56538), don't despair: throw at them another fake carrot (http://www.wowhead.com/item=76370) and wait for them to despawn (in the meantime they'll keep attacking you).\n\nMake your way into the deepest part of the burrow and fight Chufa (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56537). You'll be alone for a little while, and after she drops to 75% or so, Chen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56611) will appear to aid you. Finish her (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946) and make your way to the surface to complete your quests.",
            date = "2012-10-06T18:42:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948#comments:id=1733710",
        },
        {
            id = 1733267,
            score = 3,
            author = "MrFix3",
            text = "Hops are in the cave/burrow.",
            date = "2012-10-06T10:28:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948#comments:id=1733267",
        },
        {
            id = 1784060,
            score = 3,
            author = "109019",
            text = "The pun of collecting bags of hops while killing rabbits is amazing.",
            date = "2012-12-19T10:44:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948#comments:id=1784060",
        },
        {
            id = 1839668,
            score = 1,
            author = "664402",
            text = "If you are unable to collect those just kill few rabbits and it should start working again.",
            date = "2013-04-06T06:46:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948#comments:id=1839668",
        },
    },
    [29949] = {
        {
            id = 1749775,
            score = 6,
            author = "averagehero",
            text = "\"No fat uncle tying me down!\"\n\n....",
            date = "2012-10-24T20:48:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29949#comments:id=1749775",
        },
        {
            id = 1828510,
            score = 4,
            author = "636960",
            text = "This quest is a part of a story-line and must have it's prerequisites completed before you can pick it up. The story-line quests are as followed. There is a possibility that they will not be grouped together like I have them shown below, but the primary thing is that all of the quests above Legacy must be completed before legacy becomes available.\n\nChen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133) starts the quest line with Great Minds Drink Alike (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29919)\nLi Li (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56138): Yellow and Red Make Orange (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29945) and  Chen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133): Leaders Among Breeders (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29944)\nLi Li (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56138): Crouching Carrot, Hidden Turnip (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29947), Chen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133): The Warren-Mother  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29946) and Mudmug (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56474): Thieves to the Core (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29948)\nChen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133): Legacy (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29949)\n[spoiler]\nAfter you complete Chen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133): Legacy, (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29949) the rest of the story-line becomes available (hopefully in the order shown below.)\n\nMudmug (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56474): Muddy Water (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29951) and Li Li (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56138): Li Li's Day Off (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29950)\nChen (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=56133): Broken Dreams (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=29952)\n\nOptional side quests at the Silken Fields:\nSilkmaster Tsai (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=57405): Where Silk Comes From (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30072)\nMaster Goh (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=57407): The Moth Rebellion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30059)\nMaster Goh (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=57407): Mothran! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30058)\n\nAlso, there are more quests following these with Chen in them but I didn't list them here. This listing is everything immediately surrounding \"Legacy\"\n[/spoiler]",
            date = "2013-03-14T10:39:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29949#comments:id=1828510",
        },
    },
