            text = "If you have problem with Evacuate the Marlfur family try the follow. its work for me.\n\nAfter Wei Blacksoil yells: Look out! Mantid! (you have to kill the add that you attacking you). After Wei Blacksoil Says: I've Recosidered....... (when it'says that i talk him again and i complete the quest)",
