        },
        {
            id = 1724576,
            score = 2,
            author = "735486",
            text = "I've killed 4 of those stupid bugs, then he says something about \"Ok I changed my mind, I'll evacuate, let me see those evacuation orders.\"  Then I don't get credit.  If I try to talk to him again another bug comes.  The dumb part is it worked fine in beta.",
