            text = "The eggs are located atop the hill in the Singing Marshes.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/object=209953 is tiny and purple, located near rocks.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/object=209954 is larger and white, located near overgrowth or brush.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/object=209955 is located in the small cave in the mountain.\n\nAs with any egg collecting quest, if there is a bird around when you collect its eggs, it will attack you.",
