        {
            id = 1827743,
            score = 4,
            author = "1037966",
            text = "This third part of the series does not begin automatically like the others.  Once you accept the quest you must talk to Master Bruised Paw again and select the option that says something along the lines of \"I have done all you have told me, I'm ready.\"  This will put you in the vehicle to break the stacks of stones.",
