            score = 3,
            author = "590544",
            text = "I never get into 'vehicle mode' for this one.  Am I totally missing something, or is it glitched?\n\nedit: I submitted a ticket, GM had me do the normal disable addons, delete cache etc. and it seemed to fix this issue.  Just wanted to post a follow up if someone else runs into the issue I had.",
            date = "2012-09-26T22:01:10-05:00",
