            author = "Techhead7890",
            text = "At the end of this quest, Loon Mai will announce you have a free ride into Krasarang (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=111803/free-ride) with the flight master (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=58843/dragonwing-dan) to the southeast. You can choose some different characters in the quest series to go to, such as Ken-Ken and Kang -- for a full list see yoshimario40's (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30376/hope-springs-eternal#comments:id=1921042) comment.",
            date = "2016-08-14T07:51:54-05:00",
