            author = "ArgentSun",
            text = "The four snakes - young wind serpents, really - are adorable. As you run/ride around, the ones you have found will occasionally emote cute stuff, such as:\n\nPlayful Crimson Serpent nips at you experimentally.\nPlayful Crimson Serpent licks you.\nPlayful Emerald Serpent wants to play a game!\nPlayful Emerald Serpent sniffs you.\nPlayful Emerald Serpent tries to eat your hair, and then spits it out. Yuck!\nPlayful Gold Serpent does a fancy flip.\n\n...and so on.",
