        {
            id = 1866735,
            score = 47,
            author = "falcko",
            text = "This quest gives you 550 [faction=1341] rep (with bonus) and, if you don't have rep with them from earlier, lets you choose them as your preferred faction to get rep from the dungeons\n\nI have made a little guide to get to this quest as i found it confusing to chase back to the start (for the horde(!)):\nto get to this chain you first have to complete the following:\nThe Grookin village quests up until https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29943 where you can accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30015\n\nThen you must complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31230 before you can get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29716 and after that https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29925 and all the quests from Mann until you get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29931  when that chain is over you finally get to the temple of the jade serpent where you have to do all the quests until you get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30000\n\nHope this helps, as I found it confusing to chase the quests back to the start, feel free to comment if there are any errors",
            date = "2013-06-15T00:05:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30000#comments:id=1866735",
        },
        {
            id = 1718414,
