        {
            id = 1672958,
            score = 10,
            author = "Zillions",
            text = "To complete the quest, you either need to interact with the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=57237 (which will cause you to JUMP on them, squashing them) or you can, in fact, DPS them down and get credit.  It may take several jumps to squash the bookworm completely.\nI personally found it to be much more simple and quick to click the worms.",
            date = "2012-06-03T04:35:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30002#comments:id=1672958",
        },
        {
            id = 1726351,
            score = 5,
            author = "Jollygood",
            text = "One could banter back and forth about using your mighty powers for Good and DPSing down the bookworms.  However, it is much funnier to use the golden hand cursor and watch your 'toon jump on them with a very satisfying squish, complete with a spray of gray goo. The smaller your 'toon (ie dwarf, gnome or goblin), the funnier it is. Bring your camera in nice and close and have a few laughs.\n\nClick the cogwheel, click the golden hand and , to quote River Tam, \"Squish!\"\n\n(ETA,Funnier still...my demented water elemental started firing on the dead worms. Silly boy.)",
