            score = 4,
            author = "Emsarrev",
            text = "Prepare to be annoyed by other people. You can attack hawks and sprites that are carrying bags of grain, and they will drop them on the floor. Since you get interrupted when they hit you, usually some other guy comes along and \"steals\" your quest item.\n\nI recommend you use an aoe stun for the sprites as they usually come in packs of 4-5 and loot the item while they are stunned or otherwise CC'd. The hawks are always alone unless you accidentally pull multiple so a single target stun / CC will likely suffice.",
            date = "2012-08-19T17:41:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30028#comments:id=1701874",
        },
        {
            id = 1726760,
            score = 3,
            author = "556068",
            text = "The grain despawns pretty quickly. I was attacking sprites and they'd drop the bag, and the grain would despawn before I finished fighting them.\n\nBest bet, especially for the sprites: get them to drop the grain, cc them away from the bag, get the bag, then finish fighting. Otherwise the silly bag may despawn or someone will grab it while you are fighting.",
            date = "2012-10-01T01:15:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30028#comments:id=1726760",
        },
        {
            id = 1740044,
            score = 2,
            author = "431013",
            text = "Anyone unable to loot them? I can right click to loot but no loot window comes up. I think it's bugged right now.\n\nEDIT: Disregard that, it only happened last night. Working now.",
            date = "2012-10-13T01:17:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30028#comments:id=1740044",
        },
    },
    [30029] = {
