            text = "It's funny that Chen as his show-off wants to brew stout. Stout is the style for beginners, the easiest to make, the hardest to screw up. If he'd really wanted to show what a great brewer he is, he should have brewed pilsner.",
            date = "2023-03-08T17:48:41-06:00",
