            text = "Don't be dumb like me and think the cave is in the side of one of the hills or mountains, it's actually in the ground, more like a burrow or den than a cave. I found one at coordinates 43.28,41.10, which is just to the right of the \"D\" in Heartland if you're looking at your map.",
            date = "2012-10-02T00:15:47-05:00",
