            date = "2013-05-08T13:41:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30057#comments:id=1851224",
        },
        {
            id = 1720482,
            score = 12,
            author = "selvin",
            text = "Hilariously, you can stealth all the way back to the questpoint, as the person your protecting won't aggro the mobs, making this a very easy quest.",
            date = "2012-09-26T16:18:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30057#comments:id=1720482",
        },
        {
            id = 1662751,
            score = 10,
            author = "wareZxv",
            text = "After you return Mina to Den Mudclaw, the quest tells you to talk to Haohan Mudclaw. I was rather confused and ran all around the heartland unable to find him.\n\nIf you look to the right of Den Mudclaw there is a scroll attached to a barrel next to the building, after clicking the scroll it will send you to Half-Hill Market to find him.\n\nHope this helps, Good luck!",
            date = "2012-05-04T19:48:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30057#comments:id=1662751",
        },
        {
            id = 1753451,
            score = 8,
            author = "64825",
            text = "It's weird to post this but these comments sound like you're playing another game or that you didn't do this quest until you were 90.  I go into the warren as stealthed kitty and start to walk her out and, either the little roaming vermin break the stealth or my kitty's stealth breaks itself.  There's so many of these damnable vermin around here it seems impossible to do anything without aggro'ing WAY too many to kill without dying.  I almost gave up on Taste Test.  So.....what's the damn deal with this?",
            date = "2012-10-29T21:26:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30057#comments:id=1753451",
        },
    },
    [30058] = {
        {
