        {
            id = 3178089,
            score = 8,
            author = "Fluffmeister",
            text = "When Mothallus ascends, you're supposed to free the fighters from their cocoons to assist, but the cocoons seem to be immune to everything, so I can't see how to do that. If you can't figure it out either, just wait for Mothallus to come down again, and finish him/her off.",
