            score = 18,
            author = "Xabidar",
            text = "The dialog of Chen, Li Li, and Mudmug is different, depending on the order you accept these three quests:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30075 from Chen\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077 from Li Li\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30076 from Mudmug\n\nThere is a lot of overlap when a character is picked first or third; most of the unique lines are when a character is picked second.\nAfter completing these three quests, this also affects the order of the bosses you fight in the next quest in the chain, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078\n\nIf you pick Chen first, Li Li second, Mudmug third:\n\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout yells: Mudmug, Li Li... follow me!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: Hey, you dumb old uncle! You left me behind!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_04.OGG\")\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: Where'd those other two go? Did they leave me behind? Don't nobody care about Mudmug?\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")\n\nChen first, Mudmug second, Li Li third:\n\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout yells: Mudmug, Li Li... follow me!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Li Li?\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_04.OGG\")\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: Hey, you old jerks! You left me behind!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")\n\nMudmug first, Chen second, Li Li third:\n\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: I reckon I'll see you over there.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout says: I'd better catch up (with) Mudmug.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_05.OGG\")\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: Hey, you old jerks! You left me behind!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")\n\nMugmug first, Li Li second, Chen third:\n\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: I reckon I'll see you over there.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: See you there, Uncle Chen!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_05.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout yells: Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")\n\nLi Li first, Chen second, Mudmug third:\n\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: Uncle Chen, Mudmug! Race you there!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout yells: Li Li, wait up!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_04.OGG\")\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: Where'd those other two go? Did they leave me behind? Don't nobody care about Mudmug?\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")\n\nLi Li first, Mudmug second, Chen third:\n\nLi Li says: I'm going ahead to see if there's anything I can do to help.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nLi Li yells: Uncle Chen, Mudmug! Race you there!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/LiLiStormstout/VO_LI_LI_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_02.OGG\")\nMudmug says: The brewery's got a second entrance, over yonder.\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nMudmug says: I suppose I'll be off then. You a-comin', Chen?\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/Mudmug/VO_MUDMUG_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_05.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout says: See you on the other side, .\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_01.OGG\")\nChen Stormstout yells: Li Li, Mudmug, wait up!\n/script PlaySoundFile(\"Sound/creature/ChenStormstout/VO_CHEN_EVENT_BONKERS_BREWERY_03.OGG\")",
            date = "2013-06-03T05:29:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077#comments:id=1862149",
        },
        {
            id = 1726695,
            score = 10,
            author = "MarsJenkar",
            text = "If you yourself are caught in a barrel, you can put your own \"ridiculous muscles\" to use and break out (there should be a button that pops up to allow you to do it; if it doesn't, you might check your action bar mods).  Just...don't do it when Ook-Ook is close by; otherwise he'll just chuck another barrel on you.  Since these barrels also do damage (about 20k to a mage in my experience), it's unwise to tempt Ook-Ook more than necessary.\n\nIn other news, one thing the barrel \"prisoners\" might say is \"Ach!  The light... It hurts our eyes....\" ...which sounds like a Lord of the Rings reference to me.",
            date = "2012-10-01T00:07:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077#comments:id=1726695",
        },
        {
            id = 1731744,
            score = 7,
            author = "1040332",
            text = "Ook-Ook is basically harmless, so don't bother being afraid him or letting him slow your quests down because you're trying not to get close. he won't attack. if you attack him or if he comes near you, he will just turn you into a beer keg and continue on his merry way, and you just click the button to free yourself. also, if you you look up, Hoptallus can be seen hopping around the outer parts of the brewery.",
            date = "2012-10-04T23:31:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077#comments:id=1731744",
        },
        {
            id = 1772591,
            score = 7,
            author = "mecitceylan",
            text = "Ook-ook does not mind your presence as long as your feet do not touch the ground. Levitated the entire quest with my priest, he ran right past me many times without tossing a barrel.",
            date = "2012-11-30T22:06:45-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077#comments:id=1772591",
        },
        {
            id = 1726009,
            score = 3,
            author = "Valentino",
            text = "Two of the lines spoken by the Barreled Pandaren, 'It's dark in here.' and 'Anybody out there?' were also lines spoken by Covetous Shen in Diablo 3 when you first met him trapped in a barrel.",
            date = "2012-09-30T11:52:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077#comments:id=1726009",
        },
    },
    [30078] = {
        {
            id = 1721889,
            score = 35,
            author = "aabeba",
            text = "Careful with this quest - if you accept and complete a random dungeon queue inside the brewery, you'll be stuck once you're done. I was forced to use my hearthstone.",
            date = "2012-09-27T16:49:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078#comments:id=1721889",
        },
        {
            id = 1679017,
            score = 29,
            author = "708606",
            text = "Just talk with quest giver and he will port u inside\nAfter u kill 1st guy loot empty keg in the same room and u will get ported again.\nClear next room to summon Fuzzy. He got like ton of health but weak dmg.\nNext and last is Eddy. After some time he will cast a big bubble on him. And he will get some stacks. To brake bubble u need to step on small bubbles on the ground. After he lose all stacks just right click on him and he will lose bubble and u can dps him again.",
            date = "2012-06-21T05:39:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078#comments:id=1679017",
        },
        {
            id = 1722386,
            score = 17,
            author = "Xabidar",
            text = "From what I can tell, the order of the mobs that you kill here depends on the order that you accepted each of the earlier following quests :\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30075 from Chen\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30077 from Li Li\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30076 from Mudmug\n\nAlso of note, the flavor text you get from the friendly NPCs during the fights will also be different, as well.\n\nWhen speaking to Chen before fighting the Fizzy Yellow Alemental, he says:\nWhat is going on inside this brewery! Has nobody maintained this place? Where are the brewers?\n\nWhere is my family...?\n\nThey must have gone somewhere. If they were here, then they'd be cleaning up this mess! For now, looks like it's up to you and me, . You ready?\n\n==> Let's do this, Chen\n\nWhen speaking to Mudmug before fighting Eddy, he says:\nYou ready to do this? I'm ready to do this. I'm fixin' to make a puddle out of that critter.\n\nIts just... well, I ain't much of a bruiser, and I get skeered real easy. You're the  here. You gonna... you gonna protect me, right?\n\n==> Calm down, Mudmug. Let's go.\n\nWhen speaking to Li Li before fighting Jooga, she says:\nThis guy's a little bigger than I thought he'd be.\n\nYou think its from drinking beer? I know too much beer makes you fat, like Uncle Chen, but I didn't think it'd make you any taller.\n\nEither way, I don't think I can take this guy on alone.\n\n==> I'll help.",
            date = "2012-09-28T01:07:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078#comments:id=1722386",
        },
        {
            id = 1768433,
            score = 13,
            author = "Sketchie",
            text = "You will need to fight 3 \"bosses\" during this quest: Eddy, Jooga and Fizzy Yellow Alemental. Mudmug, Li Li and Chen Stormstout will assist you, however.\n\nVS Eddy\nMudmug will assist you here. He will mainly tank Eddy, but be mindful that you will occasionally get smacked into the face with a weak water bolt or be launched up into the air via a geyser - but it is easily avoidable since there's an obvious mark under you that you need to get off of.\n\nEddy has a lot of health, but there's a way to whittle down huge chunks of it. When Eddy does his Bubble Shield move, he is impervious to all damage and you will need to stomp out a certain number of bubbles on the floor. Mudmug will assist you with it as well. Once all 80 bubbles are stomped, go burst Eddy's Bubble Shield to cause massive damage to him. You are likely going to have to burst his Bubble Shield 3 or 4 times.\n\nVS Jooga\nLi Li will assist you against Jooga, but she will not actually do much other than run away from Jooga while he is chasing her. While he is chasing her, he will have a 100% dodge chance which makes it impossible for you to hurt him.\n\nYou will need to click on the barrels in the room to throw one onto Jooga's head to temporarily stun him and remove his 100% dodge buff. Once he gets the barrel off his head, he will then start wailing on you while scattering bananas around the room for a while, and then start chasing after Li Li with the 100% dodge buff.\n\nJust rise and repeat.\n\nThe bananas will knock you off your feet for a few seconds, so try to avoid those as you're chasing Jooga around the room.\n\nVS Fizzy Yellow Alemental\nChen Stormstout will assist you. You will need to get rid of all the Fizzy Yellow Spirits in the room. They have very low health and will go down easily. Chen Stormstout will randomly bounce around the room killing them one by one. Given enough time, he will probably kill them all, but it's a good idea to assist him anyway to speed up.\n\nA Fizzy Yellow Alemental will show up after you have defeated all Fizzy Yellow Spirits. He will use Water Bolt, Wave Crash, Noxious Fumes, Frigid Chill and an AOE pushback. Wave Crash knocks you back, but he seems to only use it on Chen Stormstout, since he's tanking him. Noxious Fumes causes you to take 100 damage every second, and it can stack (although only up to 2 from what I've seen). Frigid Chill makes you take 50% more damage from frost element spells, which I believe applies to Water Bolt and Wave Crash.\n\nHe's just a simple tank and spank fight overall.\n\nEnjoy your blue helmet!",
            date = "2012-11-26T23:33:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078#comments:id=1768433",
        },
        {
            id = 1822179,
            score = 5,
            author = "Amaristella",
            text = "Like other commenters I was having trouble getting the Fizzy Yellow Alemental slain portion of this quest to complete. I tried the standard logging out and back in, then dropping and reacquiring the quest. I made sure to talk to the NPCs before every encounter. It may have just been a coincidence, but the time that I actually got a completion there were two other random people doing the quest along with me.",
            date = "2013-03-06T02:37:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30078#comments:id=1822179",
        },
    },
