        {
            id = 1721025,
            score = 3,
            author = "Sindail",
            text = "For Horde Hunters trying for Sleeping Guardian (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=58419) tame, you have to complete...\n\n  Search Party (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30121)\nPoisoned (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30179)\n Blind Them (H) (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30124) There is also an Alliance version of this quest.\n Skitter Stew (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30123) @ loc 60, 25 (wowhead map showing wrong location atm)\n\nTHEN you can start this chain beginning with Threat from Dojan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30127)\nHope this helps.\n\nAnd for the nit pickers out there, yes there is more to this chain. This post is specifically for hunters looking for more information on how to get the tame.",
