            author = "821994",
            text = "Golden Carp are always plentiful and cheap on the AH.  Buy 60 on an alt and put them in 6 stacks of 10 along with the  6 stacks of 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=82829 that you bought for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30148 in a single mail.\n\nOh, and fish schools of valuable fish (and a 100% drop rate) when you're fishing for https://www.wowhead.com/item=79046 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30146.\n\nPS - If you don't have Argent Squire/Gruntling mail . . . there's a box in Sri La.",
