        {
            id = 1724268,
            score = 23,
            author = "766485",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58363 spawn under the honeycombs around the Arboretum - They come in groups of 3-5 on average (but can have up to 9 in one group) and have around 118k HP each\nThey are non elite and pretty easy aoe-able",
            date = "2012-09-29T08:55:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30150#comments:id=1724268",
        },
        {
            id = 1793076,
            score = 11,
            author = "1068066",
            text = "Yep, has my vote for worst quest in the game.  Kill and entire swarm (which you can't ambush as a rogue) and only get one honeycomb.  Questions my reason for living.\n\nWas it the quest designer's goal to make us hate this game?  There's no mount in the entire game I want bad enough to suffer this aggravation.",
