            text = "I had 29/30 honey combs (naturally) and my next kill dropped 5 of them (of course). When I looted, I ended up with 31 honey combs for some reason. I deleted the one (stupidly ignoring the \"will drop this quest\" message) and lo! I had to do it over.\n\nObviously the looting bugged, but don't be dumb like me and drop the quest by deleting extra honey combs.",
