            text = "Found a real nice video  (http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5avgfQ2PJ98) and got the two achievements in a row ; https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7291 and https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7290\n\nJust look for Mists of Pandaria Sky Race: How To Win It and you will more than likely find it",
            date = "2012-10-08T14:18:40-05:00",
