            text = "I don't know if anyone's reported this or not, usually not a problem with me as I don't normally get separated from Mudmug. However, this time I did and came here to find out where the big banana was. I noticed the map on this page has the wrong location for the turn in, Chen is now at the Halfhill Market and not where we first find him when we first enter Valley of the Four Winds. In fact, he's right out front of the Lazy Turnip inn, location /way 55.89, 49.52.\n\nThe map on this page shows him at 86, 22.\n\nSo, if you lose him the big banana is located at /way 54.23, 38.88 right where you pick him up for this quest.",
