            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59151, when clicked on during https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30178:\nThe courier must have died of his wounds after what looks to have been a brutal struggle.\nUhm... yeah, I'll say... considering he's INSIDE a tiger.\nHe looks like he was literally fused to a tiger's neck and abdomen, on its right side.\nI would agree that is indeed \"brutal\".",
