        {
            id = 1725518,
            score = 1,
            author = "1038206",
            text = "Joined so I could \"mark helpful\" the above comment from hostinginbg, but cant cause im not rated, so posting.\n\nInto the wilds slightly buggy, had to pick up the quest twice.  Fist time clicked on the dead courier, finished quest - nothing happened.  Seemed to get a second quest with the same name back at Zhu's Watch.",
            date = "2012-09-30T04:10:19-05:00",
