        {
            id = 5965112,
            score = 1,
            author = "Grabos",
            text = "The NPC is not there if u do the Quest",
            date = "2024-09-21T16:36:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30178#comments:id=5965112",
        },
        {
            id = 6438820,
            score = 1,
            author = "Hearthwood",
            text = "This quest line can, according to Blizzard Support Article (https://eu.support.blizzard.com/en/help/article/12086), be skipped, as it is just a breadcrumb quest - but that is FALSE.\n\nThis quest line can currently not be continued, for without the breadcrumb quest, none of the NPCs are quest NPCs, all are just 'Crane Wing Disciple'.\n\nNone of the quests following after having to find the patrol, will appear, in fact, you will be missing NPCs in the camp for some quests too.\n\nEdit: I will leave the comment in for others, in case that they do the same, or experience the same. I did not notice that the same quest, so path had two different flags, and not just a universal, but an Alliance, and a Horde flag. I have completed everything as Horde, but faction changed to Alliance. This will be one of those quests that will keep lingering on the map, it seems, as it is rooted into the primary faction completion, and not just something you can do because it is there.",
            date = "2026-09-30T16:21:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30178#comments:id=6438820",
        },
    },
