            date = "2012-05-09T09:32:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30186#comments:id=1664672",
        },
        {
            id = 1729221,
            score = 22,
            author = "Mzbehavin",
            text = "Ok,  Hemit Nesingwary does a quick dance and then jumps off the edge into the pond below down into the depths (where the turtles are).\nSwim down after him and there is a shark mouth shaped cave on the right, swim into that and you will find Hemit there with junior, talk to him and he will then summon Torans Bane, kill him, quest complete, get the next part of quest and then head back to the camp.\n\nThis completes the chain and also the achievement for Nesingwary's Safari under 'Rally the Valley'.",
            date = "2012-10-02T21:48:55-05:00",
