            author = "545034",
            text = "Anyone having problems with this quest and the one to kill the sprites? I've been wandering around the town for an hour now, and only been able to get some Mistfall Water Buckets... haven't seen a single mob in the town and neither a fire.... only normal decorative braziers, which i tried to put out, but it doesn't seem to be those, any help pls?",
            date = "2012-09-30T09:22:39-05:00",
