            text = "the fires you click are the rings of fire around the pots of fire. where the sprites run from...and tip for the add, aggro and run away to grab more..the fire will kill them if you wait until they catch fire",
            date = "2012-10-16T02:18:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30192#comments:id=1743001",
        },
        {
            id = 1751629,
            score = 1,
            author = "anubalabeloralon",
            text = "Seems can be \"stomp\" on mounts\n\nI really wish you guys would stop throwing the buckets at the fire too; just the water would have been fine.\n\nAlthough you are not really throwing buckets in this quest, but oh well... [achievement=289 domain=www]",
            date = "2012-10-27T08:55:36-05:00",
