        },
    },
    [30193] = {
        {
            id = 1821442,
            score = 5,
            author = "Vynillin",
            text = "Did the drop rate on Fairlands Gazelle Meat (http://www.wowhead.com/item=79244) drop in 5.2? Pre-5.2, I used to get at least one per group, and now I'm getting about one per every 3-4 groups.\n\nEdit--\n\nI'd like to add that as of this edit, I'm still at 4/10 on the quest requirement and I have 51 Shattered Bone Fragment (http://www.wowhead.com/item=83157)s. Sad face :(\n\nEditx2--\n\nFinal Shattered Bone Fragment (http://www.wowhead.com/item=83157) (at 10/10 Fairlands Gazelle Meat (http://www.wowhead.com/item=79244)) was 74. Maybe it was just incredibly bad luck.\n\nEditx3--\n\nPossibly fixed: A thanks to lankybrit (http://www.wowhead.com/user=lankybrit) on the forums (http://www.wowhead.com/forums&topic=211190&p=3388606): it looks like this issue was fixed with the restart this morning. Source (http://us.battle.net/wow/en/forum/topic/8155915635).",
            date = "2013-03-05T17:10:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30193#comments:id=1821442",
        },
        {
            id = 1780280,
            score = 1,
            author = "Smallfoot",
            text = "The drop rate on the Fairlands Gazelle Meat (http://www.wowhead.com/item=79244) isn't abyssmal, but low enough to make you wonder.  With the number of heroes out there hunting the tasty gazelle, is it any wonder the Thundermaw are turning to local yaks (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30194)?\n\nWe may be witnessing the dark side to the jolly Pandaren;  their voracious appetite brings ecosystemic collapse.",
            date = "2012-12-12T17:21:32-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30193#comments:id=1780280",
        },
    },
    [30194] = {
        {
            id = 1806748,
            score = 2,
            author = "steppman2",
            text = "At first glance as a blood DK I thought these guys were just doing an incredible amount of damage but upon further inspection I determined that about 70-75% of their damage is from a skill called Thunder - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=128999 which does exclusively nature damage which circumvents a lot of mitigation and/or absorption effects that most tanks have. The following things will help for most tanks:\n\nEffulgent Primal Diamond - https://www.wowhead.com/item=76897\nAnti-Magic Shell - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=48707\nRune of Spellshattering - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=53342\nIcebound Fortitude - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=48792\nBarkskin - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=22812\nDivine Shield/Protection - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=642/https://www.wowhead.com/spell=498\nDevotion Aura - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=31821\nShield Wall - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=871\nDemoralizing Banner - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=114203\nTouch of Karma - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=122470\nFortifying Brew - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=115203\nZen Meditation - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=115176\n\nThis is in no way meant to be a comprehensive list but I wanted to try and save some people time having to look up useful stuff like I had to do with my Monk (Still know nothing about the class). Feel free to comment with additional things that work.\n\nEdit: Also, for those who don't know...if the packs running around where the other related quests are turn out to be too tough for you just head south to just west of the point where the river hits the edge of the map and you'll find them in easier to manage groups.",
            date = "2013-01-30T13:06:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30194#comments:id=1806748",
        },
        {
            id = 1773270,
            score = 1,
            author = "1060553",
            text = "You can find single Thundermaw Wolves along the banks of Whitepetal Lake.  You can also find them around Sunblossom Hill, 24.5, 76.6",
            date = "2012-12-01T17:47:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30194#comments:id=1773270",
        },
        {
            id = 1767396,
            score = -1,
            author = "984199",
            text = "Any tips on how to break up the packs to complete this quest without blowing every cooldown I have?  Little ridiculous to have 6 of these OP'd beasts on a daily quest, so I hope I'm missing something easy.",
            date = "2012-11-24T22:47:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30194#comments:id=1767396",
        },
        {
            id = 1821901,
            score = -1,
            author = "CaptCrook",
            text = "The trick to this quest is to work off the singles over by the lake",
            date = "2013-03-05T22:32:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30194#comments:id=1821901",
        },
    },
    [30195] = {
        {
            id = 1894757,
            score = 1,
            author = "Hegs",
            text = "I started seeing these on my map (Herbalist - https://www.wowhead.com/spell=2383) as of patch 5.4. My reputation with the Golden Lotus is Honored. I am unable to see the quest at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58820 though.",
            date = "2013-09-10T18:22:52-05:00",
