            text = "Most of these mobs seem to be bugged, they are evading every bucket I throw at them.\nSome of the groups of mobs are working though, so keep trying if you get stuck on it.\n\nEdit: I noticed that the ones running around aimlessly were all evading, but the few that were standing still in groups were all hit with no problem. Working as intended? /shrug",
            date = "2012-10-14T08:20:32-05:00",
