            text = "Quest is bugged and the Scouts will not speak to you.\n\nEdit:  This has been hotfixed.  The scouts were not refusing to speak to you, what they were actually doing was failing to despawn, so the scouts you attempted to talk to were already tapped.",
            date = "2012-10-05T20:22:23-05:00",
