        },
        {
            id = 1809591,
            score = 1,
            author = "Saikusu",
            text = "I have to say.. this Ren Firetongue is rather... flamey, shall I say? ||D;; But still, this quest is super simple to do, so long as you time yourself whilst either fighting underwater, or decide to use ranged attacks from swimming at the surface to breathe.\n\nMy method of doing this is a combination of both, if there aren't any schools of the nasty fish close enough for a Retribution Paladin to deal ranged damage. For those that yearn to get it done fast, and have plenty of high scoring DPS, you may want to try out the Dark Water Potion. It turns you into a Jinyu Assassin for 20 seconds(I think), and allows underwater breathing, and increased swim speed as well, so you can take out any number of fish with this.... or simply just swim around to gain aggro from the ones too low to reach normally!\n\nAnd I must say once more... no matter which gender you are, Ren Firetongue is certain to \"flirt\" with you a fair bit, so don't be put off if you think it's only your class's gender. :P",
            date = "2013-02-05T15:30:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30284#comments:id=1809591",
        },
    },
    [30285] = {
        {
            id = 1721818,
            score = 43,
            author = "Prales",
            text = "In addition to having a low chance to drop from the Mogu in the area, you can also find the reports laying around on the ground and on tables. Don't make the mistake I did and kill tons and tons of Mogu, it will take you forever!",
