            score = 9,
            author = "MarsJenkar",
            text = "IMO, this and the Freeing Mind and Body daily quests are badly designed.  It's very difficult to spot the \"free\" scrolls, and everyone else is out to get them.\n\nGenerally, I use the generic \"kill X mobs\" quest as a yardstick to compare quests.  If I'm trying to finish that quest after all the others, and I end up finishing it before the quests I'm trying to finish first, I consider there to be something wrong.  And that happened both times I tried.",
