        {
            id = 1725670,
            score = 8,
            author = "268441",
            text = "Fire appears when Shao-Tien Pillagers live long enough to throw a molotov cocktail on the roofs. If you're doing this on a high-pop server, then God be with you.\n\nI suggest telling the players not to kill them when you're the same action and /slap them when they're from the opposing side.\nI also suggest nominating this for the worst designed quest in WoW.",
            date = "2012-09-30T06:36:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30288#comments:id=1725670",
        },
        {
            id = 1744215,
            score = 5,
            author = "791176",
            text = "Might be worth mentioning even on my high pop server, I was able to find tons of buckets at the well at 37, 73. Hope this helps you guys at least stock up on buckets when you fight for tagging the fires :)",
            date = "2012-10-17T16:44:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30288#comments:id=1744215",
        },
        {
            id = 1809091,
            score = 4,
            author = "Malvenue",
            text = "There's a well NE of the main town behind a house up on the hill. It has 7-8 buckets spawning around it constantly, more than enough to complete the quest.",
            date = "2013-02-04T13:31:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30288#comments:id=1809091",
        },
        {
            id = 1868200,
            score = 4,
            author = "1117679",
            text = "I found the easiest and fastest way to complete this quest is to fly on top of the roofs (the wooden bar on top) and from there you can see the whole rooftop and quickly douse the entire roof in one swoop. The well is the most plentiful source of water buckets.",
            date = "2013-06-19T09:42:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30288#comments:id=1868200",
        },
        {
            id = 1871706,
            score = 3,
            author = "cmacord",
            text = "This may have been obvious to everyone but me, but you can pick up more than bucket of water at a time. After picking up a bucket, running and finding a fire, dumping the bucket on the fire and then going and finding another bucket and repeating the maddening cycle, it occurred to me to try to pick up more than one, and it worked ! I don't know the max you can hold - I picked up 7 and that was enough for me to complete the quest.\n\nAlso, the poster below was correct when he suggested landing on the flat center board on one of the roofs and dumping your water from there. This \"aggro free\" method is far superior to dodging all the nasty mobs below while toting your bucket around. I up-voted him and you should too :)",
            date = "2013-06-28T20:32:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30288#comments:id=1871706",
        },
    },
    [30289] = {
        {
