            author = "Zyland",
            text = "Dispellers listen up! Even you hunters! (lol tranq shot)\n\nYou are able to dispel the mind control buff on the target! I can confirm that you can dispel the target for instant release of mind control.\n\nYou can even dispel them from a range and not even aggro the Subjagator.",
