            text = "The quote in the quest text from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58471 about \"I'm not sure they really thought this thing through fully\" may be a reference to two quotes from the movie \"Meet The Robinsons\":\n\nFrankie: Well, it's just that there's a million people over there, and I have little arms. I'm just not so sure how well this plan was thought through.\n\nT-Rex: I have a big head and little arms. I'm just not sure how well this plan was thought through.",
