            text = "Stand in the exact middle of the training area at coordinates 19,74.\nWait a second for a Shado-Pan Trainee to automatically start combat.\nWait every couple seconds for another Shado-Pan Trainee to fight.",
            date = "2012-11-17T01:18:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30306#comments:id=1763574",
        },
    },
    [30307] = {
        {
            id = 1769133,
            score = 10,
            author = "Gardakan18",
            text = "As of today (patch 5.1), the quest requires to kill only 8 Shao-Tien mogu, down from 12.",
            date = "2012-11-27T19:09:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30307#comments:id=1769133",
        },
        {
            id = 1767097,
            score = 1,
            author = "Lintian",
            text = "This quest is guaranteed to be offered in the daily batch of four Golden Stair quests (the other three quests are selected randomly).\n\nIt is usually best to do this one last, as some of the other quests offered (rescuing torture victims or stopping the Shao-Tien Behemoth ritual) also involve killing mogu, which counts towards this quest, and you might also pull some by accident while doing the others.",
            date = "2012-11-24T06:21:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30307#comments:id=1767097",
        },
        {
            id = 1880727,
            score = 1,
            author = "cajundiva79",
            text = "Not sure if anyone else has to do pretty hot dance moves to stay alive in this quest...But I have found that for my Level 90 shaman who is in great need of new gear...If you climb on the rock behind the tree you can easily heat both mogul, and then just sit and wait till they respawn to get your 8. The two in the corner seem to respawn pretty fast.",
            date = "2013-07-25T17:48:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30307#comments:id=1880727",
        },
    },
    [30308] = {
        {
            id = 1753438,
            score = 1,
            author = "1048602",
            text = "Can't tel why, but the quilen are not targetable. The first time i try that quest every thing was fine then at 6/8 kill, they stop spawning. I abandon and try again, but nothing. Any tips!",
            date = "2012-10-29T20:58:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30308#comments:id=1753438",
        },
        {
            id = 1753674,
            score = 1,
            author = "1042297",
            text = "This quest is half-bugged, because of the cross-server mechanic.\n\nI was having a problem when I was doing my Golden Lotus dailies with a friend off of my Real ID (he was on Stormrage, I'm on Khaz'Goroth) All of the quests from the first hub went smooth, but I wasn't able to target the Quilen.\n\nI realized quickly, it was because I was in a group with him and I got transported to his server, so it sort of glitched out, because his server didn't have that quest, my server had this quest, while his server had the 'Kill 6 Mogu Effigy' quest.\n\nI simply dropped group, ran out of that specific area (to allow it to reset back to my server) and everything was able to be targeted and completed. I just did that one quest solo to ensure it wouldn't glitch out again.\n\nI hope this helps anyone who is experiencing similar problems.",
            date = "2012-10-30T08:27:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30308#comments:id=1753674",
        },
        {
            id = 1771635,
            score = 0,
            author = "Erlik",
            text = "At the moment, this quest bugs for 2 reasons. If you can't find or kill any https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59157 then:\n\nYou're in a cross-realm group, where the one setting up the group doesn't have this particular quest as part of his daily Golden Lotus quests.\n\nYou can either drop the quest, and accept the equivalent but different quest from his realm. Or you can leave his group, leave the zone and then re-enter to complete it.\n\nYou accepted the quest before 03:00 realm time, and try to complete it after 03:00 when the quests have reset.\n\nYou can not complete this quest now unless this quest also is part of the next days dailies. Abandon the quest and accept the equivalent one for this day.",
            date = "2012-11-29T21:08:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30308#comments:id=1771635",
        },
    },
    [30309] = {
    },
    [30310] = {
        {
            id = 1831025,
            score = 5,
            author = "Peter4730",
            text = "Read the earlier comment from socksmcgregor.   You need to kite these (as an arms warrior I used Heroic Throw to get the serpent's attention). Once they are following you, lead them back (SE direction) to where the GoldenLotus defenders will help you kill them.  Yes, it is a long kill, but once you have the serpent's attention, do not run away too quickly ..... let them give you a bit of damage ...... or else they will lose interest and fly off somewhere else. (Don't move too far from the GoldenLotus guys, when you are trying to attract a serpent's attention.  Be patient, and wait till one flies close to where you want to kite it, else you will have a hard time pulling it all the way back to the hired help).",
            date = "2013-03-19T05:11:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30310#comments:id=1831025",
        },
        {
            id = 1846444,
            score = 2,
            author = "Darneas",
            text = "Yeah just kite them to the soldiers a little down the hill and if it's anything like when I did it. The dragon will spit it's lighting at them even though you have the aggro and only hit you in between lighting strikes. Meanwhile about five pandas are helping you take it down.",
            date = "2013-04-24T04:01:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30310#comments:id=1846444",
        },
        {
            id = 1882223,
            score = 1,
            author = "Yogilaw",
            text = "A lot more manageable than I thought it would be. Once you have the serpent over by the 5 Golden Lotus warriors/archers on a mound to the left of the path (looking uphill) it doesn't take too long to finish them off. Just stay out of the lightening circles.",
            date = "2013-07-30T04:06:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30310#comments:id=1882223",
        },
        {
            id = 1677689,
            score = -2,
            author = "SFFCorgi",
            text = "The battle area is in phase with the area marked 'Vale of Eternal Blossoms' but out of phase if the battlefield is approached; it lies between the Golden Stair and the Shrine of Two Moons, towards the northeast.  About eight or so https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59158 are active at one time, fighting https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58464s and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59146s -- who also have to fight off https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59157.",
            date = "2012-06-17T13:39:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30310#comments:id=1677689",
