        {
            id = 1755183,
            score = 3,
            author = "Aletheua",
            text = "Confirming that this quest gives no reputation - possibly a bug.\nI have done it every time it has come up and it awards no reputation, but doing quests for other daily hubs reward 110 reputation per quest for all of them; this appears to be the only one that has a daily that rewards no reputation.\nWorth reporting as a bug as I have found no information stating otherwise.",
