        {
            id = 1755983,
            score = 8,
            author = "onlymeaz",
            text = "Okay, none of the prior comments were very helpful.  The last one got me on the right path (what the heck is \"jerkcity\") but this quest was a pain.  First, go to 55/38 stairs then straight ahead and you should see one of the red glowing traps slightly right and ahead that is bigger than the others.  You need to cross that trap (does take about 20k HP) to 55/33 then over the small archway.  It isn't really a bridge and will bring you to the pool.",
            date = "2012-11-03T01:04:52-05:00",
