        {
            id = 1721692,
            score = 4,
            author = "staynight",
            text = "I had a bit of trouble with this at first since the area was heavily populated and I couldn't see the mobs I needed until they respawned.\n\nThey are called Captive Sentinel, and you right click them to free them. You can do this while mounted and it will not dismount you.",
