            date = "2012-09-27T09:13:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30359#comments:id=1721595",
        },
        {
            id = 3131090,
            score = 1,
            author = "SilentSword1010",
            text = "You know what would have been an epic ending to this quest? If a sequence occurred when Brojai was at low health where Kang or Dezco or somebody caused a distraction while Vaeldrin leaped onto Brojai and forced the Waters of Youth down HIS throat instead, thus killing two birds with one stone; killing Brojai while reviving Lyalia, and allowing Vaeldrin to live.",
            date = "2019-06-28T11:35:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30359#comments:id=3131090",
        },
        {
            id = 1692213,
            score = 0,
