    [30386] = {
        {
            id = 1725054,
            score = 69,
            author = "723410",
            text = "If anyone wants to see all of the \"A dish for....\" quests in one place.\n\nHere they are:\n\nElla:\n5 x Shrimp Dumplings (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Giant Mantis Shrimp (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74857)\n            - Obtained from Fishing Pools along the Coast of the Jade Forest\n\nFarmer Fung:\n5 x Wildfowl Roast (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30421)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Wildfowl Breast (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74839)\n            - Is dropped by cranes just North of Halfhill\n\nGina:\n5 x Swirling Mist Soup (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30390)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Jade Lungfish (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74856)\n- Fished from pools in streams in rivers in Jade Forest\n\nHaohan:\n5 x Charbroiled Tiger Steak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30414)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Raw Tiger Steak (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74833)\n- Drops from tigers all across Pandaria. I suggest the 90 tigers on Windward Isle in Jade Forest\n\nJogu:\n5 x Sauteed Carrots (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30439)\n\nIngredients:\n10 x Juicycrunch Carrot (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74841)\n- Bought using 1 Ironpaw token or planting seeds.\n\nSho:\n5 x Eternal Blossom Fish (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30408)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Jade Lungfish (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74856)\n25 x Striped Melon (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74848)\n- Melons bought with 1 Ironpaw token or seeds planted.\n- Jade Lungfish fished from schools along streams and lakes in Jade Forest\n\nOld Hillpaw:\n5 x Braised Turtle (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30396)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Raw Turtle Meat (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74837)\n25 x Juicycrunch Carrot (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74841)\n- Juicycrunch Carrot bought with 1 ironpaw token or plant a seed\n- Raw Turtle Meat drops from turtles all over pandaria. Some nearby near Nesingwary's Safari\n\nFish:\n5 x Twin Fish Platter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30427)\n\nIngredients:\n10 x Krasarang Paddlefish (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74865)\n- Fished from pools in Valley of The Four Winds. Found some in the Pools of Purity\n\nChee Chee:\n5 x Valley Stir Fry (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30402)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Reef Octopus (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74864)\n5 x Wildfowl Breast (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74839)\n- Octopus fished in pools along the coast of Krasarang Wilds\n- Wildfowl Breast is dropped by cranes just North of Halfhill\n\nTina\n5 x Fire Spirit Salmon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30433)\n\nIngredients:\n5 x Emperor Salmon (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74859)\n25 x Scallion (http://www.wowhead.com/item=74843)\n- Salmon fished in Pools inland Valley of the Four Winds\n- Scallion bought with 1 Ironpaw token or farmed",
            date = "2012-09-29T19:18:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386#comments:id=1725054",
        },
        {
            id = 1725754,
            score = 41,
            author = "453960",
            text = "Below is a map showing where you can find the different NPC's and which dish they want:\n\nhttp://i48.tinypic.com/2l99iv.png",
            date = "2012-09-30T08:06:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386#comments:id=1725754",
        },
        {
            id = 1735298,
            score = 14,
            author = "QuickBASIC",
            text = "Waypoints for the possible food turn ins... if they're in town, you can just delete the ones that you don't need to visit after you add them. These people either show up in Halfhill Market or they're in one of these places. You can do these once a day.\n\n/way Valley of th 34.4 46.8 Chee\n/way Valley of th 31.6 58 Ella\n/way Valley of th 48.2 33.8 Fung\n/way Valley of th 41.6 30 Fish\n/way Valley of th 44.6 34 Haohan\n/way Valley of th 31 53 Hillpaw\n/way Valley of th 29.6 30.6 Sho\n/way Valley of th 45 33.8 Tina",
            date = "2012-10-08T05:43:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386#comments:id=1735298",
        },
        {
            id = 1720136,
            score = 13,
            author = "ranu",
            text = "This quest becomes available when you have the food in your inventory.",
            date = "2012-09-26T12:41:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386#comments:id=1720136",
        },
        {
            id = 1736778,
            score = 13,
            author = "126915",
            text = "I'm at 460/999 Best Friend with Ella and she is no longer offering me the A Dish for Ella daily. I've double checked I have the shrimp dumplings in my inventory. This is the second day in a row, so also not just a weird reset. It's possible these food dailies are no longer available once you reach Best Friend, which is unfortunate since it was a nice quick way to grab some valor and coins.\n\nEdit: You definitely can't turn in food or the dark soil items once you hit Best Friend. However, if you're like me and obsessed with getting all your bars you 999, don't despair! You can keep doing the Tiller dailies, which do still reward friendship. It may take a while, but eventually you will get the \"A Gift For ...\" daily, or the friend you need will offer a daily (eg. Chasing the Chicken (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30318) would finish you up with Old Hillpaw). Eventually you can get everyone up to 999!",
            date = "2012-10-09T16:20:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30386#comments:id=1736778",
        },
    },
