            score = 5,
            author = "QuickBASIC",
            text = "Waypoints for the possible food turn ins... if they're in town, you can just delete the ones that you don't need to visit after you add them. These people either show up in Halfhill Market or they're in one of these places. You can do these once a day.\n\n/way Valley of th 34.4 46.8 Chee\n/way Valley of th 31.6 58 Ella\n/way Valley of th 48.2 33.8 Fung\n/way Valley of th 41.6 30 Fish\n/way Valley of th 44.6 34 Haohan\n/way Valley of th 31 53 Hillpaw\n/way Valley of th 29.6 30.6 Sho\n/way Valley of th 45 33.8 Tina",
            date = "2012-10-08T05:42:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30439#comments:id=1735288",
        },
        {
            id = 1805984,
            score = 3,
            author = "Tomro",
            text = "It's a tiny bit annoying that this easy easy source of 5 (x10) Valor and 1 (x10) Lesser charms per day is no longer available once you hit best friend with each NPC.  Not only are the rewards for Best Friend quite weak (thanks for the hat old Hillpaw, now come and help me clear these annoying Wild crops you lazy little.......) it actually feels like a major loss for having max rep.  That's 350 valor a week and 70 charms by the way.\n\nI'd rather like them to be repeatable daily no matter what your rep is.  Gives a worthwhile point to cooking, fishing and farming other than buff food and crafting mats.\n\nChange please!",
            date = "2013-01-29T06:05:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30439#comments:id=1805984",
        },
    },
