    [30457] = {
        {
            id = 1732266,
            score = 23,
            author = "MrThawa",
            text = "If you're curious.....\n\nAfter completing the quest, Mayor Bramblestaff (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=59073) says, \"You have saved Binan Village, . Ring the gong so all shall know!\".\n\nThe gong is just to the right, if you are facing him. However, I could not find a way to ring the gong on my own. I did see the NPC in front of it ring the gong after about three minutes. I really wanted to ring it, but it appears it is simply some flavor text, for now.\n\n:[\n\nAlso, after completing this quest the NPCs of the town no longer speak of a stranger or foreigner.",
            date = "2012-10-05T12:12:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457#comments:id=1732266",
        },
        {
