        {
            id = 1720352,
            score = 3,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "The Road to Kun-lai Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre][ins]#[/ins])Robbing Robbers of Robbers (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31286) [ins]#[/ins])Educating Saurok (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31287) [ins]#[/ins])The Spring Drifter (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31285)(The Veiled Stair)\n\n[ins]#[/ins])The Road to Kun-Lai (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31254){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31255)(Multiple zones)\n\n[ins]+[/ins])Hit Medicine (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30460) [ins]+[/ins])All of the Arrows (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30459) [ins]+[/ins])Call Out Their Leader (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457)\n ├─────┬────────┴───────────────────┘         ||\n ||     ||                                    Turnabout (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30670)*\n || The Defense of Shado-Pan Fallback (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30665)*\n ||\n ├──────────────────────────────────────┐\na)Admiral Taylor has Awakened (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30506)(A,v2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30507),v3 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30508)) a)General Nazgrim has Awakened (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30509)(H,v2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30510),v3 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30511))\nb)Westwind Rest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30512)(A)                     b)Eastwind Rest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30513)(H)\n ||                   ┌──────────────────┘\nb)Challenge Accepted (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30514){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30515)\n || ||                 └───────────┬>c)Blue Dwarf Needs Food Badly (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30583)(A)\n || ├>c)Round 'Em Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30575){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31256)           ├>c)Best Meals Anywhere! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31251)(H)\n || └>d)Profiting off of the Past (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30595) └>d)Deanimate the Reanimated (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30593){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30594)\n ||\n ├───────────────────────────┐\nd)Mogu? Oh No-gu