        {
            id = 5456238,
            score = -2,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nOn This Achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7601 you need to finish quests with https://www.wowhead.com/object=208127 in 22 locations. All of them You can find in main Vilages/Cities in Northrend Zones. To get to Pandoria use Teleport in Stormwind in Wizard's Sanctum \"Portal to Jade Forest\" 45.5 87.4.\n\nSee My Video for this achievement with MAP and Quests if need it - https://youtu.be/jYQF3ggmmWM\n\nSee Locations in the order I did :\n\n1. Jade Forest, Paw'don Village 44.8 84.4\n2. Jade Forest, Pearlfin Village 59.6 83.2\n3. Jade Forest, Jade Temple Grounds 54.6 63.3\n4. Jade Forest, Dawn's Blossom 45.8 43.6\n5. Jade Forest, Greenstone Village 48.1 34.6\n6. Jade Forest, Sri-La Village 55.7 24.4\n7. Jade Forest, Tian Monastery 41.7 23.2\n8. Kun-Lai Summit, Binan Village 72.7 92.2\n9. Kun-Lai Summit, Westwind Rest 54.1 82.9 To unlock this https://www.wowhead.com/object=208127 You need to do 6 quests:\n[spoiler]\n1A. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59073 72.2 91.9 Slay 10 Bataari mobs and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59083\n1B. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30460 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59077 71.6 92.8 Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=79819 on 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59143\n1C. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30459 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59076 70.8 90.4 Pick up from ground 12 arrows\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30506 after done quest 1A-1C You can pick up this quest from one of this three NPC. Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59441 He is inside bulding on 1st floor 71.5 93.1\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30512 Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63754 58.9 80.4 then speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63542 56.3 84.4\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30514 first press on Yaungol Banner then slain https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59483 after finish this quest village will go up then You will be able to see https://www.wowhead.com/object=208127 54.1 82.9\n[/spoiler]\n10. Kun-Lai Summit, One Keg 57.5 60\n11. Kun-Lai Summit, The Grummle Bazaar 64.2 61.2\n12. Kun-Lai Summit, Zouchin Village 62.5 28.9\n13. Townlong Steppes, Longying Outpost 71.1 57.8\n14. Dread Wastes, Klaxxi'vess 55.9 32.3\n15. Dread Wastes, Soggy's Gamble 55.2 71.1\nFirst Speak with Zidormi 81 29.5\n16. Vale of Eternal Blossoms, Shrine of Seven Stars 37.1 66.5\n17. Vale of Eternal Blossoms, Mistfall Village 35.1 77.7\n18. The Veiled Stair, Tavern in the Mists 55 72.3\n19. Valley of the Four Winds, Pang's Stead 83.6 20.3\n20. Valley of the Four Winds, Stoneplow 19.8 55.9\n21. Krasarang Wilds, Marista 51.5 77.3\n22. Krasarang Wilds, Zhu's Watch 75.9 6.9\n\nWay points for Tomtom:\n\n[spoiler]\n\n/way Jade Forest 44.8 84.4\n/way Jade Forest 59.6 83.2\n/way Jade Forest 54.6 63.3\n/way Jade Forest 45.8 43.6\n/way Jade Forest 48.1 34.6\n/way Jade Forest 55.7 24.4\n/way Jade Forest 41.7 23.2\n/way Kun-Lai Summit 72.7 92.2\n/way Kun-Lai Summit 54.1 82.9 To unlock this https://www.wowhead.com/object=208127 You need to do 6 quests:\n/way Kun-Lai Summit 57.5 60\n/way Kun-Lai Summit 64.2 61.2\n/way Kun-Lai Summit 62.5 28.9\n/way Townlong Steppes 71.1 57.8\n/way Dread Wastes 55.9 32.3\n/way Dread Wastes 55.2 71.1\n/way Vale of Eternal Blossoms 81 29.5 First Speak with Zidormi\n/way Vale of Eternal Blossoms 37.1 66.5\n/way Vale of Eternal Blossoms 35.1 77.7\n/way The Veiled Stair 55 72.3\n/way Valley of the Four Winds 83.6 20.3\n/way Valley of the Four Winds 19.8 55.9\n/way Krasarang Wilds 51.5 77.3\n/way Krasarang Wilds 75.9 6.9\n\n[/spoiler]\n.\nHope That help You :).",
            date = "2022-10-22T12:00:39-05:00",
