        {
            id = 3302341,
            score = 7,
            author = "indigo09",
            text = "This appears to be a breadcrumb quest. If you have completed the quest after it, Unsafe Passage (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30269/unsafe-passage), you can no longer turn it in, but it doesn't look like it prevents zone loremaster completion.",
