            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30462#comments:id=1815353",
        },
        {
            id = 1918334,
            score = 26,
            author = "Guildmaster",
            text = "If this quest isn't showing up to you, it has a hidden prerequisite of doing all the quests at Zhu's Watch.\n\nThese two start the dual-chain:\n\n[quest=30079 domain=www]\n[quest=30080 domain=www]\n\nending with [quest=30090 domain=www] which unlocks this quest.",
            date = "2013-11-14T17:00:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30462#comments:id=1918334",
        },
        {
            id = 1873048,
            score = 15,
            author = "Bellabel",
            text = "As I leveled I skipped the entire zone, and only recently went back to get the zone quest achievement.   After getting this quest I was unable to locate the NPC at the location indicated.  I did a ton of tricks to unbug the quest, like dropping it, logging off, and such.\nAfter a few hours I decided to open a ticket.  The next day a gm told me I managed to bug out the quest because I had phased it previously, he/she didn't elaborate much past that.  The gm completed the quest for me and I moved forward.\n\nSo if you cannot locate the NPC and you did all the simple tricks to unbug a quest, drop a ticket don't wait 2 hours like me.\n.",
            date = "2013-07-02T22:14:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30462#comments:id=1873048",
        },
        {
            id = 5951047,
            score = 7,
