            text = "For me the best spot to target and kill one of the Monstrous Plainshawk (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=59641) is on the bridge that connects to Spicemaster Jin Jao (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=59581)'s hut (56.1, 47.13).  They routinely cross over this area.",
            date = "2012-11-30T05:16:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30475#comments:id=1771905",
        },
