        },
        {
            id = 1722072,
            score = 3,
            author = "Aros",
            text = "And for those of you who missed the dialogue:\n\nWaterspeaker Gorai (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=60973) says: I've never performed this ritual. I don't know what will happen, exactly.\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: It's been passed down from ancient times, but none of our people have needed to use it since then.\n-- Gorai walks over the the dead Jinyu. --\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: Let us see if this is sufficient to cleanse the corruption from my people's souls.\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: It worked! It wo-\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: Wh... what is happening? Why is the ritual affecting her?\n-- A sha beast emerges from Mei --\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: What is that?\nSwordmistress Mei (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=59273) says: I feel so much calmer. What happened?\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: A beast emerged from you when I began the ritual.  slew it!\nSwordmistress Mei says: I felt a presence, a burning pain and rage in my mind...\nWaterspeaker Gorai says: That... thing must be what was controlling the villagers! I know what we must do.",
            date = "2012-09-27T19:56:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30480#comments:id=1722072",
        },
        {
            id = 1767054,
            score = 2,
            author = "959900",
            text = "Seems to be as buggy as a hornet's nest.\n\nTried at least 5 times to complete this quest (abandoning each time and starting over) but I was faced with 2 unfavorable outcomes: 1. I end up an inch from death from the Hatred monster (who is impervious to any spells) and then Mistress Mei keels over dead or 2. Gorai freezes up and endlessly casts with no effect on the other NPCs.\n\nMoving on.......",
            date = "2012-11-24T02:46:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30480#comments:id=1767054",
        },
    },
