        {
            id = 1720921,
            score = 41,
            author = "jojopojo64",
            text = "Riko is indeed by the lake, taking care of slickie supplies. He also, in his own words, \"Got this #$%^& on lockdown.\"\n\nWell. Riko's by far my most favorite primate-minded, comedic quest NPC ever...next to Budd Nedreck, (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=46463#comments) of course.",
