            author = "mRshykid",
            text = "To anyone who had the same bug as me(seeing the quest icon on the map but not being able to take the quest), you need the pre-quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30499, which is from a chain at Temple of the Jade Serpent(the zone not the dungeon)",
