            author = "998027",
            text = "Despite Sergeant Gorrok living through the encounter with the Jade Witch (after you save him), he doesn't seem to play a part in any of the quests from here on out. He's asleep in a hut after you save him, and proceeds to not be an important NPC for the duration of MoP it seems.\n\nShokia is found in Dominance Offensive, while Nazgrim and company (Kiryn and Clutchpop) travel to Kun-Lai. Gorrok is never seen again outside the Jade Forest.\n\nStrikes me as a bit odd.",
            date = "2013-01-25T19:47:04-06:00",
