            text = "You can just hop in the cart and go AFK for a few minutes. The cart takes no damage, the yeti despawns, and you arrive at the destination ready to turn in the quest.\n\nI call this the LFR Quest, because you get carried while AFKing and still win. It really ought to reward epics.",
