            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30488#comments:id=1751291",
        },
        {
            id = 1815044,
            score = 7,
            author = "924646",
            text = "So you've found the cave and it's a little confusing cuz, when you get to where the yellow ? is you'll see nothing but little sprite dudes running around where he should be. It's him! He's just covered over with the lil guys. So, just kill them and he shows up. But don't dawdle any too long cuz more lil guys'll come runnin and drama is renewed for a couple seconds. Then it's get out of the cave n go back to the ranch via the last muskpaw next to him. So hit the green arrow for a ride on it and it'll take you back to the ranch to get 5 more of those free ride muskpaws. Peace!",
            date = "2013-02-18T02:27:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30488#comments:id=1815044",
        },
        {
            id = 2552194,
            score = 5,
            author = "ShamrockSoup",
            text = "Only classes that make sense he's not aware of them are Death Knight's, Demon Hunters, Paladins, and Warlocks. I know I shouldn't expect much from Blizzard's effort in terms of details but they could've provided this npc two variants of dialogue.",
            date = "2018-02-12T01:31:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30488#comments:id=2552194",
        },
    },
