            text = "Alliance side:\n[quest=30506 domain=mop]\n\nQuest text:\n\nGeneral Nazgrim says: You escaped me in Vashj'ir. You won't be so lucky here.\nAdmiral Taylor says: These people shall not be enslaved by your cruel Horde. I won't allow it!\nAdmiral Taylor says: We must gain a foothold here... away from these Horde dogs.\nGeneral Nazgrim says: Your kind shall never build a foothold here. This is destined to be Horde land.\nGeneral Nazgrim says: Soon, you and your Alliance will only be found in Azeroth's history books.\nAdmiral Taylor says: I'll wait until you're healed to finish you, Nazgrim. Let it not be said that the Alliance has no honor.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Kun-Lai Summit is where you're going to die, orc. I'm going to bury you.\nGeneral Nazgrim says: I hope you have the courage to die bravely, human. I'm in the mood for a good fight.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Only three Horde rats left. Shouldn't be much of a problem to finish you filth off once and for all.\nGeneral Nazgrim says: As soon as I can get up, human, I'm going to crush you!\nGeneral Nazgrim says: My axe will soon feast on your blood, human.\nAdmiral Taylor says: Look at the peaceful, kind people of this land. They were born to belong to the Alliance.\nGeneral Nazgrim says: These pandaren are a wish enough people. Sooner or later, they will side with the Horde.",
            date = "2012-08-27T08:59:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30511#comments:id=1704872",
        },
        {
            id = 1720374,
