            text = "For those Alliance players here looking for the Westwind candy bucket during Hallow's End, here is the quick and dirty:\n\n* Start by picking up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31254 near the Grassy Cline flight point in [zone=5805] .  Speak to Highroad Grummle.\n* Go up the path (also grab the candy bucket from Tavern in the Mists) and speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63367\n* Pick up the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31285 and ride the boat thru to Binan Village.\n* Turn in quests.  Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30460, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30459, and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457.\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30508\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30512\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30514\n* After the cutscene, you can access your candy bucket.",
