            author = "Karadine",
            text = "For those doing here looking for the Eastwind (Horde) candy bucket during Hallow's End:\n\n* Start by picking up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31255.  Speak to Highroad Grummle.\n* Go up the path (also grab the candy bucket from Tavern in the Mists) and speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63367\n* Pick up the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31285 and ride the boat thru to Binan Village.\n* Turn in quests.  Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30460, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30459, and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457.\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30511\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30513\n* Pick up and complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30515\n* After the cutscene, you can access your candy bucket.",
