        },
        {
            id = 1736465,
            score = 14,
            author = "Netn",
            text = "This questchain consists of five quests.\n\nHaohan's Vote I: Bungalow Break-In (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30521)\nHaohan's Vote II: The Real Culprits (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30522)\nHaohan's Vote III: Pure Poison (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30525)\nHaohan's Vote IV: Melons For Felons (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30527)\nHaohan's Vote V: Chief Yip-Yip (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30528)\n\nThe questchain seems to open up at around 16800/21000 into revered.\n\nThe first four quests will each give you 300 reputation. The last one will give you 1000 reputation.\n\nWithout human racial or guild perk that is: 2200\nWith either human racial or guild perk it's: 2420\nWith both human racial and guild perk it's: 2640\n\nHuman racial: Diplomacy (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=20599)\nGuild perk: Mr. Popularity (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=78635)",
            date = "2012-10-09T08:31:48-05:00",
