 of quests each starting from NPC that gave you previous quests.\nOrdo Warbringer have quest that starts via pop-up after Channelers and backup from Taylor/Nazgrim if you abandon first.",
            date = "2012-09-26T16:01:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30571#comments:id=1720460",
        },
        {
            id = 1720775,
            score = 2,
            author = "Zeaig",
            text = "This is by far the most annoying quest in the whole expansion.\n\n-Instructions-\n\nThere are about 5-6 groups of slaves in the Chow Farmstead. You have to stand kill the mob that spawns next to them. The problem being. The re spawn timer is very long. and the zone tends to be camped by players.\n\nIf there's a bunch of players, Find a group. If not your best bet is to try again later.",
            date = "2012-09-26T20:51:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30571#comments:id=1720775",
        },
        {
            id = 1723502,
            score = 2,
            author = "Quaeril",
            text = "Best way to do this quest is standing in the middle of the pandaren Farmhands spaming a macro like this: /tar Ordo Overseer.\nAs soon as you target it, cast an instant spell to aggro it before someone other does and kill it near the farmhands.\n\nTook me 20 mins to finish this quest, as the respawn timer is very slow.\nRemember: not Raiders, Overseers only will do.",
            date = "2012-09-28T19:35:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30571#comments:id=1723502",
        },
        {
            id = 1662681,
            score = 1,
            author = "Yinxy",
            text = "What I noticed so far is that even when the Ordo is tapped by another, when you are closeby the farmers/ Ordo, you will free them when you kill Ordo.",
            date = "2012-05-04T16:30:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30571#comments:id=1662681",
        },
    },
    [30575] = {
        {
            id = 1788239,
            score = 20,
            author = "aoeu",
            text = "Oddly enough, as Alliance, I accidentally ventured into Eastwind Rest (horde camp), and it actually counted at a Yak turn-in location.  Of course, I didn't know this was a horde camp until I starting hitting TAB.. no NPCs attacked me.  However, you actually have to turn in the quest at Westwind Rest (ally camp).",
            date = "2012-12-27T16:03:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30575#comments:id=1788239",
        },
        {
            id = 3172573,
            score = 12,
            author = "amymicaela",
            text = "It may appear like you cannot round up all 3 at once, but you can. You can see each Yak you capture at the top right of your screen as a Yak icon near the mini map. They all stack on top of one another looking like you suddenly only have 1 Yak again :O GASP.\n\nTURN IN POINT: coordinates: 63/80 Eastwind Rest",
            date = "2019-11-19T17:40:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30575#comments:id=3172573",
        },
