        },
        {
            id = 1799581,
            score = 3,
            author = "788318",
            text = "I found Momo okay - and was able to loot the Rabbitfoot's Luckydo, however, I cannot find the npc to turn in the quest to. The map shows the \"?\", Brother Rabbitsfoot does not appear however.\n\nThis was found later - the turn in shows up at both the Kota Basecamp AND The Burlap Waystation, the nps is at the Waystation only.",
