            score = 5,
            author = "341848",
            text = "To rescue Brother Yakshoe, you simply have to click on Mok Mok (big hozen in the screenshot). You don't actually do any fighting, unless you're jumped on your way there. Mok Mok and the brother are almost directly north of the Burlap Waystation, on the top of a rise. Mok Mok is visible from the quest giver.",
