            text = "I had a little trouble with this at first.  Every time I killed the mobs around the hanging captives then they disappeared.  But I found that you can target the ropes holding the hanging ones to cut them down.  Mouse over the rope and you get the sword icon.  It's even better for ranged characters because you don't have to engage those standing nearby.",
