            date = "2012-09-27T09:14:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30612#comments:id=1721596",
        },
        {
            id = 1724178,
            score = 11,
            author = "Obolon",
            text = "I figured I would kite him through the laser beam until he was dead.  He'll die, but you won't get credit.  Then I thought, well, maybe I have to have the killing blow, so I kited him through the laser beam until he was severely injured and then I got the killing blow.  Still no credit for the kill.  It turns out that you really need to fight him.  You can run away from him and let him get hit by the laser, but to get credit for the kill, it seems as if you have to do the majority of the damage to him yourself.  I came to this conclusion after about 20 attempts and the only time I got credit was when I did the majority of the damage to him.",
            date = "2012-09-29T07:26:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30612#comments:id=1724178",
        },
    },
