! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30619){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30620)    e)Trouble on the Farmstead (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30569){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30570)\n ||                        /     \\\n ||       e)Farmhand Freedom (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30571)     e)... and the Pot, Too!  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30581)\n ||                       └─┬───┬─┘\n || e)Back to Westwind Rest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31252)(A) e)Back to Eastwind Rest (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31253)(H)\n ├─────────────────────────┴───┴─┬───────────────────┐\n ||                               ||                   ||\nf)In Tents Channeling (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30652){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30657)        f)Barrels of Fun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30651){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656) f)Pandaren Prisoners (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30650){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30655)\nf)The Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}  ||                   ||\n ||                           └─┬─┴─────────────────┬─┘\nMuskpaw Ranch (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31456){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31457)*              ├>The Shado-Pan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31455){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31453)* ├>The Missing Merchant (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31452){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31451)*\n                               └>Beyond the Wall (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695)*  └>Cho's Missive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31460){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31459)*\nLegend:\n+ means Can start anytime, prequests not needed.\n# means Other Zones\n(A)/(H) means Alliance/Horde only.\n{H} means Quest Have Horde Variant, click {H} for it.\n* means another Quest Tree.[/pre]\nAdditionall info:\n\nYes, Shado-pan questline have such weird prequests :D\nAwakened quests have 3 version of quests each starting from NPC that gave you previous quests.\nOrdo Warbringer have quest that starts via pop-up after Channelers and backup from Taylor/Nazgrim if you abandon first.",
