        },
        {
            id = 1885654,
            score = 2,
            author = "Myci",
            text = "In order to kill the rare Major Nanners you need to finish this an unphase the area.\nIncase you were looking for the quest that did it ^-^\n\nAlso if your planning to specifically farm skyshards (that dont require an npc that spawns after the phase)  you should do it before you finish this. Just by doing the dailys I have been lucky and got a few over time, but at some point I just wanted to farm the rest out.\nIf your on a high pop server or just want less people in the area your farming, its likely the majority will be phased to you if you dont complete this quest.",
            date = "2013-08-09T15:24:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30638#comments:id=1885654",
        },
    },
    [30639] = {
        {
            id = 1742767,
            score = 34,
            author = "960490",
            text = "Enter the Guo-Lai Halls and make a left (You can now go left, before you reached this point the way was blocked).\n\nHe Softfoot will be waiting there for you.  Talk to him and then follow him.  He will be shadowmelded, but I was not.\n\nThe Statues along the way will crumble and fall, doing a large aoe damage to the ground.  If you pay attention and stay close to He Softfoot you can avoid any damage.\n\nWhen he arrives at the last room, a small dialog will start.  He Softfoot will disapear.  Do not panic, just continue into the room.  Two elites will be on the platform, listen to the dialog.  They will net-trap you.  You will then be teleported out of the Halls and into a cell.  He Softfoot will release you from the cell.",
            date = "2012-10-15T18:58:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30639#comments:id=1742767",
        },
        {
            id = 1763236,
            score = 32,
            author = "1055611",
            text = "At the end of the encounter, right before you get transported to the cages:\n\nZhao-Jin the Bloodletter says: Throw these prisoners in the cages. Let the men have their way with them.\n\nDoes no one else find this as horrifyingly hilarious as I do?",
            date = "2012-11-16T08:15:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30639#comments:id=1763236",
        },
        {
            id = 1725539,
            score = 30,
            author = "1038212",
            text = "As of the launch of Mists, the quest (along with The Battle Ring daily) is bugged. You can get through the steps of the quest, but the person you turn it in to simply is not there. The only reason I was able to get these quests was due to obtaining https://www.wowhead.com/item=86592 several times.\n\nHopefully the Dev team can jump on it quick before the masses start hitting honored. I speculate that I am one of the only people at honored this early into the expansion.\n\nEDIT: After waiting for the daily reset, the quest ending NPC appeared at the hub and I was able to complete the quest.",
            date = "2012-09-30T04:33:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30639#comments:id=1725539",
        },
        {
