            text = "The spear is not located inside the halls, it is located in the shallow lake in the hill above the halls at 21.3, 19.7. When looted, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60294 spawns and attacks, he has 1.2M health and is relatively trivial to kill.\n\nThis quest does change your phase and you will be unable to see other players around Guo-Lai halls while on it.",
