        {
            id = 1813641,
            score = 8,
            author = "Mendric",
            text = "The \"?\" is outside the entrance of \"The Silent Sanctuary\" that you should go into. Soon as you're inside, it will then move about 100 yards in front of you.\n\nSeems like there are a lot of inconsistencies in WOW lately with the quests. Like there's no editor to keep things similar. I mean in MOP there are a ton of bugs in the quests (especially if grouped), but like this one, some quests will point you to the entrance, while others you find out later that he's\\she's below you in a cave. MOP needs a SOP!",
