        {
            id = 1809891,
            score = 2,
            author = "Discordian",
            text = "Currently broken again (02/06/13) - at least on Terokkar realm. Contacted a GM prior to reset about this quest. Let them know the specifics of what was going on with it on my home realm (Zhu's guardians won't complete).  Gonna quote my ticket here:\n\n  \" After some digging into this for you, I was able to find some other reports being submitted by players having the same problem.  Looks like our QA folks, which is our in-game bug exterminators, have been hard at work since the first report was put in.\n\n        Knowing how important and frustrating this is, I still wanted to thank you for the additional information you've hooked us up with.  Hopefully with all the information gathered on this topic, from players like yourself, we'll have something implemented soon to get all you guys up and running.  As for right now though, we don't have a work around or an estimated time for that hotfix. In the meantime, you can keep an eye on this concern as well as other known issues on our bug report forums located at:  http://us.battle.net/wow/en/forum/1012660/ \"\n\nTL;DR: Needs hotfix, no work around, not sure when they're going to do that hotfix.\n\nI tried it again after this Tuesday's reset - same results. So it's broke-broke. Nice GM though. Glad he had some solid info <3",
            date = "2013-02-06T09:53:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30653#comments:id=1809891",
        },
        {
            id = 1665120,
            score = 1,
            author = "946307",
            text = "as a horde, the tauren are near the quest area, even though it shows on the map that its at Mudmug's place.  They are not at Mudmug's place.  However as of 5/10/2012 it cannot be completed",
            date = "2012-05-10T10:55:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30653#comments:id=1665120",
        },
    },
    [30654] = {
        {
            id = 1690382,
            score = 93,
            author = "Cielos",
            text = "Down on the lower floor of the Guo-Lai Halls stands https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60273.  Once you aggro him, he will do a little RP then summon Dagou.",
            date = "2012-07-20T14:57:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30654#comments:id=1690382",
        },
        {
            id = 1733273,
            score = 27,
            author = "PriestessAur",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59977 is the stone guardian of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59921. After accepting this quest it tells you that you need to go into Gao-Lai Halls and kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59977, however you can not attack or even target him. You need to enter combat with Zhao-Jin to get access to Dagou. Zhao-Jin is a level 90 Elite, but don't let that scare you. You don't actually have to fight him. Just attack him and he will talk for a few seconds than send in Dagou.\n\nEdit: Oct 4, 2012 hotfix All players attacking Dagou will now properly receive quest credit when he is slain.",
            date = "2012-10-06T10:35:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30654#comments:id=1733273",
        },
        {
            id = 1725305,
            score = 8,
            author = "Brantu",
            text = "Th entrnce to the cave is 22,26",
            date = "2012-09-29T23:56:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30654#comments:id=1725305",
        },
        {
            id = 1752692,
            score = 7,
            author = "ZadaMahri",
            text = "If you happen to have Ancient Guo-Lai Cache Key (http://www.wowhead.com/item=87779#dropped-by) be sure to check for the Ancient Guo-Lai Cache (http://www.wowhead.com/object=214388)\n\nCache locations I have found:\n-Just as you enter the halls in between the 2 Quilen statues.\n\n-Sides of the hall entrance.\n\n-If you enter the Ritual Chamber you will see two sets of stairs with a pedestal in the middle (a large Quilen statue may or may not be in the middle of the room) chests can be on either side of him along the back wall.\n\n-From the statue mentioned above, turn right and enter the decline, It will be along the back wall where the small pool of water is.\nThe elite spider \"bloodtip\" can be \"protecting\" it here. (Can spawn behind him)\n\n-If you are facing the two small staircases/statue, the wall opposite to the statue can spawn one on either side.\n\nEdit: I have found these JUST after I hit 90 with most of my MOP faction standings at neutral-friendly and no higher.",
            date = "2012-10-28T16:12:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30654#comments:id=1752692",
        },
        {
            id = 1795965,
            score = 7,
            author = "SammeZhao",
            text = "For some trivia, Dagou literally means \"Big Dog\" in Chinese. I had a good laugh when I saw his name.",
            date = "2013-01-10T13:05:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30654#comments:id=1795965",
        },
    },
