        {
            id = 1725721,
            score = 1,
            author = "Noobiedoobie",
            text = "Big tip, don't go around trying to pick up three barrels and then try to sue them. You can only pick up one at a time - use that one and then pick up another one. I thought they weren't spawning. There is a barrel quite close to each of the oil pump thingies.",
            date = "2012-09-30T07:28:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656#comments:id=1725721",
        },
        {
            id = 1728069,
            score = 1,
            author = "179905",
            text = "Another tip, if you don't get credit for destroying the rig try again very close to it.  It will allow you to throw the barrel and count down and go boom if you're too far away but it won't give you credit.",
            date = "2012-10-01T23:45:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656#comments:id=1728069",
        },
        {
            id = 1740458,
            score = 1,
            author = "Narwhals",
            text = "When you pick up a barrel and have it in your inventory, the barrel will be on your character's back. This is visible even in shapeshifts - my cat druid had a barrel right between the front shoulders. I haven't tested it yet, but if you retain the barrel when you log out our die and if it's visible outside Kun-Lai Summit, then it might be an interesting little decoration for players trying to spice up their look.\n\nEDIT: Tested it. Leaving Kun-Lai removes the barrel.",
            date = "2012-10-13T12:45:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656#comments:id=1740458",
        },
    },
