        {
            id = 1723650,
            score = 11,
            author = "carens",
            text = "The quest giver is the first one you rescue.  Go clockwise from her around the sha-infested area.  Follow the chat bubbles on your mini-map - all are inside buildings.\n\nYa Firebough   41.0   87.0\nOld Lady Fung     42.8   85.7\nJin Warmkey    43.8   86.2\n\nTurn in is inside the wall, behind the doors which you can (conveniently) open since there is fighting going on outside on the steps.  Just walk past, open the doors, and turn in!",
