        },
        {
            id = 1738401,
            score = 5,
            author = "lisaroxy",
            text = "I was curious how much damage they do, and you really do have to kind of stomp on them.  I took about 14k damage.  After you've gotten enough poked, they stop sparkling, so keep your eyes open a little bit.  They can still sting you after you've turned it in, too, and after completion you can no longer disarm the traps.",
