            id = 1736812,
            score = 10,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Minh Do-Tan the first time, you receive e-mail from Ellia Ravenmane (http://www.wowhead.com/search?q=ellia+ravenmane).\n\n\"I heard you beat Minh Do-Tan.  Well, I've been training, too.\n\nI've asked Thelonius to set up a rematch between you and I.  This time, we'll see who's really the better fighter!\"",
