er the guise of Fat Long-Fat, I once asked you, 'Why do you fight?' Some of us fight out of fear. Some fight for a sheer love of violence. Some in anger. In hatred. In doubt.\nEllia Ravenmane fought out of despair.\nBut you... I don't see any of this in you. Which is why I chose you to protect my people.\nYou will always hold a place of honor among the heroes of my order, {name}. You have our gratitude.\"",
            date = "2013-02-27T17:33:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726#comments:id=1818960",
        },
        {
            id = 1842875,
            score = 1,
            author = "Xoxotl",
            text = "You'll find him loitering in the area of 32.76 next to a statue of a crane.  Surrounding him will be 3-4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60616.  You can start the fight by talking to him.\n\nTry to kite him away from the cranes once he aggros to make the encounter easier, otherwise any AOE or cleave-type attacks you have will cause the cranes to add into the fight.  He won't kite very far though before evading and resetting (I guess he doesn't like to scuffle without his crane backup) but you can get him far enough.",
            date = "2013-04-13T23:09:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726#comments:id=1842875",
        },
        {
            id = 1853442,
            score = 1,
            author = "silveress",
            text = "About the fight:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60532 is a monk between a couple cranes, and you won't want to fight him there. Tag him and run near the shore to his left about 30-40 yards if there are no aggroable cranes or monks there. The cranes won't follow you as long as you don't AoE close to them. He has an Area of Effect spell that will aggro all nearby fighters so dueling him by the water will likely keep him solo since the student monks don't usually walk that far.\n\nHe has one green AoE spell that causes immense damage called the https://www.wowhead.com/spell=101546 which causes pain if you stand within its radius very long and be aware that it also decreases your run speed by 50% within a 7 yard radius.\n\nWhen you see him casting it, just make sure none will be aggroed in the process. And just run. Hit. Run. Hit. Run. If you have a way to tangle him up & slow him down using rooting spells and movement reducing spells, I encourage you to use them. Throw a spell that roots him in spell and hit him from afar with high-powered dps. If you can't cast any spells, slow down his running speed the best you can and just fight him without being right beside him. As long as you're not too close to him, you'll be fine.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/spell=108920 (Priests), https://www.wowhead.com/spell=122 and https://www.wowhead.com/spell=116 (Mages) and https://www.wowhead.com/spell=116281, https://www.wowhead.com/spell=339 and https://www.wowhead.com/spell=16689 (Druids), https://www.wowhead.com/spell=2484 and https://www.wowhead.com/spell=2484 (Shamans), https://www.wowhead.com/spell=116095 (Monks), poisoned weapons (Rogues), and anything to reduce their speed so you can't catch up to you to cast the spell. If you can hold them in place 7 yards away from you, you won't be damaged.\n\nIn between AoE spells he throws, he will engage in hand to hand combat. No worries, his punches don't hurt. Only his https://www.wowhead.com/spell=101546 causes enough damage to kill you if you stay in it too long. Running out of it is hard since it slows you down by half. So when you see him casting it, just run around to a spot outside of his reach and do long range hits until he runs up to you to engage in hand to hand combat.\n\nVery easy fight for a level 90 shadow priest - gear score item level 447. My health didn't drop below 80%. Good luck!",
            date = "2013-05-16T00:26:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726#comments:id=1853442",
        },
    },
