        {
            id = 1680256,
            score = 18,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Julia the first time, you receive mail from Fat Long-Fat.\n\n\"Dear Calesta,\n\nThis is Fat Long-Fat.  We fought a few days ago, atop Angkhai Pavilion.\n\nI have a question for you.  You do not need to answer me, but you should seek the answer within your mind.  The question is this.\n\nWhy do you fight?\"",
            date = "2012-06-23T15:11:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729#comments:id=1680256",
        },
        {
            id = 1797367,
            score = 11,
            author = "Eillesthis",
            text = "Previous in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30728\n\nFrom her portrait:A recent arrival to Pandaria.\n\nWhen you speak to her:\nHey there, sweetie. You're lookin' pretty good in all that fancy armor.\n\nSo you've found the way of the Red Crane, too? Interested in a duel?\n\n*Let's fight!\n\nWhen you fight her:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60535 says: YAAAAAAAAHHHH!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60535 says: Nice moves, sweetie. Maybe I'll see you again...\n\nIn the mail, later:\n\nFrom: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60534\nSubject: A Question\nGreetings, .\n\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a few days ago, atop Angkhal Pavilion.\n\nI have a question for you. You do not need to answer me, but you should seek the answer within your mind. The question is this:\n\nWhy do you fight?\n\nNext in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730",
            date = "2013-01-12T15:46:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729#comments:id=1797367",
        },
        {
            id = 1741498,
            score = 8,
            author = "Catriona",
            text = "This battle involves a \"Hundred Hand Slap\" (just strafe out of the way) and a heal. There are two Students that pat close to her little piece of the coast so if you plan to kite, either kill them first or make sure you're not going to run into them.",
            date = "2012-10-14T14:49:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729#comments:id=1741498",
        },
        {
            id = 1818963,
            score = 7,
            author = "coolderka",
