        {
            id = 1684194,
            score = 11,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Izissha the first time, you receive mail from Fat Long-Fat.\n\n\"Greetings Calesta,\n\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a atop Angkhai Pavilion.  I am writing to deliver some advice.\n\nDo not give up your training. I have spoken with Thelonius, and he will do his best to make sure you are adequately challenged.  We may need to call on you in the future, and in that eventuality, you must be ready.\n\nI must disappear for a while.  I will be in touch in the future.\n\nLong-Fat\"",
            date = "2012-07-03T22:02:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730#comments:id=1684194",
        },
        {
            id = 1800567,
            score = 7,
            author = "Eillesthis",
            text = "Previous in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729\n\nFrom his portrait:A surprisingly strong fighter, Izissha tends to keep to himself.\n\nWhen you speak to him:\nYou will not find many jinyu here in the Cradle of Chi-Ji. In fact, I believe I may be the only one.\n\nIn general, my people shun Chi-Ji and his teachings. The crane dines on carp, after all.\n\n*Let's fight!\n\nWhen you fight him:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60536 says: Your winning streak ends here, . Today, you fall by my spear.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60536 says: My father foresaw this day in the waters. He told me that I would be defeated, but I refused to believe it.\n\nIn the mail, later:\n\nFrom: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60534\nSubject: Farewell\nGreetings, .\n\nThis is Fat Long-Fat again. We fought atop Angkhal Pavilion. I am writing to deliver some advice.\n\nDo not give up your training. I have spoken with Thelonius, and he will do his best to make sure you are adequately challenged. We may need to call on you in the future, and in that eventuality, you must be ready.\n\nI must disappear for a while. I will be in touch in the future.\n\nLong-Fat\n\nNext in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731",
            date = "2013-01-18T13:54:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730#comments:id=1800567",
        },
        {
            id = 1818965,
            score = 6,
            author = "coolderka",
