        {
            id = 1804115,
            score = 3,
            author = "Eillesthis",
            text = "Previous in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731\n\nFrom her portrait:Ellia has returned, and she's determined to defeat her rival.\n\nWhen you speak to her:\nHello, rival.\n\nI've been busy training.\n\nI hope you've done the same.\n\n*Let's fight!\n\nWhen you fight her:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60538 says: Just give up! It's hopeless! You'll never beat me!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60538 says: How did... I don't... no, no NO! NOT AGAIN!\n\nIn the mail, later:\n\nFrom: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60539\nSubject: Cradle of Chi-Ji Letter\nTukka-Tuk heard people saying you strong.\n\nTukka-Tuk watched you fight. Three of your fights, you just beat up little girl. Not very strong, Tukka-Tuk thinks.\n\nTukka-Tuk challenge you, !\n\nNext in the series: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30733",
            date = "2013-01-25T18:08:02-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30732#comments:id=1804115",
        },
    },
