        {
            id = 1688451,
            score = 9,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Mindel Sunspeaker the first time, you receive mail from Yan Quillpaw (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=60529).\n\n\"You have defeated every student that had a chance of beating you, but you have not yet defeated me.\n\nI may be one of your trainers, but I am not too proud to test my skills against a student.\n\nI challenge you to a duel, Calesta.  See you in the Cradle.\"",
