            score = 22,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Fat the second time, you receive mail from Thelonius (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=60506).\n\n\"Fat Long-Fat is not what he seems.  He is testing you.  He is testing both of us, actually.\n\nYour next duel will be against me.  The victor will perform a special task for the Red Crane himself.\n\nI haven't fought in ages.  I suppose I'd better start limbering up.  See you on the battlefield, Calesta.\"",
