        {
            id = 1805195,
            score = 32,
            author = "375198",
            text = "Part of the chain of \"bosses\" with connected quests you need to kill for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7287 a series of quests for The August Celestials at the Cradle of Chi-Ji .\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30725\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30727\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30728\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30732\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30733\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30734\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30735\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30736\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30737\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738 <---- YOU ARE HERE\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739",
            date = "2013-01-27T15:54:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738#comments:id=1805195",
        },
        {
            id = 1689691,
            score = 22,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "After defeating Thelonius (http://mop.wowhead.com/npc=60506) the first time, you receive mail from Ellia Ravenmane.\n\n\"I'm back, Calesta\n\nI was a fool to follow the path of the Red Crane.  You are all fools - babies, fighting over a Cradle.\n\nI will show you how fragile your precious Chi-Ji is.  He fell once into the depths of despair.  He will fall again.\"",
            date = "2012-07-18T22:00:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738#comments:id=1689691",
        },
        {
            id = 1818974,
            score = 13,
            author = "coolderka",
            text = "those are all letters thet you recieve after each victory in Cradle of Chi-Ji:\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30725 she sends you:\n\"I refuse to accept defeat! You haven't heard the last of me!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726 Ellia sends you:\n\"I heard you beat Minh Do-Tan. Well, I've been training, too.\nI've asked Thelonius to set up a rematch between you and I. This time, we'll see who's really the better fighter!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30727 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"Before your match today, Ellia Ravenmane swelled with hope and pride. After your victory, she lost a lot of that hope.\nYour lesson for today is that hope can turn into despair in a heartbeat. Ellia is learning this lesson the hard way.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30728 he sends you:\n\"You are strong. This is good.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729 Fat Long-Fat sends you:\n\"Dear {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a few days ago, atop Angkhai Pavilion.\nI have a question for you. You do not need to answer me, but you should seek the answer within your mind. The question is this.\nWhy do you fight?\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730 Fat Long-Fat sends you:\n\"Greetings {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a atop Angkhai Pavilion. I am writing to deliver some advice.\nDo not give up your training. I have spoken with Thelonius, and he will do his best to make sure you are adequately challenged. We may need to call on you in the future, and in that eventuality, you must be ready.\nI must disappear for a while. I will be in touch in the future.\nLong-Fat\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731 Ellia sends you:\n\"I heard you beat Kuo-Na. Impressive stuff... RIVAL.\nWell, I've been training, too. And I've got a few surprises for you.\nSee you soon, {name}\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30732 Tukka-Tuk sends you:.\n\"Tukka-Tuk heard people saying you strong.\nTukka-Tuk watched you fight. Three of your fights, you just beat up little girl. Not very strong. Tukka-Tuk thinks.\nTukka-Tuk challenge you, {name}!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30733 he sends you:.\n\"Tukka-Tuk is sorry for saying you only fight little girl. Tukka-Tuk thinks you are strong.\nTukka-Tuk hopes you win all your fights.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30734 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"I am concerned about Ellia Ravenmane. She has not appeared for her training in several days. I fear she has crossed that narrow threshold from hope into despair.\nIf you see her, let me know\n-Thelonius.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30735 Yan Quillpaw sends you:.\n\"You have defeated every student that had a chance of beating you, but you have not yet defeated me.\nI may be one of your trainers, but I am not too proud to test my skills against a student.\nI challenge you to a duel, {name}. See you in the Cradle.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30736 Fat Long-Fat sends you:.\n\"Greetings {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a atop Angkhai Pavilion. Do you remember me?\nI will be returning from my absence shortly. When I return, I would like to fight with you again. Perhaps this time we fight atop Dome Balrissa?\n- Long-Fat\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30737 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"Fat Long-Fat is not what he seems. He is testing you. He is testing both of us, actually.\nYour next duel will be against me. The victor will perform a special task for the Red Crane himself.\nI haven't fought in ages. I suppose I'd better start limbering up. See you on the battlefield, {name}.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738 Ellia sends you:\n\"I'm back, {name}\nI was a fool to follow the path of the Red Crane. You are all fools - babies, fighting over a Cradle.\nI will show you how fragile your precious Chi-Ji is. He fell once into the depths of despair. He will fall again.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739 Chi-Ji sends you:.\n\"Under the guise of Fat Long-Fat, I once asked you, 'Why do you fight?' Some of us fight out of fear. Some fight for a sheer love of violence. Some in anger. In hatred. In doubt.\nEllia Ravenmane fought out of despair.\nBut you... I don't see any of this in you. Which is why I chose you to protect my people.\nYou will always hold a place of honor among the heroes of my order, {name}. You have our gratitude.\"",
            date = "2013-02-27T17:43:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738#comments:id=1818974",
        },
    },
    [30739] = {
        {
            id = 1690515,
            score = 73,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "Awards the achievement Champion of Chi-Ji (http://mop.wowhead.com/achievement=7287).\n\nAfter defeating Ellia Ravenmane the final time, you receive e-mail from Chi-Ji.\n\n\"Under the guise of Fat Long-Fat, I once asked you, 'Why do you fight?'  Some of us fight out of fear.  Some fight for a sheer love of violence.  Some in anger.  In hatred.  In doubt.\n\nEllia Ravenmane fought out of despair.\n\nBut you... I don't see any of this in you.  Which is why I chose you to protect my people.\n\nYou will always hold a place of honor among the heroes of my order, Calesta.  You have our gratitude.\n\n-Chi-Ji, the Red Crane\"",
            date = "2012-07-20T21:32:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739#comments:id=1690515",
        },
        {
            id = 1805197,
            score = 38,
            author = "375198",
            text = "Part of the chain of \"bosses\" with connected quests you need to kill for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7287 a series of quests for The August Celestials at the Cradle of Chi-Ji .\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30725\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30727\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30728\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30732\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30733\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30734\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30735\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30736\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30737\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739 <---- YOU ARE HERE! CONGRATARU, KUPO!",
            date = "2013-01-27T15:55:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739#comments:id=1805197",
        },
        {
            id = 1779635,
            score = 33,
            author = "Balgair",
            text = "Conversation during/after the fight for anyone who missed it:\n\nEllia Ravenmane says: My hated rival... so glad you came.\nEllia Ravenmane says: Still clinging to the tailfeathers of Chi-Ji, and his idiotic notions of \"hope\"?\nEllia Ravenmane yells: I will show you the meaning of despair... and I will drag this whole island down with me!\n(You defeat her with help from Chi-Ji)\nEllia Ravenmane says: N-no...\nChi-Ji says: Well fought, student. You've proven that you truly embody my way... the Way of the Crane.\nChi-Ji says: Hope can blossom anywhere... even in this dark corner of a forgotten jungle.\nChi-Ji says: All it needs is a hero like you to plant the seed.",
            date = "2012-12-11T13:41:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739#comments:id=1779635",
        },
        {
            id = 1818975,
            score = 31,
            author = "coolderka",
            text = "those are all letters thet you recieve after each victory in Cradle of Chi-Ji:\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30725 she sends you:\n\"I refuse to accept defeat! You haven't heard the last of me!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30726 Ellia sends you:\n\"I heard you beat Minh Do-Tan. Well, I've been training, too.\nI've asked Thelonius to set up a rematch between you and I. This time, we'll see who's really the better fighter!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30727 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"Before your match today, Ellia Ravenmane swelled with hope and pride. After your victory, she lost a lot of that hope.\nYour lesson for today is that hope can turn into despair in a heartbeat. Ellia is learning this lesson the hard way.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30728 he sends you:\n\"You are strong. This is good.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30729 Fat Long-Fat sends you:\n\"Dear {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a few days ago, atop Angkhai Pavilion.\nI have a question for you. You do not need to answer me, but you should seek the answer within your mind. The question is this.\nWhy do you fight?\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30730 Fat Long-Fat sends you:\n\"Greetings {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a atop Angkhai Pavilion. I am writing to deliver some advice.\nDo not give up your training. I have spoken with Thelonius, and he will do his best to make sure you are adequately challenged. We may need to call on you in the future, and in that eventuality, you must be ready.\nI must disappear for a while. I will be in touch in the future.\nLong-Fat\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30731 Ellia sends you:\n\"I heard you beat Kuo-Na. Impressive stuff... RIVAL.\nWell, I've been training, too. And I've got a few surprises for you.\nSee you soon, {name}\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30732 Tukka-Tuk sends you:.\n\"Tukka-Tuk heard people saying you strong.\nTukka-Tuk watched you fight. Three of your fights, you just beat up little girl. Not very strong. Tukka-Tuk thinks.\nTukka-Tuk challenge you, {name}!\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30733 he sends you:.\n\"Tukka-Tuk is sorry for saying you only fight little girl. Tukka-Tuk thinks you are strong.\nTukka-Tuk hopes you win all your fights.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30734 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"I am concerned about Ellia Ravenmane. She has not appeared for her training in several days. I fear she has crossed that narrow threshold from hope into despair.\nIf you see her, let me know\n-Thelonius.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30735 Yan Quillpaw sends you:.\n\"You have defeated every student that had a chance of beating you, but you have not yet defeated me.\nI may be one of your trainers, but I am not too proud to test my skills against a student.\nI challenge you to a duel, {name}. See you in the Cradle.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30736 Fat Long-Fat sends you:.\n\"Greetings {name},\nThis is Fat Long-Fat. We fought a atop Angkhai Pavilion. Do you remember me?\nI will be returning from my absence shortly. When I return, I would like to fight with you again. Perhaps this time we fight atop Dome Balrissa?\n- Long-Fat\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30737 Thelonius sends you:.\n\"Fat Long-Fat is not what he seems. He is testing you. He is testing both of us, actually.\nYour next duel will be against me. The victor will perform a special task for the Red Crane himself.\nI haven't fought in ages. I suppose I'd better start limbering up. See you on the battlefield, {name}.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30738 Ellia sends you:\n\"I'm back, {name}\nI was a fool to follow the path of the Red Crane. You are all fools - babies, fighting over a Cradle.\nI will show you how fragile your precious Chi-Ji is. He fell once into the depths of despair. He will fall again.\"\n\nafter https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739 Chi-Ji sends you:.\n\"Under the guise of Fat Long-Fat, I once asked you, 'Why do you fight?' Some of us fight out of fear. Some fight for a sheer love of violence. Some in anger. In hatred. In doubt.\nEllia Ravenmane fought out of despair.\nBut you... I don't see any of this in you. Which is why I chose you to protect my people.\nYou will always hold a place of honor among the heroes of my order, {name}. You have our gratitude.\"",
            date = "2013-02-27T17:44:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739#comments:id=1818975",
        },
        {
            id = 1838335,
            score = 25,
            author = "LostDrewid",
            text = "So... where, exactly, is the redemption hidden in the quest title?  Ellia just says \"N-no...\" and runs off.  What redemption was there for her?  How is this worth the months-long way for Red Crane dailies to pop.  Where was the danger to Chi-Ji we were supposed to avert?  She wasn't even attacking him or anything; he shows up, absolutely fine and unharmed, when the fight is almost over.\n\nIt just... ugh, I'm sorry, I'm just so *disappointed* by this finale.  Checking the breadcrumber daily only to find day after day after week after week of White Tiger dailies, I built this chain up in my head into having some epic finale... only to leave scratching my head at the whole affair.",
            date = "2013-04-03T03:52:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30739#comments:id=1838335",
        },
    },
    [30740] = {
        {
            id = 1741026,
            score = 8,
            author = "Tharama",
            text = "I would guess that this replaces the 4th \"defeat this person\" daily for the Chi-ji dailies after you finish the chain needed to complete https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7287 (Listed by Calesta (http://www.wowhead.com/user=Calesta) on that achievement page)\n\nThis is because, you have defeated everybody already and you can't just do the chain again but a 4th daily has to exist for reputation. Thus you are just given a generic NPC to fight. Also, it gives the same rep as the other quests which strengthens my guess.\n\nEDIT: Confirmed by commenter bbzm and myself, this is the case.",
            date = "2012-10-14T02:30:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30740#comments:id=1741026",
        },
        {
            id = 5381708,
            score = 6,
            author = "Mehet",
            text = "If like me you are wondering why you can't see this quest in Karasang - it starts in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms from the Aug Celestial QM",
            date = "2022-06-05T08:09:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30740#comments:id=5381708",
        },
        {
            id = 1729160,
            score = -1,
            author = "uriahworld",
            text = "Appears to require a certain rep (such as honored or revered), there is no quest here at level 90 for me.",
            date = "2012-10-02T20:12:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30740#comments:id=1729160",
        },
    },
    [30742] = {
        {
            id = 1796948,
            score = 3,
            author = "Luhka",
            text = "Very possibly a reference to the legend of the origins of coffee - Kaldi, a goat herder is said to have discovered coffee after noticing that his goats, upon eating berries from a certain tree, became so spirited that they did not want to sleep at night.",
            date = "2013-01-11T23:20:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30742#comments:id=1796948",
        },
        {
            id = 1721622,
            score = 2,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "What is Your 'Luckeydo?' Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre][ins]+[/ins])Traffic Issues (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30616) [ins]+[/ins])Oil Stop (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30614) [ins]+[/ins])A Grummle's Luck (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30808)\n       \\          ||         /\n       a)Roadside Assistance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30617)\n\n   [ins]+[/ins])The Burlap Trail: To Burlap Waystation (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30592)\n   /                 \\\nb)The Rabbitsfoot (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30602)    b)The Broketooth Ravage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30603)──>c)Breaking Broketooth (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30604)\n ||            ┌───────┤\nc)A Monkey Idol (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30599)      c)No Pack Left Behind (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30600)\n   \\                 /\n   d)Bros Before Hozen (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30605)──>d)Thumping Knucklethump (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30606)\n   /                 \\\nd)The Snackrifice (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30608)    d)Hozen Love Their Keys (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30607)\n                └┬───┬┘\ne)Unleash The Yeti! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30611) e)Grummle! Grummle! Grummle! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30610)\n   \\                /\n   e)The Leader Hozen (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30612)\n   f)The Burlap Trail: To Kota Basecamp (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30692)\n\n[ins]+[/ins])Kota Blend (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30744){ver2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30825)} [ins]+[/ins])Trouble Brewing (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30745){ver2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30826)} [ins]+[/ins])Gourmet Kafa (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743){ver2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30824)}\ng)A Fair Trade (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30746)\nh)The Burlap Grind (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30747)                         [ins]+[/ins])Shut it Down (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30742){ver2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30823)}\n[ins]D[/ins])The Burlap Grind (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30821)\n\nLegend:\nD means Daily\n+ means Can start anytime, prequests not needed.[/pre]\n\nKota camp have second version of quests, they start from the other side of the mountain.",
            date = "2012-09-27T09:31:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30742#comments:id=1721622",
        },
        {
            id = 5390517,
            score = 1,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60596, in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30742:\nIt's hard work cutting seeds out of kafa berries!\nBut I noticed goots eat the berries up and give back the seeds... in a day or so.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60596, in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743:\nIt was genius: kafa berries go in the goot, seeds come out.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60503 occasionally to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60596, while standing nearby them:\nThis is what happen when you get lazy.\n\nI was actually impressed with the idea: it's difficult work for a Grummle to do, but it's so easy and natural for the groot... so why not let nature take care of the hard part?\nIt's called \"efficiency\"! Too many people like old https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60503 here mistake efficiency with laziness.\nThey mistake brilliance in the creation of these efficient new methods for simple laziness.\nHe's only complaining because it didn't work out and now all the groots are caffeinated out their arses.\nBut if it had worked, he'd be commending https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60596 on his ingenuity!\n\nMoral of this Story:\nDon't listen to people when they call you lazy.\nYour boss calls you into their office to tell you that you need to stop being so lazy?\nTell them they're mistaken -- you're being efficient, not lazy.\nAnd if it looks like your efficiency isn't paying off and is perceived to be causing problems, well...\n\"When in Rome!\"\n\"All roads lead to Rome!\"\n\"Rome wasn't built in a day!\"",
            date = "2022-06-30T00:16:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30742#comments:id=5390517",
        },
    },
    [30743] = {
        {
            id = 1683218,
            score = 40,
            author = "Eralson",
            text = "Obligatory poop quest. But now that we've saved the world from Ragnaros, Nefarian, C'thun, Kel'Thuzad, Kael'thas Sunstrider, Illidan Stormrage, Kil'Jaedan, Kel'Thuzad again, Malygos, Sartharion, Yogg-Saron, Zombie Anub'arak, the Lich King, Halion, Zombie Nefarian, Cho'gall, Al'Akir, Ragnaros again, and Deathwing, the NPCs finally acknowledge that actually picking it up is below our pay grade.\n\nTough crowd.",
            date = "2012-07-01T06:56:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743#comments:id=1683218",
        },
        {
            id = 1672715,
            score = 27,
            author = "Cielos",
            text = "I'm guessing this is a reference to Kopi Luwak (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kopi_Luwak), the most expensive coffee in the world which is produced by the same means.",
            date = "2012-06-02T12:20:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743#comments:id=1672715",
        },
        {
            id = 2368397,
            score = 11,
            author = "Dougeh",
            text = "Fun fact:  You can just mash right-click and get all 15 poops marked on a single pile as of the time of my writing this.",
            date = "2016-08-15T17:31:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743#comments:id=2368397",
        },
        {
            id = 1720944,
            score = 8,
            author = "Mormolyce",
            text = "Hear that guys? We're finally past the poop-scooping stage of our adventuring career!",
            date = "2012-09-26T23:31:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30743#comments:id=1720944",
        },
        {
            id = 1721610,
            score = 6,
            author = "Whiterock",
