        },
        {
            id = 1724479,
            score = 36,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "Sha in the Monastery Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre]The Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}* Barrels of Fun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30651){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656)* Pandaren Prisoners (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30650){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30655)*\n                           └──────┼───────────────┘\nCall Out Their Leader (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30457)* [ins]S[/ins])The Shado-Pan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31455){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31453) Hit Medicine (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30460)* All of the Arrows (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30459)*\n ||                  └────┐        ||       /             /\na)Turnabout (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30670)             a)The Defense of Shado-Pan Fallback (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30665)    [ins]+[/ins])Holed Up (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30682)\na)Unmasking the Yaungol (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30690)\nb)To Winter's Blossom (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30699)\n ||                \\\nb)A Line Unbroken (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30715) b)Honor, Even in Death (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30723)\n    \\             /\n    b)To the Wall! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30724)\n    /             \\\nc)Off the Wall! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30750)   c)A Terrible Sacrifice (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30751)\n ||                /\nd)Lao-Chin's Gambit (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30994)\nd)Do a Barrel Roll! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30991)\nd)Finish This! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30992)──────>My Husband... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30768)*\n ||\nf)Where are My Reinforcements? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993)\nf)Unbelievable! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30752)\n[ins]S[/ins])Into the Monastery (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31030){backup version (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31031)}(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n[ins]#[/ins])Lord of the Shado-Pan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757)(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n\n[ins]#[/ins])The Path to Respect Lies in Violence (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31342)(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n\nLegend:\nS means Skippable\n+ means Can start anytime, prequests not needed.\n{H} means Quest Have Horde Variant, click {H} for it.\n* means another Quest Tree.[/pre]\n\nYes, there are SUCH WEIRD prequests, even more weird that it have breadcumb with other prequests.",
            date = "2012-09-29T12:12:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30752#comments:id=1724479",
        },
        {
            id = 2148766,
            score = 36,
            author = "Grumsta",
            text = "I wasn't able to start part of this quest line as the \"breadcrumb\" bit didn't show up in the Loremaster add-on.\n\nHowever I stubbornly flew around until I found a \"!\" at 44.49 89.92 (Shado-Master Chung).\n\nThat gave me the \"To Winters Blossom\" quest and I finished in a few minutes.",
            date = "2015-03-31T14:16:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30752#comments:id=2148766",
        },
        {
            id = 5865664,
            score = 17,
            author = "Jbishhh",
            text = "If you already started the Winters blossom area and can't find any more quests, check in the top of the tower at /way 29 61 .\n Talk to the NPC to fly you back and a new quest will open up to ride the barrels into catapults at the gate.",
            date = "2024-05-25T04:47:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30752#comments:id=5865664",
        },
        {
            id = 1750118,
            score = 9,
            author = "771987",
            text = "After killing the guard for this quest I saw Ban with a completed quest icon over his head...then he disappeared. I couldn't find him. I decided it was a phasing thing so I tried getting into the Monastery (through the instance entrance). And that fixed it. It wouldn't let me get in the instance...as soon as it loaded back up he was next to me.\n\nSo if you're having issues with it...try that.",
            date = "2012-10-25T09:36:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30752#comments:id=1750118",
        },
    },
    [30757] = {
        {
            id = 1735028,
            score = 31,
            author = "296074",
            text = "To complete this you must save all FIVE souls from the bodies BEFORE you kill the boss. Four of the bodies are along the path, but one of the bodies is behind a group of mobs that you can easily skip. This group is right outside of the temple, before the little island that leads to the boss. Kill that group, save the souls, then kill the boss. Booyah.",
            date = "2012-10-07T23:35:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757#comments:id=1735028",
        },
        {
            id = 1757824,
            score = 25,
            author = "762672",
            text = "Frustrating, one of these daft quests that you have to google to find out that you can't get it and only realize after you've finished.  The blue quest reward and half million xp won't be yours this time.\n\nYou then go back and travel around the big instance fruitlessly.  The end point with the ? is shut off from you.\n\nThen you come to a page like this and wonder why they STILL make quests like this.",
            date = "2012-11-05T19:11:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757#comments:id=1757824",
        },
        {
            id = 1849441,
            score = 9,
            author = "tworley210",
            text = "The quest says free Taran Zhu of the sha.  Not free this or that soul.  I hate quests with unspecified requirements.  Battle ticket on this the GameMaster first told me \"havent completed the quest.\"  The second complaint I get referred me here. Sheesh.  What a crock.",
            date = "2013-05-02T22:42:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757#comments:id=1849441",
        },
        {
            id = 1872330,
            score = 5,
            author = "BBB545",
            text = "Did the quest today. During my first run we didn't free all the souls. The quest log said the quest was complete but i couldn't turn in the quest.\n\nI opened a GM ticket. The GM explained you need to free all the souls to be able to turn in the quest. (The quest doesn't mention this).\n\nDid a second run after that and freed all the souls. This time I could turn in the quest.",
            date = "2013-06-30T14:45:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757#comments:id=1872330",
        },
        {
            id = 1724430,
            score = 4,
            author = "1037844",
            text = "You will get out of combat (and thus be able to loot the chest) if you run around and kill all those purple orbs in the boss area.. However I have not discovered a fix yet for turning in the quest. :\\",
            date = "2012-09-29T11:37:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757#comments:id=1724430",
        },
    },
