        {
            id = 5687885,
            score = 5,
            author = "tooltip",
            text = "Look for Virtos in front of Stormwind Keep and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=77408 if you're trying to do the quest line for unlocking the man'ari customization for draenei.\n\n(Adventure Journal had it labeled as \"Seeing Red\" because of the achievement of the same name. Dumb execution, Blizzard.)",
