            text = "I can't even do the quest.  There's nothing to click on that I can see and I didn't get a quest item.",
            date = "2012-07-27T23:15:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30776#comments:id=1692976",
        },
        {
            id = 1760562,
            score = 4,
            author = "168688",
            text = "Any suggestions on how to fight this guy? It's not flagged as a \"Group\" quest, yet I'm on my 4th toon, a rogue (I've leveled a mage, pally and druid) and every one of them got their asses handed to them. I would think you would get to keep the 4 guys who helped you on the previous quests.",
            date = "2012-11-10T22:56:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30776#comments:id=1760562",
        },
        {
            id = 1693627,
            score = 2,
