        {
            id = 1719081,
            score = 1,
            author = "dreedo",
            text = "The Blood aint guaranteed to drop. And the low spawn rate makes this quest a pain in the ass.\n\nEdit: Whats the reason for downrating this? pure info..",
            date = "2012-09-25T18:38:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30791#comments:id=1719081",
        },
        {
            id = 1721440,
            score = 1,
            author = "Reixes",
            text = "I'm not entirely sure if this was the correct way to go about completing this quest, but after killing many rodents without getting any bloods, I started trying new things out of desperation. Whenever I killed the rodents by any of the geysers used for the \"Orbiss Fades\" quest, it was then they I seemed to get the bloods at a more constant rate, though whether this was by pure coincidence or luck I'm not so sure. Can anyone else corroborate this?",
            date = "2012-09-27T07:22:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30791#comments:id=1721440",
        },
    },
