            text = "The Opalescent Blue Crab Shell drops from the crabs around the quest giver. It has a low drop rate. I killed 10 crabs before I got it.\n\nThe Stolen Pandaren Spices can be found in barrels in the mercenary camp at nearby area of 61,21, or they can be looted from the blackmane mercenaries directly. The mercenaries do not always drop supplies, however.",
