            score = 1,
            author = "Bogdanov89",
            text = "As of patch 5.3 you only get a \"kill count\" increase for about 1 out of 4 Charges you kill.\n\nI tried killing both the 100% hp ones that were standing still, the near death ones that are fighting and the 100% hp ones that are fighting - none of them gave consistent quest progress.\n\nJust kill EVERY charger you find, after about 30 kills you will get the 8/8 done.",
            date = "2013-06-12T08:10:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30814#comments:id=1865618",
        },
        {
