            text = "Two Empires Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre]Barrels of Fun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30651){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656)* Pandaren Prisoners (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30650){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30655)* The Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}*\n                \\      ||        ┌─────────┘\n                [ins]S[/ins])Cho's Missive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31460){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31459)\n                [ins]+[/ins])Path Less Traveled (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30999)\n                /      ||           └─────┐\na)Resupplying One Keg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30618) a)Instant Courage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30601) a)They Stole My Luck! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30621)\n                \\      ||                 ||\n                b)Comin' Round the Mountain (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30487)\n                b)One Traveler's Misfortune (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30683)\n                b)Seeker's Folly (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30684)\n                /               \\\nd)It Was Almost Alive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30797)           c)The Tongue of Ba-Shon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30829)\nf)The Tomb of Shadows (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30799)           d)Staying Connected (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30795)\ng)Breaking the Emperor's Shield (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30798) d)An End to Everything (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30796)\nh)Stealing Their Thunder King (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30800)\nh)Lessons from History (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30801)\nh)Chasing the Storm (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30802)\ni)Fisherman's Tale (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30935)────────────┬─>j)Make A Fighter Out of Me (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30942)\n ||  ||    ||                    ||                 ||\n ||  ||  