        {
            id = 1741277,
            score = 18,
            author = "InsaneHacker",
            text = "Interestingly, the quest tooltips say \"Lorekeeper Cho\" instead of Lorewalker Cho, is this a bug or am i missing something?\n\nEDIT: To people complaining that this has nothing to do with how to complete the quest, at least it's something related to the game, i'm just trying to point out a potential mistake that blizzard has made, nothing more. I don't see people complaining when comments about references to TV shows and such fills the comment section.",
