            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30829#comments:id=1741277",
        },
        {
            id = 1875378,
            score = 17,
            author = "Driva",
            text = "Right after punching Ba-Shon in the face, but before turning in the quest to Lorewalker Cho I saw a rope on the ground and thought, \"Hey, what's this?\" If you are as forgetful as me, I recommend you suppress your curiosity, since it starts the end cinematics for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32816 and makes Lorewalker Cho disappear. If you leave Seeker's Point and come back however, he will be waiting there for you again.\n\nI'm sure there's no rope on the ground if you haven't completed that quest.",
            date = "2013-07-10T05:04:47-05:00",
