            date = "2013-02-10T13:20:03-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30883#comments:id=1811890",
        },
        {
            id = 1763438,
            score = 5,
            author = "zharshoul",
            text = "remember not only does he have the power of determination and an indomitable will, and the strength of a mountain\n\nhe has the most important thing a fighter needs\n\nno, not friends\n\nno not a trainer\n\nno not a nutritionist\n\nthe most important tool in a fighters arsenal is\n\nA MASK!",
            date = "2012-11-16T16:46:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30883#comments:id=1763438",
        },
        {
            id = 1756967,
            score = 3,
            author = "NobodyYouKnow",
            text = "If you get a killing blow on him just as he grabs you, he'll toss you, then charge you, then come back with 100% hp. At that point you can fight him again (but only if you want too), or you can run away, or do something else that makes you exit combat. You don't need to kill him two or more times; you'll get credit for killing him the first time.",
            date = "2012-11-04T11:54:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30883#comments:id=1756967",
        },
        {
            id = 1828044,
            score = 3,
