            text = "No one's reacting to the big Game of Thrones reference here? You get a quote, from the Night's Watch each time you talk to a pandaren. Came here to see witch ones since i only remember two of them:\n\n\"We are the shadows on the wall\"\n\n\"I am the sword in the darkness\".",
