            author = "Visceron",
            text = "Name of mob to kill is Needlebottom. Spawns at 63,87.",
            date = "2012-09-28T22:00:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30897#comments:id=1723641",
        },
        {
            id = 1797755,
            score = 5,
            author = "love45acp",
            text = "Keep an eye out for https://www.wowhead.com/item=86472 as you're going to find the mini-boss. I found it on the right hand side of the largest pool of water, prior to going up the last hill to find Needlebottom.",
            date = "2013-01-13T08:34:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30897#comments:id=1797755",
        },
        {
            id = 3289596,
            score = 5,
            author = "alsoascientist",
            text = "This is honestly one of my favourite quests in the game purely because of the story it tells in so few words. You can tell this guy comes from a loving home and wants to do his best to protect Pandaria and make his mum proud. She clearly loves the little guy and it actually broke my heart to take the https://www.wowhead.com/item=88586 from him as a reward... I bet he's been saving them as a treat ever since he was posted away!",
            date = "2021-01-12T10:51:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30897#comments:id=3289596",
        },
        {
            id = 2336363,
