            text = "Beautiful sword model. It is a shame that there isn't (yet) a model for us to use.",
            date = "2016-06-02T04:33:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30897#comments:id=2336363",
        },
        {
            id = 1777234,
