            text = "Bugged for me as well... Lost Zhu somewhere along the way, and Taoshi stopped just before the destination camp, the moment she said \"Do you feel that?\". The quest hung there. I returned to the questgiver, abandoned, and did it again.",
            date = "2014-03-01T00:22:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30901#comments:id=1947560",
