            author = "Chew",
            text = "I am really glad that this fight is pretty easy because ...\n... I just could not stop laughing !\n\na few quotes from them:\nHackiss says: But... but... I needed that gear...\n\nHealiss yiells: Help! It's on my face!\nHealiss yiells: Ah! Facefull of !\nHealiss says: Out of mana...\nHealiss says: Tankiss... too... squishy...\nHealiss says: Tankiss... get a shield!\nHealiss says: Lousy... tank...\n\nTankiss says: Where are my heals you scrub-chinned-lizard-nub?\nTankiss says: Start healing you filthy snakehead!\nTankiss says: Healiss, heal me, you mogu loving pond drinker!\nTankiss says: Healiss, keep up on the heals you mushan lips!\nTankiss says: Where... were... my heals?\nTankiss says: Healiss... you failed!\nTankiss says: Need... better... healer...\nTankiss says: Ah! My cooldowns!\nTankiss says: Why did it have to be a ?\n\nPriceless !\n\nEdit: added a few more quotes",
            date = "2012-10-14T21:25:20-05:00",
