            author = "dreedo",
            text = "For this quest all you have to do is kill mobs while your friend, the shadow panda will search their bodies while you kill them.\n\nSo all you have to do is kill all the bugs you see till you got all 4 clues.\nBut be aware, they hit like a truck!",
