        {
            id = 2016605,
            score = 20,
            author = "1363331",
            text = "I don't have coordinates, but I found the supplies with the red arrows no problem.  Ran all over, fighting like crazy to find the weapons.  Watched a Youtube video showing me where they were, no arrows, blew it up anyway, nothing.  Reset the quest and started over, destroyed the supplies, and again no arrows for the weapons.  Set up bomb inside the fenced area across the courtyard from the supplies, in front of the building with steps, and it worked.  Never did see any weapons, and never seen any red arrows, but after setting several random bombs throughout town, I did blow them up and got credit.",
            date = "2014-10-20T17:41:58-05:00",
