        {
            id = 1757642,
            score = 6,
            author = "MountainKing",
            text = "When doing this quest, my character had loot lag while trying to loot the turtles.  He'd bend down to pick up the shell fragments and then get stuck.  (I guess when you hit 90, it's not as easy to stand up anymore.)\n\nIn any case, to get around this, I killed the Mushan close to where I'd killed the turtles and loot them instead.  This way I'd get the loot from both corpses and not get stuck in loot lag.  Hope this helps anyone else having the same problem.",
