            author = "1105358",
            text = "[ins]To make this go even faster, do the following:\n\n1. Go as close to the edge as you can\n2. use a long range attack/something that causes aggro (40 range-ish) and aim at the mobs flying in from the other side of the valley\n3. profit*\n\nThe mobs will - if you are lucky - plummet into the valley below\n[/ins]",
