            author = "Newara",
            text = "My best advice: Don't aoe too many, you will die. Go for the ones who already have low hp due to fighting NPC's and last but not less important: Avoid the dang AOE attack that knocks you back. Submitted screenshot.\n\nEdited to clear up something: AOE can be used against the mobs. It will knock them back and do damage as well. Just try to time it so  you dont get the damage.",
