        {
            id = 5861552,
            score = 10,
            author = "Moppentoff",
            text = "In WoW Remix, spamming it too quickly seems to disconnect you. It might be the sheer amount of damage you do (40-60 million per hit at 60-70)",
            date = "2024-05-21T16:16:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30978#comments:id=5861552",
        },
        {
            id = 6401353,
            score = 10,
            author = "Velsae",
            text = "This quest is very bugged at the moment. For a second I was afraid this bug would lock me out of my Loremaster achievement. Bullets from the cannon pass right through mobs and only explode at maximum range or when striking solid terrain, making the mobs impossible to kill normally. However, there is a workaround.\n\nThe mobs come in swarms. I managed to kill 50 swarmers by spamming the shoot key aimed at the upper branches of the second tree from the left. The AoE from the exploding bullets will kill 1 to 5 swarmers per group, so it might take some time.\n\nSelecting a boss and shooting just below his hitbox circle didn't work for me. Eventually, I got tired of endlessly shooting at the boss and trying to figure out which spot on his hitbox would register a hit, so I alt-tabbed out of the game (with the cannon still active and my character holding it) and went AFK. I came back 10 minutes later to see that the quest had somehow completed itself. So my advice would be to pick up the cannon, shoot at the boss for a bit, and then go AFK? Lol.",
            date = "2026-08-17T17:06:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30978#comments:id=6401353",
        },
    },
    [30979] = {
        {
