            author = "Nourishment",
            text = "These fellas are all around Ragefire Chasm - under rocks, hanging off of ledges and inside crates. They are the objective of the quest 'No Orc Left Behind', which is obtainable at the beginning of the instance (Horde only).\n\nThe quest gives the explanation that they were inside Ragefire Chasm to 'clean up a few troggs' and to ensure there was no threat to the city of Orgrimmar. As of patch 5.6, we now know that wasn't entirely true ...",
