    [30993] = {
        {
            id = 5857694,
            score = 693,
            author = "W3r3w0lf",
            text = "if you're here in remix and find out it's bugged, just fly to where the quest should be turned in and log out and in and you will be able to hand it in.",
            date = "2024-05-17T02:49:26-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993#comments:id=5857694",
        },
        {
            id = 1683294,
            score = 64,
            author = "zealvurte",
            text = "This is bugged (in several ways), but can be worked around.\n\nAfter you tell Ban you are ready, you both ride up to the balloon, and Ban waits for you to tell him to leave, Ban will jump into the balloon. You should also be placed in the balloon, and a cinematic should begin; however, this sometimes fails to happen, with Ban simply staying in the balloon, doing his talk, with the balloon not moving and you still standing outside it. Abandoning the quest to try again alone won't help, and you will just produce multiple Bans and balloons (side effect of this is that each Ban will buff you with an earth shield, allowing you to have as many on you as you want.)\n\nIf you abandon and repeat the same steps, before talking to Ban to leave in the balloon, simply exit the game/log out. This appears to fix the issue.\n\nAs to the volume of Ban's dialogue, hopefully Blizzard will fix that in time.",
            date = "2012-07-01T12:25:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993#comments:id=1683294",
        },
        {
            id = 5863038,
            score = 47,
            author = "globalmenace",
            text = "Blizz, nobody really expects you to deliver quality anymore, you've made it clear over the years that you don't care. We got that.\n\nBut: For a \"Remix\", a sort of a new edition, slapping the same old bugs we have been reporting for the last 10 years right in our faces is just a complete lack of respect towards your players.",
            date = "2024-05-22T18:15:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993#comments:id=5863038",
        },
        {
            id = 1827697,
            score = 24,
            author = "TheRealSaiph",
            text = "I originally posted this as a reply to someone else, but I thought it might be a good idea to make it a separate post so that more people get to see it.\n\nAs of 5.2.0, this quest is still bugged, but in a slightly different way than before. However, it is possible to complete the quest, and keep the quest chain going. To achieve this, go through the following steps:\n\nAfter talking to Ban, he will mount up and ride up the hill to the balloon. However, when you both get there, he will disappear, and leave you unable to use the balloon.\n\nAt this point, use your own mount and fly to the Shado-Pan Monastery. When you get there, you will see Ban and the balloon standing outside the front of the building.\n\nTalk to Ban, and this will complete the section of the quest \"Tell Ban you are ready to leave\".\n\nYou will now hop into the balloon, and your flight will begin. The cinematic will play, Ban will give his speech, and the balloon will simply go up vertically and come down again in the same place.\n\nWhen you get back to the ground, hop out and talk to Ban again, and this will complete the quest.\n\nI know it sounds weird, taking a balloon journey when you're already at your destination, but it works!",
            date = "2013-03-12T21:22:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993#comments:id=1827697",
        },
        {
            id = 5866954,
            score = 17,
            author = "Skoomawaffles",
            text = "EXTREMELY BUGGED. So it will take many many tries , including redoing, if not that, go into the portal in the dungeon nearby and leave. It finally worked and let me turn it in.  Lot of old content very buggy",
            date = "2024-05-27T02:42:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30993#comments:id=5866954",
        },
    },
