        {
            id = 1811902,
            score = 1,
            author = "1071155",
            text = "It's a pretty simple quest that took me quite a while to figure out for some reason. First\ni thought there was a bug and you can loot from the racks.. Just kill Shek'zeer Bladesworn..\n\nThough bare in mind it won't always drop. It drops randomly , I'm guessing 40% Chance.\nSometimes it drops every other time than 2 times.. Never more than 3 for me...\nIt is actually a very simple quest and probably the second most simple in the quest group..\n\n Breezeofholy@Darkspear",
            date = "2013-02-10T13:44:37-06:00",
