            score = 42,
            author = "784507",
            text = "I received this quest as soon as I hit Revered with the Klaxxi. Kills give Black Prince rep. Turn in gives Klaxxi rep and opens three new quests.\n\nThe entrance may be found at 29.0,42.5 in the Venomous Ledge of Dread Wastes. For those without coords, that is just east of Heart of Fear - look for Dread Scarabs all over.\n\nWhen you enter, there are four chambers surrounding the main room. Moving counterclockwise, you will find:\n\nIkkess - Sonic Boom (counter spell and silences), Sonic Blast (damage, stun), Sonic Burst (AoE damage, silence)\n\nEk'Vem - Venom Splash (Poison AoE, nature damage every 3 seconds), Venom Bolt (targeted attack), Venom Sting (targeted DoT)\n\nSuruz - Tornado (interrupts - can be blinked out of), Focused strikes (melee damage), Wind Blast (damage, knock back)\n\nTzikzi - Insect Swarm (decreased hit chance, damage), Summon Enslaved Harvester - If you have Angel of Death Enhancement on, the Wind-Reaver will come to kill the adds.\n\nAfter you have killed all four of the Adjuncts, click on the amber in the central chamber. Xaril the Poisoned Mind gives a speech, then you follow...(her? him?) it outside for turn in.\n\n**Completed on a lvl 90 mage with no problems other than the fact that leaving a chamber will reset the Adjunct, so I had to fight Ek'Vem twice. All the Adjuncts can be polymorphed for easy setup for the fight.**\n\n------------------------------------------------SPOILER-----------------------------------------------------\n\n\"You came not a moment too soon, Wakener. The Adjuncts would have destroyed me as I slept.\n\nEven in my dreams, I could hear their dark thought...HER dark thoughts.\n\nThe Empress fears her own undoing, yet fear itself is her undoing. She is gone beyond the edge of madness.\n\nWait. The Klaxxi speak to me. Yes, Council, I have heard the Empress's intentions. Her reign must end.\n\nTell me no more, Council. I will see my old home with my own eyes. I would gaze upon the ruin that Shek'zeer has wrought.\n\nThere is much punishment to deliver for the empire's crimes. We have no time to waste, Wakener. Meet me outside.\"\n\n-Xaril the Poisoned Mind",
            date = "2012-10-18T00:57:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31018#comments:id=1744489",
        },
        {
            id = 1793338,
            score = 32,
            author = "Myrroddin",
            text = "Here is the TomTom coordinates for the cave entrance\n/way 29.2 42.4 The Amber Womb",
            date = "2013-01-05T22:02:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31018#comments:id=1793338",
        },
