            date = "2013-04-14T05:29:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31019#comments:id=1842949",
        },
        {
            id = 1850442,
            score = 30,
            author = "1107819",
            text = "To be more specific, if your standing at edge of water looking at a fallen log and the dead Mushan, go left. There will be a big mound of dirt. (The Vermin hole) with a tree behind it. Thats it, jump in!",
            date = "2013-05-06T00:18:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31019#comments:id=1850442",
        },
        {
