    [31026] = {
        {
            id = 1747057,
            score = 20,
            author = "1048125",
            text = "The entrance to Coldbite Burrow can be found at coords 58.7, 59.5\n\nAvoid the purple eggs or they will hatch into baby spawns and you will have to kill them. Not bad if you only have one or two, but if you trample over all of them you're gonna have a problem.",
            date = "2012-10-21T09:00:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31026#comments:id=1747057",
        },
        {
            id = 1677605,
            score = 18,
            author = "ldene",
            text = "She's located under a tree (hence root :D), its west of the Lake of Stars (if u look at the zone map, it's where the road makes a loop). Careful as you enter as the eggs will spawn level 88/99 Coldbite Spawn (miniature crocs).",
            date = "2012-06-17T09:38:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31026#comments:id=1677605",
        },
        {
            id = 1754002,
            score = 10,
            author = "642952",
            text = "UBRS Rookery... We meet again...\nLeeeeeeeeeeeeeroy !1",
            date = "2012-10-30T18:53:50-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31026#comments:id=1754002",
        },
        {
            id = 1788189,
            score = 4,
            author = "685841",
            text = "I can't believe nobody found any easter eggs in this quest. For those wondering, while not official, there's a truly easy link to be made with Zelda: Ocarina of Time.\n\nFrom the quest text:\n\nKypari Zar is dying.\n\nA creature of terrible darkness corrupts it from deep beneath its roots.\n\nThe tree cannot be saved, but at least we can lessen its pain.\n\nLook. The vile creature has carved a path to its own lair. We need only follow it down the hill, just behind this tower.\n\nNow, when we take a look at Zelda OOT, the 1st dungeon you have to do is Inside the Deku Tree. Basically what's happening is that the tree has been cursed by Ganondorf and that you must go inside of it to kill the curse (Queen Gohma). Once it is done, you go out and speak to the tree, who\nwill none the less die, but with eased pain. In this quest, you go into a cursed tree, with a boss that spawn adds from the eggs like Gohma, and when it is done the tree die too, but with eased pain. In that version the enemy is the sha and not ganondorf; yet they both represent pure evil.\n\nThis is why I love wow.",
            date = "2012-12-27T14:30:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31026#comments:id=1788189",
        },
        {
            id = 1807530,
            score = 2,
            author = "Peter4730",
            text = "Okay, so I found the deep cave where the Matriarch hides, and killed her with Korven's help.  At this point, some n00b came in on my tail, upset everyone (me) with HIS helper, so I was trying to click on TWO yellow ?'s at one time ........ End result, bloody Korven has stayed behind forever fighting the big croc.  Had to get outa there.  Left him behind.  Now, quest says, meet him at Lake of Stars, but HE tells me to meet him at KlaxxiVess.  Just a warning in case is bugged",
            date = "2013-02-01T04:33:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31026#comments:id=1807530",
        },
    },
