)}(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n[ins]#[/ins])Lord of the Shado-Pan (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30757)(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n\n[ins]#[/ins])The Path to Respect Lies in Violence (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31342)(Shado-Pan Monastery)\n\nLegend:\nS means Skippable\n+ means Can start anytime, prequests not needed.\n{H} means Quest Have Horde Variant, click {H} for it.\n* means another Quest Tree.[/pre]\n\nYes, there are SUCH WEIRD prequests, even more weird that it have breadcumb with other prequests.",
