            id = 1881637,
            score = 5,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "The new version of Ragefire Chasm for orcs, trolls and goblins. Tauren get their own version, given to them by Baine Bloodhoof here (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31036) and undead get their own version from  Lady Sylvanas Windrunner here (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31037)\n\nOddly, there does not appear to be a lead-in for Blood Elves for this quest. Pandaren should have no problem, since like goblins, they are directed to Orgimmar after their starter zone.",
