        {
            id = 1975299,
            score = 2,
            author = "manveru",
            text = "Freeing the cloudrunners has no casting time. As soon as you right click on the ball and chain the cloudrunner has been released and you are free to move on. Thus, I have found that the fastest way to do this quest is to run from cloudrunner to cloudrunner clicking the ball and chain, ignoring any mobs I run in to and all mobs chasing me. After I have 6, I run off the edge of the cliff into the water. A few seconds of swimming and they will stop chasing, and I can mount up and fly away. Makes the whole quest take only a few seconds.",
            date = "2014-06-26T19:41:45-05:00",
