    [31062] = {
        {
            id = 1747181,
            score = 18,
            author = "Eclipsegirl",
            text = "The first time I did this, I thought the NPC on the highest mountain, with lots of lightening , and dragonkin, was the target.\nIT IS NOT!\nThat NPC wil  kill you quickly, and I took rezz sickness because I couldnt get up the mountain to recover my corpse.\n\nYou are looking for an NPC that is a tad NW of the highest peak.\nHe is in a clearing, with quillen",
            date = "2012-10-21T12:19:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31062#comments:id=1747181",
        },
        {
            id = 1748771,
            score = 6,
            author = "731235",
            text = "/way 32,3 9,6",
            date = "2012-10-23T14:32:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31062#comments:id=1748771",
        },
        {
            id = 1909889,
            score = 3,
            author = "Madr",
            text = "Doing this quest as a level 90, fairly decently geared (so I thought) iLvl 492 fire mage, I found it very difficult to survive this fight.  After you accept the quest, your Shado-Pan \"sidekick\" abandons you, leaving you to do this last Shado-Pan daily in the series solo.\n\nThe strategy that ultimately worked for me:\n\nFirst, stand near the edge of the area and do your best to pick off the quillen one at a time. (This will aggro other quillen nearby, but it's not a problem as they have weak health pools and can be AoE'd.)\n\nThen take care of any Beastmaster or Serpentbinder that may be nearby with his combat pet(s).\n\nFinally, take on the Deathspeaker himself.  He will summon gems; attack the gems.  Stay out of the purple patterns on the ground which the Deathspeaker casts.  Attack the Deathspeaker between your attacks on the gems.\n\nFor an elite, he goes down fairly quickly, and does only moderate damage on his own.  As long as the trash is cleared out before the fight, and you attack the gems, it can be soloed even as a clothie.  If I could do it, anyone can (fire mage being possibly the least survivable class/spec; cloth, no heals like a priest, and no pet like a frost mage or warlock).\n\nEDIT: I did this again the next day on a different toon, and my Shado-Pan \"sidekick\" stayed with me for the quest, making it an absolute piece of cake.  Not sure why she abandoned me when I did it the first time.",
            date = "2013-10-18T17:16:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31062#comments:id=1909889",
        },
        {
            id = 1956746,
            score = 1,
            author = "Wimbleton",
            text = "This quest has one big risk - the Goofmaster blows you off the side of the mountain with his...uh..instawind generator? Then you die but you can't get back to your corpse because it's stuck in between the mountain and Hoboken, so you have to take rez sickness, which means you can't finish the quest and you lose a day in the grind, not to mention all those expensive buffs. Good thinking from Irvine. Must be the medical marijuana thing.\n\nJust be prepared ahead of time and make sure he doesn't blow you into the elite either; keep your back to the hill. If you stay on the hill, you will prevail. The elite is tough but not that tough. Make sure you kill and do not loot all the adds ahead of time. If you're a little tight on time, don't risk it - just don't take this quest.",
            date = "2014-04-07T12:42:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31062#comments:id=1956746",
        },
        {
            id = 5876033,
            score = 1,
            author = "ekrietlow",
            text = "This quest, as well as MOTIVES OF THE MANTID and SET THE MANTID BACK are currently complete in my log, but the questgivers are phased out.  Flying in after taking the portal to Shan'ze Dao as fast as I could I was able to turn in a couple from this group but the NPCs phased back out.  Still not sure what is holding me back.",
            date = "2024-06-06T21:30:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31062#comments:id=5876033",
        },
    },
