            author = "Eclipsegirl",
            text = "For me, a clothie, I couldnt just kill one or two of mobs and sneak into the the back to kill Azzik.\nI have to kill a few of the adds in the center.\nWhen you pull Azzik, you usually get one of the center mobs aggroing into the fight.\nAnd the enhancement REAVE wasnt triggered - ugh",
