        {
            id = 1733019,
            score = -3,
            author = "1041515",
            text = "May be a glitch, but some of the worms popped up when there was no dust cloud.  I couldn't kill it either.  I finally found one that had a dust cloud and was able to kill it, but there was only one.  At one point, there were 3 worms that I couldn't target that popped up.  Gonna turn that in cause that ain't right.",
