        {
            id = 1763900,
            score = 24,
            author = "Myrroddin",
            text = "For TomTom users, here is the entrance:\n/way 46.42 52.84 Amberglow Hollow",
            date = "2012-11-17T17:37:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31087#comments:id=1763900",
        },
        {
            id = 1726230,
            score = 14,
            author = "rzzr",
            text = "It's worth saying that there are 2 Singing trails, one high and one low. The gears appear seem to appear on the high one (see map above) because he is in a cave. basically if you are on top of the cliff you are on the wrong trail and need to be nearer the sea where the lower trail is.",
