        {
            id = 1984350,
            score = 35,
            author = "Kurasu",
            text = "If you do not complete this quest before you do the 'Traitor' quest, the replacement NPC will *not* accept the items. You have to drop the old quests and get the new ones: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31680.",
            date = "2014-07-25T07:43:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31088#comments:id=1984350",
        },
        {
            id = 5876189,
            score = 17,
            author = "DCCXVIII",
            text = "So you're doing this in mop remix and wondering why tf doesn't the turn in NPC let you complete the quests. Apparently you can't turn in both \"Crime and Punishment\" and [quest=31090 domain=www] at the same time. You have to first do \"Crime and Punishment\". Turn it in. THEN pickup and do [quest=31090 domain=www]. Can't do both quests at once.",
            date = "2024-06-07T06:16:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31088#comments:id=5876189",
        },
        {
