            text = "Also make sure you have the cleave guy enhancement.  he will one shot them all",
            date = "2012-10-02T00:00:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31109#comments:id=1728079",
        },
        {
            id = 1852548,
            score = 26,
            author = "CataBreed",
            text = "My wife and I encountered a problem in which when you depress the button once and do not dive bomb you will then be unable to use it again. You will also have an icon at the top of the screen showing dive bomb.... We then just went ahead and killed them all ourselves.",
            date = "2013-05-12T17:36:34-05:00",
