            author = "1430337",
            text = "Has anyone noticed that as of late, we're no longer getting 5 quests on the days we should be getting this daily? it seems this quest isn't being handed out any longer... can anyone confirm if they are seeing the same thing elsewhere? This is the only quest i have left for the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7308 Achievement. I noticed it missing 2 weeks ago.",
