            text = "If you're just attempting to get Uruk! for the achievement, you only have to do the two Deadtalker's Plateau dailies.\n\nOnce you turn those in, you will either get Uruk!, or the follow-up \"boss\" that day is Cheng Bo.\n\nThere is no need to do the Gai-Cho dailies to find out.",
