            author = "1147406",
            text = "Considering the amount of times I'd seen this quest appear in 2 months (0), I was convinced it was generally just rarer. However I made a ticket yesterday and received this response:\n\n\"As you correctly pointed out these quests do have a 50/50 chance of appearing, there is no guarantee it will be one or the other though, to put it into perspective if you flip a single coin one a day every day for a month there is a chance it will come up heads every day, it is unavoidable but it can happen, the quest you need will hopefully appear soon.\"\n\nSo I guess I'm just one of many very unlucky people.\n\nEDIT: 20 days later.... and still waiting for the Uruk quest to appear.\n\nEDIT: 3 days later and TODAY WAS THE DAY! Finally! Don't give up guys.",
