        {
            id = 1836507,
            score = 39,
            author = "combatboots7",
            text = "For anyone still working on this one for Know Your Role (http://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7308), here's what I just did:\n\nPick up the quest.\nHead to the Deadtalker's Plateau, and kill away. Don't worry about taking damage at this point, and don't auto-loot the corpses.\nFind, but don't pick up the Ciphered Scroll (http://www.wowhead.com/item=84759).\nAbandon the quest, fly to Master Snowdrift (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=63009) at Shadow-Pan Garrison and pick the quest up again. Then fly back to the corpse with the Ciphered Scroll (http://www.wowhead.com/item=84759).\nLoot, turn in, get achievement credit.",
