            text = "To get the Highly Explosive Yaungol Oil (http://www.wowhead.com/item=84762) go directly north of the mobs you need to kill for this quest. The barrels should be laying around on the ground in a Yaungol camp.\n\nIncidentally (or not) its the same place you do this quest: Assault Fire Camp Gai-Cho (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31113) which should be one of your other dailies.",
