            author = "Eroth",
            text = "This quest is an awesome way to farm Your reputation with [faction=1359], however there are some things You have to remember -\n\nYou can have only 10 https://www.wowhead.com/item=84762 in Your backpack.\nIf you will slain 100 Combatants (meaning end the quest) - You will not be able to pick any more of https://www.wowhead.com/item=84762\n\nSo, pick up 10 https://www.wowhead.com/item=84762, go to the battlefield, fire them up, BUT don't get 100 slains, abandon quest, and take it again, since the quest giver is close to You... repeat....\n\nHappy farming!",
