    [31132] = {
        {
            id = 1731751,
            score = 49,
            author = "Aureliana",
            text = "If you lose him, or don't feel like following him, you can simply go straight to the Circle of Bone and wait. He shows up without any need for you to follow him or drop and re-accept the quest. But as noted below, he will have an interesting little conversation with you on the way if you stick with him.",
            date = "2012-10-04T23:47:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31132#comments:id=1731751",
        },
        {
            id = 1671253,
            score = 14,
            author = "231785",
            text = "I waited for a minute and he walked in.",
            date = "2012-05-28T22:10:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31132#comments:id=1671253",
        },
        {
            id = 1671815,
            score = 14,
            author = "Zillions",
            text = "For this quest, you will follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63217 as he tells you more about himself.  The quest will end in the Circle of Bone once his story is complete.\n\nQuest text:\nFollow me, traveler. Let us get to know one another better.\nI am known as a Lorewalker - a kind of historian for my people.\nAs such, knowledge is my armor, and I carry a quill in place of a sword.\nMuch of Pandaria's past is shrouded in mystery, even to us.\nA Lorewalker's sworn duty is to rediscover our history - to rend that shroud, piece by piece.\nThis demands a tireless search for ancient clues, and the wisdom to interpret them.\nAhh, here we are. Be careful - I've had trouble in this area before.",
            date = "2012-05-30T18:53:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31132#comments:id=1671815",
        },
        {
            id = 3127025,
            score = 5,
            author = "WokkaD",
            text = "You need to at least go a short way with him. If you fly directly to the point, you will loose sight of him. As said below, just wait and he will probably eventually turn up.\nThe same happens with the next quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31152 which should be number 5 in the list above.\nThis is followed by https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31167\nWe then go back to the Hozen with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29879",
            date = "2019-06-16T04:21:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31132#comments:id=3127025",
        },
    },
    [31133] = {
        {
            id = 5676048,
            score = 8,
            author = "hiltie0427",
            text = "If you are stuck on Bound With Wood (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31073/bound-with-wood), Wood and Shade (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31074/wood-and-shade), and Kor’thik Aggression (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133/korthik-aggression) quests in Dread Wastes and are a fully leveled toon, you must go to Zidormi in Vale of Eternal Blossom (/way 81.13, 29.43) and change your timeline to present time and then complete Taoshi’s questline (/way 13.6, 75.4) as follows:\n\n1.\009Reflections in Amber (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56574/reflections-in-amber)\n2.\009Once More into Kor’vess (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56575/once-more-into-korvess)\n3.\009Crippling the Hive (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56577/crippling-the-hive)\n4.\009Rotten at the Roots (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56578/rotten-at-the-roots) (/way 47.0, 16.0)\n5.\009Amber Secrets (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56580/amber-secrets)\n6.\009Old Faces, New Problems (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56616/old-faces-new-problems)\n7.\009A Unified Swarm (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56617/a-unified-swarm)\n8.\009Heart of the Swarm (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56645/heart-of-the-swarm)\n9.\009The Mantid Threat (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56647/the-mantid-threat) (/way 40.14, 75.26)\n\nIf you do not do this, you will not be able to move forward with the Dread Wastes questline. On another note, when I went to present time, it turned out that I had already completed the 1st (3) quests in Taoshi’s questline. I ended up having to abandon the dread waste quests to get Taoshi to appear alongside me at Kor’Vess offering me the Rotten at the Roots quest.\n\nI hope this helps someone. I spent a ridiculous amount of time trying to complete Dread Wastes as a level 70 in Dragon Flight.",
            date = "2023-09-04T02:13:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133#comments:id=5676048",
        },
        {
            id = 1754474,
            score = 5,
            author = "toggie",
            text = "Pull the ones on the ground through the fires. Some of them will die instantly, some will jump off and lose some of its HP.\nThe fire barriers are in the cave (47,17). Combine this quest with Han Stormstout (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31078).",
            date = "2012-10-31T14:57:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133#comments:id=1754474",
        },
        {
            id = 3218129,
            score = 5,
            author = "Wautyriex",
            text = "Quote from a comment of quest Wood and Shade: \"If you are 120 and you're struggling with this quest, you need to complete the quest chain given by Taoshi. Doing so will phase the area back to level 90\n\nI was trying to do this in 8.3, all the mobs here are scaled to 120\nI have found the rooms I need, walked in and got the red blades light up, but the quest wasn't marked as complete.\n\nI had a feeling the Kor'vess scaling/phasing is really messing around with the quests here so I went at did that, and after finishing Taoshis questline that starts at Serpents Bite, I was able to complete this quest\"",
            date = "2020-07-18T20:39:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133#comments:id=3218129",
        },
        {
            id = 3217623,
            score = 4,
            author = "Zef92",
            text = "Is this quest still doable in 8.3? There are only lv 120 Kor'thik around the area and they don't even count for it :(",
            date = "2020-07-15T16:34:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133#comments:id=3217623",
        },
        {
            id = 3224708,
            score = 4,
            author = "Nivius",
            text = "AS OF 8.3 this quest is broken (atleast for 120 players), you get phased into the 120 version of the zone for a vale quest.\n\nGo to 44.0  7.0, on the oterside of the big log bridge, there is a small section that DOES NOT phase into 120.\nhere you can kill a bunch of Kor'thik Mantid for quest -> Kor'thik Aggression  (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133/korthik-aggression)\nhere you can loot 2 corpses for Fragrant Corewood for quest -> Bound With Wood (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31073/bound-with-wood)\n\nyou might have to wait for respawns, its not IDEAL ofc, but its a temporary walkaround i found.\n\n(you can also complete the quest chain given by Taoshi (as in destroy the 5 crystals, and do the reconinace misson after), as that will then phase the area back to lvl 90)",
            date = "2020-08-22T06:18:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31133#comments:id=3224708",
        },
    },
    [31134] = {
        {
            id = 1747610,
            score = 60,
            author = "Layci",
            text = "If you're wondering why you can't decrypt (as I was).. then you're using the wrong stone, they have to be done in order. :)",
            date = "2012-10-22T01:34:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31134#comments:id=1747610",
        },
        {
            id = 1857846,
            score = 2,
            author = "Naommi",
            text = "Some posters have listed a specific order for using (decrypting) the stones. In my opinion there is no \"set\" order. Mine was right stone first, then the middle stone, then the left and final stone. Your's might be left first, then middle, etc....etc...\n\nAfter clicking / using each stone, the cog wheels above them disappear and you will no longer be able to use (decrypt) them, and the quest is complete.",
            date = "2013-05-25T17:00:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31134#comments:id=1857846",
        },
        {
            id = 2344952,
            score = 1,
            author = "albinoette",
            text = "After completing this quest, Cho should offer https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31152, which will lead to another 4-part quest chain starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31167.\n\nAs others have mentioned, the stones don't always activate in the same order (left vs. middle vs. right), but only one of the 3 stones with cogwheels above them will be \"interactable\" at a time. You'll have a \"Decrypting\" casting bar while you interact with each stone. Seems consistent that add(s) will spawn for stone 2.\n[hr]\nLorewalker Cho has dialog after/during each decryption (correct me if it's not the same for everyone, I know other parts of his quest chain are race-specific):\n\nStone 1: Lorewalker Cho says: This stone tells of a great hozen warlord who lived here twenty-five hundred years ago. What are your leaders like? Poets? Warriors? I should like to meet them someday.\nStone 2: Lorewalker Cho says: Prepare yourself! Saurok raiders approach!\nBloodthirtsy Saurok says: Die, softskin!\nLorewalker Cho says: The saurok have plagued this land since the time of the mogu. They are impossible to negotiate with. But we never stop trying! We fight them only as a last resort.\nStone 3: Lorewalker Cho says: Thank you for your help - these notes are important to my studies. Your people value knowledge too, yes? I assume so, only because you arrived on a great airship.",
            date = "2016-06-26T05:29:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31134#comments:id=2344952",
        },
        {
            id = 6050978,
            score = 1,
            author = "1751886",
            text = "By reading the comments I can see it is random.\n\nFor me it was: Right - Middle - Left.",
            date = "2025-01-18T08:44:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31134#comments:id=6050978",
        },
        {
            id = 1671816,
            score = 0,
            author = "Zillions",
            text = "Upon accepting this quest, the three stones at the outside of the Circle of Bone will have a cogwheel appear above them.\nFirst, click the Stone Monolith to the left, then center, then right.  You will cast \"Decrypting\".  When you click the 2nd stone, a mob will appear and attack.",
            date = "2012-05-30T18:56:54-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31134#comments:id=1671816",
        },
    },
