        {
            id = 5655532,
            score = 257,
            author = "ZongFlips",
            text = "Cave entrance is underwater - /way 25.69 54.18 - Skeer The Bloodseeker",
            date = "2023-07-22T23:26:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31175#comments:id=5655532",
        },
        {
            id = 1699145,
            score = 119,
            author = "Yoosfulidiot",
            text = "The entrance is located just south east (just a little bit) of where the objective is on the map underwater in a cave.",
            date = "2012-08-12T17:22:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31175#comments:id=1699145",
        },
        {
            id = 1846656,
            score = 57,
            author = "arick",
            text = "The exact coordinates are 25.64, 54.37.  Type \"/way 25.64 54.37\" in the chat window to generate a way point.  The cave (or grotto), is all the way to the bottom of the ocean.  It is a huge opening, like the caves in Cataclysm.\n\nSwim in (it's a little ways, but you won't run out of breath.  Then surface just offshore.  If you are a squishy, like I am, kill off the adds one or two at a time.  Be sure and grab the Bloodsoaked Chitin Fragment (http://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=1&cad=rja&ved=0CDQQFjAA&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wowhead.com%2Fitem%3D86525%2Fbloodsoaked-chitin-fragment&ei=Rn54UeHpNNHJ4APJ_oHYDQ&usg=AFQjCNFUx1-V1x30ZXt6021zJ16LOW-2Qg&sig2=G1SUmT86tn5zDwdEsVUW8w&bvm=bv.45645796,d.dmg) before you waken Skeer the Bloodseeker (http://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=2&cad=rja&ved=0CDsQFjAB&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wowhead.com%2Fnpc%3D63359%2Fskeer-the-bloodseeker&ei=2n94UczuCMfb4AOllICwAw&usg=AFQjCNGaCe-WS5U9oWYyPSVX3AEOJKar3A&sig2=GeiOO0AS5JffGwqnZZODQA&bvm=bv.45645796,d.dmg).  (Actually, I grabbed the fragment while he was mono-logging.  He tends to chatter on for a while).  I had to click on/off him a couple of times before I finally got the quests dialog.  Grab the quests, then swim out of the cave quickly, before the bad guys re-spawn and read the quests.\n\nThe quests are:\n\nA Bloody Delight (http://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=1&cad=rja&ved=0CDQQFjAA&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wowhead.com%2Fquest%3D31178%2Fa-bloody-delight&ei=xn54Uf-DHvfJ4AOJlIG4CA&usg=AFQjCNFxtbJpTTsmAJ9pGcFXBUg2gzxVqg&sig2=h8bv-aVSIIC6wnEbosbn4A&bvm=bv.45645796,d.dmg)\nA Strange Appetite (http://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=1&cad=rja&ved=0CDQQFjAA&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wowhead.com%2Fquest%3D31176%2Fa-strange-appetite&ei=5n54UfTFM_jJ4APNp4HgCA&usg=AFQjCNHtBLcepRkNWIEj-rWUrz96wmGVJQ&sig2=nrLrsj7aUb6gAfWPN_8uHg&bvm=bv.45645796,d.dmg)\nFine Dining (http://www.google.com/url?sa=t&rct=j&q=&esrc=s&source=web&cd=1&cad=rja&ved=0CDQQFjAA&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.wowhead.com%2Fquest%3D31177%2Ffine-dining&ei=CH94UffMCY7A4AOejYDQAg&usg=AFQjCNH_fYdaTvHksA__PXxCQapnHT-zmg&sig2=-5ePAu1NUDCXT3JSeE4ySA&bvm=bv.45645796,d.dmg)",
            date = "2013-04-24T20:01:43-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31175#comments:id=1846656",
        },
        {
            id = 1724336,
            score = 52,
