        {
            id = 1950030,
            score = 1,
            author = "LeRevaq",
            text = "Incase you don't know where this \"Challenger Ring\" is, look at your minimap and north of the garrison  should be a ring like place. That is where you will duel him.\n\nIt's easily soloable and if you've an ilvl above 500 it will be over quickly.",
