    [31228] = {
        {
            id = 1689286,
            score = 148,
            author = "Kaelani",
            text = "In case you're unsure, Mishi will take you to the Isle of Reckoning. Mishi can be found to the right, outside of the building that Lorewalker Cho is in.\n\nMishi will also return you when you are done with the Prophet. She will be down the stairs from the altar, to the left.",
            date = "2012-07-17T20:24:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31228#comments:id=1689286",
        },
        {
            id = 1721457,
            score = 81,
            author = "950640",
            text = "For the Cauldrons found on the isle\nPurple: Summons maggots, makes you purple and vomit for 2 minutes\nBlue: Makes all the trolls on the island passive (still attackable)\nRed: A well fed buff for 100 Mastery\nGreen: 2 minute buff that gives you a chance on hit Hex spell. Doesn't break with damage, no apparent diminishing returns.\n\nInteresting to note, the Blue cauldron buff will make players of the opposite faction friendly and unattackable, so long as they have the buff as well. Enemy players can exchange buffs and the like, although the language barrier still exists.\n /dance emote used on the Witchdoctors will yield the line \"I be jammon wit' you, \"",
            date = "2012-09-27T07:33:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31228#comments:id=1721457",
        },
        {
            id = 1720949,
            score = 38,
            author = "what3ver212",
            text = "The cauldrons with the blue light over them are the ones that will give you a disguise that will make all the mobs neutral, except for Prophet Khar'zul, your disguise will disappear when you approach him.\n\nAfter you kill him Mishi is at the bottom of the stairs, don't fight your way back to the entrance like I did, lol.\n\nDid this again today on an alt, just want to add 1 more thing to it.  After you kill Prophet Khar'zul, if you have not yet killed the requisite number of Gurubashi Mishi will not be where he should be.  Go and kill the 12 you need then go back up the stairs where Prophet Khar'zul is, (don't pull him, not necessary to kill him again) then just walk back down and Mishi will have spawned.",
            date = "2012-09-26T23:39:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31228#comments:id=1720949",
        },
        {
            id = 1844483,
            score = 28,
            author = "861121",
            text = "After dying several times, I finally read what it said on the screen...\n\nStrategy is:\n\n1. Get buff from green cauldron before attacking.\n\n2. When everything turns purple jump onto altar.\n\n3. When birds attack move out of their range (but not too far - you'll need to jump back on altar when ground turns purple again).",
            date = "2013-04-18T03:26:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31228#comments:id=1844483",
        },
        {
            id = 1724196,
            score = 24,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "Two Empires Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre]Barrels of Fun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30651){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656)* Pandaren Prisoners (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30650){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30655)* The Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}*\n                \\      ||        ┌─────────┘\n                [ins]S[/ins])Cho's Missive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31460){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31459)\n                [ins]+[/ins])Path Less Traveled (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30999)\n                /      ||           └─────┐\na)Resupplying One Keg (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30618) a)Instant Courage (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30601) a)They Stole My Luck! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30621)\n                \\      ||                 ||\n                b)Comin' Round the Mountain (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30487)\n                b)One Traveler's Misfortune (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30683)\n                b)Seeker's Folly (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30684)\n                /               \\\nd)It Was Almost Alive (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30797)           c)The Tongue of Ba-Shon (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30829)\nf)The Tomb of Shadows (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30799)           d)Staying Connected (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30795)\ng)Breaking the Emperor's Shield (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30798) d)An End to Everything (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30796)\nh)Stealing Their Thunder King (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30800)\nh)Lessons from History (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30801)\nh)Chasing the Storm (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30802)\ni)Fisherman's Tale (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30935)────────────┬─>j)Make A Fighter Out of Me (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30942)\n ||  ||    ||                    ||                 ||\n ||  ||  