            text = "In 2021 this is just as broken as most of the comments from 2020 indicate; I also searched for a while for any bugs and found none, and the buff I was promised was never given.\n\nIf you're a Demon Hunter, try Spectral Sight as one comment mentioned; otherwise, until/unless it's fixed or someone finds a more general solution that's confirmed to work in 2021, I suggest just skipping this one.",
            date = "2021-02-12T18:34:55-06:00",
