            text = "Guessing that the quest is bugged.  Several people have attempted to locate \"Sun Tenderheart\", and even tried to cross-realm the issue.  A support ticket has been issued.  Please post if this issue has been resolved, thanks.",
            date = "2012-09-30T07:26:10-05:00",
