            score = 15,
            author = "Lythoras",
            text = "After completing Citizens of a New Empire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31107), The Dreadsworn (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31689), Concentrated Fear (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31108), and A Cry From Darkness (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31066); I only turned in A Cry From Darkness (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31066), flew to Soggy's Gamble, and this quest was available. It had not been available prior to completing these quests, so apparently turning in A Cry From Darkness (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31689) is what opens this up, confirming the post by Cozmomomo.",
            date = "2013-01-20T12:22:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31265#comments:id=1801522",
        },
        {
            id = 1755338,
            score = 10,
            author = "425699",
            text = "This is the first quest in Soggy's Gamble, and seems to open up upon the completion of https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31066.",
            date = "2012-11-02T03:21:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31265#comments:id=1755338",
        },
        {
            id = 2062498,
            score = 5,
            author = "FireEmerald",
            text = "Part 1 - How to access the Klaxxi:\n\nStarts by:\nBowmistress Li (http://wowhead.com/npc=62112)\nFalling Down (http://wowhead.com/quest=31001)\nNope (http://wowhead.com/quest=31002)\n\nMarksman Lann (http://wowhead.com/npc=62166)\nPsycho Mantid (http://wowhead.com/quest=31003)\n\nKlaxxi'va Tik (http://wowhead.com/npc=62203)\n... some Quests - just accept all frome the questgiver ...\n\nKil'ruk the Wind-Reaver (http://wowhead.com/npc=62202)\n... some Quests - just accept all frome the questgiver ...\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nPart 2 - The Klaxxi:\n\nFrom:\nAmbersmith Zikk (http://wowhead.com/npc=64599)\nAmber Arms (http://wowhead.com/quest=31008)\nConcentrated Fear (http://wowhead.com/quest=31108)\n\nFrom:\nKor'ik (http://wowhead.com/npc=64815)\nDead Zone (http://wowhead.com/quest=31009)\n-> In Her Clutch (http://wowhead.com/quest=31010)\n\nUnlocks Malik the Unscathed (http://wowhead.com/npc=62774).\nThe Dreadsworn (http://wowhead.com/quest=31689)\nCitizens of a New Empire (http://wowhead.com/quest=31107)\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nPart 3 - Requirements to reach the Anglers:\nKor'ik (http://wowhead.com/npc=64815)\n\nComplete the quest A Cry From Darkness (http://wowhead.com/quest=31066).",
            date = "2014-12-07T09:05:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31265#comments:id=2062498",
        },
    },
