        {
            id = 1725119,
            score = 8,
            author = "Neverknow",
            text = "This seems to be bugged/broken right now. No matter how many Mogu or Pandaren artifacts I fix, I'm not getting any further; doesn't matter in what zone I am, even standing in front of her does absolutely nothing.\n\nEdit: Apparently, you can't complete this before you max Archaeology. Or something. I'm still not entirely sure.",
