            author = "neousagi",
            text = "In MoP Remix, I didn't get the extra buttons, no matter how many times I tried getting off and back on, or abandon and retake quest.\nWhat actually helped was the good old relogging. Specifically, I abandoned, then logged out, then logged back in, then took the quest and got on Mishi again. This time I got the special button to bomb the fissures.",
            date = "2024-05-17T23:51:32-05:00",
