            score = 20,
            author = "Sunbendyr",
            text = "If one of the shrines doesn't work for you, rather than abandoning and doing it again (which has been confirmed to work), I just ran to the top of Mount Neverest for fun. When I came back down, the shrine works.\n\nApparently, just going a distance away from it and coming back works as well. Hope this helps.",
            date = "2012-10-21T10:07:00-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31306#comments:id=1747097",
        },
        {
            id = 1724940,
            score = 15,
            author = "515518",
            text = "There are three shrines, just follow the flags from 46, 48 up.  Avoid snowballs and tornadoes.  Making it all the way up the quest can be handed in to the left of the last shrine.\n\nAll three shrines will be marked in your mini map with a gear icon.",
            date = "2012-09-29T17:33:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31306#comments:id=1724940",
        },
        {
            id = 1863303,
            score = 14,
            author = "digitalutopia1",
            text = "There seems to be some correlation between the order you need to do this quest in, and how buggy its appearance on the quest tracker is.\n\nI've just recently finished this on three different characters - and the objective tracker appeared in three different ways.\n\n1. If your quest tracker looks like this:\n\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Body\n0/1\n0/1\n\nTry doing the order 3-1-2\n\n2. If your quest tracker looks like this:\n\n0/1\n0/1\n0/1\n\nTry doing the order 2-3-1\n\n(credit to Cicero)\n3. If your quest tracker looks like this:\n\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Body\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Breath\n0/1\n\nTry doing the order 2-1-3\nFinally, if your quest tracker looks as it should...i.e.:\n\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Body\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Breath\n0/1 Shrine of the Seeker's Heart\n\nThen try doing them in order (1-2-3).",
            date = "2013-06-06T02:42:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31306#comments:id=1863303",
        },
        {
            id = 1724321,
            score = 9,
            author = "Vallix",
            text = "This quest was a bit buggy, the quest text didn't list the objectives.  You need to find shrines off a path that starts at 46.9, 48.0.  Watch out for falling snow balls and tornados, I also had to skip the first shrine, get the other two, come back to the first one and go back to the top to complete it.",
            date = "2012-09-29T10:06:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31306#comments:id=1724321",
        },
    },
