        {
            id = 1745457,
            score = 95,
            author = "Karadine",
            text = "Quest progression:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31312 (from https://www.wowhead.com/item=86404 looted from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=59639 if you are exalted with [faction=1272] and are best friends with all the farmers https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6552)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31313\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31314 (rewards https://www.wowhead.com/item=86428 which contains one of each rare gem)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31315 (achieves https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7296)",
