        {
            id = 1874387,
            score = 8,
            author = "Paralyse",
            text = "Updates as of patch 5.3:\n\n- Old Man Thistle's Treasure now contains 100 gold, in addition to one of every blue-quality Pandarian gem, one Primal Diamond, and two new items:\n\n* Bag of Songbell Seeds:  10 charge soulbound item that seeds four plots at once with Songbell Seeds.  = 40 plantings\n\n* Bag of Magebulb Seeds: same as above but seeds with Magebulb Seeds.\n\n- Cave can now be exited once quest is complete by clicking on the rocks, the same way you entered.  You no longer have to hearth out or die.\n\n(Note to the above) --  If you are Exalted w/Tillers and Exalted w/all Farm Friends, it is now possible to enter the cave before you have obtained the Old Map from the Enormous Cattail Grouper.  You can kill all the spiders (which drop no loot, except the levelled Toxic spider at the end)  but when you go to leave the cave, you cannot click on the rocks to get back out, forcing you to hearth or die.",
            date = "2013-07-07T02:54:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31315#comments:id=1874387",
        },
    },
