            author = "Netn",
            text = "If you bought the Grand Expedition Yak (http://www.wowhead.com/item=84101) you can buy the Plum Wine (http://www.wowhead.com/item=81415) directly from the vendor on the mount.\n\nIf not, you can buy it from Den Den (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=64319) in The Lazy Turnip which is located just north-east of Jogu.",
