        {
            id = 1787256,
            score = 10,
            author = "998027",
            text = "Rewards 3300 Reputation for Jogu the Drunk.\n\nMission unlocks as soon as you become Buddies, very similarly to the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31320, which unlocks as soon as you become acquaintances. Both quest requirements can be purchased from the same areas - primarily https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64319. He is more like North Northeast from Jogu the Drunk.\n\nBasically pushes you to 1/3 completion of the Buddy rank instantly.",
