            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31323#comments:id=1697341",
        },
        {
            id = 1737261,
            score = 68,
            author = "yodadoe",
            text = "I suggest accepting the quest and \"stop tracking\" it in your UI. That way, you don't keep seeing the yellow ! on your map and can see when he has a daily quest for you. Sure it takes up a quest spot in your quest book... small price to pay, I say.",
            date = "2012-10-10T07:09:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31323#comments:id=1737261",
        },
        {
            id = 1749179,
            score = 65,
            author = "73955",
            text = "I should have followed Wowhead's advice. I did this quest and hoped for the best; thinking maybe Jogu would mail me some kind of mystery reward for eating the cost of the Black Pepper and the soil slots wasted on Turnips... Not a damn thing. This quest is a tremendous waste of time and resources. Avoid it...\n\nUpdate:\nIt's been more than a month and a major patch later and the completion of this quest has still yielded no noticeable rewards. Keep avoiding it.\n\nUpdate II:\nPatch 5.2 has been live for more than 24hrs. Still no change in the status of this quest line. No mails, no rewards, no quest continuation from Jogu the Drunk.",
            date = "2012-10-24T03:30:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31323#comments:id=1749179",
        },
    },
