            score = 20,
            author = "kakes",
            text = "The world was red, warm like blood. No more sunlight, no more innocent lambs wandering carefree, their only crime wanting to explore the beautiful valley. Krungko Firelicker had paid for his monstrous deeds, his life soaking black into the pristine knoll atop the Skyrange. All that fills your eyes is the frail little ball of wool, laid still by the dead hozen before you, never to roam again.\nAll your tears can't bring Sheepie back.\n\nThis quest is available after completing the Oh Sheepie... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31340) quest from Chee Chee, one of the few hozen Tillers. Though the vengeance you take will never return sweet Sheepie, the revenge you seek is a bloodthirsty way to gain reputation with Chee Chee. Krungko Firelicker (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=64389) will spawn after using the Old Sheep Skin (http://www.wowhead.com/item=86465) anywhere in the Skyrange area.\n\nMay Krungko burn for what he's done.",
            date = "2013-01-10T13:31:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31341#comments:id=1795985",
        },
        {
            id = 1835718,
            score = 17,
            author = "Cynddrela",
            text = "My worgen particularly enjoyed this quest. I suspect she's done this before.",
            date = "2013-03-28T09:14:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31341#comments:id=1835718",
        },
        {
            id = 3201356,
