    [31354] = {
        {
            id = 1730663,
            score = 31,
            author = "ssjheero",
            text = "After completing this quest, a short little RP scene occurs with a paragon egg that was recovered:\n\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: So, do you just want to... I don't know... Roll it away or something?\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: Wait... is it moving?\n\n(The egg hatches, revealing the Klaxxi Paragon inside)\n\nKa'roz the Locust says: Tremble, fools! The locust has awakened!\n\n(Ka'roz vomits out water)\n\nKa'roz the Locust: WHARRGARBL!\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: Oh, nasty.\nMaster Angler Ju Lien yells: You okay up there?\nKa'roz the Locust says: Ughh....  The locust is fine!\n\n(Ka'roz the Locust is swarmed by crabs that were also caught in the net.)\n\nKa'roz the Locust says: Get off me, insolent crabs!\nKa'roz the Locust says: The Klaxxi beckon...\n\n(Ka'roz the Locust flies away.)\n\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: Well then.\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: I'm guessing you know something about what just happened?\nMaster Angler Ju Lien says: Actually, forget it - I don't want to know. I'm going back to my lines.",
            date = "2012-10-04T02:50:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354#comments:id=1730663",
        },
        {
            id = 1840175,
            score = 20,
            author = "MajorXMidge",
            text = "Am I the only person that recognized the Spongebob Squarepants Reference when you speak to Master Angler Ju Lien, he says...\n\n\"Hey there!\"\n\n\"Oh I'm fine. I've had worse spills than that after a night at the Chum Bucket.\"\n\nChum Bucket - http://en.spongepedia.org/images/thumb/c/c5/ChumBucket.jpg/210px-ChumBucket.jpg",
            date = "2013-04-07T12:47:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354#comments:id=1840175",
        },
        {
            id = 1795195,
            score = 16,
            author = "1022650",
            text = "For those doing the awakening achievement and are wondering when this quest appears you have to complete all the quests at Soggy's Gamble up to and including The Mariner's Revenge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31190) where you take down leviathan in the boat.\n\nDeck Boss Arie will then have moved and after turning in aforementioned quest you are able to get this one (of course you also have to complete the quests in the chain preceding this one which require completing the brew quests in the north of the dread wastes as mentioned in the comments of this quest Fires and Fears of Old (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31085)",
            date = "2013-01-09T06:22:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354#comments:id=1795195",
        },
        {
            id = 1730244,
            score = 14,
            author = "292346",
            text = "If you're like me and finished the Soggy quests and didn't know where to go next after you woke up Ka'roz the Locust, fly back to the Klaxxi'vess camp. The final chapter of quests (for the zone achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6540) gets re-started with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31175 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31730.",
            date = "2012-10-03T16:31:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354#comments:id=1730244",
        },
        {
            id = 1947441,
            score = 9,
            author = "593357",
            text = "In order for you to unlock the quests from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63349 you have to do the initial [faction=1337] quests:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31003\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31001\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31002\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31676\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31006\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31007\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31008\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31009\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31010\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31660\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31661\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31107\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31689\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31108\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31066\n\nUpon completion of https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31066 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31108 I was able to accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31265 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63349.\n\nThis is a simple script you can copy into Paste (http://www.curse.com/addons/wow/paste) and it will print the quests you have yet to do:\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31003) then print(\"Psycho Mantid (Marksman Lann)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31001) then print(\"Falling Down (Bowmistress Li)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31002) then print(\"Nope (Bowmistress Li)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31676) then print(\"Ancient Vengeance (Kil'ruk the Wind-Reaver)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31006) then print(\"The Klaxxi Council (Kil'ruk the Wind-Reaver)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31007) then print(\"The Dread Clutches (Kil'ruk the Wind-Reaver)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31008) then print(\"Amber Arms (Ambersmith Zikk)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31009) then print(\"Dead Zone (Kor'ik)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31010) then print(\"In Her Clutch (Klaxxi Sonic Relay)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31660) then print(\"Not Fit to Swarm (Kil'ruk the Wind-Reaver)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31661) then print(\"A Source of Terrifying Power (Sha-Haunted Crystal)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31107) then print(\"Citizens of a New Empire (Malik the Unscathed)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31689) then print(\"The Dreadsworn (Malik the Unscathed)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31108) then print(\"Concentrated Fear (Ambersmith Zikk)\") end\n/run if not IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(31066) then print(\"A Cry From Darkness (Kor'ik)\") end\n\nThe Like A Deck Boss (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354) quests include the following:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=63349:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31265\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31182\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31181\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31183\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31188\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31187\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31189\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=63317:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31184\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31185\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31190\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=63955:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31186\n\nAll of the above is criteria of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6540 which is a criteria of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6541!",
            date = "2014-02-28T11:31:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31354#comments:id=1947441",
        },
    },
