        {
            id = 2451007,
            score = 2,
            author = "voodoopimp",
            text = "There's a different description for this quest now, which as far as I've seen only appears when you loot a Cloud Serpent mount on a character that hasn't already been to the Order.\n\nAhhh, it seems you have found yourself the proud owner of a majestic cloud serpent.\n\nBefore you may fly the skies on this powerful creature, you must first earn the skill to ride it.\n\nThe Order of the Cloud Serpent can teach you the knowledge that you seek.\n\nIf you wish to follow our way, you should speak to Instructor Skythorn at The Arboretum in the Jade Forest.\n\nI wish you luck, .\n\nNever mind that Cloud Serpent Riding is no longer a separate skill and you can use the mount as soon as you get it.",
            date = "2016-12-04T18:32:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31373#comments:id=2451007",
