        },
        {
            id = 1754767,
            score = 12,
            author = "987383",
            text = "So with another one of his Dailies, Challenge at the Temple of the Red Crane, I did the same thing.  I turned it in and nothing appeared.  However, I had the quest for a couple days.  When dailies reset today, it just so happened he had the same daily for Red Crane.\n\nI didn't even have to turn it in, three NPC's at the ? already had dailies.  So it would appear that you have to do the daily in the time frame that you received, if they reset then you loose the ability to do the dailies.  However, if your in a Guild that has not gotten to lvl 25, you DO get 60k Guild Exp.\n\nHope this helps\n\nCsiber",
            date = "2012-11-01T04:28:09-05:00",
