        {
            id = 1869985,
            score = 11,
            author = "Andorana",
            text = "One thing to watch out for: if you still have this daily breadcrumb quest from a previous day, it will still lead you to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=57324 (maybe across much of the continent). But you'll get nothing for the breadcrumb and no follow-on daily quests unless today's daily quest hub for [faction=1341] is the Jade Temple Grounds (only 1 out of 4 possible hubs).\n\nUnsure about today's hub? You could check with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64001 (Alliance: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64032). If she has a different daily to offer then that will match today's hub (thus this quest won't match). If she doesn't offer a quest (you might have multiple daily breadcrumbs in your log), pick the dialog option asking how you can help, the text of her response will let you figure out today's hub. Of course just finishing the quest might be easier for those near [zone=5785].",
            date = "2013-06-24T01:38:42-05:00",
