        {
            id = 1725952,
            score = 23,
            author = "sharpyx1",
            text = "If you have done this quest and can't acquire any dailies, it means you have not fully unlocked the zone.\n\nYou need to go and complete a small quest chain from Kun-Lai Summit (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=5841).\n\nAlliance Chain:\n\n1. Temple of the White Tiger (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392)\n2. A Celestial Experience (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31394)\n3. A Witness to History (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31512) - Gate Unlocked\n\nHorde Chain\n\n1. Temple of the White Tiger (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31393)\n2. A Celestial Experience (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31395)\n3. A Witness to History (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31511) - Gate Unlocked\n\nHope this helps!",
            date = "2012-09-30T10:58:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31384#comments:id=1725952",
        },
        {
            id = 3300073,
