        {
            id = 1727934,
            score = 4,
            author = "1036812",
            text = "I had the same problem with completing the white tiger and then not receiving dailies after completing the chain and turning in the golden lotus at the Golden Pagoda. Voting them down is futile, seeing as they can't even get the Golden Lotus quests until they do the white tiger, the problem is after-the-fact...\n\nThis is what helped me: Try going to Mogu'shan's Palace, east of Twin Moons, and speak to the quartermaster in the southern part of the temple. Literally, just opening it up and taking a look, for me, some gear was available to purchase for JP. Once simply looking at the quatermaster and heading back over to the Pagoda, there was the quest to go speak to Anj.\n\nThis may be a bug, this could simply be my own issue, but figured I'd post it since I've come across a few forums being formed on it; Completing the white tiger AND the golden lotus and not opening up dailies.",
            date = "2012-10-01T21:14:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31384#comments:id=1727934",
        },
