            author = "Propulson",
            text = "what's the point of flying to Serp Spines? you can't get to the place you need to be from there so your comment made no sense what so ever",
            date = "2013-05-27T04:29:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31391#comments:id=1858615",
        },
    },
    [31392] = {
        {
            id = 1725676,
            score = 51,
            author = "Aros",
            text = "At the completion of this quest chain the gates to Vale of Eternal Blossoms (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=5840) will be opened which will gain you access to Shrine of Seven Stars (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=6142) which is the Alliance city hub in Pandaria.\n(Or if you are Horde to Shrine of Two Moons (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=6141).)\n\nIt has portals to Stormwind (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1519), Ironforge (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1537), Darnassus (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=1657), Exodar (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=3557), Shattrath  (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=3703)and Dalaran (http://www.wowhead.com/zone=4395).\n\nIt has bankers (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=63969) and auctioneer (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=65599) (for engineers only) and access to void storage (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=64574), reforging (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=64045) and transmogrification (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=64573).\n\nAnd it has a flight trainer (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=60166) which on level 90 will teach you to fly in Pandaria (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=115913).\n\nEdit: Updated auctioneer info.",
            date = "2012-09-30T06:41:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392#comments:id=1725676",
        },
        {
            id = 1723552,
            score = 29,
            author = "staynight",
            text = "Head to 66, 58 for the path up to the Temple. The path is marked by tiny dots on the map, heading east off the road.",
            date = "2012-09-28T20:39:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392#comments:id=1723552",
        },
        {
            id = 1898273,
            score = 28,
            author = "tolbarath",
            text = "With the events of 5.4, this quest has been updated.\n\nAs you approach Xuen and co, the following exchange takes place.\n\nTaran Zhu says: Half of the Vale lies in ruins! These outsiders have been more destructive than the mantid and mogu combined!\nAnduin Wrynn says: Give us a chance to put things right.\nTaran Zhu says: Great Tiger, the strangers from beyond the mists, they cannot be trusted. The wreckage in the Jade Forest can attest to this.\n\nTurning in the quest to Anduin now reads as:\n\n[class], I'm glad you're here! The \"Vale of Eternal Blossoms\" is legendary among the Pandaren. It's a place of great healing, if the locals are to be beleived. But the Horde Warchief has done something to the Vale - something terrible. We need to get in there!\n\nThe only line that changes during the battle is Anduin's line:\nAnduin Wrynn says: We're here to lend our aid. We can help you rebuild the Vale.\n\nAfterwards Xuen's decision changes to:\nXuen says: It is decided. The Vale of Eternal Blossoms shall remain open. The transgressions of the outsides have been great... but I see in them the capability to right what has been wronged.",
            date = "2013-09-15T08:08:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392#comments:id=1898273",
        },
        {
            id = 1721500,
            score = 20,
            author = "Whiterock",
            text = "Kun-lai Side Story Quest Tree From Whiterock\n[pre]   [del]S[/del])Temple of the White Tiger (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392){H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31393)}(Multiple zones)\n   [ins]+[/ins])A Celestial Experience (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31394)   {H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31395)}\n   a)A Witness to History (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31512)     {H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31511)}\n   /                           ||\nThe Shrine of Seven Stars (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30631)(A)* The Shrine of Two Moons (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30649)(H)*[hr]\nThe Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}*   [ins]+[/ins])The Kun-Lai Kicker (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31611)([zone=6426])\n ||\n[del]S[/del])Muskpaw Ranch (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31456){H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31457)}\n[ins]+[/ins])The Missing Muskpaw (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30488)            [ins]+[/ins])Fresh Needle Scent (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30489)\n ||           \\\nb)Yakity Yak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30587) b)At the Yak Wash (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30491)   [ins]+[/ins])The Late Mrs. Muskpaw (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30582)\n ||           /                   b)The Fearmaster (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30804)\nc)Back in Yak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30492)[hr]\nThe Ordo Warbringer (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30660){A2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30662),H1 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30661),H2 (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30663)}* Barrels of Fun (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30651){H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30656)}* Pandaren Prisoners (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30650){H (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30655)}*\n                          \\          ||            /\n                          [del]S[/del])The Missing Merchant (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31452){H} (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31451)\n         [ins]+[/ins])Repossession (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30469)   [ins]+[/ins])My Son... (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30467)\n                          d)Father and Child Reunion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30834)[hr]\n[ins]+[/ins])The Waterspeaker's Staff (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30496) [ins]+[/ins])Enraged Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30468) [ins]+[/ins])Free the Dissenters (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30967)\n                         \\  ||       ┌───────────┘\n                         d)The Ritual (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30480)\n                         e)Cleansing the Mere (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30828)\n                         e)The Fall of Shai Hu (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30855)[hr]\nLegend:\n[del]S[/del] means [acronym=\"Also known as Breadcumb\"]Skippable[/acronym]\n[ins]+[/ins] means Can start anytime, prequests not needed.\n(A)/(H) means Alliance/Horde only.\n{H} means Quest Have Horde Variant, click {H} for it.\n* means another Quest Tree.[/pre]",
            date = "2012-09-27T08:07:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31392#comments:id=1721500",
