            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31502#comments:id=1734106",
        },
        {
            id = 1817015,
            score = 5,
            author = "859333",
            text = "Be aware that if you are doing this quest in peak hours, you will be competing for the mobs with other players, and there aren't many of them.\nSo be prepared to camp out for a long time if you cant cast any long range spells.\nSucks IMHO.",
            date = "2013-02-22T15:25:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31502#comments:id=1817015",
        },
        {
            id = 1760652,
            score = 4,
            author = "pmakaro",
            text = "One of many quests in Pandaria that currently leaves the item in your bags after the quest is completed.\n\nHere is a list of some of the quests and their items that remain after completion.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=80484 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30634\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=87394 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31487\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=87841 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31507\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=87400 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31496\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=89366 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30341 (Thanks Ungluck)\n\nIn addition to the above provided quest items that stick around the following are some quest items that can be over looted and extras may remain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=88855 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31713 (Thanks Eighjan)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=79864 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=30329\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=87401 for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31502\n\nIn all these cases the provided item or the extra looted items are safe to delete after the quest is complete.",
            date = "2012-11-11T03:08:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31502#comments:id=1760652",
        },
    },
    [31503] = {
        {
            id = 1727100,
            score = 36,
            author = "FatCheeseMan",
            text = "I had a bit of trouble finding him because I made assumptions that were not true. He looks like the other mantids surrounding him, do make the folly I did and assume otherwise.",
            date = "2012-10-01T07:19:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31503#comments:id=1727100",
        },
        {
            id = 1735041,
            score = 19,
            author = "Lorri",
            text = "Use the macro\n\n/target Vess-Guard Na'kal\n/run SetRaidTarget(\"target\", 4)\n\nto target and mark him",
            date = "2012-10-08T00:00:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31503#comments:id=1735041",
        },
        {
            id = 1757731,
            score = 12,
            author = "243011",
            text = "The most important things to know is that:\n\nHe is standing on ground level, not underground\nHe does not show up as a skull on the minimap\nBut he is a quest mob, so kills are shared even when you are not grouped",
            date = "2012-11-05T15:17:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31503#comments:id=1757731",
        },
        {
            id = 1763482,
            score = 8,
            author = "974125",
            text = "I found the best way to do this guy is to use the macro Lorri has provided, then clear the area except for the unnamed guard he's with.  Then, get some range and use the Klaxxi \"Master of Puppets\" enchantment you get from Kaz'tik the Manipulator to enslave the guard he's with, then the guard will start on him and you can join the fight.  Works like a charm.\n\nPS> Much thanks to Lorri for that very useful macro!",
            date = "2012-11-16T18:24:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31503#comments:id=1763482",
        },
        {
            id = 1728147,
            score = 4,
            author = "sorceressdee",
            text = "This guy is hard to distinguish since they all look the same, so I just used /tar Vess. He is walking patrolling with another regular unnamed guard. He has 1.2 M health and hits pretty hard so try to clear around before pulling him. Map location is correct.",
            date = "2012-10-02T01:25:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31503#comments:id=1728147",
        },
    },
