        {
            id = 1759247,
            score = 3,
            author = "Mairin",
            text = "Your Wasting Dread damaged You 30209 Shadow.\nYour Wasting Dread damaged You 60420 Shadow. (Critical)\nYour Wasting Dread damaged You 60420 Shadow. (Critical)\nYour Wasting Dread damaged You 88724 Shadow. (Critical)\nYour Wasting Dread damaged You 44362 Shadow.\nFor those downrating people above who are saying the dots can add up, if you get an unlucky string of the negative versions they really can. The above is from my combat log and since I'd just finished killing Kypa'rak and wasn't at 100% to begin with it was (fortunately) Painkiller time.",
            date = "2012-11-08T10:24:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31509#comments:id=1759247",
        },
        {
            id = 1748418,
            score = 2,
            author = "598246",
            text = "As Setback said, you can just drive over them/fly over them in a mount to roadkill them. As a warning though, if you find a lot of the bulbs in an enclosed area and you run over all of them within a few seconds of each other, watch out for the stacking DoTs and debuffs you get. They can add up and be mildly dangerous if you're not careful.",
            date = "2012-10-23T03:36:03-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31509#comments:id=1748418",
        },
    },
