            text = "I have never seen this quest live. Maybe it was intended to be a Buddy mission quest? From Sho I only got Mission: Culling The Vermin /4200 Acquaintance/, Mission: Aerial Threat /4200 Friend/ and Mission: Predator of the Cliffs /4200 Good Friend/. But a quest with the Buddy rep is missing.",
