        {
            id = 1807801,
            score = 1,
            author = "TaxMan",
            text = "This quest became available to me when my rep level with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58708 was at (5/6) Good Friends and my rep went from 4020/8400 to 5010/8400 after handing in a  https://www.wowhead.com/item=79267 which is worth 990 rep with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58708 (900 rep +10% guild level rep bonus)\n\nCompleting this quest at level 90 rewarded me with 19g84s50c and 4125 rep with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58708 which is enough to reach Best Friends (6/6) with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=58708",
            date = "2013-02-01T17:28:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31532#comments:id=1807801",
        },
        {
            id = 5527862,
