            text = "Search the wooded area around the entrance of Sik'vess Lair (47,79). The \"cages\" are tall skinny orange crystal-looking things that look nothing like cages, and there aren't a lot of them. Each is guarded by at least one bug man, so pick up Thinning the Sik'thik (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31687) while you're at it. I suspect Restless Leng always spawns from the 8th and last cage, as he did for me.",
