        },
        {
            id = 1793960,
            score = 17,
            author = "Dimikcz",
            text = "These 3 quests are concurrent. You can accept and complete only one of them.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31386\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=30768",
            date = "2013-01-06T23:41:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695#comments:id=1793960",
        },
        {
            id = 1860135,
            score = 9,
            author = "Anedill",
            text = "Hey you! Out there [Beyond The Wall], breaking bottles in the hall, can you help me?",
            date = "2013-05-30T14:17:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695#comments:id=1860135",
        },
        {
            id = 2526601,
            score = 9,
            author = "soupahumble",
            text = "Wow, this quest is so old, I can't believe there are just 6 comments...it seems like there are not so many people having problems with this quest, but I did, so if anyone else will have problems with it, I hope my comment will help them.\n\nIf you look at the map of Kun-Lai Summit, the westernmost flight master (you probably haven't discovered this flight path yet, neither did I at the time, but you can still see him on your map) is at a place called Winter's Blossom, and the gate you are looking for in order to pass through the wall from Kun-Lai to Townlong Steppes is exactly southwest of Winter's Blossom.\n\nIf you're coming from Westwind Rest (where you got the quest, if you haven't picked it up from the adventure guide), you need to follow the road west and then go right (north) at the fork. Don't make the mistake and go left, because you will bump into Shado-Pan Fallback (another flight master on your map there, the southernmost in Kun-Lai). I did this and thought \"great, this is the wall I was looking for\" and went upstairs and followed the yellow arrow on my mini-map which was perfectly aligned with the angle of the wall but then I bumped into the Horde flightmaster and his level 90 elite guards...\n\nYou need to go northwest, just like the quest says. You will pass through Kota Basecamp (flight master on your map) on the way to Winter's Blossom.\n\nHope that helps!",
            date = "2017-09-28T04:19:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695#comments:id=2526601",
        },
        {
            id = 1902629,
            score = 7,
            author = "308485",
            text = "I wasn't able to pick up this quest until I completed the Westwind Rest storyline. This involves around 20 quests.",
            date = "2013-09-25T12:42:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31695#comments:id=1902629",
        },
    },
