        {
            id = 1698290,
            score = 1,
            author = "selvin",
            text = "After taking  the shoes I had a ton of the Shadow fae tricksters aggro, so be careful, even though they do have fairly low health.\n\nAdditionally, if you have aggro and can't figure out why, it may be because your hatchling is tanking some of them and you just haven't noticed. Kill them and you'll drop out of aggro.",
