            text = "Begin Spam\n\nOdd these are a mixture of winterspring and netherwing..Not even close..To start with the \"eggs\" werent a daily they were a constant hand in.. Winterspring you got a kit and fed that kit over 40 solid days no way around it 1 daily per day so many days..this xpac hasnt been out 30 days and people are exalted....\n\nAs well. no companion egg or otherwise was handed out in the past week ive been running these....\n\nEnd of Spam.",
