            text = "I discovered that the silkworms were hostile ONLY while you have this quest.  Therefore, If you have both \"Pooped\" and \"Sweet as honey\", kill the silkworms to collect your 5 poops and turn the quest in!  The silkworms become friendly, and farming the honeybees becomes much simpler.",
