            author = "copterchris111",
            text = "You will find the hives as stated by adavis (56.41) thats just across the small stream north of the quest giver.  Stand under the large one.  I could not click on the item in my bags, had to use the quest tracker.  But it worked just fine, simple enough to kill, sprays some stuff around that hurts a little and slows ya down.  Clothies may want to avoid it more than others.  But its a simple kill.",
            date = "2012-09-30T10:43:26-05:00",
