            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31733#comments:id=1768886",
        },
        {
            id = 1766895,
            score = 9,
            author = "Sketchie",
            text = "A word of advice: If you are a fresh level 85 entering Mists of Pandaria, use the advantage to ride all the way north to Dawn's Blossom to get yourself a full set of level 372 gear - including trinkets - from Singegruff.\n\nThis will make the earlier parts of Jade Forest more tolerable, even if you do have to ride all the way back south to continue questing.",
            date = "2012-11-23T17:20:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31733#comments:id=1766895",
        },
        {
            id = 1771518,
            score = 6,
            author = "mari228",
            text = "I solved the problem. I didn't see the parachute, so I jumped. Abandoned the quest. Went to Paw'don Village and used the portal back to the gunship. Accepted the quest again, and the parachutes were available. This worked for two of my characters.\nWhen I get back to the village, I don't see the portal to the ship anymore, only to Stormwind.",
            date = "2012-11-29T18:22:50-06:00",
