        {
            id = 1718715,
            score = 16,
            author = "knightxwolf",
            text = "In case you are wondering where you have to turn this in , you have to go across the creek to the npc.",
            date = "2012-09-25T12:28:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31739#comments:id=1718715",
        },
        {
            id = 1927085,
            score = 8,
            author = "Engrelled",
            text = "I did the quest, Teng was with me, we got all 6 barrels, but when we started up the steps into the village, he briefly disappeared and now he wants to 'start' the quest.  The quest box says \"6/6 (Complete)\" but he will not allow me to complete the quest.  I tried logging out and back in - no change; I tried using the portal to SW and back - no change. Finally re-read the quest and noticed that it needs to be turned in to LIN Applebloom [look for the (?) on the map].",
            date = "2013-12-18T12:58:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31739#comments:id=1927085",
        },
        {
            id = 1742292,
            score = 7,
            author = "Macree",
            text = "Hopefully this tip prevents others from walking around aimlessly like I did.  Teng Applebloom mentions that the barrels are in the orchard.  Do NOT go to Nectarbreeze Orchard.  The barrels are in the area southwest of Paw'Don Village.\n\nLook for the kegs by trees, many are guarded by a Twinspire Peon or Twinspire Taskmaster.  Some coordinates where I found barrels are:\n     42, 87\n     43, 87\n     44, 87\n     45, 87\n\nNot sure if they only appear on points across the same Y coordinate (87), but in my case, they were.  I had two additional barrels respawn at 44,87, so that may be the best point to check.\n\nWhile on the quest, make sure to take a laugh at Teng carrying six barrels on his back.  Quite amusing!",
            date = "2012-10-15T10:20:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31739#comments:id=1742292",
        },
        {
            id = 1828783,
            score = 4,
            author = "1031604",
            text = "II tought that the q was broken too but no! It's super simple, youre suppose to have a panda with you, i didnt had one because i died. Cancel the quest, and take the quest again, you will have a panda who care all the 6 applebaum things. Thats it and if you die then you have to cancel and restart the quest for your new panda who chare the 6 applething. Good questing!",
            date = "2013-03-14T21:52:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31739#comments:id=1828783",
        },
    },
