            text = "When you complete this quest and the following three other quests:\n\nTwinspire Keep (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31741)\n Unfair Trade (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31744)  Smoke Before Fire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=31743)\nthe quest The Fall of Ga'trul (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=30070) becomes available.",
