        {
            id = 1953285,
            score = 4,
            author = "arnoldc6",
            text = "If you are reading this before you start the quest, entree the fortress in the left.\nRight next to you ('left' next to you, actually) is a giant bomb that you can use your quest item to call in air strike on, do that.\nThen process to clear all those creepy green floating eye balls on this floor, they are relatively more rare on other floors of the fortress so kill them on here and by killing green eyes you will also be rescuing cute little panda cubs as required by https://www.wowhead.com/quest=29716.\nWhile clearing, call in air strike on the purple floating demon as well.\nAfter you are done with this, go on to the other side of the platform and bomb that giant circle with loads of Imps. It's pretty obvious you won't miss it.\nAfter these is the simplest part of all, go upstairs, bomb those demos right on the second floor, then go to the third floor and kill that 2 bosses,\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=66274\nand\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=66275\nThey are no brainer for casters just burst them till they die and for melee they actually do hit hard since by now you likely only have 2 pieces of MoP gear, but avoid those special attack of theirs and you will be fine.\nReturn quest at top of fortress.\nHave fun playing with those demonic gate.\n\n*Air Strikes are for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31743 which you should already have accept when doing this.",
            date = "2014-03-23T22:13:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31742#comments:id=1953285",
        },
