        {
            id = 1781943,
            score = 5,
            author = "onecrazykid",
            text = "Unlike many other quests since Cata with a \"boss\" target, the mobs in this one will turn gray if attacked by another person.  However, you will get quest credit even if you don't tag a mob at all and are in the general area.\n\nAt least that's what happened to me while I was fighting the mobs on the stairs since a DK decided to pull all the rituals at once and I noticed they turned gray.",
            date = "2012-12-15T16:21:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31760#comments:id=1781943",
        },
        {
            id = 1834296,
            score = 4,
            author = "Draewind",
            text = "I had this quest and searched the area and THE spot.  All that ever appeared was an abomination that began to march.  Could never find any teracatta anything with Soul Renders  (just them with captives and such).  I thought the quest might be bugged, so I abandoned it to pick it back up and reset it.  There was no quest to pick up ... ?  ANYWHERE\n\nCome to find out, I picked it up before the dailies reset.  After the reset, the mobs were no longer available and neither was the quest.  The following day, the quest was available again and the mobs were there.",
            date = "2013-03-25T16:20:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31760#comments:id=1834296",
