            author = "1020453",
            text = "Just fight you're way up the building. Kill all enemies and destroy all barricades using your flare gun on your way. On top of the building you will find Captain Doren, but he doesn't want to fight and flees instead with an airplane.\n\nAfter this a little event occurs where a Pandaren will appear and extract the bad feelings which posessed Nazgrim. This is the first time a player experiences that Pandaria is a living continent and that negative emotions will manifest themselves there (which is also the reason why the Sha appear there).\nThe whole place will now be in a new phase and was overrun by the manifestations. The follow-up-quest wants the player now to eliminate/kill these manifestations.",
