        {
            id = 1731603,
            score = 326,
            author = "fai1",
            text = "The map will send you anywhere where there are mantids. You actually need to go to 50.7, 41.6 to get Kovok.",
            date = "2012-10-04T20:09:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31808#comments:id=1731603",
        },
        {
            id = 1724274,
            score = 55,
            author = "Feranda",
            text = "This is one of the Klaxxi daily quests you can get from Klaxxi'vess. You can find Kovoc at 50.8, 40.9.\n\nCompleting this quest will give you Test Drive (http://www.wowhead.com/achievement=7314) achievement.",
            date = "2012-09-29T08:59:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31808#comments:id=1724274",
        },
        {
            id = 1733675,
            score = 37,
            author = "codeytherhino",
            text = "This quest is fun, but every time you leave Kovok you stay in combat for far too long.",
            date = "2012-10-06T18:02:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31808#comments:id=1733675",
        },
        {
            id = 1803786,
            score = 32,
            author = "13808",
            text = "Go west from where you get the quest a little bit and there's a path leading down to the sha-touched lands.  Kovok is a huge beetle right on the edge at about 50.80, 40.42.  He shows up as a gear on the minimap and your minimap quest arrow should point towards him if he's out of range.  Hop on and enjoy the ride.\n\nBy far the best ability is the third, Slice.  It'll kill most of a group in one hit and the rest with the second.  The first ability is a large AOE poison that is basically just for pulling as it doesn't do much damage.  The second ability is a knock-back, but that just makes it take longer.  With your powerful swipe nothing will last long against you.  The only problem I had initially was that the cone isn't very wide so some enemies would be off to the side and I would have to turn to finish them off.  I found out though that the range of swipe is pretty large so I start it as I am joining a group and back away slowly so they group more straight in front of me and it goes much more quickly.  If you get another big bug on you then just slice away, it won't hurt you too much.",
            date = "2013-01-25T02:40:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31808#comments:id=1803786",
        },
        {
            id = 1724003,
            score = 25,
            author = "lillbrorsan",
            text = "This is probably the best daily so far but nothing beats https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27779 :D",
            date = "2012-09-29T03:48:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31808#comments:id=1724003",
        },
    },
