            text = "This quest (along with all the \"plant this seed\" quests) becomes obsolete once you inherit the farim from Yoon - or rather, it gets replaced by the faction work orders.",
            date = "2013-03-06T19:30:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31941#comments:id=1823101",
