            author = "Bullchinian",
            text = "This can be picked up from the Emperor in the Jade Temple while still questing there. If you happen to miss picking it up before the Temple becomes an instance you can get the quest from Bolo in the Inn at Dawn's Blossom.\n\nTo get in to VotFW, fly to Grookin Hill and follow the road south to a bridge in to the Valley.",
