            author = "vambora",
            text = "This quest is given by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62667 AFTER you get the achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6540.\n\nDon't expect to get the quest from her before getting the achievement. If you're stuck in any part waiting for this quest, go back and do all the quests for the achievement then she will promptly give you the quest.",
