            text = "This quest can be a little misleading when the quest area is busy.   The Skyscreamer you need to save is being tormented by four Zandalari Arcweavers.    (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=69224)  You need to help kill them to get credit.",
            date = "2013-03-08T17:57:13-06:00",
