            text = "The runes are in the Violet Rise area on the Isle of Thunder ~ Coordinates 60, 70\n\nRunes are blue circles on the ground and you need to click on them.\n\nEmpty runes will not count towards the quest, the runes must contain a captive to count.  Its quite annoying as there sometimes are no captives at all and you have to run through the whole alliance site!",
            date = "2013-03-13T06:42:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32262#comments:id=1827872",
        },
        {
            id = 1828319,
