        {
            id = 1864464,
            score = -1,
            author = "genius13",
            text = "Seadragons have \"Water Spout\", which does quite a lot of frost damage and tosses you high in the air.  The falling damage can be avoided by kiting them out into the water and fighting them there.  They also have something akin to the hunter's Disengage, which can jump them back onto shore, so kite them far enough out to prevent that.  (Getting between them and the shore so their disengage takes them further out to sea may also work, but I didn't try that.)",
            date = "2013-06-09T03:33:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32274#comments:id=1864464",
        },
    },
