        {
            id = 5857650,
            score = 110,
            author = "HalfFroMan",
            text = "As of MoP Remix (Horde-side) this seems bugged and kicks you off the Thunderwing rather quickly regardless of what you seem to do...\n\nEDIT: I beat it. You just have to do TONS of damage and kill all three waves before the corner where it teleports you. Protip: do this as low level as possible (level 50 in MoP:Remix) and do it in GOOD GEAR! I was able to complete it on my ilvl 323 Level 70 Hunter by switching to Marksman and just being incredibly quick.",
