            text = "Deleted unhelpful grumbling - if you die on the ship, wait at the spirit healer and you will rez there. Terrorwing will take you back to the ship and drop you off so you can get back where you left off. This is not obvious, and some of us need the hint :D",
            date = "2013-04-16T16:48:32-05:00",
