        {
            id = 2313982,
            score = 1,
            author = "HarlWindwolf",
            text = "Scout Captain Elsia says:   Good, you are here.\nScout Captain Elsia says:   Regent Lord! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but...\nLor'themar Theron says:   Yes?\nScout Captain Elsia says:   The Alliance is waiting for us just across the courtyard.\nLor'themar Theron says:   Ahhh, so the grand lady of the Kirin Tor wants a fight, does she?\nLor'themar Theron yells:   Rangers! Advance!\nLor'themar Theron says:   I will deal with Proudmoore.\nShan Bu yells:   Taran Zhu! It does not matter how many you array against the Thunder King. Soon all will kneel before him.\nTaran Zhu yells:   YOU will kneel when you beg for my mercy, monster.\nLor'themar Theron yells:   One problem at a time, people. Focus on the Zandalari!\nLady Jaina Proudmoore yells:   Ignore the Horde - focus on the Zandalari guarding the door!\nTaran Zhu yells:   Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!\nScout Captain Elsia yells:   Regent Lord - more Zandalari approach from the mines!\nLor'themar Theron yells:   Damn their hides. Rangers! Hold this position!\nTaran Zhu yells:   Taoshi, get those doors open.\nTaran Zhu yells:   Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear.\nTaran Zhu yells:   Shan Bu! Again you try to create a God. When will you learn?\nShan Bu yells:   Who needs a God? We have the Thunder King!\nShan Bu yells:   Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here.\nTaran Zhu says:   Zandalari reinforcements are coming.\nTaran Zhu says:   Yalia - we need more healing! Taoshi - cover the rear!\nShan Bu yells:   Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor.\nTaran Zhu yells:   Face me, Shan Bu! Or is the court of the Thunder King a den of cowards?\nShan Bu yells:   The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan.\nNalak yells:   I am born of thunder!\nShan Bu yells:   Your \"Horde\" is a disgusting pack of animals, hardly worth enslaving.\nTaran Zhu yells:   Keep moving! Avoid the Storm-Lord's lightning!\nShan Bu yells:   I tire of your insolence! I will choke the life from you, impudent slave!\nTaran Zhu yells:   Auugh - kill him. Quickly!\nTaran Zhu yells:   Finish him!\n\nShan Bu yells:   I ... no... My emperor! My emperor, I have failed you!\n\nTaran Zhu says:   You see? No power of this world can trample the pure of spirit.\nTaoshi yells:   Lord Zhu! The Alliance - the Horde - all chaos is about to erupt out here!\nTaran Zhu says:   Like children.\nTaran Zhu says:   Taoshi! Hand me my weapon.\nTaoshi says:   My Lord... you are gravely wounded!\nTaran Zhu yells:   My weapon! Champion, with me. I want you to see this.\n\nLady Jaina Proudmoore yells:   Hand over the Archmage and I may yet allow you to walk out of here, Lor'themar.\nLor'themar Theron yells:   Proudmoore! You will release my people from the Violet Hold, or I will cut you down myself!\nLady Jaina Proudmoore yells:   Your people are legitimate prisoners of war. They orchestrated an attack on Darnassus from MY city-\nLor'themar Theron yells:   The Sunreavers knew NOTHING of Garrosh's raid on Darnassus!\nAethas Sunreaver shifts uncomfortably.\nTaran Zhu yells:   ENOUGH! There will be no more bloodshed today.\nTaran Zhu yells:   I see now why your Alliance and your Horde cannot stop fighting.\nTaran Zhu yells:   Every reprisal is itself an act of aggression, and every act of aggression triggers immediate reprisal.\nLady Jaina Proudmoore yells:   They have undermined EVERY attempt at peace!\nLor'themar Theron yells:   I must protect my sovereign people.\nTaran Zhu yells:   SILENCE! YOU must break the cycle.\nTaran Zhu yells:   It ends TODAY. Here. The cycle ends when you, Regent Lord, and you, Lady Proudmoore, turn from one another. And walk. Away.\nLor'themar narrows his eyes.\nJaina takes a deep breath.\nLor'themar Theron yells:   Rangers. Lower your weapons.\nScout Captain Elsia yells:   My Lord!\nLor'themar Theron says:   Do it.\nLady Jaina Proudmoore says:   Very well. We will stand down.\nVereesa Windrunner yells:   They killed my husband!\nLady Jaina Proudmoore says:   This won't bring him back.\nLady Jaina Proudmoore says:   But know this, \"Blood\" Elf: There can be no peace while Hellscream is Warchief of the Horde.\nLor'themar Theron says:   That is precisely why I wish to conserve our strength today.\nJaina's expression softens.\nLor'themar Theron says:   Lady.\nLady Jaina Proudmoore says:   Lord.\nLor'themar Theron yells:   Gather the wounded. Withdraw to the harbor.\nLady Jaina Proudmoore yells:   Everyone, regroup back at the camp. Our work here is done.\nTaoshi yells:   Lord Zhu!\nTaran Zhu says:   Champion, this cease-fire may not last, but remember what you have seen today.\nTaoshi says:   We must get you back to the monastery.\nTaran Zhu says:   Shan Bu's monstrosity remains at the foot of the palace. It must be stopped before it wreaks havoc across Pandaria.\nTaoshi says:   Yalia, take Lord Zhu to safety.\nTaoshi says:   Hero, it will be up to you to defeat the Storm Lord Nalak. You will have to marshal a small army!\nTaoshi says:   But after what I have seen today, I have faith in you.\nTaoshi says:   It has been a great honor to fight by your side. Thank you.\nYou bow before Taoshi.",
            date = "2016-03-13T14:09:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32279#comments:id=2313982",
        },
