            author = "Matokeagle",
            text = "Ok,  for those that are having some problems understanding this. This is the quest that leads to the [zone=6716 domain=www] This is a Solo Scenario. You will have 5 minutes to open as many chests as you can. These chests are clickable by everyone so no other keys or lockpicking skills are needed. Once you have used up the 5 min time period, you will be port back to Taoshi is. You will need a [item=94222 domain=www] in order to get this quest. By the way, you can very easily make 400G+ plus get tons of loot from here. Good luck and happy hunting.",
