        {
            id = 1833097,
            score = 14,
            author = "AtroposZ",
            text = "They drop off any troll in the beast pens, with a good drop rate, and can also be picked up off the ground in some of the buildings in the area.\n\nWhile you *can* use them on the elite Adolescent Direhorns, dont :) It causes them to aggro every time (with the raptors it has a few different effects, most of them are immediate aggro from what I found, but I could just have had a bad RNG streak). If you have the quest to kill 10 trolls, use them on the ones the trolls are riding, otherwise just do the solo raptors in the pens, they're by far the easiest.",
            date = "2013-03-23T05:43:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32298#comments:id=1833097",
        },
        {
            id = 1836758,
            score = 5,
            author = "tzakanel",
            text = "You will not be attacked while inside the special \"dome\" you get the quest from.\nSo you can use the item and run for your life inside the dome.\nDO NOT use the item inside the barrier - it will get consumed but it will not count.\n\nIt may get the beast friendly so you have to find another one but you can reuse it right after it goes back to it place.\nIf you use it on a raptor that is mounted, and the raptor becomes friendly, it will dismount the mob riding it.",
