        {
            id = 1794907,
            score = 2,
            author = "739009",
            text = "Upon killing Nalak for the first time you get a https://www.wowhead.com/item=93660, which is similar to https://www.wowhead.com/item=89317. Due to the changes Blizzard is going to make to how the tapping system works, the rewards for the quest these items start are probably not going to change, since it will be easy for everyone to (help) kill the boss, get the tap and get the Egg.\n\nYou will need level 90 to start the quest, but you don't have to be level 90 to recieve the item.\n\nGood luck in your hunt!",
