        },
        {
            id = 1829419,
            score = 1,
            author = "979563",
            text = "Used some horde as guinea pigs for this.\n\n(by /Chicken at them)\n\nCharging it causes it to rapid-fire purple explosions around itself which do some pretty serious damage. It's usually fatal without a healer nearby.",
