    [32489] = {
        {
            id = 1822674,
            score = 11,
            author = "715486",
            text = "For those running around forever hunting roaches, there are small groups to be found scattered all over that spawn.  I found that around the lake in the center of the Crag, they have more group spawn points.\n\nHere's waypoints to general spawn points as well.\n\n/way 51.96 78.86\n/way 50.38 83.56\n/way 54.47 81.28\n/way 47.24 80.61\n\n*edit* I don't know if I wasn't clear, but I'm talking about WHERE spawned groups are more likely to appear, not where general roaches appear.  As Pucurica said, yes they spawn everywhere, but you will find groups around the lake.",
            date = "2013-03-06T11:54:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32489#comments:id=1822674",
        },
        {
            id = 2028419,
            score = 9,
            author = "Auryan",
            text = "So after not receiving credit for all the roaches I was CLEARLY running over, I went to the Blizz bug report forums.  It seems that after the stat squish, the roaches have 40 health and it now takes 2-3 passes to \"kill\" a roach.  So do not go by that gruesome \"squish\" noise, pretend you're looking at super Florida cockroaches (I know whereof I speak) and stomp those suckers until the quest tracker registers it for credit.",
            date = "2014-11-12T11:08:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32489#comments:id=2028419",
        },
        {
            id = 1830735,
            score = 7,
            author = "Shoadowolf",
            text = "\"Ah, roaches! I once bought a pet roach in the Undercity.\"\nObiously a reference to https://www.wowhead.com/item=10393 which is sold by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8403 in Undercity! Edit: why the downrate? I was only giving a reference! :(",
            date = "2013-03-18T15:21:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32489#comments:id=1830735",
        },
        {
            id = 1794195,
            score = 4,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "No need to target the roaches individually or attack. Simply walk/run over them and you're credited for the 'crush'.\n\nNear the entrance, you'll find a few here and there scampering around. As you get further into Ihgaluk Crag, you'll find large groups of them that make the quest go a lot faster.",
            date = "2013-01-07T09:05:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32489#comments:id=1794195",
        },
        {
            id = 1824327,
            score = 3,
            author = "Melilithia",
            text = "You merely have to run/walk over the roaches to kill them; you can actually do this in your normal form as well, but obviously you want to be doing this in the saurok skin buff provided automatically during the quest.\n\nAlso, killing a roach does not seem to aggro any of the saurok, despite the cockroach being a sort of \"sacred animal\" to them. I squished one right next to a saurok, and he didn't even flinch. How odd.",
            date = "2013-03-08T06:01:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32489#comments:id=1824327",
        },
    },
