        {
            id = 1794418,
            score = 55,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "Cha'lat's Altar - SW Za'Tual (33.9, 76.1)\nTec'uat's Altar - NE Za'Tual (39.8, 65.2)\nPa'Check's Altar - SE Za'Tual (38.7, 78.6)",
            date = "2013-01-07T17:42:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32538#comments:id=1794418",
        },
        {
            id = 1821495,
            score = 4,
            author = "979563",
            text = "The \"Method\" in question is throwing a bomb into it.\n\nVery advanced",
            date = "2013-03-05T17:36:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32538#comments:id=1821495",
        },
        {
            id = 2869119,
            score = 4,
            author = "Maravec",
            text = "I found Pa'chek's Sacrificial Altar (https://www.wowhead.com/object=217203/pacheks-sacrificial-altar) using the link, but for those who don't use a coord addon, let me see if I can help you out. South of Za'Tual on the southern end of the island, there is a gigantic rib cage in the water, with large skull-like bits on shore. Pass the skeletal pieces, moving west, toward the stone stairs surrounded by trolls. Move up three sets of small stone steps, then veer right toward a large stone staircase patrolled by a Drakkari God-Hulk (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69200/drakkari-god-hulk). Veer right again, up a stone slope with vague steps; there should be a corral with a ring of Zandalari Prospects (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69269/zandalari-prospect) in a boxing match.\n\nPass the Prospects and veer right again, up another stone slope with vague steps. You'll see a Zandalari Speaker (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69136/zandalari-speaker) in an ornate tent structure. Spiritbinder Pa'check (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69256/spiritbinder-pachek) will be under a structure at the cliff's edge at the end of the path past the tent, passing on the tent's left.\n\nPlease let me know if I can add anything for clarity.",
            date = "2019-01-31T17:36:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32538#comments:id=2869119",
        },
    },
