            author = "Turpentine",
            text = "This is on the same terrace that houses the outdoor raid boss Nalak, BUT, you do not have to use the same access route when you're trying to get to Nalak.\n\nThere is a break in the wall on the right of the terrace and you can just walk in where the path meets the wall on the map.  Sneak or fight your way past a few mobs and the quest turn-in is hidden in a beam of light/mana field (as posted by others).",
            date = "2013-08-29T18:19:14-05:00",
