            text = "This confused me for a moment or two due to the quest saying \"We've been collecting mogu weaponry\". I thought I was supposed to get the weoponry but I didn't. When you kill one of the mobs a little button appears (see my screenshot). Click on the button and whallah! they get impaled with the polearm (see my other screenshot). Happy stabbing ;)",
