        {
            id = 1809954,
            score = 31,
            author = "Calesta",
            text = "When you enter the Swollen Vault, you'll see a 5x5 grid of pillars.  Most pillars are covered in purple lightning that does a substantial amount of damage.  Some pillars are lightning-free and you can safely jump to them.  These 'safe' pillars rotate in a pattern around the grid.  It appears that the sequence changes daily.\n\nIf you fall off the pillars, you'll end up on the floor below where you'll see several statues.  If you are near one of these statues a 'crush' animation will begin and you need to move away to avoid taking damage.  There is a set of stairs near the entrance that you can use to escape the floor area.",
            date = "2013-02-06T12:49:28-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32608#comments:id=1809954",
        },
        {
            id = 1839511,
