            id = 1822002,
            score = 96,
            author = "dlbert2000",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=94721 drops from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69461\nItoka is here (http://i.imgur.com/LjrYoXz.jpg)\nAfter you loot Itoka, go through this door (http://i.imgur.com/pz4XYt3.jpg)\nThen turn the quest in to this book (http://i.imgur.com/C36eZtf.jpg)\n\nYour server needs to be on Stage 4 for Itoka to spawn",
