        {
            id = 1835680,
            score = 17,
            author = "Milagros",
            text = "Itoka is at 57.84, 34.09\nCoords for the entrance of The Thunderforges: 58.67, 30.72\nand to turn in the quest --> 60.03, 28.26\nUpon completing the quest you'll receive https://www.wowhead.com/item=94553 which contains the blacksmithing plans below:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94552\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94571\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94567\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94569\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94570\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94568\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=94572",
            date = "2013-03-28T07:08:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32621#comments:id=1835680",
        },
        {
            id = 1847700,
            score = 5,
            author = "1007326",
            text = "You do not need to be exalted with the Black Prince to gain access to the area where you get this item, you just need to do the scenarios following your arrival on the isle.  I'm told you only have to finish up to the one where you hop across all the flying mounts but I do know the area is certainly open for players after you complete that series of scenarios.  These are available at the Sunreaver Onslaught base of operations.  I played a Horde character so the scenarios might be very different for Alliance.  Do not try to go through the gate at the Thunder Forge area as it will not open, go through the cave to the west of it.  When you reach Itoka make sure you do not accidently fall into the water near him when he turns immune to your attacks, just carefully approach the devices generating lightning nearby.  Once these are destroyed you can go back to whacking Itoka who drops the quest item as a reward for putting him out of his misery.  After you accept the quest from the quest item just proceed through the door to the west of where you found Itoka where you can finish the quest and get your new blacksmith recipes.  Happy crafting!",
            date = "2013-04-27T18:47:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32621#comments:id=1847700",
        },
    },
    [32627] = {
        {
