            date = "2013-03-17T06:43:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32642#comments:id=1830041",
        },
    },
    [32643] = {
        {
            id = 1823633,
            score = 36,
            author = "rogermw",
            text = "If you turn in this quest, and then do \"Work Order: Dominance Offensive I\" the same day, you will NOT get offered this quest as a follow up.\n\nDon't despair and dig up your crops, though!  You will get re-offered this quest on the following day the moment you harvest your first crop click on the blue ! over the Empty Crate next to your field.\n\n(EDIT: As of 5.4, the get-the-quest-automatically-by-harvesting-a-crop mechanism seems to be broken.  Be sure you click on the Empty Crate or you'll waste a day!)",
            date = "2013-03-07T10:14:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643#comments:id=1823633",
        },
        {
            id = 1822756,
            score = 12,
            author = "817836",
            text = "If you're looking for the quest turn-in, it's on a wagon on the sw corner of the farm.  It did not show correctly on my mini-map and was not easily seen.  After the turn-in, part I (planting) becomes available again.",
            date = "2013-03-06T13:06:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643#comments:id=1822756",
        },
        {
            id = 1859175,
            score = 4,
            author = "1123355",
            text = "It should be noted if you get a Bursting crop, DO NOT harvest until the next day. You must harvest all 8 after a daily reset.",
            date = "2013-05-28T10:49:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643#comments:id=1859175",
        },
        {
            id = 1878383,
            score = 1,
            author = "Schnoodledorfer",
            text = "Although it's not documented, Blizzard has now undone the changes made in a March 7, 2013 hotfix (http://us.battle.net/wow/en/blog/8953693): The way to obtain Work Order quests on the Sunsong Ranch farm has changed. The quests will be given while harvesting crops, or by interacting with the drop-off crate.\n\nNow, instead of starting with the https://www.wowhead.com/object=218765 or waiting until the crops are harvested, the Part II quest is automatically accepted as soon as the Part 1 quest  completes. That happens as soon as you plant enough crops and was the way these quests originally worked. Apparently due to an attempt to make it idiot-proof, it isn't even possible to avoid accepting Part II once you complete Part 1. (The window offering the quest opens automatically, there is no \"Decline\" button, and the \"X\" button to close the window is grayed out. I don't know if that part was true before March 7.) You won't see a blue exclamation point on the crate the second day because you will have already accepted the quest the first day. The exception is if you just completed the same Part II on the same day. In that case, you won't be offered the quest until the next day.\n\nIt still is possible to abandon the Part II quest and pick it up later. If you abandon the quest, the blue \"!\" will appear above the https://www.wowhead.com/object=218765. You can pick up the quest by clicking on the box, but again, you can't decline it once the window opens.",
            date = "2013-07-18T23:10:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643#comments:id=1878383",
        },
        {
            id = 3311065,
            score = 1,
            author = "Weezyyttv",
            text = "I am not sure if they did in the past but as of 9.0.5 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32642 does not give any reputation, but https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643 does give you 400 reputation towards the Dominance Offensive.",
            date = "2021-03-25T15:39:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32643#comments:id=3311065",
        },
    },
    [32644] = {
        {
            id = 1871537,
            score = 24,
            author = "bryanakperry",
            text = "This might be an \"everyone knows that\" kind of thing, but I didn't know, so I thought I'd post this:\nIf you are like me and don't raid or even group, like, ever, don't be scared of this. You aren't in a group. That's what a solo instance is, I guess. It still is hard, but you aren't grouped. Just to clarify.",
            date = "2013-06-28T08:52:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32644#comments:id=1871537",
        },
        {
            id = 1826781,
            score = 13,
            author = "eighty8",
            text = "Starts at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=67992 on the [zone=6507].\n\nIs a solo instance for Stage 2 in the Kirin Tor Offensive.\n\nStages for Instance are as follows:\n\nStage 1: Rendezvous with Ranger General https://www.wowhead.com/npc=67993\n\n0/1 Ride the Silver Covenant Hippogryph\n0/1 Fly with Ranger General https://www.wowhead.com/npc=67993 over the island.\n\nStage 2: Survive the Attack (paraphrased as I didn't get a screenshot)\n\nStage 3: Destroy the Barricades\n\n0/1 Destroy the Barricades and its defenders.\n\nStage 4: Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69531 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69532\n\n0/1 Kill  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69531\n0/1 Kill  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69532\n\nFinal Stage:  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69538 and his Spirit Mask\n\n0/1 Kill  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69538 and his Spirit Mask\n\nNotes:\nFor Stage 4, you must first kill Anki, and once he is dead, Pakutesh will dismount and become attackable.\n\nFor Arcanital Mara'kah, you need to fight inside the protective shield as the Spirit Mask casts https://www.wowhead.com/spell=140315 which does a LOT of damage per second as well as silences your spells.\n\nAlso, there is a potion on the table underneath where the Spirit Mask originally was that will cast an HoT spell on you which will be beneficial if you are low on health.",
            date = "2013-03-11T12:03:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32644#comments:id=1826781",
        },
        {
            id = 5871082,
            score = 13,
            author = "NotSombra",
            text = "Playing MoP Remix and Jaina wont give me this quest?",
            date = "2024-05-31T14:43:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32644#comments:id=5871082",
        },
        {
            id = 3173806,
            score = 12,
            author = "1967884",
            text = "Today, the queue didn't work for me. I had been in queue for 10 minutes, nothing happened. I used the portal to get back to the Townlong Steppes, and as I entered the main island the solo instance gave me the invitation.",
            date = "2019-11-26T22:56:49-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32644#comments:id=3173806",
        },
        {
            id = 5845760,
            score = 12,
