        {
            id = 1845598,
            score = 8,
            author = "Crotalidus",
            text = "If you get a Bursting Green Cabbage when you are completing part I, you have a choice to make: harvest it immediately, or wait until the next farming day when everything is ready to harvest.  If you harvest it immediately, it won't count for the follow-up quest, and unless you re-plant immediately after harvesting, you will be one Green Cabbage short the next day and won't be able to complete Part II until you harvest another Green Cabbage.  Since there isn't any point in harvesting it right away, my advice is wait until the next farming day when the rest of the crop is ready too.",
            date = "2013-04-21T15:02:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32649#comments:id=1845598",
        },
        {
            id = 1856182,
            score = 5,
            author = "651676",
            text = "As of 5.3 at least it appears you don't need factions at revered or even honoured (Australian spelling... inb4:) as long as they are visible as reputation bars in your interface.\n\nI'm neutral with Dominance Offensive and August Celestials and friendly with Golden Lotus and Shado-Pan and honoured with Klaxxi but I have all their work orders up and available after recruiting Farmer Yoon to the Tiller's Union.",
            date = "2013-05-22T20:44:37-05:00",
