            score = 40,
            author = "Intergalactic",
            text = "After entering the scenario, go forward and get the bomb on the left of the walkway, you'll see it on minimap as a cogwheel. 2 trolls attack after you exit from the starting building and the bomb is protected by 4 other trolls. Avoid or kill the huge patrollers on the walkway. Time consuming, but you may get a green if you kill them. After you get the bomb, take it to Velreesa (open the worldmap, you'll see a chatbubble where she is), you blow up the wall and now you have to kill the troll from the cinematic, War God Al'Chukla. Go trough the blown-up wall and head left avoiding or clearing trash until you reach the central walkway, he's up the stairs on the plateau, appears as skull on minimap. He only has 1 special skill, summons a thunderpillar, which draws you slowly towards it and explodes after a few seconds. Run away from the blue thunderpillar and you'll be fine. When he's dead take the portal next to Velreesa back to Jaina.\nSide fact: if your character dies at any moment, release spirit and you will be resurrected in 5 seconds in the building you started.\nSide fact 2 : after killing the thundertroll, if you walk up to the uppermost gate and you can see [ins]Shan Bu[/ins]'s healthbar on the other side with over 4 million hp. Managed to pull him somehow on my hunter character, it's not worth it tho, has no special abilities, just keeps pounding with his mace and drops absolutely nothing.",
            date = "2013-03-19T12:43:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32654#comments:id=1831237",
        },
        {
            id = 1813560,
            score = 26,
            author = "stym",
            text = "This is an obvious reference to a speech (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tear_down_this_wall!) by Ronald Reagan in Berlin on June 12, 1987 where he urged  Michael Gorbachev to destroy the Berlin wall.",
            date = "2013-02-14T12:49:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32654#comments:id=1813560",
        },
        {
            id = 1831282,
            score = 20,
            author = "Arrica42",
            text = "Mr. Hellscream, Tear down this wall!",
            date = "2013-03-19T13:43:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32654#comments:id=1831282",
        },
        {
            id = 1830869,
            score = 14,
            author = "716334",
            text = "Just finished this on live (Terenas EU) and it just seemed to stop after killing the boss. Doesn't say what to do next despite being marked as complete, so I went back through the courtyard and killed / looted the remaining trash mobs. Having done that I returned to Jaina at the top of the stairs and used the portal. This takes you back to the base established in the previous stage and I then got the instruction to hand in the quest to Jaina at her usual position.",
            date = "2013-03-18T20:47:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32654#comments:id=1830869",
        },
        {
            id = 1898920,
            score = 10,
            author = "Ballybog",
            text = "After completing the objectives, I tried to use the portal and it wouldn't let me. I simply left the instance and immediatly I was standing next to Jaina, and was able to turn in the quest.",
            date = "2013-09-16T14:57:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32654#comments:id=1898920",
        },
    },
    [32655] = {
        {
            id = 1838738,
            score = 50,
            author = "Arnen",
            text = "So, during stage five (where you have to navigate the large area with the mobs and the sentry totems), I ended up tripping several totems at once and drawing a ton of mobs to me.  So, I hit my rocket boots and ran past everything and hit feign death.\n\nUnfortunately, Taoshi was no longer with me!  I was pretty sure I was going to have to start over, and extremely frustrated (I cleared completely the wrong totems at the beginning, since I had a hard time seeing where I was supposed to go).  Then I went back to the boat, just to see if she was there -- and she was.\n\nTL;DR, if you lose track of Taoshi, go back to the beginning of the stage you're on.",
            date = "2013-04-03T22:32:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32655#comments:id=1838738",
        },
        {
            id = 1838206,
            score = 28,
            author = "Avareal",
            text = "**** THIS IS NOT A COMPLETE WALKTHROUGH.  INFORMATION WITHIN IS FROM PERSONAL EXPERIENCE HAVING JUST COMPLETED THE QUEST/SCENARIO ****\n\nHope this will help you along until someone does a more clear cut and precise guide.\n\nBroad overview of this quest as I did it:\n\nFirst, you will fly Thunderwing Doomslayer and use smoke bombs to disable sentry totems.  I didn't know exactly what I was trying to do, other than create a \"path\" for later on.  I'm not sure if it lets you get to the next stage or not if you don't do a good job, or whether you only have one go at it before the next part begins.  It's doesn't seem to matter match (as shown later in this post).\n\nNext you will follow around https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 and disable some Zandalari with your Extra Action button.  The ones you are to disable are marked, and its quite simple.  (Note: If you lose your stealth it's probably because you lost https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 from not disabling a mark Zandalari and going on ahead.  Find them again via backtracking, and if mobs are agro'd Taoshi puts down a purple smoke you can run in and restealth).  Continue on, following Taoshi and disabling mobs that are marked.  If you're not a Rogue, and never been one, you might get a kick out of this part.  Pardon the pun.  Taoshi will be putting bombs throughout the ship, if you're wondering what's going on.\n\nAnd then...  you will follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 down to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69482 .  He mostly does melee attacks with the occasional keg toss ability.  He might have a Drunken Wanderer help him out which will melee you as well.  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 puts recuperate on you if you get lowish on health, but remain cautious.  He's not all that easy if you have a low ilvl (460-470).  If you do happen to die, don't release.  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 will finish him off and you will rez at the docks to continue on.  If you release, you will be rezzed at the graveyard and will have to fly Thunderwing back to the ship from the graveyard and fight the Captain again.\n\nAnd then... after you kill the Captain, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 leaves you!  Just kidding.  But I had  to go back out the way you came in getting to Captain's Halu'kal (i.e. (up the stairs).   Then go North and jump off the ship (this is the way I went, you might be able to stay in the room you killed the Captain in and theres an exit down there. I didn't look, I just ran back upstairs and jumped off the ship.)  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69544 will be waiting, stealthed, on the docks for you.  After killing the Captain, there is an exit from that room.  Plain as sight!  It takes you right out to the docks to continue on the scenario.\n\nNavigate up to the skull on map to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69483.  You might have to walk through some sentry totem areas...i walked through them quickly and nothing happened.  So, avoid mobs.  Be careful.  Again this is not a walkthrough.  I'm sure you're not suppose to walk in the cyan circles....  this is why you threw down the smoke bombs in the beginning;  to clear a path.\n\nAnd then....kill the Gatekeeper... loot the orb.  Open the gate.  You're done!",
            date = "2013-04-02T19:58:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32655#comments:id=1838206",
        },
        {
            id = 3123484,
            score = 11,
            author = "jamesa2552",
            text = "Cant complete past stage 3 as of 8.1.5. When landing on the boat Taoshi just disappears and doesn't join you so you can assassinate and then destroy the siege weapons. I cannot find a work around. Have tried restarting dozens of times",
            date = "2019-05-22T01:44:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32655#comments:id=3123484",
        },
        {
            id = 3218244,
            score = 10,
            author = "Gaunter",
            text = "There's a workaround to the bugs in this quest - I previously couldn't complete it because Taoshi would phase through the floor and refuse to sabotage the siege weapons.\n\nThe solution that worked for me was pretending it was current content. Once you arrive on the ship with Taoshi, simply stay close to her and follow as she marks enemies to incapacitate. It's critical that you don't kill them! Walk up behind anyone Taoshi marks and a Sap icon will appear, click it to knock them out and she will continue along the ship to sabotage the weapons.\n\nContinue to follow her closely to the captain, and rudely interrupt his nap with murderous intent. Once you've completed this section, you're in the clear and can complete the quest as normal. Hope this helps anyone having issues!",
            date = "2020-07-19T12:02:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32655#comments:id=3218244",
        },
        {
            id = 5905408,
            score = 9,
            author = "CCwow",
            text = "During stage 3, on the boat. To make sure the scenario doesn't BUG.\n\nDo not kill the mobs. Make sure to follow Taoshi and incapacitate them with the sapping skill only.\n\nThis will prevent you from starting over several times ^^",
            date = "2024-07-26T01:35:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=32655#comments:id=5905408",
        },
    },
