        {
            id = 1846897,
            score = -8,
            author = "LazyRiver",
            text = "Just did this last night.\n\nWill just say, if you want specific information on the forge master kill, do a wowhead search on Itoka...someone posted a superb breakdown of the far from simple fight.\n\nThe other boss in this daily not so hard.\n\nBut a daily where you have to kill 2 bosses for 5 valor points?\n\n If you like challenges and progression great..you will have fun.\n\nIf you are trying to speed grind valor points avoid this one.",
            date = "2013-04-25T15:01:59-05:00",
