    [33134] = {
        {
            id = 1911084,
            score = 34,
            author = "827693",
            text = "I have too many level 90s so i made this macro to tell me easily if i've completed the weekly quest for my seals.\n\n/run for k, v in pairs({WarforgedSeals = 33134}) do print(format(\"%s: %s\", k, IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(v) and \"\\124cFFFF0000Completed\\124r\" or \"\\124cFF00FF00Not Completed Yet\\124r\")) end\n\nafter running it looks like:\nWarforgedSeals: Completed\nor\nWarforgedSeals: Not Completed Yet",
            date = "2013-10-22T11:37:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33134#comments:id=1911084",
        },
        {
            id = 2013159,
            score = 18,
            author = "Silden",
            text = "As of Patch 6.0.2 you can complete this quest as many times as you want",
            date = "2014-10-15T06:02:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33134#comments:id=2013159",
        },
        {
            id = 2344152,
            score = 11,
            author = "jjanchan",
            text = "This quest grants one of the extra roll currencies that was introduced in Mists of Pandaria.  It allows you to roll (at a cost of 1 currency per roll) for an extra chance at loot on certain world, raid or dungeon bosses.\n\nThis extra loot is granted directly to the person rolling and is not part of the group/party's loot for that boss.  The majority of the time the roll does not yield loot - when this is the case, gold is granted instead.  Certain currencies also can grant pets or mounts as part of the bonus loot - this will vary depending on boss (a list of mounts and pets you can bonus roll for is listed later in this comment).\n\nThere is protection for bad luck on bonus rolls.  As per a blue post:\nWhenever you use a bonus roll and you don’t get any loot, your chance of getting loot on the next roll will increase. This increased probability won’t be reset until some loot is awarded, and this is independent of the boss that is being killed.\nThe bad luck streak protection will carry over and continue to increase the probability from boss to boss and instance to instance and won't reset until you get some loot.\n\nFor all currencies, World Bosses will only allow a single roll a week.  This can be on any kill - if you kill a boss more than once and pass on rolling the first time, you will still have the option of doing so on a subsequent kill that week.\nFor most currencies you can kill bosses in a single or multiple lockouts/difficulties (kill a boss on both Heroic and Normal, or a Heroic boss twice) to also get a bonus roll chance EACH time.  For example, you can kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=76877 on Heroic difficulty twice, and while you will be able to get loot directly from the boss only once, you can bonus roll both times for extra chances at loot.\nThe above is NOT true for Mythic raids however - those lockouts prevent you from doing multiple bosses in one week.\n\nThe currencies listed can be found on the currency tab in your character screen.  Below is a table summarizing the currency types, including sources for each.\nNOTE: NPC locations can be seen on a by mousing over the zone name in the \"Source\" column.\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100% cellpadding=4]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]Legion[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[td width=45% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]Eligible Raids/Bosses\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Cap\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=1273]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]\nObtainable (maximum 3 per week) from [npc=111243 domain=legion] (Dalaran - Legion) for various currencies, as below.\n[table border=0 width=100%]\n[tr]\n[td width=46%][/td][td width=18%]1st[/td][td width=18%]2nd[/td][td width=18%]3rd[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Gold[/td][td]1000[/td][td]2000[/td][td]4000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Order Resources[/td][td]2500[/td][td]5000[/td][td]10000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[/td]\n[td width=30%]\n[zone=8025 domain=legion]\n[zone=8026 domain=legion]\nMythic dungeons\nLegion World Bosses:\n[npc=109943 domain=legion]\n[npc=109331 domain=legion]\n[npc=110378 domain=legion]\n[npc=99929 domain=legion]\n[npc=108879 domain=legion]\n[npc=108829 domain=legion]\n[npc=110321 domain=legion]\n[npc=107544 domain=legion]\n[npc=108678 domain=legion]\nThe Soultakers (http://legion.wowhead.com/npcs/humanoids/name:soultakers)\n[npc=112350 domain=legion]\n\n[br]\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]10\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100% cellpadding=4]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]Warlords of Draenor[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[td width=45% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]Eligible Raids/Bosses\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Cap\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=994]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]A)  Sold by vendors:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=95424 (Tanaan Jungle (/npc=95424#map class=mouseover)) - 240-300g*\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=96130 (Tanaan Jungle (/npc=96130#map class=mouseover)) - 240-300g*\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=87391 (Stormshield (/npc=87391#map class=mouseover)) - 300g\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=88570 (Warspear (/npc=88570#map class=mouseover)) - 300g\n\n*NOTE - Cost from vendors in Tanaan vary with reputation level with [faction=1849], with lowest cost being 240g at Exalted reputation.\n\nB)  Obtained from garrison missions:\n\n[mission=358]\n[mission=359]\n\n[/td]\n[td width=30%]\n\n[zone=6996]\n[zone=6967]\nDraenor World Bosses:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=81252\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=81535\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=87493\n\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]20\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=1129]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]A) One per week can be obtained from [building=10] in your garrison.\nSpeak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=79815 (H)/https://www.wowhead.com/npc=77377 (A) to obtain your weekly seal.\n*NOTE - This seal counts as 1 of the maximum 3 seals you can obtain per week.\n\nB)  Obtainable (maximum 3 per week) from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=88570 (Warspear (/npc=88570#map class=mouseover))/https://www.wowhead.com/npc=87391 (Stormshield (/npc=87391#map class=mouseover)) for various currencies, as below.\n[table border=0 width=100%]\n[tr]\n[td width=46%][/td][td width=18%]1st[/td][td width=18%]2nd[/td][td width=18%]3rd[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Gold[/td][td]500[/td][td]1000[/td][td]2000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Garrison Resources[/td][td]1000[/td][td]2000[/td][td]4000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Honor[/td][td]500[/td][td]1000[/td][td]2000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr][td]Apexis Crystals[/td][td]500[/td][td]1000[/td][td]2000[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n*NOTE - If you already obtained 1 from your [building=10], only 2 more can be obtained for currency that week.\n\nC)  One seal obtainable for completing the Timewalking Bonus Event quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=39020 (during Burning Crusade Timewalking, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=39021 (during Wrath of the Lich King Timewalking) or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40792 (during Cataclysm Timewalking).  The seals are in addition to the 3 seals per week otherwise obtainable.\n[/td]\n\n[td width=30%]\n\n[zone=7545]\nTanaan Jungle World Boss:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=94015\nMythic Dungeons\n\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]10\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br][br]\n[table border=1 width=100% cellpadding=4]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]Mists of Pandaria[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[td width=40% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Eligible Raids/Bosses\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Cap\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=697]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]\nA)  Sold by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64607 in Townlong Steppes (/npc=64607#map class=mouseover) for the cost of 20 [currency=738] each.  Use the following macro to purchase them quickly and easily: /run BuyMerchantItem(1,1)\n\nB)  Dropped by various rare spawns and summoned mobs on the Isle of Thunder.\n[/td]\n[td width=30%]\n[zone=6125]\n[zone=6297]\n[zone=6067]\nPandaria World Bosses:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=62346\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=60491\n[br]\n\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]20\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]Sold by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73305 on the Timeless Isle (/npc=73305#map class=mouseover) for the cost of 1000 [currency=777] each.\n[/td]\n[td width=30%][zone=6622]\nIsle of Thunder World Boss:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=69099\nIsle of Giants World Boss:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=69161\n\n[br]\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]20\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=20%][currency=776]\n[/td]\n[td width=40%]Weekly quest which grants 3 seals for the cost of 50 [currency=738] total.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=33133, available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63996, ground floor in Shrine of the Two Moons (/npc=63996#map class=mouseover)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=33134, available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=64029, ground floor of Shrine of the Seven Stars (/npc=64029#map class=mouseover)\n\n[/td]\n[td width=30%]\n[zone=6738]\nTimeless Isle World Bosses:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=71952\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=71953\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=71955\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=71954\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=72057\n[br]\n\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]20\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br][br]\nBelow I have compiled some data on pets, mounts and other drops from bosses (both World and Raid bosses).\nThe \"Bonus Roll\" column notes whether the item in question is obtainable from a bonus roll (note that you can USE a bonus roll on all bosses, but you will not necessarily be able to get certain pets and mounts on the bonus roll).\nNOTE: World Boss locations can be seen on a by mousing over the zone name in the \"Source\" column.\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100%]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]MOUNTS[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Mount\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Bonus Roll\nMount\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=87777\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60410\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6125]\nNormal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=89783\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62346\nWorld Boss\nValley of the Four Winds (/npc=62346#map class=mouseover)\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=697]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=87771\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=60491\nWorld Boss\nKun-Lai Summit (/npc=60491#map class=mouseover)\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=697]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=93666\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68476\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nNormal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=95059\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69712\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nNormal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=95057\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69099\nWorld Boss\nIsle of Thunder (/npc=69099#map class=mouseover)\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=94228\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69161\nWorld Boss\nIsle of Giants (/npc=69161#map class=mouseover)\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=104253\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71865\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nMythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=116660\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=77325\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6967]\nMythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=116771\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=87493\nWorld Boss\nSpires of Arak\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=123890\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=91331\nRaid Boss\n[zone=7545]\nMythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\n[hr]\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100%]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]PETS[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Pet\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Bonus Roll\nPet\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=94574\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=70083\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=68476\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=94125\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69748\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Council of Elders (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=69134/kazrajin)\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nLFR\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes*\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n*NOTE: In Normal or Heroic mode, this drops from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69944 trash mobs and cannot be bonus rolled.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=94835\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=70144\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69712\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=97959\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71199\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69017\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nONLY LFR\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=97960\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71200\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69017\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nONLY Normal and Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr][tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=94152\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69820\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=69427\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6622]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=752]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=104163\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73351\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71734\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nONLY LFR and Normal\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=776]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=104162\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73350\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71734\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nONLY Normal, Heroic and Mythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=776]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=104158\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73352\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71504\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic, Mythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=776]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=104165\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73354\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Paragons of the Klaxxi (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=71161)\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic, Mythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=776]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop: https://www.wowhead.com/item=127749\nPet: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=94623\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=90316\nRaid Boss\n[zone=7545]\nLFR, Normal, Heroic, Mythic\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Yes\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center][currency=1129]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\n[hr]\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100%]\n[tr][td width=100% align=center colspan=4]MISCELLANEOUS[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]Drop\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Source\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]Bonus Roll\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]Currency\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=35% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=105751\n(contains [transmog-set=1790])\n[/td]\n[td width=30% align=center]Kor'kron Dark Shaman (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=71859)\nRaid Boss\n[zone=6738]\nNormal, Heroic, Mythic\nONLY drops for Shamans\n[/td]\n[td width=10% align=center]No\n[/td]\n[td width=25% align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]",
