    [33211] = {
        {
            id = 1878329,
            score = 1129,
            author = "Stonehearth",
            text = "I did all the research, so you don't have to!\n\nThis Horde ship was crafted by goblins. Originally intended to bring Thrall and Aggra to the Maelstrom, the ship was destroyed in a surprise attack by the Alliance.\n\nDraka's Fury\nHellscream's Fury\nAggra's Fury\nDurotan's Fury\n\nWhat are undead murlocs called?\n\nGorlocs\nMur'ghouls\nWolvar\nMur'liches\n\nWhat is the name of Tirion Fordring's gray stallion?\n\nAshanor\nMistsilver\nFeonir\nMirador\n\nWhich of these is the correct name for King Varian Wrynn's first wife?\n\nTiffin Windemere Wrynn\nTherese Anne Wrynn\nTherese Angharad Wrynn\nTiffin Ellerlan Wrynn\n\nWho was the first satyr to be created?\n\nPeroth'arn\nGaraxxas\nXavius\nVyletongue\n\nBefore Ripsnarl became a worgen, he had a family. What was his wife's name?\n\nEmma Harrington\nCalissa Harrington\nVanessa Whitehall\nKatrina Whitehall\n\nThis structure, located in Zangarmarsh was controlled by naga who sought to drain a precious and limited resource: the water of Outland.\n\nSnakecoil Cavern\nSerpentine Basin\nCoilfang Reservoir\nSpiralfang Cistern\n\nOne name for this loa is \"Night's Friend\"\n\nShirvallah\nKimbul\nMueh'zala\nShadra\n\nThis defender of the Scarlet Crusade was killed while slaying the dreadlord Beltheris\n\nFellari Swiftarrow\nHolia Sunshield\nYana Bloodspear\nValea Twinblades\n\nBrown-skinned orcs first began showing up on Azeroth several years after the Third War, when the Dark Portal was reactivated. What are these orcs called?\n\nMag'har\nFelblood\nMok'Nathal\nFel orc\n\nSuccubus demons revel in causing anguish, and they serve the Legion by conducting nightmarish interrogations. What species is the succubus?\n\nEred'ruin\nSayaad\nShivarra\nEredar\n\nWhile working as a tutor, Stalvan Mistmantle became obsessed with one of his students, a young woman named Tilloa. What was the name of her younger brother?\n\nBilly\nWilliam\nGiles\nTobias\n\nWho was the mighty proto-dragon captured by Loken and tranformed into Razorscale?\n\nGalakrond\nVeranus\nZeptek\nVyletongue\n\nThis emissary of the Horde felt that Silvermoon City was a little too bright and clean.\n\nCheneta\nKristine Denny\nTatal\nDela Runetotem\n\nThis queen oversaw the evacuation of her people after the Cataclysm struck and the Forsaken attacked her nation.\n\nQueen Lia Greymane\nQueen Malia Greymane\nQueen Liria Greymane\nQueen Mia Greymane\n\nNot long ago, this frail Zandalari troll sought to tame a direhorn. Although he journeyed to the Isle of Giants, he was slain in his quest. What was his name?\n\nMaaka\nGrimath\nTalak\nRa'wiri\n\nArthas's death knights were trained in a floating citadel that was taken by force when many of them rebelled against the Lich King. What was the fortress's name?\n\nAcherus\nNaxxanar\nKolramas\nNaxxramas\n\nWhite wolves were once the favored mounts of which orc clan?\n\nWhiteclaw clan\nWarsong clan\nFrostwolf clan\nIcefang clan\n\nIn Taur-ahe, the language of the tauren, what does lar'korwi mean?\n\nSharp claw\nRazor tooth\nSharp tooth\nRazor claw\n\nName the homeworld of the ethereals.\n\nK'aresh\nXarodi\nKhu'ral\nXoroth\n\nWho was the first death knight to be created on Azeroth?\n\nTeron Gorefiend\nArthas Menethil\nAlexandros Mograine\nKoltira Deathweaver\n\nIn the assault on Icecrown, Horde forces dishonorably attacked Alliance soldiers who were busy fighting Scourge and trying to capture this gate.\n\nCorp'rethar\nAldur'thar\nAngrathar\nMord'rethar\n\nWhat evidence drove Prince Arthas to slaughter the people in Stratholme during the Third War?\n\nTainted soil\nTainted wildlife\nTainted water\nTainted grain\n\nWho is the current leader of the gnomish people?\n\nGelbin Mekkatorque\nMillhouse Manastorm\nSicco Thermaplugg\nFizzcrank Fullthrottle\n\nMalfurion Stormrage helped found this group which is the primary druidic organization of Azeroth\n\nCrimson Ring\nEmerald Circle\nEarthen Ring\nCenarion Circle\n\nThe draenei like to joke that in the language of the naaru, the word Exodar has this meaning\n\nDefective elekk turd\nCrystal death trap\nWorthless elekk dung\nRadioactive biohazard\n\nThane Kurdran Wildhammer recently suffered a tragic loss when his valiant gryphon was killed in a fire. What was this gryphon's name?\n\nSwiftwing\nSharpbeak\nSky'ree\nStormbeak\n\nBefore she was raised from the dead by Arthas to serve the Scourge, Sindragosa was a part of what dragonflight?\n\nRed dragonflight\nBlue dragonflight\nGreen dragonflight\nBronze dragonflight\n\nThe Ironforge library features a replica of an unusually large ram's skeleton. What was the name of this legendary ram?\n\nGorehoof\nToothgnasher\nBloodhorn\nSteelmauler\n\nName the titan lore-keeper who was a member of the elite Pantheon\n\nAman'Thul\nNorgannon\nEonar\nKhaz'goroth\n\nWhat did the dragon aspects give the night elves after the War of the Ancients?\n\nTeldrassil\nWell of Eternity\nNordrassil\nMoonwells\n\nFormerly a healthy paladin, this draenei fell ill after fighting the Burning Legion and becoming one of the Broken. He later became a powerful shaman.\n\nVelen\nAkama\nMaraad\nNobundo\n\nWho were the three young twilight drakes guarding the twilight dragon eggs in the Obsidian Sanctum?\n\nTenebron, Vesperon and Shadron\nTenebron, Vesperon and Halion\nTheralion, Shadron and Abyssion\nTheralion, Halion and Abyssion\n\nWhat phrase means \"Thank you\" in Draconic, the language of the dragons?\n\nBorela mir\nBelan shi\nAvral shi\nAlena mir\n\nBefore the original Horde formed, a highly contagious sickness began spreading rapidly among the orcs. What did the orcs call it?\n\nScarlet fever\nBlood pox\nCrimson fever\nRed pox\n\nWhat is the highest rank bestowed on a druid?\n\nShaman\nStormcaller\nArchdruid\nFar seer\n\nWhose tomb includes the inscription \"May the bloodied crown stay lost and forgotten\"?\n\nPrince Arthas Menethil\nKing Llane Wrynn\nUther the Lightbringer\nKing Terenas Menethil II\n\n*as of 5.4 PTR\n**speeling(!) corrections, thank you krazykenny666 (http://www.wowhead.com/user=krazykenny666), solitha (http://www.wowhead.com/user=solitha)",
            date = "2013-07-18T18:54:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33211#comments:id=1878329",
        },
        {
            id = 1878325,
            score = 82,
            author = "Stonehearth",
            text = "If you close the dialogue box, a fresh question will appear.",
            date = "2013-07-18T18:40:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33211#comments:id=1878325",
        },
