            author = "Pocahuntess",
            text = "If you have completed this quest once, you can mail the book that Kairoz rewards you at turn in to your alts and not have to spend an additional 500 timeless coins. I usually just leave it in the alts mail until I have the quest and upon taking it out of the mail, I get credit for obtaining it. Don't know if this is intended.",
