        {
            id = 1888714,
            score = 4,
            author = "blupache",
            text = "You purchase the https://www.wowhead.com/item=103977 for 500 Timeless Coins from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=73305\n\nOn PTR currently, handing in the quest lets you keep the Time-Worn Journal you bought and gives you a second one - meaning you can then return the one you bought to get your 500 Timeless Coins back.\n\nOn live you cannot return the book after completing the quest.\n\nYou'll get 500 Timeless Coins from the hand-in tho, and a non-returnable copy of the Journal, so you'll at least break even.",
