        {
            id = 1894751,
            score = 11,
            author = "Teiresias911",
            text = "The rares come around fast enough for people to tag them ASAP.  So, if you happen to find a rare (or places where a few rares spawn) then it might be best to just hang around in that area until respawn.  If you spend your time running around hoping to find one that just showed up, odds are 20+ people have beat you to him.\n\nNow, if you can get a few hits on the mob before they die, you can still loot.  However, there's normally a good mix of horde/alliance coming together to bring the rare down and you might miss your chance to loot if the opposite faction decides to clear out anything red.\n\nA good place to camp is around 44,84 on the island.  This area has about 4 rares within a short distance.\n\nThe names and APPROXIMATE coords are:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=72909 40, 82 (surrounded by a circle of smaller worms)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=72193 34, 85 (off the dock, very large beast)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=71919 37, 77 (middle of nearby town, will spawn when 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=71908 are killed)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=72245 47, 87 (off the south shore, in the water completely)\n\nFor a full list and locations of all the island's rares, check out the 5.4 section of the Wowhead Rare Elites of Pandaria guide (http://www.wowhead.com/guide=1132/glorious-rare-elites-of-pandaria#5-4-timeless-isle-rare-elites)\n\nBe quick, be nimble, be ready.",
            date = "2013-09-10T18:10:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33334#comments:id=1894751",
        },
        {
            id = 1990159,
            score = -6,
            author = "saturasxc",
            text = "This is one of the worst quest ever made. I dont take this q anymore, because I dont have all day to kill 5 ^&*!ing low HP rares which are killed 10-15sec after some #$%^&* announce them in general.",
            date = "2014-08-10T05:06:35-05:00",
