            text = "(Had begun writing a post.)\n\nGetting there (Timeless Isle)\n\n1) Fly there (probably not a good idea first time, if you intend to quest)\n2) Players are first introduced to the Timeless Isle via the quest [90] A Flash of Bronze...\n\nwhich starts automatically upon entering their faction's shrine in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\n[90] A Flash of Bronze\n[90] Journey to the Timeless Isle (use [Curious Bronze Timepiece], disappear on usage).\n\nAt the landing point is a flight path, which can then be used for return trips to the isle.\nInitially you have to do these quests (from memory):\n\nA Timeless Tour\nThe Essence of Time\nand\nTime in Your Hands",
            date = "2013-09-11T18:37:57-05:00",
