        {
            id = 1895900,
            score = 99,
            author = "Netherspark",
            text = "During the PTR there was actually dialog in this cinematic, and it was much easier to understand what was actually happening. If anyone's interested it went something like this:\n\nThrall and Saurfang walk up to Orgrimmar's rear gate, trying to enter the city but the Kor'kron guards say something like \"we don't serve you any more, get lost\". Then Nazgrim appears and after some thought, gives the Kor'kron a bogus order, telling them they're needed elsewhere. The Kor'kron are confused but follow the order anyway.\n\nNazgrim then turns his back, allowing Thrall and Saurfang to enter the city and telling them they may not like what they find.",
            date = "2013-09-11T21:21:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33337#comments:id=1895900",
        },
        {
            id = 1898694,
            score = 79,
            author = "smackthekids",
            text = "IMPORTANT: This is part 1 of 6 of a weekly quest chain that begins each week by collecting 50 epoch stones; therefor putting this quest off during week-1 of the new 5.4 Patch and waiting until the next week to complete it, you will not be able to advance into the 2nd part of the quest chain during week-2 without waiting another week!\n\nOnce you have completed any 1 of the 6 parts to the quest chain during a given week, you must wait until the following week to again collect 50 epoch stones and resume the next step in the quest chain.\n\nGet it done before the weekly reset, to ensure each week you can be on the latest part of the quest!",
            date = "2013-09-16T04:00:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=33337#comments:id=1898694",
        },
        {
