            text = "sykopat on 2013/09/29 (Patch 5.4.0)\nIn LFR you need to have cleared the wing, but in normal you only need to be inside. This is probably to avoid ppl just entering and leaving the group immediately.\n\nSince this is why people are here most likely queing for LFR then going wtf do you mean \"you can't do that now?\"\n Push this tot he top so people don't have to search through the dribble",
