            author = "Emaziz",
            text = "All in one TomTom macro, for your convenience:\n/way 35.04, 29.45\n/way 28.01, 72.08\n/way 26.69, 52.15\n/way 58.11, 46.66\n/way 49.80, 70.15\n/way 43.41, 55.88\n/way 37.52, 74.19\n/way 22.83, 29.31\n/way 30.19, 45.53\n/way 66.18, 72.31\n/way 63.89, 50.60\n/way 53.00, 60.79\n\nThanks to Centrisian for posting co-ords.",
