            author = "926948",
            text = "Well, that's it for me then. Looks like I'm not going to be completing this event :V\n\nCall me a pansy, but I have a hard time justifying:\n\na: Maarad condoning me poisoning people's food in vengeance for the death of Enohar's sister, and;\n\nb: My Paladin doing the poisoning.\n\nNice job, Blizz.",
