            score = 4,
            author = "1034144",
            text = "Am stuck in a loop. Took this along with the other three available quests. This and \"Under Siege\" are not possible to turn in after Thrall goes down into the valley. Abandoned quest, tried again, still submission of quest appears on the upper True Horde camp on the map, still no Thrall there, still no submit quest question mark over Thrall's head when I go back to him and Okrilla.\n\nKeeping quests till post-patch? What the gnell?\nMust I reach level 100 for completion?",
            date = "2014-10-17T22:32:01-05:00",
