        {
            id = 2012972,
            score = 5,
            author = "Stompa",
            text = "I was a little confused because there were no flags in my inventory as part of this quest.  The new game mechanic means there is no item to \"use\"  - rather, look for the glowing flag out line in the spot where you should plant it, and simply click the outline to make it happen.",
            date = "2014-10-14T22:09:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=35751#comments:id=2012972",
        },
        {
            id = 2014389,
            score = 5,
            author = "Krastopic",
            text = "When you pick up this quest, also pick up the following quests to do at the same time:\n\nLunatic Lieutenants (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35750)\nRansacking Nethergarde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35761)\n\nFor this quest, look for the new game feature where you will see the outline of the flag.  Click on the outline and you plant the flag.\n\nTo find Nethergrade Keep, fly to the northeast of where Thrall gives you the quest.  Assuming you are doing all of the quests at the same time, here is the order for all three quests:\n\nRukah's Battleplan, 57,18 - Pick Up off of Rukah after kill (Lunatic Lieutenants)\nNeka's Poison Flack, 59,18 - On the picnic table, highlighted (Ransacking Nethergrade)\nFlag Planted Outside Main Keep, 60,16 - Click on outline of flag (Attack on Nethergrade)\nOverseer Struk's Shield, 61,20 - laying on ground highlighted (Ransacking Nethergrade)\nFlag planted at Nethergarde entrance, 63,23 - Click on outline of flag (Attack on Nethergrade)\nFlag planted in the center of Nethergarde, 62,19 - Click on outline of flag (Attack on Nethergrade)\nAitokk's Axe, 62,15 - Inside building, in the door frame next to Aitokk's body. Axe is roughly at eye level for your toon. (Ransacking Nethergrade)\nMokrik's Battleplan, 63,13 - Pickup after the kill (Lunatic Lieutenants)\nGar's Battleplan, enter at 60,15 - Inside the building, go to the third floor Pickup after the kill (Lunatic Lieutenants)\n\nYou will note that the flags which you have to plant for the Attack on Nethergrade will have the new outline shading to help you find the spot to plant the flag.\n\nThe Overseer Struk's Shield is laying on a boot at a slight angle in the middle of the rubble of a building.\n\nNeka is already dead.  Her poison flask is on the table.  You do not have to kill her to pick up the flask.\n\nLike Neka, Master Aitokk is already dead.  You do not have to kill him to pick up the axe.  The axe is in the door frame next to the body.\n\nYou can pick up the bombs thrown by Mokrik at the start of the fight and an icon will appear and you can throw a bomb back at him doing reasonable damage.  Just run over the bomb to pick it up.",
            date = "2014-10-16T22:36:38-05:00",
