            text = "This quest is best accomplished if you do it as a group of quests including:\n\nOkrilla's Revenge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35764)\nToothsmash the Annihilator (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35760)\nDeath to the Dreadmaul (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35762)\n\nWhile you are killing ogres for Death to Dreadmaul, if you travel the route of the cooking cauldrons which you will be poisoning you will encounter everything for the above three quests including this one.\n\nThe first cooking pot is located at 44,31.  The second is at 44,35 which is also where you will find Toothsmash the Annihilator.  The final cooking pot is located at 43,37.\n\nTo poison the pot, get close and click on it.",
            date = "2014-10-18T17:19:55-05:00",
