        {
            id = 2014353,
            score = -1,
            author = "Krastopic",
            text = "This quest should be picked up at the same time you get the two quests from Thrall which are:\n\nUnder Siege (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35746)\nAttack of the Iron Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35745)\n\nAll of these quests are located to the northwest of Shattered Landing where you pick up the quests.  On top of a hill, in the area where the Iron Demolishers are located (which you will destroy as part of the Under Siege quest), at location 62/37 you will find NPC Archmage Khadgar and next to him is the \"Telescope\".  Click on the scope and enjoy the cinematic showing Iron Horde pouring from the gate in the Blasted Lands.  Quest complete.",
