        {
            id = 2013673,
            score = 7,
            author = "zenithstorm",
            text = "If you abandon this quest for whatever reason, you can pick it up again at the Hero's Call Board.\nIf you can't click on the portal you need to take to get to the Blasted Lands, try abandoning the quest and picking it up again.\nThe portal is the one at the bottom of the spiral ramp, not the one to the Hellfire Peninsula that is next to you when you teleport to Stormwind.",
