    [36499] = {
        {
            id = 2011836,
            score = 23,
            author = "1133367",
            text = "The portal is near the Mage trainer in the Cleft of Shadows  (where the Blasted Lands portal previously was), not in the Drag itself.",
            date = "2014-10-12T03:27:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499#comments:id=2011836",
        },
        {
            id = 2880698,
            score = 19,
            author = "jacjacjacky",
            text = "As of Patch 8.1.5 the https://www.wowhead.com/item=111660 is STILL OBTAINABLE!\nFollow the steps below to obtain, rather than run around aimlessly for hours like I did.\n\nFIRSTLY  - It does NOT matter whether you have completed your Garrison quests, got your Garrison Hearthstone and completed the WoD quest chain. You can still pick this quest up.\nI was also lvl 120.\n\nTo start - head to the Stranglethorn Vale Zepplin in Orgrimmar. You want to catch this to Stranglethorn Vale now that they have gotten rid of the portals to the Blasted Lands.\nFly to the Dark Portal.\nOnce there head east to Shattered Landing on the beach. You will then find a small Horde outpost on a hill.\nYou’ll know you’re in the right place as you’ll see the Zepplin hovering above your head.\nThrall will be there waiting for you (coords 71.8, 47.8), with the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=35745 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=35746 quests ready. You need to accept both quests.\nThe third quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36382 starts with Rokhan and is just to Thralls left.\n https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499 the original starter quest is no longer available.\n\nHope this saves everyone some time!\nHappy Pet Battling!",
            date = "2019-04-07T16:01:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499#comments:id=2880698",
        },
        {
            id = 2039582,
            score = 17,
            author = "SpareSimian",
            text = "The followup quests are no longer available. I did them this weekend on two Alliance characters but my Horde character was only able to turn this in and wasn't able to get the next quest. Too bad, as he still had some 496 Timeless Isle gear that could have benefited from the 515 upgrades.\n\nEdit: The problem was that I had the quest to attack https://www.wowhead.com/quest=34398, which hides the subsequent quests. Drop the Dark Portal quest and you'll see the quests in Blasted Lands. Or turn in the Dark Portal quest (ie. complete the intro series through the Tanaan Jungle), you'll once again see and be able to complete the Blasted Lands quests.",
            date = "2014-11-19T03:32:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499#comments:id=2039582",
        },
        {
            id = 2436435,
            score = 14,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "This quest is no longer available at lvl 90 since Legion. Instead, there is a quest The Dark Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=34398/the-dark-portal) offered up on the board, which replaces the board version of Iron Horde Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499).\n\nHowever, The Dark Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=34398/the-dark-portal)  will invalidate the whole questline in Blasted Lands if taken from the board. If you click on the board's quest, it auto-accepts, meaning you'd have to abandon the quest to do the Blasted Lands questline. Instead use the portal in Cleft of Shadow, and head directly to Thrall (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=82851/thrall) in Blasted Lands to take the next part of the chain.\n\nThe quest chain is as follows:\n\n0 - Iron Horde Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499) - [auto-accept breadcrumb] no longer available (removed)\n\n1 - Attack of the Iron Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35745/attack-of-the-iron-horde) - [Thrall]\n1 - Under Siege (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35746/under-siege) - [Thrall]\n1 - Peeking into the Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36382/peeking-into-the-portal) - [Rokhan]\n\n2 - Subversive Scouts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35748/subversive-scouts)  - [Thrall]\n2 - Ending Executions (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35744/ending-executions) - [Rokhan]\n\n3 - Investigating the Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36292/investigating-the-invasion) - [Thrall] (moves Thrall to a new location)\n\n4 - Attack on Nethergarde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35751/attack-on-nethergarde) - [Thrall]\n4 - Lunatic Lieutenants (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35750/lunatic-lieutenants) - [Thrall]\n4 - Ransacking Nethergarde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35761/ransacking-nethergarde) - [Okrilla]\n\n5 - Toothsmash the Annihilator (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35760/toothsmash-the-annihilator) - [Thrall]\n5 - Death to the Dreadmaul  (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35762/death-to-the-dreadmaul)- [Thrall]\n5 - Okrilla's Revenge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35764/okrillas-revenge) - [Okrilla]\n\n6 - Garmak Bladetwist (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35763/garmak-bladetwist) - [Thrall]\n\n7 - Warning Orgrimmar (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36940/warning-orgrimmar) [Thrall] (directs you back to Orgrimmar)\n\n8 - The Dark Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=34398/the-dark-portal) [Orgrimmar Warboard]\n\nNow you can accept the quest The Dark Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=34398/the-dark-portal), head back to the Blasted Lands and continue with the Draenor questline after speaking to Khadgar. If your used a boost, this quest will not be available, but you can still do the Draenor questline by running through the Dark Portal at Blasted Lands",
            date = "2016-10-28T19:05:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499#comments:id=2436435",
        },
        {
            id = 2019974,
            score = 9,
            author = "Evenuel",
            text = "Why would wowhead's quest objective section say \"Thrall slain\"...? o_O",
            date = "2014-10-27T16:28:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499#comments:id=2019974",
        },
    },
    [36940] = {
        {
            id = 2880697,
            score = 137,
            author = "jacjacjacky",
            text = "As of Patch 8.1.5 the https://www.wowhead.com/item=111660 is STILL OBTAINABLE!\nFollow the steps below to obtain, rather than run around aimlessly for hours like I did.\n\nFIRSTLY  - It does NOT matter whether you have completed your Garrison quests, got your Garrison Hearthstone and completed the WoD quest chain. You can still pick this quest up.\n\nTo start - head to the Stranglethorn Vale Zepplin in Orgrimmar. You want to catch this to Stranglethorn Vale now that they have gotten rid of the portals to the Blasted Lands.\nFly to the Dark Portal.\nOnce there head east to Shattered Landing on the beach. You will then find a small Horde outpost on a hill.\nYou’ll know you’re in the right place as you’ll see the Zepplin hovering above your head.\nThrall will be there waiting for you (coords 71.8, 47.8), with the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=35745 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=35746 quests ready. You need to accept both quests.\nThe third quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36382 starts with Rokhan and is just to Thralls left.\n https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499 the original starter quest is no longer available.\n\nHope this saves everyone some time!\nHappy Pet Battling!",
            date = "2019-04-07T15:59:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36940#comments:id=2880697",
        },
        {
            id = 2359299,
            score = 71,
            author = "Tanfana",
            text = "The entire Horde quest chain you need to complete to get Iron Starlette (http://www.wowhead.com/item=111660/iron-starlette):\n\nIron Horde Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36499/iron-horde-invasion) (Starts at Warchief Command Board)\n\nAttack of the Iron Horde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35745/attack-of-the-iron-horde)\nUnder Siege (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35746/under-siege)\nPeeking into the Portal (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36382/peeking-into-the-portal)*\n\nSubversive Scouts (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35748/subversive-scouts)\nEnding Executions (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35744/ending-executions)*\n\nInvestigating the Invasion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36292/investigating-the-invasion)\n\nLunatic Lieutenants (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35750/lunatic-lieutenants)\nAttack on Nethergarde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35751/attack-on-nethergarde)\nRansacking Nethergarde (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35761/ransacking-nethergarde)**\n\nToothsmash the Annihilator (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35760/toothsmash-the-annihilator)\nDeath to the Dreadmaul (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35762/death-to-the-dreadmaul)\nOkrilla's Revenge (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35764/okrillas-revenge)**\n\nGar'mak Bladetwist (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=35763/garmak-bladetwist)\n\nWarning the Warchief (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=36940/warning-the-warchief)\n\nAll quests are picked up from and/or turned into Thrall except the ones from Rokhan (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=85247/rokhan)* and Okrilla (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=76609/okrilla)**. If you wait to do this at Level 100 it will only take about 15 minutes to complete the whole chain. If you do it at 90 you'll get to enjoy the upgrades of a 515 rare ring, neck, & cloak and 520 epic trinket.",
            date = "2016-07-31T05:07:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36940#comments:id=2359299",
        },
        {
            id = 2001172,
            score = 38,
            author = "Foxpaw",
            text = "It's still just as awesome to read \"Warchief Vol'Jin\" as the first time seeing the cinematic.\n\nI missed having sympathy for the horde.",
            date = "2014-09-10T02:38:20-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=36940#comments:id=2001172",
