        {
            id = 2287204,
            score = 18,
            author = "Marcimo",
            text = "Is the NPC Kiake only there for hand in during timewalking events?",
            date = "2015-12-13T01:08:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40787#comments:id=2287204",
        },
        {
            id = 2277151,
            score = 15,
            author = "jjanchan",
            text = "SPENDING [currency=1166]s\n\nDuring different Timewalking events (Burning Crusade, Wrath of the Lich King, and Cataclysm) specific Timewalking vendors are available with unique items.  This means that certain items are available from only one vendor, and the vendors from other Timewalking events will not carry them!\n\nAn important thing to note is that each vendor is available ONLY during the corresponding event.  For example, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=98685 is only available during the week of the Burning Crusade Timewalking event, and will not be available during the Wrath of the Lich King and Cataclysm Timewalking events.  Each vendor will be available from the beginning of the event until 24 hours AFTER it is finished (in case you like to make last minute purchases).\n\nThe items available for [currency=1166]s include mounts, toys, and various vanity/utility items, as well as Timewarped gear.  The gear is unique, in that it will scale to the level of the character that buys it.\nIt should be noted that the scaling is ONLY when the item is purchased - as such, the item is stuck at the level at which it was purchased (e.g. If you purchase https://www.wowhead.com/item=129857 at level 76, the item will retain stats scaled to level 76, even if that character levels to 77 or higher).\n\nWhile the individual gear list is too extensive to include below, each slot has a set price, as in the chart below.\nGear from certain slots are available from specific vendors but not from others (e.g. helms are only available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=98685 during Burning Crusade Timewalking, and they are not available during Wrath of the Lich King Timewalking).  The exception to this are trinkets, which are available during multiple events.\n\nVendor Locations:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=98685\n\nShattrath (/npc=98685#map class=mouseover) [54,39].  She is within the central dome building of Shattrath, north side, on the upper level.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=98690\n\nDalaran (/npc=98690#map class=mouseover) [50,47].  He is at the center of Dalaran, next to the fountain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=101759\n\nHORDE: Orgrimmar [52,41].  She is near a palm tree just southeast of the Earthshrine in Orgrimmar (on the upper level), where the portals to Cataclysm zones are located.\nALLIANCE: Stormwind [76,17].  She is located near the Cataclysm zone portals, on the island northeast of the Dwarven District.\n\n[br]\n[table border=1 width=100%]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2 align=center]BURNING CRUSADE - Level 70+ Gear\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=98685\n[/td]\n[td colspan=2 align=center]WRATH OF THE LICH KING - Level 80+ Gear\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=98690\n[/td]\n[td colspan=2 align=center]CATACLYSM - Level 85+ Gear\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=101759\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=16%]Slot\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%]Slot\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%]Slot\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=100% cellpadding=8 border=1]\n[tr]\n[td width=16%]Trinket\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%]50\n[/td]\n[td width=16%]Trinket\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%]50\n[/td]\n[td width=16%]Trinket\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=16%]50\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]One-handed weapon\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Neck\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Ring\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Two-handed weapon\n[/td]\n[td align=center]100\n[/td]\n[td]Chest\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Chest\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Ranged weapon\n[/td]\n[td align=center]100\n[/td]\n[td]Gloves\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Bracers\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Off-hand/shield\n[/td]\n[td align=center]35\n[/td]\n[td]Ring\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Belt\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Helm\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Feet\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Cloak\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Belt\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Legs\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\n[hr]\nBelow are lists of the items available during each event.\n[br]\n[table width=95% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=3 align=center]CATACLYSM - https://www.wowhead.com/npc=101759, Orgrimmar/Stormwind\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=36% align=center]Item\n[/td]\n[td width=20% align=center][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[td width=44% align=center]Comments\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=95% cellpadding=5]\n[tr]\n[td width=36%]https://www.wowhead.com/item=49602 X 5\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]10\n[/td]\n[td width=44%]Consumable.  Grants you a top hat and monocle for 10 minutes.  Available to Alliance Only.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=36%]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133545\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]10\n[/td]\n[td width=44%]Consumable.  Buffs you for +2 of a primary stat and causes your character to yell a random \"idea\".  Available to Horde Only.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133160\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1171].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133154\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1173].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133159\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1135].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133152\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1158].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133150\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1172] (Horde-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133151\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1174] (Alliance-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=67414\n[/td]\n[td align=center]150\n[/td]\n[td]Bag previously only available from Cataclysm fishing dailies in the major cities of each faction.  Other than flavour vendor trash, has a chance to contain any of the following:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=44983 (Pet)\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34109\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33820\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=45991\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=45992\n[/td]\n[/tr]\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=67414\n\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122338\n[/td]\n[td align=center]750\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122339\n[/td]\n[td align=center]900\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122340\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1000\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122341\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1200\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133511\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1500\n[/td]\n[td]Toy that turns you into a Giblin (http://ptr.wowhead.com/npc=101925/gilblin-illusion#modelviewer:10+0) for 10 minutes, allowing underwater breathing and an additional 80% swim speed bonus while in Vashj'ir.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=133542\n[/td]\n[td align=center]3000\n[/td]\n[td]Toy that simulates Deathwing flying over Azeroth and breathing fire over the continent.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\nNOTES:\n- The Cataclysm Timewalking Dungeon event is not live until 6.2.3, and details are forthcoming.  This post will be updated as information is available.\n- The third mount available exclusively from Timewalking events (other than https://www.wowhead.com/item=129922 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=129923) is https://www.wowhead.com/item=133543.  This mount is not available for purchase from vendors like the others, but rather has a chance to drop as personal loot from any Timewalking boss (not just during Cataclysm Timewalking)\n[br]\n[hr]\n[br]\n[table width=95% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=3 align=center]BURNING CRUSADE - https://www.wowhead.com/npc=98685, Shattrath (/npc=98685#map class=mouseover) [54,39]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=36% align=center]Item\n[/td]\n[td width=20% align=center][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[td width=44% align=center]Comments\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=95% cellpadding=5]\n[tr]\n[td width=36%]https://www.wowhead.com/item=33857\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]25\n[/td]\n[td width=44%]Crate previously only available from the Outland cooking daily.  Contains Burning Crusade meats, and has a chance to contain any of the following:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33873*\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33875\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33871\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33925\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=33844\n[/td]\n[td align=center]25\n[/td]\n[td]Barrel previously only available from the Outland cooking daily  Contains Burning Crusade fish, and has a chance to contain any of the following:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33869**\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33870**\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33875\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33871\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33925\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129945\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=933].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129946\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=935].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129947\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=947] (Horde-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129948\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=946] (Alliance-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129949\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=942].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129950\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=989].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129951\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1011].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=35348\n[/td]\n[td align=center]150\n[/td]\n[td]Bag previously only available from the Outland fishing daily  Among other items, has a chance to contain any of the following:\n[table width=100%]\n[tr]\n[td width=50%]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=35350***\n[/td]\n[td width=50%]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33818***\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=35349***\n[/td]\n[td]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33816***\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34836\n[/td]\n[td]- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129929\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500\n[/td]\n[td]Item that leads you to and allows you to see convergence points (portals) between Draenor (Warlords of Draenor era zones) and Outlands (Burning Crusade era zones), which can be used to travel between the zones.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122338\n[/td]\n[td align=center]750\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122339\n[/td]\n[td align=center]900\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122340\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1000\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122341\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1200\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129926\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1250\n[/td]\n[td]Toy that will turn you into a Broken for 5 minutes.  The visual effect works persists in combat.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129923\n[/td]\n[td align=center]5000\n[/td]\n[td]Flying Mount.  1 of 3 mounts available from Timewalking events alone.  Dragonhawk model, with purple and pink coloration.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\nNOTES:\n*This recipe is ONLY available from https://www.wowhead.com/item=33857.\n**These recipes are ONLY available from https://www.wowhead.com/item=33844.\n***These pets ONLY drop in the Burning Crusade https://www.wowhead.com/item=35348, but they are cageable and can be traded, or bought/sold on the Auction House.\n[hr]\n[br]\n[table width=95% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=3 align=center]WRATH OF THE LICH KING - https://www.wowhead.com/npc=98690, Dalaran (/npc=98690#map class=mouseover) [50,47]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td width=36% align=center]Item\n[/td]\n[td width=20% align=center][currency=1166]s\n[/td]\n[td width=44% align=center]Comments\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=95% cellpadding=5]\n[tr]\n[td width=36%]https://www.wowhead.com/item=44113\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]25\n[/td]\n[td width=44%]Bag previously only available from the Northrend cooking daily.  Contains https://www.wowhead.com/item=43007, and has a chance to contain any of the following:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=44228*\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33871\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33925\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129940\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1090].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129941\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1098].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129954\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1052] (Horde-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129955\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1037] (Alliance-only faction).  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129942\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1106].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129943\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1119].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129944\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50\n[/td]\n[td]Commendation that grants 500 reputation with [faction=1091].  Bind on Account.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=46007\n[/td]\n[td align=center]150\n[/td]\n[td]Bag previously only available from the Dalaran fishing daily.  Other than level 80 epic gems, vanity items and flavour vendor trash, has a chance to contain any of the following:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=45984 (Toy)\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=44983 (Pet)\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=34834\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=33820\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=45991\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=45992\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=19971\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129965\n[/td]\n[td align=center]750\n[/td]\n[td]Item that allows you, every 10 minutes, to travel on the ground very fast (+250% speed) for 15 secs.  Similar to https://www.wowhead.com/item=127669, a Draenor-only item.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122338\n[/td]\n[td align=center]750\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122339\n[/td]\n[td align=center]900\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 90.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122340\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1000\n[/td]\n[td]Non-weapon heirloom armor upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=122341\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1200\n[/td]\n[td]Heirloom weapon upgrade, allowing scaling to level 100.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129938\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1500\n[/td]\n[td]Toy that is a cosmetic version of the ICC Trinket https://www.wowhead.com/item=50362.  Randomly gives you the appearance of a Vrykul, Iron Dwarf, or a Taunka for 2 minutes.  Can be used in and persists through combat.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129952\n[/td]\n[td align=center]2000\n[/td]\n[td]Toy that spawns a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=98942 NPC, that will greet you and respond to various emotes you make before despawning.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=129922\n[/td]\n[td align=center]5000\n[/td]\n[td]Flying Mount.  1 of 3 mounts available from Timewalking events alone.  Ghostly armored horse.\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\nNOTES:\n*This cosmetic item is ONLY available from https://www.wowhead.com/item=35348.",
