            text = "Quest should be titled \"Weapon of the Horde,\" as depicted in the video, on live servers.\n\nVideo Guide: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlsRAuHypNI\n\n1.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41002\n•\009Accept the quest, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41002, from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=101035 at coords 45.6, 15.8 (Outside the gates of [zone=1637]).\n•\009Travel north, into [zone=1637], to coords 52.8, 56.8.\n•\009Turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=95234.",
