        {
            id = 2546016,
            score = 23,
            author = "hevgirl",
            text = "The quest starts with a dropped https://www.wowhead.com/item=134859 on the ground by a mailbox in Dalaran. Respawns approx every 2 hours.\nThis https://www.wowhead.com/item=134859 is also BoE and a copy is mailed to you upon completion of the quest, so you can give it to a friend.\n\n- First you'll deliver it to Madam Goya in the Underbelly https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41368.\n- From there you'll receive a mail from the Postmaster summoning you to the Dalaran Mailroom.\nThis room, accessible by the pet cemetery, is crammed with elementals, junk mail, even a Pepe overseer!\n\n- You'll then sort 9 pieces of flying mail.\n- That turns into https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41397: you will deliver 1362 https://www.wowhead.com/item=7912.\n(this is a throwback to The Bank of Vernal in Utah, USA)\n- In https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41367, someone has forgotten to loot https://www.wowhead.com/item=135463 and you must return it to them.\nYou will have to fight with ethereals trying to ninja-loot it.\n- You'll then head to the Steam Pools in Feralas and find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=52562.\n- He already has Invincible and demands you sell the duplicate to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=51735 in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41394.\n- After returning, he then asks you to visit his SparklePony's grave in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41395.\n- When you reach the grave, you learn that Twinkles' favorite toy was https://www.wowhead.com/item=45693.\n- Yay for the minigame part of the questline: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=50247:\nYou are asked to sort 15 letters correctly in a minute.\nCity and zone names will flash on the screen, and you must click on the proper mailbox for each continent.\nCompleting this finishes the main Postmaster questline and awards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12416 achievement!\n\n- You now have access to the advanced minigame, where you must sort 30 incomplete letters in a minute.\nCompleting this rewards the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12439 achievement, the [title=521] title, and https://www.wowhead.com/item=156721 battle pet.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=156833 toy is also now in your mailbox as well!\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=156721 teaches the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=132366 Battle Pet.\n\nAbilities:\n[pet-ability=2013] [pet-ability=2010] [pet-ability=2012]\n[pet-ability=2009] [pet-ability=2023] [pet-ability=2011]",
            date = "2018-01-16T21:20:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41395#comments:id=2546016",
        },
        {
            id = 2547195,
            score = 21,
            author = "deeDafydd",
            text = "After helping out Johnny Awesome during the postmaster quest chain I received a letter with an attached https://www.wowhead.com/item=122340 from him that read:\n\nDearest ____,\n\nI look back upon our adventures together as if they happened yesterday.\n\nSeveral of my admirers informed me that you looked rather sullen... when last we met. While I see no reason for such behavior when you had the pleasure of working with the world-renowed Johnny Awesome I did feel a twang of... what is it... pity?\n\nBeing as such, I felt it appropriate to send you this tip as a token of my appreciation for your efforts.\n\nDo people still tip? If people do NOT still tip, please return all attachments to me at once, along with a small amount of coin to cover my shipping costs.\n\n~Johnny\n\nI laughed so hard <3 Well done, Blizzard, well done!",
            date = "2018-01-20T05:30:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41395#comments:id=2547195",
        },
        {
            id = 2569137,
            score = 16,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi ALL\n\nFirst of all see My Video with full chain quest for Postmaster  - PostMaster Full Chain Quest Video (https://youtu.be/j6eKMYRpQR4)\nVideo for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12431 - Post Haste Achievement Video (https://youtu.be/Znaam2Boyj0)\nVideo for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12439 - Priority Mail Achievement Video (https://youtu.be/rzxm6NHrsEM)\n\nFinal Drop:\n\n2 achievements https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12416, https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12431 and https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12439;\n1 Toy https://www.wowhead.com/item=156833 can be very useful;\n1 Battle pet https://www.wowhead.com/item=156721;\n1 Title [title=521].\n\nChain quest:\n\nFirst of all you need to find https://www.wowhead.com/item=134859 That can be find next to Mailbox in Dalaran ( of any of them ) I was flying from mailbox to mailbox and i found it - this way you startking quest chain for Postmaster :) ( see on My video how is look that letter.\n.\n\n[table border=\"7\" width=90%  ]\n\n[tr][td align=center]Quest Name:[/td]                         [td align=center]Start[/td]   [td align=center]Finish [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left] 1 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41368  [/td]                             [td align=center]Pick Up https://www.wowhead.com/item=134859    [/td]   [td align=center]  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=100986 She is under Dalaran  [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left] 2 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=46278  [/td]                          [td align=center] Go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976 use https://www.wowhead.com/object=280797 in Dalaran from the\nback on the right from The Violet Citadel. Pick up 9 letters flying in same room  [/td]   [td align=center] https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976   [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]3 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41397  [/td]                           [td align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976  Pick Up Sack Of Solid Stone ( thay are in same room )\nand deliver them to portal in dalaran is close to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=107109   [/td]   [td align=center] https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976     [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]4 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41367   [/td]                          [td align=center]  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976 Use portal kill 3 mobs and travel to Feralas. [/td]   [td align=center] https://www.wowhead.com/npc=52562   [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]5 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41394   [/td]                          [td align=center]  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=52562 after pick up quest go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=51735 speak with him and go back [/td]   [td align=center] https://www.wowhead.com/npc=52562    [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]6 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=41395   [/td]                        [td align=center]  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=52562  Fly to [zone=267] and go to The Sludge Fields.\nAfter you will press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=104110 quest will finish.  [/td]   [td align=center]  Quest finish after press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=104110  [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left] 7 https://www.wowhead.com/quest=50247  [/td]                    [td align=center]  Go back to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976. You need to play in minigame\n- send 15 letters to correct continents in 1 min -\n you will get zone name with city [/td]   [td align=center]  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=103976 after finish Quest\nyou will get https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12416  [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]8 -----   [/td]                          [td align=center] This is not a Quest But now you can do other achi and get:\n https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12431, https://www.wowhead.com/item=156833 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=156721\nEvery thing i same like in quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=50247 but this time you need to do\nsend correct 30 letters xDIs very hard but after 20-30 games you wil get there :)[/td]   [td align=center]    [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]9 -----   [/td]                          [td align=center] This is not a Quest But now you can do other achi and get:\n https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12439, Title [title=521]\nThis time is much harder ;/ I used macro /run local t = time() + 15 while time() < t do end\nAs well i open game in window to have easier jump on webside to look what is correct location xD[/td]   [td align=center]    [/td]    [/tr]\n\n[/table][br]\n\nSee Table with all location and continents ( as well you can see my Video :):\n.\n[table border=\"7\" width=90% ]\n[tr][td] Kalimdor [/td]   [td]    Eastern Kingdoms  [/td] [td]    Outland [/td]   [td]        Northrend     [/td]  [td]    Pandaria   [/td]    [td]   Broken Shore[/td] [/tr]\n\n  [tr][td] Astranaar  [/td]        [td]Arie Peak    [/td]   [td]   Allerian Sh  [/td] [td]     Conquest Hold  [/td] [td]   Dawn's Blossom [/td] [td]   Azurewing Repose       [/td]   [/tr]\n[tr]  [td] Everlook   [/td]       [td] Booty Bay     [/td]    [td]   Area 52      [/td]  [td]  Camp Oneqwah    [/td]  [td]    Halfhill    [/td] [td]     Bradensbrook [/td]   [/tr]\n[tr][td]Feathermoon Sh   [/td] [td]      Brill     [/td]   [td]  Altar of Sha'tar  [/td]  [td]   Frosthold     [/td]   [td]  Klaxxi'vess  [/td]  [td]  Deliverance Point [/td]  [/tr]\n[tr] [td]  Gadgetzan      [/td]  [td]  Goldshire   [/td]  [td]   Cenarion Refuge  [/td] [td]      Kamagua   [/td]   [td]  Longying Outpost [/td]  [td]     Greywatch[/td]   [/tr]\n[tr] [td]  Lor'danel        [/td]  [td] Kharanos      [/td]   [td] Cosmowrench   [/td] [td]    Moa'ki Harbor  [/td]  [td] Lion's Landing   [/td]   [td]   Lorlathil [/td]  [/tr]\n[tr] [td] Nighthaven     [/td] [td]  Menethil Harbor  [/td]   [td]   Garadar    [/td]  [td]    Nesingwary BC  [/td]  [td]     One Keg     [/td]    [td]     Meredil  [/td] [/tr]\n[tr][td]  Nordrassil       [/td] [td]  Stonard      [/td]   [td]  Honor Hold   [/td] [td]  The Argent Stand [/td]  [td]  Soggy's Gamble  [/td]  [td]      Skyhorn  [/td] [/tr]\n[tr] [td]  Ramkahen       [/td] [td] Sentinel Hills   [/td]  [td]   Sylvanaar  [/td]   [td]    Valiance Keep  [/td]  [td]  Tian Monastery[/td]   [td]    Shackle's Den[/td]   [/tr]\n[tr][td]The Crossroads     [/td]  [td]Tranquillien   [/td] [td]     Thrallmar  [/td]   [td]    Warsong Hold  [/td]   [td]  Thunder Cleft  [/td]    [td]  Thunder Totem [/td]  [/tr]\n[tr][td]Whisperwind Grove  [/td]  [td] Tarren Mill [/td]   [td]     Zabra'jin  [/td]  [td]    Wyrmrest Temple [/td] [td]  Zouchin Village  [/td] [td]     Valdisdall [/td] [/tr]\n[/table][br]\nI Hope this Help You a Lot :)",
