        {
            id = 2367717,
            score = 19,
            author = "twosheds76",
            text = "You will get this quest at level 98.\n\nBe warned that if you choose to do this quest at 98, when it becomes time for your \"warm up duel\", you will be dueling a level 100.\n\nIf you happen to win the duel, you beat them until they are on the brink of death and the duel is over however if you do not defeat them you die.\n\nI know. That's fair right?\n\nIf this happens to you, an easy option to get around this is to wait for another person on the quest to come along and help them on their duel. It will also give you credit for your quest.",
            date = "2016-08-14T16:04:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=42782#comments:id=2367717",
        },
