            text = "Invasion Scenarios\n\nThere will be 6 different invasion events during the pre-launch patch.  After the patch launches, invasions will become more and more frequent as we get closer to the launch of the expansion (August 30, 2016).\nEach invasion is a scenario entered by anyone that moves into the invasion area, and has 4 stages:\n\nStage 1 - Defend against a general invasion point (e.g. Orgrimmar Rear Gate).\nStage 2 - Defeat two lieutenants and a commander.\nStage 3 - Defeat the invading forces marked on the map - a zone-wide objective, with each enemy NPC killed or friendly NPC saved granting a fraction of a percent of progress.\nStage 4 - Defeat a boss NPC at the original invasion point (requires a group).\n\nRewards from the invasion are as follows:\n\nStage 1 - 15 [currency=1226 domain=legion].\nStage 2 - [item=139048 domain=legion], which will contain 35 [currency=1226 domain=legion] and chance for iLevel 685 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*.\nStage 3 - 60 [currency=1226 domain=legion].\nStage 4 - [item=139049 domain=legion], which will contain 90 [currency=1226 domain=legion], a chance for iLevel 685 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*, and a chance for iLevel 700** weapons (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=2?filter=minle=700;maxle=700;qu=3;cr=166;crs=7;crv=0#items), with very unique models.\nCompleting the invasion grants an extra 60 [currency=1226 domain=legion] bonus.\n\nTOTAL: 260 [currency=1226 domain=legion] per invasion\n\n*This armor is the same armor that makes up the 4 transmog armor ensembles (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=0.8?filter=na=ensemble+fel+-warmongering+-grievous+-malevolent+-tyrannical+-wild+-prideful+-primal+-dreadful;minle=100;maxle=100) available for 1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion].  If you are wanting only the transmog appearances an