    [43284] = {
        {
            id = 2338526,
            score = 6,
            author = "jjanchan",
            text = "When are the invasions coming?\n\nThe Legion invasions (and [class=12 domain=legion] early access) arrived August 9, 2016 (US) and August 10, 2016 (EU).  The will continue until August 30, 2016 when Legion launches, and will progressively become more frequent until that point.\n[hr]\nInvasion Scenarios\n\nThere will be 6 different invasion events during the pre-launch patch.  After the invasions start, they will become more and more frequent as we get closer to the launch of the expansion (August 30, 2016).\nEach invasion is a scenario entered by anyone that moves into the invasion area, and has 4 stages.  There is a progress bar for Stages 1 and 3 which is zone-wide - you will see how close you are to the next stage.  Stage 2 and 4 have boss objectives, and completing these will complete the stage.\nNote that the invasion instance you enter may already be in progress, with potentially a stage or stages completed already.\nThe stages are below:\n\nStage 1 - Defend against a general invasion point (e.g. Orgrimmar Rear Gate).  Mobs are fairly trivial in nature, although numerous.\nStage 2 - Defeat two lieutenants and a commander.  The commander spawns after the lieutenants are killed.  These bosses hit pretty hard, so DPS and healers have to watch threat.\nStage 3 - Defeat the invading forces marked on the map - a zone-wide objective, with various activities that will advance the progress bar:\n\nThere are mobs to kill, of various sizes and strengths.  These can be found at invasion points, marked on the map.\nThere are protected \"Legion Structures\" also marked on the map.  You must kill the mobs protecting the structures; doing so will make the [npc=96985 domain=legion]s attackable.  When the crystals are destroyed, the structure collapses.\nThere are various mini bosses scattered around the zone during this phase.  These hit pretty hard, so ideally they need to be tanked or kited.  These mini bosses often drop [currency=1226 domain=legion]s, so it's worthwhile helping to kill them!  They are marked on the map with skulls.\n\nStage 4 - Defeat a boss NPC at the original invasion point (requires a group).  These bosses hit VERY hard and have some abilities that will kill you if you do not avoid them (e.g. breath mechanics - make sure to stand behind the boss!)\n\nSome other miscellaneous notes:\n\nZones that have active invasions are marked very clearly on the world map.  Note that only zones in Kalimdor and Eastern Kingdoms are involved.\n\nMousing over the invasion icon will show you a timer, indicating how much time is left in the invasion, so that you can get there.\n\nEntering a zone with an active invasion will put you into a scenario instance.  There will be multiple instances going on at one time, so arriving at any point while the invasion is active will allow you to participate.\nThere are various vehicles you can use to assist you during the invasion (e.g. Demolishers, Glaives).  These usually have a few abilities that will do area damage to mobs.\nMost of the mobs killed for the invasions do not drop anything, although minibosses do.  The shards/chests that are rewarded go into your bags automatically (even if you are dead when the appropriate stage is completed).\n\nRewards from the invasion are as follows:\n\nStage 1 - Nil.\nStage 2 - [item=139048 domain=legion], which will contain 5 [currency=1226 domain=legion], guaranteed iLevel 700 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*, and a chance for iLevel 700** weapons (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=2?filter=minle=700;maxle=700;qu=3;cr=166;crs=7;crv=0#items), with very unique models.\nHelping to kill the minibosses during this stage will reward more [currency=1226 domain=legion]s (5-10 extra).\n\nStage 3 - 10 [currency=1226 domain=legion] at the end of the stage.  Additionally, mini-bosses during this stage drop [currency=1226 domain=legion]s (reportedly 5-15).  Therefore, killing these can net you a much higher yield than any other stage!\nStage 4 - [item=139049 domain=legion], which will contain 10 [currency=1226 domain=legion], guaranteed iLevel 700 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*, and a chance for iLevel 700** weapons (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=2?filter=minle=700;maxle=700;qu=3;cr=166;crs=7;crv=0#items), with very unique models.\n\nTOTAL: 25-80+ [currency=1226 domain=legion] per invasion\n\n*This armor is the same armor that makes up the 4 transmog armor ensembles (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=0.8?filter=na=ensemble+fel+-warmongering+-grievous+-malevolent+-tyrannical+-wild+-prideful+-primal+-dreadful;minle=100;maxle=100) available for 200 [currency=1226 domain=legion].  If you are wanting only the transmog appearances and not the gear, collecting it piece-by-piece from these chests will be presumably much slower than buying the Ensemble.\n**These weapons can be upgraded to iLevel 725 using [item=139171 domain=legion], which will also be available during the pre-launch event\n\nCompleting a single invasion rewards the achievement [achievement=11200 domain=legion].\nCompleting 6 of the invasions (as listed below) will reward [achievement=11201 domain=legion]\n\n[quest=42804 domain=legion]\n[quest=43284 domain=legion]\n[quest=42805 domain=legion]\n[quest=42236 domain=legion]\n[quest=43244 domain=legion]\n[quest=42235 domain=legion]\n\nThe above achievements will be Feats of Strength (similar to https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4887 from the Cataclysm pre-expansion event) that will not be obtainable after Legion launches.\n\nAnother Feat of Strength that will be exclusively available during the Legion pre-launch event is [achievement=11065 domain=legion] (collect all 12 of the pamphlets from Doomsayer NPCs in Orgrimmar/Stormwind).\n[hr]\nGetting to the Invasions\n\nBelow is a summary of ways to get to the invasions.  I have included many different routes, including some that may be obvious (for those who may be returning to the game after a while).\n[br]\n[table border=1 cellpadding=5 width=90%]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=20%]Zone\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=40%]Horde\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=40%]Alliance\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center rowspan=2][zone=16]\nStaging point: Orgrimmar rear gates\n[/td]\n[td]Right outside [zone=1637] rear (North) gates\n\nUse portal from [zone=7333]\nUse portal from [zone=6141]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=63353/https://www.wowhead.com/item=63207/https://www.wowhead.com/item=65274\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1637]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=95050/https://www.wowhead.com/item=118908\n\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=616]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=616] at the [zone=1519] Eastern Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\nFly from [zone=1657]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7332]\nUse portal from [zone=6142]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1537]\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2 align=center]Goblin Engineers use https://www.wowhead.com/item=18984, fly from Everlook\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center rowspan=2][zone=17]\nStaging point: The Crossroads\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=1637] or [zone=1638]\n\nUse portals from [zone=7333]\nUse portals from [zone=6141]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=63353/https://www.wowhead.com/item=63207/https://www.wowhead.com/item=65274\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1637]/[zone=1638]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=118908\n\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=616]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=616] at the [zone=1519] Eastern Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\nFly from [zone=1657]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7332]\nUse portal from [zone=6142]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1537]\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2]\nGoblin Engineers use https://www.wowhead.com/item=18984, fly from Everlook\nTake boat from Booty Bay ([zone=5287]) to Ratchet ([zone=17]), fly from Ratchet\n\n[pad]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center rowspan=2][zone=440]\nStaging point: Gadgetzan\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=5034]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=5034] at the [zone=1637] Western Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=5034]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=5034] at the [zone=1519] Eastern Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\nFly from [zone=15]\n\nTake boat from Menethil Harbor ([zone=11]) to Theramore ([zone=15])\nUse [class=8] portal to Theramore ([zone=15])\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2]\nTake the portal from [zone=4395] to [zone=2300] in Violet Citadel, fly from [zone=2300]\na) Use [class=8] portal to [zone=4395]\nb) Use portal from [zone=6141]/[zone=6142]\nc) Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=40585 (or equivalent (https://legion.wowhead.com/items/armor/rings/name:of+the+kirin+tor+-empowered))\nd) Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=52251\n\nGnomish Engineers use https://www.wowhead.com/item=18986\nTake boat from Booty Bay ([zone=5287]) to Ratchet ([zone=17]), fly from Ratchet\n\n[pad]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center rowspan=2][zone=267]\nStaging point: Tarren Mill\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=1497]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7333]\nUse portal from [zone=6141]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1497]\nTake the zeppelin from [zone=1637] to [zone=85]\n\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=1537]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7332]\nUse portal from [zone=6142]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1537]\nTake the [zone=2257] from [zone=1519]\n\nFly from [zone=4922]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=4922] at the [zone=1519] Eastern Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2]\nUse [class=8] portal to Dalaran Crater (/spell=120145) (Ancient Dalaran) - mind the long fall!\n[class=6]s use https://www.wowhead.com/spell=50977, fly from Acherus: The Ebon Hold\n\n[pad]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center rowspan=2][zone=40]\nStaging point: Sentinel Hill\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=4]\n\nTake portal from [zone=1637] to [zone=4] in Cleft of Shadow\n\nFly from [zone=33]\n\nTake zeppelin from [zone=1637] to [zone=33] (Grom'gol)\n\nFly from [zone=5287]\n\nTake ship from Ratchet ([zone=17]) to Booty Bay ([zone=5287])\n\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=1519]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7332]\nUse portal from [zone=6142]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=63352/https://www.wowhead.com/item=63206/https://www.wowhead.com/item=65360\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1519]\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=95051/https://www.wowhead.com/item=118907\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td colspan=2 align=center]Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=50287, fly from Booty Bay\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][zone=1]\nStaging point: Kharanos\n[/td]\n[td]Fly from [zone=4922]\n\nUse the portal to [zone=4922] at the [zone=1637] Western Earthshrine (Cataclysm portals)\n\nFly from [zone=1497]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7333]\nUse portal from [zone=6141]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1497]\nTake the zeppelin from [zone=1637]\n\n[/td]\n[td]Right outside [zone=1537]\n\nUse portal from [zone=7332]\nUse portal from [zone=6142]\nUse [class=8] portal to [zone=1537]\nTake the [zone=2257] from [zone=1519]\n\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]\n[hr]\n[currency=1226 domain=legion] Currency\n\n[currency=1226 domain=legion] is a new currency that will be specific to the Legion pre-launch event.  These can be earned via invasion scenario events (25-50+ [currency=1226 domain=legion] per invasion).\n\nNote that aside from [currency=1226 domain=legion]s, the invasions grant achievements, and also the Stage 2 and Stage 4 chests can have unique weapons in them (that can be upgraded to item level 725).\n\nThe items available for [currency=1226 domain=legion]s include transmog sets and item level 700 necks, rings, trinkets, weapon upgrade items, and a pet!  These items are sold by [npc=109912 domain=legion], who can be found in the Illidari camps in all invasion zones, as well as [zone=1637] and [zone=1519] as below.\nNote that the vendors in [zone=1637] and [zone=1519] require that you complete the Broken Shore scenario to see them; the ones in the invasion zones are visible regardless.\n[hr]\nVendor Locations\n\nHORDE\n\n[zone=1637] - At [52,58], on the upper level, near the zeppelin tower for Undercity (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=1637:525574)).\n\nALLIANCE\n\n[zone=1519] - At [41,79], on the western edge of the Mage Quarter overlooking the coast (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=1519:410792)).\n\nBOTH FACTIONS\n\n[zone=16] - At [30,69], northeast of the gates of Orgrimmar (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=16:297689)).\n[zone=1] - At [60,35], right outside the gates of Ironforge (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=1:599355)).\n[zone=267] - At [54,40], northwest of Tarren Mill (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=267:536401)).\n[zone=17] - At [51,58], just east of The Crossroads (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=17:514578)).\n[zone=440] - At [53,26], just north of Gadgetzan (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=440:531260)).\n[zone=40] - At [58,24], between The Jansen Stead and Saldean's Farm (Map (https://www.wowhead.com/maps?data=40:582244)).\n\nThe inventory of the [npc=109912 domain=legion]s is as follows:\n[br]\n[table width=90% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=30%]Item\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]Cost\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]Model\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]Type/Slot\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=90% cellpadding=3]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=30%][item=139170 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]200 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%][outfit=15922]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]Transmog Set Appearance\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139169 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]200 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15923]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Transmog Set Appearance\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139168 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]200 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15924]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Transmog Set Appearance\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139167 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]200 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15926]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Transmog Set Appearance\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138160 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Neck\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139172 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Neck\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138162 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Finger\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139173 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Finger\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138161 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138170 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138171 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138188 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]50 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Back\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=136924 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]150 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Pet\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139171 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]150 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Weapon Upgrade\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=141604 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]100 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Weapon\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]",
