            author = "jjanchan",
            text = "Invasion Scenarios\n\nThere will be 6 different invasion events during the pre-launch patch.  After the patch launches, invasions will become more and more frequent as we get closer to the launch of the expansion (August 30, 2016).\nEach invasion is a scenario entered by anyone that moves into the invasion area, and has 4 stages:\n\nStage 1 - Defend against a general invasion point (e.g. Orgrimmar Rear Gate).\nStage 2 - Defeat two lieutenants and a commander.\nStage 3 - Defeat the invading forces marked on the map - a zone-wide objective, with each enemy NPC killed or friendly NPC saved granting a fraction of a percent of progress.\nStage 4 - Defeat a boss NPC at the original invasion point (requires a group).\n\nRewards from the invasion are as follows:\n\nStage 1 - 15 [currency=1226 domain=legion].\nStage 2 - [item=139048 domain=legion], which will contain 35 [currency=1226 domain=legion] and chance for iLevel 685 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*.\nStage 3 - 60 [currency=1226 domain=legion].\nStage 4 - [item=139049 domain=legion], which will contain 90 [currency=1226 domain=legion], a chance for iLevel 685 Fel-Touched Gear (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=4?filter=na=fel%3Bminle=685%3Bmaxle=685%3Bqu=3%3Bcr=166%3Bcrs=7%3Bcrv=0)*, and a chance for iLevel 700** weapons (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=2?filter=minle=700;maxle=700;qu=3;cr=166;crs=7;crv=0#items), with very unique models.\nCompleting the invasion grants an extra 60 [currency=1226 domain=legion] bonus.\n\nTOTAL: 260 [currency=1226 domain=legion] per invasion\n\n*This armor is the same armor that makes up the 4 transmog armor ensembles (http://legion.wowhead.com/items=0.8?filter=na=ensemble+fel+-warmongering+-grievous+-malevolent+-tyrannical+-wild+-prideful+-primal+-dreadful;minle=100;maxle=100) available for 1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion].  If you are wanting only the transmog appearances and not the gear, collecting it piece-by-piece from these chests will be presumably much slower than buying the Ensemble.\n**These weapons can be upgraded to iLevel 725 using [item=139171 domain=legion], which will also be available during the pre-launch event\n\nCompleting a single invasion rewards the achievement [achievement=11200 domain=legion].\nCompleting 6 of the invasions (as listed below) will reward [achievement=11201 domain=legion]\n\n[quest=43301 domain=legion]\n[quest=43284 domain=legion]\n[quest=43285 domain=legion]\n[quest=43282 domain=legion]\n[quest=43244 domain=legion]\n[quest=43245 domain=legion]\n\nThe above achievements will be Feats of Strength (similar to https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4887 from the Cataclysm pre-expansion event) that will not be obtainable after Legion launches.\n\nAnother Feat of Strength that will be exclusively available during the Legion pre-launch event is [achievement=11065 domain=legion] (collect all 12 of the pamphlets from Doomsayer NPCs in Orgrimmar/Stormwind).\n[hr]\nInvasion Weapons\n\nBelow is a complete list of the invasion-exclusive weapons that can be found in the [item=139049 domain=legion] (Rewarded after Stage 4).  Some of them have very unique models!  The weapons are item level 700, but can be upgraded to 725 with [item=139171 domain=legion]\nNote that some of the weapons have the same model, with slight variations in colour.  These are grouped together in the table.\n[table width=95% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td width=15% align=center]Type\n[/td]\n[td width=35% align=center]Weapon\n[/td]\n[td width=15% align=center]Type\n[/td]\n[td width=35% align=center]Weapon\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]Dagger\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141600 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1H Sword\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141598 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]1H Axe\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=139155 domain=legion]\n[item=139157 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1H Sword\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141595 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]1H Axe\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141594 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Polearm\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141599 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]1H Axe\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141602 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Staff\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141596 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]1H Mace\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=138762 domain=legion]\n[item=139158 domain=legion]\n[item=139163 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Staff\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=139160 domain=legion]\n[item=139161 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]1H Mace\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141609 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]2H Mace\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141603 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]Bow\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141601 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]2H Sword\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=139162 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center]Wand\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141616 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1H Warglaive\n[/td]\n[td align=center][item=141604 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n\n[br]Wowhead has made a video outlining all of the weapon models - see it here (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tr_7uMHNUPs).\nThe order of weapons shown is: 2H Sword, Dagger (0:15), 1H Axes (0:29), 1H Maces (1:25), 1H Swords (1:57), Polearm (2:24), Staves (2:39), 2H Mace (3:12), Bow (3:24), Wand (3:40), Warglaive (3:54)\n\n[hr]\n[currency=1226 domain=legion] Currency\n\n[currency=1226 domain=legion] is a new currency that will be specific to the Legion pre-launch event.  There will likely be a number of ways to obtain it, but one will be via invasion scenario events (260 [currency=1226 domain=legion] per invasion).\n\nThe items available for [currency=1226 domain=legion]s include transmog sets and item level 700 necks, rings and trinkets (as below):\n[table width=90% border=1]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=30%]Item\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]Cost\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]Model\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]Slot\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[table width=90% cellpadding=3]\n[tr]\n[td align=center width=30%][item=139170 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%]1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=25%][outfit=15922]\n[/td]\n[td align=center width=20%]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139169 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15923]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139168 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15924]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139167 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]1850 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center][outfit=15926]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138160 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Neck\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139172 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Neck\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138162 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Finger\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=139173 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Finger\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138161 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138170 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138171 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Trinket\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td align=center][item=138188 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]500 [currency=1226 domain=legion]\n[/td]\n[td align=center]-\n[/td]\n[td align=center]Back\n[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n[br]",
