    [43926] = {
        {
            id = 2380813,
            score = 60,
            author = "Extrawesome",
            text = "UNABLE TO START THE LEGION QUESTLINE? Khadgar's Upgraded Servant Bugged? Dropped the quest and can't get it back? **Solved!**\n\nThere is an NPC for each faction:\nHorde: Holgar Stormaxe (npc=4311)\nAlliance: Recruiter Lee (npc=107934) *See edit at bottom*\nthat will get you where you need to go.\n\nSimply interact with them and select this dialog option (https://i.imgur.com/TlUAR0J.png) , accept the confirmation pop-up (https://i.imgur.com/v7MI4lJ.png) . You will be given the quest In the Blink of an Eye (quest=44184) and teleported directly to New Dalaran where you can start your Artifact Quest and thus the Expansion. Win!\n\nI have been looking all over for information on this issue and there has been little to be found anywhere, so I thought i'd post here in hopes that it saves other adventurers some time that ought be spent playing!\n------------------\nEdit: Alliance seems to be having some other technical issues that this might not solve.",
            date = "2016-09-01T16:09:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926#comments:id=2380813",
        },
        {
            id = 3240328,
            score = 50,
            author = "Quejinn",
            text = "To skip the scenario in Shadowlands Pre-Patch follow these steps:\nComplete The Legion Returns ( https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926/the-legion-returns)\nAccept The Battle for Broken Shore ( https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40518/the-battle-for-broken-shore) but DO NOT board the ship.\nGo back to Holgar Stormaxe ( https://www.wowhead.com/npc=4311/holgar-stormaxe) and the skip should now be a dialogue option if you have completed it prior on at least one other character.",
            date = "2020-10-19T12:10:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926#comments:id=3240328",
        },
        {
            id = 2385856,
            score = 25,
            author = "sluggyjunx",
            text = "If you decide to \"skip\" the follow-up quest when you get to Holgar Stormaxe in front of Orgrimmar, and then get ported to Dalaran, and then you decide you'd like to actually do the questline, go visit Archivist Elysiana (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=113873/archivist-elysiana) who is just inside the Violet Citadel, to the left. She will allow you to \"re-start\" the Legion invasion questline again, giving you The Legion Returns quest once again.",
            date = "2016-09-04T10:05:24-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926#comments:id=2385856",
        },
        {
            id = 2507837,
            score = 24,
            author = "Pryxangel",
            text = "If you dont get the quest when you ding 98, just relog and it will pop up.",
            date = "2017-07-13T16:47:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926#comments:id=2507837",
        },
        {
            id = 2349945,
            score = 9,
            author = "Zarrek",
            text = "I was checking to see how much exp would be lost if you skipped the introductory quests in Legion. In Warlords of Draenor, I was never bothered by doing the Tanaan introductory scenario because it was easily half a level and the quests were relatively quick and painless. (30-60m max)\n\nIn Legion, after you complete the introduction once, you can subsequently skip it, but I wanted to see how much exp was lost.\n\nQuests 1-5 don't even give experience and the introduction took me roughly 45 minutes with the beta bugs and knowing exactly what to do. At this time, I'd recommend skipping on subsequent characters based on exp/hour.\n\nAs a note, it appears that these quests don't even reward experience, so I'm not sure if that's a bug or not.\n\n1) The Legion Returns <- Option to skip presented here\n2) To Be Prepared (I believe you can turn this in and still skip.)\n3) The Battle for Broken Shore (Forced into a group for a scenario minimal exp -- 20-30 minute scenario)\n4) Fate of the Horde\n5) Emissary\n6) Demons Among Us (group kill exp, if swarmed) (15k exp)\n7) Keep Your Friends Close (3750 exp)\n8) In the Blink of an Eye (You skip to the turn in of this quest)",
            date = "2016-07-10T15:36:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=43926#comments:id=2349945",
        },
    },
