        {
            id = 2438342,
            score = 12,
            author = "tooltip",
            text = "If you're like me and end up stumbling onto a https://www.wowhead.com/object=258978, the quest is unrelated. You may as well pick it up and turn it in at new Dalaran for credit towards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=11240, though.",
