        {
            id = 2558359,
            score = 12,
            author = "Gorganite",
            text = "When you stand between the 2 entrances the one on the left leads do the soil and the one on the right leads to the water.\n\nAs you appoach the correct spots you get a message that says \"Your Arcane-Infused Vial warms as it emanates a soft glow.\" This indicates that you are near and should use the provided vial.\n\nTo get the soil head down the left ramp until you get to a room where there are mages casting around a long fire pit. Head to the left of the room and you will see 2 very large barrels that have been half buried. Stand between them and use the vial. Voila you have the soil.\n\nTo get the water head down the right ramp until you come to a large body of water. Stand somewhere near the middle and use the vial. Voila you have the water and can complete the quest,\n\nYou can also complete other quests as stated in Eillesthis post.",
            date = "2018-03-17T16:20:25-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=44684#comments:id=2558359",
