            text = "Here’s a macro that works with the NPC, without using any addons :\n\n/run C_GossipInfo.SelectAvailableQuest(C_GossipInfo.GetAvailableQuests()[1][\"questID\"])\n/run SelectAvailableQuest(1)\n/run AcceptQuest()\n/run CompleteQuest(1)\n/run GetQuestReward(1)\n\nReplace the \"1\" in these two lines:\n\n/run C_GossipInfo.SelectAvailableQuest(C_GossipInfo.GetAvailableQuests()[1][\"questID\"])\n/run SelectAvailableQuest(1)\n\nwith the number that corresponds to the meat you want to turn in to the NPC.\n\n1 = Sandworm Meat (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45637/sandworm-meat)\n2 = Crunchy Spider Legs (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45638/crunchy-spider-legs)\n3 = Chilled Meat (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45639/chilled-meat)\n4 = Crocolisk Tails (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45640/crocolisk-tails)\n5 = Raw Tiger Steaks (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45641/raw-tiger-steaks)\n6 = Raw Clefthoof Meat (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45642/raw-clefthoof-meat)\n7 = Lean Shanks\n (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45643/lean-shanks)\nWatch the video below to see the macro in action.\n> Here (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JITPeZ8eJcQ) <\n\nYour keyboard is about to learn what true suffering is..",
            date = "2026-01-21T12:04:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=45642#comments:id=6266519",
        },
    },
