            author = "Expiring",
            text = "You can complete both https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49532 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11048. First abandon https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49532, complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11048, then you can re-take https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49532 from the Warchief's Command Board.\nAlso https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11048 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=11047 are mutually exclusive, you can complete only one of them before taking https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49532 again.",
