            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49538#comments:id=2879599",
        },
        {
            id = 3245647,
            score = 4,
            author = "microb92",
            text = "Had trouble getting with a new character there as Nazgrim \"cinematic\" wouldn't trigger when I entered the building. What worked for me was abandoning the war campaign main quest. Once I abandoned it, the inside of Grommash Hold would reset with all the NPCs and spawn Nazgrim and his event trigger.",
            date = "2020-11-05T04:30:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49538#comments:id=3245647",
        },
        {
            id = 5462896,
            score = 1,
            author = "keklord69OfDoom",
            text = "Make sure you finish the intro quests after leaving the tutorial island. For example abandoning \"An Urgent Meeting\" will make Nazgrim phase out until you've completed it.",
            date = "2022-11-02T05:40:57-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49538#comments:id=5462896",
        },
        {
            id = 5708997,
            score = 1,
            author = "D3Wa",
            text = "WOW: Dragonflight 10.1.7\n\nI had the Issue that Nazgrim wasnt in Orgrimmar, tried over 6 hours to get work.\nWrote a Ticket, According to the GM it was a bug and help was needed,\nGM teleported me to Pandaria and added the quest to my Questlog.\n\nI hope it helps someone.",
            date = "2023-10-22T10:07:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49538#comments:id=5708997",
        },
        {
            id = 6089906,
            score = 1,
            author = "Augmentum",
            text = "If you have problems with this quest, for example, you took it, but there is no NPC, then I offer my own solution.\n\nThis will be especially interesting for those who complete achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6541.\n\n1. We take this quest with another character or create a new one.\n2. We go through the chain of quests from this one until we get the achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=6534.\n3. After that, we switch to your main character and do all the other points from the achievement (they will be available without the quest Warchief's Command: Jade Forest! and the chain associated with it)\n\nP.S. I recommend the BtWQuests and TomTom addons. The first will show which quest you stopped at in the general chain, and the second will show the necessary NPCs on the map.\n\nP.P.S. I found another way, maybe it will help someone - start doing the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=72462.",
            date = "2025-03-29T18:24:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49538#comments:id=6089906",
        },
    },
