            id = 3118970,
            score = 6,
            author = "Mortimerty",
            text = "The way to do all 3 breadcrumbs:\n\n1) Take https://www.wowhead.com/quest=38936 (1) from Adventure Guide (take it as soon as possible (82 level min), because eventually it disappears)\n2) Take https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49559 from any Hero's Call Board\n3) Complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=49559 and take https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31254 (2) from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63778\n4) Talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62738 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63367, then complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=38936 (1)\n5) Talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=62738 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=63367, then complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=31254 (2)\n6) PROFIT!",
