            text = "You can get https://www.wowhead.com/item=163620 as a reward from Island Expeditions.\nBring it to the closest https://www.wowhead.com/npc=126334 mysterious trashpile.\nYou can find one in the north-west part of Dazar'alor near the entrance.\nTurn in the item https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53115 and you'll be rewarded with 250 [currency=1597] reputation.\nIf you never interacted with Jani before you need to unlock it by doing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=47441 quest in Dazar'alor.\nCheck https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12482 achievement for more information about https://www.wowhead.com/npc=126334 and trashpile locations.\nIsland Flotsam video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kSuwc6qmZuE",
