        {
            id = 3177770,
            score = 2,
            author = "Artio",
            text = "If you cannot access a trash pile of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=126334 yet, you need to do the starting quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=47441 first to open up his appearance. It won't take long.\nYou can find that quest at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=127665 which can be found 40.2, 19.2 in Dazar'alor.\nThe quest is: you need to kill 8 Thieving Snappers and then 'Follow the big one' that pops up after the last one.\nIt leads you to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=126334 at 35.4,7.8. It's close.\nHe gives you a fun follow up quest where you have to survive a trial and bite the first quest giver (hint: right click to attack that NPC and have a laugh, highly recommended), but you can also immediately turn in the turn-in quest for 250 reputation with the Zandalari Empire.\nI recommend doing the giving quest, because then you can access all Jani's trash piles in Zandalar.",
            date = "2019-12-21T18:39:05-06:00",
