        {
            id = 2878835,
            score = 3,
            author = "Oceandust",
            text = "8.0 Vol'jin Quest Chain\n\nYou pick up the first quest from Rokhan in The Great Seal. You will only see this quest pop up once you've completed the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12479 achievement. This quest chain starts \"The Fallen Chieftain\" portion of the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12719 achievement. Note: You will not be able to start this chain if you are on any part of the Zandalari Troll Allied Race quest chain.\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51513\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51514\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51533\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51515\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52114\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52113\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51516\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51517\n\nThe next part of the chain you pick up from Bwonsamdi in the Necropolis in Nazmir. You must have the prior quest chain completed. This quest chain starts the \"Justice For The Fallen\" portion of the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12719 achievement.\n\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51518\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51519\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51520\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51521\n\n8.1 Vol'jin Quest Chain\n\nThis quest chain requires you to have the 8.0 and 8.1 War Campaign completed (you can check your progress on the War Campaign by opening up your quest log and checking the top right hand corner for any leftover quests you haven't completed). Exalted with the Zandalari Empire as well as have the prior Vol'jin achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12719.\n\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53774\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53775\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53776\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53778\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54120\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53777\n18. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53779\n19. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54145\n20a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53780\n20b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53781\n21. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54147\n22. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53782",
