        {
            id = 3170653,
            score = 3,
            author = "pros4c",
            text = "This can be completed during the 15th anniversary event \"Korrak's revenge\"!\nYou actually have to be close to Drek'thar or dps him for both objective to count.\n\nIn normal alterac valley I always defended bunkers/graveyards and never got credit\nfor both objectives, during the anniversary event I was in the frostwolf base and\nattacked Drek'thar directly.\n\nQuest completed  :)",
            date = "2019-11-10T05:05:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56256#comments:id=3170653",
        },
        {
            id = 3181008,
            score = 3,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "I won the 15th anniversary version of this by winning and killing drek'thar (which is completely redundant since there is no other way to win).  But I did not get the killing Drek'thar part.  I put in a ticket and after multiple back and forths I found out that you need to be close to Drek'thar during the kill to get credit for that part of the quest.\n\nBlizz is aware of this, but  like many of their kajillion bugs they don't plan on fixing it (would be an incredibly easy fix I'd think).\n\nWhat makes this even worse is that the Horde version of this quest (that includes killing Vann) does not have this bug.  You don't have to be close to Vann when he's killed as horde.  I've gotten credit for Vann's kill on my horde toon while being completely on the other side of the map.",
            date = "2020-01-11T15:50:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56256#comments:id=3181008",
        },
