        {
            id = 3189117,
            score = 7,
            author = "Nulgar",
            text = "Don't bother with the extra button to Sap targets if you have selected https://www.wowhead.com/spell=127370 from questing in the Dread Wastes, it will always trigger (even with your back to the target) and take you into combat, with Taoshi proceeding to attack the target, possibly pulling more mobs.",
            date = "2020-02-08T13:00:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56617#comments:id=3189117",
        },
        {
            id = 3195596,
            score = 7,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "This quest seems to be even more buggy than normal for Blizz's low standards.\n\nTaoshi's sap button disappeared when I entered the area, you don't see the normal \"eye\" above the guards that can see you stealthed (pretty much everything can see you stealthed, look for their buff).\n\nI tried a reload and didn't help.\n\nI never leveled through this area so I don't have any of the buffs so no idea what caused it.\n\nJust a mess.\n\nEdit:  this quest is even worse than I thought.   I did it on another toon and this is what you should see if it's working correctly:\n\n1)  A sap button on your screen from Taoshi.\n2)  The guards should have the eye on top of them indicating they can see stealthed.\n3)  They should also have a circle around them letting you know how far they can see.\n\nNo idea how to get these features if you don't have them.  Reloading didn't seem to help my other toon.\n\nEdit again:  I've done this on several toons now.  If you are seeing the above bugs the best way to handle it is to walk out of the area a bit until you get the ability to mount again and then you can just fly to each amber piece.  This may be the best way to do it period.\n\nEdit yet again:  I finally figured out how to make the quest work as it's meant to.  If it's bugged out, just speak to Taoshi again and ask her to put you back in the shadows and that should fix it.",
            date = "2020-03-21T19:42:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56617#comments:id=3195596",
        },
    },
