            date = "2020-10-27T16:43:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=57069#comments:id=3242983",
        },
        {
            id = 3243660,
            score = 1,
            author = "GibbleFenwick",
            text = "Apart from the annoying phasing of this entire quest-chain interfering with the zone for candy buckets.\nThis particular quest currently seems bugged in terms of number of mobs in the area.\nThere are 60+ Zan-Tiens fighting Baruks very close to one of the targets, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=156420.\nIf you do anything to pull too much aggro, you get swarmed by the lot of them and have little chance of survival.\nI managed to single-target burn down Huo from range just in time to get swamped by 3 of the clusters in his vicinity.\n\nUpdate:\nI passed back that way later on when handing in my quests and noticed the fighting clusters had moved away from the central area where Huo is located.\nThis would have made the fight much more reasonable: fly over and land in the arena to fight the commander without attracting the lightning swarms. (I.e. much more like the other commanders.)\nSo if you do find the quest seeming impossible, perhaps just wait a few minutes; kill the other commanders in the time-being.",
            date = "2020-10-30T02:52:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=57069#comments:id=3243660",
        },
        {
            id = 5377689,
            score = 1,
            author = "ClasscMalcontent",
            text = "For quick Pasting using CopyPasta2 (https://www.tukui.org/addons.php?id=186).\n/way 54.06, 83.65 Rui\n/way 59.97, 87.84 Pai the lifedrainer\n/way 56.92, 76.49 Ti-Qiang the bulwark\n/way 62.25, 80.16 Huo the Lightning-Fist\nCredit to Rawsons for the coordinates (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=57069/cut-off-the-heads#comments:id=3224939). I wanted a quick list easy to paste into CopyPasta2. Thanks.",
            date = "2022-05-27T07:22:39-05:00",
