            text = "From my experience, and testing, this quest can be completed multiple times at EXALTED.  I am alliance and have not tried this on horde yet.  I tried it at Honored and Revered and it did not work.\n\nEDIT:  After getting another Alliance toon to exalted I can confirm the following:\n\nYou can turn in until honored.\nOnce you hit honored and revered there are no available quests.\nOnce you hit exalted this quest becomes available for unlimited turn in.",
