            author = "NamemeSomething",
            text = "This a repeatable quest that players who are Honored or higher with Lower City (faction=1011) can turn in to Vekax (npc=22429) for Outcast's Cache (item=31800), which has a chance to contain rare boots with unique transmogs:\nWindwalker's Footwraps (item=28491) for cloth wearers\nTalonite's Boots (item=28492) for leather wearers\nDreadhawk's Schynbald (item=28493) for mail wearers\nRavenguard's Greaves (item=28494) for plate wearers",
