        {
            id = 3182491,
            score = 49,
            author = "Castorr91",
            text = "These can be dropped by Drowed Zealot[/url ] and Tidal Corruptor (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=153956/drowned-zealot).\n\nWhat I ended up doing was heading over to Ruined Passage (57, 39) and go down the stairs.\nThis would be right in the middle of the two statues on the world map if you don't have a coords addon.\n\nIn the first staircase, you will find a patrol containing 2 Drowned Zealots\nRight below the first staircase, you will find a group of 2 Drowned Zealots and 1 Tidal Corruptor\nAfter the second staircase, in the circular room, you will find 1 Tidal Corruptor on each side and 1-2 walking around the room\n\nI killed these two times and two random Corruptors outside and it was enough for me to complete the quest.",
