            text = "Pandaren spirits are near an obelisk. You can click them either in the normal phase, or inside the void after clicking the obelisk. Spirits disappear when freed by another player - if you don't see any, wait around a few seconds and be quick to claim the respawns for yourself.",
            date = "2020-01-20T10:53:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58466#comments:id=3184145",
        },
        {
            id = 3184192,
            score = 3,
            author = "Blunderbus",
            text = "These quest items, much like the obelisks, really need to be shared. As of now, the poor game design of individual tags does nothing to enhance player experience. As it stands now, the design of this quest is really just there to artificially increase playtime metrics. Shame on you, Blizzard.",
            date = "2020-01-20T14:50:10-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58466#comments:id=3184192",
        },
        {
            id = 3198563,
            score = 1,
