            text = "If you have flying unlocked, you can actually hover near these and activate them without ever landing.  Makes the quest much faster, and you can escape from mobs that aggro you much quicker.",
            date = "2020-04-08T13:12:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58466#comments:id=3198563",
        },
