    [58469] = {
        {
            id = 3181833,
            score = 161,
            author = "jjanchan",
            text = "This quest requires that you dispel 3 Void Tears in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms.\n\nThe Void Tears look like purple fountains, just like this:\n[screenshot id=899979][/screenshot]\n[pad]\nAfter being clicked/interacted with, the Void Tear opens and looks like so:\n[screenshot id=899978][/screenshot]\n\nAt this point a few mobs pour out of the tear, and killing the last of them (the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=158963) will dispel the Void Tear and give you credit towards the quest.\n\nAn important note:  If you are flying around the zone and see a tear someone else (whether from your faction or not) has activated, but you manage to tag the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=158963 mob that emerges, you will get credit towards the quest!",
            date = "2020-01-14T20:46:14-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58469#comments:id=3181833",
        },
        {
            id = 3187278,
            score = 66,
            author = "Tiwuno",
            text = "I created a macro using Wowhead's coordinates. Note that you will need both TomTom and CopyPasta if you'd like to use this as a single macro, although you can split it into multiple smaller macros. Also, make sure you're in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms, or else you'll get a bunch of waypoints for the wrong zone:\n\n/way 43.2 38.0\n/way 46.0 42.4\n/way 44.8 51.0\n/way 42.4 62.9\n/way 45.0 68.2\n/way 49.0 69.2\n/way 51.4 66.8\n/way 49.4 63.4\n/way 50.0 58.4\n/way 51.8 50.4\n/way 55.2 61.2\n/way 54.0 35.4\n/way 57.2 38.6\n/way 60.4 31.2\n/way 63.0 36.2\n/way 60.8 45.6\n/way 61.0 58.4\n/way 60.4 58.6\n/way 65.0 57.4\n/way 66.4 48.4\n/way 68.0 43.2\n/way 71.2 57.2\n/way 77.0 62.0\n/way 79.4 63.4\n/way 78.4 52.4\n/way 73.4 49.4\n/way 79.0 46.4\n/way 84.0 45.4\n/way 88.4 47.4\n/way 84.4 39.0\n/way 68.5 28.7\n/way 71.6 19.0\n/cway",
            date = "2020-01-30T10:32:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58469#comments:id=3187278",
        },
        {
            id = 3182014,
            score = 18,
            author = "Aisenfaire",
            text = "1. The only thing that matters to get credit for the quest is tagging the last mob that comes out of the void tear, called the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=158963.\n2. The https://www.wowhead.com/npc=158963 has shared tags between factions.  Even if you are on a different faction from someone fighting it, you can still tag it and share the credit.\n\nInterestingly, the Uldum version of this quest (just out today on 23 Jan), https://www.wowhead.com/quest=57773, now says as much in its objectives.  Its objectives tell you outright to just kill the Void Keepers.",
            date = "2020-01-15T07:08:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58469#comments:id=3182014",
        },
        {
            id = 3194851,
            score = 17,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "In a patch with a ton of $%^&ty dailies, this is one of the worst.  There's only a few of these, you can spend a lot of time finding any.  And the ones that you find can be in major mob populated areas.\n\nno fun.",
            date = "2020-03-17T04:23:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58469#comments:id=3194851",
