        },
        {
            id = 3181939,
            score = 9,
            author = "anjellyx",
            text = "It looks like the Black Empire Caches have fixed locations. Here are some I've found that can be plugged into TomTom:\n\n/way 70.30, 23.03 (inside pools of power)\n/way 73.03, 24.96 (inside pools of power)\n/way 67.14, 27.55 (inside pools of power)\n/way 70.16, 32.50 (inside pools of power)\n/way 55.95, 26.47 (inside pools of power)\n/way 59.54, 56.17\n/way 62.84, 56.81\n/way 67.58, 55.52\n/way 65.85, 59.61\n/way 60.69, 63.27 (inside big blossom mine)\n/way 62.84, 69.51 (inside big blossom mine)\n/way 71.59, 68.44 (inside big blossom mine)\n\nThere are probably more. Alternatively you can also use the addon HandyNotes. Just make sure to get the base addon (HandyNotes) and its counterpart HandyNotes: Visions of N'Zoth to see all caches and bosses displayed on your map. Hope this helps some!",
            date = "2020-01-15T02:24:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58470#comments:id=3181939",
