        },
        {
            id = 3189692,
            score = 8,
            author = "mamapapaxp",
            text = "Utterly confused by this quest. Picked up in The Silent Sanctuary - from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=154444 - and the map directed me to the Golden Stair (on the far side of the map), specifically a 'triangle' bounded by 39.5,16.0 / 44.5,15.5 / 41.5,22.0.\n\nOn reaching this area, there were Pillars of Storms to be found, wandering Onyz Warserpents and other random sources of lightning, but no Lightning 'Rods' anywhere.\n\nHeading back to Mistfall Village, right next to the starting point, there the Rods are! Demolished the three I could find; waited one minute and got them as they re-spawned. Job done. Weird.",
            date = "2020-02-11T02:54:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=58479#comments:id=3189692",
        },
