            text = "This quest is garbage.  The only thing the quest says is Vil'thik will drop it.  But if you look at the tooltips on most of the Vil'thik mobs and they don't list this quest.\n\nSo either the tooltip is bugged or you need to find the very few mobs that list this quest on their tooltip.\n\nHumorously the mobs on the wall do list this on their tooltip but they aren't Vil'thik (they're Zara'thik).  And not all the Zara'thik list it on their tooltip, so not sure I'd recommend grinding here.  The elite Zara'thik's don't list it on their tooltip which makes it a pretty annoying grind.\n\nSad statement that ppl get paid for producing this garbage...\n\nI'm going to pass on this quest in the future.  But if you want to do it, probably your best best is an area called the Five Sisters at 16.50 44.41   At least every mob there has the potential to drop the blades.",
