            id = 3293305,
            score = 38,
            author = "tevelizor",
            text = "This is a great quest for beginners. First quest out of exile reach, bugged if you don't perfectly follow a character running at a very random pace.\nIt teaches you:\n\nHow to use wowhead for workarounds\nHow to abandon quests\nHow to report a bug... kidding, this game's report bug interface seems to be a link to the website, which tells you to do it in game, which redirects you to the website.",
            date = "2021-01-21T14:23:21-06:00",
