            author = "Wokie",
            text = "Stay close to Cork.\n\nRunning ahead of him will cause the quest to not complete. I tried relogging and while Cork would appear after I logged back in, he would not move. Even relogging next to the objective marker did not work. I had to abandon the quest and start over, being sure to stay with Cork as he walked through Orgrimmar.",
