        {
            id = 3242725,
            score = 29,
            author = "KangarooStu",
            text = "Basically, if you've come from the exiles reach island you need to finish this quest. If you run ahead or leave Cork for any period of time he resets and you have to run back to the start to collect him.  So don't mount up (Thinking Chauffeured Mechana-Hog here) and don't bother with the likes of Ghost Wolf as he won't run anymore than about 98% normal.\nIf you don't complete this quest you can't use Chromie Time to level etc.\nWould be nice if they changed this so as long as you get to the stables you're all done!",
