        {
            id = 3239387,
            score = 1,
            author = "Kurasu",
            text = "If, for whatever reason, you have no desire to receive your hearthstone or re-set your home location, you don't have to accept the 'reset hearth' option to complete this quest.\n\nIf you cancel instead of resetting hearth, it will keep your hearth as the blockade in front of Ogrimmar, rather than inside the city. This may come in handy during the invasion, as there may be fewer undead *outside* the gates than *inside*, or if you want to avoid Ogrimmar lag (until you have a better place to set it).\n\nOf course, unless you have an alternate Hearthstone (such as one of the toys), it doesn't do you any good as you need to set your hearth to *obtain* one.",
            date = "2020-10-17T04:56:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=60359#comments:id=3239387",
