            score = 21,
            author = "arleniaa",
            text = "Fairly easy to obtain:\n\nMake a new character  and choose to level in  BfA and finish all 3 outposts and any other quest on your ship before hitting level 50!\nOnce you are level 50 accept https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53028 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=154464 (alliance) or https://www.wowhead.com/npc=154465 (horde). Apparently horde and alliance got the same quest id for it.\nAfter accepting https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53028 just complete the follow up quests https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51211 > https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52428 > https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54938 > https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54939 > https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54940 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54964 until you finally get https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872 or https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61871\n\nTried it several times, works 100% if you make a new char which dont got https://www.wowhead.com/item=158075 yet.",
            date = "2021-10-19T13:47:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872#comments:id=5267829",
        },
        {
            id = 5405674,
            score = 9,
            author = "Vandiel01",
            text = "Wanted to add my piece that I've attempted/tried to get this quest:  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872, in this order:\n\nGot to L50, Freeze XP\nGot 3 Outpost completed (tried 2, quest didn't appear, finished 3, it did)\nDo, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53028 -> https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51211 -> https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52428 (got neck), don't do any other neck quest\nDid Trig Sound campaign (from Nath \"The First Assault\")\nPicked up quest from Nath, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51784 (but did not do it), then https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54938 was available from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=136907 in Silithus\nCompleted  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54938 then https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872 was available..\n\nSide Note: DO NOT do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=56044 for Nazj chain/openings, which boost your neck to L50, and you're screwed",
            date = "2022-07-26T23:49:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872#comments:id=5405674",
        },
        {
            id = 5794210,
            score = 7,
            author = "Lilyoptra",
            text = "For my max level (70) alt, never done any BFA content, and without the HOA.  This is my experience and taking from both @arleniaa and @Vandiel01 posts:\n\nPick up Intro to BFA starter quest beside the Warboard in SW/Org, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=46727/https://www.wowhead.com/quest=51443 (take 2nd quest but don't do, talk to quest giver again who then offers skip which you need to take)\n Once Intro chain is done (Achievement is granted (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12582/https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=12555 at the end of the chain)\n Then use the Scouting Map to pick a starting zone - this must be done to trigger the war campaign.\n Ally: Go to the boat (Genn Greyman-https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52749) Horde: Great Seal (Nathanos-https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52749, start the war campaign, and complete the 3 zone outpost chains.  As noted: do NOT do Send the Fleet!\n https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53028 should then be offered by Earthen Guardian in Boralus/Dazar'alor. If it isn't, as noted by @kajimelons, under https://www.wowhead.com/quest=53028, for DF toons, make sure you've completed the DF intro quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65444/https://www.wowhead.com/quest=67700 (maybe some day this will get fixed)\n For my level 70, I was offered https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54938 immediately after doing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=52428 from above chain\n Complete the 4 quests in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=54938 chain and then Magni offers this quest in the Chamber of the Heart.\n\nUPDATE: Didn't seem to be able to get this to work for my horde-if anyone was able, please add comment with details!",
            date = "2024-02-29T23:52:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872#comments:id=5794210",
        },
        {
            id = 3240944,
            score = 3,
            author = "Andarist",
            text = "This seems to be a short new quest that leads players back to Boralus / Dazar'alor after finishing the short 8.1.5 questline from Magni.",
            date = "2020-10-21T10:44:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872#comments:id=3240944",
        },
        {
            id = 5916530,
            score = 3,
            author = "Jamuestus",
            text = "You can do this on a 70. If you are doing this in 11.0, when you get to the part where you get A Dying World, you have to do the war within quests before you can see the BFA phase of Magni.\nOn a fresh 70, do intro up until you unlock the boat > do the 3 outposts > do the war within prequests (I just hearthed out once Magni got sent to dalaran and went back) > unlock neck > do Uldir events to escort mother. Accept To Current Matters.\n\nDo nothing else. This has worked for me on both factions.",
            date = "2024-08-12T03:26:12-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=61872#comments:id=5916530",
        },
    },
