            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489#comments:id=5382594",
        },
        {
            id = 5458774,
            score = 40,
            author = "lagmoose",
            text = "Just completed this quest today. Unfortunately when I did it, it was bugged for turn-in. Had to exit game to trigger the \"?\" to appear. So if anyone in the future runs into the same problem after defeating Vorath and there's no turn in marker, just log out and back in again and it should pop up.",
            date = "2022-10-26T19:04:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489#comments:id=5458774",
        },
        {
            id = 5388897,
            score = 28,
            author = "Lurkling",
            text = "This has got to be one of the most infuriating, and badly designed quests in all of retail wow at the moment. I came here solely to see if I was doing something horribly wrong, but NO, the quest is just extremely badly tuned, and I could just BARELY nick his HP off a few percent at a time, and trying to move and kill the small adds that heal him, makes him follow, and they just regenerate his HP, making it completely useless to even try. Your best bet is to just stand there for like 10 minutes, knocking his HP off, a few percent at a time.",
            date = "2022-06-26T09:29:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489#comments:id=5388897",
        },
        {
            id = 5388906,
            score = 26,
            author = "MythWorg",
            text = "Greetings all.\n\nI've just spent a fair time, like everyone else, trying to get this done.\n\nAnd I have found a way.\n\nLiandra is already pulling Vorath in his new form. DON'T add yourself to the mix.\nInstead, concentrate on the ravens that appear.\nKill those, and then smack Vorath around a little if you can't shift threat.\n\nIf your alt can disappear/vanish/remove threat, then smack him so much that it pulls him, then use that talent to get him back onto Liandra.\nConcentrate on the ravens whilst you wait for your anti-threat cooldown to clear, then do it again.\nAnd keep going like this until he's dead.\n\nIt does take an age, but it does work as I found out on my 12th attempt.\n\nAs to why it's not as easy as the Dark Iron dwarf mount? If someone has an answer to that question, I'd love to know.\n\nGood luck!",
            date = "2022-06-26T10:34:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489#comments:id=5388906",
        },
        {
            id = 5375829,
            score = 21,
            author = "HeatherWind",
            text = "I don't know what I'm doing wrong. I've started this quest multiple times now. Killed Vorath's mortal form, used the ranseur, and he morphed into the beast form. Then Liadrin stops fighting, and Vorath keeps summoning spirit ravens to heal him faster than I can burn them down. I didn't see that mechanic even show up in the tutorial vid. Is there something I'm missing, or is this bugged?\n\nEDIT -- I tried it again on another toon (a prot palli this time), and hit the same wall. Phase 2, NPCs stop fighting, can't get him below 50% because of multiple ravens healing faster than you can burn them down. It says nothing about this being a group quest, the quest gives no clue as to how to finish him. This is absolutely infuriating.",
            date = "2022-05-20T20:15:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489#comments:id=5375829",
        },
    },
    [63490] = {
        {
            id = 5379942,
            score = 32,
            author = "Bursi",
            text = "Questline starts in Oribos at Lady Liadrin (/npc=176789#map) near the teleport to Orgrimmar.\nYou need to be exalted with [faction=911] to get this.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63479 - meet her in Silvermoon /way 88.75 37.58 entrance to Lady Liadrin\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63480 - watch dialogue\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63481 - click the portal next to you\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63482 - kill 15 enemies\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63483 - click https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176843 and defeat https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176856. Go west to 45.41 35.15 and repeat it. To north at 44.99 30.84 and again.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63484 - leave the building, take the stairs on your right. Collect the weapon\n https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63485 - go to Bastion, you can take the teleport to Orgrimmar behind the quest giver\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63486 - go to Maldraxxus\n\nBastion:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63522 - click dialogue to start the race. Start running and click the yellow bells on your way\nTravel to Maldraxxus, entrance at 45.88 45.07\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63519  - click dialogue to start the fight, defeat https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176917. Talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176918 after that\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63487 - return to Tristessa (Oribos > Orgrimmar > Silvermoon)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63488 - go to the marked area and mount the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176991. Click your extra button https://www.wowhead.com/spell=367787 for aoe. You can also use your normal abilities. Fill the bar\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63489 - kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176864. Move him to the other crystal if the areas are growing too much. Click the extra button on his corpse and kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=176865\nThis quest rewarded https://www.wowhead.com/item=191604 (this depends on whether you can wield polearms).\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=63490 - return to Silvermoon and get https://www.wowhead.com/item=191566. [class=2]s also receive https://www.wowhead.com/item=191565.\n\nQuestline took about 40 minutes (incl. flight paths) with itemlevel 230.",
            date = "2022-06-01T10:46:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=63490#comments:id=5379942",
        },
