            text = "This optional breadcrumb is easily missable. Most players pick up the follow-up quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071 and turn it into a different version of this NPC at a different location, never seeing this NPC. Speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184164 at (15.53, 59.95) on the Morqut Islet before heading to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184166 outside the cave.",
