        {
            id = 5514649,
            score = 5,
            author = "regma",
            text = "Guessing you have to do this a certain way as I was unable to get this.",
            date = "2022-12-27T01:09:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65065#comments:id=5514649",
        },
        {
            id = 5552529,
            score = 5,
            author = "Lilyoptra",
            text = "Make sure you do this quest and the followup, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071, as soon as you get them.  I grabbed this after doing https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66324 and assumed the chain would bring me over to the turn-in area so I waited, but it never did (or if it did, I didn't realize it).  When I realized we were getting ready to leave the starting area, I tried to go hand it in.  This was after the final \"fight\" and crossing the bridge.  I was on https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65100 when I realized it, but the change likely happened sooner.  Soar is disabled at this point, so I tried to just run there.  I ran back across the bridge but the other side had winds preventing me from going further.\n\nSo the good news is:  I was able to die in the ravine by the bridge, run back to my corpse and found I could Soar in this part of the map.  After multiple attempts Soaring over the mountains, I succeeded in getting to the little guy and turned in the quest.\nThe bad news is:  While I was able to pick up the followup, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071, the npc's for the quest are gone so it could not be completed.\n\nTL:DR:  Do the quest and followup as soon as possible or take a chance on not being able to do them.",
            date = "2023-02-20T00:25:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65065#comments:id=5552529",
        },
    },
