        {
            id = 5470673,
            score = 9,
            author = "RundleAllnighter",
            text = "Head East around the corner then a bit south to the big cave entrance.  The in-game indicator will try to send you West to start.\n\nAlso attached a screenshot of the map.",
            date = "2022-11-15T21:30:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071#comments:id=5470673",
        },
        {
            id = 5471879,
            score = 9,
            author = "Katardre",
            text = "Note that you can pick up this quest up until just before you leave The Forbidden Reach, but at some point all the NPC's(both friendly and hostile) go away in this area except To'no, who gives the quest, and Explorer Ko'nali who gives the breadcrumb that leads to this quest. Suggest doing this quest sooner rather than later as Little Ko will not be present to find in the back of the cave if you wait too long.",
            date = "2022-11-17T05:07:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071#comments:id=5471879",
        },
        {
            id = 5547878,
            score = 9,
            author = "Saintgabrial",
            text = "There is an optional breadcrumb to this quest that is easily missable if you're not looking out for it. As Blizzard didn't add a quest to send you to this part of the The Forbidden Reach. You can skip this breadcrumb though as it isn't needed for the next part of the quest chain. Most players just go strait to the follow-up quest Halp! (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071/halp) as they don't know about the breadcrumb.  You'll need to finish a few quests first and do not pick up the quest Halp! (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071/halp), until you have this breadcrumb sending you there.\n\nThis quest will be available to pick up once you pick up the quest Never Forgotten (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66324/never-forgotten). I'd go pick up this bread crum at this time, as I don't know how far into the rest of the quests you can go before it's no longer available. As far as I know you should be able to pick it up anytime after never-forgotten and before Halp!\n\nSpeak to Explorer Ko'nali (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184164/explorer-konali) at (15.6, 59.8) on the Island on the west of the map before heading to To'no (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184166/tono#comments) outside the cave at (33.4, 33.2). There is also a mailbox on this island and as far as I know it's the only mailbox in the  Forbidden Reach.",
            date = "2023-02-10T09:36:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65071#comments:id=5547878",
        },
    },
