            score = 5,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1300]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16334 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/psUM4ybBfzk\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66114 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186795 55 30.9 then He will take you to Queen 62.3 72.9 , You need to speak with Her and Movie will start\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66115 - Speak with 4 NPC in order: 60.7 74 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189261, 59.4 72.4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189262, 61.5 68.7 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185904 and 62.7 70.4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189260. Don't do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70061 Pick it up but go first to do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68795.\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68795 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193287 to get Your DRAGON MOUNT ! After conversation You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 and learn https://www.wowhead.com/spell=376027. Now every time You use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 https://www.wowhead.com/spell=376027 will be activated.\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65118 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 then jump off the platform and fly through the circles then land 57.4 59.1 when you will finish quest NPC will teleport You back. When You press jump button You will fly up, Skill 1 Is going fast forward and ect. FROM THIS QUEST IS START GUIDE HOW TO USE DRAGONS FLY.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65120 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 then jump off the platform and fly through the circles then land 57.4 59.1 when you will finish quest NPC will teleport You back. Reward https://www.wowhead.com/item=188139\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65133 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 then jump off the platform and fly through the circles then land 57.4 59.1 when you will finish quest NPC will teleport You back. Reward https://www.wowhead.com/item=188139\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68796 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034 then jump off the platform and fly through the circles then land 75.1 55 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193359.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68797 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/npc=198464 74 58.1 is a platform on ground big but i did not see at start xD. Reward https://www.wowhead.com/spell=385274 Now You can costomize Your Dragon.\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68798 - Collect Dragon Glyph 74.3 57.5 is over ground then speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193364 ( 2nd option ) to open dragon skills now you can learn new skill. After all speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193411.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=68799 - Fly to Queen https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187290 62.3 72.9.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70061 - Now You can go back to this Quest. Use https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193979 to Kill: 12 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193994, 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194142 and 1 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194159. I use instant kill 1 for killing and skill 2 to move lower lever to get to other mobs.\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66931 - Follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187290 to 59.6 72.5 Movie will start.\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66116 - Fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187119 59.4 75.9\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66118 - Slay 4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187090 59.2 78.2 , 60.9 77.7 , 57.7 76.3 are 2 of them. During this Quest You can do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66117 auto Quest.\n15a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66121 - Rescue 4 eggs: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190149 57.3 83.2, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190131 56.1 81.2, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190127 55 81, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190124 55.3 83.2\n15b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66122 - Kill 3 Elite Proto-dragons use https://www.wowhead.com/item=192436 for pull and extra dmg to kill them fast.\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66123 - Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=188447 53.5 83.4 Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=192436 to do it fast then Movie will start.\n18. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66124 - Fly to 46.1 78.3 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187278 Video will start, Storyline will finish after that.\n\nMain Rewards During This Storyline are: https://www.wowhead.com/item=194034, learn using Dragons Skills and Costomize them, As well You will Get https://www.wowhead.com/item=197406, https://www.wowhead.com/item=197378, https://www.wowhead.com/item=197365, https://www.wowhead.com/item=197380.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
            date = "2022-11-30T02:51:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65133#comments:id=5481472",
        },
        {
            id = 5569418,
            score = 5,
            author = "Dewines",
            text = "After weeks of being unable to do this, I finally found how to get shot of these horrible dragonriding games and move on to the proper stories.\n\nFor the first three quests (gliding, diving momentum). I got on the dragon and aimed at any ring I could see from the parapet.  If I passed through it, I made the dragon jump to go upwards and tried to aim for another ring if I saw one. If I missed, I let the dragon fall to the ground. The secret I found at this point is not to give up the quest or use the timer thing, because using that sets it all to zero again. Not using the timer meant I kept the score for the rings I had managed to pass. Once the blue ovals on the screen filled up again, I made the dragon jump again and tried to get near a ring. Each time I passed through a new ring, it added to the score and it didn't matter in what order or direction I passed through nor how many times I tried. Once I had all the rings, I tried jumping up to the landing target until I managed that. Climbing some rocks to get higher before jumping helped me to reach the rings and the landing target. I'm not sure whether it matters, but I made sure I stayed inside the blue quest area marked on the minimap until I had finished the quest I was on. I needed very many attempts, but finally got through all the rings for all three of these quests.\n\nFor the final quest, ignore the guy who tries to force you to race him to the observatory. Just make your way to the bottom of the observatory in your own time by any route you want. There is a \"ferry\" there, which will take you to the top. Once you are at the top, the quest is marked as completed.",
            date = "2023-03-18T10:46:16-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65133#comments:id=5569418",
        },
        {
            id = 5444232,
            score = 4,
            author = "linda535",
            text = "Make sure to go thru ALL the rings or even if you get to the landing, you won't get quest credit.",
            date = "2022-10-01T06:52:58-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65133#comments:id=5444232",
        },
        {
            id = 6255167,
            score = 1,
            author = "BobCompletes",
            text = "Hi, full quest video below for anyone needing it.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/6irmWm8PXdc",
            date = "2025-12-29T05:23:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65133#comments:id=6255167",
        },
    },
    [65267] = {
