            id = 5486370,
            score = 4,
            author = "Potatochip",
            text = "From a gameplay and storytelling perspective, this quest is a bit frustrating.  It’s coupled with another quest, Flying Rocs (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66071/flying-rocs), which asks you to heal the Bluefeather Rocs.  While this quest asks you the kill the Screechflight Hexclaws and Witherers, which are often found in combat with other big blue birds.  The frustrating part being, these versions of the big blue birds are attackable, and given most classes operate with some form of aoe damage, you’ll often find yourself killing the same birds you’re being asked to save.",
            date = "2022-12-03T09:52:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65267#comments:id=5486370",
        },
