            text = "First run to the wall and start climbing up by clicking the rocks on the wall. Bear left to go pick the flower on the wall. Climb right again and keep following all the rocks on the wall, turning left. Make sure to go all the way to the dude we are rescuing. There is a rock very close to him. You will be able to click him to rescue him and you get yeeted off in a parachute.\n\nTook me a while to realise I did not get a parachute to toss to him as the quest text mentioned...\n\nEdit: My comment does not take any quest bug into consideration. Sometimes rocks are not there. That is a typical (Jan 2023) issue with the Climbing quests.",
            date = "2022-12-07T04:39:54-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65421#comments:id=5491488",
        },
