            author = "Shadow007",
            text = "For those who are confused about why it doesn't auto-accept this anymore: looks like the addition of DF to Chromie Time has prevented it from immediately popping up when you ding at 60. Instead, go directly to either Wrathion or Ebyssian, depending on faction. They will have the initial quest for you there.",
