        {
            id = 5946847,
            score = 9,
            author = "Saintgabrial",
            text = "As of the War Within starting it seems no characters level 70 plus (with the exception of dracthyr) can start any of these quests if they haven't already. Like our Remix characters, they are for now locked out of doing these quests. At least until Blizzard fixes it.",
            date = "2024-09-05T23:43:30-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65435#comments:id=5946847",
        },
        {
            id = 6256003,
            score = 7,
            author = "MagicBoomkin",
            text = "So for anyone else who spent an unholy amount of time trying to start this questline so you could progress the Dragon Isles campaign on a lvl 80 alt... I was unable to locate the start of this quest (or any of the other quests in the chain). I was able to fly to The Obsidian Citadel and found a bronze dragon, Kalendormu ([npc=198751 domain=www]) that allowed me to skip ahead in the questline and unlocked that area. That in turn allowed the next campaign quest to finally become visible/available to me. If you go to the Ruby Life Pools after 'skipping ahead' at the Obsidian Citadel you will be able to start \"The Last Eggtender\" which is a part of the main campaign.\n\nHopefully that  helps others who have been struggling to finish this silly questline!",
            date = "2025-12-31T10:49:22-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65435#comments:id=6256003",
        },
    },
