        {
            id = 5472084,
            score = 4,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1289], achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16431 and how to get [item=199686 bonus=0] released at 15/11/2022.\n\nSee Video with Quest chain + Extra Quests + https://www.wowhead.com/item=199109 if need it part 1 - https://youtu.be/Mh4zj_2v_VY\nSee Video for achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16431 - https://youtu.be/WJPdG2qfkRI\nSee Video for [item=199686 bonus=0] - https://youtu.be/-sVEFLrU5LQ\n\nStoryline [storyline=1289] + Extra Quests:\n[spoiler]\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65436 - start automaticly when login You need to go to Stormwind and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189569 79.9 27.2\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66577 - speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189569 conversation will start.\n3a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66589 - Speak with 3 NPC: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189767 64 37.4, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189765 63.2 70.1 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189763 38.2 45.2\n3b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=72240 - speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=198401 51.1 67.5 on top of tower\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66596 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193450 He will come from teleport, Video will start.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70050 - Start from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189077 22.9 55.5 Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=195912 25 53.2\nFor Storyline probably the rest of the quests next week. But after 6 quests You can do extra quests:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66458 - Do dungeon [zone=13968] located in 41.4 9.9, best way is to go LFG dungeons. Dont forget to put dungeon on normal dif.\n- A Primal Threat - Kill mobs at  Primal Elements and pick up from them 10 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192493 Reward is https://www.wowhead.com/item=199109.\nAfter finishing quest 6 You will be able to buy items from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=195912. All items 252ilvl + https://www.wowhead.com/item=199337 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=202188, to Buy all item you need https://www.wowhead.com/item=199211 you can get them from killing mobs at Primal Elements.\n[/spoiler]\n.\n.\nAchievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16431 and how to get [item=199686 bonus=0] Guide:\n[spoiler]\nFirst think about Primal Elements. You have 4 elements bosses and they are spawn only in 3 location:\n/way Badlands 32.9 42.1\n/way Un'Goro Crater 48.4 27.8\n/way Northern Barrens 35.2 40.4\n\nElements are spawn every 3 hours and is random elemental on each location ( can be 3 x ice or 1xfire 1xice 1x wind ).\n\nTo get Achi done You just need to kill all 4 bosses but to get [item=199686 bonus=0] You need to get drop from them but is not 100% drop rate.\n Elemental bosses and drop:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185784 drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=199838 i got it after 2nd kill :D,\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189954 drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=199837 i got it after 11 kills xD\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189933 drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=199839 i got it after first kill :D\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189955 drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=199836 i got it after 2nd kill :D.\n\nNow most important for drop, to get it easy use LFG ! in this way i get all Dimmed Primeval very fast. Only You need to be lucky with elemental spawn.\n[/spoiler]\n\nI hope that help You if neew quest will come up i will drop update :)",
            date = "2022-11-17T08:55:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65436#comments:id=5472084",
        },
