            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline The Screetchflight Scramble. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16398 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee My Video if need it - https://youtu.be/-wjlCYzp19s\n\nQuests in order I done:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=71239 - Start from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194578 /way #2112 52.12 65.85, You need to fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183912 She is in cave /way 50.09 70.30\n2A. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66071 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=189384 on 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184481, During full Storyline https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184151 will help You in fight if they are close even you attack them they will not attack you.\n2B. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65267 - Slay 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183995 and 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183954.\n4A. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65373 - Quest 4A-4D do it in cave /way 51.36 72.37, Find 4 items: https://www.wowhead.com/item=191176, https://www.wowhead.com/item=189453, https://www.wowhead.com/item=191177 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=191178:\n/way 51.45 73.59 Feather-Plucker 3300 Gasket\n/way 51.02 74.66 Feather-Plucker 3300 Bolts\n/way 49.89 76.08 Feather-Plucker 3300 Exhaust Pipe\n/way 48.80 75.28 Feather-Plucker 3300 Gears\n4B. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65313 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184592 /way 48.82 74.84\n4C. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65490 - Trample https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185148 ( small insects ) then use https://www.wowhead.com/item=190188 to pull them bodys 2% or slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187415 ( is not many of them )  then use https://www.wowhead.com/item=190188 to pull them bodys 6% Ultil 100%.\n4D. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65475 - When You kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184592 /way 48.82 74.84, You will loot https://www.wowhead.com/item=189361 Just return quest to same quest giver 4B.\n8A. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65371 - You need to Loot 3 type of items:\n- 20 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189981 Drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183888 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184816\n- 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189979 Drop From https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184816\n- 3 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189974 Drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185262 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=199011\n8B. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65374 - Pluck 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189751 by using https://www.wowhead.com/item=189454 on Flying https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185524.\n8C. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65287 - Collect 20 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189899 You can pick them up in nests around, I get max from one 5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189899. Wuest 8A-8C return to /way 42.99 71.41\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65778 - First use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191681 then go inside cave 43.39 71.49 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187280 then use extra bar and wait few sec.\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66299 - First use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191763 then press on stew after go out from cave and use https://www.wowhead.com/object=376529. Get inside cave and Place the \"egg\" on the Matriarch's Egg Bowl, then wait and finally kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184847. When You get out from cave you can use extra bar to fly back to quest giver. After this Quest Storyline finish.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
            date = "2022-12-16T03:05:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65475#comments:id=5503944",
        },
    },
