            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline Creektooth Den. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16428 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee My Video if need it - https://youtu.be/4GuP_K9XVDs\n\nQuests in order I done:\n\n1a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65279 - Quest start from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183997 16.22 20.89, Slay 8 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183956and 4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183957\n1b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65306 - Collect 20 https://www.wowhead.com/item=189183 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184011 but is good to open https://www.wowhead.com/object=375266 You can find even 5.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65302 - First pick up https://www.wowhead.com/item=188959 is on ground small next to traps /way 13.82 21.90 the go inside bulding 14.57 20.50 open https://www.wowhead.com/object=375024 to get https://www.wowhead.com/item=189126. then move 15.74 19.23\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65594 - Jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189840 and using skill 1 destroy 3 totems /way 15.92 19.67 /way 15.54 20.69 /way 13.86 20.85, then move to exit you can skip all mobs /way 12.88 21.93 Exit.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65595 - get to cave /way 12.91 22.09, then you will needt open cage from left kill mob then middle cage kill mob then on last cage speak with mob then pull Root to get https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185326 Slay him. That will finish storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
