    [65657] = {
        {
            id = 5448798,
            score = 9,
            author = "fxtech10",
            text = "I had done part of these quests and then put it aside and do other things. When I finally returned I wasn't sure how to pick this up again. You can go back to Brill but there is no one there.  If you have this issue open the map. Find the little bubble with the bronze dragon https://www.wowhead.com/npc=141488 in Tirisfal Glades that will change the timeline. Talk to her and change it to the present time and the quests and quest givers will reappear.",
            date = "2022-10-09T10:42:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65657#comments:id=5448798",
        },
        {
            id = 5401610,
            score = 4,
            author = "Wyr3d",
            text = "This quest dialogue:\n\nIt's heartening to see progress has been made in rebuilding Brill, but this is only a first step. The ruins of the capital remain inaccessible because of the blight. And here is where I hope you will aid the cause. Restoring as much of the land as possible will require a gathering of minds all working toward a singular purpose. A number of influential figures have risen to prominence among the Forsaken. Please help bring them together so we can meet and discuss the path forward.\n\nOkay that's fine, I'll go fetch all the most influential Forsaken I can think of. Oh wait, you have a list? Who's on it?\n\n Speak to Dark Ranger Velonara\n Speak to Lilian Voss\n Speak to Master Apothecary Faranell\n\nWhat the actual F? You asked for all the most influential Forsaken, and you don't have Gunther Arcanus (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=1497/gunther-arcanus) on this list?  Gunther Arcanus, formerly of the Kirin Tor? Gunther Arcanus, the Necromancer? Gunther Ancanus, The Prodigal Lich? Gunther Arcanus, the only undead besides Sylvannus* to shake off the control of the Lich King, and become a free-willed Forsaken of his own volition? Gunther Arcanus, Future Leader of the Forsaken?\n\nHashtag Gunther Arcanas for President!\n\n*Although with SL content, Sylvannas's ability to do this is suspect, since it's possible she's been in contact with The Jailer since way back then, albiet subconsciously so.",
            date = "2022-07-20T02:14:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65657#comments:id=5401610",
        },
        {
            id = 5397286,
            score = 3,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present [storyline=1294] Storyline. This Storyline have 15 Quests. After complite this Storyline You will get Achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=15579.\n\nSee Video Full Quest chain if need it - https://youtu.be/3Hnf4e51S-s\n.\n[table border=\"7\" width=90%  ]\n\009\009[tr][td align=center]Quest Name:[/td]                         [td align=center]Start and description[/td]   [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]\0091\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65655\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First Quest is from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185525 in Oribos 41,7 63,6 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185914 then you will be teleported. Then move to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185512 61 51,5.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0092a\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65657\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009\"Speak with 3 NPC:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185514 62 50.5 Do quest for him https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65658 kill 8 mobs.\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185794 63.2 55.5\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185793 57.6 49.2\"\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0092b\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65658\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Kill 8 mobs\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0094\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65659\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185513 then after conversation speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185512 then move to 62 55.5\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0095\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65660\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185797 then stay inside barrien and kill mobs until https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185912 when you kill him use flask on your extra spell bar then move back.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0096\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65661\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=177782 in Maldraxxus 74.7 33.6 on top of flying bulding.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0097\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65662\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185517 71.2 71.4\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0098a\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65664\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First press on Simmering Concoction 70.9 74.1 then Unstable Concoction 69.6 75.6 and last Tumultuous Concoction 68.5 79.7\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0098b\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65663\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Slay plague mobs until 100%\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00910\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65665\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185828 68.3 84\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00911\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65666\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191029 to teleport then go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185831 65.8 60.1 and speak with him and wait until conversation end.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00912\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65667\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185832 65.7 59.9, use kill 1 and 2 on mobs under you, when you will get 100% you will start fight with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185841 use on him skill 3-5.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00913\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65668\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First will be a conversation \009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00914\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66090\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009hmm i just finish this quest without accept maby due to that im not hunter ?\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00915\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65669\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Back to Oribos to speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185525 41.5 63.4 first give him letter then finish quest after that you will reach Achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=15579.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[/table]\n.\nThank You i Hope that Help You :).",
