wowhead.com/quest=65661\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=177782 in Maldraxxus 74.7 33.6 on top of flying bulding.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0097\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65662\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Fly to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185517 71.2 71.4\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0098a\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65664\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First press on Simmering Concoction 70.9 74.1 then Unstable Concoction 69.6 75.6 and last Tumultuous Concoction 68.5 79.7\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0098b\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65663\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Slay plague mobs until 100%\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00910\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65665\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185828 68.3 84\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00911\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65666\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191029 to teleport then go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185831 65.8 60.1 and speak with him and wait until conversation end.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00912\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65667\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185832 65.7 59.9, use kill 1 and 2 on mobs under you, when you will get 100% you will start fight with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185841 use on him skill 3-5.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00913\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65668\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009First will be a conversation \009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00914\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66090\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009hmm i just finish this quest without accept maby due to that im not hunter ?\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\00915\009https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65669\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009Back to Oribos to speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185525 41.5 63.4 first give him letter then finish quest after that you will reach Achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=15579.\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[/table]\n.\nThank You i Hope that Help You :).",
            date = "2022-07-15T04:46:35-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65660#comments:id=5397289",
        },
