            score = 4,
            author = "Janaq",
            text = "Cool little quest. For some reason the mobs don't seem to scale and it's a bit weird to be blazing thru them at 66v62 level. The final dude is a bit tougher but not too bad.\n\nIngot is at 39.4 48.3 - if you were to leave Obsidian Bulwark and head north, going a bit left around the mountain, you will find him about 2/3 the way to the sea on a ledge on your right hand side. Hope that makes sense.\n\nKinda funny what he believes in but I'll let you discover that for yourself. I guess some tribes do believe WWII is still going on...",
