            text = "If you happen to log out right before making the choice of Devastation or Preservation and realize that the Talents window (N key) is not enabled yet, just talk to the questgiver Scalecommander Emberthal to see the choices again. I kept expecting to find it in the talents window after logging in.",
            date = "2022-09-30T00:07:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65701#comments:id=5443359",
        },
    },
