            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline Initiate's Day Out. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16405 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee My Video if need it - https://youtu.be/hIdW1Dtt07o\n\nQuests in order I done:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65906 - Quest start from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=195302 63.13 34.13. Go to see https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190014 56.28 75.93.\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65901 - place 3 totems: /way 56.65 76.21 /way 57.35 76.31 /way 57.03 75.47,  then speak with quest giver and fly 54.81 66.41.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65907 - First get 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192743 54.06 71.05 then fed 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192594 53.92 65.74\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65770 - First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190014 then go 52.06 63.21 and finish to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190022 white bird.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65761 - First go 51.07 62.14 to speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190022 then go 47.50 54.22 speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190014 in tent.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65711 - Go cave 47.57 56.00 and kill 3 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190011 then go out 48.35 56.60 to speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192929.\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66676 - Return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190014 56.20 77.03 in Ohn'iri Springs. That finish storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
