            author = "C4rr",
            text = "I totally lost Radiya and couldn't locate her in the middle of the quest chain (to start this quest) , been searching for her for days. Frustrating.\nThen while randomly flying around, came across some random bird with a quest ... turns out it will lead to Radiya. OMG.\n\nQuest is:  [quest=65761 domain=www]\nBird is Godoloto to be found at 56.4 73.2\n\nHope it helps anyone",
