        {
            id = 5497019,
            score = 1,
            author = "Tribunal",
            text = "\"You hear that voice too, don't you? It's calling for Malygos, the previous blue dragon Aspect.\"\n\n1. Lol that that's always the (appropriate) go to concern for the Aspects.\n2. Do not cite the old Aspect to me, elf. I was there when the murders were committed. (That feel when what was current WotLK content is so old they feel the need to provide the reminder, tho...)",
            date = "2022-12-11T04:16:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65751#comments:id=5497019",
        },
        {
            id = 5848163,
            score = 1,
            author = "Atomicpumpkin",
            text = "The spells that hit in a circle around the unstable arcane energies do a knockback that's very easily fatal. I know DF is basically over at the point I'm writing this, and I've leveled at least ten alts though here, but I never got hit by these. I just assumed they were bad so I always avoided them. Today I finally decided to get hit on my latest alt just to see what happens and, yeah, I got blasted off the archive and died on another ring half way down.\n\nAnyway, now I know what it does, and now you don't have to try it for yourself.",
            date = "2024-05-04T12:15:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65751#comments:id=5848163",
        },
    },
