            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1303]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=15394 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/z0rlZ8Zj9L8\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65795 - Fly to 48.2 88.6\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65779 - Move to 77.7 23.9\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65780 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185883 78.7 26.8\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65783 - Move to 85.3 25.3\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70174 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=181217 85.7 25.3\n6a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65801 - Speak with 3 NPC - https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186176 85.7 26.5 , https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186183 83.9 25.9 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184595 85.6 20.9\n6b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65802 - Pick up 5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192812 ( around villade ) and 4 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191055 ( 86.1 25.3 inside bulding , 84.2 27.1 , 84.3 24.8 , 84.3 23.1 )\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65803 - Go to 83.2 23.7 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185882 to start caravan, now you can listen stories or just fly 75.6 31.6.\n9a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65804 - Kill animals around to get 30 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191100.\n9b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70185 - Quest start from https://www.wowhead.com/object=379321 76.7 32 go to cave 77.7 35.4 and slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194544 to get https://www.wowhead.com/item=198517.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65940 - Now you can listen stories or just fly 69.9 37.9\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65805 - Get 3 thinks:\n- 4 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191101 from grass https://www.wowhead.com/object=376152 around river.\n- 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191102 get from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190708 You don't need to kill them.\n- 1 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191103 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190961 is not 100% drop i get after 4 kills.\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66848 - First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=184595 then place 3 totems.\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65806 - Go to 61.4 39.5 That will finish Storyline and You will unlock https://www.wowhead.com/spell=395358.\n\nHope That help You :)",
            date = "2022-11-30T10:19:33-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65780#comments:id=5481820",
        },
    },
