        {
            id = 5602769,
            score = 1,
            author = "Ehayen",
            text = "The quests in this expansion make me feel like an outsider, merely observing the goings on.\n\nThey even call my character \"outsider.\"\n\nI miss the quests in BfA where my character was a part of the story.\n\nThe way the storyline progresses with me running jo jobs while everyone else does the hero stuff makes me feel disinterested and disengaged with the story.\n\nI could just walk away and any other \"hero\" could step in and collect five ruby feathers or f___ all whatever.",
