            text = "\"We have much to discuss, you and I\"....and proceed to say exactly nothing afterwards.  I think this happens if you already have the other breadcrumb quest to get into Ohn'ahran Plains, but it's kinda hilarious.",
            date = "2023-01-18T20:57:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65795#comments:id=5530687",
        },
        {
            id = 5645908,
            score = 2,
            author = "wouren11",
            text = "If you leveled to 70 when Dragonflight was free to play and later purchased the expansion, this quest will be marked as \"low level quest\" and will not show up on your map or minimap.\nAlexstrasza will still offer you the quest when talking to her.",
            date = "2023-07-12T08:47:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65795#comments:id=5645908",
        },
        {
            id = 5788488,
            score = 2,
            author = "NiccoloM",
            text = "You need to finish the Waking Shores questline \"A Purpose Restored\" in order to have Alexstrasza show up next to the Black Dragon Eggs, such that she can give you this quest.  And for that questline to be available, you need to do the questline \"Wrathion's Gambit\" to smuggle the eggs out of the Obsidian Citadel.",
            date = "2024-02-18T16:19:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65795#comments:id=5788488",
        },
    },
