            text = "You have to collect 4 items for journey\nBundel of hides: /way 86.10 25.43  in tent with Interpretor Khan standing at the entrance\nCrate of horse shoes: /way 84.40 24.91 exit the tent where Khan is standing and it is straight ahead of you\nWeapon rack: /way 84.39 23.11 near Makhur the Skinning Trainer\nBasket of fish mentioned above, by Lomira.  For non tom tom the lake is south / south west from the village.\nAfter picking up hosre shoes turn right and take the road that leads to the lake.  It will be on your left sitting on the shore.\nThe flowers you need to collect are scattered around the village.",
