        },
        {
            id = 5451508,
            score = 19,
            author = "Meleamee",
            text = "River Reed - Found along the waterline\nSalamanther Heart - Might take a few more kills than one likes to get from killing Mudwalker Salamanthers who can be found in the water or/and along the waterline\nFowl Tailfeathers - You can pluck these from the Jadethroat Mallards, you do not need to kill the birds (unless they get mad at you)",
            date = "2022-10-14T02:51:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65805#comments:id=5451508",
        },
        {
            id = 5499325,
            score = 19,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "You really get a sense of what huge turnover this game must have as far as developers and designers.  I remember when Cata redid all the quests that were these low drop rates (and stupid, what salamander is not going to have a heart?).\n\nIt's like they are incapable of learning from past mistakes, because everyone is new (and incapable of learning).",
