    [65838] = {
        {
            id = 5508113,
            score = 18,
            author = "Janaq",
            text = "To get access to this quest, to start opening up the Tuskarr reputation, you must first complete the previous questline, Tuskar Troubles (https://www.wowhead.com/storyline/tuskarr-troubles-1317), which begins with Ask The Locals (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66699/ask-the-locals), Catch the Caravan (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65864/catch-the-caravan) etc.\n\nIf you follow the normal main Dragonflight questlines, you will be doing these quests. Along the way you will see your earning Tuskarr rep - even though the faction isn't \"opened\" yet. Don't stress, once you finally do open it, the rep is there and you'll be almost level 3.",
            date = "2022-12-20T00:58:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65838#comments:id=5508113",
        },
        {
            id = 5848441,
            score = 14,
            author = "Onuava",
            text = "For anybody else trying to find Kalecgos, he's not at the waypoint that wowhead's map indicates (15.2, 39.4). I took a break inbetween quests and had no map indicator, came looking.\nFor starting Breaching the Brackenhide, he can actually be found at:\n/way #2024 20.54 35.69 Kalecgos",
            date = "2024-05-04T23:31:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65838#comments:id=5848441",
        },
        {
            id = 5484457,
            score = 6,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1316]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16336 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/44ixJUalR1M\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65838 - Investigate 3 area by removing roots: /way 18.8 37 /way 17.5 37 /way 18.4 34.7 during that quest you can do autoquest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65841.\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65844 - Slay 5 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186361 and 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186362.\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65846 - Pick up from ground 7 https://www.wowhead.com/item=194431.\n2c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65845 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191928 on 5 tuskarr corpses.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65848 - First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187873 then wait few sec and jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191636. Using skill 1 and 2 slay 3 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=196496.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65847 - First press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189779 then on 3 https://www.wowhead.com/object=377917 placed around. Then Fly to 16.1 41.4\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65849 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186480 13.2 49.5 in bulding. Now You unlock https://www.wowhead.com/spell=395584.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66210 - Pick Up 4 items:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=194120 13.47 48.56 to the left of the cook.\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=194121 13.89 49.48 on a tree trunk.\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=194119 12.46 50.31 on right side from guardian.\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=194115 is in bulding enter 12.82 49.37 and is on left side on table.\n   Then place all in to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189271 13.1 48.6\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65850 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186480 and follow him then wait that long to see to press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189271. Move will start.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65911 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186280 39.4 63. To get to this location is best to use Fly master, if you don't have trawel there will take a lot of time ;/. That will finish storyline :).\n\nHope That Help You :)",
