    [65852] = {
        {
            id = 5590233,
            score = 38,
            author = "GeekyPrimate",
            text = "If you're having trouble getting the stepping stone out of the bag, don't do what I did and abandon the quest over and over, exit the game, leave the continent, come all the way back only to be frustrated again. This is a case of Blizzard's poor wording of quests. You have to go to one of the two \"arcane platforms\" you went to on the previous quest with the scepter you got out of the bag. Once you are standing in one of those spots, the action button will work and you can go through the bag and get the stepping stone and continue the quest.\n\nOn the first quest when I went through the bag to get the scepter, I did it right next to the quest giver, so I assumed I could do the same again, and when I couldn't, I went through a big hassle for nothing. It should have worked like the previous quest, but at a minimum the quest description should specify \"go to one of the arcane platforms then look through the bag\". Hope this saves someone from pulling out their hair.",
            date = "2023-04-17T00:28:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65852#comments:id=5590233",
        },
        {
            id = 5483464,
            score = 11,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1314]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16336 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/hcBVvvPMowY\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66340 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185599 71.6 80.5\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65686 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185603 41.43 35.6\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66228 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183543 46.6 40.1 movie will start.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=67033 - Get 3 https://www.wowhead.com/item=194512. Location: /way 46.1 39.3 /way 45.8 40.1 /way 46 40.8\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=67035 - Find 4 Ancient Tomes. You can fine a lot around.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=67036 - jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192244 46.2 38.8 and using skill 1 take down all dragons. DON'T LEAVE https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192244 until you will get kick out or you will need to kill dragons one more time.\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65688 - Go to 46 38.8 press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=188915 and from it will drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=191954 take it. Now go 40.9 55.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65689 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/object=376570 is outside tower then you will be teleported on top level now move to 40.7 59.\n9a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65702 - Loot 40 https://www.wowhead.com/item=190769 from mobs.\n9b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65709 - First press on https://www.wowhead.com/item=191953 then Fly to 2 location: 39.5 60.3 and 41.1 62.2 and use there https://www.wowhead.com/item=191952.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65852 - Fly to location: 39.5 60.3 or 41.1 62.2 and use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191978 after few sec you will get extra bar use it to get teleport on top platform.\n12a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65751 - Press on 3 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185775 they look line big portals ease to see.\n12b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65752 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=194891 to pull 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192739 and slay them.\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65854 - Fly down on ground and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186187 Movie will start.\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65855 - Go to 46.6 40.1 Storyline finish.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
            date = "2022-12-01T11:50:06-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65852#comments:id=5483464",
        },
        {
            id = 5501909,
            score = 5,
            author = "deancp1",
            text = "I created the Arcane Stepping Stone no problem, but couldn't interact with the action button.  Tried dropping the quest and retaking with no success.\nMy eventual solution:\n-dismiss my pet\n-exit the game and re-enter\nThen it worked just fine.",
            date = "2022-12-14T16:38:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65852#comments:id=5501909",
        },
        {
            id = 5507673,
            score = 1,
            author = "Aerynsun8449",
            text = "After having the bubble evaporate half way up several times, I decided to fly up there myself, F the bubble. It worked, when I got up to the top Kalecgos  was ready to turn the quest into. I'm not sure if this would work before yoou try the bubble the first time, but as it evaporates and any class not able to slow fall, glide, etc will fall to their death, I'd give it a try the first time.",
            date = "2022-12-19T16:10:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65852#comments:id=5507673",
        },
        {
