            author = "varenne",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875 is located in [zone=13644] on the shore west of Obsidian Citadel\nTo start the quest ask https://www.wowhead.com/npc=196000 \"What are you doing here?\"\nShe's patrolling the area in her dragon form so it may take some time for her to come down\n/way #2022 20.07 39.17 Vazallia\nReward is https://www.wowhead.com/item=198622\nQuest requires you to finish Wrathion's Gambit https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16334 - [zone=13644] story quest line.\n\n[table border=2][tr][td]ID[/td][td]Drink[/td][td]Coordinates[/td][td]Note[/td][td]Video[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]1[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=197738[/td][td]39.44 48.34 Ingot\n35.93 47.92 Dealer[/td][td]1. Complete https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185627 quest line\n2. Buy the drink from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193310[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=75[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]2[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=197737[/td][td]39.30 38.32[/td][td]Shipwreck[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=182[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]3[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=198045[/td][td]46.91 30.70[/td][td]Tree house on the mountain[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=205[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]4[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=198043[/td][td]25.70 55.14[/td][td]Sold by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=188349[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=236[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]5[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=197739[/td][td]43.10 67.30[/td][td]Sold by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186752[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=275[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]6[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=198044[/td][td]43.10 67.32 Kora Fullsails\n76.18 42.91 Rampaging Wind[/td][td]1. Buy https://www.wowhead.com/item=198047 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186454\n2. Throw it at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187494[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=313[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td]7[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=195543[/td][td]62.95 79.77[/td][td]In the cave[/td][td]https://youtu.be/5xarya-Juo4?t=383[/td][/tr]\n[/table]\n/way #2022 39.44 48.34 1 Finish Ingot quest line (Flameslinger Rum)\n/way #2022 35.93 47.92 1 Cave Entrance (Flameslinger Rum)\n/way #2022 34.75 46.63 1 Flameslinger Rum (Sold by Dealer Vexil)\n/way #2022 39.30 38.32 2 Popfizz Punch\n/way #2022 46.91 30.70 3 Slam Bam Swill\n/way #2022 25.69 55.11 4 Stealthy Elven Port (Sold by Outfitter Tipech)\n/way #2022 43.10 67.30 5 Happy Trigger Sour (Sold by Firstmate Kaleson)\n/way #2022 43.10 67.32 6 Kul Tiran Red (Sold by Kora Fullsails)\n/way #2022 76.18 42.91 6 Whirlwind Wine (Throw Kul Tiran Red at Rampaging Wind)\n/way #2022 62.95 79.77 7 Riptide Brew (In the cave)",
            date = "2022-11-27T05:10:04-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875#comments:id=5478413",
        },
        {
            id = 5481986,
            score = 86,
            author = "Baelof",
            text = "In addition to completing Ingot's questline, you will need a Worldbreaker Membership (https://www.wowhead.com/item=199215/worldbreaker-membership) to speak with Dealer Vexil (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193310/dealer-vexil).\nYou can find a membership in Twilight Caches (https://www.wowhead.com/item=201817/twilight-cache) obtained by exchanging a Restored Obsidian Key (https://www.wowhead.com/item=191264/restored-obsidian-key) with Igys the Believer (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187275/igys-the-believer).",
            date = "2022-11-30T13:05:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875#comments:id=5481986",
        },
        {
            id = 5484702,
            score = 83,
            author = "Voxxel",
            text = "If you can't find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192662 in the grotto you have to wait a few minutes because she's often taking flight rounds above the area in her dragon form.",
            date = "2022-12-02T06:27:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875#comments:id=5484702",
        },
        {
            id = 5487246,
            score = 48,
            author = "Malholis",
            text = "As a bit of a heads up DO NOT DRINK THE RIPTIDE BREW.\n\nI drank mine thinking I could get another one from the keg sitting there, but I could not get another one!\n\nIt seems they take about an hour or so to 'refill'.",
            date = "2022-12-04T01:20:01-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875#comments:id=5487246",
        },
        {
            id = 5432274,
            score = 47,
            author = "DragonsAfterDark",
            text = "As of right now, there are two quest chains you'll need to complete before you have access to everything for this quest.\n\nTo get access to the quest itself you'll need to complete the campaign quest chain Wrathion's Gambit (https://www.wowhead.com/beta/storyline/wrathions-gambit-1301), and perhaps all the way to A Purpose Restored (https://www.wowhead.com/beta/storyline/a-purpose-restored-1302). I didn't check for Vazallia between the two chains,. I checked with another character, and she'll be there after Wrathion's Gambit, but before you do this she will not be at The Hissing Grotto /way #2022 20.14, 39.54 Vazallia\n\nKeep in mind she does turn into a dragon and fly around the grotto, and according to Lazey; \"She's doing a 240sec cycle, 105sec human form for quest, 135sec not available while flying around.\"\n\nBefore she'll offer the quest, you need to speak with her and select the dialogue prompt; \"What are you doing here?\" She'll reply something along the lines of; \"Whatever I please.\" Then the quest will become available from her.\n\nBefore you do any quests, two of the drinks are available for you to pick up:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=195543  ~ /way #2022 63.24, 79.92 Riptide Brew\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=198045 ~ /way #2022 46.92 30.71 Slam Bam Swill\n\nOnce you pick up the quest, three of the drinks will be available without any extra steps:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=197737 ~ /way #2022 39.30 38.33 Popfizz Punch on a shipwreck\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=198043 ~ /way #2022 25.70 55.18 Stealthy Elven Wine (Outfitter Tipech)\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/item=197739 ~ /way #2022 43.08 67.37 Firstmate Kaleson (Patrolling Vendor)\n\nFor https://www.wowhead.com/item=198044 there are three steps:\n1. Purchase https://www.wowhead.com/item=198047 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186454 at The Obsidian Bulwark\n2. Fly to the Skytop Observatory, then head over to the Restless Wetlands for some air elementals around /way #2022 76.32, 47.33 Rampaging Wind\n3. Throw the https://www.wowhead.com/item=198047 at one of the Rampaging Wind, and it will spit out https://www.wowhead.com/item=198044 directly into your bag, so make sure you have room!\n\nFor the final drink, https://www.wowhead.com/item=197738 you will need to complete a short, multi-quest chain. The Worldbreaker chain will start with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185627's quests: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65687 & https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65690\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=185627 can be found at /way #2022 39.44, 48.30 Ingot\n\nOnce you complete the chain, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193310 will be inside the cave and to the left of where you killed Cygenoth for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65691\n\n/way #2022 35.71, 47.96 Cave Entrance for Dealer Vexil\n/way #2022 34.25, 45.80 Dealer Vexil (Inside Cave)\n\nOnce you get all the items, head back to Vazallia at The Hissing Grotto. When you turn it in you get gold, xp if you're still leveling, and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191381 will appear in your bag.",
            date = "2022-09-11T01:13:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65875#comments:id=5432274",
        },
    },
