            text = "Mypciscraze,\nif you are going to post coordinates, please make sure that they are correct. Line 3b you list a five sets of coordinates, yet the first set is WRONG. \"/way 64.32 15/71\" should be \"/way 64.32 15.71\". The only slash (\"/\") that is used in TomTom (https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/tomtom) commands is at the beginning (\"/way xx yy\"). Below is the full set of CORRECT coordinates for TomTom (https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/tomtom)\n\n/way 64.32 15.71\n/way 64.13 14.98\n/way 63.57 15.19\n/way 62.83 15.65\n/way 63.01 14.88\n\nPS, The addon Paste (https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/paste) allows you to put in multiple TomTom (https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/tomtom) coordinates at once, which makes quests like this much easier\n\nCheers!",
            date = "2023-01-14T17:34:36-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65891#comments:id=5527715",
        },
    },
