        {
            id = 5677701,
            score = 76,
            author = "mraymus",
            text = "I've done this quest a bunch of times with my toons.  However, today, my Rogue is trying to do it and I've had several of the refti survivors jump up and run away, however, none of them are counting for the 4 I need.  I've gone through about 10 of them jumping up, but the count on my quest never completes.   I tried logging out and back in.  I've tried a /reload.  I've tried abandoning the quest and starting it again.  Nothing I have tried thus far allows the count to go up from Zero.    I also tried unchecking all of my Addons and reloaded the UI.  No change.   The log shows:  Refti Corpse says: Praise the Titans and Thank you, Rogue!  So I know it recognizes that I helped the survivor, but it never updates my count.   :-(\n\nAny ideas?",
