            score = 9,
            author = "Kismat",
            text = "I found this confusing because I was standing in the wrong place the first time around.  In order to use the Timewalker staff, go past the dragons, up the ramp to the temple door.  Click on the button that appears on your screen and then pull the stream that appears away from the temple door.",
