        {
            id = 5694460,
            score = 6,
            author = "zoransis",
            text = "During Dreamsurge, you may get a buff that stealths your character. You'll see a buff icon which cannot be clicked off, and your character will appear translucent, and sort of \"sneak\" walk around when moving. During this buff, you may find that the staff doesn't work, either by special action or clicking the staff item. This apparently is because it will not proc when stealthed. How to drop stealth? The old fashioned way, pull aggro. Or mount up. Either way, this should unstealth you and the action actually proc (assuming you can cast it without getting interrupted).",
            date = "2023-09-26T12:12:04-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65938#comments:id=5694460",
        },
        {
            id = 5453369,
            score = 4,
            author = "Lanzen",
            text = "This quest is bugged as of 10/18 on the beta.  If you don't see a bunch of NPC wardens attacking the elemental when it spawns, you might not be able to get credit for the kill.\n Abandon the quest and try again, and if that doesn't work try server hopping or other tricks to get in a different phase.  If you see the NPC's attacking you should be able to get credit.",
