        {
            id = 6153932,
            score = 1,
            author = "KlokworkKro",
            text = "For anyone having trouble turning this in because they find Khadgar to be missing, this is the response I received from a GM. Despite the below named quests having nothing to do with Khadgar, completing them did in fact seem to make him appear at the turn-in location for this quest. Good luck everyone!\n\nThanks for contacting Blizzard Entertainment's support team. This is Game Master Thryrltur here to assist.\n\nI understand you completed the 2 quests \"Elemental Unfocus\" and \"Lava Burst\" but can't find Archmage Khadgar to turn in the quest. However, generally speaking, when an NPC is missing from The Azure Span, it is likely because the same NPC is needed for another questline that you currently have in progress or a quest chain that you started. I would highly recommend checking through your quest log for quests related to The Azure Span like \"Falling Water\", \"Academic Acquisitions\" and \"Orientation: Iskaara\" and finishing those. This will fix any phasing issue that might be causing the NPC to mysteriously disappear.\n\nYou can also try abandoning \"Elemental Unfocus\" and turning in \"Lava Burst\" first if the previous didn't work.\n\nWishing you the best of luck and have a nice day!",
            date = "2025-08-04T18:39:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65944#comments:id=6153932",
        },
    },
