        {
            id = 5498092,
            score = 7,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline Mudfin Village. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16405 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee My Video if need it - https://youtu.be/YDcCd-bd688\n\nQuests in order I done:\n\n1a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70319 - This Quest start from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194904 84.58 25.04. You need to loot 4 items:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=198792 Drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192854 around 75.76 26.18 ( had to kill over 20 of them to get it  ;/ ).\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=198793 Drop from mobs around 76.25 22.32\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=198795 Drop from mobs around 84.76 16.32\n- https://www.wowhead.com/item=198794 Drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190943 84.70 17.15\n1b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65950 - Slay mobs and collect 30 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191541 80.68 30.88\n1c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65951 - Go 80.57 30.74 to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186649 is in cage.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65953 - Get 4 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191143 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186679.\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65954 - Free the Shikaar Bakar: 2 Bakar Collar /way 80.63 30.78 /way 82.21 30.49, and 5 Bakarin cage /way 81.26 31.81 /way 82.21 30.32 /way 81.50 29.75 /way 81.21 29.77 /way 82.32 30.52\n4c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65955 - Free  https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186649 then go to cave 82.91 31.70 and free https://www.wowhead.com/object=376475 then wait few sec in cave.\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65952 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186678 81.92 31.18\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66005 -  When You kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186678 He will drop https://www.wowhead.com/item=191127. Return to same NPC like quest 7a.\n9a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66006 - First pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=376534 is on back in cave then go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186650 84.42 24.97\n9b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65949 - go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186650 84.42 24.97 Finish this quest will finish storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
