        {
            id = 5488784,
            score = 12,
            author = "Woodymakespizza",
            text = "This is the final quest of the Time Management (https://www.wowhead.com/storyline/time-management-1324) storyline, which is the second of three for  Just Dont Ask Me to Spell It (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16363/), the  Thaldraszus (https://www.wowhead.com/zone=13647/) storyline. The next quest is Tumbling Through Time (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70040/) which begins the Big Time Adventurer (https://www.wowhead.com/storyline/big-time-adventurer-1323) line of 17 more quests, thus completing  Just Dont Ask Me to Spell It (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16363/) and rewarding the Cliffside Wylderdrake (https://www.wowhead.com/item=194521/) dragonriding mount and paving the way for World Quests in Dragonflight!",
            date = "2022-12-05T08:15:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65962#comments:id=5488784",
        },
        {
            id = 5490364,
            score = 8,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1324]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16363 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/YOoS2s4PvS4\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66320 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187100 57.46 78.90\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66080 - Go to 54.96 75.66\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70136 - Get 2 items: https://www.wowhead.com/item=198408 53.2 77.3 then Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194224 in cave 52.9 76.8 and pick up in cave https://www.wowhead.com/item=198410 is on ground.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66081 - Pick Up 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192602, is a crystals big on ground around.\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66082 - Kill mobs and collect orbs to get energy until 100%\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66083 - Follow NPC then speak with him then press on crystals and you will be teleported. after conversation enter orange portal. Then follow back NPC.\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66084 - Loot 100 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192809 from animals.\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66085 - First press on https://www.wowhead.com/object=376313 58.6 78.2 then go to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187098 59.8 79.3 then close 2nd https://www.wowhead.com/object=376313 then go close next https://www.wowhead.com/object=376313 59.9 77.2 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190929 He will come from portal.\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66087 - Get 100% by using extra bar on enemy, closing portals or picking up https://www.wowhead.com/object=377193.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65935 - Fly to 59.6 81.6 on platform.\n11a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65947 - Free 8 Timewalkers from Time Bubbles. Timewalkers are in Orange Bubbles use on them eztra button spell\n11b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65948 - Go to west and ease crystals press on them then pull out. Crystals break into small pieces pick them up to 100.\n11c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66646 - Kill mobs until 100%\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65938 - Go 60.61 83.39 use extra bar and pull barier. Then slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186672.\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65962 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186711 Movie will start. Finishing this quest will finish storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
