.2 and wait for NPC and speak with him then follow him and pick up egg https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187406 will die ;/. Take https://www.wowhead.com/npc=197040 to 55 30.8 and wait for dragon to finish storyline. When you carry egg you can't use mount.\n\nHope That help You :)",
