        {
            id = 5497179,
            score = 3,
            author = "auryunderground",
            text = "The NPC dialogue for this quest:\n\nThe player seeks out and consults with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=188299.\n\nThese Qalashi are so proud of themselves. In time, the Blacktalon will deal with all of them!\n\nPlayers then ask, \"What have you observed about the djaradin?\", prompting Kavia to respond:\n\nTalonstalker Kavia says: The red dragonflight wasn't ready for the surprise attack.\nTalonstalker Kavia says: The djaradin seem to be hoping for a tougher fight next time.\n\nThe player seeks out and consults with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190564.\n\nNo fear in the enemy's den?\n\nPlayers then ask, \"What have you observed about the djaradin?\", prompting Right to respond:\n\nRight says: The djaradin consider the outpost a well-earned victory against their ancient foes.\nRight says: They're already talking about another raid. And another. And another.\nRight says: It seems this is just the beginning.\n\nThe player seeks out and consults with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190563.\n\nHmph. Good kill.\n\nPlayers then ask, \"What have you observed about the djaradin?\", prompting Left to respond:\n\nLeft says: The djaradin were ancient foes of the dragons for a good reason. They're formidable fighters.\nLeft says: The dragons left and the djaradin seized the moment... and they don't seem like they want to give it back.\n\nAfter turning in quests, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194772 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186767 have a short interaction:\n\nWrathion says: The djaradin scheme to claim the Obsidian Citadel... the black dragonflight's seat of power! Enough of this.\nMajordomo Selistra says: Patience, Wrathion.\nWrathion says: I will have the luxury of patience when they are scoured from my home!\nMajordomo Selistra sighs.",
            date = "2022-12-11T08:03:16-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65992#comments:id=5497179",
        },
        {
            id = 5816875,
            score = 2,
            author = "bu1e",
            text = "Hello, i have this weird issue i'm doing those quests :\n\n[quest=65993 domain=www]\nand\n[quest=65992 domain=www]\n\nin which I need to meet Wrathion at the end. But he's not at the top of the tower.\n\nI've already try to restart the quests (4 times) but he's still not spawning. Any ideas ?",
            date = "2024-04-03T11:27:30-05:00",
