            id = 5602402,
            score = 1,
            author = "Ehayen",
            text = "So in Shadowlands the way Bliz sold game time was by forcing slow walking at every conceivable opportunity.\n\nI guess in Dragon Flight, it's forced waiting for quicktime events. Wait ten minutes for the ship to arrive. Wait five minutes for a mob to spawn. You get the idea. Just long enough for the player to get up and walk away from their computer out of boredom for ten or fifteen minutes. Gets em just a little closer to buying another month of game time.",
            date = "2023-05-06T20:49:46-05:00",
