            author = "Lazare69",
            text = "Neither of the comments below gave ANY helpful information on how to kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186777.\nAs a level 61 Outlaw Rogue in iLevel 199 gear I just can't seem to kill him.\n\nUpdate: While writing this I heard some fighting going on so switched screens to find a Death Knight fighting him and found I could get credit (\nMeatgrinder Sotok's name was RED) so I joined in and finally killed him. It only took a WEEK but got it done. So if you are having problems with this, get a buddy or guild mate or just call out for some help. I REALLY don't love forward to doing this on my clothes.\nCheers!",
            date = "2022-12-15T19:41:31-06:00",
