            text = "The quest title is a play on the Library of Alexandria (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Library_of_Alexandria), and each of the books references famous works:\n\nThe Titanic Comedy - The Divine Comedy\nThe Scales of Wrath - The Grapes of Wrath\nDracuixote[ - Don Quixote\nThe Lord of the Wings - The Lord of the Rings\nThe Red and the Black Flights - (I actually have no idea what work this references)\nPride and Protodrakes - Pride and Prejudice",
            date = "2022-11-28T22:13:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66000#comments:id=5480042",
        },
