            id = 5481412,
            score = 10,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1299]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16334 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/xybqfs9bc2A\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65760 - Follow https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187406 to 71.2 40.7 ( don't go to fast or you will need to move back to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187406 ).\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65989 - Kill 6 djaradin\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65990 - Save 4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194231: 71.3 44.7 behind tent, 70.9 46.6 top level tower, 69.9 45.3 behind tent, 69.4 43.4 fling on platform hard to see xD.\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65991 - Go to 66.3 34.7 on top of tower wait for dragons to fly down. Going for that quest you can do auto quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65994 kill mobs until 100%.\n5a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65993 - Kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186777 63.2 29.6\n5b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65992 - Speak with 3 NPC: 63 33.3, 65.1 29.3 and 63.4 28.9\n5c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65995 - After killing https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186777 loot https://www.wowhead.com/item=193874 to start this quest, return to Wrathion 62.6 33\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65996 - Heal 4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190771: 61 35.3 , 61.1 36.6 , 59 34.8 and 56.6 34.8 then go 55 30.8\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65997 - Move to 55.2 24.9 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187406.\n10a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65998 - Go close to Dragon eggs and kill 9 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191883 coming from them.\n10b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65999 - Kill 15 Primalist invaders.\n10c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66000 - Pick Up 4 books 57.1 23.8 , 57.6 23.8 , 54,6 20.6 top of tower , 53.4 22 in tower on bottom on the shelf.\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66001 - Move to 56.2 22