            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline Lilac Ramble. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16405 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee My Video if need it - https://youtu.be/MGvz2cNSy_w\n\nQuests in order I done:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65899 - Quest start From https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186303 25.11 56.86. Go find and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187270. is in the farthest cave /way 24.79 63.15\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65900 - You need to get few thing all close to water:\n- 2 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191085 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186308\n- 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191084 contained in https://www.wowhead.com/object=376695\n- 15 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191083  youcan get even 3 from one bush\nthen speak with questgiver. wait few sec to finish quest.\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65903 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=191134 to Catch 12 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187473 /way 23.25 65.89.\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65902 - speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187270 in cave then press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186970 next to him.\n5a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65905 - Kill mobs until 100%\n5b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65937 - Find 3 evidence: https://www.wowhead.com/item=201874 24.88 60.39, https://www.wowhead.com/item=191086 25.77 59.67 ( hard to see due to that plants over there is big but you pick up small part ) and https://www.wowhead.com/item=191568 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186321\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65904 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187270 in cave then just wait.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66011 - Go to 24.93 65.84 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187270 then just wait to finish storyline.\n\nHope That help You :)",
