        {
            id = 5484588,
            score = 2,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1315]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16336 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/H1GOO8gaAH0\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66027 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186280 movie will start. After finish You will get new dragon skill https://www.wowhead.com/spell=377709 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=194705.\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65886 - Go to 38.2 61.5 use extra bar and from top platform fly to 65.8 25.3\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65887 - Go to 67 35.2.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65943 - Defeat 15 Primalists within Vakthros most of them in cave 71 35.5\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65944 - Go to cave and Destroy 3 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186552: /way 72.2 37.2 /way 73,1 37.7 /way 73.7 38.3\n4c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66647 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189939 72.8 38.5 to get https://www.wowhead.com/item=192478.\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65958 - Kill mobs and on them body use https://www.wowhead.com/item=192479 to get 100%.\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65977 - Rescue 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=189769: /way 74.5 38.6 /way 75.3 37.1 /way 75.6 38.3 /way 76.1 37.9 /way 76.5 38.9 /way 76 39.5\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66007 - Use skill on extra bar to transform to lava element then Destroy 4 https://www.wowhead.com/object=376928 avoid all circles on ground some mobs can discover You. I was using only skill 1 to move faster. https://www.wowhead.com/object=376928 Location: /way 77.2 39.9\n/way 77.4 38.2 /way 78.3 37.5 /way 78.5 38.9\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66009 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183422 79 36.4 You can pick up barier to protect you when you will see Kalecgos czating xD.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70041 - First jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=193842 now there will be 3 stages:\n- Stage 1 - Kill 150 mobs using skill 1 and 2 ( maily skill 1 )\n- Stage 2 -Then Using skill 3 dispell 2 Storm funnels.\n- stage 3 - Use skill 1-2 to kill 200 mobs, then movie will start.\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66015 - Fly back to 39.5 63 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186188 Movie will start. After that Storyline will finish and you will reach https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16336.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
            date = "2022-12-02T04:09:51-06:00",
