        {
            id = 5519216,
            score = 12,
            author = "Tikkin",
            text = "If like me you struggled to find this quest on an alt - it appears that it requires the campaign breadcrumb quests - you can't just rock up and do it!",
            date = "2023-01-03T17:32:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016#comments:id=5519216",
        },
        {
            id = 5656027,
            score = 7,
            author = "Miitza",
            text = "After progressing thru the Obsidian Citadel quests and arriving in The Ruby Life Pools, I eventually started the quest-chain beginning with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65795\nProgressing thru this chain eventually lead to this quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65806 - after arriving in Maruukai, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=181217 offered me the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016 quest\nThe Clan Teerai quest might be accessible earlier, without finishing this quest-chain and arriving in Maruukai, but I don't know. This is how I spotted this quest first time\n\nI, among others, was also confused as to why I couldn't accept the Clan Teerai quest after haphazardly flying to Maruukai to initiate the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016 quest, for https://www.wowhead.com/item=194964 (awarded from https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66019, the quest after Clan Teerai)\n\nHope this helps!",
            date = "2023-07-24T04:41:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016#comments:id=5656027",
        },
        {
            id = 5482818,
            score = 0,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1304]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=15394 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/PRv31gJKfRU\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186941 59.1 37.5\n1b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66018 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191485 60.3 40.7\n1c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66017 - See https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191595 in bulding 62.9 33.7\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66019 - Help Qariin Dotur cook a meal for the ancestors. Step by step what to do:\n- Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=376259 from the wagon 59.3 37.7 and place on table.\n- Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=376261 next to grill 59.2 37.3 and use on table where is meat by using extra bar\n- Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=376260 from table 59.3 37.3 and use on table where is meat by using extra bar\n- Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=376262 next to wagon 59 37.8 and use on table where is meat by using extra bar\n- Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=380887 from table and take it to fire and press extra bar ( don't move until finish ) then place meat on table 59.1 37.1\nReward is https://www.wowhead.com/item=194964.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66021 - Defeat 6 Nokhud centaur.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66020 - Pick up 5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191160 they are around bulding then pres on https://www.wowhead.com/item=191160 to make https://www.wowhead.com/item=198981. then go back to bulding and press on https://www.wowhead.com/object=378032 62.8 33.7\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66969 - Go to speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191283 61.4 39.5 then you need to answer 4 questions: Arswers: 1, 4 , 2 , 3. after finish quest wait for new NPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194927 to start next quest.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66948 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194927.\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66022 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186942 He is on top of bulding 60.3 37.9 movie will start.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66023 - Kill 10 Nokhud forces.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66024 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191843 57.6 39.5 - reward https://www.wowhead.com/item=197405\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66025 - after start quest conversation will start when it finish Storyline is done.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
            date = "2022-12-01T02:15:30-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66016#comments:id=5482818",
        },
    },
