            text = "No need to abandon all side quests as some are doing. All you need to do is abandon or complete all Artisan's Supply quests. Those are interfering with this quest.",
            date = "2022-11-29T06:14:51-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66020#comments:id=5480337",
        },
        {
            id = 5496937,
            score = 23,
            author = "Janaq",
            text = "The flowers to collect are just outside the tent. Easy enough now to get five quickly.\n\nThen \"use\" the flowers in your bag to make the Incense - which for some reason isn't visible in your bag but its ok.\n\nBack inside the tent there is a large pot opposite the quest giver, just click on that and done.",
            date = "2022-12-11T02:02:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66020#comments:id=5496937",
        },
        {
            id = 5480179,
