            text = "Seems bug on launch, it is not possible to create incense burned :/\n\nEdit : as Balador said, abandon all side quests and it works",
            date = "2022-11-29T01:45:08-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66020#comments:id=5480179",
        },
        {
