t.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66948 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=194927.\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66022 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186942 He is on top of bulding 60.3 37.9 movie will start.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66023 - Kill 10 Nokhud forces.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66024 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=191843 57.6 39.5 - reward https://www.wowhead.com/item=197405\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66025 - after start quest conversation will start when it finish Storyline is done.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
