        {
            id = 5779248,
            score = 3,
            author = "Messyschmidt",
            text = "I want to help those who got stuck on this quest where Scout Tomul does not spawn at the proper location to hand in this story campaign quest and are therefore stuck from moving forward.  I tried abandoning the quest and re-doing it; flying away and back to see if he would be there; and I thought about clearing my cache.  Instead I completed the questline where you assist Baine Bloodhoof and Scout Tomul which begins with the quest: https://www.wowhead.com/guide/lore/dragonflight-patch-baine-bloodhoof-old-hatreds.  At some point (SPOILER ALERT HERE) Baine and Tomul have a falling out and Tomul presumably runs away back to Maruukai.  Before beginning the Old Hatreds quests, be in mind I had abandoned the 'Unwelcome Outsider' quest and did the Old Hatreds questline up to Tomul deserting Baine.  I then returned to Maruukai, picked up the quest for 'Unwelcome Outsider', completed the 6 fights, and Tomul was available for the turn in so I could move forward with the main story campaign and the Old Hatreds storyline.  I've seen people stuck on this on forums/other social media sites and just want to assist those in the same seemingly dead end.  Hope this helps.",
            date = "2024-02-05T01:40:11-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66021#comments:id=5779248",
        },
    },
