        {
            id = 5497596,
            score = 9,
            author = "alpanhell",
            text = "Kind of a silly questline, they don't even mention the Green Dragon that was killed.  You'd think their first goal would be to tell the Green Dragons what happened.\n\nAlso doesn't make sense that all the Nokhur just disappear after this, I thought they were taking the Maruuk?",
            date = "2022-12-11T15:26:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66025#comments:id=5497596",
        },
        {
            id = 5430302,
            score = 1,
            author = "ezili78",
            text = "So it isn't very evident with how the npcs move and phase but once you accept the quest they kinda move around. In order to get the npc to be in the right location you need to talk to Captain Exposition just to the right of the doorway before entering and choose \"meeting of the Khans.\"\n\nOn beta this was not very obvious.",
            date = "2022-09-07T21:27:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66025#comments:id=5430302",
        },
