        {
            id = 5484370,
            score = 9,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1317]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16336 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/y04SXv1uSqc\n\nStoryline in order I done it:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66699 - Speak with: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190229 46.7 38.6 , https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190226 46.3 38.2 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=190225 45.7 38.9\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65864 - Go 35.2 37 and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186224 wait ultil conversation finish to get next quest.\n3a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65868 - Slay the mobs and get 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=191107 is not 100% drop.\n3b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65866 - Press on 5 https://www.wowhead.com/object=376139 they are around 35.1 34.7\n3c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65867 - Kill 3 mobs: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186515 35.7 34.6 , https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186516 34.9 32.7 inside cave, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186517 33.9 33.1\nNext 4 quest to do in Kargpaw's Den 34 30.7.\n6a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65870 - Collect 3 items: https://www.wowhead.com/item=192189 36 93.7 , https://www.wowhead.com/item=191111 29.8 75 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=192190 50.8 36.6\n6b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65871 - Rescue https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186655 40.8 63.6 and 3 Tuskarr they are in cage.\n6c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65872 - Kill 16 Shadepaw gnolls.\n6d. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65873 - Go slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186660 40.6 17.7 and loot https://www.wowhead.com/item=191118.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66239 - Meet https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187721 28.7 34.8\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=65869 - First speak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187730 28.7 34.8 then examine 4 nearby corpses: /way 29.2 33.5 /way 29.1 32.5 /way 28.1 31.8 /way 27.9 32.7\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66026 - Meet https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186179 20.6 35.6. After this quest storyline finish.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
