        {
            id = 5508669,
            score = 15,
            author = "Jeolene",
            text = "What's interesting is that this quest takes you to an instanced version of Northrend, not the Dragon Soul dungeon like you would expect.  This is evident by the missing Old God's boss generals areas and that Wyrmrest Temple still has its crown on top.  You can enter Wyrmrest Temple, but sadly, there are no neat easter eggs or other fun things like murloc versions of the aspects.  Just Horde/Alliance on Deathwing murloc action.  I also noticed that when you do go into Wyrmrest, it sends you to a phased version of that instance where everything on the battlefield disappears.  If you run around back of the temple, you see some glitched land objects and it eventually teleports you back out front.",
