            text = "Since no one else has mentioned this, I've decided to hang out and grab who was here, cause literally, this was great.\nAmong the characters here are:\nThrallgrulgulgul\nVarian Wryngrrlgulgll\nFinduin Wryngrrlgulgll (He's behind his dad, so cute!)\nVrglrok Saurfin\nBaine Blrrgfin\nGillvanas\nTyrggrin Webbedring\nSefin\nMurkdeep\nOld Murk-Eye\n\"Captain\" Cookie\nMmmrrrggglll\nGrrvrgull the Conqueror\nSir Finley Mrrgglton\n\nBig Bad:\nDeathwingurlugull\n\nIn the next quest:[Spoiler]Amrrgla Grglllhrrt and \"her\" [/Spoiler]\n\n**Note: Please comment if you found any other unique characters. As a Horde player, I am curious to if my \"champions\" are skewed towards the Horde side.",
            date = "2022-12-04T05:03:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66035#comments:id=5487395",
        },
