        {
            id = 5897432,
            score = 3,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "Y'know, I think it'd be a really, really fun idea if they made a \"Bronze Timeline Wormhole Generator\" Toy.\n\nIt would work like the Engineering Wormhole Generators, but instead of sending you to a random location in that Generator's continent, it sends you to a random Timeline -- like this fantastic Murloc one!\n\nYou can't really do much in the various Timelines, yeah, but I think it would still be neat. They could make some really wacky Timelines if they wanted to. Perhaps even throw some Secrets in there to find, or have a questline that uses the Toy... I think there are a lot of possibilities here!\n\nPlease, Blizzard? :D",
            date = "2024-07-14T21:45:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66035#comments:id=5897432",
        },
    },
