            author = "Mogster1234",
            text = "I see a lot of NPCs here, some based on WoW NPCs (like Finduin Wryngrrlgulgll and Baine Blrrgfin) but also some murlocs like Old Murkeye and even Sir Finley Mrrgglton from Hearthstone. Also, the NPCs seem to change if you leave the quest area and come back.",
