        {
            id = 5490440,
            score = 4,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You Storyline [storyline=1323]. This Storyline is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16363 which is criteria for https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=16585.\n\nSee Video with Storyline if need it - https://youtu.be/9C5hRjvdR9w\n\nStoryline in order i'm done:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70040 - Speak with 3 NPC: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192403 59.5 82.5, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=192404 59.3 82.2, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=185915 60.2 81.7. Then Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186931 wait until conversation finish.\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66028 - Use portal and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183860\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66029 - Use portal and fly 47.8 40.8 then use under Flying dragons https://www.wowhead.com/item=192749.\n2c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66030 - Inside portal after finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66028. Heal 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187341 there are a lot of them lying on the ground.\n2d. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66031 - Inside portal after finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66028. Kill mobs to get 30 https://www.wowhead.com/item=192454.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66032 - Use  orange portal to go back\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=72519 - Use portal and fly 61.7 61.8  then use under Flying dragons https://www.wowhead.com/item=192749.\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66033 - Take the portal and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187344.\n7c. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66035 - Inside portal after finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66033 Collect 12 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=186652 this are a orbs you just need to cross them. is above the fire\n7d. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66036 - Inside portal after finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66033 Slay 25 small murlocs and 5 Big murlocs.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=70373 - Jump on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=195209 and use all skills to take down https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183849.\n12. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66037 - Use orange portal.\n13. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66660 - Use orange portal.\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66038 - Use have 3min 10 sec to get to portal 15.2 58.5 ( any one look what will happen if you will not get on time ? ). To move fast cross buff and avoid white circles that will slow you.\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039 - Go to 53.3 44.2 and use https://www.wowhead.com/item=192749. CARE ON EYE !\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66040 - Defend your allies until 100% then movie will start. After speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=183972 ( is small NPC XD ) another movie will start, After You will get new dragon https://www.wowhead.com/item=194521.\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66221 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187678 at the Seat of the Aspects in Valdrakken. Speak with him and after finish this Quest You will be able to do World Quests, Weekly Quest and https://www.wowhead.com/spell=393788.\n\nHope That Help You :)",
            date = "2022-12-06T07:28:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66036#comments:id=5490440",
        },
    },
