            id = 5748995,
            score = 3,
            author = "Akaislot1",
            text = "DON'T CLICK THE PORTAL BEFORE YOU HAVE THE QUEST,,,,\n\nI successfully defeated Deathwingurlugull, but unfortunately, quest 66037 (Back to Reality) did not trigger automatically with Andantenormu for me. In my eagerness to complete the quest chain and without re-logging, I accidentally clicked the portal and got teleported back. This has significantly hindered my progression, and I am currently in contact with customer service as there is no apparent way to return and reacquire the quest. The overall process has been quite cumbersome, and it feels like there's a clumsy design implementation at play here. So, until further notice I am unable to get the normal flying skill @ the dragon isles...",
