            text = "During The Pandaren Revolution:\n\nSiaszerathel says: I read about this! Those Mogu were vicious!\nSiaszerathel says: Go Pandaren! Kick their a--\nAndantenormu says: Zera--\nSiaszerathel says: a-authoritarian regime to the curb!",
            date = "2022-12-19T14:37:37-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66038#comments:id=5507569",
        },
    },
    [66039] = {
        {
            id = 5481288,
            score = 521,
            author = "gnomeregannn",
            text = "tldr; if you came to this page, you might be pressing the wrong action button :)\n\nI came here because I was stuck on this quest  for an embarrassing amount of time. Could not figure out what I was doing wrong. Well I was pressing the ability button for \"temporal displacement\" and not the button next to the quest text. Still embarrassing, figured I'd mention it in the event someone else mentally zoned out while doing these and was spamming the wrong button.",
            date = "2022-11-29T22:58:52-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039#comments:id=5481288",
        },
        {
            id = 5480968,
            score = 93,
            author = "asloversgo",
            text = "Going back so far in time and seeing Ragnaros, Al'akir and Therazane in battle with the Black Empire, albeit briefly, was honestly cool as hell.",
            date = "2022-11-29T17:34:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039#comments:id=5480968",
        },
        {
            id = 5482661,
            score = 87,
            author = "KellydaMan",
            text = "From what I can tell, based on the voice lines you hear while in The Black Empire, the presences are most likely the following Old Gods' respective whispers:\nMaddening = Yogg-Saron\nKnowing = N'Zoth\nObserving = C'Thun\nPiercing = Y'Shaarj",
            date = "2022-11-30T22:55:59-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039#comments:id=5482661",
        },
        {
            id = 5489892,
            score = 67,
            author = "TamiayTheGnome",
            text = "Warning, if like me you have depression, anxiety or schizophrenia, the whispers here can be quite jarring.\nIn myself, it triggered a pretty bad depressive episode. (I know what people without these issues might say, if I'm this delicate, I shouldn't be playing video games, or whatever.)\nBut instead of complaining about it, which I'd love to do, but I won't. I'll suggest what helped me.\nTurn your game sound off Control + S by default. Then click combat log, so you can't even read those old god whispers.\nHaving awful voices popping up saying \"You will die\" and \"Your friends will betray you\" is pretty awful. When you have to deal with voices saying that kind of thing when it's not the game sound.\nMuch love to my fellow people with mental health issues. Hopefully we'll see a brighter future some day. <3",
            date = "2022-12-05T22:14:38-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039#comments:id=5489892",
        },
        {
            id = 5507101,
            score = 58,
            author = "Inkjoy7",
            text = "60%\n\nIf you are stuck, don't use the action button, use the button by the quest on screen. This will cause it to go to the full 100% you need.\n\nMany thanks to karpana  7 days ago (Patch 10.0.2), who posted below:\n\nFor those struggling... don't use the large action button (within the quest's blue circle). Use the quest's \"crystal\"",
            date = "2022-12-19T04:04:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66039#comments:id=5507101",
        },
    },
    [66253] = {
        {
            id = 5380156,
            score = 37,
            author = "Kamraten",
            text = "Silly quests like these actually makes me smile. In a time where Blizzard somewhat forces quests to be story-lined, simple tasks like these have been forgotten. But I enjoy them a lot. Thanks for adding it in! =)\n\nUpon completion the quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66323 is offered for you.",
            date = "2022-06-01T18:52:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253#comments:id=5380156",
        },
        {
            id = 5380590,
            score = 19,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253 is a new quest that can be picked up from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187758 in central Orgrimmar (to the left of Grommash Hold, if you're looking at the Hero's Call Board out in front of it). Next to/behind him is a bunch of random stuff like watermelons and a drink, and a cart with some boxes in it. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=188655 is another new NPC related to this quest, seen standing in the corner fiddling with something in her hands endlessly.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=187775 is the target of https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253's objecctive. You'll find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187775 at the base of the Zeppelin Tower for Boren Tundra / Thunder Bluff, on the Borean Tundra side. (The Zeppelin Tower is almost directly behind Grommash Hold, but up on the higher-level (\"altitude\"?) section of Orgrimmar, near the Flight Master https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3310 and Riding Trainer https://www.wowhead.com/npc=44919.) As you approach him, you'll see he's holding a highlighted box, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187987, and he will say:\nDon't mind me, I just wanted a peek!\nUse https://www.wowhead.com/item=191408 (in your bag or on the quest list) on him, and he will say:\nNot another pie!\nThough I'm highly disappointed it didn't really explode... Like, I wanted it to be a maaassive affair, lol.\nPick up the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187987, return to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=187758, and turn in the quest!\nThe follow-up quest he gives you is called https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66323.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253/https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66323 and all these accompanying NPCs seem to be new additions, implemented with the 5/31/2022 9.2.5 patch.",
            date = "2022-06-02T20:32:01-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253#comments:id=5380590",
        },
        {
            id = 5380250,
            score = 9,
            author = "Shatterhawk",
            text = "Kanyaku can be found at the base of the zeppelin tower at /way 44.74 62.61.",
            date = "2022-06-02T00:40:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253#comments:id=5380250",
        },
        {
            id = 5548760,
            score = 7,
            author = "tooltip",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253 was removed in Patch 10.0.5, as well as the Alliance equivalent https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66390.  You will not find Kanyaku, no matter how high or low you search for him.  It is safe to abandon the quest.",
            date = "2023-02-12T05:17:56-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=66253#comments:id=5548760",
        },
        {
            id = 5544481,
            score = 3,
