            text = "The Jade Forest (https://www.wowhead.com/?quest=73227)  Chapter, from the Storyline  The Veiled Ossuary (https://www.wowhead.com/storyline/the-veiled-ossuary-1398):\n\n Jade Forest (https://www.wowhead.com/?quest=73227)\n\n Warm Winds and Water (https://www.wowhead.com/?quest=72650)\n Carp Care (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=72651/carp-care)\n Local Deliveries (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=72653)\n Up, Up, and Home (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=72654)\n Self Care (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=72652) (This Quest)\n A Drink with Kalecgos (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=72655)\n Blue is My Favorite Color (http://www.wowhead.com/?quest=74291)",
