            author = "Woodymakespizza",
            text = "If you end up leaving for whatever reason before finishing, abandon quest, You can then go back to Assistant Phineas (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=207051/) in Stormwind or Org for a ride back. Going to Org without abandoning, he will not be there.\n\nOrgrimmar\n/way 43.0 51.4 Assistant Phineas\n\nStormwind\n/way #84 43.8 79.2 Assistant Phineas",
