            score = 0,
            author = "Icehawknel",
            text = "At the Current Moment this Quest Step is Very Hard due to The single mob and everyone trying to tag and Claim it.\n\nCurrently\nCan be done in a group of (At Testing no more than 5 people in a party)\nForm a group with 5 people one person be on rain of fire duty\nEveryone else spam Subjugate Demon.\n\nAside: This quest Was POORLY planned and should have been a phased environment.\n\nThis Quest has been fixed. Completion is now shared if someone else Subjugates it",
