        {
            id = 5650022,
            score = 63,
            author = "hotchrisbfries",
            text = "Argent Dawn (https://www.wowhead.com/faction=529/argent-dawn) reputation is unlocked through the questline given by Fiona (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=45417/fiona) starting at the wagon near the border between EPL and WPL. The quests required to unlock Argent Dawn reputation takes about 20-30 minutes total.\n\nGidwin Goldbraids (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27367/gidwin-goldbraids)\nJust Encased (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27368/just-encased)\nGreasing the Wheel (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27369/greasing-the-wheel)\nTarenar Sunstrike (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27370/tarenar-sunstrike)\nWhat I Do Best (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27371/what-i-do-best)\nA Gift For Fiona (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27372/a-gift-for-fiona)\nOnward, to Light's Hope Chapel (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27373/onward-to-lights-hope-chapel)\nTraveling Companions (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27381/traveling-companions)\nRough Roads (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27382/rough-roads)\nThe Trek Continues (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27448/the-trek-continues)\nBoys Will Be Boys (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27455/boys-will-be-boys)\nA Boyhood Dream (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27463/a-boyhood-dream)\nArgent Call: The Trial of the Crypt (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27464/argent-call-the-trial-of-the-crypt)\n\nOnce progressed through the chain, completing Lord Maxwell Tyrosus's (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=11034/lord-maxwell-tyrosus) quest  Argent Call: The Trial of the Crypt (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=27464/argent-call-the-trial-of-the-crypt) will then bring the player to Revered reputation. After this point, the only way to earn reputation to Exalted with the Argent Dawn is by completing the repeatable quests  Annals of the Silver Hand (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28755/annals-of-the-silver-hand) and  Aberrations of Bone (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=28756/aberrations-of-bone), which feature objectives in the Stratholme (https://www.wowhead.com/zone=2017/stratholme) and Scholomance (https://www.wowhead.com/zone=6066/scholomance) dungeons.",
            date = "2023-07-15T22:57:46-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=76263#comments:id=5650022",
        },
    },
