        {
            id = 5771305,
            score = 5,
            author = "CircleofHealing",
            text = "Mad trolling Blizz!\n\nA long fast straight, through a narrow corridor. Then, if you aren't paying attention to the guiding arrows, you will miss a sharp right and end up in the \"The Eye (https://www.wowhead.com/zone=3845/the-eye)\" instance.\n\nProtip: There is no free ride back to the Bronze Timekeeper. Exit the instance, hop on your stupid dragon and contemplate your life choices on the long lonely flight back to the race location.",
            date = "2024-01-24T10:08:20-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=77278#comments:id=5771305",
        },
