        {
            id = 5908909,
            score = 19,
            author = "Naas",
            text = "update 8/1/2024:  After today's hotfix where memory rewards were buffed, the quests are now account-wide and daily instead of weekly. So you can only complete the 3 zone quests once per day for your account.\n\nAs of 7/30/2024, the weeklies are per character as opposed to account-wide. Also, Residual Memories are transferable between your characters.\n\nDo each of the 3 weeklies on all your alts if you want to earn Residual Memories more quickly.",
            date = "2024-07-30T23:02:42-05:00",
