            text = "As I went through this quest chain, I couldn't help but think of the following Iron Maiden albums:\n\nFear of the Dark\nA Matter of Life and Death\nPiece of Mind\nThe Final Frontier\nDance of Death\nNo Prayer for the Dying\n\nI also thought about the following Iron Maiden songs:\n\nComing Home\nStrange World\nDifferent World",
