            author = "HookTwineThinker",
            text = "Thanks to all who left a comment below.\n\nsumone54 & datgrl\n\nJust wanted to consolidate so you can quickly get back to the madness of the Harandar \"campaigns\".\n\nThe quest givers & the turn in are in the same cave.\n\nCave entrance at /way 63.2, 57.8\n\nDon't leave the cave where the quest is acquired. The mob you need is just down the cave a bit. Watch out for some of the bugs, they can be a pain.\n\nGood luck!",
