        {
            id = 6293714,
            score = 53,
            author = "Nevial",
            text = "I like how all these people are answering questions we didn't ask.\n\nWhat can you tell me about the Rift of Aln?\n\"ORWEYNA IS A PETULANT CHILD HOW DARE SHE\"\n\nWhat can you tell me about the Rift of Aln?\n\"YOU WANT HOW MUCH DUST?  IT'S DIFFICULT MAN\"",
            date = "2026-02-28T23:52:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86864#comments:id=6293714",
        },
        {
            id = 6296591,
            score = 38,
            author = "globalmenace",
            text = "The flightmaster has two valid locations (zone and microzone), so here with the map IDs:\n\n/way #2576 71 53 Flightmaster (inside den)\nor\n/way #2413 54 53 Flightmaster (from outside)\n\n---\n\nEdit/PS:\n\nI’ve seen some downvotes despite the correct info, so let me explain:\n\nWoW coordinates are always relative to a map/zone. Without a map ID, the game assumes the zone you’re in, making map IDs indeed often optional for a ‘way’ command (unless cross-zone).\n\nHere, it’s finicky: The Den (map #2576) is a relatively large microzone inside Harandar (#2413), and both have their own coordinate systems. The Den flightmaster is located in both zones. So, if you’re in Harandar (outside the Den), and enter the Den-relative coordinates (71, 53) without map ID, you’ll get a waypoint far off. (A similar thing happens when you're inside the Den and use Harandar coords.)\n\nSpecifying the map ID fixes this. Both coordinates are correct, no matter where you are.\n‌",
            date = "2026-03-03T12:27:47-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86864#comments:id=6296591",
        },
        {
            id = 6301637,
            score = 27,
            author = "rgarisn",
            text = "Watch the Den\n/way 50.91 55.56 Innkeeper (in hut)\n/way 50.99 50.77 Quartermaster (by hut)\n/way 70.59 53.29 Flight Master (in the cave below the entrance)\n/way 54.23 55.72 Ku'paal (on rock)",
            date = "2026-03-08T12:43:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86864#comments:id=6301637",
        },
        {
            id = 6294924,
            score = 20,
            author = "avgjoegeek",
            text = "/way 70.27 53.21 for the Flightmaster found in a Cave Under the Main Building.",
            date = "2026-03-01T22:56:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86864#comments:id=6294924",
        },
    },
