    [86911] = {
        {
            id = 6292446,
            score = 12,
            author = "Aerynsun8449",
            text = "It would have been nice if Blizz gave us a little heads up that Freya was walking around and will kill us very quickly while we are looting the Iceberries. I'm currently level 84 with an iLvL of 148.31. I wondered what the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244628 was for. I was just five steps away from one when I got \"attacked\". I was dead by the time I had taken three steps towards the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244628. I'm not sure if she just walks in a specific area (atm I'm sitting in one of the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244628 watching her. Seems to only go in a small circle around me. For those with TomTom I'm at /way 36.64, 46.53. I got out of the https://www.wowhead.com/NPC=244628 and watched her for a bit. As I watched her, I don't think she attacked me. Seems maybe I was just in the wrong place at the wrong time. Several players (mounted) rode past her without her attacking them. I think I must have just been in her path and she didn't see me. She seems to be patrolling around that small area. Should be easily avoidable.",
            date = "2026-02-27T22:13:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86911#comments:id=6292446",
        },
        {
            id = 6316395,
            score = 9,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "For the  part of https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86911:\n\nI thought it was so dang cool that they finally made it so that NPCs actually move around while they're talking to each other! During this particular one, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=23746 and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=237567 will talk to each other while occasionally walking around each other, or towards or away from one another. It's done at points in the conversation where it makes sense, so it really positively adds to the immersion, since real people generally don't just always stand in one spot every time they talk to each other.\n\nThis was the first time I've ever seen this, to my recollection, since they started implementing the  thing. And if they've done it before (where NPCs move around while talking), they most definitely haven't done it to the extent that they did with this one!\n\nSuper small details, but it's the details that really pull the world together! Here's hoping they continue adding these types of details to improve the immersion in WoW. <3\n(I even submitted an in-game suggestion praising this design choice, so they know it was noticed and received favorably!)",
            date = "2026-03-25T01:55:18-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86911#comments:id=6316395",
        },
        {
            id = 6313048,
            score = 7,
            author = "brionl",
            text = "Who thought playing hide and seek with a Boss that can kill you in 3 hits was a good idea for a quest?",
            date = "2026-03-20T19:25:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86911#comments:id=6313048",
        },
        {
            id = 6328616,
            score = 7,
            author = "Qixel",
            text = "For those who come after, don't waste your time trying to kill Freya. Spent 10 minutes soloing her while I was going through, but she cannot go below 1hp.",
            date = "2026-04-11T12:39:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86911#comments:id=6328616",
        },
        {
            id = 6304382,
