        {
            id = 6292505,
            score = 7,
            author = "Aerynsun8449",
            text = "OK, this is a little confusing at first glance. When you get the quest, you're inside this tree \"house\". I'm not sure what they call it at this point. The point is, however, the quest \"zone\" looks like it's entirely inside the tree \"house\". They're not. However, if you step outside, the quest zones disappear. There is nothing you can do for the quest that is inside the tree \"house\". (I don't know why I keep referring to it like that. :D ) Anyway, go outside and take several steps away from the tree thing and you will see the quest zones. If you're doing The Traveling Flowers quest at the same time, the first time you talk with one of them that makes the zones for both quests brighter and easier to see outside of the \"tree house.\" And, of course, once you've completed both quests (or if you're only doing one) go back inside the tree \"house\" ( :D ) and turn the quest in.",
            date = "2026-02-27T23:26:53-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=86914#comments:id=6292505",
