            score = 4,
            author = "Oceandust",
            text = "Once you open the door using the Humming Core, don't be a dummy like me and run up the ramp and use the Translocation Orb. The quest mob Hungering Lightroot is on the bottom floor and has a longer respawn timer. Give it a minute or so and it will respawn.",
