    [88719] = {
        {
            id = 6292572,
            score = 5,
            author = "Raa007",
            text = "Some fun facts about this quest!\n\nAfter you accept the quest, but before you use Light's Summon (https://www.wowhead.com/item=239151/lights-summon):\nIf you fly all the way out to the Sunwell Ramparts, there won't be any NPCs there apart from a handful of guards. You'll also be able to sky-ride in the area.\n\nAfter you accept the quest, and then use Light's Summon (https://www.wowhead.com/item=239151/lights-summon):\nIf like I did, despite standing exactly where you should end up, you'll actually be teleported to an instanced version of the Sunwell to continue the campaign.\nWhen in this instance, you won't be able to fly (as Opressive Void (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1226952/oppressive-void) debuff is in effect), and if you stray too far, you will get automatically teleported back to the start position.\nYou CAN however, use your Hearthstone (https://www.wowhead.com/item=6948/hearthstone) to port out. If you then fly back, you will get a quest marker directing you to Silvermoon's portal room, then a direction to use the portal to go back to Stormwind, then to Dornogal where the Image of Lady Liadrin (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=241677/image-of-lady-liadrin) is, and you can be teleported back to the instance. (Alternatively, you can just use the Light's Summon (https://www.wowhead.com/item=239151/lights-summon) in your bags)\n\nBonus tip: If you walk into the Sunwell's water, you'll die.",
            date = "2026-02-28T00:35:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88719#comments:id=6292572",
        },
        {
            id = 6293837,
