            text = "You can't hearthstone out or use teleporting toys after you get teleported to the Isle of Quel'Danas.\n\nA skip is not offered as an option if you are already on the isle. If you accidentally got there on an alt when you wanted to skip the introduction instead, you can use dungeon or raid teleports with 8h cd's to get out.",
