        {
            id = 6437022,
            score = 1,
            author = "Maxpain87",
            text = "New Update Please read the whole guide before start: 9/27/2026  Fastest way to get  https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61574 and  https://www.wowhead.com/item=253443  in almost 3-4h (except waiting time for the Dreamrif LFG ) using 7 Alts from 0 progress (depends on your current progress you may need less alt than 7)\nthese guide also works for https://www.wowhead.com/item=263037 , https://www.wowhead.com/item=263315, https://www.wowhead.com/item=264262, https://www.wowhead.com/item=262906, https://www.wowhead.com/item=263196 and https://www.wowhead.com/item=263041 you will have them unlocked along the way and then you can buy more of them from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=255114   /way 62.6 34.2\n\nGo to Harandar and accept the \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89268\" quest from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=238170  the Blue weekly quest\nthen select one of the relics behind him that its not unlocked for you yet\n\nAfter you turn in this quest he will give you another for this relic, finish it.  then go on other alt and do the next relic quest.... I got 5 of them unlocked in like 1h,\n\nLast two will remain locked for you, So go ahead like this:\nYou will get the \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88997 \" quest do the storyline go on your next Alt, to get the last quest \" https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88997 \", then the 6th relic will be unlocked and u can do its questline\n\nAfter u got the Root of the world quest completed, you'll have unlock the 6th relic.\n\n For the last on \" https://www.wowhead.com/item=253443 \", go on ur 7th Alt and get the quest \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90735\" do the storyline again turn it and come back for \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90741 \", at the end of this questline you have to do \"Dreamrif\" raid on LFG so u can queue up right after u logged in on ur 7th alt (average waiting 60min for tank role right now) at the end you will have the \"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=42278 \" achievement done and the last relic is unlock for https://www.wowhead.com/item=253443 do the last storyline and you got it\n\nbtw you have to do the \"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92694 \" /way 70.54, 51.20 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=252871 storyline (4-5 quests) before you can select the last relic\n\nyou will have each one of these mini questlines as part of [storyline=6015] as you complete each one of the relics quest, DON\"T FORGET  you have to do all these storylines on your alt to get to the progress point, before taking the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89268, its almost just taking the quest and turning it, like 2 min, except last 3 storyline that needs doing 5-6 quest for each\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88993\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88994\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88995\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88996\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88997\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88998\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=88999",
