        },
        {
            id = 6291159,
            score = 10,
            author = "jedijesse",
            text = "Dawnblaze? Blackmail?\n\nThe info here is split between quest text and in-game dialogue, so pay attention to speech bubbles/chat if you want to follow the story.\n\nAs I was saying, the wardsmiths are led by Magister Dawnblaze. She inherited the vacant seat following the war but has proven inadequate since then.\nShe does not adapt to the new challenges the sin'dorei face. That is why I proffered myself to take her seat.\nShe has fabricated blackmail against me in an attempt to prevent this. You can see how this is a great injustice.",
            date = "2026-02-26T20:29:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89200#comments:id=6291159",
        },
        {
            id = 6367577,
            score = 5,
            author = "Dlucks83",
            text = "If anyone has not been able to interact with puzzle nodes like me for the last couple months; RIGHT CLICK INSTEAD OF LEFT CLICKING on the nodes. I had done everything to make these work. Turning off everything, deleting everything and fresh installing and this finally worked on a fresh install with nothing added to the game. Will checking back to see if it works with my addons and settings.\n\n*EDIT*\nAdded my old WTF and Interface folders back and it still works!",
            date = "2026-06-17T06:37:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89200#comments:id=6367577",
        },
        {
            id = 6293301,
            score = 3,
            author = "ldene",
            text = "On the final platform, there should be an image of Magister Aradis, if the's not there, abandon and pick it back up from 53.32",
            date = "2026-02-28T15:45:23-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89200#comments:id=6293301",
        },
