        {
            id = 6310248,
            score = 11,
            author = "Pralaya",
            text = "\"There was gold on his head. we'll all split my share\"\n\"Jaeth , you dont--\"\n\" Get back to the row before the guards come . Character, lets go collect.\"\n\n\"I am pleased this little situation could be resolved happily\"\n\"You think think this is happy? one of my friends died over this.\"\n\"Certainly Aradis is no longer a thorn in my side and the Row being involved made you take this job inexpensively.\"\n\"I was protecting the Row. Like all of you should be doing, instead of pretending Silvermoon doesnt include us.\"\n\"It is amusing to receive a lecture from somone who accepts gold for murder.\"\n\"Your head is worth gold too. Remember that.\"\n-Magister Dawnblaze smiles and sips her wine.\n_jaeth takes two steps back and uses the vanish spell\n\nAll the quests involving the Row have been absolutely stellar. Also I have done things alot more hideous than killing people for gold and people call me a hero I believe in you Jaeth.",
            date = "2026-03-17T21:44:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89208#comments:id=6310248",
        },
        {
            id = 6373457,
            score = 1,
