            author = "Stompa",
            text = "If you're choosing which reputation to work on, here's the details that helped me.\n\nFirst, all the vendors offer transmogs and housing items, which you can see on the individual vendor pages.\n\nWhat tipped the balance for me was the trade recipes:\n\n[faction=2712]\n• Vendor: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242725\n• https://www.wowhead.com/item=259364\n\n[faction=2714]\n• Vendor: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242726\n• https://www.wowhead.com/item=259375\n\n[faction=2711]\n• Vendor: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242723\n• https://www.wowhead.com/item=259367\n\n[faction=2713]\n• Vendor: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242724\n• https://www.wowhead.com/item=258505\n\nRaise all factions to neutral or better to earn the Achievement: https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62190\n• Reward: https://www.wowhead.com/item=257144\n\nRelated note: [faction=2710] reputation is separate from the four related factions.\n• Vendor: https://www.wowhead.com/npc=240838",
            date = "2026-06-21T11:01:31-05:00",
