        {
            id = 6293271,
            score = 10,
            author = "Augmentum",
            text = "Once you complete the entire campaign on one character (including the Voidstorm storyline), you will unlock the option to skip the introductory storyline. After that, you’ll be able to choose different regions to play through the campaign without any order restrictions — meaning you can start with Harandar right away and then complete the rest afterward.\n\nThe same applies to the Voidstorm campaign.",
            date = "2026-02-28T15:09:48-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89402#comments:id=6293271",
        },
        {
            id = 6293641,
            score = 8,
            author = "Dangerbook",
            text = "If you go back to Silvermoon because questing is taking a long time and respawns are not happening, the portal (rootway) to get back to Haradar is not far from where Orwena was but there are hostile mobs in the area and it's a pain to bounce around trying to find it.  Portal at /way #2395 45.17 46.92",
            date = "2026-02-28T21:56:34-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89402#comments:id=6293641",
        },
        {
            id = 6291637,
            score = 5,
