        {
            id = 6305241,
            score = 3,
            author = "Bengarion",
            text = "I finally broke the code. The quest Hanandar is not picked up/given - you 'select it'.\n\n1. \009Go to Sanctum of Light, upper level\n2. \009Click the big horizontal yellow disk (the new “map table” - roughly 10 metres in diamater)\n3. \009Choose “One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar”\n4. \009This adds the quest Harandar to your log\n5. \009Go to Orweyna in Fairbreeze Village and hand in the quest\n6. \009She opens the portal (follow Orweyna up the hill where she opens up the portal)\n7. \009Jump in → Harandar unlocked\n\nThere are other map selections, but this one will get you started to Harandar.\n\nMinimum level - 93. (There are some other restrictions, but at 93 you prolly already meet them. Prolly...)\n\nSanctum of Light is in the middle of Silvermoon. Middle of the city. \"You can't miss it.\"",
            date = "2026-03-12T18:01:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89402#comments:id=6305241",
        },
    },
