            score = 3,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "While you are running around doing this quest, the siblings will speak with one another. Transcribing their dialogue!\n\nChana: Iz'ken, be careful pickin' de spores. You don't wanna anger de boars.\nIz'ken: I see some things never change.\nMother never gave me de chance to make mistakes.\nNeither did you.\nChana: You are my little brother. It was my duty to protect you.\nIz'ken: Did you consider how guilty I felt when you were punished for my mistakes?\n*Chana hesitates.*\nChana: No.\nBut I still look at each scar I saved you from with pride.",
            date = "2026-06-28T15:24:14-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89503#comments:id=6375797",
        },
    },
    [89506] = {
        {
            id = 6375800,
            score = 3,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "There is some dialogue upon accepting the quest.\n\nChana: How is life in de woods?\nIz'ken: Fine, actually. I have a good life now.\n\nAfter a bit, the dialogue continues.\n\nIz'ken: After I left, did she ever get better?\nChana: No. She got worse. But to be honest, I was glad when you left us.\nIz'ken: Because you didn't have to fix my mistakes anymore?\nChana: Because I knew she couldn't reach you.\n\nngl that last line really got me.",
            date = "2026-06-28T15:30:22-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89506#comments:id=6375800",
        },
    },
    [89513] = {
        {
            id = 6335566,
            score = 7,
            author = "glamscum",
            text = "Do not worry for Kan'sha. She has outlived generations of trolls, and de druids say she'll survive many more.\n\nForest Troll Druids confirmed?",
            date = "2026-04-21T20:10:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89513#comments:id=6335566",
        },
        {
            id = 6375813,
            score = 1,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "Transcribing quest dialogue!\n\nIz'ken: How did she die?\nChana: She got sick. We knew de end was comin'. It was just a matter of when.\nIz'ken: Did she ever... did she have any final words?\nChana: Just comfortin' lies.\n\nFind it interesting that the quest item https://www.wowhead.com/item=239483 text reads: \" Every shed branch carries a little poison away from Kan'sha's heartwood.\"\nI guess it's a reference to how time heals wounds? How we too can break the cycles of abuse by not letting ourselves be consumed by it?",
            date = "2026-06-28T15:45:23-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89513#comments:id=6375813",
        },
    },
    [89559] = {
        {
            id = 6306111,
            score = 15,
            author = "Evenuel",
            text = "By the stone you need to take, sleeps a pretty tough elite bear - be prepared.\nWhile fighting with my two troll companions, they had aggro and.. suddenly Chana died! I was so sad! I thought it is part of the quest, but nope - she just respawned. I think it's the first time I see the accompanying NPC die in a fight and respawn.. Normally they are dazed at 1HP or something.",
            date = "2026-03-13T13:15:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89559#comments:id=6306111",
        },
        {
            id = 6375822,
            score = 3,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "Transcribing spoken dialogue here!\n\nIz'ken: Why are we even honorin' her like this?\nChana: De tribe still loves her.\nIz'ken: Ya never told dem?\nChana: Dey never believed me.\n\nThere are some Shadowpine NPCs nearby, I'm not entirely sure if they are related to the quest? But they do have some dialogue and gossip, I'll put it underneath a spoiler.\n[spoiler]\nUpon approach, the family will start to speak.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=254802: Dis walk is too long, father. De ocean's boring.\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=254801: It isn't about de destination, Tay'sa.\nTay'sa: Maybe it could be. We could go someplace fun...\n\nAll three named Shadowpine all have unique gossip dialogue when interacted with.\nPalutan: De Shadowpine have no home. We make our homes along de way as we travel.\nTay'sa: Are we there yet?\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=254803: Father says dis place is sacred. We should be quiet!\n\nPerhaps Chana and Iz'ken's mother was part of the Shadowpine tribe? Not sure. [/spoiler]",
            date = "2026-06-28T16:00:09-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89559#comments:id=6375822",
        },
    },
    [89560] = {
        {
            id = 6298936,
            score = 59,
            author = "Jacobstx",
            text = "This was... a surprisingly mature questline, dealing with themes of abusive and narcissistic parents and how older siblings sometimes shield their younger ones from said parents, all the while the abusive parent presents outwardly as someone that others admire because of lies.\n\nHonestly, I spit on her grave. As the saying goes: \"Every child deserves parents, not every parent deserves children.\"",
            date = "2026-03-05T15:37:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89560#comments:id=6298936",
        },
        {
            id = 6297093,
            score = 30,
            author = "DiosaDeMuerte",
            text = "This questline made me cry.",
            date = "2026-03-03T21:16:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89560#comments:id=6297093",
        },
        {
            id = 6299428,
            score = 19,
            author = "vivisecting",
            text = "Very emotional. My favourite quest of the xpac so far.",
            date = "2026-03-06T00:01:09-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89560#comments:id=6299428",
        },
        {
            id = 6301095,
            score = 18,
            author = "castlerox66",
            text = "Truly great writing, one of my favorite quests ever. The final dialogue between Chana and Iz'ken had me in tears.",
            date = "2026-03-07T16:16:58-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89560#comments:id=6301095",
        },
        {
