        {
            id = 6375794,
            score = 1,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "Upon accepting Chana states: \"Thank you, . I don't wanna do this on my own. I'll meet you in de Solemn Valley, across the river.\"\n\nWhen you next meet with her, you'll find her standing next to her brother (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242015/izken).  Transcribing the dialogue!\n\nChana: Brother, is dat you?\nIz'ken: I heard mother died. Who is dis ?\nChana: I didn't think you'd show up. Dey came to help with de ceremony.\nIz'ken: To help, or to make sure we play nice and don' kill each other?",
            date = "2026-06-28T15:21:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=89565#comments:id=6375794",
        },
    },
