        },
        {
            id = 6381150,
            score = 1,
            author = "ohvist",
            text = "When the haranir began to grow restless, they looked to new sources of purpose. Some cast their gazes upward, toward the stars and the moon. Others, such as the Hara'ti, heard a call from deep within the world. The moment the first of the Hara'ti heard the Song echoing from the roots, we knew that we had found a new purpose.\n\n...You ignored Elune... You. Ignored. Elune...\n\nA Cosmic power unaffiliated with any Titan, that was actively calling out to you. And you chose to ignore the same Deity that your Kaldorei and a sect of your Zandalari cousins were both drawing power and Natural Magic from...\n\nAnd people wonder why I hate the Haranir....",
            date = "2026-07-12T20:54:07-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90095#comments:id=6381150",
        },
