        {
            id = 6292645,
            score = 3,
            author = "Elyrien",
            text = "Almost impossible to see until you're right on top of her. Additionally, she's not IN Dreth'mar Cavern, she's just outside the entrance. Strangely, the game doesn't seem to do the usual thing of marking the NPC with the yellow/grey circle to indicate the person you need to find.\n\nFor people without co-ords: the waterfall and the little covered bridge will be to your right as you face the cliffs. When you're facing the enormous mushroom, fly up one level directly behind it (not to the top of the mountain, about halfway up the mushroom) and you should see Kuri right in front of you.",
            date = "2026-02-28T02:49:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90469#comments:id=6292645",
