        },
        {
            id = 6294829,
            score = 10,
            author = "Tharama",
            text = "I asked a friend who was already on their second character and they said they weren't getting any https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826s on their alt toons until after they'd completed the questline starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90467/https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90468 and ending with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90474.\n\nTo test this, I got on an alt I went to the Grudge Pit delve and killed the first room over and over about 6 times and did not receive any https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826s.\n\nI then went and finished the questline and again got no Mysterious Skyshards along the way. I got another 5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826s from finishing the quest chain which is nice btw.\n\nI then went back to the Grudge Pit, pulled the first room 6 times again and got a https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826 on each run.\n\nConclusion: I was either very unlucky before I completed the questline or completing the questline on each character is required for https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826s to drop. I am gunna lean towards the latter and doing the questline first thing on every single alt I have do anything in Harandar.",
            date = "2026-03-01T21:07:57-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90474#comments:id=6294829",
        },
        {
