            score = 7,
            author = "eldiin",
            text = "I was hoping for a bit of actual lore, but it seems these stories are just fluff. When they tell their stories, there's a beginning, middle, and end and seems like each part has a pool that it pulls from making it very possible for the stories have similar parts, but with 1 or 2 parts different. These are the ones I got. You can see bullet point 2 and 4 has the beginning and middle the same, but the end is different. And bullet point 5 and 7 have the same beginning, but different middles and ends.\n\nA dense mist had covered de forest... Elemental giants tore through de forest! De Witherbark defended their home proudly.\nDe heat of summer was at its peak when... A raging dragonhawk rained chaos down on de village. It came at great cost, but de Witherbark triumphed.\nIt was in de temple city of Atal'Aman... A vengeful elf stole an artifact of terrible power. And no Witherbark can forget dat fateful day.\nDe heat of summer was at its peak when... A raging dragonhawk rained chaos down on de village. And no Witherbark can forget dat fateful day.\nIt was in de aftermath of war... Elemental giants tore through de forest! De Witherbark were outnumbered, but dat's just how we like it. We survived by de skin of our tusks.\nIt began at de peak of a mountain... A bear de size of a mammoth attacked! It was a simple matter for de fierce Witherbark.\nIt was in de aftermath of war... Countless murlocs besieged de Witherbark! And no Witherbark can forget dat fateful day.",
            date = "2026-03-01T00:47:27-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90483#comments:id=6293747",
        },
        {
            id = 6331011,
            score = 3,
            author = "yanna",
            text = "This quest is not intuitive. You need to walk up to the witherbark visitors (trolls), click on them to talk to them. Once they start to tell you their story they will fight you. Do that to 5 trolls and bam you're done.",
            date = "2026-04-15T01:25:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90483#comments:id=6331011",
        },
        {
            id = 6299627,
            score = 1,
            author = "LovelyGabby",
            text = "This quest to me is the pinnacle of todays WoW quest design. The trolls have to fight you when telling stories, not because that makes sense in any way but because if they didn't the quest would be too fast and we have a designated ammount of quests where you have to fight stuff.\n\nIt doesen't make sense. The stories are just cobbled together from three random lines giving you no lore or flavour.",
            date = "2026-03-06T06:26:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90483#comments:id=6299627",
        },
        {
