        {
            id = 6293657,
            score = 29,
            author = "Aerynsun8449",
            text = "Ok, what exactly are we suppose to do to \"scout\" the Devouring Citadel? I sat at the marker for roughly 5 minutes. Nothing happened, nothing changed. I traveled around, nothing happened nothing changed. I don't have a quest item to use to scout the area. Someone stated the 2nd location is up above... well, how do you complete the first location?\n\nThere should be more information in the quest dialog as to what we're suppose to do. If it wasn't for the fact this is a campaign quest, I'd abandon it and move on. But. . .\n\nEdit: I just need to open my eyes. There are abilities on my primary bar while directing Ciphus. Ability 1 is Scry, which when I pressed that, completed the first location. Duh. Sometimes I feel like a clone.",
            date = "2026-02-28T22:23:31-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90571#comments:id=6293657",
        },
        {
            id = 6297949,
            score = 15,
            author = "motogoosy",
            text = "Don't go inside the building. Just keep flying in the direction you started but fly above the buildings looking for the scrying areas (button 1 when you reach them)",
            date = "2026-03-04T19:01:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90571#comments:id=6297949",
        },
        {
            id = 6295267,
            score = 12,
            author = "danegeld",
            text = "use the scry button to do your thing...when you need to do the 2nd location keep jumping and fly above the building to reach it.  annoying vauge quest is annoying.",
            date = "2026-03-02T10:46:35-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90571#comments:id=6295267",
        },
        {
