        {
            id = 6292170,
            score = 20,
            author = "Malcorne",
            text = "If some of the mobs are bugged, you need to try to move to another shard. You can do this in several ways:\n\nJoin another group that is in the same zone\nSwitch Warmode on or off\nDo instanced content (delve, dungeon, ...) and come back after doing it\n\nYou're not guaranteed to actually move to another shard and even if you do, the mobs might be bugged in the new shard, but that can help.",
            date = "2026-02-27T17:31:34-06:00",
