        {
            id = 6301916,
            score = 19,
            author = "Hieronymuski",
            text = "Great job on this quest, Blizzard.\n\nCan't complete because of party poopers.",
            date = "2026-03-08T18:34:19-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620#comments:id=6301916",
        },
        {
            id = 6299766,
            score = 14,
            author = "NeilFawkes",
            text = "If you pick your own name in the previous quest The Most Important Thing (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91270/the-most-important-thing) (i. e. Fungal Fellowship), Boletus won't like the team name and the quest text will be slightly different:\n\nFungus... Fellows? Weird name. Who chose?\nDon't worry about. Ok, ready?\nYou and the Fungus Fellows head on down, and we say words.\nYou fight Spore Storm. If beat, fight Cap Clash.\nIf beat, fight Fungus Force.\nAlways-winners are Glow Guard. You won't beat.\nNo run out! Run out is big, big lose.",
            date = "2026-03-06T09:38:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620#comments:id=6299766",
        },
        {
            id = 6301255,
            score = 6,
            author = "brett1337",
            text = "Talking to Motta is listed as optional in the quest. After killing far too many waves, I realized it was not optional. If there are a bunch of gold farmers spamming, I just nature swiftness chain lightninged one single pack, so I think maybe you only need 1 pack tagged to get credit.",
            date = "2026-03-07T20:14:41-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620#comments:id=6301255",
        },
        {
            id = 6318740,
            score = 3,
            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "In https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91270, you can choose between 4 options for your team's name:\n1) The Ringcaps (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=257287's choice)\n2) The Puffguard https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251715's choice)\n3) The Sporesworn (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251723's choice)\n4) The Fungal Fellowship (presumably, your character's choice)\n\nIf you choose \"The Ringcaps\", https://www.wowhead.com/npc=257287 will say:\nRingcaps was choice. Caps are best part of us!\n\nIf you choose \"The Puffguard\", https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251715 will say:\nPuffguard, most good choice that could be, !\n\nIf you choose \"The Sporesworn\", https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251723 will say:\nSporesworn is good name. Will help us try most hard. We sworn now.\n\nNobody says anything when you choose Option 4, \"The Fungal Fellowship\". No emotes, either. :(\n\nFor the first 3 choices: When you go to turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251715, in the quest text box he will say:\nRingcaps / Puffguard / Sporesworn, perfect! Was best name.\n\nNow we ready.\n\nWill run into pit together, shout the Ringcaps / Puffguard / Sporesworn, eh...\n\nCrowd will cheer, then will be new champions!\n\nFor Option 4: When you go to turn in the quest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=251715, in the quest text box he will say:\nFungal Fell...owship, ok. Now we ready.\n\nWill run into pit together, shout the Fungal Fello...sip, eh...\n\nCrowd will cheer, then will be new champions!\n\nAlso, if you chose Option 4, the next quest's text will be a bit different, too:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=243226, in the quest text box for https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620, says:\nFungus... Fellows? Weird name. Who chose?\n\nDon't worry about. Ok, ready?\n\nYou and Fungus Fellows head on down, and we say words.\n\nIf you chose any of the first 3 options, this part of the quest text when accepting https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620 will read:\nRingcaps / Puffguard / Sporesworn? Not bad. I like!\n\nYou and the Ringcaps / Puffguard / Sporesworn head on down, and we say words.\n\nAfter accepting https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620, if you chose \"The Fungal Fellowship\", the spectators will have things to say, too!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=243179 says:\nTeam has a name now.\n\nBut Motta... isn't sure. What is Fungly Follows Hip?\n\nHard to yell that name when in Pit. Could have kept being \"'s team\". Would be easier for yell.\n\nStill, Motta will yell.\n\nOnce you run into The Pit, your team will attempt to yell the correct name:\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=257287 yells: The Fungal Fellosh!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=251715 yells: The Fungus Falls!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=251723 yells: The Fungal Fellowship!\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=251723 yells: You will get right next time. Is hard name.\n\n(I would include what https://www.wowhead.com/npc=243179 says --and what your team yells as they enter The Pit-- if you chose any of the first 3 options, but since we can't redo quests, I can't do that until I hop on another character, which will be quite some time.)",
            date = "2026-03-28T00:49:49-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90620#comments:id=6318740",
        },
    },
