            id = 6366431,
            score = 15,
            author = "Soilbreaker1993",
            text = "*UPDATE - Midnight 12.1*: Quest now opened up as available.\n\nI have finished all relics on my account, and when doing on my main I've done atleast 3 weeks worth of relics - but the problem is I do not recall which ones I have done on my main, and which I haven't on my main - I suppose I neeed to complete three individual relics, without knowing which?\n\nI reported the bug, but I still really would like a script to see which I have done on my main and which I havent\n\nPerhaps this can help someone else, in order left to right:\n\nWey'nan's ward: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88993))\nThe Cauldron of Echoes: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88994))\nThe Echoless Flame: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88996))\nRossula's Outreach: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88997))\nAln'hara's Bloom: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88995))\nRoot of the World: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88998))\nSky's Hope: /run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(88999))\n\nRunning the scripts I can see I have done the same atleast a few times on my main, but now I know which ones I should complete.\n\nUPDATE as of July 2026: I have done the 7 individual relics on my main, still this quest remains unavailable.\nI have started completing weekly \"blue quests\" from the end beginning again - will let you know if I some day get the quest.\nBlizzard seem unable to help, and just keeps saying I need to submit a bug report.\nDid anyone get this quest, by doing the full Harandar campaign on another character, or how do I get this done?",
