            text = "Sitting for an hour, watching the 18 damage toons gather quickly and rarely drop, while healers waiver between 3/ and 5/5, and tanks... 1/2 forever. Until finally, a seemingly vanishingly rare tank joins and we can all finally get through a pointless raid for a storyline that could have been a follower dungeon or story mode. I don't know exactly what the threshold for expressions of dissatisfaction is before Blizzard stops doing this kind of thing, but I for one have Mcfriggin' had it with these.",
