            author = "Voxxel",
            text = "If you're missing quest mobs in the Cleft as a demon hunter, you may notice that Orgrimmar is in a different phase where most townspeople are gathering in front of Grommash Hold.\n\nAfter you walked through from the Dornogal portal to Org. and leave the portal room, you may find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=97296 at the entrance corridor of Orgrimmar offering the quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40976. This quest led me outside of Orgrimmar's gate (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=40982) where I finished the 2-3 outside quests and the quest mobs in the Cleft were finally visible when I returned to the Cleft.",
            date = "2026-01-28T05:41:39-06:00",
