            text = "There is a different dialogue for any shadow/void users (shadow priests, warlocks, devourer demon hunters):\n\nThe cult of twilight has long been dedicated to ending Azeroth. That they ally with Xal'atath is no surprise.\nIf the Twilight's Blade are indoctrinating citizens, we must stop them. Scour the Cleft of Shadows for cultists and end any you may find.\nThe cult's rhetoric may appeal to you. Save your fraternizing with the Void for after we have destroyed Xal'atath and her Twilight's Blade.",
