            author = "KingsTears",
            text = "Did this 3 times easily taking a couple of city quests at a time, then suddenly lost track of what I was about leveling another alt with 4 quests all in this area.  My notes in case I fill my map with too many quest points again:\nIn Murder Row (lower level):\n\nStained Worker's Shirt: Pile of rags by the Murder Row Meeting stone\nBlackened Metal Fragment: Concealed crate at the back of a street market stall\nHandwritten List: Book on the center right side table in Silvery Serenades shop\n\nAbove Murder Row (upper level):\n\nDrained Wyrm Core: Mislaid bag on platform that juts out over Murder Row\nBottled Fel Dust: Green bottle on the floor back of the street market stall on above murder row. Can be seen easily while picking up the Drained Wyrm Core in the Mislaid Bag",
