    [90838] = {
        {
            id = 6322809,
            score = 18,
            author = "SongOfTheVoid",
            text = "This quest is a breadcrumb quest to https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90845 (Questline [storyline=6014]), and if you can't see the NPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244490 to offer this (even though the marker is on your map) at The Howling Ridge:\nYOU CAN SKIP THIS QUEST, and just go directly to the NPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244499 at Ethereum Overcroft ( /way #2405 44.6 68.6 Kifaan at Ethereum Overcroft ).\n\nSkipping this breadcrumb quest will still make the questline to count towards https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61864 (it did at least for me).\n\n----\n\nI was able to pick this breadcrumb quest on my main who had completed the main campaign fully, but on my alt, who hasn't done the main campaign, I am not able to see the NPC to pick the quest at the Howling Ridge.\nBUT on my alt I was able to just go directly to Ethereum Overcroft and pick the next quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90845 just fine and I completed the questline on the said alt and it counted towards the achievement, and the breadcrumb quest was also removed from my map.",
