        {
            id = 6292942,
            score = 39,
            author = "Chasavaqe",
            text = "This quest has unique text for draenei. Main quest text:\n\nWe'll get over it. Besides, my other theory required Juras and I getting into a fist-fight.\n\nNow, you do the same to the others. The violent energies will power the portal, but attuning it will be a separate matter. When you're done here, meet me on the domanaar rise above. With you here, we can finally take what we need.\n\nEnding quest text:\n\nThis hellish place... I was kept here for weeks before I slipped my restraints. There are far more of our kin here than when last I chanced a visit.\n\nNow, we save our brothers and sisters. And kill these monsters..",
            date = "2026-02-28T10:15:17-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90872#comments:id=6292942",
