            author = "camerynmaru",
            text = "This quest \"These Violent Delights\" and their companion quest \"Their Violent Ends\" are an homage to the HBO series Westworld, where the phrase \"these violent delights have violent ends\" was a big part of the narrative during the first season.  Very cool.",
