            text = "To obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=256424 mount, you need to collect 500 No https://www.wowhead.com/item=255826, with which you can cast https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1259475 and obtain the achievement https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61706.\n\nTo unlock these you need to do the questline starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90467, which is given by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=242358, at /way 67.78 24.79. She is not inside a building or cave.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/npc=242358 won't offer you the quest until you've completed the brief quest chain starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91063 which is offered by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=245637.\n\nTomTom Coordinates:\n/way #2413 67.78 24.79 Kuri - questgiver for Tales of the Sky\n\nNote that when doing the next quest chain, which starts with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91063, when you reach https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91088, the NPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=245637 is in a cave behind a waterfall - it's not easy to find the correct entrance, but it's at 55.82 26.08.\n\n/way #2413 55.82 26.08 Entrance to Su'Meera's cave for quest \"Behind The Falls\"",
