    [91068] = {
        {
            id = 6187920,
            score = 27,
            author = "Illidana",
            text = "The reveler will have a very faint pretzel icon above its head. If it doesn't have the pretzel,, you can't serve it.",
            date = "2025-09-23T18:48:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91068#comments:id=6187920",
        },
        {
            id = 6187803,
            score = 24,
            author = "Qwagsoir",
            text = "Why am I serving a night elf in Durotar",
            date = "2025-09-23T15:34:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91068#comments:id=6187803",
        },
        {
            id = 6188484,
            score = 18,
            author = "musicita",
            text = "Honestly these new quests to seem to be poorly designed with how I'm running to Wowhead to keep checking \"what am I supposed to be doing?\"\n\nI don't see any indicators or pretzels or whatever to show who I'm supposed to be serving.\n\nedit: okay I abandoned the quest and tried again and the pretzel icon is TRANSLUCENT and the SAME COLOR AS THE GROUND in Durotar.  No wonder I did not see it!  And I couldn't remember who the customer was because there'd been a boss fight after I talked to him.  There's other NPCs complaining about wanting pretzels so I wasn't sure who to go to.   It was a night elf guy.",
            date = "2025-09-24T19:13:38-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91068#comments:id=6188484",
        },
        {
            id = 6190026,
            score = 15,
            author = "lynchsta",
            text = "The pretzel that you will need is the one that you made in the previous quest chain, it is sitting on the table directly behind Gorgrum Kegfist.  Just click on it and it will appear on your serving tray.\n\nDO NOT BUY ONE FROM THE VENDOR, it is the wrong pretzel.\n\nLeaving this here so as to help others unfamiliar with the quest to not waste the ridiculous amount of time that I did (see my time-waste log below).\n\n-##-##-##\n\nI have tried pretty much everything imaginable to complete this quest, but I cannot.\n\nI can take the order.  I can buy a pretzel from the vendor. I can even buy a stack of pretzels.  Woot? Nope, no \"woot\".\n\nThe pretzel stays in my bag and never ends up on my serving tray.  I have watched other people start and complete the quest, I can even see the pretzel on their tray, but it does not work for me.\n\nTroubleshooting:\n- drop the quest, start over -> same result\n- disable auto-complete addons / reload UI -> same result\n- log out and log back in -> same result.\n- close out WoW completely, bring it up from scratch - same result\n- walked out of the Brewfest grounds, waited a moment, then came back -> same result\n- hearthed back to Org, flew back out to Brewfest grounds -> same result\n- waited a day, came back the following day -> same result\n\n- disable ALL addons. Exit out of game. Start from scratch. Drop existing quest, Start quest from scratch. Talk to \"Brewfest Reveler\". Take her order. Pretzel is showing over her head as well as there being a pretzel icon showing as a \"buff\" under her portrait.  Go buy yet another pretzel.  ---> same exact result.  No pretzel on tray. No way to talk to her and/or deliver it.\n\nWhat gods of wow do I need to bow down to to finish this silly, holiday quest chain?",
            date = "2025-09-28T15:46:53-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91068#comments:id=6190026",
        },
        {
            id = 6189945,
            score = 7,
            author = "Nerdelbaum",
            text = "If the correct reveler doesn't spawn at all, abandon the quest, relog and take it again. Worked for me that way.",
            date = "2025-09-28T11:25:02-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91068#comments:id=6189945",
        },
    },
