            score = 21,
            author = "Jeolene",
            text = "All that build up for some epic reporting, possibly followed up with a reprimand.\n\nAnd... nothing.\n\nI turned in the quest and absolutely nothing.  No dialogue, no movie, no cut scene... just NOTHING.\n\nWe just finished an epic quest to reunite the Amani with their loa, which in turn could be seen as a threat to Eversong, but destroying the Twilight's Blade from flanking Silvermoon should at least be something worthy of noting, and Liadrin wanting to stay behind to help the Amani further should be even more worrying for Lor'themar.  And yet, nothing.\n\nJust how lazy are you, blizz?",
