        {
            id = 6373460,
            score = 1,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=61957 Achievement. To reach it you must Finish 17 StoryLines in Eversong Woods. This Achievement is a part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62110.\n\nSee My Full Video with all StoryLine in one and maps for this Achievement - \009https://youtu.be/Aiv9Boq8L-I\n\nStart Location For All Storylines:\n\n1. Fear and Fel /way #2393 55.94 63.66,\n2. Sunbath, Take Me Away /way #2395 48.73 76.72,\n3. Lesser Evil /way #2393 54.58 61.55,\n4. Far Striding high platform /way #2395 45.27 45.83,\n5. Blinding Sun /way #2395 50.54 78.19,\n6. Paladin Rescue In City /way #2393 53.15 69.32,\n7. Scootin' Through Silvermoon in City /way #2393 35.80 69.06,\n8. The Drinking Debt in City /way #2393 57.76 68.94,\n9. Daggerspine Landing /way #2395 37.30 73.90,\n10. Flowers for Amalthea /way #2395 37.51 72.52,\n11. Port Detective /way #2395 46.94 45.19,\n12. One Adventurous Hatchling /way #2395 56.81 35.55,\n13. Tailor Troubles in City /way #2393 48.33 54.54,\n14. Runestone Rumbles /way #2395 50.15 34.25,\n15. How to Train Your Protegee /way #2395 42.59 14.62,\n16. Aspiring Academic /way #2395 39.46 17.43,\n17. Theft Tracking /way #2395 41.10 38.45,\n\n.\n[table border=\"7\" width=90%  ]\n\009\009[tr][td align=center] StoryLine[/td]                         [td align=center]Quests and Description[/td]       [td align=center]Start Location[/td] [/tr]\n\n[tr][td align=Left]\0091. [storyline=5931]\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009\"1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90835 - Fly Up to /way #2393 51.61 64.39, to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244440\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90818 - Fly down to 3 locations and use extra skill poping up when you will stand in shining circle:\n/way #2393 52.26 60.62 Ground,\n/way #2393 52.40 63.53 Up,\n/way #2393 51.36 57.12 Up,\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90837 - You need to interact with 5 items just press on them:\n/way #2393 51.97 60.86,\n/way #2393 54.86 61.16,\n/way #2393 52.15 55.95 up,\n/way #2393 50.57 58.09 up,\n/way #2393 51.05 56.25 inside bulding.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90819 - Pick Up next to Quest giver https://www.wowhead.com/item=244407 then Speak with 3 NPC:\n/way #2393 53.07 52.83 ground,\n/way #2393 56.38 48.53 ground inside bulding,\n/way #2393 50.69 48.01 ground inside bulding,\nThen Go /way #2393 56.20 54.29 get inside bulding and speak with NPC Vira then pick up from crate behind Her https://www.wowhead.com/item=244528.\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90821 - Fly to docks to see Belath then speak with dockmaster on ship then Slay Him, That will finish Storyline but will open for You Dungeon Quest\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90822 - Do Dungeon [zone=16091] on any difficult.\"\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009https://www.wowhead.com/npc=244493 /way #2393 55.94 63.66,\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n[tr][td align=Left]\0092. [storyline=5949]\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009\"1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91271 - You need to Catch 4 fish, every time y Catch fish speak with NPC then go Catch next one, Spots have defferent color if not in place just wait for spawn:\n/way #2395 49.77 75.12, - https://www.wowhead.com/item=246379\n/way #2395 49.23 76.22, - https://www.wowhead.com/item=246380\n/way #2395 48.75 75.31, - https://www.wowhead.com/item=246381\n/way #2395 48.66 75.93, - https://www.wowhead.com/item=246382\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91090 - Slay 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246574 around camp and flown off 10 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246679 - use fly mount to fly them thru.\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91328 - Quest will show up with deley - Pick up from ground herbs 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=246364 and 5 https://www.wowhead.com/item=246363.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91137 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=245942 /way 50.16 74.01, That will finish Storyline and You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=2