            text = "Hi all\n\nOn This WQ You need to:\n\nSee My Video if need it with all 5 quests and full WQ - https://youtu.be/g_AaTt1nLLU\n\n1. Fly to area where is WQ then You need to do 3 quests ont this area ( 5 will be able to pick )\n\n2. Do minimum 3 Quests:\n\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91401 - /way #2437 28.50 76.83, on top on tower - In This Quest You need to: Collect 20 https://www.wowhead.com/item=246440 drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246619 or https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246620\n\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91400 - /way #2437 22.43 79.67, next to tree - In This Quest You need to: You need to pick up from ground 12 https://www.wowhead.com/object=555573.\n\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91399 - /way #2437 22.75 73.13, on a hill - In This Quest You need to: Loot 50 https://www.wowhead.com/item=246439 from Void creatures.\n\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91402 - /way #2437 25.41 74.58, next to steps - In This Quest You need to: Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246916 /way #2437 25.35 77.58\n\n- https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91398 - /way #2437 27.37 72.56, next to tree - In This Quest You need to: Loot 4 https://www.wowhead.com/item=246436, they drop from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=246617 is a lot of them in this area.\n\nAfter Finish 3 Quests You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=260193, when i open i get 237 ilvl item\n\nHope that help You :).",
