            author = "DaemoniKira",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/npc=247503:\nThe naga have a history of abusing arcane magic. I bet my boots this is no different--arcane is their lifeblood and source of power.\n\nUmmmm... hold up... didn't the Blood Elves have the exact same issue? Wasn't that, like... a whole thing? Hence the Sunwell?\n\nAnd this is a Blood Elf saying this nonsense?\n\nWhat the actual f--",
