            id = 6306620,
            score = 38,
            author = "jeian7",
            text = "You know, I thought Astre seemed awfully attached to Hieron, but I put it out of my mind when he they first referenced that the letter was for \"her.\"\n\nIt didn't click with me until Sedona said \"Did he also wake you to thistle tea?\" that Hieron and Astre ended up together after Hieron took up the Void.\n\nedit: As a follow-up, I went back to visit Sedona later, and she referred to Astre as \"he - sorry, they\".\n\nVery nice quest that shows some of the more everyday/realistic sides of life in chaos that is Azeroth.",
            date = "2026-03-13T22:46:27-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91546#comments:id=6306620",
        },
