            score = 7,
            author = "Nordrassil1",
            text = "I tried 3 of options for the tea - notably not drinking it will cause the image of yourself to NOT spawn.\nI chose \"nothing, I have mastered my emotions,\" regret, and not drinking the tea. An image of yourself appears and you can say a bunch of stuff to it, I'm guessing most of these options won't change what happens. Attempt #3 on the quest and I picked all of the options, relogged and reloaded and the image eventually just disappeared.\n\nI saw another player pick something and the player and image bowed to each other, I'm assuming \"damn I look good\" was the choice there (I had picked that earlier and only recall the image bowing but I'm guessing my character did too.\n\nEDIT: You get a letter in the mail from Riftblade Astre and some tea. If you return to Sedona Duskspire after the quest chain - you can read the letter on her bed and speak with her, and purchase more tea from her.",
            date = "2026-03-14T11:47:21-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91546#comments:id=6307050",
