        {
            id = 6294960,
            score = 3,
            author = "Aerynsun8449",
            text = "This has nothing to do with how the quest works, or anything like that. And I don't mean to be the grammar police here, but seriously. Doesn't anyone in the dev team know anything about anatomy? You can't \"tighten\" your fist around anything. You can tighten your hand around your weapon. You can tighten your fist. But you can't, as the text of this quests states, \"Ziadan tightens her fist around her weapon.\" It is not physically possible to wrap your fist round anything that would enable you to tighten it. It should read, \"Ziadan tightens her hand around her weapon.\" Or, \"Ziadan tightens her grip around her weapon.\"\n\nI'm sure people will down vote this, as if it were an assault on them. No, it's just a note for the dev team (if they read these things, IDK if they do) to maybe think before they write something that's just not physically possible to do. It breaks the immersion in the game.",
            date = "2026-03-02T01:01:42-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91600#comments:id=6294960",
        },
    },
