        {
            id = 6299511,
            score = 11,
            author = "Johasne",
            text = "There is a bug that makes this quest impossible to finish. If you hand in the tokens to the nearby NPCs before starting the quest, you can get soft-locked. Because the NPCs only accept the tokens once, the quest does not count tokens that were already given to them before the quest began.\n\nUpdate: It is fixed after every reset. If you go to the NPC who gives the quest, you should be able to pick up a new quest that gives you 3 new tokens. That worked for me. Just make sure you have the quest The Subtle Game active when you give the tokens to the NPCs",
            date = "2026-03-06T02:26:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91693#comments:id=6299511",
        },
        {
            id = 6304687,
            score = 10,
            author = "Kazumi0815",
            text = "I found the solution. After the weekly reset I had no quests in my log.\n\nLord Saltheril offers two quests — you must accept both:\n\nThe Subtle Game\n\nWeekly Quest – choose a faction and receive 3 Saltheril’s Favors\n\nChoose a faction (e.g. Blood Knights) → receive 3 Favors.\nTurn the 3 Favors in at the factions to unlock a quest.\n\nThen return to Lord Saltheril and complete The Subtle Game.\nThis unlocks the 246 helmet quest.\n\nFly to the runestone, activate it, then return and collect the helmet.",
            date = "2026-03-12T08:01:06-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91693#comments:id=6304687",
        },
