            text = "So far the coolest moment in the expansion. Being aware of the lore here, it was really cool to see this moment depicted in-game using WoW's modern assets! Young Turalyon looked badass.\n\nBut yes, there is a slight continuity error. The \"height of the Second War,\" specifically the events shown here, took place in 6 ADP (After Dark Portal). Midnight is said to take place after 43 ADP (perhaps 44?), so Kurdran's \"nearly thirty years ago\" doesn't add up as that would put us around 14 ADP instead.\n\nBut he's only off by eight years, and he's getting old... so maybe we can forgive him for getting it a bit wrong.",
            date = "2026-04-17T02:58:33-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91726#comments:id=6332516",
        },
