        {
            id = 6306623,
            score = 15,
            author = "wakalao",
            text = "Doing this quetline as a Horde character feels... awkward at best, and honestly sad. I initially thought this would be the chance for Horde characters to acknowledge the elephant in the room when it comes to the Haranir and the Burning of Teldrassil, especially when the Haranir that we help throughout this questline, Teldrassil's former warden Hagar, is the one that brings up the Haranir from the roots and to the surface for them to join both factions.\n\nI mean, sure, a huge portion if not most of the Horde playerbase never liked that it was our faction who actually burned it, and like my character we betrayed Sylvanas and served as Varok's spy as soon as we were able to, but even if my character didn't actually burn the tree, I was still there during the BfA pre-expansion event, it really feels like there should be a moment to acknowledge this with the Haranir or at least with Hagar.",
            date = "2026-03-13T22:51:28-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=91876#comments:id=6306623",
