            id = 6292264,
            score = 7,
            author = "Hollyleaves",
            text = "You would pick this quest up at around 37,72 (just northwest of the Windrunner Spire dungeon, in Eversong Woods) but bear in mind if you can't see the questgiver yet it's because you need to further yourself along in the campaign first. I was at level 83 and couldn't find it until I got through more of my campaign, and later picked it up, still at level 83.\n\nWhile getting Sojourner, know that campaign progress is needed as is level requirements. Paladin Rescue for example requires level 90.",
