w.wowhead.com/quest=88977 - Use https://www.wowhead.com/item=238730 you get, then move to 3 frozen moments and press on them:\n/way 41.15 39.12,\n/way 40.34 38.75,\n/way 39.68 38.85,\nWhen return Quest just wait few sec and move /way 38.53 39.59, to pick up next Quest.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88979 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=240416 then pick up from ground book https://www.wowhead.com/item=241192 /way 38.08 39.19,\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=90544 - Follow Luma, when You get to end them speak with dog ... and after few sec You will be able to finish quest, That will finish Storyline and You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=262999\"\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[tr][td align=Left]\009/way #2395 41.10 38.45, 2 NPC- 2 quests\009\009\009\009\009[/td]\009[/tr]\n\n[/table]\n.\nThank You i Hope that Help You",
