            text = "I thought getting to High Exarch Turalyon without flying would be impossible. In old expansions, when they first came out you couldn't fly and I thought that was the case here. But even though we don't have steady flight available until we get the achievement Midnight Pathfinder, we still have dragonflight available. Get into a flying mount and use dragonflight to fly up to the level above.",
