            id = 6294060,
            score = 194,
            author = "Tyleah",
            text = "Just coming from a Blizzard GM :\n\n\"Greetings\n\nThank you for reaching out about the “A More Potent Foe” quest chain, this includes the quest Truth of the Past, from Leona Darkstrider. I completely understand how confusing or frustrating it can be when a quest chain suddenly becomes unavailable, especially when you’re eager to continue the story.\n\nThis particular quest chain was designed to be time-gated as part of its intended progression. Because of that, Leona Darkstrider is not currently available to offer the chain, and this is working as designed.\n\nWe truly appreciate your patience while waiting for the next portion to become available. Please be sure to check back in the future, as additional quests and updates will unlock as the content progresses.\"\n\nSadge.",
            date = "2026-03-01T08:42:13-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92505#comments:id=6294060",
