        {
            id = 6243499,
            score = 12,
            author = "Hyrul",
            text = "This is the introductory quest to the [url guide=8040]Brawler's Guild. You need to go back to Stormwind, and head to the Deeprun Tram to talk to Pick Butterworth.\n\nIt'll then start the [quest=92851 domain=www] quest, which simply requires you to purchase the [item=254690 domain=www] (50g) so you can enter the Brawler's Guild.\n\nRewards the achievement [achievement=61413 domain=www]\n\n/way #84 66.5 34.8 Deeprun Tram Stormwind Entrance\n/way #499 52.2 46.3 Bizmo's Brawlpub Entrance",
            date = "2025-12-10T00:31:29-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92845#comments:id=6243499",
        },
        {
            id = 6271986,
            score = 8,
            author = "Quovella",
            text = "How to Access Bizmo’s Brawlpub via Deeprun Tram (Midnight Pre-Patch)\n\nWith the new patch leading into the Midnight expansion, Deeprun Tram now provides access to Bizmo’s Brawlpub, an active Brawler’s Guild-style location filled with NPCs where players can brawl for fame.\n\nGetting There\n\nEnter the Deeprun Tram from either Stormwind or Ironforge.\nMove forward until you reach the first main platform (before boarding the train).\nFace down the tracks and look slightly to the left side of the platform.\nLook for a blinking red light along the wall beside the track.\nCarefully jump down near the red light.\nFollow the lower tunnel path forward.\nYou will arrive at Bizmo’s Brawlpub.\nStarting Brawling Content\nOnce inside Bizmo’s Brawlpub, locate and speak to Bizmo’s Brawlpub Bouncer.\nChoose: “Yes, sign me up for a fight!”\nThis unlocks the quest The Gloves Are Off, which begins your Brawl progression.\n\nNotes:\nNo special class abilities required.\nArea contains multiple NPCs, vendors, and Brawl enthusiasts.\nIf you fall while attempting the jump, simply run back to the platform and try again.\n\nEnjoy the fights",
            date = "2026-01-28T12:57:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92845#comments:id=6271986",
        },
        {
