            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You a Storyline [storyline=6050] that is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62413 Achievement. That Storyline start from 08.07.2026.\n\nPlease See My Video with all Quests from this storyline if Need It - https://youtu.be/RQOBTTFu56Y\n\nAll Quests from [storyline=6050]:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92897 - Press on Adventure Guide Shift-J -> Suggested content -> and 'Accept Quest' call [storyline=6050] for storyline to star. Or You can skipp this and go from 2nd quest xD.\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92895 - Go to [zone=15355] and in main base speak with Orweyna /way 44.11 53.53 inside cave,\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92899 - speak with 6 delegates:\n/way 42.15 48.95,\n/way 42.65 43.11,\n/way 45.56 44.15,\n/way 49.82 41.69,\n/way 48.40 54.45,\n/way 44.39 57.00,\nThen speak with Quest giver and Movie will start. After You finish this Quest You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=246731 NICE :D\n4. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92900 - Speak with NPCs: /way 44.39 48.03 and /way 49.33 42.11 and/or just with /way 54.44 52.49, After that fly to /way 38.79 46.77,\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92901 - First press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=255234 /way 37.55 47.71, then slay mobs or heal injured untill 100%. Then go on circle and use skill from extra bar. then wait when will finish quest to get next one.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92904 - when accept quest w8 for portal then enter it.\n7. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92907 - search 3 boxes in order at first: /way 17.43 20.06, then /way 15.90 21.83, and last /way 19.41 17.20, after press on last one will come out https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253833 You need to caught it.\nThen Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=237301 and collect 2 tools: /way 14.51 18.68, and 2nd tool /way 19.48 19.37, then press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253833 to fix it.\n8. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92955 - Fly to crypt /way 39.19 39.02,\n9a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92957 - Collect 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=262654 from ground, You can find them: /way 37.99 36.98, /way 38.54 38.25, /way 37.77 37.88, /way 37.33 37.03, /way 36.90 37.83, /way 37.71 38.66,\n9b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92958 - Slay mobs inside crypt and loot from them 6 https://www.wowhead.com/item=262659 is around 33% drop rate or 25% xD.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92952 - Fly to 44.50 36.70\n12a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92953 - Slay 3 mobs and use on them bodies spell from extra bar. Location: /way 45.36 38.35 inside cottage, /way 46.50 37.95 inside cave, /way 46.47 41.06 inside\n12b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92951 - Pick up 8 https://www.wowhead.com/item=262752, You can find them on tables, inside buldings ect i a lot of them around.\n14. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92954 - You need to do Dungeon [zone=16395] Safe to do it from NPC side fast and ez, just w8 when conversation will finish and then speak with Zul'jan to start it.\nFrom 2nd boss pick up https://www.wowhead.com/item=262791 then slay last boss and get out from dungeon after finish.\n15. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93010 - Fly to Atal'Aman /way #2536 67.71 47.18,\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93011 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253858 then Speak to Kinduru - Movie will start.\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93012 - Fly to /way 43.78 68.34, and speak with Zul'jarra then:\n- pick up https://www.wowhead.com/object=628271 /way 43.61 68.35,\n- then on 3 circle next to fire use spell from extra bar.\nThat will finish Quest and You will get https://www.wowhead.com/item=268557. That is finishing Storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
