        {
            id = 6403628,
            score = 3,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You a Storyline [storyline=6231] that is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62297 Achievement.\n\nPlease See My Video with all Quests from this storyline if Need It - https://youtu.be/4ecMLhhsLO0\n\nAll Quests from [storyline=6231]:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92931 - First speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=259374 left from quest giver, then press https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253528  then one more time speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=259374, now speak with 3 npc:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253827 next to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253528,\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=258755 big turtle xD /way 57.37 48.87,\n- Press on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=254016 /way 57.52 47.72\nTo finish quest fly to /way 64.01 56.64\n2a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92932 - Slay 12 swamp beasts in the Whispering Marsh\n2b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92933 - At first aid https://www.wowhead.com/npc=256074 /way 64.68 59.23, under the root of a tree. Then freed 6 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253498 - press on them then sley to get count. Reward https://www.wowhead.com/item=279285.\nAfter return quest wait few sec.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92938 - investigate:\n- /way #2512 70.53 62.27 https://www.wowhead.com/object=584805\n- /way #2512 71.16 64.75 https://www.wowhead.com/object=586572\n- /way #2512 67.21 66.29 https://www.wowhead.com/object=586570\nThen fly to temple  /way #2512 70.29 65.81, and press on https://www.wowhead.com/object=655349 and wait to return quest.\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93063 - Slay mobs to loot from them 12 https://www.wowhead.com/item=260314.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93064 - First speak with quest giver You will be move in time, and transform.\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92935 - Use skill 1-2 to do damage, skill 3 will speed you up and reduce CD, skill 4 teleport in short distance, skill 5 heal You. Now Use skill 1-2 to slay mobs until 100%.\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92934 - You need to do:\n- Find 12 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=255799:\n/way #2512 68.05 64.53,\n/way #2512 68.28 63.41,\n/way #2512 68.63 62.69, as well speak with Jaz'di Wisemon\n/way #2512 70.43 62.44,\n/way #2512 67.99 66.67\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92936 - move on circle /way #2512 69.11 64.01, and use spell from extra bar movie will start and after video transformation will finish.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92937 - first speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253536 on right side from quest giver then conversation will start after move to /way #2512 69.07 64.04, and slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253536 then move back to village to finish storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
            date = "2026-08-21T02:49:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92931#comments:id=6403628",
        },
        {
            id = 6395223,
            score = 1,
            author = "wanus88",
            text = "Currently stuck on this quest.\n\nI accept the quest from Liadrin.\nI talk to Raz'taka and choose 'take the cure'\nI receive the item, but the quest is stuck on the 'take the cure' part.\nUsing the item I received does not progress the quest. Reloading/restarting the game did not help.\n\nAnyone else experienced this and if yes do you have a fix?",
            date = "2026-08-13T14:36:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92931#comments:id=6395223",
        },
    },
