        {
            id = 6414260,
            score = 2,
            author = "Sigery97",
            text = "Considering we know after the world soul saga, the world is going to get a soft reboot of sorts, I wonder if this will end up becoming relevant again? Akintunde technically exploded into spirit particles but that doesn't necessarily mean he's actually gone. Though he ended civilizations, not reset the worlds (probably at least). idk, very random thoughts.",
            date = "2026-09-11T02:58:10-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92948#comments:id=6414260",
        },
        {
            id = 6414688,
            score = 2,
            author = "BadrogueKek",
            text = "Very interesting questline, you learn a lot about this world.\n\nIt was named Predacea and it had incredible cities, then a war broke out. (Maybe Light or Void related ? not sure).\n\nAlso fit the midnight general vibes, you find a tablet talking about cities, life, war but there's nothing but void in front of your eyes.",
            date = "2026-09-12T13:15:48-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92948#comments:id=6414688",
        },
    },
