            text = "So I got lost in this quest and the next one. When you click Orweyna you phase into becoming the Witch Doctor girl.\n\nBefore I could speak to the NPCs with the quests though, I logged out for the day and the next day I was somewhere else completely forgetting I was phased. Well, I didn’t see any quest markers on the map and was stuck.\n\nI even went down to the Vault thinking that was my next chapter to complete the “Original Sin” quest line. It wasn’t.\n\nWhat I ended up doing is looking up these quest lines, typing in the command to see if I completed said quests, got to this one and it said ‘false’.  Had to talk to Orweyna again to re-phase back to the Witch Doctor girl.\n\nHope this helps someone out if they’re also lost",
