            text = "This quest is neat because it has a different way of scaring Kel'vujo depending on your class and spec.  Should have thought to switch to my other specs and see what they said.\n\n(Priest - Shadow)",
            date = "2026-02-28T22:04:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93096#comments:id=6293647",
        },
        {
            id = 6292351,
            score = 27,
            author = "gamer74123",
            text = "If you go right away and don't see Kel, just wait a minute :)",
            date = "2026-02-27T20:50:21-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93096#comments:id=6292351",
        },
        {
            id = 6301541,
            score = 27,
            author = "Nyxcera",
            text = "So...just a flesh wound with that spear in his chest? Got it!",
            date = "2026-03-08T09:56:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93096#comments:id=6301541",
        },
        {
            id = 6376319,
            score = 13,
            author = "Phlynch",
            text = "The dialog goes a little differently depending on your class.\n\nDeath Knight:\n\nKel'vujo yells: S-stay away from me!\nKel'vujo yells: I'm gonna send you to your next death!\n\nDemon Hunter:\n I may be \"blind\", but I see you intend to betray me.\n*\n\nDruid:\nNature itself will shield me from your betrayal!\nKel'vujo is entangled in roots for a few seconds\nKel'vujo yells: I'm not scared of you and your stupid trees!\n\nEvoker:\nI am one of the elite amongst the Dracthyr. Do you think you stand a chance?\nKel'vujo yells: Only thing I know about a dracthyr is that one's standin' in de way of my glory!\n\nHunter:\nGood luck fighting with your feet frozen to the ground.\nKel'vujo starts the fight in a Freezing Trap.\n\nMage:\nI have a polymorph spell for betrayals like this.\nKel'vujo is polymorphed for 10 seconds.\nKel'vujo yells: Baaaa!\nAfter the polymorph ends or is broken:\nKel'vujo yells: I won't be beaten by some book-lovin' mage!\n\nMonk:\nYour stance displays your traitorous intentions. Do you really wish to strike me?\n*\n\nPaladin:\n\nKel'vujo is stunned by Hammer of Justice.\nKel'vujo yells: Curse you and your Light!\n\nPriest:\nYou do not have to betray me. Turn away from this path.\nKel'vujo yells: Only one of us can get de glory, priest. And it's not you!\n\nShadow Priest:\n\nKel'vujo is feared for 3 seconds.\nKel'vujo yells: I thought priests were supposed ta be nicer than dis!\n\nRogue:\n\nKel'vujo yells: You can't hide from me!\nKel'vujo wanders around for a moment attempting to find you.\n\nShaman:\nThe elements themselves heed my call. Do you really want to attack me?\n*\n\nWarlock:\nI wouldn't cross someone who regularly tames demons, Kel'vujo.\n*\n\nWarrior:\nRaise your weapon, and I'll knock you into next week.\n*\n\n* Kel'vujo responds to Demon Hunters, Monks, Shaman, Warlocks, and Warriors all the same way:\n\nKel'vujo initially stays friendly and says:\nKel'vujo says: Uh... maybe you're right. Maybe I don't wanna be dealin' with someone like you.\n6 seconds after selecting the option, he turns hostile and yells:\nKel'vujo yells: No! Only one of us gets de glory, and it's gonna be me!",
            date = "2026-06-29T18:16:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93096#comments:id=6376319",
        },
    },
