        {
            id = 6296064,
            score = 4,
            author = "eldiin",
            text = "I realize there are at least 3 separate posts with different waypoints that related to different parts of this quest. Those posts reference either Part 2, Part 3, or Part 6 of my post below. The purpose of this post is to gather and display a collection of those posts into a single post.\n\nPart 1: Picking up the quest. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=254719 initially appears at /way #2437 52.29, 32.17. Accept the quest. She WILL disappear.\nPart 2: She can be found at  /way #2437 50.78, 31.42. Talk to her again. She will run off and disappear again.\nPart 3: She should show up as a yellow dot on your minimap. But, if for some reason, she doesn't show up as a yellow dot, head to /way #2437 51.48, 30.60.\nPart 4: Talk to her again to pick up some tasks to complete\nPart 5: Do the following tasks:\n\n6 Stinger Hatchling slain (these will be the yellow non-aggressive wasp-like mobs)\n4 Stinger Matriarch slain (these will be the aggressive wasp-like mobs)\n20 Thorncap picked (each mushroom you pick will give between 4 and 5 Thorncaps)\n\nPart 6: Once done, the quest marker will tell you to go back to the temple. Don't. Instead head back to where you last saw her /way #2437 51.48, 30.60.\n\nFrom there, everything is pretty straight forward.",
            date = "2026-03-03T01:18:25-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93180#comments:id=6296064",
        },
    },
