        {
            id = 6308572,
            score = 25,
            author = "Axxislex",
            text = "If you done the campaign on your main and you play an alt, you can pick up the quest in Eversong Woods  /way 50.78, 40.04. Its on the bridge on the left as you facing north.\nPS: if you don't see the yellow \"!\" that means you have deactivated the filter on your map \"Warband Completed Quests\".\nPSA: leveling your alts it is made easier by visiting all 4 quartermasters at lvl 81 because they each have a piece of item level 180 for you. Have fun!",
            date = "2026-03-16T07:33:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93372#comments:id=6308572",
        },
        {
            id = 6299637,
            score = 16,
            author = "mville",
            text = "Level 1 - Easy once you understand the mechanics.  Pick up a mirror and charge it with the  super lux focusing mirror.  Move the mirror around until it illuminates another mirror further into the delve, use the extra action button to drop the mirror and move on to the next mirror.  You can carry the mirror anywhere in the lighted area, so move it around until you can see another mirror. Continue deeper into the delve by using the mirrors to focus the light until you can illuminate the nexus, which is shown on your mini map as a gold ball marker.    It took me a bit of going back and forth to adjust the the mirrors.  It helped me to brighten my screen so I could  see the path.",
            date = "2026-03-06T06:49:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93372#comments:id=6299637",
        },
