        {
            id = 6310584,
            score = 8,
            author = "globalmenace",
            text = "It seems we can now pick up most of the Delver’s Call quests inside the delve itself. Sometimes it’s really not obvious, for example in the Atal'Aman delve the quest is on the corpse of a Fallen Amani Scout, and none of these quests shows the quest exclamation mark.\n\nThe only delve where I couldn’t find the Delver’s Call quest inside the delve, is Sunkiller Sanctum (Voidstorm). But probably I’m just blind 😉\n\nUpdate: In the meantime one of my alts has also found the Sunkiller Sanctum quest inside the delve. So it seems all can be picked up inside the delves. Not sure if I really was blind or if they added some later on inside 😉",
            date = "2026-03-18T07:33:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93409#comments:id=6310584",
        },
    },
