            text = "Ran the dungeon, got the dagger, but now you're at the quest giver and can't find it?\n\nThe dagger is sticking out of the ground about 10 yards in front of Zul'jarra.\n\nClick the dagger to begin healing Zul'jarra.\n\nClick it again to destroy the dagger (as it is too strong and is killing Zul'jarra).",
