            text = "Cant finish this quest, middle circle in silvermoon  Lorthemars stand there but cant do anything for the quest.\n\n(On this char i didnt run the prev. Season Storyline but this should not be a problem hopefully!\n\nAny tips?\n\nThanks\n\nMister",
