            author = "Spitonem",
            text = "If Lor'themar has the question mark for you but you are unable to complete the quest, it's likely you're still in a raid group. Leave and you should be able to complete.\nIf he does not have the question mark or any dialog options, continue the season 1 story line. I had to complete killing Lura and finishing Thalyssra's Arcway delve story quest which unlocked the Battle of the Bridge scenario. Completing the Battle of the Bridge will remove all the faction leaders from around the scouting map except for Lor'themar which will be there now able to complete this quest.",
