        {
            id = 6301565,
            score = 228,
            author = "ricepower",
            text = "There's a good chance that you focused on the main storyline on your main character and skipped all the side quests.  There's also a good chance that you saved the side quests for leveling alts.  Now, you've finished all the side quests on your alt, but still can't find the questgiver to start the 'Bloodstains' portion of the Sojourner of Zul'Aman achievement.  That's because the questgiver Zul'jarra won't appear until you advance the main storyline.\n\nTo get the 'Bloodstains' portion of the Sojourner of Zul'Aman achievement, simply log onto your character that completed the main storyline.  The quest will be available and since achievement progress is linked to your warband, you'll get the Sojourner of Zul'Aman achievement after finishing the quest series.",
