        {
            id = 6400756,
            score = 7,
            author = "RobberRobina",
            text = "Giving wisdom about Zul'jan is completely optional and doesn't affect the overall quest!\n\nOption 1: Your lenience toward Zul'jan will be seen as weakness.\nI know de justice of Zul'Aman and how we deal with traitors.\nIf he weren't my brother, I would take his head and paint my face with his blood for all he's done.\n\nBut he is my brother. And I'm de hash'ey. Anyone who wants Jan gotta come through me first.\n\nDamn it, Jan...\n\nI know why he's doin' it. I just...\n\nI'm de one who can knock some sense into him. I know there's a way.\n\nOption 2: I believe in Zul'jan too. We can stop this.\nDe moment I give up on Zul'jan, he'll be gone.\n\nI don't expect everyone to understand but I'm glad you do, .",
            date = "2026-08-16T23:28:45-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93454#comments:id=6400756",
        },
