            id = 6402395,
            score = 1,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You a Storyline [storyline=6031] that is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62297 Achievement.\n\nPlease See My Video with all Quests from this storyline if Need It - https://youtu.be/U_OUgldyodA\n\nAll Quests from [storyline=6230]:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93454 - Speak with Quest giver ( i pick 2nd option to skip conversation ) then move thru stairst in to the bulding.\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92925 - Fly to /way 47.48 73.55, and speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253514 then press on orb https://www.wowhead.com/npc=255284.\n3. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92927 - Press and follow Orbs, first to will spawn mob to slay, on last orb after You press on it move to doors to Crypt /way 45.37 75.92, and open them.\n4a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92928 - Investigate three chambers:\n/way 29.92 23.19 picture on wall\n/way 42.43 48.08 Urn\n/way 73.11 59.96 picture on wall\n4b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92929 - Slay mobs or press on https://www.wowhead.com/object=588904 until 100%.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92930 - You need to do in order:\n- Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253480 /way 45.14 77.59,\n- Press on picture on wall /way 26.87 75.44, then wait few secoud for portal from crypt.\n- Raturn Quest to Village, That quest is finishing Storyline\n\nHope That Help You :).",
            date = "2026-08-19T01:51:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93454#comments:id=6402395",
        },
