    [93525] = {
        {
            id = 6329396,
            score = 126,
            author = "kygirl2011",
            text = "No one mentioned that you have to do a tier 10 delve to enter that delve.",
            date = "2026-04-12T17:12:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93525#comments:id=6329396",
        },
        {
            id = 6313427,
            score = 90,
            author = "Aredhela",
            text = "In case it's not clear where this Delve Boss is... Torment's Rise Delve is in Voidstorm, slightly south east of The Howling Ridge, on the way to Obscurion Citadel.",
            date = "2026-03-21T09:14:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93525#comments:id=6313427",
        },
        {
            id = 6310241,
            score = 62,
            author = "Kraftee",
            text = "Completed at ilvl 240 Ele Sham as Stormbringer. Took about 6 minutes and 2 seconds. Use Valeera as your healer. I suppose you can use the strat with most dps classes, just replace your weaker cooldown in place of Stormkeeper and stronger cooldown in place of Ascendance.\n\n1. Use Stormkeeper at the opener, but do not use Lust or Ascendance yet. Use your normal rotation until he hits 75%. Just make sure to interrupt the AOE.\n\n2. At 75% he’ll stop attacking for around 30 seconds and spawn two bugs. Pop Ascendance and Stormkeeper (should be back up) to burn them down before he starts attacking again. If they aren't dead, finish them off quickly, then go back to the boss and keep interrupting the AOE.\n\n3. At 50% he spawns a bunch of small adds and stops attacking for another 30 seconds. Use Stormkeeper here to clear them out, this is probably the easiest part. Resume normal rotation and interrupts once he's active.\n\n4. At 25% he spawns an ogre and stops attacking for 30 seconds. This ogre hits hard with Shadowbolt. Now blow Lust, Stormkeeper, and Ascendance. You need to kill the ogre before the boss starts attacking again or it gets messy.\n\n5. After the ogre dies and Nullaeus starts back up, it’s pretty straightforward. Just stick to your rotation and survive until he's down.",
            date = "2026-03-17T21:32:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93525#comments:id=6310241",
        },
        {
            id = 6317545,
            score = 24,
            author = "Vulconar",
            text = "Did it with a Guardian Druid - Item LvL 230 - 8min 32 seconds\n\nMost important thing is that you adapt your class and your play style for your CDs. Because a lot of people say, last phase use your CDs\nfor me it was at 75% to burst them down.\n\nMore important even is, to focus on the interruption of the boss when he casts [spell=1256351 domain=www]\nMiss that 1 time in a critical moment and all is over.\n\n1. 75% put out my damage CDs out to kill them asap.\n2. 50% they spawn small minions where you get poisoned. Best you wait here with your CDs until you have 5-7 stacks to keep yourself alive.\n3. 25% the last caster, is not that hard. Go out of the violet areas, and focus the boss. He does not make that much damage.\n\nSkill i used for guardian: CgGA8cL7tpvige+kkmGM9zUPWDAAAAAAAAAAAgZmZml5BmZMWMLeg5BmZZZgZzMGNRzMziZmZmlxMAAAAAAMsNDYZbmBjZZAMFAAAYDz8ADYxMYwglNAzMAG",
            date = "2026-03-26T14:40:32-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93525#comments:id=6317545",
        },
        {
            id = 6338200,
            score = 13,
            author = "biggaz13",
            text = "Straightforward for a 252 Holy Priest:\n\n1. Enter the Delve\n2. Ensure Valeera is DPS\n3. Select Porcelain Blade Tip\n4. Select Mandate of Secret Death\n5. Start fight with 'Death'\n6. Click 'fade'.\n7. Do not DPS the boss again.\n8. Valeera will take the heat for the rest of the fight\n9. Heal Valeera at all times.\n10. Purify yourself from whatever the boss is hitting you with\n11. Avoid the crap on the ground\n12. You can kill the adds as they appear.\n13. I didn't interrupt anything\n14. 11 minutes and 16 seconds\n\nFirst attempt with no idea what the mechanics were at the start of the fight.\n\nGo and get your toy  [item=264413 domain=www]",
            date = "2026-04-24T07:39:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93525#comments:id=6338200",
        },
    },
