        {
            id = 6293082,
            score = 187,
            author = "Grraci",
            text = "You can easily change your choice so no need to spend 10 minutes deciding like I did xD\nThe alter is right next to the NPC that give you the quest (Du'gal (https://www.wowhead.com/npc=256510/dugal), /way 43, 69 in Zul'Aman).\n\nThere are 4 different Loas and starting abilities:\n\nAkil'zon, Loa of Victory\n\nBlessing: Victor's Presence: 15% chance to stun your enemy for 3 sec.\nBlessing: Victory at Any Cost: 100% movement speed for 3 sec whenever you slay an enemy, but you also take 100% more damage from the next source. Doesn't work on players.\n\nHalazzi, Loa of the Hunt\n\nBlessing: Guaranteed Yield: 15% chance to poison your enemy, dealing 5,396 Nature damage every 1 sec for 4 sec.\nBlessing: Predator's Gamble: 25% chance on hit to deal 100% more damage, but you also have a 25% chance on hit to deal -50% less damage.\n\nJan'alai, Loa of Fire\n\nBlessing: Ensorcelling Flame: 15% chance to Charm your enemy for 10 sec, forcing them to fight other hostile foes on your behalf.\nBlessing: Ravenous Glass: 100% Spell Power, but you also receive 100% more damage from all sources.\n\nNalorakk, Loa of War\n\nBlessing: War-Spoiled: 15% chance to increase Physical damage taken by 30% for 10 seconds, stacking up to 5 charges.\nBlessing: Reckless Feast: 25% leech, but you also take 25% more damage from all sources.\n\nThese are only active in Zul'Aman.\n\nThere is also a common one that add \"Packpeddlers\" throughout Zul'Aman, I guess depending on which one you choose the NPCs will spawn on different locations. These NPCs also give you the blessings that you chose on this tree.",
            date = "2026-02-28T12:15:50-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93792#comments:id=6293082",
        },
        {
            id = 6292990,
            score = 45,
            author = "Xozus",
            text = "The alter for the quest is right next to the quest giver, it is not in the tower.",
            date = "2026-02-28T10:54:46-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93792#comments:id=6292990",
        },
        {
            id = 6294989,
