            author = "arakkoan",
            text = "I couldn't get any of the big buffs (Akil'zon, Halazzi, Jan'alai, Nalorakk) you get while doing the campaign back at all after interacting with the altar. I was sitting with the Nalorakk buff for a few days and wanted to see if I could go back to Halazzi, but it doesn't appear possible to get anything that isn't a combination buff with a lesser loa.",
            date = "2026-03-02T01:54:43-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93792#comments:id=6294989",
