            author = "ZeleNC",
            text = "So, not sure if I am the only one who had this quest bug out on them. But if you feel like you're missing something, don't worry, you are, but it's not your fault.\n\nI didn't get the Collected Ectoplasm the first time I grabbed the quest. I ran around, killed myself 3 times by guying the drinks off the vendors, even relogged thinking it was a day-one bug. Which it was, in a way.\n\nIf you didn't get the Collected Ectoplasm from Ja'bonu, just abandon the quest and grab the quest again.\n\nI hope this helps.",
