            text = "The best way to get the https://www.wowhead.com/item=264380 is by going to the zone just West of Shenzar Refinery where the world quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=88679 is. In this zone you will find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=239941 flying around that you can kill and then mount. This will give you a buff called https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1224971 which gives you 100% movement speed and 30% haste. Being mounted does not affect any of your action bars or ability to cast spells. With this, you can easily run around killing players that are on foot, or just snipe bodies by swooping in and out of others' fights.",
