        {
            id = 6296824,
            score = 60,
            author = "FordPrfct",
            text = "This unlocks the Loa of Abundance, for use in the Altar of Blessings.  The Altar of Blessings allows you to combine the blessings of one of the greater Loa, with one of the lesser Loa.\n\nThe Loa of Abundance, when combined with:\n\nAkil'zon, Loa of Victory:\nBlessing: Abundant Rush - The loas of Victory and Abundance vastly increase your profession Gathering and Crafting speed by granting you +15 Deftness and +50 Crafting Speed.\n\nHalazzi, Loa of the Hunt:\nBlessing: Guide of the Harvest - The loas of the Hunt and Abundance bless your Professions Gathering with a 15% chance to summon a Visage of Dundun every time you successfully harvest using Mining, Herbalism, Skinning, or Fishing.\n\nJan'alai, Loa of Fire:\nBlessing: Harvest Haste - The loas of the Hunt and Abundance increase your Movement Speed by 100% for 5 sec whenever you gather reagents via Mining, Herbalism, Skinning, or Fishing.\n\nNalorakk, Loa of War:\nBlessing: Abundance Permanence - Whenever you gather reagents via Mining, Herbalism, Skinning, or Fishing, the Loas of War and Abundance heal you by 15% and reduce damage taken by 50% until you're damaged next.\n\n[br]\n\nNote that this blessing is independent of the blessings of the major Loa.  You can have, for instance, Nalorakk's blessing at the same time as the Abundant Rush blessing.",
            date = "2026-03-03T16:32:00-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94834#comments:id=6296824",
        },
