            text = "This already has been commented by Riddich (thank you!) as a reply to another comment, but I think it's helpful to have it as a top level post, in case folks want to vote it to the top.\n\nThis quest is the first in a four week series of quests that will grant a piece of hero tier gear at the end of the four weeks of quests:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/news/new-timegated-4-week-pvp-quest-chain-to-earn-hero-track-gear-380708#news-post-380708",
            date = "2026-03-11T18:57:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94835#comments:id=6304359",
        },
