        {
            id = 6313191,
            score = 29,
            author = "Audity",
            text = "I have the week 2 quest even though I never did the week 1 quest.\nI'm wondering if I even need to do any of the ones leading up to the last quest to get the gear.\nI tend to stay away from pvp because I just dont enjoy it very much (and I'm awful at it), but hero gear is hero gear\n\nedit add : as Alowin said below, apparently you can complete multiple weeks of this quest in one go. Obviously we don't know how many yet, but at least the first two weeks.",
            date = "2026-03-20T23:12:40-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836#comments:id=6313191",
        },
        {
            id = 6336965,
            score = 8,
            author = "Gwez",
            text = "I think I finally figured out what's going on with these quests:\nDuring the first quarter of the season (6 weeks) all four quests were made available, unlocking one every week:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94835, named as \"Week 1 of 4\", available since week 1\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836, named as \"Week 2 of 4\", available since week 2\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94837, named as \"Week 3 of 4\", available since week 3\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94838, named as \"Week 4 of 4\", available since week 4\n\nWhen the 7th week hit, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94835 got disabled and people got confused as the first offered was https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836, named as \"Week 2 of 4\", along with progress resets.\nWhen patch 12.0.5 released the names were changed and got presented as:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836, named as \"Week 1 of 3\"\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94837, named as \"Week 2 of 3\"\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=94838, named as \"Week 3 of 3\"\n\nI think that the names of the quests (\"Early Morning\", \"Late Night\", \"Midnight\", and \"Final\") seem to indicate the progress through the season and I believe we could expect https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836 to be disabled by the 13th week and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94837 on the 18th.\nBlizzard should have been more clear into communicating how these quests work, because so far this is just a theory and have not seen any clear information, neither in game, nor outside.",
            date = "2026-04-22T22:49:41-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=94836#comments:id=6336965",
        },
