        {
            id = 6395585,
            score = 5,
            author = "meganerd18",
            text = "The Soulcoilers seem to be bugged atm. From what I'm seeing, if you get help from someone not in party with you, then the soul won't spawn. Killed one on my own, soul. Someone chipped in trying to help? No soul. Maybe it's a realm thing, maybe it's something else, but all I can say is at present it's probably best NOT to help someone kill Soulcoiler mobs (as of August 13) in case they're on the quest and you ruin it for them. Yes, that's entirely against the spirit of an MMO, yes it's stupid, but it's where we are.",
            date = "2026-08-13T20:34:34-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95523#comments:id=6395585",
        },
