        {
            id = 6387715,
            score = 1,
            author = "Pheydre",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=271851 [decor=21833] can be purchased after completing this quest: https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95564\n\nIt costs 250 [currency=3316] from Decor Specialist https://www.wowhead.com/npc=270399 in The Coiled Isle. /way #2512 58.6 45.9 Firetender Zab'ni",
            date = "2026-07-27T22:41:11-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95564#comments:id=6387715",
        },
        {
            id = 6398458,
            score = 1,
            author = "Mypciscraze",
            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You a Storyline [storyline=6229] that is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=62297 Achievement. That Storyline start from 12.08.2026. and is 2nd Storyline at first You need to do [storyline=6050].\n\nPlease See My Video with all Quests from this storyline if Need It - https://youtu.be/rz-Tonxdfd8\n\nAll Quests from [storyline=6229]:\n\nWhen i login to game Move start when Finish You can press Shift-J to open Adventure Guide then press on Suggested content and You can accept 1st Quest or You can start from 2nd quest but you need to fly for it.\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=98218 - Fly /way #2437 43.6 68.2, to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263331.\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92916 - Fly to /way #2437 37.0 23.2, to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263331 inside bulding.\n3a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92917 - You need to Rescued 8 Villagers and Dak'zor\n/way #2437 38.04 25.94 Dak'zor\n/way #2437 37.87 25.09\n/way #2437 37.63 25.77\n/way #2437 37.49 26.04\n/way #2437 37.34 25.86\n/way #2437 37.03 25.84\n/way #2437 37.08 25.27\n/way #2437 37.25 25.22\n/way #2437 37.25 24.87\n3b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92919 - Slay 16 forces of Malacrass i a lot of them around.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93265 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=256465 /way #2437 38.53 22.45, then speak with quest giver Video will start.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92921 - Fly to Skybridge /way #2437 44.07 54.42\n7a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93263 - Slay 12 Snakes is a lot of them on bridge.\n7b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93266 - Pres on 5 https://www.wowhead.com/object=617994 move to the end of bridge in the way you will see a lot of https://www.wowhead.com/object=617994.\n9. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92920 - Defend Zul'jarra and slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=259275 /way 50.70 54.46, When slay mob Video will start.\n10. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=92924 - New MAP is open  [zone=16365] Now You need to fly to /way #2512 57.8 47.2, i did not see any teleport then You need to fly manual :D.\n11. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95804 - Speak with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=258755 next to Quest giver and movie will start is same movie that i had when i login then i skip it.\n12a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93019 - Slay mobs until 100%.\n12b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95564 - First place Banner /way #2512 55.73 44.31, then destroy Barricade: /way #2512 52.24 38.66, then destroy Pillar of Ruin /way #2512 53.06 36.48, then destroy Depraved Effigy /way #2512 51.10 33.11, and at last slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=261789 /way #2512 51.14 31.90,\n14a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93018 - Release 12 Amani - /way #2512 47.06 29.97, /way #2512 44.68 30.06, 46.30 27.65, all 3 point release 4 Amani\n14b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93022 - Slay 4 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=256291 and destroy 50 green toxic egs using flame from extra skill ( You can use that skill to kill mobs around is very powerfull ).\n16. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93023 - Slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=253756 /way #2512 45.52 28.81\n17. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=93024 - Speak with Zul'jarra and movie will start then after video speak with her one more time then fly to /way #2512 58.30 46.12, That will finish Storyline.\n\nHope That Help You :).",
            date = "2026-08-15T03:04:13-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95564#comments:id=6398458",
        },
        {
