            text = "Hi all\n\nI present You a Storyline [storyline=6227] that is part of https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63641 Achievement.\n\nPlease See My Video with all Quests from this storyline if Need It - https://youtu.be/D7s8tZ5ysQY\n\nAll Quests line [storyline=6227]:\n\n1. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95521 - Go to messi https://www.wowhead.com/npc=261659 ( This is real Messi or just Me'si ? ) is a ghost /way #2509 48.8 64.6\n2. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95522 - Go to statue https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263557 /way #2509 38.46 34.12, and press on it.\n3a. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95523 - Slay 5 https://www.wowhead.com/npc=261376 they will drop blue orb that you need to press to count progress. i almost lost first one xD\n3b. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95524 - You need to Honored 2 statues:\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263214 /way #2509 39.50 49.66, press on statue they on 2 https://www.wowhead.com/object=642820\n- https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263215 /way #2509 44.00 56.10, press on statue then on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=262324 is behind statue on right next to wall then press on statue one more time.\n5. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95954 - Go to Crypt enter /way #2509 39.63 48.31, go to last chamber /way 40.24 72.37, and slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263210 then slay https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263253 will spawn after kill https://www.wowhead.com/npc=263210.\n6. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=95525 - Retur to Messi to finish Storyline. Doing this Story line You can get a little of [currency=3448].\n\nHope That Help You :).",
