    [96090] = {
        {
            id = 6398727,
            score = 21,
            author = "Khae404",
            text = "As of this post, there appears to be some sort of phasing issue with this quest. If the mobs you are killing are not dropping anything at all, head to 53.34, 45.85 (it's a green waterfall, just north of the tiny island that is in the centre of the whole map, that opens up to cleaner water just past the rope bridge) and at the top of the waterfall, stand on the west side, on a tiny hill. This spot will phase in the needed mobs but is a small area so you will need to pull mobs to you to stay phased in. If someone knows what's causing the phasing issue, please reply to this post.\n\nGG Microsoft/Blizzard. I hope the money you saved from all the staff cuts was worth all these damned bugs.\n\nEdit: I think I've figured it out. You need to finish \"An Island of Fangs\" storyline and start the \"Ghosts of the Past\" storyline. Once you have cleared all the eggs, freed the Amani prisoners, killed the Brood Furies and then talked to Zul'jarra (which will start a cut scene with her brother), you will have completed the \"An Island of Fangs\" storyline. The \"Ghosts of the Past\" storyline will start with a meeting with the main protagonists of the storyline. A new quest will appear on the map nearby called \"A Bond of Brothers\" which requires taking out 3 burrows. At this point, the mobs needed for this quest will now be phased in.\n\nThis would be an easy fix by making the storyline this quest is a part of, unavailable until the \"An Island of Fangs\" is complete, since this quest is the second quest in this storyline. This should have been picked up and fixed in PTR.\n\nTL;DR: Finish the \"An Island of Fangs\" storyline --> pick up \"A Bond of Brothers\" quest --> finish both quests together --> GG Microsoft/Blizzard.",
            date = "2026-08-15T07:13:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=96090#comments:id=6398727",
        },
