            text = "FYI, I finally found Wood Debris down on Gnarldor Isle.  You just have to fly around and you'll see piles of wood, like branches, on the ground.  I just found a pile at /way 60.99 83.45.  Also, once you get there, a quest circle shows up on the mini-map designating the area where the wood can be found.  Otherwise, before you get here, there is no indicators where it can be found.\n\nThe Wood Debris Pile was also not obvious.  So I flew around Gnarldor Isle until I found a small circle in my mini-map on the beach.  /way 54.73 78.76\n\nAs soon as you build the pile, Birdie shows up and starts lobbing bombs at you, which are pretty easily avoided (at least with my hunter, as the beasts were tanking).   Once she's dead, click on her and bob's your uncle.",
