            id = 6406089,
            score = 3,
            author = "Adrenaliin",
            text = "📌BUG FIX 1: Your \"ADD\" criterion is done, but the \"EQUIP\" one seems bugged. Try these steps.\n\nCopy, Paste and Run (press ENTER) each of these two scripts in your chat (separately).\n\n/run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(96612))\n/run print(C_QuestLog.IsQuestFlaggedCompleted(93943))\n\nIf at least one of them is TRUE you can abandon the quest and never think of it again. It won't pop up anymore. :)\n\nIf both are FALSE:\n1. Go inside a delve (any delve / level)\n2. Interact with the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=249296 at the beginning\n3. Select the last option:\n4. This should immediately complete the quest (if it hasn't already, just by entering the delve)\n* If you quest is still NOT completed and the \"EQUIP\" portion still isn't done, then unfortunately I cannot suggest anything else. :/\n\n----------\n\n📌BUG FIX 2: Your quest is completed, but you cannot see where to turn it in.\n\nFortunately, this one is easy:\n1. Open your Quest Log (press \"L\")\n2. Find the Quest (inside the Silvermoon section)\n3. Track it (add a checkmark in the box next to it)\n4. Close the Quest Log and Look at your Objective Tracker (right side of the screen)\n5. If you do not see your quest there, start SHIFT-clicking every other quest you see\n6. When you see you quest, there will be a an option underneath: \"Click to Complete\".\n7. Click on it, Confirm and you're done. :)",
            date = "2026-08-25T16:17:55-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=96612#comments:id=6406089",
        },
    },
