        {
            id = 6393901,
            score = 269,
            author = "ChudNL",
            text = "I figured this one out with my peanut brain:\n\nThe Curse Surges start at a set time (you can see the time and location on the Event page next to your quest log).\nBut as there are many players playing at the moment, they are completed within minutes! That's why I had a hard time finding them.\n\nSo go be at the right location at spawn time and you'll see the event.\nQuests:\nCounter Curse Bounty (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97382/counter-curse-bounty)\nTurn Back the Surge (https://www.wowhead.com/quest=96995/turn-back-the-surge)\n\nMlurkkr Massacre : /way 70.5 32.7\nSiege at the Whispering Marsch: /way 67.1 77.5\nThe Malformed Leviathan: /way 46.7 62.8\nThe Broodmother's Nest: /way 45.7 29.6\nThe Looming Mutagenior: /way 26.4 64.9",
            date = "2026-08-12T05:59:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=96995#comments:id=6393901",
        },
