            text = "This quest is a disaster, given how long respawn timers take.\n\nWhat a huge waste of time. Respect your player base, change your philosophy – we're not 14 anymore.",
            date = "2026-08-13T03:29:17-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=96995#comments:id=6394623",
