            score = 239,
            author = "Lazey",
            text = "[toggler name=\"Requirements for the Mixing Mysteries Daily Quest\" closed=true]\nReach Renown 3 with [faction=2772] for the \"Spoils of Coils\" perk, so you may now find specific treasures at [zone=16365]. (https://www.wowhead.com/object=654991, https://www.wowhead.com/object=656039, and https://www.wowhead.com/object=656044) You will very likely achieve that by completing the available 12.1 campaign chapters.\n[br]\nDo the introduction quests starting with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=98388 from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=262798 at the Amani Foothold in the [zone=16535]. This will unlock access to the https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1310218. While on the intro, don't miss picking up the https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97640 quest from a https://www.wowhead.com/npc=272024 to unlock the https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1305036 ability as well. You can barely miss that sack, because they placed it near an objective of the intro quests. It will reward you with enough [currency=3448] for your first talent point.\n[br]\nGet another talent point to activate the \"Ofi's Offerings\" trait node. Only this will add specific \"potent ingredients\" to the treasures mentioned above and allow us to find a quest starter to begin with Ofi's https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97016 Daily Quest at her cauldron in Tokka's Landing. (We have several ways to get talent points, with 14 coming from corroding our spirit ([currency=3448] -> Spirit Corrosion exchange) at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=262880 near the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=269485, 2 from [faction=2772]'s Renown 8 and 14, and 4 provided when unlocking the tree's selection nodes with corrosive relics we can find in the Vaults. Check my Altar of Corrosion comment (https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/npc=269485/altar-of-corrosion#comments:id=6389618) for more info.)\n[br]\nStart to farm https://www.wowhead.com/object=654991 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124, https://www.wowhead.com/object=656039 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126, and https://www.wowhead.com/object=656044 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117. Soon enough (most likely with your first potent ingredient looted), you should find the https://www.wowhead.com/item=278070 quest starter. Bring it to Ofi at her hut in the swamp to unlock her Daily Quest and get a https://www.wowhead.com/item=278084 containing one of each ingredient. You can now accept her Daily near her hut or in Tokka's Landing, but she will only have her mixing dialogue options available near her cauldron in Tokka's Landing./way #2512 61.0 32.6 Ofi the Sly (Swamp)\n/way #2512 57.4 48.7 Ofi the Sly (Tokka's Landing)[/toggler][toggler name=\"Mysterious Mixing - Limitations, Achievement Combinations, and Rewards\" closed=false]\nThe https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97016 Daily Quest seems to be account-shared, so it is very likely only available once per day for your warband.\nWhen you accept the quest and have potent ingredients available (they are tradable, so you don't necessarily need to farm the treasures yourself after unlocking the Daily), https://www.wowhead.com/npc=254599 in Tokka's Landing will have new dialogue options for you to offer your ingredients separately. Unfortunately, there's no visual feedback for adding them to the cauldron, so the only hint is slightly changed text on Ofi's dialogue frame. So, be careful with your choices, but also remember that your ingredients will not be consumed until you make your third choice, so you could abandon the quest and restart if you lost track or made a mistake while mixing specific combinations for the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63432 achievement.\nWhen you make your third choice, the used ingredients are removed from your inventory, and a floating https://www.wowhead.com/npc=267451 bowl will appear for your quest turn-in. Based on the combinations of ingredients used, your https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303259 reward will create 1 of the 10 possible Offerings required for the achievement.\n[br]\nDuring PTR testing, I got 22-44x [currency=3316] from the Offering container items, and one time 1x https://www.wowhead.com/item=274473 as well. In my opinion, far from enough to expect big business from selling the ingredients, because buyers could turn them into Voidlight Marl (especially with these negligible amounts once a day).\nThe https://www.wowhead.com/item=280189 pet has this activity as its source, and seems to come as loot from the Offering containers, but we're lacking data to be sure if it's about a chance from all of them, or the https://www.wowhead.com/item=277937 specifically.\nAnd there's the [decor=5130] reward for the achievement itself, with additional https://www.wowhead.com/item=248962 purchases unlocked at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=270399 in Tokka's Landing (150x [currency=3316] each). /way #2512 58.57 45.93 Firetender Zab'ni\n[br]\n[table width=80% border=1 cellpadding=10 cellspacing=10]\n[tr][td align=center width=8%]Order[/td][td width=23%]https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303259[/td][td width=23% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124[/td][td width=23% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126[/td][td width=23% align=center]https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117[/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]1[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277946[/td][td][/td][td][/td][td align=center]3x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]2[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277938[/td][td][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]3[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277939[/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td][/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]4[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277944[/td][td][/td][td align=center]3x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]5[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277942[/td][td][/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]6[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277943[/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]7[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277945[/td][td align=center]3x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]8[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277940[/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]9[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277941[/td][td align=center]2x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td][/td][/tr]\n[tr][td align=center]10[/td][td]https://www.wowhead.com/item=277937[/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2032172 size=medium][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=2103838 size=medium][/td][td align=center]1x [icondb=134120 size=medium][/td][/tr]\n[/table]\n[/toggler]",
