ou collect all ingredients first do Quest to open this Quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97016 then start mixing:\n\n- 3 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 = You will get - https://www.wowhead.com/item=277944\n- 2 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277943\n- 2 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277942\n- 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277937\n- 3 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277945\n- 2 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277940\n- 2 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 1 x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277941\n- 3x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277946\n- 2x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 1 x  https://www.wowhead.com/item=276124 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277939\n- 2x https://www.wowhead.com/item=276117 1 x  https://www.wowhead.com/item=276126 = https://www.wowhead.com/item=277938\n\nWhen You finish https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63432 You will get as well [decor=5130].\n\nHope That Help YOu :)",
