    [97462] = {
        {
            id = 6404366,
            score = 11,
            author = "Killaks",
            text = "Must be 4/5 with Tokka's reputation (https://www.wowhead.com/faction=2773/captain-tokka).\n\nLump of Crystalline Malachit (https://www.wowhead.com/item=277998/lump-of-crystalline-malachite) is fished up from a Willow Sea (https://www.wowhead.com/object=655891/willow-sea) pools in Cursed Waters and has also been confirmed within the Vaults of Atal'Utek (https://www.wowhead.com/zone=16535/vaults-of-atalutek) as well (I fished mine up from Willow Sea pools.)\n\nCursed Waters refers to fishing in waters while you have the Cursed Land and Waters (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1299580/cursed-land-and-waters) buff. This buff is applied to a region of the map following a successful [url guide=34409]Cursed Surge event. You do not need to have participated in the Cursed Surge yourself to receive the buff.\n\nThe buff remains active in that region until the next Cursed Surge event begins.",
            date = "2026-08-22T05:22:37-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97462#comments:id=6404366",
        },
    },
    [97463] = {
        {
            id = 6408792,
            score = 5,
            author = "Melandroso",
            text = "I find it really hard to find good info on how to get the items for the https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=63512. I have credit for the https://www.wowhead.com/item=279384, but no idea how I got it. So I tried to see what to do to get the others, but wowhead has weird and useless info and most guides are AI slop without the information I need.\n\nOK. I surmissed that it would be worth trying fishing with the https://www.wowhead.com/item=281022 and with the buff https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1299580 (which is available for all after the most recent Curse Surge has been defeated on the server that you are at. So, I started fishing in open waters like that, and after five minutes, I caught the https://www.wowhead.com/item=277999 that starts this quest.\n\nThere may also be items gated by reputation, and for what it is worth, I am at 3/5 with Captain Tokka.\n\n[EDIT] Turns out that for each level you get with Captain Tokka, you can fish up two more of these. They can be fished from pools or open water and there appears to be no way to increase the chances of catching one of them. The last one, at 5/5, needs to be fished from the special pool created with the https://www.wowhead.com/item=278391.",
            date = "2026-08-30T06:58:52-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=97463#comments:id=6408792",
