        {
            id = 6391272,
            score = 17,
            author = "Lazey",
            text = "To obtain the https://www.wowhead.com/item=279483 battle pet, it's required to reach the \"Venom Trawler\" friendship rank 4 (out of 5) with [faction=2773]. This unlocks the https://www.wowhead.com/item=278391 purchase for 250x [currency=3316]  from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=257598 at Tokka's Folly at [zone=16365]. Or try to find someone who has done that and is willing to use the item for you whenever you need it ;-) The bauble turns any fishing pool at [zone=16365] into an https://www.wowhead.com/object=667628 (it's not consumed on use). These can be fished once for the https://www.wowhead.com/item=278397, which triggers the spawn of the https://www.wowhead.com/npc=269313 quest NPC. Don't be confused by the player-generated question marks on your map. You will probably need another https://www.wowhead.com/object=667628 for every quest turn-in.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=97535[br][br]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=97559[br](Requires items from all 5 Curse Surge bosses. With their 45-minute scheduled rotation, which is visible on your map's event tab, this will take several hours. I am not sure phasing will help here, I'd assume the event schedule is region-wide, but you could find a shard with previous Surges unfinished)[br][br]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=97565[br](Fish up the https://www.wowhead.com/item=278279 from the https://www.wowhead.com/object=667545 in the [zone=16535] which will trigger the spawn of https://www.wowhead.com/npc=269450, and then slay it.)\n/way #2512 51.64 49.78 Second Mate Sluggs\n/way #2509 46.35 49.03 Blighted Venom Pool (Blightfang)",
            date = "2026-08-06T02:27:54-05:00",
