    [97616] = {
        {
            id = 6399155,
            score = 3,
            author = "hotchrisbfries",
            text = "Corrosive Codex Powers (Patch 12.1 / Midnight Season 2)\n\nOutdoor / Delve / Prey only (does not work in dungeons, raids, or PvP). Unlock account-wide by spending Corrosive Souls (8 per power) at the Altar of Corrosion. Start with 1 active slot; second slot unlocks after 8 powers. With an alt army, you can unlock these within a few hours. LFR boss gives 3 + vault events give 3. They are warbound transferable.\n\nThe system revolves around a poison loop — several powers gain strong bonuses against Poisoned targets or while you yourself are Poisoned. Pair a poison source with a poison payoff for the strongest results.\n\n[hr]\n\nFull List of the 12 Powers\n\nOffense\n\nOphidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw) — Chance on damage to summon a giant snake (split Nature damage). Executes any Poisoned non-boss under 20% health.\nPlague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion) — Chance to apply stacking Poison to nearby enemies. Jumps to a new target on death with remaining duration.\nUla'tek's Gift (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303477/ulateks-gift) — Chance on harmful abilities to apply 5 stacks of a Nature DoT. While you are Poisoned it applies 10 stacks instead. At 20 stacks it Corrodes and dumps remaining damage. (Recently nerfed ~30%.)\nMiasma Geyser (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303476/miasma-geyser) — Chance to create a delayed geyser that damages enemies and heals allies (stronger on Poisoned units).\n\nDefense\n\nVirulent Mucus (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303473/virulent-mucus) — Entering combat grants 5 layers that each negate one hit exceeding 5% of your max health (low chance to refresh from Poisoned targets).\nLithic Plumage (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303467/lithic-plumage) — Chance on taking damage to gain 75% damage reduction up to a cap that scales with nearby Poisoned enemies.\nGorgoneion Gaze (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303469/gorgoneion-gaze) — Drop below 50% health → petrify nearby enemies for 10 sec. When they break free they are Poisoned, take DoT, and are slowed.\n\nUtility / Stats / Group\n\nAccursed Poison (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303474/accursed-poison) — Chance to put a long Nature DoT on the strongest enemy that also interrupts its next interruptible cast.\nViperine Grasp (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303471/viperine-grasp) — Chance on harmful abilities to pull nearby enemies to your target (more pulls on Poisoned enemies).\nMephitic Cloud (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303470/mephitic-cloud) — Applies a cloud to allies and enemies: allies’ attacks apply Poison, but enemies’ attacks also heal their targets (generally avoid in groups).\nOuroboric Cycle (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303468/ouroboric-cycle) — Chance to cycle Tertiary → Secondary → Primary stat buffs. Kills extend the cycle; steps last longer while you are Poisoned.\nInsidious Venom (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303478/insidious-venom) — Chance in combat to Poison yourself, massively boosting Primary stat while lowering Secondary/Tertiary stats. Main self-Poison enabler.\n\n[hr]\n\nBest Loadouts (2 slots)\n\n[table border=1]\n[tr]\n[td]Content / Goal[/td]\n[td]Recommended Pair[/td]\n[td]Notes[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]World farming / packs[/td]\n[td]Plague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion) + Ophidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw)[/td]\n[td]Spreading Poison + constant executes. Best trash clear.[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Rares / single-target elites[/td]\n[td]Ula'tek's Gift (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303477/ulateks-gift) + Insidious Venom (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303478/insidious-venom)[/td]\n[td]Self-Poison doubles Gift stacks → faster Corrode burst.[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Delve survival[/td]\n[td]Virulent Mucus (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303473/virulent-mucus) + Gorgoneion Gaze (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303469/gorgoneion-gaze)[/td]\n[td]Absorbs big hits + emergency petrify. Priority for tanks/healers.[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Public events / groups[/td]\n[td]Viperine Grasp (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303471/viperine-grasp) + Ophidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw)[/td]\n[td]Pulls + packs enemies for cleave/execute.[/td]\n[/tr]\n[tr]\n[td]Stat / general DPS ramp[/td]\n[td]Ouroboric Cycle (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303468/ouroboric-cycle) + Plague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion) (or Accursed Poison (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303474/accursed-poison))[/td]\n[td]Poison extends the strong stat cycle.[/td]\n[/tr]\n[/table]\n\nRole leanings\n\nHealer: Survival first (Virulent Mucus (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303473/virulent-mucus) + Gorgoneion Gaze (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303469/gorgoneion-gaze) / Lithic Plumage (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303467/lithic-plumage)). Miasma Geyser (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303476/miasma-geyser) for some group healing value. Later swap into Ula'tek's Gift (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303477/ulateks-gift) + Insidious Venom (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303478/insidious-venom) or Plague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion) + Ophidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw) for contribution.\nTank: Same defensive core as healers for hard Delves/Prey. Add Ophidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw) or Viperine Grasp (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303471/viperine-grasp) for threat and pack control once you have the second slot.\nMelee DPS: Plague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion) + Ophidian Maw (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303472/ophidian-maw) (AoE) or Ula'tek's Gift (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303477/ulateks-gift) + Insidious Venom (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303478/insidious-venom) (ST). Viperine Grasp (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303471/viperine-grasp) helps packing.\nRanged / Caster DPS: Same offensive pairs as melee. Ouroboric Cycle (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303468/ouroboric-cycle) + a poison applicator is also excellent for sustained damage.\n\n[hr]\n\nEarly game (1 slot only)\n\nFarming packs → Plague of Corrosion (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303475/plague-of-corrosion)\nHard Delves / survival → Virulent Mucus (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303473/virulent-mucus) or Gorgoneion Gaze (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303469/gorgoneion-gaze)\nGeneral damage → Ula'tek's Gift (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303477/ulateks-gift)\n\nSkip / low priority in most group content: Mephitic Cloud (https://www.wowhead.com/spell=1303470/mephitic-cloud) (it heals enemies).\n\nUnlock order is flexible and account-wide. Farm souls from Coiled Isle content (Vaults of Atal’Utek, Curse Surges, Prey, Bountiful Delves, etc.), unlock the powers for your preferred combos first, then fill out the rest to open the second slot. You can swap freely at the Altar (also available at the start of Delves).",
